	{"buy_fishrod._140_say", "402:6B26A8D4", "Thanks for buying the Fishing Pole Package.[ENTER]Our company not only offers special bargains, it[ENTER]also offers a Fishing Contest for beginners! The[ENTER]first prize is desired by everyone... a beginners[ENTER]weapon+3!! If you bring 5 Dead Zanders to the[ENTER]Fisherman, this breath-taking prize will be[ENTER]awarded to you immediately. This is a rare[ENTER]chance! So accept the challenge! "},
