	{"charge_cash_by_voucher._010_syschat", "43:51255D0D", "%s Dragon Coins have been credited to your account. "},
	{"check_collect_reward._010_npcChat", "31:6EF85805", "The ineffective recipes of the biologist "},
	{"check_collect_reward._030_say", "51:FD404579", "Hello! How are you, what can I do for you? "},
	{"check_collect_reward._040_say", "153:75465521", "It concerns the Biologist Chaegirab's rewards.[ENTER]Do you remember the Secret Recipes that I brought[ENTER]you? Well, one of the potions didn't work on me. "},
	{"check_collect_reward._050_say", "218:9A341B21", "Hmm, well I never! An ingredient is missing from[ENTER]this recipe. But don't worry: I've got everything[ENTER]we need here and can quickly brew a new potion[ENTER]that will give you the required effect. Wait a[ENTER]second... "},
	{"check_collect_reward._060_say", "153:0437D6BC", "So there you go. Take a deep breath and swallow[ENTER]it. Very good. Now I'm going to visit Chaegirab[ENTER]and tell him about the mistake. Take care and see[ENTER]you soon! "},
	{"check_trans_ticket._100_say", "89:F3E3257D", "When you are ready to devote your life to the[ENTER]Dragon God, you might be accepted into the Order. "},
	{"check_trans_ticket._10_npcChat", "23:2D376C76", "To the secret caves "},
	{"check_trans_ticket._110_say", "145:E8112159", "You dare to counter the Dragon God? You may be[ENTER]able to defeat me, but you will never escape the[ENTER]wrath of a god! "},
	{"check_trans_ticket._120_say", "120:71785082", "You will find the right path once you are ready[ENTER]to dedicate your life to the Dragon God. Now go[ENTER]forth in peace! "},
