	{"collect_herb_lv20._70_npcChat", "4:A5DA051B", "Lilac "},
	{"collect_herb_lv20._80_say", "52:7C998B49", "Oh, you've found some Lilac![ENTER]Let me take a quick look at the blossoms... "},
	{"collect_herb_lv20._90_sayTitle", "18:3938D0DA", "Biologist Chaegirab: "},
	{"collect_herb_lv25._100_say", "123:F8013A3B", "Oh! This Tue Fungus has top quality![ENTER]I do however need another %s of them. Please try[ENTER]and find some! "},
	{"collect_herb_lv25._10_say", "108:F2DD5C88", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]looking for you. Please go see him and find out[ENTER]how you can help him. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv25._110_say", "134:E76293BD", "Now I've got enough Tue Fungi. Good work! As a[ENTER]token of my gratitude I'm going to give you some[ENTER]Yang and my research results. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv25._120_sayReward", "44:B135387A", "As a reward, the Biologist Chaegirab will give you:"},
	{"collect_herb_lv25._170_say", "103:EB21FD8B", "I'm sorry, but this Tue Fungus has very poor[ENTER]quality and is useless to me. Please get me[ENTER]another one. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv25._20_say", "226:B20D43A1", "Heaven, please help me...[ENTER]I study all kind of plants in this kingdom. There[ENTER]is tons of work that needs to be done. I do not[ENTER]have the time to go hunt plants on my own. Will[ENTER]you please help me? "},
	{"collect_herb_lv25._20_sendLetter", "24:DCFB811B", "Biologist's Analysis (lv. 25)"},
	{"collect_herb_lv25._30_say", "271:00400A38", "I'm studying Tue Fungi at the moment. I need to[ENTER]do some experiments with the Tue Fungus and[ENTER]that's why I need 10 of them. Can you bring me[ENTER]some? I would be very grateful for you help.[ENTER]Bring me one Tue Fungus at a time, so that I can[ENTER]examine them individually. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv25._40_sayTitle", "18:525764E4", "Collect Tue Fungi "},
	{"collect_herb_lv25._50_say", "197:C99863FA", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]looking for Tue Fungi. Take one to him at a time[ENTER]for his experiments. You can get them from the[ENTER]Hungry Brown Bears. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv25._60_sayReward", "41:06D1BE8A", "You have delivered %s Tue Fungi so far. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv25._70_say", "77:F64E9CF6", "You can use the elixir as soon as you've found a[ENTER]Tue Fungus. "},
