	{"collect_herb_lv4._120_say", "147:6C914CA7", "Now I've got enough Peach Blossoms. Good work![ENTER]As a token of my gratitude I'm going to give you[ENTER]some Yang and my research results. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv4._130_sayTitle", "12:13856003", "Information: "},
	{"collect_herb_lv4._140_sayReward", "24:CED7C61A", "Biologist Chaegirab gave you:"},
	{"collect_herb_lv4._170_say", "79:9BCFC8A8", "I'm sorry, but this Peach Blossom has very poor[ENTER]quality and is useless to me. Please get me[ENTER]another one. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv4._20_say", "108:F2DD5C88", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]looking for you. Please go see him and find out[ENTER]how you can help him. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv4._30_say", "226:B20D43A1", "Heaven, please help me...[ENTER]I study all kind of plants in this kingdom. There[ENTER]is tons of work that needs to be done. I do not[ENTER]have the time to go hunt plants on my own. Will[ENTER]you please help me? "},
	{"collect_herb_lv4._40_say", "284:0C41766B", "I am studying Peach Blossoms at the moment. I[ENTER]need to do some experiments with them, so I need[ENTER]quite a few. Can you bring me 5 Peach Blossoms? I[ENTER]would be very grateful for your help! Bring me[ENTER]one Peach Blossom at a time, so that I can study[ENTER]them individually. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv4._50_sayTitle", "25:F398B3E0", "Collect Peach Blossoms "},
	{"collect_herb_lv4._60_say", "193:05DDF60F", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]looking for Peach Blossoms. Please just take one[ENTER]at a time to him for his experiments. You can get[ENTER]them from the Hungry Alpha Wolves. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv4._70_sayReward", "48:E728C1FE", "You have delivered %s Peach Blossoms so far. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv4._80_say", "21:F85EF4CA", "You've already used an elixir! "},
	{"collect_herb_lv4._90_say", "84:F6C65D7A", "You can use the elixir as soon as you've found a[ENTER]Peach Blossom. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv7._100_sayReward", "44:B135387A", "As a reward, Biologist Chaegirab will give you:"},
	{"collect_herb_lv7._10_say", "108:F2DD5C88", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]looking for you. Please go see him and find out[ENTER]how you can help him. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv7._150_say", "91:872D41BA", "I am sorry, but the quality of this Bellflower is[ENTER]very bad. Please bring me a new one. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv7._20_say", "226:B20D43A1", "Heaven, please help me...[ENTER]I study all kind of plants in this kingdom. There[ENTER]is tons of work that needs to be done. I do not[ENTER]have the time to go hunt plants on my own. Will[ENTER]you please help me? "},
	{"collect_herb_lv7._20_sendLetter", "23:5DE1C397", "Biologist's Analysis (lv. 7)"},
	{"collect_herb_lv7._30_say", "261:1BC791C3", "I am studying Bellflowers at the moment. I need[ENTER]to do some experiments so I need a couple of[ENTER]them. Could you get hold of some for me? 5 should[ENTER]be enough. I would be very grateful for your[ENTER]help. Just bring me one at a time though, as I[ENTER]can only examine them individually! "},
	{"collect_herb_lv7._40_sayTitle", "16:A8A1F916", "Collect Bellflowers "},
	{"collect_herb_lv7._50_say", "197:47D84440", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]looking for Bellflowers. Just take one to him at[ENTER]a time for his experiments. You can get them from[ENTER]the Hungry Alpha Blue Wolves. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv7._60_sayReward", "37:9B4EA332", "You have delivered %s Bellflowers so far. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv7._70_say", "76:FD0C55D3", "You can use the elixir as soon as you've found a[ENTER]Bellflower. "},
	{"collect_herb_lv7._80_npcChat", "9:B35FC15D", "Bellflowers "},
	{"collect_herb_lv7._90_say", "111:CEC4C80C", "Oh! This is top quality![ENTER]Unfortunately, I need %s more Bellflowers.[ENTER]Please try to find some! "},
	{"collect_herb_lv7._95_say", "143:AA5C6D93", "I've finally got enough Bellflowers. Good work![ENTER]As a token of my gratitude I'm going to give you[ENTER]some Yang and the results of my research. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._100_sayReward", "40:05965B0F", "You have delivered %s Orc Teeth so far. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._10_sendLetter", "15:B7F36598", "The biologist's request "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._110_say", "47:EC7703CF", "You cannot use the Researcher's Elixir yet. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._120_say", "21:F85EF4CA", "You've already used an elixir! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._130_say", "76:F381EFC7", "You can use the elixir as soon as you've found a[ENTER]molar. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._140_npcChat", "11:329AC2C5", "The Orc Teeth "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._150_say", "81:8E63BE3C", "Oh, you've found a molar![ENTER]Give me a second to check it... "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._160_say", "274:09D9A198", "Oh! This tooth has top quality! I'm going to[ENTER]start my research immediately. However, I do need[ENTER]another %s of them. Please try and find some![ENTER][ENTER]And remember that I need some time. I won't be[ENTER]able to examine the next tooth until tomorrow. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._170_say", "298:17FE48ED", "You have collected all ten Orc Teeth! Thank you.[ENTER]Now I just need a special stone. It's called[ENTER]Jinunggyi's Soul Stone. It would be great if you[ENTER]could get hold of it. You can get it from the[ENTER]Orcs. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._180_say", "123:32114B45", "Hm... This tooth looks rotten...[ENTER]I probably won't be able to use it for my[ENTER]research. Please bring me another one!"},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._190_say", "46:671260B9", "Please come back when you have found another Orc[ENTER]Tooth. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._200_say", "97:D478CFB5", "I'm sorry, but I haven't finished analysing the[ENTER]last one yet. Do you mind coming back later? "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._20_say", "134:76ED1C7B", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]desperately looking for you. Go there and quickly[ENTER]find out how you can help him. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._210_sendLetter", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._220_sayTitle", "25:1D7BDB31", "Jinunggyi's Soul Stone "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._230_sayReward", "104:5F6E6E7A", "You've finally found the Soul Stone![ENTER]Take it to the biologist Chaegirab.[ENTER]He's already expecting you. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._240_say", "183:2BAB8A88", "You have collected 10 Orc Teeth for biologist[ENTER]Chaegirab's research.[ENTER]Now he just needs Jinunggyi's Soul Stone to help[ENTER]him understand his research results better. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._250_say", "47:A8763E6D", "You can get it from different Elite Orcs in the[ENTER]Valley of Seungryong. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._260_sendLetter", "36:16A89C8C", "You have found Jinunggyi's Soul Stone."},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._270_npcChat", "30:A36DBA6F", "I've got Jinunggyi's Soul Stone. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._280_say", "370:6BAF9C5A", "Thank you so much![ENTER]As a reward, you will receive a recipe. Its[ENTER]ingredients are carefully guarded and only a few[ENTER]people know them. The potion that can be made[ENTER]from this recipe will give your feet wings.[ENTER]Set off and find Baek-Go. He will prepare this[ENTER]drink for you.[ENTER]With your help I have learned many important[ENTER]things about the Orcs! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._290_say", "60:241DBA29", "Please come back when you have found Jinunggyi's[ENTER]Soul Stone. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._300_sendLetter", "22:BDA5DD14", "Chaegirab's reward "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._30_npcChat", "16:FDEAE428", "Listen to me. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._310_targetVid", "22:00B4815D", "Chaegirab's reward "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._320_say", "181:66EF2398", "As a reward for the Orc Teeth and Jinunggyi's[ENTER]Soul Stone, the biologist Chaegirab has given you[ENTER]a secret recipe. Please give the recipe to[ENTER]Baek-Go. He will make the miracle cure for you. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._330_npcChat", "20:8ED24A3B", "The secret recipe "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._350_say", "301:3FC2628B", "Oh, is that biologist Chaegirab's secret recipe?[ENTER]Hm, it will increase your movement speed by 10[ENTER]points.[ENTER]Here's your potion![ENTER]I should also give you this Red Ebony Box. A[ENTER]valuable surprise is hidden inside it. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._360_sayReward", "97:57731A8D", "As a reward for fulfilling Chaegirab's request,[ENTER]your movement speed is permanently increased by[ENTER]10 points. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._370_npcChat", "11:EFBF6255", "Try again. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._380_say", "139:BE53748E", "Hm, that's very good. But perhaps you could try[ENTER]it again? "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._40_say", "316:A94FB85A", "It's great that you're here - I need your help.[ENTER]I'm collecting information about all the[ENTER]creatures that live on our continent. It's a very[ENTER]complicated task, that I just can't handle by[ENTER]myself. If you help me, I will of course give you[ENTER]a reward. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._50_say", "257:8C2C2323", "I'm currently examining the Orcs in the Valley of[ENTER]Seungryong. Orc Teeth can even grind iron, which[ENTER]is an incredibly interesting fact. Despite the[ENTER]obvious differences, a lot of researchers think[ENTER]that the human race is related to the Orc race.[ENTER]Perhaps the Orc's molars will be able to tell me[ENTER]more and give me a vital clue about the history[ENTER]of our development. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._60_say", "171:C12AACD3", "Could you bring me a few Orc Teeth? They do,[ENTER]however, need to be molars. Just bring me one at[ENTER]a time, so I can examine them individually. Good[ENTER]luck! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._70_sendLetter", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._80_sayTitle", "20:BB39332B", "Teeth from the Orc Valley "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30._90_say", "198:664C5244", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice,[ENTER]needs 10 Orc Teeth from the Valley of Seungryong[ENTER]for his research. Just take one tooth to him at a[ENTER]time, so that he can study them individually. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv30.fail_wait_info", "113:4AA2F5D5", "However, I will need some time to analyse it,[ENTER]so I can only examine the next Orc Tooth[ENTER]tomorrow. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._100_sayReward", "35:4D7EA849", "You have delivered %s books so far. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._10_sendLetter", "15:B7F36598", "The biologist's request "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._110_say", "47:EC7703CF", "You cannot use the Researcher's Elixir yet. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._120_say", "21:F85EF4CA", "You've already used an elixir! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._130_say", "80:B7381053", "You can use the elixir as soon as you've found a[ENTER]Curse Book. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._140_npcChat", "13:53AFE78D", "The Curse Books "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._150_say", "79:8884DF25", "Oh, you have found a Curse Book![ENTER]Give me a second to check it... "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._160_say", "293:AA45F43C", "Oh! This Curse Book has top quality! I'm going to[ENTER]start my research immediately. I do however need[ENTER]another %s of them. Please try and find some![ENTER]And remember that I need time to read. I won't be[ENTER]able to examine the next book until tomorrow. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._170_say", "246:FFE9B70A", "You have collected all 15 books! Thank you. Now I[ENTER]just need to get hold of the Temple Soul Stone,[ENTER]which also acts as a key. Would you do this task[ENTER]for me? You can get it from the monsters inside[ENTER]the Hwang Temple. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._180_say", "155:5E82DDBE", "Hm, this Book cannot be read at all, and on top of[ENTER]that its pages are falling out... I'm sorry. It is[ENTER]useless to me. Please bring me another one."},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._190_say", "42:558EA1EA", "Please come back after you have found another[ENTER]Curse Book. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._200_say", "159:8106B994", "I'm really sorry, but I haven't finished studying[ENTER]the last book. Do you mind coming back later? "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._20_sayTitle", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._210_targetVid", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._220_sayTitle", "25:F5CD8867", "The Temple Soul Stone "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._230_say", "114:AB116EA3", "You have finally found the Temple Soul Stone![ENTER]Take it to biologist Chaegirab. He's already[ENTER]expecting you. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._240_sayTitle", "25:F5CD8867", "The Temple Soul Stone "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._250_say", "243:8B65F9D4", "You have got hold of 15 Curse Books for biologist[ENTER]Chaegirab's research.[ENTER]Now he just needs the Temple Soul Stone to help[ENTER]him understand the secret sect's writing. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._260_say", "58:F46C9DE4", "You can get it from the Esoterics in the Hwang[ENTER]Temple. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._270_sendLetter", "37:A94FD7F6", "You have found the Temple Soul Stone."},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._280_npcChat", "30:87533BE3", "I've got the Temple Soul Stone. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._290_say", "461:00D880C4", "Thank you so much![ENTER]As a reward, I'm going to give you this recipe.[ENTER]Its ingredients are known by very few and its[ENTER]secret is carefully guarded. The potion that can[ENTER]be produced with the recipe will accelerate your[ENTER]sword arm. Go and look for Baek-Go. He will[ENTER]produce the potion for you.[ENTER]Farewell, my friend. Thanks to you, I managed to[ENTER]find out lots of important information about the[ENTER]ancient magic. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._295_say", "60:1DA4D25B", "Please come back when you've found the Temple[ENTER]Soul Stone. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._300_sendLetter", "22:BDA5DD14", "Chaegirab's reward "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._30_say", "134:76ED1C7B", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]desperately looking for you. Go there and quickly[ENTER]find out how you can help him. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._310_sayTitle", "22:00B4815D", "Chaegirab's reward "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._320_say", "209:DCDD0860", "As a reward for the Curse Books and the Soul[ENTER]Stone, the biologist Chaegirab has given you a[ENTER]secret recipe. Go to Baek-Go now, he'll make the[ENTER]miracle cure for you. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._330_npcChat", "20:8ED24A3B", "The secret recipe "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._340_say", "247:D1D72636", "Oh, is that biologist Chaegirab's secret recipe?[ENTER]Hm, it will increase your attack speed by 5[ENTER]points. Here's your potion! I'm also supposed to[ENTER]give you this wooden box. Take good care of it. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._350_sayReward", "119:EB80EC34", "As a reward for fulfilling Chaegirab's request,[ENTER]your attack speed permanently increases by 5[ENTER]points. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._40_npcChat", "16:FDEAE428", "Listen to me. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._50_say", "336:B4817D12", "Ah, it's good that you are here! I need your[ENTER]help. Not only am I studying every creature in[ENTER]this kingdom, but I'm also making notes about[ENTER]various magic spells. I can't do it all by myself[ENTER]because I don't have enough time to go on[ENTER]excursions. Would you take care of that for me? "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._60_say", "286:9B16589C", "I want to find out more about the secret sect in[ENTER]the Valley of Seungryong. I think they have[ENTER]information about the magic of the olden days;[ENTER]I'm especially interested in the Curse Books that[ENTER]they have produced. They are probably the key[ENTER]piece of info that I'm missing for my research. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._70_say", "351:4D1EF77E", "Please bring me these books! And make sure that[ENTER]they are intact - some of them are so old that[ENTER]they are barely legible.[ENTER]I can't do with any of those.[ENTER]I need a total of 15 Curse Books for my research.[ENTER]Just bring me one at a time so that I can study[ENTER]them individually. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._80_sayTitle", "20:DA364A17", "The magic of the olden days "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40._90_say", "322:CDDFF105", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]researching the spells of the olden days. In the[ENTER]Valley of Seungryong there are 15 books from a[ENTER]Curse Book collection. Take these books to[ENTER]Chaegirab, but just take one at a time. You can[ENTER]get them from the Dark Tormentors and the High[ENTER]Tormentors. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv40.fail_wait_info", "143:9FDBD905", "Still, I will need time to save at least a few of[ENTER]its pages, so I won't be able to examine the next[ENTER]Book until tomorrow."},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._100_say", "247:BCA182AA", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]examining the creatures in the Demon Tower. He[ENTER]needs 15 Demon's Keepsakes for his research.[ENTER]Take one to him at a time so that he can examine[ENTER]them individually. You can get them from the[ENTER]demons in the tower. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._10_sendLetter", "15:B7F36598", "The biologist's request "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._110_sayReward", "49:F3F84FAF", "You have delivered %s Demon's Keepsakes so far. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._120_say", "47:EC7703CF", "You cannot use the Researcher's Elixir yet. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._130_say", "21:F85EF4CA", "You've already used an elixir! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._140_say", "87:88FCB359", "You can use the elixir as soon as you've found a[ENTER]Demon's Keepsake. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._150_npcChat", "20:9D96D268", "The Demon's Keepsakes "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._160_say", "68:9214E216", "Oh, you've found one![ENTER]Give me a second to check it... "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._170_say", "295:84AD4D0E", "Oh! This keepsake has top quality! I'm going to[ENTER]start my research immediately. However, I do need[ENTER]another %s of them. Please try and find some![ENTER][ENTER]And remember that I need time. I won't be able to[ENTER]examine the next Demon's Keepsake until tomorrow. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._180_say", "271:0F2D23CC", "You have got hold of all 15 Demon's Keepsakes![ENTER]Thank you. Now I just need Sagyi's Soul Stone to[ENTER]find out all of their secrets. Would you do this[ENTER]for me? You can get it from the demons in the[ENTER]Demon Tower. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._190_say", "162:8EDD0B45", "Hm, do you see this deep scratch? I'm sorry, but[ENTER]this Demon's Keepsake is damaged. I won't learn[ENTER]anything more from it. Please bring me another[ENTER]one!"},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._195_say", "71:7EA701A2", "Please come back when you've found another[ENTER]Demon's Keepsake. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._200_say", "97:D478CFB5", "I'm sorry, but I haven't finished analysing the[ENTER]last one yet. Do you mind coming back later? "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._20_sayTitle", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._210_sendLetter", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._220_sayTitle", "21:8C8B7C43", "Sagyi's Soul Stone "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._230_say", "104:5F6E6E7A", "You've finally found the Soul Stone![ENTER]Take it to the biologist Chaegirab.[ENTER]He's already expecting you. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._240_say", "203:1720F14A", "You have got hold of 15 Demon's Keepsakes for[ENTER]biologist Chaegirab's research.[ENTER]To be able to interpret them properly, Chaegirab[ENTER]needs Sagyi's Soul Stone. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._250_say", "41:096A074A", "You can get it from the demons in the Demon Tower. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._260_sendLetter", "32:A9D0C6C6", "You have found Sagyi's Soul Stone."},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._270_npcChat", "26:33189E74", "I've got Sagyi's Soul Stone. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._280_say", "440:A1930D71", "Thank you so much! To reward you, I'm going to[ENTER]give you this recipe. Its composition is known by[ENTER]very few and its secret is carefully guarded. The[ENTER]potion that can be made with the recipe improves[ENTER]your evasion instinct. Go and look for Baek-Go.[ENTER]He'll brew the potion for you.[ENTER]Farewell, my friend. Thanks to your help I was[ENTER]able to find out important information about the[ENTER]demons. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._290_sendLetter", "22:BDA5DD14", "Chaegirab's reward "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._295_say", "50:C0B66E85", "Please come back when you've found Sagyi's Soul[ENTER]Stone. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._300_sayTitle", "22:00B4815D", "Chaegirab's reward "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._30_say", "134:76ED1C7B", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]desperately looking for you. Go there and quickly[ENTER]find out how you can help him. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._310_say", "235:9A9597DE", "As a reward for the Demon's Keepsakes and the[ENTER]Soul Stone, the biologist Chaegirab has given you[ENTER]a secret recipe. Now go to Baek-Go, he'll make[ENTER]the miracle cure for you. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._320_say", "245:5AFE29C9", "Oh, is that biologist Chaegirab's secret recipe?[ENTER]Hm, it will increase your defence by 60 points.[ENTER]Here's your potion! I'm also supposed to give you[ENTER]this wooden box. Take good care of it. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._330_sayReward", "105:4FAA8B14", "As a reward for fulfilling Chaegirab's request[ENTER]your defence permanently increases by 60 points. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._40_npcChat", "16:FDEAE428", "Listen to me. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._50_say", "237:2618AD54", "It's great that you're here! I'm examining every[ENTER]dark creature in this kingdom. I'm sure you[ENTER]understand that as an academic, I can't just go[ENTER]out and hunt monsters for my own research.[ENTER]Would you help me? "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._60_say", "225:D6DAD765", "During the course of my research I would like to[ENTER]study the demons in the Demon Tower.[ENTER]I can feel the dark energy of the building and[ENTER]from the creatures inside it from here. Can you[ENTER]get hold of a Demon's Keepsake for me for my[ENTER]research? "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._70_say", "300:80F180C7", "I would be very grateful for your help. But[ENTER]please keep this in mind: Demon's Keepsakes have[ENTER]different levels of quality. However I need[ENTER]keepsakes of high quality for my research.[ENTER]Altogether I need 15 of them. Please bring them[ENTER]to me one at a time, as the research takes quite[ENTER]a bit of time. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._80_sendLetter", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50._90_sayTitle", "20:9D96D268", "The Demon's Keepsakes "},
	{"collect_quest_lv50.fail_wait_info", "123:1DE34FEF", "But remember that I need time for the analysis. I[ENTER]won't be able to examine the next Demon's Keepsake[ENTER]until tomorrow."},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._100_sayTitle", "25:344BA550", "Ice Marbles from Mount Sohan "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._10_sendLetter", "15:B7F36598", "The biologist's request "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._110_say", "275:50E55B4F", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]examining Mount Sohan in the western part of the[ENTER]continent. He needs 20 Ice Marbles for his[ENTER]research. Take one to him at a time, so that he[ENTER]can examine them individually. You can get them[ENTER]from the Ice Golems. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._110_sayReward", "48:76152C78", "You have delivered %s Ice Marbles so far. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._120_say", "47:EC7703CF", "You cannot use the Researcher's Elixir yet. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._130_say", "21:F85EF4CA", "You've already used an elixir! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._140_sayTitle", "18:3938D0DA", "Biologist Chaegirab: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._150_say", "78:369FBDC6", "You can use the elixir as soon as you've found an[ENTER]Ice Marble. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._160_npcChat", "11:4E68ED65", "The Ice Marbles "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._170_say", "82:2BF6C649", "Oh, you've found an Ice Marble![ENTER]Give me a second to check it... "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._180_say", "288:D1CEF028", "Oh! This Ice Marble has top quality! I'm going to[ENTER]start my research immediately. However, I do need[ENTER]another %s of them. Please try and find some![ENTER][ENTER]And remember that I need time. I won't be able to[ENTER]examine the next Ice Marble until tomorrow. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._190_say", "225:7C06E51F", "You have collected all 20 Ice Marbles! Thank you.[ENTER]Now I just need Aurtumryu's Soul Stone to solve[ENTER]the mystery of the Ice Mountain. Would you take[ENTER]care of this? You can get it from the Ice[ENTER]Creatures. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._200_say", "111:C5FE1F93", "Hm, unfortunately this Ice Marble has partly[ENTER]melted and is useless to me. Please bring me[ENTER]another one!"},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._205_say", "40:5734566D", "Come back when you've found another Ice Marble. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._20_sayTitle", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._210_say", "97:D478CFB5", "I'm sorry, but I haven't finished analysing the[ENTER]last one yet. Do you mind coming back later? "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._220_sendLetter", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._230_sayTitle", "25:951DE995", "Aurtumryu's Soul Stone "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._240_say", "104:5F6E6E7A", "You've finally found the Soul Stone![ENTER]Take it to the biologist Chaegirab.[ENTER]He's already expecting you. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._250_sayTitle", "25:951DE995", "Aurtumryu's Soul Stone "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._260_say", "193:39F28A47", "You have got hold of 20 Ice Marbles for biologist[ENTER]Chaegirab's research.[ENTER]Now he just needs Aurtumryu's Soul Stone to help[ENTER]him understand its special crystalline structure. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._270_say", "59:DD40833F", "You can get it from the various Ice Creatures on[ENTER]Mount Sohan. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._280_sendLetter", "36:D653646C", "You have found Aurtumryu's Soul Stone."},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._290_npcChat", "30:BF2B6239", "I've got Aurtumryu's Soul Stone. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._300_say", "436:E3A1002A", "Thank you very much![ENTER]As a reward, you will receive a recipe. Its[ENTER]ingredients are carefully guarded and known to[ENTER]only a few. The potion that can be made from this[ENTER]recipe will increase your attack strength. Set off[ENTER]and find Baek-Go. He will brew this drink for you.[ENTER]May fortune smile on you, my friend. With your[ENTER]help I have learned many important things about[ENTER]the Ice Land! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._305_say", "60:9CFD6100", "Please come back when you've found Aurtumryu's[ENTER]Soul Stone. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._30_say", "134:76ED1C7B", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]desperately looking for you. Go there and quickly[ENTER]find out how you can help him. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._310_sendLetter", "22:BDA5DD14", "Chaegirab's reward "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._320_say", "175:D91DFD58", "As a reward for the Ice Marbles and the Soul[ENTER]Stone, the biologist Chaegirab has given you a[ENTER]secret recipe. Now go to Baek-Go, he'll make the[ENTER]miracle cure for you. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._330_npcChat", "20:8ED24A3B", "The secret recipe "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._340_say", "249:5AA5CE39", "Oh, is that biologist Chaegirab's secret recipe?[ENTER]Hm, it will increase your attack value by 50[ENTER]points. Here's your potion! I'm also supposed to[ENTER]give you this Wooden Box. Take good care of it. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._350_say", "58:31ED1C42", "Thank you. What colour does the Box have this[ENTER]time? "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._360_say", "70:955A4E62", "Let's see...[ENTER]Ah, it's the Lightgreen Ebony Box. Here you are! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._370_sayReward", "110:12E2B453", "As a reward for fulfilling Chaegirab's request,[ENTER]your attack value permanently increases by 50[ENTER]points. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._40_npcChat", "16:FDEAE428", "Listen to me. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._50_sayTitle", "18:3938D0DA", "Biologist Chaegirab: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._60_say", "227:738D780D", "Oh, it's you! Come closer. At the moment I'm[ENTER]gathering information about the Ice Land in the[ENTER]west and the creatures that live there.[ENTER]Unfortunately I can't go myself and enrich my[ENTER]research with my own observations. Could you take[ENTER]care of this for me? "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._70_say", "315:0CD2957B", "Have you ever seen the country of eternal ice?[ENTER]Rumour has it that it was surrounded by an[ENTER]unexplainable power in the olden days. That's why[ENTER]magicians and scholars are so interested in this[ENTER]place nowadays. But due to its remoteness, it has[ENTER]barely been explored. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._80_say", "307:92465337", "Apparently the Ice Marbles, which the mountain[ENTER]partly consists of, have an unusual crystalline[ENTER]structure. Bring me 20 of them, but bring them to[ENTER]me individually so that I can examine them[ENTER]separately. And make sure that you don't bring me[ENTER]ones that have already half melted, because they[ENTER]won't keep long enough for my extensive[ENTER]experiments. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60._90_sendLetter", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv60.fail_wait_info", "141:D0A0EFFB", "I will try to find out as much as I can from this[ENTER]melted slush. I won't be able to examine the next[ENTER]Ice Marble until tomorrow."},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._100_say", "81:D322EFED", "You can use the elixir as soon as you've found a[ENTER]Zelkova Branch. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._10_sayTitle", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._110_sendLetter", "25:100FB4CD", "You found a Zelkova Branch. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._120_npcChat", "15:6DC0F614", "The Zelkova Branches "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._130_say", "65:52856F9D", "Oh, you've found a branch![ENTER]Give me a second to check it... "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._140_say", "290:14918282", "Oh! This Zelkova Branch has a top quality. I'm[ENTER]going to immediately start my research. However,[ENTER]I do need another %s of them. Please try and find[ENTER]some![ENTER][ENTER]And remember that I need time for the analysis. I[ENTER]won't be able to examine the next one until[ENTER]tomorrow. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._150_say", "217:793DFD2D", "You have collected all 25 Zelkova Branches! Thank[ENTER]you. Now I just need Gyimok's Soul Stone to help[ENTER]me understand the growth of these trees. Would[ENTER]you take care of this for me? You can find it by[ENTER]the trees at Ghost Forest. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._160_say", "110:E0D14460", "Hm, this branch is thin and stunted. I'm afraid[ENTER]it's too weak for my purposes. Bring me[ENTER]another one!"},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._165_say", "43:1B8957AB", "Come back when you've found another Zelkova[ENTER]Branch. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._170_say", "97:D478CFB5", "I'm sorry, but I haven't finished analysing the[ENTER]last one yet. Do you mind coming back later? "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._180_sayTitle", "22:7876D19B", "Gyimok's Soul Stone "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._190_say", "104:5F6E6E7A", "You've finally found the Soul Stone![ENTER]Take it to the biologist Chaegirab.[ENTER]He's already expecting you. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._200_sayTitle", "22:7876D19B", "Gyimok's Soul Stone "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._20_say", "255:A2E8D353", "Hello, it's good to see you! I'm studying the[ENTER]Ghost Forest and the strange creatures that live[ENTER]there at the moment. As you already know, I don't[ENTER]have enough time to go on excursions so I'm[ENTER]reliant on your help. Would you collect some[ENTER]information for me? "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._210_say", "166:88B05ADA", "You got hold of 25 Zelkova Branches for biologist[ENTER]Chaegirab's research. Chaegirab needs Gyimok's[ENTER]Soul Stone to help him fully understand the[ENTER]branches' properties. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._220_say", "64:C7EB6089", "You can get it from the trees in the Ghost Forest. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._230_sendLetter", "33:F4EB3A45", "You have found Gyimok's Soul Stone."},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._240_npcChat", "27:448CE066", "I've got Gyimok's Soul Stone. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._250_say", "345:E3AF3EC1", "Thank you so much![ENTER]As a reward, I'm going to give you this recipe.[ENTER]Its contents isn't known by many and its secret[ENTER]is carefully guarded. Go and look for Baek-Go.[ENTER]He'll produce the potion for you. Farewell, my[ENTER]friend. Thanks to your help I was able to find[ENTER]out lots of important information about the Ghost[ENTER]Forest. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._255_say", "51:75904F53", "Please come back when you've found Gyimok's Soul[ENTER]Stone. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._260_say", "180:91A0A0C7", "As a reward for the Zelkova Branches and the Soul[ENTER]Stone, the biologist Chaegirab has given you a[ENTER]secret recipe. Go to Baek-Go now, he'll make the[ENTER]miracle cure for you. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._270_say", "217:7B5D39DE", "Oh, is that biologist Chaegirab's secret recipe?[ENTER]Hm, it will increase your damage resistance by[ENTER]10% and your movement speed by 11 points.[ENTER]Here's your potion! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._280_say", "88:4892D02D", "I'm also supposed to give you this Green Ebony[ENTER]Box. Please take good care of it. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._290_sayReward", "169:7C3B27B8", "As a reward for fulfilling Chaegirab's request,[ENTER]your damage resistance will permanently increase[ENTER]by 10% and your movement speed will increase by[ENTER]11 points. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._30_say", "261:FA2F1197", "It's about the place they call the Ghost Forest.[ENTER]After the Metin Stones spread their influence[ENTER]over the continent, terrible ghosts overtook this[ENTER]place. This makes it one of the most interesting[ENTER]but also most dangerous places to study. So be[ENTER]careful. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._40_say", "315:C20210E2", "I need 25 Zelkova Branches for my research -[ENTER]however I only need ones that are thin and[ENTER]completely intact. Just bring me one branch at a[ENTER]time, as the research takes quite a lot of time. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._50_sayTitle", "21:1D9A1418", "Branches from the Ghost Forest "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._60_say", "229:9A589683", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]studying the trees in the Ghost Forest. He needs[ENTER]25 Zelkova Branches for his research. Just take[ENTER]one to him at a time, so that he can examine them[ENTER]individually. They grow on Ghost Trees. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._70_sayReward", "37:9D6AA05C", "You have delivered %s branches so far. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._80_say", "47:EC7703CF", "You cannot use the Researcher's Elixir yet. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70._90_say", "21:F85EF4CA", "You've already used an elixir! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv70.fail_wait_info", "88:2C0913CA", "For now, I will examine this one. I won't be able[ENTER]to deal with another Zelkova Branch until[ENTER]tomorrow."},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._100_sayReward", "50:755B2083", "You have delivered %s Tugyi's Tablets so far. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._10_targetVid", "18:3938D0DA", "Biologist Chaegirab: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._110_say", "47:EC7703CF", "You cannot use the Researcher's Elixir yet. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._120_say", "21:F85EF4CA", "You've already used an elixir! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._130_say", "86:A1E2B7A6", "You can use the elixir as soon as you've found a[ENTER]Tugyi's Tablet. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._135_sendLetter", "40:2C298135", "You've found one of Tugyi's Tablets."},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._140_npcChat", "19:FDF543F7", "The Tugyi's Tablets "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._150_say", "69:7C057387", "Oh, you've found a tablet![ENTER]Give me a second to check it... "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._160_say", "276:A1046680", "Oh! This Tugyi's Tablet has top quality! I'm[ENTER]going to start examining it immediately. However,[ENTER]I do need another %s of them. Please try and find[ENTER]some![ENTER][ENTER]And remember that I need time for the analysis. I[ENTER]won't be able to examine the next one until[ENTER]tomorrow. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._170_say", "227:64025AF4", "You have collected 30 Tugyi's Tablets. Thank you.[ENTER]Now all I need is Tugyi's Soul Stone to[ENTER]understand the source of the giants' strength.[ENTER]Could you do this for me? You can get it from the[ENTER]Ogres in the Land of Giants. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._180_say", "185:078BDB32", "Hm, this tablet looks weathered. Look, it's[ENTER]cracking and crumbling, and I've barely touched[ENTER]it. I'm afraid I can't use it for my research.[ENTER]Please bring me another one! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._185_say", "70:65422DBB", "Please come back to me when you have found[ENTER]another Tugyi's Tablet. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._190_sayTitle", "21:E02C273A", "Tugyi's Soul Stone "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._200_say", "104:5F6E6E7A", "You've finally found the Soul Stone![ENTER]Take it to the biologist Chaegirab.[ENTER]He's already expecting you. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._20_sendLetter", "15:B7F36598", "The biologist's request "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._210_sayTitle", "21:E02C273A", "Tugyi's Soul Stone "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._220_say", "170:8332A148", "You have collected 30 of Tugyi's Tablets for[ENTER]biologist Chaegirab's research.[ENTER]Now he just needs Tugyi's Soul Stone to help him[ENTER]understand their strength. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._230_say", "45:5B3E1460", "You can get it from the Ogres in the Land of Giants. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._240_sendLetter", "32:887478D4", "You have found Tugyi's Soul Stone."},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._250_npcChat", "26:B3582DD9", "I've got Tugyi's Soul Stone. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._260_say", "457:EF8940AB", "Thank you so much![ENTER]As a reward, you will receive a recipe. Its[ENTER]ingredients are carefully guarded and only a few[ENTER]people know them. The potion that can be made[ENTER]from this recipe will increase your attack[ENTER]strength. Set off and seek out Baek-Go. He will[ENTER]brew this potion for you. May luck be with you,[ENTER]my friend. With your help I have learned many[ENTER]important things about the giants of the Land of[ENTER]Giants! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._265_say", "50:8BE320BE", "Please come back when you've found Tugyi's Soul[ENTER]Stone. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._270_say", "186:BBAE82E5", "As a reward for Tugyi's Tablets and the Soul[ENTER]Stone, the biologist Chaegirab has given you a[ENTER]secret recipe. Now go to Baek-Go, he'll make the[ENTER]miracle cure for you. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._280_say", "193:615DD127", "Oh, is that biologist Chaegirab's secret recipe?[ENTER]Hm, it will increase your attack value by 10% and[ENTER]your attack speed by 6 points.[ENTER]Here's your potion! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._290_say", "90:CFF9B272", "I'm also supposed to give you this Blue Ebony[ENTER]Box. Take good care of it. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._300_sayReward", "154:DC084BD2", "As a reward for fulfilling Chaegirab's request,[ENTER]your attack value permanently increases by 10%[ENTER]and your attack speed permanently increases by 6[ENTER]points. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._30_sayTitle", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._310_sendLetter", "40:2C298135", "You've found one of Tugyi's Tablets."},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._40_say", "134:76ED1C7B", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]desperately looking for you. Go there and quickly[ENTER]find out how you can help him. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._50_say", "296:11297566", "Thank you for sparing me your time! I'm currently[ENTER]gathering information about the Land of Giants.[ENTER]It's a very difficult task and of course I need[ENTER]first-hand information. Would you be willing to[ENTER]go to the Land of Giants for me? You know I won't[ENTER]forget about your reward. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._60_say", "314:631EADBB", "The Land of Giants lies between the mountains, on[ENTER]the edge of the desert. The place is inhabited by[ENTER]giants. They are not only incredibly strong, but[ENTER]also very aggressive. Each of them carries small[ENTER]tablets... I wonder whether it is these that hold[ENTER]the secret of their power. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._70_say", "233:E3078363", "Please get 30 tablets from the Ogres in the Land[ENTER]of Giants. Bring me one at a time, so that I can[ENTER]examine each one individually. Please remember[ENTER]that I can only use an undamaged tablet. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._80_sayTitle", "30:E4E29D26", "Tablets of the Land of Giants "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80._90_say", "233:4DC5CE42", "The Biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]gathering information about the Land of Giants.[ENTER]He needs 30 Tugyi's Tablets for his research.[ENTER]He can only examine one tablet at a time.[ENTER]You can get them from the Ogres. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv80.fail_wait_info", "136:01015191", "I'll try to carry out a few simple tests on this[ENTER]tablet. I won't be able to examine another[ENTER]Tugyi's Tablet until tomorrow."},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._010_target", "18:3938D0DA", "Biologist Chaegirab: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._020_send_letter", "15:B7F36598", "The biologist's request "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._030_say_title", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._040_say", "134:76ED1C7B", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]desperately looking for you. Go there and quickly[ENTER]find out how you can help him. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._050_npcChat", "16:FDEAE428", "Listen to me. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._055_say_title", "18:3938D0DA", "Biologist Chaegirab: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._060_say", "376:1218280E", "Oh, there you are again! I can't thank you enough[ENTER]for helping me again. I'm working on a book about[ENTER]the Red Forest at the moment. Of course I should[ENTER]go there myself, but as you know, I'm not strong[ENTER]enough. I also need time to read and study.[ENTER]Please help me. I will give you a very generous[ENTER]reward! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._064_say", "18:3938D0DA", "Biologist Chaegirab: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._065_say", "360:B4492014", "I want to find out more about the Red Forest. It[ENTER]used to be a peaceful forest with huge trees. But[ENTER]the influence of the Metin Stones has[ENTER]contaminated it with bad energy and has[ENTER]transformed it into a cursed place full of evil[ENTER]spirits. To find out more about this area, I need[ENTER]some Red Ghost Tree Branches. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._069_say", "18:3938D0DA", "Biologist Chaegirab: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._070_say", "238:076A55EF", "Could you get me 40 of these branches? Make sure[ENTER]that they're not too thin or broken. I can only[ENTER]use strong, healthy branches for my research. And[ENTER]bring them to me individually so that I can check[ENTER]each one separately. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._080_send_letter", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._090_say_title", "25:DB50572D", "Branches from the Red Forest "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._100_say", "275:20D81BEA", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]examining trees in the Red Forest. He needs 40[ENTER]Red Ghost Tree Branches. Take one to him at a[ENTER]time so that he can examine them individually.[ENTER]They grow on Red Ghost Trees. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._105_1_say_reward", "25:99AE0BD9", "Up until now you have delivered "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._105_2_say_reward", "10:5D0F1F87", "branches. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._110_say", "47:EC7703CF", "You cannot use the Researcher's Elixir yet. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._115_say", "21:F85EF4CA", "You've already used an elixir! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._120_say", "96:080241D5", "You can use the elixir as soon as you've found a[ENTER]Red Ghost Tree Branch. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._130_send_letter", "51:9FC4FA74", "You have found a Red Ghost Tree Branch."},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._140_npcChat", "29:53185AAE", "The Red Ghost Tree Branches "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._149_say", "18:3938D0DA", "Biologist Chaegirab: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._150_say", "65:52856F9D", "Oh, you've found a branch![ENTER]Give me a second to check it... "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._159_say", "18:3938D0DA", "Biologist Chaegirab: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._160_say", "98:C8AD922B", "Oh! This Red Ghost Tree Branch is top quality![ENTER]I'm going to start my research immediately. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._165_1_say", "34:17676448", "However, I need another "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._165_2_say", "8:A034EB0F", "of them. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._170_say", "154:E077146D", "Please try and find some![ENTER][ENTER]And remember that I need time for the analysis. I[ENTER]won't be able to examine the next branch until[ENTER]tomorrow. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._174_say", "18:3938D0DA", "Biologist Chaegirab: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._175_say", "228:7D8D8E32", "You have collected all 40 branches! Thank you.[ENTER]Now I just need a Forest Spirit Soul Stone to[ENTER]help me understand the creatures behind these[ENTER]living trees. Would you take care of this for me?[ENTER]You can find it by the trees in the Red Forest. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._179_say", "18:3938D0DA", "Biologist Chaegirab: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._180_say", "128:8000DDF7", "Hm, this branch is very thin and slightly bent.[ENTER]I'm afraid it won't do for my research.[ENTER]Please find another one! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._185_say", "18:3938D0DA", "Biologist Chaegirab: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._190_say", "97:D478CFB5", "I'm sorry, but I haven't finished analysing the[ENTER]last one yet. Do you mind coming back later? "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._195_send_letter", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._200_say_title", "20:10A7930C", "The Forest Spirit Soul Stone "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._210_say", "104:5F6E6E7A", "You've finally found the Soul Stone![ENTER]Take it to the biologist Chaegirab.[ENTER]He's already expecting you. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._220_say_title", "20:10A7930C", "The Forest Spirit Soul Stone "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._230_say", "181:5FB63940", "You have got hold of 40 Red Ghost Tree Branches[ENTER]for biologist Chaegirab's research.[ENTER]Now he just needs a Forest Spirit Soul Stone to[ENTER]help him understand his research results. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._240_say", "46:D3A50120", "You can get it from the trees in the Red Forest. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._250_send_letter", "30:46B0B83D", "Got Forest Spirit Soul Stone. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._255_npcChat", "25:E01267E7", "I've got the Forest Spirit Soul Stone. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._260_say", "18:3938D0DA", "Biologist Chaegirab: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._265_say", "348:94EDD11C", "Thank you so much![ENTER]As a reward I will give you this secret recipe.[ENTER]Not many people know what it consists of and its[ENTER]contents is a carefully guarded secret. Go and[ENTER]look for Baek-Go. He'll produce the potion for[ENTER]you. Farewell, my friend. Thanks to you I was[ENTER]able to find out lots of important information[ENTER]about the Red Forest. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._270_send_letter", "22:BDA5DD14", "Chaegirab's reward "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._290_say_title", "22:00B4815D", "Chaegirab's reward "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._300_say", "196:2EC832A6", "As a reward for the Red Ghost Tree Branches and[ENTER]the Soul Stone, the biologist Chaegirab has given[ENTER]you a secret recipe. Now go to Baek-Go, he'll[ENTER]produce the miracle cure for you. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._310_npcChat", "20:8ED24A3B", "The secret recipe "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._315_say", "167:EF186639", "Oh, is that biologist Chaegirab's secret recipe?[ENTER]Hm, it will increase your damage resistance[ENTER]against attacks made against you by other heroes[ENTER]by 10%. Here's your potion! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._316_say", "83:C2DDD49C", "I'm also supposed to give you this Crimson Ebony[ENTER]Box. Please take good care of it. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._317_say_reward", "48:002D0792", "This is your reward for fulfilling Chaegirab's[ENTER]request. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._318_say_reward", "161:B42C8D1D", "As a reward for fulfilling Chaegirab's request,[ENTER]your damage resistance against attacks made[ENTER]against you (PvP) permanently increases by 10%. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85._319_say_reward", "37:E8171C25", "The increase is permanent. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv85.fail_wait_info", "167:374F2535", "On second thought, I will take a closer look at it[ENTER]and run a few experiments on it. I will only[ENTER]examine the next Red Ghost Tree Branch[ENTER]tomorrow."},
	{"collect_quest_lv85.no_item", "80:F0EB8DC6", "Please come back to me when you find another[ENTER]Red Ghost Tree Branch. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._010_target", "18:3938D0DA", "Biologist Chaegirab: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._020_send_letter", "15:B7F36598", "The biologist's request "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._030_say_title", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._040_say", "134:76ED1C7B", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]desperately looking for you. Go there and quickly[ENTER]find out how you can help him. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._050_npcChat", "16:FDEAE428", "Listen to me. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._055_say_title", "18:3938D0DA", "Biologist Chaegirab: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._060_say", "222:7B94DDDA", "Hello, my friend! Thank you for taking all these[ENTER]dangers upon yourself to fulfil my request.[ENTER]You've really helped make an inquisitive[ENTER]scientist very happy... Now I have one final task[ENTER]for you. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._064_say", "379:094BC770", "I want to find out more about the creatures'[ENTER]leaders, the Boss Monsters. I need the Leaders'[ENTER]Notes for that! I hope that you will help me so[ENTER]that I can bring my research to a successful end.[ENTER]Please understand that I can only accept[ENTER]originals. So bring me the notes one at a time,[ENTER]so that I can examine them individually. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._065_say", "159:0415127A", "I need 50 of them for the research. I know it[ENTER]sounds like a lot of work, but this really is my[ENTER]last request. I will give you a good reward! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._080_send_letter", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._090_say_title", "19:EA343FCF", "Leaders' Notes "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._100_say", "247:7CCBFCD5", "The biologist Chaegirab, Uriel's apprentice, is[ENTER]collecting information about Boss Monsters. He[ENTER]needs 50 Leaders' Notes for his research. Take[ENTER]one to him at a time so that he can examine them[ENTER]individually. You can get them from the Boss[ENTER]Monsters. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._105_1_say_reward", "25:99AE0BD9", "Up until now you have delivered "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._105_2_say_reward", "9:5DE5A10B", "notes. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._105_say_reward", "37:4A90AAE1", "You have delivered %s notes so far. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._110_say", "47:EC7703CF", "You cannot use the Researcher's Elixir yet. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._115_say", "21:F85EF4CA", "You've already used an elixir! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._119_say", "18:3938D0DA", "Biologist Chaegirab: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._120_say", "85:492C7684", "You can use the elixir as soon as you've found[ENTER]the Leaders' Notes. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._130_send_letter", "29:80582691", "You found the Leaders' Notes. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._140_npcChat", "18:2980804C", "The Leaders' Notes "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._150_say", "69:7A30E2C9", "Oh, you've found some notes![ENTER]Give me a second to check them... "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._160_say", "29:20DAA292", "Oh, great! Good work! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._165_1_say", "34:17676448", "However, I need another "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._165_2_say", "8:A034EB0F", "of them. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._165_say", "42:97502C70", "However, I do need another %s of them. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._170_say", "130:8834C208", "Please try and find some![ENTER][ENTER]And remember that I need time to examine them. I[ENTER]won't be able to study the next ones until[ENTER]tomorrow. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._175_say", "339:6D0FF8B1", "You have collected all 50 notes, that's fantastic!So you've probably already guessed what I need[ENTER]now.[ENTER]I'm still missing a Leaders' Soul Stone. Then[ENTER]I'll have everything I need.[ENTER]You can do that, can't you? Get a Leaders' Soul[ENTER]Stone and bring it to me. You can get it from the[ENTER]Boss Monsters. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._180_say", "159:D441075E", "Hm, the paper has a strange colour and the seal is[ENTER]somewhat crooked. I think it's a fake. Please get[ENTER]me some real Notes! Fake ones are useless."},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._185_say", "61:F126248A", "Come again when you have found some more notes. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._190_say", "130:DD54E62C", "I'm sorry, but I haven't finished studying the[ENTER]last notes yet. Do you mind coming back later? "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._195_send_letter", "16:8A21FD41", "The biologist's research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._200_say_title", "23:AD2DE4F9", "The Leaders' Soul Stone "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._210_say", "104:5F6E6E7A", "You've finally found the Soul Stone![ENTER]Take it to the biologist Chaegirab.[ENTER]He's already expecting you. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._220_say_title", "23:AD2DE4F9", "The Leaders' Soul Stone "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._230_say", "143:58A31BF4", "You have got hold of 50 Leaders' Notes for[ENTER]biologist Chaegirab's research. Now he just needs[ENTER]a Leaders' Soul Stone to help him interpret them. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._240_1_say", "20:9C6DD302", "You will get it from: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._240_say", "20:9C6DD302", "You will get it from: "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._250_send_letter", "34:07D7474F", "You have found the Leaders' Soul Stone."},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._260_npcChat", "26:450CF68E", "I've found the Soul Stone. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._265_say", "279:A3D935B6", "Oh, good work! Now I can finally successfully[ENTER]finish my research. As a reward, I will give you[ENTER]the secret recipe for a miracle cure that Baek-Go[ENTER]can brew for you. Have a nice day! And thanks for[ENTER]all your help. I wouldn't have managed it without[ENTER]you! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._266_say", "22:2BB5F890", "is missing! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._270_send_letter", "22:BDA5DD14", "Chaegirab's reward "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._290_say_title", "22:00B4815D", "Chaegirab's reward "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._300_say", "213:5120F673", "As a reward for getting the Leaders' Notes and[ENTER]the Soul Stone, the biologist Chaegirab has given[ENTER]you a secret recipe. Now go to Baek-Go, he'll[ENTER]make the miracle cure for you. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._310_npcChat", "20:8ED24A3B", "The secret recipe "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._315_say", "181:D249A593", "Oh, is that biologist Chaegirab's secret recipe?[ENTER]Hm, it will increase your attack value during[ENTER]fights against other heroes. Here's your potion. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._316_say", "115:DB393E24", "And this time it is the Blue Ebony Box. Are you[ENTER]curious? Then open it quickly! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._317_say_reward", "48:002D0792", "This is your reward for fulfilling Chaegirab's[ENTER]request. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._318_say_reward", "140:EDA4EBD9", "As a reward for fulfilling Chaegirab's request,[ENTER]your attack value for fights against other[ENTER]players (PvP) increases permanently by 8%. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90._319_say_reward", "37:E8171C25", "The increase is permanent. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv90.fail_wait_info", "158:CF16F451", "Even so, I'm going to examine this Note. Perhaps[ENTER]I'll at least find out who forged it. I won't be[ENTER]able to examine any further Notes until tomorrow."},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._020_send_letter", "26:003CB165", "Seon-Pyeong's research: %s "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._030_say", "116:35C2C5DA", "Seon-Pyeong in the Valley of Seungryong needs[ENTER]your help. Go see him and find out what's up. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._040_npcChat", "16:07492607", "Research help "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._060_say", "346:29E30F41", "Hey you, brave warrior! You've come just in time.[ENTER]I'm looking for a special type of jewel for my[ENTER]weapon research. Could you help me? Some of the[ENTER]creatures in the Grotto of Exile have these[ENTER]jewels. But I'm too important to risk my life in[ENTER]such a dangerous place. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._070_say", "376:87C7FEBD", "At the moment I need some impeccable Malevolence[ENTER]Jewels - beautiful gems that only grow in the[ENTER]depths of the mountains. They are special[ENTER]diamonds that were subjected to years of the evil[ENTER]god Beran-Setaou's powers and have absorbed a[ENTER]tiny part of his energy. I need 10 perfect[ENTER]jewels. Good luck and see you soon! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._080_say_title", "26:47F57889", "Jewels for Seon-Pyeong "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._090_say", "249:B335F9C6", "Weaponsmith and scientist Seon-Pyeong needs 10[ENTER]Malevolence Jewels for his weapon research. Take[ENTER]them to him individually, so that he can study[ENTER]them separately. You can get them from the[ENTER]Underworld Ice Men and the Underworld Ice Golems. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._100_sayReward", "39:2C1A4D51", "You have delivered %s jewels so far. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._110_say", "47:EC7703CF", "You cannot use the Researcher's Elixir yet. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._120_say", "21:F85EF4CA", "You've already used an elixir! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._130_say", "68:9023BC50", "You can use the elixir as soon as you have found[ENTER]a jewel. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._140_send_letter", "18:94C0C0CB", "Found the jewel "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._145_npcChat", "30:24235501", "Jewels for weapon research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._150_say", "120:9DFCA07A", "You? Here? I'm sorry, but I haven't finished[ENTER]studying the last one yet. Come back again later! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._160_say", "123:468AF523", "You haven't found anything yet? I'm sorry, but[ENTER]why are you here then? Come on, hurry up! Come[ENTER]back when you can bring me some jewels! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._170_say", "82:195B36DE", "You've found a jewel? Fantastic! Wait a second, I[ENTER]need to make sure... "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._180_say", "147:B954F7AC", "Oh yes, that's good. Without doubt it's one of[ENTER]the prettiest jewels that I've ever seen. Thank[ENTER]you very much! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._190_say", "157:07D4E87C", "But as you already know, I need another %s more[ENTER]of them with this kind of quality. Give me a day[ENTER]to examine this one thoroughly. Then you can[ENTER]bring me the next one. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._200_say", "12:A57357F3", "Good luck! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._210_say", "117:6B2FC57C", "That was the last jewel, you have collected all[ENTER]10 of them. I'm so grateful... and I won't be[ENTER]stingy with my reward. Now choose! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._220_1_select", "19:929FDEA4", "Hit Points +1000 "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._220_2_select", "12:6FE2165D", "Defence +120 "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._220_3_select", "9:037CFBAC", "Attack +51 "},
	{"collect_quest_lv92._230_say", "248:9FE245DE", "Hmm... and this jewel is really from the Grotto[ENTER]of Exile? It's pretty, but somehow it's missing[ENTER]something... I don't think it'll be any good to[ENTER]me. I'm going to study it anyway and in the[ENTER]meantime you can get me a new one, OK? "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._020_send_letter", "26:003CB165", "Seon-Pyeong's research: %s "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._030_say", "116:35C2C5DA", "Seon-Pyeong in the Valley of Seungryong needs[ENTER]your help. Go see him and find out what's up. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._040_npcChat", "16:07492607", "Research help "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._060_say", "305:2DFDA718", "Greetings! So you received my letter? Great, then[ENTER]you already know that I need help with my weapon[ENTER]research again. Since I rediscovered the grotto,[ENTER]more and more truths have been coming out. Now[ENTER]I've found out that the creatures in this[ENTER]mountain also rake other types of jewels out of[ENTER]the stone. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._070_say", "310:D93AE011", "It concerns the beautiful Wisdom Jewels - they're[ENTER]especially clear and pure diamonds which[ENTER]apparently contain the essence of the killed[ENTER]Goddess Bahar-Taraji. Keep your eyes open for[ENTER]some when you're in the grotto.[ENTER]I need 20 perfect specimens.[ENTER]Good luck and don't make me wait too long! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._080_say_title", "26:47F57889", "Jewels for Seon-Pyeong "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._090_say", "230:F841F54D", "The weaponsmith and researcher Seon-Pyeong needs[ENTER]20 Wisdom Jewels for his weapon research. Take[ENTER]them to him separately so that he can study them[ENTER]individually. You can get them from the Setaou[ENTER]Archers and the Setaou Commanders. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._100_sayReward", "39:2C1A4D51", "You have delivered %s jewels so far. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._110_say", "47:EC7703CF", "You cannot use the Researcher's Elixir yet. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._120_say", "21:F85EF4CA", "You've already used an elixir! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._130_say", "68:9023BC50", "You can use the elixir as soon as you have found[ENTER]a jewel. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._140_send_letter", "18:94C0C0CB", "Found the jewel "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._150_npcChat", "30:24235501", "Jewels for the weapon research "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._160_say", "123:67DA4868", "You again? I'm sorry, but I haven't finished[ENTER]studying the last one yet. Come back later! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._170_say", "123:468AF523", "You haven't found anything yet? I'm sorry, but[ENTER]why are you here then? Come on, hurry up! Come[ENTER]back when you can bring me some jewels! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._180_say", "82:195B36DE", "You've found a jewel? Fantastic! Wait a second, I[ENTER]need to make sure... "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._190_say", "147:BD6E3CFC", "Oh, a beautiful gemstone. Can you feel the warmth[ENTER]in your heart? The peace? That's all the stone's[ENTER]doing... Thank you so much! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._200_say", "157:07D4E87C", "But as you already know, I need another %s more[ENTER]of them with this kind of quality. Give me a day[ENTER]to examine this one thoroughly. Then you can[ENTER]bring me the next one. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._210_say", "12:A57357F3", "Good luck! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._230_1_select", "19:D1FEEDFB", "Hit Points +1100 "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._230_2_select", "12:32F484BD", "Defence +140 "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._230_3_select", "9:6C2D06B7", "Attack +60 "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._240_say", "245:665DEE0B", "Hmm... it's a pretty diamond, there's no doubt[ENTER]about it. But it doesn't seem to have a godly[ENTER]aura. I'm afraid it's not going to help me any[ENTER]further. Get me another one! And remember that[ENTER]I'll need some time to investigate this one in[ENTER]detail. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._250_say", "274:BDE1599F", "You actually managed it! 20 Wisdom Jewels... I'm[ENTER]impressed![ENTER]But unfortunately, it's just not enough. What I[ENTER]need next, to truly understand the nature of the[ENTER]power of these diamonds, is a Soul Stone: the[ENTER]Soul Stone of the Lord of the Grotto - the dragon[ENTER]Beran-Setaou. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._260_send_letter", "19:B508A9BD", "Seon-Pyeong's request "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._270_say_title", "21:5566DB66", "The Dragon's Soul Stone "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._280_say", "126:BF27ECC4", "You've managed to get hold of the dragon's soul[ENTER]stone. Take it to Seon-Pyeong at the entrance to[ENTER]the Grotto of Exile. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._290_say_title", "21:5566DB66", "The Dragon's Soul Stone "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._300_say", "137:594AC1EA", "You took 20 Wisdom Jewels to Seon-Pyeong in the[ENTER]Valley of Seungryong. Now he just needs the[ENTER]Dragon's Soul Stone! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._310_say", "30:77A9EB03", "You can get it from Beran-Setaou. "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._320_send_letter", "33:606CD3ED", "You have received the Dragon's Soul Stone."},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._330_npcChat", "26:2BFA7F8B", "I've got the Dragon's Soul Stone! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._340_say", "234:6C64524B", "That's... incredible. The dragon's soul stone![ENTER]I bow in the presence of your great skill! Now[ENTER]nothing stands in the way of my research - and I[ENTER]will give you a generous reward. Choose one! "},
	{"collect_quest_lv94._350_say", "180:05421785", "You've got the soul stone? And why can't I see it[ENTER]then?! Don't try to deliberately mislead me... I[ENTER]know that I gave you a difficult task, but I'm[ENTER]absolutely sure that you can do it! "},
	{"couple_ring._100_sendLetter", "16:B9AA2158", "Defeat the Jin-Hee "},
	{"couple_ring._10_npcChat", "30:FBD8D9E5", "Revenge for the Ringtrader "},
	{"couple_ring._110_sayReward", "190:2C63B603", "The Old Lady has asked for your support: her[ENTER]friend, the Ringtrader was murdered by the[ENTER]Jin-Hee, the elite of the White Oath. Avenge the[ENTER]death of the Ringtrader by killing 30 Jin-Hee. "},
	{"couple_ring._120_sayReward", "20:F38F6119", "Jin-Hee remaining: %d"},
	{"couple_ring._130_say", "172:698AD4A1", "Oh, I see you have you fought against the[ENTER]Jin-Hee? And you obviously couldn't defeat them[ENTER]all. I know about their strength and their skills[ENTER]- it's not an easy job.  "},
	{"couple_ring._140_say", "97:F98550F6", "The Ringtrader's family went into deep mourning[ENTER]after his death. It would be very noble of you if[ENTER]you could avenge his death to help them get over[ENTER]their loss. "},
	{"couple_ring._150_say", "138:077DDA74", "It's a shame that you don't want to avenge the[ENTER]Ringtrader's death. But of course every life has[ENTER]its value and of course you value your own life. "},
	{"couple_ring._160_say", "144:6D107109", "You can see something in the Old Lady's hands[ENTER]when she turns away. It's a shiny object - it[ENTER]could be a valuable stone. "},
	{"couple_ring._170_select", "19:C33ABBC5", "I will try again. "},
	{"couple_ring._180_say", "153:18AD9F75", "I'm not interested in valuable stones. I want the[ENTER]Ringtrader's death to be avenged, for the sake of[ENTER]his family. It's nice that you have reconsidered[ENTER]and want to fulfil the mission. "},
	{"couple_ring._190_say", "78:5CEBD58D", "My thoughts are with the Ringtrader's family at[ENTER]this difficult time. It's a shame that you didn't[ENTER]accept the challenge. "},
	{"couple_ring._200_sendLetter", "24:8BF79E93", "Back to the Old Lady "},
	{"couple_ring._20_sayTitle", "13:49EDAE86", "Old Lady "},
	{"couple_ring._210_say", "106:8DAB7E17", "Go back to the Old Lady and tell her that you[ENTER]have avenged the Ringtrader's death by killing[ENTER]the Jin-Hee. "},
	{"couple_ring._220_npcChat", "22:98724B81", "You have defeated 30 Jin-Hee! "},
	{"couple_ring._230_say", "236:32A9C52F", "You have defeated all Jin-Hee. Well done! The[ENTER]Ringtrader can rest in peace now. This is the[ENTER]piece of jewellery he has entrusted me with - a[ENTER]special engagement ring. It is yours now. This is[ENTER]your reward for avenging his death.[ENTER]I'm sure that's what he would have wanted. "},
	{"couple_ring._240_sayReward", "36:9E21293B", "You have received an engagement ring. "},
	{"couple_ring._250_sayItem", "24:427DEB33", "Engagement Ring "},
	{"couple_ring._255_sayItem", "49:BB805BD9", "This ring symbolises an imminent wedding. "},
	{"couple_ring._30_say", "316:39D49B06", "You are now one of the warriors of the village.[ENTER]If only I knew how you could use your new found[ENTER]skills. Have you ever heard of the Jin-Hee? They[ENTER]are a group of very dangerous elite warriors. One[ENTER]of them killed our village's Ringtrader. The[ENTER]merchant was not only a good friend of mine, but[ENTER]also a very fair man who sold jewellery to young[ENTER]couples who were intending to get married. Are[ENTER]you ready to avenge his death? In order to do so[ENTER]you have to kill 30 Jin-Hee... "},
	{"couple_ring._40_select", "33:04B2C6BE", "I will avenge the Ringtrader. "},
	{"couple_ring._50_select", "35:D7227E95", "No, the Jin-Hee are too strong for me. "},
	{"couple_ring._60_say", "158:7AB15378", "That is a very wise and honourable decision! But[ENTER]remember - you have to kill 30 Jin-Hee. Be[ENTER]careful though, they are crafty and very skilled[ENTER]at hiding themselves! "},
	{"couple_ring._70_say", "127:E62D4ABF", "Well, that is a regrettable decision, but it is[ENTER]up to you. After all, overconfidence can be[ENTER]lethal. Take care! "},
	{"couple_ring._75_say", "18:5BDD964C", "Amount of remaining Jin-Hee"},
	{"couple_ring._80_sayTitle", "30:25ADE62C", "You have defeated all Jin-Hee. "},
	{"couple_ring._90_say", "105:55299CA4", "Now that the Ringtrader's death has been avenged,[ENTER]your mission is complete. "},
	{"cube._060_npcChat", "29:3C89A02F", "Produce all potions "},
	{"cube._10_say", "276:3371AC87", "Greetings! Are you interested in creating various[ENTER]potions that can strengthen or heal you?[ENTER]I am a medic and very experienced in creating[ENTER]potions. I have several different recipes that[ENTER]aren't available anywhere else. Do you want to[ENTER]try them out? "},
	{"cube._20_say", "286:2D9165A9", "Refining things is an important craft. Are you[ENTER]interested in such skills? I can show you some of[ENTER]my herbal recipes. They're very useful for[ENTER]producing stronger variations of well-known[ENTER]potions. Or I can teach how to turn an everyday[ENTER]belt into a powerful tool. "},
	{"cube._30_npcChat", "14:DDAE2889", "The secret recipe "},
	{"cube._50_say", "253:2682410F", "I have found a secret family recipe. Using this[ENTER]recipe, I can make a potion that will make you[ENTER]almost invincible! Are you interested in trying[ENTER]out my potions? "},
	{"cube_opener_list._010_say", "84:9A296F50", "I need the following things to be able to refine[ENTER]this armour: %s. "},
	{"cube_opener_list._020_sayTitle", "11:3909AF70", "Materials: "},
	{"cube_opener_list._030_say", "20:FCCD8C27", "As a result, you receive: "},
	{"cube_opener_list._040_say", "65:E6822BC2", "Should I refine the following armour:[ENTER]%s[ENTER]to[ENTER]%s[ENTER]for you? "},
	{"cube_opener_list._050_say", "71:04F6DB8D", "I'm still missing one or two materials to fully[ENTER]complete my work. "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._100_npcChat", "24:7DF40996", "In the Devil's Catacomb "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._10_say", "60:A62086F0", "Destroy this gate's seal to reach the 3rd floor! "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._110_say", "193:B8A45367", "Access has been denied to you. You do not have[ENTER]enough experience to survive in the Devil's[ENTER]Catacomb. Come back when you have reached a[ENTER]minimum level of 75. "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._120_say", "145:CF13BE2E", "You are too weak to survive in the Devil's[ENTER]Catacomb. Come back when you have defeated the[ENTER]Death Reaper on the 9th floor of the Demon Tower. "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._130_say", "59:A2AFB1B0", "You have to wait 30 minutes before you can[ENTER]re-enter. "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._140_say", "41:9FDA0395", "Do you want to enter the Devil's Catacomb? "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._150_select", "20:C57B8734", "Yes, let me enter! "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._160_select", "17:0CC92FD0", "No, I don't wish to enter. "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._170_say", "104:3D518F59", "You won't be able to achieve anything here as a[ENTER]lone fighter. You can only enter the next floor[ENTER]with a group. "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._180_say", "37:2DAB0AA6", "Your group has already entered the dungeon. "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._190_say", "54:F9794015", "The entrance portal has been opened. Enter it[ENTER]quickly! "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._200_say", "104:DBCAD9B2", "The real adventure begins here! However, you have[ENTER]another hour to explore the Devil's Catacomb. "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._20_say", "29:7D739076", "You have %s minute(s) left. ", "b"},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._210_dNotice", "84:A2740804", "The time has expired. For your own safety you[ENTER]will be teleported out of the Devil's Catacomb. ", "b"},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._220_say", "50:8FB87F32", "Access has been denied to you. The door is still[ENTER]locked. "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._230_say", "72:2BCC2525", "Whilst examining the stone more closely, you[ENTER]discover an engraving. "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._240_say", "191:23A2956C", "Merely the owner of the Shrunken Head can enter,[ENTER]after the seals of all three doors have been[ENTER]broken open.[ENTER][ENTER]If you are not carrying this relic on you, you[ENTER]will be teleported out of the Devil's Catacomb. "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._270_say", "35:451B3C1B", "You will be teleported at any moment. "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._280_dNotice", "84:DA3AE99C", "The real Metin Stone has been destroyed. You can[ENTER]now go on to the 4th floor. ", "b"},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._290_dNotice", "59:31A0496D", "You destroyed the wrong Metin stone. Find the[ENTER]right one! ", "b"},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._300_say", "71:B8BDD98F", "You've done it! Here's the labyrinth's exit.[ENTER]Now go down to the 5th floor. "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._30_say", "66:945DDEE9", "Stay close to your group so that you are not left[ENTER]behind. "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._310_dNotice", "97:3ED53071", "A blood-curdling cry echoes out from the depths[ENTER]of the Devil's Catacomb. Charon has awoken! ", "b"},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._320_say", "93:4A1DCCEF", "You have defeated Charon! Now you will be[ENTER]teleported to the last floor of the Devil's[ENTER]Catacomb. ", "b"},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._330_dNotice", "17:C74991FF", "Defeat Azrael! ", "b"},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._340_say", "122:05DAC7B0", "Azrael has been defeated. Peace finally reigns in[ENTER]Devil's Catacomb again. Now you will be[ENTER]teleported to the surface. ", "b"},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._40_say", "144:DEEE8A00", "You have been defeated. The Dragon God's Blessing[ENTER]saved you in the nick of time and is now taking[ENTER]you out of the Devil's Catacomb. "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._50_say", "101:9DBD2B3C", "Destroy the creatures to receive the Soul Crystal[ENTER]Key. It opens the door to the 2nd floor. "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._60_say", "44:9ACB308D", "Look for the right Metin stone and destroy it! "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._70_say", "61:B6D94A08", "Find your way out of the labyrinth to reach the[ENTER]5th floor! "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._80_say", "99:277F3A9A", "Defeat the Demon Guards to receive the Grimace[ENTER]Totem. It will serve you as the key to the 6th[ENTER]floor. "},
	{"devilcatacomb_zone._90_say", "33:7517C8BB", "Defeat Charon and his henchmen! "},
	{"deviltower_zone._100_dNotice", "129:898DF63F", "You have proved that you have an excellent sense[ENTER]of hearing and instinct and have destroyed the[ENTER]real Metin Stone! Now you can enter the 4th[ENTER]floor. ", "b"},
	{"deviltower_zone._10_npcChat", "20:F6F355C5", "Into the Demon Tower... "},
	{"deviltower_zone._110_dNotice", "361:98F7DFBE", "You are at the sealed gate on the 4th floor. You[ENTER]need to open the five Ancient Seals to get to the[ENTER]next floor. The path there is full of creatures[ENTER]that will be waiting to pounce on you. Some of[ENTER]them have keys on them. Get hold of enough Key[ENTER]Stones, to open all five Ancient Seals and to get[ENTER]to the 5th floor. But beware: You only have 20[ENTER]minutes time! ", "b"},
	{"deviltower_zone._120_dNotice", "20:4E98B099", "You have 15 minutes left. ", "b"},
	{"deviltower_zone._130_dNotice", "215:E2EBB068", "You have opened the Key Stones' seal and can now[ENTER]enter the 5th floor. The Proud Demon King is also[ENTER]on that floor. Destroy all the creatures that you[ENTER]meet there. ", "b"},
	{"deviltower_zone._140_dNotice", "43:4FE3230E", "You have opened the seal! There are %s left. ", "b"},
	{"deviltower_zone._150_dNotice", "39:86FB0A24", "Kill all monsters on the 6th floor! ", "b"},
	{"deviltower_zone._160_dNotice", "194:940F1655", "You've killed all the creatures. Now go to the[ENTER]Blacksmith and pick up your reward - he will[ENTER]improve an item of your choice. In order to do[ENTER]this, drag the item that you want to improve onto[ENTER]the Blacksmith. ", "b"},
	{"deviltower_zone._170_npcChat", "14:0D46C3C7", "The upper floors "},
	{"deviltower_zone._190_say", "196:C4549494", "You want to enter the 6th floor of the tower? It[ENTER]requires great skill and experience to deal with[ENTER]this floor. I can teleport you there, but only[ENTER]once you've reached level 75. "},
	{"deviltower_zone._200_say", "115:75C1F3BE", "You have the necessary experience and therefore[ENTER]have a good chance of surviving the upper floors.[ENTER]You can enter now! "},
	{"deviltower_zone._20_sayTitle", "23:0F9070BE", "Demon Tower Guard "},
	{"deviltower_zone._210_select", "4:6EF7A824", "Go "},
	{"deviltower_zone._220_select", "13:23CD2E14", "Leave the tower "},
	{"deviltower_zone._230_say", "221:F0A966A6", "I can't allow you to enter the upper floors. You[ENTER]do not have enough experience yet. Come back when[ENTER]you have reached a minimum level of 75. "},
	{"deviltower_zone._240_dNotice", "97:7E163155", "The Zin-Sa-Gui Tower Map opens up the path to the[ENTER]next floor. You can find them by destroying the[ENTER]Metin Stones. ", "b"},
	{"deviltower_zone._250_say", "51:F9285AF9", "This map teleports you to the 7th floor of the[ENTER]Demon Tower. "},
	{"deviltower_zone._260_dNotice", "142:18174F42", "Find the right key to enter the next floor. You[ENTER]need the Zin-Bong-In Key to open Sa-Soe's seal. ", "b"},
	{"deviltower_zone._270_dNotice", "25:ECA53175", "Kill the leader of the demons. ", "b"},
	{"deviltower_zone._280_dNotice", "88:9738D5CD", "You have completed the quest successfully and[ENTER]will be teleported out in a few minutes. ", "b"},
	{"deviltower_zone._290_dNotice", "123:29EC97B8", "I'll be expecting you at Devil's Catacomb![ENTER]Follow me and my wrath will descend upon you like[ENTER]a tornado! ", "b"},
	{"deviltower_zone._30_say", "233:A5664545", "This tower is swarming with devils. Only the[ENTER]strongest can reach the top. Rumour has it that[ENTER]no one who has entered that tower has ever got[ENTER]out of there alive. You cannot enter the tower[ENTER]yet, as you haven't reached level 40. "},
	{"deviltower_zone._40_say", "218:9C8F6F3D", "This tower is swarming with devils. Only the[ENTER]strongest can reach the top. Rumour has it that[ENTER]no one who has entered that tower has ever got[ENTER]out of there alive. Do you still want to enter[ENTER]the Demon Tower? "},
	{"deviltower_zone._50_dNotice", "208:50557BE5", "You are at the sealed gate on the 3rd floor.[ENTER]A lot of fake stones are waiting here to confuse[ENTER]you, but one of them is the very important Metin[ENTER]Stone. You have to destroy it within 15 minutes[ENTER]or you will not be able to pass back through the[ENTER]gate. ", "b"},
	{"deviltower_zone._60_dNotice", "20:6760FEFB", "There are 10 minutes remaining. ", "b"},
	{"deviltower_zone._70_dNotice", "19:569422DF", "There are 5 minutes remaining. ", "b"},
	{"deviltower_zone._80_dNotice", "16:8A8E1CF4", "Your time is up. ", "b"},
	{"deviltower_zone._90_dNotice", "35:A2FD0C32", "The fake Metin Stones are disappearing. ", "b"},
	{"deviltower_zone._level7_start_loop", "174:CA13188D", "The curse of the Demon Tower seeps into your body,[ENTER]making you more vulnerable to damage. Leave this[ENTER]place or prepare for pain and suffering! "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._010_npcChat", "23:DCA32FED", "I want to kill the dragon! "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._020_say", "132:808EC769", "You're not the first to demand entry. Tell me the[ENTER]secret number, otherwise I won't let you in! "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._030_say", "29:7D3ADDFD", "That wasn't the right number! "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._040_select", "19:C33ABBC5", "I'll try it again. "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._050_say", "436:1FF2C8FE", "You're the first to demand entry to the Dragon's[ENTER]Temple. I'll let you in, as long as you have[ENTER]enough Twisted Keys. First you have to determine[ENTER]the secret code. Pass the secret code on to your[ENTER]competitors within the next 5 minutes so that[ENTER]they can also enter the room.[ENTER]Please remember that the power of the key only[ENTER]lasts 60 minutes. The dragon has to be defeated[ENTER]within this time frame! "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._060_select", "15:A7E7E601", "I'm ready! "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._070_say", "34:124B5EE8", "OK, I'm going to define the code now: "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._080_say", "43:2C579034", "The code can only contain digits. "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._090_notice", "43:58526B79", "%s's group is trying to kill the Blue Dragon! "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._100_say", "86:B547D028", "You don't have enough keys! To activate the[ENTER]portal, I need "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._105_say", "63:A051F696", "You can get it from the evil leaders Yonghan and[ENTER]Huashin. "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._110_npcChat", "25:22D9A7F0", "I want to leave this place! "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._115_say", "44:9D5F005B", "I'll take you back to the grotto's entrance. "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._116_select", "16:A72B9A03", "Yes, do that. "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._117_select", "23:1F73EA49", "No, I'll stay here. "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._120_say", "98:90C3D6D7", "Another group is already trying to kill the[ENTER]dragon. You'll have to wait a while before you[ENTER]can enter the Dragon's Temple. "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._130_say", "75:F17B3B70", "If you like, I can take you to the dragon's cave[ENTER]immediately. Give me "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._140_select", "22:C1666441", "Here, take this and let me in! "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._145_notice", "39:8F9B8389", "You have 5 minutes to pass on the code %s! "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._150_notice", "27:F887567B", "The Blue Dragon is still alive! "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._160_notice", "25:416AE3A4", "The Blue Dragon has returned! "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._165_sendLetter", "30:52E5FFDD", "Defeat the Blue Dragon "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._170_notice", "62:83127E27", "You have another %d minutes time to kill the Blue[ENTER]Dragon! "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._180_notice", "36:F6524147", "%s's group has killed the Blue Dragon! "},
	{"dragon_lair_access._190_npcChat", "33:36EE0C69", "I want to go back to the Dragon's Temple! "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._010_chat", "24:9D2BA17B", "Ghostly Polymorph Marbles "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._020_sayTitle", "16:C04287A8", "Ghost of a warrior: "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._030_say", "124:3D982626", "So, you want a Polymorph Marble, do you? To[ENTER]create one I need 150,000 Yang and %s of the[ENTER]following materials: "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._040_say", "171:B2AEB994", "Bring me the materials and 150,000 Yang and I'll[ENTER]create the Polymorph Marble. However, with my old[ENTER]hands I can't guarantee that there won't be any[ENTER]mistakes. "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._050_select", "7:9BB7C771", "Understood. "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._060_select", "38:AD34EE8A", "No, that sounds too arduous. "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._070_say", "23:F9EF8C2B", "Fine, that's your decision. "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._080_say", "96:9FE5B74C", "The stars are not aligned, you've come too soon![ENTER]You need to wait for %s. "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._090_questRest", "15:B7782156", "Remaining time "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._100_sendLetter", "17:076E61E1", "Collect Materials "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._110_sayTitle", "29:B7C77F86", "Materials for the Polymorph Marble "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._120_sendLetter", "18:9C6367A2", "Materials Collected "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._130_sayTitle", "28:09A971A4", "All Materials Collected "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._140_say", "62:60815716", "You still need %s of the following materials: "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._150_say", "187:5F2FD771", "You've collected all the required materials.[ENTER]Return to the Ghost of a Warrior. You'll find him[ENTER]in the second level of the Grotto of Exile. You[ENTER]also require 150,000 Yang to receive the marble. "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._160_notice", "75:7D2BE0F9", "You haven't managed to collect the required[ENTER]materials in the allowed time. "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._170_say", "42:9613D056", "Do you want to give me %s of this material? "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._175_say", "74:D19700B6", "Sadly you cannot afford my services.[ENTER]I require 150,000 Yang from you. "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._180_select", "8:BC1FDD10", "Here, you're welcome. "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._190_select", "28:6CCD732C", "No thanks, I'd rather keep them myself! "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._200_sayReward", "155:FAFE7B06", "Thank you, you have worked hard.[ENTER]Everything went according to plan. I'm clearly[ENTER]not as rusty as I thought. Here, take this: "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._205_sayReward", "152:57362D94", "Oh dear, my brittle old bones have failed me[ENTER]again. I wasn't able to craft any Polymorph[ENTER]Marbles. Allow me to give you this item by way of[ENTER]recompense: "},
	{"dragon_lair_weekly._210_say", "13:95550FBE", "As you wish. "},
	{"dragon_soul._010_sayTitle", "29:469D098F", "Dragon Stone Shard?! "},
	{"dragon_soul._020_say", "228:047711E7", "In your hand lies the fragment of a stone. It[ENTER]sparkles as if full of secrets and you can sense[ENTER]its power as it flows through you.[ENTER]What kind of stone is it? Take it to the[ENTER]alchemist. He will be able to help you further. "},
	{"dragon_soul._030_npcChat", "29:469D098F", "Dragon Stone Shard?! "},
	{"dragon_soul._040_say", "305:7581E5C6", "That is a fragment of a Dragon Stone - an[ENTER]extremely scarce and valuable crystal with great[ENTER]power. It is said that such a stone is the soul[ENTER]of a dragon. Unbelievably beautiful![ENTER]Do you feel its power as it flows through you as[ENTER]soon as you pick it up and carry it?[ENTER]Bring me a total of ten Dragon Stone Shards. I[ENTER]can then turn them into a complete stone. "},
	{"dragon_soul._050_npcChat", "31:03A089C7", "Dragon Stone transmutation "},
	{"dragon_soul._060_say", "116:6E800257", "Don't be so impatient. I can only transmute ten[ENTER]shards into a Dragon Stone. Keep searching! "},
	{"dragon_soul._070_say", "476:8F9F2D47", "Ah, very good! You have found ten Dragon Stone[ENTER]Shards. Please wait a moment.[ENTER]...[ENTER]Done it! My my, we've managed to create a Cor[ENTER]Draconis through the process - a crystalline[ENTER]dragon heart that encases and protects the Dragon[ENTER]Stone.[ENTER]Break it open to find out which stone it contains.It will be moved directly to the Dragon Stone[ENTER]Alchemy inventory.[ENTER]Did you know that you can also further refine[ENTER]Dragon Stones? "},
	{"dragon_soul._080_say", "286:B67FE80F", "You would like another Cor Draconis? Bah, I'm[ENTER]past my prime already and the production process[ENTER]for such a complex item wears my strength out.[ENTER]But I will try for you. Although, even at my[ENTER]best, I am not going to manage more than ten a[ENTER]day! "},
	{"dragon_soul._090_say", "176:2804717F", "That's enough for today. I simply can't manage to[ENTER]make more than ten a day. I'm at the end of my[ENTER]strength and I need to rest. Come again tomorrow. "},
	{"dragon_soul._100_npcChat", "13:8349D8B2", "Open shop "},
	{"dragon_soul._1010_sendLetter", "36:980270F3", "Arrival of the Dragon Stone Shard"},
	{"dragon_soul._1020_say", "103:B4AD5D1F", "The most knowledgeable mineral alchemist in the[ENTER]entire kingdom is looking for you. Go to him as[ENTER]soon as possible! "},
	{"dragon_soul._1030_npcChat", "29:469D098F", "Dragon Stone Shard?! "},
	{"dragon_soul._1040_say", "378:B1E06BC3", "Ah, there you are! I have discovered something[ENTER]quite remarkable: the fragment of a Dragon Stone![ENTER]A Dragon Stone is an extremely rare and valuable[ENTER]crystal with great power. It is said that they[ENTER]were once the soul of a dragon. Unbelievably[ENTER]beautiful! I will give you the Power of the[ENTER]Dragon Eye, so that you too can detect the shards[ENTER]too.[ENTER]Bring me a total of ten Dragon Stone Shards.[ENTER]I will then be able to transmute them into a[ENTER]complete stone. "},
	{"dragon_soul._1050_sendLetter", "34:620736DD", "Gather Dragon Stone Shards "},
	{"dragon_soul._1060_say", "50:DD0E3F38", "Bring the alchemist 10 Dragon Stone Shards. "},
	{"dragon_soul._1070_say", "575:BE9CE27B", "Ah, very good! You have found ten Dragon Stone[ENTER]Shards. Please wait a moment.[ENTER]...[ENTER]Incredible! The transmutation has resulted in a[ENTER]Cor Draconis - a crystalline dragon heart, that[ENTER]protectively surrounds the Dragon Stone.[ENTER]When you break it open, the Dragon Stone within[ENTER]will then go straight into the Dragon Stone[ENTER]Alchemy inventory.[ENTER]To find Dragon Stone Shards, you will need the[ENTER]Power of the Dragon Eye. I can lend it to you -[ENTER]just come and see me every day. Then you too will[ENTER]be able to transmute Dragon Stones! I have[ENTER]already done one for you today, the remaining %d[ENTER]you can manage on your own. "},
	{"dragon_soul._1080_say", "79:566DE674", "Hey, don't waste any time! Get out there and[ENTER]search for Dragon Stone Shards! "},
	{"dragon_soul._1090_sendLetter", "17:36670AC3", "Power of the Dragon Eye "},
	{"dragon_soul._1100_say", "31:3EAF6DA2", "Remaining Power of the Dragon Eye: %d "},
	{"dragon_soul._110_say", "8:27FBC9C2", "Select. "},
	{"dragon_soul._1110_notice", "43:600110DD", "There is no Dragon Stone Shard left. "},
	{"dragon_soul._1120_npcChat", "30:222ECE75", "Give me the Power of the Dragon Eye "},
	{"dragon_soul._1130_say", "166:6B6F780F", "Hello! You have already received the Power of the[ENTER]Dragon Eye today. The process weakens me so much[ENTER]that I can only help you once a day. Come again[ENTER]tomorrow! "},
	{"dragon_soul._1140_say", "258:8ADD5689", "Hello! I bet that you are here for the Power of[ENTER]the Dragon Eye. Correct? Very well then, here you[ENTER]are. Good luck on your hunt! I hope you find[ENTER]enough shards for ten Dragon Stones! "},
	{"dragon_soul._1150_sendLetter", "26:18FF2131", "No Power of the Dragon Eye "},
	{"dragon_soul._1160_say", "30:46F46A13", "The Power of the Dragon Eye has left you. "},
	{"dragon_soul._1170_say", "61:971D1446", "Go back to the alchemist tomorrow to once again[ENTER]gain the Power of the Dragon Eye! "},
	{"dragon_soul._1180_say", "59:BB5B5A46", "Go to the alchemist to get yourself the Power of[ENTER]the Dragon Eye! "},
	{"dragon_soul_daily_gift._010_npcChat", "26:5D47F3F8", "Cor Draconis as a gift "},
	{"dragon_soul_daily_gift._020_say", "184:CF5E6A1E", "Controlling the Power of the Dragon Eye is not as[ENTER]easy as it seems. Only experienced warriors are[ENTER]capable. Train a little longer in the art of[ENTER]battle and then return when you have reached at[ENTER]least level 50. "},
	{"dragon_soul_daily_gift._030_say", "112:46922CF5", "To be able to use a Cor Draconis, you will need[ENTER]to be able to use the Power of the Dragon Eye.[ENTER]Come back again when you believe you are capable[ENTER]of this! "},
	{"dragon_soul_daily_gift._040_say", "183:C3162798", "Ah, I sense the Power of the Dragon Eye within[ENTER]you. As a mark of my deep respect, I would like[ENTER]to present you with this Cor Draconis.[ENTER]One stone a day - I am afraid I cannot spare any[ENTER]more. "},
	{"dragon_soul_daily_gift._050_say", "31:9FC28672", "Here you go, your Cor Draconis. You're welcome. "},
	{"dragon_soul_daily_gift._060_say", "131:BB11178A", "I'm very sorry, I cannot spare more than one a[ENTER]day. Come again tomorrow. Perhaps I will have a[ENTER]new Cor Draconis for you then. "},
	{"dragon_soul_gift_mgr._010_npcChat", "33:79802456", "GM: Daily Quest - Settings "},
	{"dragon_soul_gift_mgr._020_say", "17:7CEBDF65", "Start time "},
	{"dragon_soul_gift_mgr._030_say", "17:A397D555", "End time "},
	{"dragon_soul_gift_mgr._040_say", "71:0E6ECC8F", "Enter following format for date and time:[ENTER]yy.mm.dd[ENTER]hh.mm "},
	{"dragon_soul_gift_mgr._050_say", "24:1995D849", "Do you want to continue? "},
	{"dragon_soul_gift_mgr._060_say", "17:648B4E54", "Quest activated "},
	{"dragon_soul_refine._010_npcChat", "33:D60CD07A", "Dragon Stone Refinement "},
	{"dragon_soul_refine._020_say", "277:EC82DC58", "You would like to refine a Dragon Stone? Fair[ENTER]enough. You should know however, that this[ENTER]process can fail. I have heard that these Dragon[ENTER]Beans that you can find behind the spinning coin[ENTER]improve the chances of success. "},
	{"energy_system._001_npcChat", "15:2B9F7C79", "A new technology! "},
	{"energy_system._010_say", "190:C775EDE3", "I've done it![ENTER]I have finally managed to develop a completely[ENTER]new technology.[ENTER]I've managed to process items and extract pure[ENTER]energy from them. It's absolutely brilliant! "},
	{"energy_system._020_say", "304:BE046738", "If you destroy an item using my new technology,[ENTER]you will receive an Energy Fragment. If you merge[ENTER]30 of these fragments, you will receive a[ENTER]powerful Energy Crystal! Pure, unfiltered energy,[ENTER]bundled with a Gemstone. This power will flow[ENTER]into your entire equipment.[ENTER]Are you interested in it? "},
	{"energy_system._030_say", "183:A2A022DF", "Bring equipment items such as weapons, jewellery[ENTER]and the clothing that you find whilst on the hunt[ENTER]to me. I will process them into Energy Fragments.[ENTER]Our kingdom's future and hope has been pinned on[ENTER]this technology. We will become invincible! "},
	{"energy_system._035_npcChat", "26:8B8038F5", "Extract Energy Fragments "},
	{"energy_system._040_say", "290:90CB3A46", "Did it work? Did you receive Energy Fragments?[ENTER]Bring me more items and I will shatter them using[ENTER]alchemy. My technology has not quite been[ENTER]perfected yet. That's why I can never guarantee[ENTER]how many fragments you will receive. "},
	{"energy_system._050_say", "118:2320C11B", "There is one condition: your own level as well as[ENTER]that of the item must have a minimum level of 35.[ENTER]Hm, let's take a look... "},
	{"energy_system._060_say", "83:B1945848", "You aren't strong enough yet! Come again, when[ENTER]you have reached a minimum level of 35. "},
	{"energy_system._070_say", "127:9F8A8E5D", "Ah, excellent! You are strong and experienced.[ENTER]Give me the item that you want me to process. "},
	{"energy_system._080_say", "165:8D23480C", "You are not strong enough to control the power[ENTER]inside these Energy Fragments. Come again when[ENTER]you have reached a minimum level of 35. "},
	{"energy_system._090_say", "93:8A26AAC1", "This item is not suitable for my technology.[ENTER]Bring me something else. "},
	{"energy_system._100_say", "143:2434C077", "This item does not have enough energy. Bring me[ENTER]one with a minimum level of 35 - that's the only[ENTER]way I'll be able extract its energy with my[ENTER]technology. "},
	{"energy_system._110_say", "39:56DB8EC4", "Should I destroy this item? "},
	{"energy_system._120_select", "4:48F9C4CD", "Yes "},
	{"energy_system._130_select", "18:810E1857", "No, not yet! "},
	{"energy_system._140_say", "106:B10E542B", "I have failed - unfortunately I could not extract[ENTER]any Energy Fragments. Perhaps I'll have better[ENTER]luck next time. "},
	{"energy_system._150_say", "89:EB2F66F3", "Wonderful! I managed to find %d Energy Fragments.[ENTER]There you go. "},
	{"energy_system._160_npcChat", "22:3F021F02", "Produce Energy Crystal "},
	{"energy_system._170_say", "167:17C60A9C", "Have you used up all your power reserves already?[ENTER]You shouldn't work so hard and put your life on[ENTER]the line in such a careless way. I will need %d[ENTER]Energy Fragments to produce an Energy Crystal. "},
	{"energy_system._180_say", "188:CAE4A26F", "You do not have enough Energy Fragments.[ENTER]I can't produce an Energy Crystal with that.[ENTER]Come again when you have collected at least %d[ENTER]fragments. "},
	{"energy_system._190_say", "182:7DB9A31F", "Very good, you have got the %d required Energy[ENTER]Fragments. I can produce an Energy Crystal with[ENTER]that. Please wait a minute. I'll try, but I can't[ENTER]guarantee it will work. "},
	{"energy_system._200_say", "201:5CA51BED", "Everything's ready to melt the fragments into an[ENTER]Energy Crystal. However, I have to live on[ENTER]something too and my tools don't just fall from[ENTER]the sky. I require a small expenses charge of %d[ENTER]Yang. Are you willing to pay? "},
	{"energy_system._210_select", "12:B8E85D39", "Naturally. "},
	{"energy_system._220_select", "16:5255EEF4", "No, not right now. "},
	{"energy_system._230_say", "112:1A9AF378", "All right, I respect your decision.[ENTER]Come again when you have changed your mind and[ENTER]need an Energy Crystal after all. "},
	{"energy_system._240_say", "144:86353AC3", "Sorry, you have to pay first. I'm not a charity.[ENTER]That's just business - give me the money and then[ENTER]I'll do my work. "},
	{"energy_system._250_say", "231:4182CD84", "Here, your Energy Crystal. But it's only the[ENTER]first attempt that's always successful. Alchemy[ENTER]is an unpredictable science - minor mistakes lead[ENTER]to failure! There is always a small chance that[ENTER]the experiment might fail. "},
	{"energy_system._260_say", "214:204D1A62", "Unfortunately, the attempt failed. I couldn't[ENTER]produce an Energy Crystal. My technology is[ENTER]brilliant - but the process is full of risks.[ENTER]Things don't always work according to plan. Next[ENTER]time I'm sure we'll be successful! "},
	{"energy_system._270_say", "128:E684152A", "I knew it! My technology is brilliant![ENTER]Here's your Energy Crystal. It's certainly a fine[ENTER]specimen! Can you feel its power? "},
	{"entry_event_map._010_sayTitle", "21:09777179", "Gameland Supervisor "},
	{"entry_event_map._020_say", "31:1E24797A", "Would you like to leave the Gameland? "},
	{"entry_event_map._030_say", "32:50441B15", "Would you like to enter the Gameland? "},
	{"entry_event_map._040_say", "72:2E05D336", "Currently only players with a level between %s[ENTER]and %s may enter the Gameland. "},
	{"entry_event_map._050_say", "123:3EC1AF74", "Unfortunately, members of your kingdom cannot[ENTER]participate in the events currently taking place[ENTER]in the Gameland. "},
	{"entry_event_map._060_say", "65:928DF520", "The Gameland is already really full. No-one else[ENTER]can enter currently. "},
	{"entry_event_map._070_say", "30:69D3C18B", "The event starts now! "},
	{"entry_event_map._080_npcChat", "11:6A81CB2F", "Gameland "},
	{"entry_event_map._090_npcChat", "25:CB06DF4F", "GM: Gameland Supervisor "},
	{"entry_event_map._100_select", "25:E6C70AA4", "GM: Prepare Gameland "},
	{"entry_event_map._110_select", "25:99BEDBD8", "GM: Clear Gameland "},
	{"entry_event_map._120_select", "23:386EE55D", "GM: Evacuate Gameland "},
	{"entry_event_map._130_say", "162:9CAB9E35", "The Gameland will now close and the event reset.[ENTER]All participants will be teleported back to their[ENTER]village in 30 seconds. "},
	{"entry_event_map._140_say", "68:8ACCE285", "To be able to evacuate the event, you have to be[ENTER]located in the Gameland. "},
	{"entry_event_map._150_say", "62:94840F06", "Which level ranks should take part in the event? "},
	{"entry_event_map._160_say", "109:F3EFA2DA", "Please enter the maximum number of users that may[ENTER]participate.[ENTER](Max. amount in Gameland: 200) "},
	{"entry_event_map._170_say", "38:1ED6B9CB", "Which kingdom should participate? "},
	{"entry_event_map._180_say", "32:FBE0D87A", "Following settings have been selected: "},
	{"entry_event_map._190_say", "20:9D690AC2", "Level range: "},
	{"entry_event_map._200_say", "14:D8B7EAA4", "Player - amount: "},
	{"entry_event_map._210_say", "18:6C9018FA", "Player - kingdom: "},
	{"entry_event_map._220_notice_all", "183:32CA0E98", "The Gameland is now open to all kingdoms. Players[ENTER]from level %s to level %s can participate in the[ENTER]event. Speak to the Battle Bailiff to gain[ENTER]access. ", "b"},
	{"entry_event_map._230_notice_all", "176:32BC0E05", "The Gameland is now open for the %s. Players from[ENTER]level %s to level %s can participate in the[ENTER]event. Speak with the Battle Bailiff to gain[ENTER]access. ", "b"},
	{"entry_event_map._240_say", "47:764B01DF", "Select the amount of players that can participate. "},
	{"entry_event_map._250_say", "60:B306689E", "You have entered an invalid number. Permitted[ENTER]amounts: 1 - 200 "},
	{"event_easter._020_sayTitle", "19:17C66C41", "Easter Bunny: "},
	{"event_easter._030_say", "94:30845255", "I have hidden Easter Eggs all over the place![ENTER]Find them and bring them to me and I'll give you[ENTER]a reward. "},
	{"event_easter._035_say", "126:2D5B6F03", "Unfortunately you haven't collected any Easter[ENTER]Eggs yet! Come back when you've got some Easter[ENTER]Eggs in your inventory. "},
	{"event_easter._040_chat", "19:33479B21", "I have found Easter Eggs! "},
	{"event_easter._050_say", "52:6D195093", "Very good! I'll exchange your Easter Eggs for %d[ENTER]of these: "},
	{"event_easter._055_say", "44:D4949A98", "You have brought me the following amount of eggs:[ENTER]%d "},
	{"event_easter._060_say", "19:1B06011E", "Did you find some Easter Eggs? "},
	{"event_easter._065_say", "35:CA902E02", "You have to give me %d eggs for that! "},
	{"event_easter._070_select", "10:8ABE7492", "Okay, I'll take it! "},
	{"event_easter._071_select", "19:AF49C53B", "No, I'd rather not. "},
	{"event_easter._080_say", "84:C714AB01", "Thanks for the eggs. Have fun with your Easter[ENTER]present! "},
	{"event_easter._090_sayTitle", "14:2D360831", "Empty Basket: "},
	{"event_easter._100_say", "29:7410DBA7", "Would you like to have this item? "},
	{"event_flame_dungeon_open._010_npcChat", "22:BE6BA097", "Problems in the Fireland "},
	{"event_flame_dungeon_open._020_say", "173:5FFE2EDF", "Hey, have you heard yet? A huge ruin has been discovered in the Fireland. If I were a warrior like you, I would dare to go there, but my skills are not good enough for that. "},
	{"event_flame_dungeon_open._030_say", "151:3E33BC89", "Hmm... come back later, so that I can give you a teleport scroll with the coordinates of the ruins... will you go there and tell me about it? I am very curious... hoho "},
	{"event_flame_dungeon_open._040_npcChat", "27:FBDD33C4", "Give me the teleport scroll "},
	{"event_flame_dungeon_open._050_say", "164:531D00A0", "Oh ho, you really are brave. You dare to set out for the Fireland, where it is hot and stifling. Only a true warrior could say that. Well then, let's see... "},
	{"event_flame_dungeon_open._060_say", "172:30A3BD0E", "Yes, here it is. As I promised, I am giving you a teleport scroll with the coordinates of the ruins. I am adding a Passage Ticket as well. Off you go, and tell me later what you find there. Take care of yourself. "},
	{"event_flame_dungeon_open._070_say", "119:C691DD6F", "Hello! Even for me it is quite hard to make a teleport scroll. I can only give you one a day, so come back tomorrow. "},
	{"event_flame_dungeon_open._080_say", "79:BC5F5425", "Before you can enter the dungeon, you have to defeat a few cyclopes. Good luck! "},
	{"event_halloween_hair._100_say", "219:05104175", "You can use the Magic Wand to transform a[ENTER]Halloween Pumpkin into a Halloween Chest.[ENTER]Monsters drop the pumpkins and I put the Magic[ENTER]Wand behind the rotating coin so that no one[ENTER]would steal it from me. Give it a try! "},
	{"event_halloween_hair._10_npcChat", "17:AC69097B", "Hey, pumpkin head! "},
	{"event_halloween_hair._110_say", "112:12E178A0", "The Jack O'Lantern Mask can last for 6 hours, 1[ENTER]day or 7 days. But that's decided at random! "},
	{"event_halloween_hair._120_say", "130:CCFBF6E1", "There you are. The attributes of your mask are[ENTER]set at random. Every mask is different.[ENTER]Just try it out. Happy Halloween! "},
	{"event_halloween_hair._130_say", "60:528865A0", "Do you want to exchange the Pumpkin Mask Card for[ENTER]a Pumpkin Mask now? "},
	{"event_halloween_hair._140_select_1", "4:48F9C4CD", "Yes "},
	{"event_halloween_hair._140_select_2", "4:AEC6064F", "No "},
	{"event_halloween_hair._30_say", "34:10A48A8A", "Where am I? And who are you? "},
	{"event_halloween_hair._40_say", "299:7BC13634", "Hey! Watch your mouth! I'm no pumpkin head![ENTER]My name is Jack Pumpkin. And this is just a[ENTER]costume. I'm a little confused right now, I was[ENTER]just at a Halloween party and all of a sudden,[ENTER]everything started to spin around me. And now I'm[ENTER]here... "},
	{"event_halloween_hair._50_say", "68:DB1E1B6D", "Now let me celebrate Halloween in peace! "},
	{"event_halloween_hair._60_npcChat", "24:51C68C68", "Exchange Jack O'Lantern Mask Card "},
	{"event_halloween_hair._70_say", "136:7FE4BD27", "You again! Want to know a secret? With a little[ENTER]luck, you'll find a Jack O'Lantern Mask Card in[ENTER]those Halloween Chests. "},
	{"event_halloween_hair._80_say", "78:E3F16293", "You can use this card to receive one of these[ENTER]spooky Jack O'Lantern masks. Do you want a mask? "},
	{"event_halloween_hair._90_say", "81:697F9A90", "You don't have a Jack O'Lantern Mask Card?[ENTER]Then you don't get a Jack O'Lantern mask! Haha! "},
	{"event_ramadan._010_npcChat", "10:0E4EF84C", "Historian: "},
	{"event_ramadan._020_sayTitle", "10:0E4EF84C", "Historian: "},
	{"event_ramadan._030_say", "77:6DFC77CC", "Learn from the past and be open to the future![ENTER]How can I be of assistance? "},
	{"event_ramadan._040_say", "24:0E5766EA", "I am sorry, do we know one another? "},
	{"event_ramadan._050_say", "164:BC19F925", "Pardon my manners, I forgot to introduce myself.[ENTER]I am the much travelled Historian. If you have[ENTER]any questions regarding history, don't shy away[ENTER]from asking me! "},
	{"event_ramadan._060_say", "67:B0391C84", "It is my honour to get to know you. I should[ENTER]visit you more often. "},
	{"event_ramadan._070_npcChat", "10:A1170C0D", "Something sweet "},
	{"event_ramadan._100_say", "23:E0D60317", "A shame. Till next time. "},
	{"event_ramadan._110_say", "87:625FE923", "Then you understand what I mean. If you want[ENTER]these Sweets, please bring me a piece of Bread. "},
	{"event_ramadan._120_say", "62:3727E62F", "I will give you one Sweet for 10 Bread. Do you[ENTER]agree? "},
	{"event_ramadan._130_select_1", "8:9DBF42CD", "Absolutely "},
	{"event_ramadan._130_select_2", "13:A9173E45", "No Time "},
	{"event_ramadan._140_say", "77:9EEB88C5", "Every time you bring me 10 Bread, I will give you[ENTER]a Sweet. "},
	{"event_ramadan._150_say", "46:FD75DA40", "That isn't enough Bread, I can't do much with[ENTER]that. "},
	{"event_ramadan._160_say", "64:2BB619C8", "That is enough Bread, here's some Sweets. "},
	{"event_ramadan._170_say", "44:F3813FC0", "Gather more and I will give you more in return. "},
	{"event_ramadan._180_npcChat", "14:1E9BD11F", "Tasty Bread "},
	{"event_ramadan._180_say", "73:2EC2313E", "I am full to the brim with all this bread you[ENTER]have given me. "},
	{"event_ramadan._190_say", "127:EED822AB", "There are a lot of citizens here who are fasting.[ENTER]It would be nice if you could bring them[ENTER]something to break fast with. "},
	{"event_ramadan._200_say", "95:3580D6EA", "To show your thoughtfulness, perhaps you could[ENTER]bring them the bread on a Donation Plate. "},
	{"event_ramadan._210_say", "114:BD55C0D5", "Thank you for the amazing bread! You are a wise[ENTER]and merciful person. You will be rewarded. "},
	{"event_ramadan._220_npcChat", "17:A2DE4FE6", "I'm hungry... "},
	{"event_ramadan._230_sayTitle", "23:BEDF1362", "Fasting Citizen: "},
	{"event_ramadan._240_say", "120:D162C4F7", "I am really hungry. Show some compassion and[ENTER]break fast with me. Please bring me a Food[ENTER]Donation so that I do not starve. "},
	{"event_ramadan._250_say", "78:E51E657C", "That bread smells so good. Would you give it to[ENTER]me?[ENTER]I'd be truly grateful. "},
	{"event_ramadan._260_select_1", "17:9EF8CE68", "Help yourself "},
	{"event_ramadan._260_select_2", "18:828E921B", "No, I'm keeping it "},
	{"event_ramadan._270_say", "115:802769E0", "You are hard of heart and mean. If you change[ENTER]your mind, you know where to find me. "},
	{"event_ramadan._280_say", "132:1371050E", "My thanks to you. You truly are a wise and[ENTER]generous person. May your good deeds be richly[ENTER]rewarded. "},
	{"event_ramadan._290_npcChat", "22:27C1F32C", "Blessing Fruit "},
	{"event_ramadan._300_say", "158:69FCBECF", "I heard of the 'Blessing Fruit' on my travels.[ENTER]This fruit rewards the hard worker who returns[ENTER]regularly in the same hour. "},
	{"event_ramadan._310_say", "113:1B6941F7", "I have already seen you today and you have[ENTER]already been rewarded. Please remember: only the[ENTER]patient reach their goal. "},
	{"event_ramadan._320_npcChat", "22:C951E9E6", "The Fortune of the Bold "},
	{"event_ramadan._330_say", "117:F5DDEB21", "I have been expecting you. My time here is[ENTER]running out and I am heading out into the world[ENTER]in search of more historical information. "},
	{"event_ramadan._340_say", "49:65379A2F", "You have kept %d Blessing Fruit safe for me. "},
	{"event_ramadan._350_say", "79:0D94FCD1", "Would you give them to me for my long journey? It[ENTER]shouldn't put you out any. "},
	{"event_ramadan._360_select_1", "15:45B4C0BF", "Please, take them "},
	{"event_ramadan._360_select_2", "4:AEC6064F", "No "},
	{"event_ramadan._370_say", "70:848ED16E", "Think about it carefully... I am here a little[ENTER]while longer. "},
	{"event_ramadan._380_say", "41:8CF52F9F", "Thank you for your generosity and your hard work! "},
	{"event_ramadan._390_sayReward", "23:A5516F5F", "Black Horse Seal "},
	{"event_ramadan._400_say", "81:1914E7AB", "You have less than 5? A shame, there isn't much I[ENTER]can do with that. Perhaps next time. "},
	{"event_ramadan._80_say", "42:DBE4142F", "Do you know much about sweets? These ones are[ENTER]called Baklava. "},
	{"event_ramadan._90_select_1", "11:33712939", "Yes, I have heard of them. "},
	{"event_ramadan._90_select_2", "17:6724165A", "No, I'm sorry. "},
	{"find_brother_article._100_select", "7:2568ABFA", "Refuse "},
	{"find_brother_article._10_npcChat", "19:BD9E24BC", "Why are you crying? "},
	{"find_brother_article._110_say", "131:B892D18D", "Of course I'll help you. The mission is not too[ENTER]difficult to accomplish and I can understand that[ENTER]you want to have the memento back. See you soon! "},
	{"find_brother_article._120_say", "78:97291270", "I've got more important things to do, why should[ENTER]I help an orphan? "},
	{"find_brother_article._130_sendLetter", "27:AE14DDF4", "Keepsake of Mirine's Brother. "},
	{"find_brother_article._135_sendLetter", "16:C5742C33", "Return to Mirine! "},
	{"find_brother_article._136_say", "61:728E60E6", "You have obtained the Brother's Keepsake.[ENTER]Go back and hand it over to Mirine! "},
	{"find_brother_article._140_sayReward", "185:44CF8539", "Mirine's brother is dead and the Black Wind[ENTER]Maniacs stole the only keepsake she had of him.[ENTER]Kill Black Wind Maniacs until you find Mirine's[ENTER]brother's Black Uniform. "},
	{"find_brother_article._150_npcChat", "35:02011900", "About your brother's uniform... "},
	{"find_brother_article._160_say", "156:2FBE2613", "Do you want to abandon the search? I haven't[ENTER]asked too much of you. I would really like a[ENTER]keepsake of my brother. Please help me! "},
	{"find_brother_article._170_select", "10:6C90886C", "Give up "},
	{"find_brother_article._180_sayReward", "96:413E34AE", "It's almost impossible to refuse this girl's[ENTER]request. A battle against 100 members of the[ENTER]Black Wind Gang seems to be much easier in[ENTER]comparison. "},
	{"find_brother_article._190_say", "120:51441919", "I'm sorry. I feel for you, but the Black Wind[ENTER]Gang is too strong for me. Someone else with more[ENTER]experience would be better at this job. "},
	{"find_brother_article._200_say", "191:53D9FF4E", "Oh no... I have asked others for help, but none[ENTER]of them have returned. You're my last hope.[ENTER]Look, this is the most valuable thing I own. I[ENTER]will give it to you as a reward. "},
	{"find_brother_article._205_sayReward", "167:A7461E16", "The girl carefully lifts out an item that has[ENTER]been wrapped in a blanket - it's a sword. The[ENTER]engravings on the hilt indicate that it is a very[ENTER]valuable weapon. "},
	{"find_brother_article._210_select", "19:52B1D91B", "Accept the challenge "},
	{"find_brother_article._220_say", "45:75216863", "It's not because of the reward, but I will accept[ENTER]the challenge. "},
	{"find_brother_article._230_say", "185:D45B0D1C", "You are right. Nobody has ever returned - all of[ENTER]them lost their lives. Life is more important[ENTER]than any number of memories. It would be[ENTER]pointless to sacrifice even more lives. Farewell! "},
	{"find_brother_article._240_npcChat", "36:9CC1591D", "I have found your brother's keepsake! "},
	{"find_brother_article._250_say", "180:9E4762F7", "Thank you very much! He always wore this uniform.[ENTER]He never wanted to wear anything else...[ENTER]Here, take it. This is the most valuable thing[ENTER]that I own. I don't need it, so please take it. "},
	{"find_brother_article._260_sayReward", "34:2D460E44", "You have accepted Mirine's reward. "},
	{"find_brother_article._270_sendLetter", "15:5269D48F", "Mirine's reward "},
	{"find_brother_article._280_say", "97:DF66861B", "You unwrap Mirine's valuable reward and find a[ENTER]sword with a wonderfully ornamented hilt. "},
	{"find_brother_article._290_say", "135:539076DC", "A wonderful weapon. But... what is this? The[ENTER]blade is broken![ENTER]This beautiful piece of craftsmanship is too good[ENTER]to be thrown away. I should take the pieces to[ENTER]the blacksmith. "},
	{"find_brother_article._300_sayReward", "54:48AEF77D", "You have received a broken sword. Take it to the[ENTER]Blacksmith to be repaired. "},
	{"find_brother_article._30_say", "59:95F6F8DF", "Oh sorry, I didn't hear you come in. I was[ENTER]thinking about my poor brother. But who are you? "},
	{"find_brother_article._310_sendLetter", "20:038B5485", "Go to the Blacksmith "},
	{"find_brother_article._320_say", "271:C61E225F", "Mirine was so grateful for your help that she[ENTER]gave you her most valuable possession: a[ENTER]wonderful sword which unfortunately is broken. At[ENTER]first glance you realise that it is a very[ENTER]valuable weapon, so you decide to take it to be[ENTER]repaired. "},
	{"find_brother_article._330_targetVid", "15:67A72D9A", "Repairing the sword "},
	{"find_brother_article._340_npcChat", "31:64B766FA", "Can you repair the sword? "},
	{"find_brother_article._350_say", "180:A682B04C", "That's a wonderful sword! It belonged to Mirine,[ENTER]didn't it? I heard that you helped her. Well[ENTER]done, you seem to be a honest and righteous[ENTER]person so I won't charge you for repairing the[ENTER]weapon. Wait a minute... "},
	{"find_brother_article._360_say", "95:F4FB6249", "Here, the blade is as good as new. A truly fine[ENTER]weapon. Take it, my friend. "},
	{"find_brother_article._370_sayReward", "28:A0131319", "You have received a Silver Sword+3. "},
	{"find_brother_article._380_sayReward", "32:6DC5503B", "You have received an Orchid Sword+2. "},
	{"find_brother_article._390_sayReward", "33:A98FFB4D", "You have received a Bastard Sword+2. "},
	{"find_brother_article._400_sayReward", "31:EDEACBA7", "You have received a Barbarian Sword+2. "},
	{"find_brother_article._40_say", "77:022A0727", "I just happened to be walking past and I heard[ENTER]you crying. "},
	{"find_brother_article._50_say", "276:614E7331", "Oh, I didn't realise that someone was nearby...[ENTER]My name is Mirine. Perhaps you could help me? My[ENTER]older brother is dead. He was on his way to get[ENTER]medicine but then...[ENTER]The only thing I have left of him is the sight of[ENTER]his grave and one keepsake: his black uniform. "},
	{"find_brother_article._70_say", "318:59B36753", "On my way home, the Black Wind Gang appeared -[ENTER]one of the infamous groups of lawless assassins.[ENTER]I had to flee from them and lost my brother's[ENTER]keepsake. I'm too scared to go back there and[ENTER]look for it. Could you do it for me? "},
	{"find_brother_article._80_sayReward", "95:9543328F", "Show mercy and help this poor girl to look for[ENTER]her brother's old Black Uniform! "},
	{"find_brother_article._90_select", "9:23A53143", "Accept "},
