	{"find_squareguard._100_npcChat", "36:F4FF749E", "Where can I buy the Red Potion? "},
	{"find_squareguard._10_targetVid", "12:3DB6839B", "Guardian"},
	{"find_squareguard._110_sayTitle", "10:06E874BB", "Guardian: "},
	{"find_squareguard._120_say", "258:C0D66DC5", "You can get the red potion from the General Store[ENTER]Saleswoman. She's over there. If you can't see[ENTER]her, go towards the flashing circle on the big[ENTER]map or the flashing red dot on the mini map! "},
	{"find_squareguard._130_sayTitle", "20:F10E5104", "General Store Saleswoman: "},
	{"find_squareguard._131_targetVid", "20:F10E5104", "General Store Saleswoman: "},
	{"find_squareguard._140_say", "229:81626AE7", "Welcome adventurer![ENTER]Oh, so the Guardian sent you? He needs a Red[ENTER]Potion? I'll give you five of them.[ENTER]Here you are. These are for regeneration of[ENTER]vitality and are actually quite tasty. "},
	{"find_squareguard._150_say", "156:C1FD4386", "You may be new in town, but I'm sure that you're[ENTER]going to become a regular customer soon.[ENTER]That's why I'm giving you these potions for free.[ENTER]Come round again some time. "},
	{"find_squareguard._160_sayReward", "61:C5003AAA", "You have received 5 Red Potions from the General[ENTER]Store Saleswoman. "},
	{"find_squareguard._170_sayReward", "65:AB6389BF", "The Red Potions are for regeneration of hit[ENTER]points (HP). "},
	{"find_squareguard._180_sendLetter", "22:E4D0952A", "Return to the Guardian "},
	{"find_squareguard._190_sayReward", "46:C09462E1", "Return to the Guardian and give him his Potions. "},
	{"find_squareguard._200_say", "165:DC624D04", "You didn't get the Red Potion I asked for? What a[ENTER]shame! Okay, keep the Yang for your troubles.[ENTER]By the way, the teachers have asked for you. You[ENTER]should go see them. "},
	{"find_squareguard._20_sayReward", "138:3AA8552C", "Go to the centre of the village and speak to the[ENTER]Guardian.He'll give you your first mission.[ENTER]You'll find him in the centre of the village. "},
	{"find_squareguard._20_sendLetter", "12:3DB6839B", "Guardian"},
	{"find_squareguard._210_say", "392:3428573A", "Thank you for bringing me the potion! I didn't[ENTER]even need to leave my place here in the village[ENTER]and can now fulfil my duties better. You want to[ENTER]know what I do? Well, generally I just announce[ENTER]useful information. Sometimes I also offer my[ENTER]services to people who are in trouble or are[ENTER]being attacked. But my main job is to take care[ENTER]of the guilds. If you're interested in joining or[ENTER]founding a guild, just come see me. "},
	{"find_squareguard._220_say", "210:EA747CF7", "By the way, the teachers are looking for you. You[ENTER]should head there now. Oh, I almost forgot! As a[ENTER]sign of my appreciation you can keep the change![ENTER]See you later. "},
	{"find_squareguard._30_sayTitle", "10:06E874BB", "Guardian: "},
	{"find_squareguard._40_say", "238:F3DF7F91", "Welcome to our village, adventurer! I would be[ENTER]very grateful if you would do me a favour. If I[ENTER]give you 200 Yang, would you buy me a Red Potion?[ENTER]You can get it from the General Store Saleswoman.[ENTER]I'm working at the moment, so I'm afraid I can't[ENTER]leave the Village Square. "},
	{"find_squareguard._50_select", "4:48F9C4CD", "Yes "},
	{"find_squareguard._60_sayReward", "179:AF32B10D", "You have received 200 Yang from the Guardian. You[ENTER]can use Yang to purchase items and services from[ENTER]various villagers. Go to the General Store[ENTER]Saleswoman and purchase a Red Potion. "},
	{"find_squareguard._80_sendLetter", "22:76FA50E8", "Buy a Red Potion "},
	{"find_squareguard._90_sayReward", "79:CE375A06", "Buy a Red Potion at the General Store and take it[ENTER]to the Guardian. "},
