	{"fisher._20_npcChat", "13:ABD89885", "Improving the Fishing Pole "},
	{"fisher._30_sayTitle", "7:AEB62596", "Fisherman: "},
	{"fisher._40_say", "352:1FEFAF9B", "So you're interested in the secrets of improving[ENTER]your Fishing Pole? To be honest, it's not really[ENTER]a big secret. The more time you spend fishing,[ENTER]the more points your Fishing Pole will collect.[ENTER]When your Fishing Pole has reached its maximum[ENTER]level, bring it to me. Then I'll try to upgrade[ENTER]it for you.[ENTER]OK. Now choose the Fishing Pole that you would[ENTER]like to upgrade and give it to me. "},
	{"fisher._50_say", "61:58605D49", "What should I do with that? I can only improve[ENTER]Fishing Poles! "},
