	{"forked_road._30_say", "142:E0003313", "You cannot take part in the battle once the door[ENTER]leading to the Holy Land has been opened. Pray[ENTER]that our kingdom emerges victorious![ENTER]Long live Shinsoo! "},
	{"forked_road._40_say", "141:A944CC2A", "You cannot take part in the battle once the door[ENTER]leading to the Holy Land has been opened. Pray[ENTER]that our kingdom emerges victorious![ENTER]Long live Chunjo! "},
	{"forked_road._50_say", "140:D68ABF8E", "You cannot take part in the battle once the door[ENTER]leading to the Holy Land has been opened. Pray[ENTER]that our kingdom emerges victorious![ENTER]Long live Jinno! "},
	{"forked_road._60_say", "140:D68ABF8E", "You cannot take part in the battle once the door[ENTER]leading to the Holy Land has been opened. Pray[ENTER]that our kingdom emerges victorious![ENTER]Long live Jinno! "},
	{"forked_road._70_notice_all", "37:849E545F", "The %s Kingdom has won the Kingdom Battle! ", "b"},
	{"forked_road._75_sayInMap", "10:80C77F3B", "Kill %s! ", "b"},
	{"forked_road._80_notice_all", "44:2F9D3E44", "The Shinsoo Kingdom enters the Holy Ground. ", "b"},
	{"forked_road._90_notice_all", "43:FE33BD0B", "The Chunjo Kingdom enters the Holy Ground. ", "b"},
	{"fortune_telling._100_sayTitle", "13:49EDAE86", "Old Lady "},
	{"fortune_telling._10_npcChat", "29:4613AD3D", "I heard that you are a fortune teller. "},
	{"fortune_telling._110_say", "235:A9C96944", "You are too young to be sighing like that! Do you[ENTER]want to take a look at your future? You should[ENTER]know that there are some powers out there that[ENTER]can give you the answers you need to regain some[ENTER]of your hope. "},
	{"fortune_telling._120_select", "11:478B14B9", "Tell me my fortune "},
	{"fortune_telling._130_select", "21:93D39542", "Don't tell me my fortune "},
	{"fortune_telling._140_say", "117:0BEB4216", "That's right. Following your own path and trying[ENTER]to do your best is the most important thing in[ENTER]life. Farewell! "},
	{"fortune_telling._150_select", "16:999D8EE1", "Yes, I would like that. "},
	{"fortune_telling._160_select", "13:69E16BE1", "No, thank you. "},
	{"fortune_telling._170_say", "209:B07B968F", "I may be friendly, but I can't give you a[ENTER]Talisman for free. If you want to avoid bad luck[ENTER]and misfortune, you will have to pay for it.[ENTER]It costs %s Yang. "},
	{"fortune_telling._180_say", "143:AF9752D7", "You're leaving? Perhaps you're right. Bad luck[ENTER]and sorrow are all a part of life. Take care and[ENTER]farewell. If you change your mind, come see me[ENTER]again. "},
	{"fortune_telling._20_say", "231:8C8F705D", "The look in your eyes tells me that you are very[ENTER]young. Why do you want to know your fate so early[ENTER]on in your life? Is there a particular reason for[ENTER]it? Fate still has a lot in store for you. Come[ENTER]back again later. "},
	{"fortune_telling._30_say", "311:36100B43", "Do you really want to live your life the way the[ENTER]fortune teller told you? You shouldn't take those[ENTER]kinds of things so seriously. The most important[ENTER]thing is your attitude and the way you act. If[ENTER]both are positive, then nothing can go wrong. If[ENTER]you still want to know your fortune, come back[ENTER]tomorrow. "},
	{"fortune_telling._40_sayTitle", "13:49EDAE86", "Old Lady "},
	{"fortune_telling._50_say", "81:7D71FCC2", "As I have already told you your prediction for[ENTER]today is as follows: "},
	{"fortune_telling._60_say", "145:11F02C06", "Bad luck will find you and you still haven't[ENTER]bought the talisman to turn away evil yet. Are[ENTER]you interested in buying my Talisman of Wealth? "},
	{"fortune_telling._70_select", "13:BE04C065", "Yes, I'll buy it. "},
	{"fortune_telling._80_select", "13:57F98AB4", "No, thanks. "},
	{"fortune_telling._90_say", "147:318DB665", "I may be friendly, but I can't give it to you for[ENTER]free. If you want to avoid bad luck and[ENTER]misfortune, you will have to pay a good price for[ENTER]the talisman. "},
