	{"ghost_story._010_sayTitle", "11:ACB5530D", "Ghost of a Sura: "},
	{"ghost_story._020_npcChat", "15:6956E63A", "Are you a ghost? "},
	{"ghost_story._030_say", "97:BDB60A7A", "No, I'm the Queen of Sheba... Of course I'm a[ENTER]ghost! Did someone drop you on your head as a[ENTER]baby? "},
	{"ghost_story._040_npcChat", "14:F2BB0959", "Help, a ghost! "},
	{"ghost_story._050_say", "44:50C26731", "Lo and behold, a fearless warrior! Boo!! "},
	{"ghost_story._060_npcChat", "12:309F77A7", "Who are you? "},
	{"ghost_story._070_say", "230:34C3887E", "My name is Akuma. I was once a great warrior,[ENTER]some say I was the best of my time. I even[ENTER]believed it myself! But look at me now. Look at[ENTER]what remained of me after I found the grotto...[ENTER]and perished. "},
	{"ghost_story._080_npcChat", "29:31D080DA", "Do you know the history of this place? "},
	{"ghost_story._090_say", "247:E9FDA67B", "Oh I know what happened back then. I researched[ENTER]for a long time, trying to figure out the reason[ENTER]behind this and trying to find the grotto. And[ENTER]since my death I have had a lot of time to think[ENTER]about it. Just ask me what you want to know! "},
	{"ghost_story._100_npcChat", "17:86923341", "What kind of portal is that? "},
	{"ghost_story._110_say", "202:8416E6D3", "This portal leads to the dark dragon's chamber,[ENTER]to the fallen God Beran-Setaou. It can be[ENTER]activated with a magic key, which only[ENTER]Beran-Setaou's troops can get... "},
	{"ghost_story._120_npcChat", "14:8C5C00F1", "The Three Gods "},
	{"ghost_story._130_say", "255:BF893612", "Once upon a time, three godly siblings formed the[ENTER]foundations of being.[ENTER]Bahar-Taraji, the Goddess of Creation, was the[ENTER]youngest of the three. Her job was to create new[ENTER]beings - wherever she went, flowers blossomed and[ENTER]life thrived. "},
	{"ghost_story._140_say", "337:5068358C", "The eldest brother was called Beran-Setaou. He[ENTER]was responsible for the end of life and for[ENTER]dissolution. Whenever a life cycle was at its[ENTER]end, he separated body and soul from one another[ENTER]and led the soul into afterlife.[ENTER]And thus a steady circle of becoming and passing[ENTER]away - the foundation of all life - was ensured. "},
	{"ghost_story._150_say", "244:EB4B5985", "The middle brother was Baljit-Elvedin. As the God[ENTER]of Conservation, he moderated between his two[ENTER]siblings and enabled the eternal circle of life[ENTER]for the creatures of earth. He was, for example,[ENTER]responsible for the coming and going of the[ENTER]seasons. "},
	{"ghost_story._160_npcChat", "8:64430F53", "The Quarrel "},
	{"ghost_story._170_say", "351:B6CCED5A", "During times of need, people begged the three[ENTER]gods for help. Though unfortunately they feared[ENTER]and disregarded Beran-Setaou, as in their[ENTER]short-sightedness they did not understand that[ENTER]just as light and dark exists, he had to exist as[ENTER]a counterpart to creation. "},
	{"ghost_story._180_say", "436:5F570052", "For a long time the god ignored it, but over the[ENTER]years envy grew within him, which slowly turned[ENTER]into hate and malevolence. At first he channelled[ENTER]his anger towards the people by giving them war[ENTER]and illness. However, this only resulted in their[ENTER]further rejection of him and they increasingly[ENTER]prayed to Bahar-Taraji, goddess of newly created[ENTER]life. And thus it became the vicious circle that[ENTER]finally led to ruin. "},
	{"ghost_story._190_say", "402:9FB5C5E5", "And as the wrath of the god became so intense[ENTER]that he could not control it any longer,[ENTER]something unbelievable happened: He killed his[ENTER]sister, the nation's sweetheart. This deed was[ENTER]entirely unprovoked, for on that day she treated[ENTER]her brother with the same love and trust that she[ENTER]did every day. And he, looked into those kind[ENTER]eyes and took her life away nevertheless. "},
	{"ghost_story._200_npcChat", "11:6F545CC2", "The Aftermath "},
	{"ghost_story._210_say", "318:56B04DDF", "Bahar-Taraji's death had terrible consequences[ENTER]for the world of the gods as well as that of the[ENTER]people: A long and cruel winter came, killing[ENTER]creatures at sea and ashore. The earth froze so[ENTER]firmly that stones cracked and even the eldest[ENTER]and strongest trees withered away. "},
	{"ghost_story._220_say", "360:717B3D45", "Young people and animals died and once it finally[ENTER]became warmer, the birth rate became lower than[ENTER]ever before. The weakened country did not yield[ENTER]enough to keep the adult population fed - let[ENTER]alone enough to feed new life. Hope had died[ENTER]along with life and both needed a very long time[ENTER]to fully recover. "},
	{"ghost_story._230_say", "348:AE3D1E9B", "Even the gods suffered, however, time goes by[ENTER]more slowly for them than it does for humans.[ENTER]Beran-Setaou withdrew and sought solitude, once[ENTER]the enormity of what he had done dawned on him.[ENTER]Devastating regret and deep satisfaction grappled[ENTER]inside him - until the latter won this mental[ENTER]battle. His heart turned to ice and the God of[ENTER]Dissolution became the God of Ice and Coldness,[ENTER]of Hate and of Fear. "},
	{"ghost_story._240_npcChat", "6:F6CCD173", "The Battle "},
	{"ghost_story._250_say", "421:4CA3D94F", "Baljit-Elvedin, God of Conservation, grieved for[ENTER]his sister for a long time. And as the tight[ENTER]claws of pain finally loosened their grip around[ENTER]his heart, he went searching for his brother.[ENTER]Level-headedness and wisdom still dominated his[ENTER]life's path and thus he recognised, despite his[ENTER]grief, that life could not continue to hang in[ENTER]imbalance. "},
	{"ghost_story._260_say", "429:46B59960", "He followed his brother's trail and after many[ENTER]long years, finally found him in a cave of ice,[ENTER]hate and solitude, far removed from any other[ENTER]signs of life. Baljit-Elvedin did what he had to[ENTER]do, even though it tore yet another wound into[ENTER]his heart: He challenged his brother to a duel.[ENTER]Beran-Setaou had derailed so far off the path of[ENTER]righteousness that he did not hesitate for a[ENTER]second... "},
	{"ghost_story._270_say", "347:B7142DAC", "Apparently, the battle was terrible and beyond[ENTER]all comprehension. Baljit-Elvedin won the battle.[ENTER]And remaining true to his morals, he did not kill[ENTER]his brother, but took his powers and locked him[ENTER]in the grotto. And thus Beran-Setaou remains here[ENTER]with the creatures that he has been creating in[ENTER]the last few centuries... "},
	{"ghost_story._280_npcChat", "35:1C7D3353", "I've heard enough. "},
	{"ghost_story._290_say", "34:CBC92250", "May your fate be different to mine. Good luck! "},
	{"ghost_story._300_sayTitle", "16:C04287A8", "Ghost of a warrior: "},
	{"ghost_story._310_npcChat", "31:A0669F18", "Why are you translucent? "},
	{"ghost_story._320_say", "76:8FAF8438", "What do you think?! I'm a ghost and have been[ENTER]trapped in this rock for a thousand years... "},
	{"ghost_story._330_say", "14:F2BB0959", "Help, a ghost! "},
	{"ghost_story._340_say", "41:BF090AE7", "Right, a ghost. Run away quickly, otherwise I'll[ENTER]eat you up! "},
	{"ghost_story._350_npcChat", "12:309F77A7", "Who are you? "},
	{"ghost_story._360_say", "428:1E2AA45B", "I was a mercenary once, a simple man. My parents[ENTER]were farmers. However, I didn't want to continue[ENTER]working the same field for the rest of my life,[ENTER]so I joined the military. It was tough and[ENTER]bloody, but it wasn't all bad. But then I finally[ENTER]got tired of being bossed around by[ENTER]good-for-nothing noblemen and left. And then fate[ENTER]finally led me to this dark place. "},
	{"ghost_story._370_npcChat", "26:8ED813D0", "Do you know the story of the grotto? "},
	{"ghost_story._380_say", "361:8CABC223", "No, I don't know, I suppose I was just unlucky.[ENTER]After I had deserted, I wanted to hide in the[ENTER]mountains and stumbled upon this cave. It seemed[ENTER]a bit strange to me right from the start, but it[ENTER]was convenient and seemed completely abandoned. A[ENTER]few days later I became witness and victim of a[ENTER]unbelievable battle. If you like, I can tell you[ENTER]about it. "},
	{"ghost_story._390_npcChat", "15:24C02AD7", "The Beginning of the Battle "},
	{"ghost_story._400_say", "312:78D14F04", "One day - I was just collecting roots at the[ENTER]mountainside - a silver dragon appeared from the[ENTER]heavens. I thought he was after me, but he didn't[ENTER]even see me - he was completely focused on the[ENTER]cave's entrance. Without slowing down, he swooped[ENTER]into the valley and flung himself into the cave. "},
	{"ghost_story._410_say", "434:AE6D9F62", "And then it went quiet for a while and I didn't[ENTER]know what to do. All my equipment was in the[ENTER]cave, but of course I didn't want to come across[ENTER]the dragon! Then the ground rumbled and a dull[ENTER]roar sounded from within the depths of the cave -[ENTER]but to my horror it wasn't just one voice - but[ENTER]two! Shortly afterwards two dragons shot out of[ENTER]the cave - a silver one directly followed by a[ENTER]blue one. "},
	{"ghost_story._420_say", "325:D5B55087", "An almost indescribable battle ensued between the[ENTER]dragons. They ripped into each others bodies,[ENTER]became locked in a tight grip and sunk each[ENTER]others teeth into one another's necks... It was[ENTER]raining blood... But neither one loosened their[ENTER]grip for a second. "},
	{"ghost_story._430_npcChat", "13:F38C1D0B", "The End of the Battle "},
	{"ghost_story._440_say", "494:024E94B2", "Both dragons rolled over the mountains like a[ENTER]thunderstorm - causing landslides and chaos all[ENTER]round. Lightning scorched the blue dragon's[ENTER]mouth, icy hail perforated the silver dragon's[ENTER]wings. The thick ice crust that had been covering[ENTER]the ground for years, melted under this onslaught[ENTER]and left a muddy residue behind. I hid behind a[ENTER]rock, petrified but incapable of ignoring the[ENTER]sight in front of me. "},
	{"ghost_story._450_say", "397:B428D9E2", "It took hours before their powers started[ENTER]deteriorating. And then I finally saw my chance,[ENTER]tore away from scene and ran into the valley to[ENTER]get my equipment from the cave. And thus I sealed[ENTER]my fate. I was already on my way back when both[ENTER]dragons shot out from the mountains, the blue[ENTER]ahead of the silver. He had suffered terrible[ENTER]damage. "},
	{"ghost_story._460_say", "436:9884C029", "Just before vanishing into the cave, the silver[ENTER]dragon caught up with him and something very[ENTER]strange happened: The sky started flickering, it[ENTER]became extremely draughty and a vortex of energy[ENTER]was created which the blue dragon got caught up[ENTER]in. He started roaring with pain and rage... he[ENTER]started shrinking, his roaring became weaker and[ENTER]his scales lost their shine before becoming blunt[ENTER]and colourless... "},
	{"ghost_story._470_say", "341:575FA2AE", "Finally the silver dragon released the other[ENTER]dragon into the cave. With his last bit of[ENTER]strength, the loser dragged himself under the[ENTER]mountain. However, the silver dragon proceeded to[ENTER]release a powerful magic tempest, which sealed[ENTER]the cave with an energy barrier and made part of[ENTER]the mountain collapse. The dark dragon and I were[ENTER]trapped. Condemned to a miserable and[ENTER]excruciating death from starvation... "},
	{"ghost_story._480_npcChat", "35:1C7D3353", "I've heard enough. "},
	{"ghost_story._490_say", "82:5072BBC0", "Thanks for listening. The last thousand years[ENTER]have been really lonely... "},
	{"goldbar._100_say", "309:63FCD595", "Before I escaped from the Black Wind, I found out[ENTER]where they hide their gold. They have a whole[ENTER]stack of Gold Bars! Those fools wouldn't even[ENTER]realise if a bar was missing. If you agree to[ENTER]hire me, I'll go and get a Gold Bar. But I can't[ENTER]get more than one at a time. "},
	{"goldbar._104_say", "5:1DEC55FF", "Time "},
	{"goldbar._108_say", "9:93B86852", "Minute(s) "},
	{"goldbar._10_npcChat", "29:A4E01E50", "A victim of the Black Wind Gang "},
	{"goldbar._110_say", "44:51BEBA88", "It takes about %s %s to bring back a Gold Bar. "},
	{"goldbar._120_say", "38:F2ACF6B7", "Tell me if you're interested. "},
	{"goldbar._130_say", "78:803BF69F", "Really? Then we have a deal? Just let me know and[ENTER]I'll go get you one immediately! "},
	{"goldbar._140_npcChat", "26:51D027CE", "I want to buy a Gold Bar. "},
	{"goldbar._150_say", "61:F99C5B23", "What are you talking about? I don't know anything[ENTER]about it. "},
	{"goldbar._160_say", "216:54EEF208", "What? You want to buy Gold Bars? No, not now! The[ENTER]Black Wind seems to be suspicious at the moment.[ENTER]If I'm not careful, I'll risk my life! We'll try[ENTER]again once the situation has calmed down. "},
	{"goldbar._170_sayReward", "45:14A21E12", "You can't buy Gold Bars right now. "},
	{"goldbar._180_say", "38:9A4C63B0", "I have not been able to get hold of any Gold Bars[ENTER]yet. "},
	{"goldbar._190_say", "37:A42B042D", "We have to wait for %s %s. "},
	{"goldbar._200_say", "138:08EA670E", "I have brought a Gold Bar with me. It costs 2,2[ENTER]million Yang. 200,000 of the Yang will be my[ENTER]payment. How about it? Are you interested? "},
	{"goldbar._20_sayTitle", "15:D4F30F16", "Traitor Balso: "},
	{"goldbar._210_say", "120:26ECB81C", "Here you are, a Gold Bar! You have made a wise[ENTER]decision. It's always a good idea to make[ENTER]investments. "},
	{"goldbar._220_say", "61:8BAD6F61", "You don't have enough money! It costs 2,2 million[ENTER]Yang. "},
	{"goldbar._230_say", "88:002DEDAF", "Why are you here if you don't want to buy[ENTER]anything? You're just wasting my time. "},
	{"goldbar._240_npcChat", "19:8F4A6695", "GM: Reset time for selling a Gold Bar "},
	{"goldbar._250_say", "25:72315E7B", "The time for selling a Gold Bar has been reset. "},
	{"goldbar._260_npcChat", "23:51215967", "Sell a Gold Bar "},
	{"goldbar._270_say", "61:F99C5B23", "What are you talking about? I don't know anything[ENTER]about it. "},
	{"goldbar._280_say", "213:4071B188", "What? You want to sell a Gold Bar? Haven't you[ENTER]heard? The Black Wind Gang warriors are very[ENTER]suspicious at the moment and are keeping their[ENTER]eyes peeled. If you sell the Gold Bar now, you'll[ENTER]get into a lot of trouble. It would be best if[ENTER]you left it where it is. Hide it well! "},
	{"goldbar._290_sayReward", "41:89C4F20B", "You cannot sell Gold Bars at the moment. "},
	{"goldbar._300_say", "38:A9E47ACC", "If you want to bring back the Gold Bar, "},
	{"goldbar._30_say", "130:28A2F15D", "What? A victim of the Black Wind Gang? Ha, you're[ENTER]still a child. Where did you hear about that?[ENTER]You'd be better go and play with the wild dogs! "},
	{"goldbar._310_say", "29:7A330863", "you have to wait for about %s %s. "},
	{"goldbar._320_say", "79:4607D7E6", "You don't have any Gold Bars. If you give me Gold[ENTER]Bars, I'll give you Yang for them. "},
	{"goldbar._330_say", "276:125E32D6", "What? You want to return your Gold Bar? Then why[ENTER]did you buy it, for God's sake? But if you want[ENTER]to return it so badly, I won't stand in your way.[ENTER]The Black Wind Gang guards their treasures very[ENTER]well; so I can't do this very often. Do you still[ENTER]want to return it? "},
	{"goldbar._340_select", "6:D9449340", "Return "},
	{"goldbar._350_select", "12:84CE8608", "Don't return "},
	{"goldbar._360_say", "55:6468B38E", "Here's your Yang. Damn! Now I have to return it! "},
	{"goldbar._370_say", "124:43F16E62", "Do you have any Gold Bars at all? I'm very busy.[ENTER]So don't come here if you don't want to talk[ENTER]business. "},
	{"goldbar._40_sayReward", "93:D3D57B4F", "The 'Victim of the Black Wind Gang' mission is[ENTER]only available to players on level 30 or higher. "},
	{"goldbar._50_say", "117:8AC74141", "Be careful! The Black Wind Gang warriors are very[ENTER]wary at the moment. It would be best to keep[ENTER]quiet. Farewell. "},
	{"goldbar._60_sayReward", "37:F68E8637", "The 'Victim of the Black Wind Gang' mission is[ENTER]not available at the moment. "},
	{"goldbar._70_say", "154:9FF81CB7", "Shh! Members of the Black Wind Gang could be[ENTER]hiding somewhere. Where did you hear about this?[ENTER]No, it's okay. It isn't that important. Do you[ENTER]know what's going on? "},
	{"goldbar._80_select", "17:850E8BD2", "No, not really. "},
	{"goldbar._90_select", "23:0A9F4D9C", "Yes, I know everything. "},
	{"goto_empire_castle._100_say", "28:AD9BE6FF", "Teleport to Listhmos Castle "},
	{"goto_empire_castle._10_npcChat", "22:695B908E", "Off to the castle battle "},
	{"goto_empire_castle._110_say", "87:34294F06", "This portal can only be used by the brave[ENTER]warriors of the Chunjo kingdom. "},
	{"goto_empire_castle._120_say", "86:06445DE3", "This portal can only be used by the brave[ENTER]warriors of the Jinno kingdom. "},
	{"goto_empire_castle._20_select", "17:59F6112D", "To Milaard castle "},
	{"goto_empire_castle._30_select", "18:CA74AEC2", "To Listhmos castle "},
	{"goto_empire_castle._35_select", "17:1722A819", "To Dendera castle "},
	{"goto_empire_castle._40_say", "44:CE02DE10", "You will be teleported to Milaard castle... "},
	{"goto_empire_castle._50_say", "45:95BE8D08", "You will be teleported to Listhmos castle... "},
	{"goto_empire_castle._60_say", "44:43B56528", "You will be teleported to Dendera castle... "},
	{"goto_empire_castle._70_say", "88:B39E3112", "This portal may only be used by the brave[ENTER]warriors of the Shinsoo kingdom. "},
	{"goto_empire_castle._80_npcChat", "22:695B908E", "Off to the castle battle "},
	{"goto_empire_castle._90_say", "27:825F3D2A", "Teleport to Milaard castle "},
	{"guild_building._100_say", "98:8CDEF343", "I'm just the Land Agent and therefore I can't[ENTER]lower the price. You need more Yang. "},
	{"guild_building._105_say", "21:72FCB95C", "The guild has purchased the land! "},
	{"guild_building._10_sayTitle", "14:41CA9EA3", "Land Agent: "},
	{"guild_building._110_say", "73:A4D64C54", "Come again when you have decided what to do.[ENTER]First come, first serve. "},
	{"guild_building._20_say", "320:5B8F7495", "I'm the Land Agent and responsible for selling[ENTER]land. Before the monsters occupied the region in[ENTER]the middle of the continent, we did not have[ENTER]shortage of land and everyone was happy. So now[ENTER]I'm only selling land to guild leaders, who use[ENTER]it as land for their guilds. Do you want to buy[ENTER]some land? "},
	{"guild_building._30_say", "94:F649277E", "I already told you, I can't sell land to[ENTER]everybody. I hope you understand. "},
	{"guild_building._40_say", "70:C6A28ADE", "A guild that already owns land cannot buy another[ENTER]piece of ground. "},
	{"guild_building._50_say", "32:5CB2A33C", "An error occurred during the processing of this[ENTER]order. "},
	{"guild_building._60_say", "95:6A4DE1A9", "To buy this piece of land, the guild's level must[ENTER]be above %s.[ENTER]The price is %s Yang."},
	{"guild_building._70_say", "76:AB228531", "Your guild hasn't reached the required level yet.[ENTER]I'm sorry. "},
	{"guild_building._80_say", "24:9D146A78", "Do you want to purchase this land? "},
	{"guild_building._90_say", "63:70F37570", "This piece of land has already been sold to[ENTER]another guild. I'm sorry. "},
	{"guild_building_alter_of_power._100_say", "37:52BEAE9C", "As you wish. Just come back later. "},
	{"guild_building_alter_of_power._110_say", "116:D9D09EB3", "I think that you should work a little more on[ENTER]developing your guild. You are currently not[ENTER]strong enough for a better Altar. "},
	{"guild_building_alter_of_power._120_say", "152:74EDD6E5", "If your guild level increases, you will be able[ENTER]to build a bigger Altar of Power. If your guild's[ENTER]level increases, your guild becomes stronger. "},
	{"guild_building_alter_of_power._130_say", "23:75A8A209", "Hmm... your guild ... "},
	{"guild_building_alter_of_power._140_say", "126:136ABEAD", "Oh, now it's much stronger! I'm going to replace[ENTER]your Altar of Power with the best altar.[ENTER]You need the following materials for it: "},
	{"guild_building_alter_of_power._150_sayReward", "72:91275919", "30 million Yang[ENTER]15 foundation stones[ENTER]20 planks of plywood[ENTER]20 tree trunks "},
	{"guild_building_alter_of_power._160_say", "126:D1C2E40E", "Good. I'm going to replace the altar with a new[ENTER]building. In doing so your guild now has the best[ENTER]possible Altar. My congratulations! "},
	{"guild_building_alter_of_power._170_say", "98:063ED8A3", "There's nothing else I can do for you: your guild[ENTER]already possesses the best Altar of Power. "},
	{"guild_building_alter_of_power._180_say", "75:34CB768F", "The Altar of Power allows your guild to accept[ENTER]more members. "},
	{"guild_building_alter_of_power._20_say", "250:5BD669A3", "I am Yaholo, the guard of the Altar of Power.[ENTER]This building makes it possible for your guild to[ENTER]accept more members. When your guild gets[ENTER]stronger, you can build a bigger Altar and then[ENTER]be able to invite even more members. "},
	{"guild_building_alter_of_power._30_say", "23:75A8A209", "Hmm... your guild ... "},
	{"guild_building_alter_of_power._40_say", "154:A51098BC", "Its power has clearly grown. Do you want to[ENTER]replace the current Altar of Power with a bigger[ENTER]one? If so, you need the following materials: "},
	{"guild_building_alter_of_power._50_sayReward", "72:C289615E", "25 million Yang[ENTER]10 foundation stones[ENTER]15 planks of plywood[ENTER]10 tree trunks "},
	{"guild_building_alter_of_power._60_select", "19:81FB8E14", "Replace the Altar of Power "},
	{"guild_building_alter_of_power._70_select", "26:AC30ED42", "Don't replace the Altar of Power "},
	{"guild_building_alter_of_power._80_say", "37:5882BD45", "Good. I'm going to replace it with a new building. "},
	{"guild_building_alter_of_power._90_say", "203:BDA86855", "The construction of the Altar is not cheap: I[ENTER]require a considerable amount of building[ENTER]materials and Yang. If you cannot provide me with[ENTER]these things, then I cannot help you. Come back[ENTER]when you have everything! "},
	{"guild_building_melt._100_say", "35:03B0B9B3", "That is not the necessary item. "},
