	{"guild_create._70_sayReward", "45:C612AF8C", "The Guardian at the village square is going to[ENTER]help you found a guild. "},
	{"guild_manage._100_npcChat", "32:0E9453C8", "GM: check guild information "},
	{"guild_manage._10_npcChat", "25:0C0397BC", "GM: register again "},
	{"guild_manage._120_say", "172:453780DB", "Do you want to leave the guild you belong to? I[ENTER]assume that you didn't make any real friends[ENTER]there. But it's your decision. Are you sure you[ENTER]want to leave the guild? "},
	{"guild_manage._130_say", "45:3EFC2661", "Okay, so your decision is final. I'm going take[ENTER]you out of the guild. "},
	{"guild_manage._140_say", "246:1DEE780F", "What?[DELAY value;150] [/DELAY][ENTER][ENTER]I put a lot of effort into creating it, and now[ENTER]you want to disband the guild? All the experience[ENTER]and memories of your friends will be lost[ENTER]forever![ENTER]Do you really want to disband it? "},
	{"guild_manage._150_say", "65:C5E23F53", "Well then.[ENTER][ENTER]I'm going to disband the guild that you preside[ENTER]over. "},
	{"guild_manage._160_npcChat", "13:20839E06", "Found guild "},
	{"guild_manage._170_npcChat", "13:20839E06", "Found guild "},
	{"guild_manage._180_say", "79:638944F3", "You can't establish a new guild in the first few[ENTER]days after leaving your old one. "},
