	{"guild_ranking._10_say", "147:EF470FC2", "Here you can see your guild's rank in relation to[ENTER]the guilds ranked above and below you in the[ENTER]tables:[ENTER][DELAY value;0][ENTER]|Guild's name|Points|Victories|Draws|Defeats[ENTER]%s[/DELAY][ENTER]  "},
