	{"hair._010_npcChat", "15:D1D64D87", "Swap hairstyle "},
	{"hair._013_say", "21:5CBECFA8", "That isn't a hairstyle. "},
	{"hair._014_say", "86:8C3B8ED7", "I couldn't swap your hairstyle. It doesn't suit[ENTER]your class or your gender. "},
	{"hair._030_npcChat", "15:D1D64D87", "Swap hairstyle "},
	{"hair._040_say", "211:070A919F", "Your hairstyle still belongs to the old system. I[ENTER]will swap it for a hairstyle item from the new[ENTER]outfit system, so that it isn't lost. It's really[ENTER]easy to do. Should I swap your hairstyle now? "},
	{"hair._050_say", "188:C7F6E48F", "You call that a hairstyle? Very funny. Sorry, if[ENTER]you don't have a hairstyle from the old system, I[ENTER]can't help you. Have a nice day! "},
	{"hair._060_say", "22:19111A6C", "I don't know this hairstyle. "},
	{"hair._070_say", "61:1A7A8D2F", "Sorry, I can't help you. Please contact support. "},
	{"hair._080_say", "23:3E39FCE9", "You have received your new hairstyle. "},
	{"hair._090_say", "35:3209C2B6", "This hairstyle has already been swapped. "},
	{"hair._100_say", "80:AE35D52C", "Here you go. Now you can use the outfit system. "},
	{"hair._110_notice", "253:2F3BEA6A", "Notification: The Captain in the first village is[ENTER]looking for you. You still have an old hairstyle.[ENTER]Go see him and swap your current main hairstyle[ENTER]for a hairstyle item from the new outfit system.[ENTER]That will ensure you don't lose your current[ENTER]hairstyle. "},
	{"hair_shop._100_say", "68:FC54DEBF", "You don't have enough Yang.[ENTER]It costs 500,000 Yang! "},
	{"hair_shop._10_npcChat", "15:8B74957B", "Reset hair style "},
	{"hair_shop._110_say", "130:6921A536", "Too bad. I would have liked to have used my[ENTER]scissors. But I really like your current[ENTER]hairstyle too. Farewell! "},
	{"hair_shop._30_say", "240:F5CE9FEE", "You have a very interesting hairstyle now, but[ENTER]your old style also suited you really well. If[ENTER]you're interested, I can restore your old style.[ENTER]What do you say? For 500,000 Yang we'll be in[ENTER]business. "},
	{"hair_shop._40_select", "23:E16DEC05", "Restore old hairstyle "},
	{"hair_shop._50_select", "24:46BFC05E", "Keep current hair style "},
	{"hair_shop._60_say", "33:9A065EBE", "A good decision. One moment please. "},
	{"hair_shop._70_say", "251:C9CDDE59", "Ariyoung starts cutting your hair[ENTER]enthusiastically. Her scissors are moving so[ENTER]quickly that you are starting to fear for your[ENTER]ears. But before you can get nervous Ariyoung[ENTER]stops and looks at her work. "},
	{"hair_shop._80_say", "71:F825533B", "Hm, perhaps I'll cut away a little bit more over[ENTER]here...[ENTER]And a little bit here... "},
	{"hair_shop._90_say", "52:88EE71CC", "There, finished! I'm sure you'll be satisfied! "},
