	{"harvest_festival._170_select", "7:729E4BAD", "Cancel "},
	{"harvest_festival._180_say", "109:B248E202", "You don't yet have enough Rice Cakes to swap for[ENTER]this item. Get back out on the hunt! "},
	{"harvest_festival._190_say", "20:2F3FE2B2", "You've made a wise decision. "},
	{"harvest_festival._200_say", "64:DE34FAF4", "As a thank-you for the %s Rice Cakes, I give you:[ENTER]%s "},
	{"harvest_festival._210_say", "39:9F34EE38", "Are you sure that you want this item? "},
	{"harvest_festival._220_select", "15:352FC9D3", "Yes, I am sure! "},
	{"harvest_festival._230_say", "17:2A633B4C", "You have received %s. "},
	{"harvest_festival._240_say", "70:EF219635", "You'll find me here, if you want to bring me any[ENTER]more Rice Cakes. "},
	{"harvest_festival._250_npcChat", "23:B64EE0EE", "Hunt the pillagers! "},
	{"harvest_festival._270_say", "66:418D7072", "Thank you for returning our supplies. You have[ENTER]saved us from a really desperate situation! "},
	{"harvest_festival._280_say", "79:A9EBC75F", "We are grateful that you are hunting the[ENTER]pillagers and are bringing back our supplies! "},
	{"harvest_festival._290_say", "65:607C3FB9", "You have already looted %s Rice Cakes on the[ENTER]current task! "},
	{"harvest_festival._300_say", "192:D162E8D3", "You shouldn't put yourself in danger for no[ENTER]reason! Take the Rice Cakes to Wonda-Rim. He will[ENTER]reward you for them. The more Rice Cakes you take[ENTER]to him, the more valuable your reward will be. "},
	{"harvest_festival._310_say", "139:C736A380", "You have brought all of our supplies back! We owe[ENTER]you a great deal of gratitude. Without you we[ENTER]would have been in real trouble! "},
	{"harvest_festival._320_say", "84:C5021FF9", "A large part of our supplies are still missing.[ENTER]Can we continue to count on you? "},
	{"harvest_festival._330_select", "12:B8E85D39", "Of course. "},
	{"harvest_festival._340_select", "31:C96C24F1", "I'll help you all later. "},
	{"harvest_festival._350_say", "29:62C4E800", "I will wait for you here. "},
	{"harvest_festival._360_say", "56:48FF93DD", "Task %s[ENTER]You can accept this task a total of ten times. "},
	{"harvest_festival._370_say", "141:91C07E8D", "We would have been lost without you. Will you[ENTER]continue to help? A large part of our supplies[ENTER]are still missing. "},
	{"harvest_festival._380_select", "18:2DFCAF3D", "Yes, I will continue. "},
	{"harvest_festival._390_select", "29:57B66167", "I'll be back later. "},
	{"harvest_festival._400_say", "129:88BF4D43", "You are a brave warrior. Please keep going![ENTER][ENTER]Task %s[ENTER]You can accept this task a total of ten times. "},
	{"harvest_festival._410_say", "15:D8356443", "Hell Hound "},
	{"harvest_festival._420_say", "13:1ACD61B9", "Flame Ghost "},
	{"harvest_festival._430_say", "20:6E6C8595", "Dark Fanatic "},
	{"harvest_festival._440_say", "24:EF1BA5B4", "Savage Infantryman "},
	{"harvest_festival._450_say", "22:1C0EDD66", "White Oath Soldier "},
	{"harvest_festival._460_say", "20:9D6CF6BD", "Alpha Blue Wolf "},
	{"harvest_festival._470_say", "11:87B71275", "Please help us! "},
	{"harvest_festival._480_say", "283:BA616706", "Our village has been overrun by %s! These thieves[ENTER]have stolen our Rice Cake supplies. We don't know[ENTER]what to do! What can we eat now? Can you help us?[ENTER]Hunt the pillagers and gather their loot. We will[ENTER]richly reward you. "},
	{"harvest_festival._490_select", "12:EFC7319B", "I'll help you! "},
	{"harvest_festival._500_select", "22:97E3B5A7", "I can't, sorry. "},
	{"harvest_festival._510_say", "114:05677B0B", "Without your help, we will surely starve. You[ENTER]will find me here, should you decide to change[ENTER]your mind. "},
	{"harvest_festival._520_sendLetter", "23:B64EE0EE", "Hunt the pillagers! "},
	{"harvest_festival._530_say", "34:A5FB4C46", "Defeat 30 %s and then return to Handu-Up. "},
	{"harvest_festival._540_select", "13:E1E54D89", "I give up. "},
	{"harvest_festival._550_select", "98:1B53FF58", "Bring as many Rice Cakes as you can loot from the pillagers. I give you a princely reward! "},
	{"harvest_festival._560_notice", "94:F7B7BDBF", "You have defeated the pillagers and have received[ENTER]%s Rice Cakes. Return now to Handu-Up. "},
	{"harvest_festival._570_npcChat", "24:15021DDF", "Hunting for pillagers "},
	{"harvest_festival._580_say", "31:C8571823", "Please bring our supplies back to us! "},
	{"harvest_festival._590_say", "77:3D96883A", "While you were away, our village was attacked[ENTER]again! "},
	{"harvest_festival._600_say", "17:D00228AC", "Jellyfish of Hell "},
	{"harvest_festival._620_say", "18:80410BE9", "Flame Warriors "},
	{"harvest_festival._630_say", "16:99BEC4F2", "Bullfrog General "},
	{"harvest_festival._640_say", "23:0625E20C", "Dark Summoner "},
	{"harvest_festival._650_say", "28:861A2829", "Esoteric Arahan Fighter "},
	{"harvest_festival._660_say", "12:13391F4B", "Savage Minion "},
	{"harvest_festival._670_say", "19:53A35203", "Brown Bear "},
	{"harvest_festival._680_say", "80:CFEF4572", "This time we're being attacked by %s.[ENTER]Please don't desert us now! "},
	{"harvest_festival._690_select", "24:6C0DCD90", "You can count on me! "},
	{"harvest_festival._700_select", "26:8B2E6314", "I would like my reward. "},
	{"harvest_festival._710_say", "95:C98BD19D", "We thank you for your help. Go to Wonda-Rim now[ENTER]and exchange the looted Rice Cakes for your[ENTER]reward. "},
	{"harvest_festival._715_say", "207:00BE87A6", "Go on the hunt[ENTER]for %s! But don't head into danger on your own.[ENTER]You'll only be able to beat the enemy in a group.[ENTER]Seek out at least one more partner in order to[ENTER]complete this task. "},
	{"harvest_festival._720_say", "34:77279B1F", "Defeat 60 %s and then return to Handu-Up. "},
	{"harvest_festival._730_say", "67:0DFD2CDF", "From what I can see, you have found some fellow[ENTER]fighters to go with you on the hunt. "},
	{"harvest_festival._740_say", "139:A323A4EF", "Form a group to hunt down the pillagers. Seek out[ENTER]one more member and go out together on the hunt. "},
	{"harvest_festival._750_npcChat", "26:42B6FAF9", "I bring Rice Cakes. "},
	{"harvest_festival._760_say", "130:8EC0A585", "You've brought our entire supply back to us! We[ENTER]owe you a great deal of thanks. Without you we[ENTER]would have been in a really desperate situation! "},
	{"harvest_festival._770_say", "71:F5C19343", "Fantastic! I see that you have already looted[ENTER]some Rice Cakes. "},
	{"harvest_festival._780_say", "130:8EF6B5B3", "You have already looted %s Rice Cakes! You will[ENTER]find me here when you want to exchange them for[ENTER]your reward. "},
	{"harvest_festival._790_say", "130:8EC0A585", "You have brought all our supplies back to us! We[ENTER]owe you a great deal of thanks. Without you we[ENTER]would have been in a really desperate situation! "},
	{"harvest_festival._795_say", "98:0D9F8825", "The monsters still have a large portion of our[ENTER]supplies. Will you go back into battle for us? "},
	{"harvest_festival._800_say", "123:DAFE8166", "Without your help we would have starved. In these[ENTER]tough times, we have relied on Rice Cakes as our[ENTER]main foodstuff. "},
	{"harvest_festival._810_say", "14:24D991F3", "Red Wild Boar "},
	{"harvest_festival._820_say", "5:B0D818BA", "Wild Boar "},
	{"heavens_cave_escape._010_npcChat", "12:93030337", "Leave grotto "},
	{"heavens_cave_escape._030_say", "41:00DEBD73", "Do you really want to leave the grotto of exile? "},
	{"heavens_cave_escape._040_say", "120:841732E8", "A wise decision. It's too dangerous to stay here[ENTER]any longer. Go and tend to your wounds first. "},
	{"heavens_cave_escape._050_say", "88:71347BBF", "You're very brave. Good luck in the depths of[ENTER]that horrible place... "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._020_npcChat", "9:390D4AFC", "In the Grotto "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._030_say", "84:5D9A8AD1", "Listen carefully, my boy! I'm only going to tell[ENTER]you this story once... "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._040_say", "85:CCF27F90", "Listen carefully, my girl! I'm only going to tell[ENTER]you this story once... "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._050_say", "360:2E43B3A3", "Nowadays we worship the Dragon God, but once upon[ENTER]a time, three gods watched over us. However,[ENTER]Bahar-Taraji, the Goddess of Creation, was[ENTER]murdered by her jealous brother Beran-Setaou. And[ENTER]the third God, Baljit-Elvedin, who we know today[ENTER]as the Dragon God, went into deep mourning for[ENTER]his sister. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._060_say", "279:8A9884E8", "A battle broke out between the two brothers,[ENTER]which the Dragon God won. Rumour has it, that[ENTER]traces of the battle can still be found at the[ENTER]site of their altercation. Beran-Setaou was[ENTER]locked in a cave after his defeat, which then[ENTER]became known as the Grotto of Exile. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._070_say", "195:A13B7C95", "This grotto is sealed and guarded by members of[ENTER]Baljit-Elvedin's order. You have to hand over a[ENTER]Blood Stone to be allowed through. I know how to[ENTER]produce those stones, but it's not easy. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._080_say", "343:61BA6170", "It all began with the Tears the Dragon God shed[ENTER]as he mourned his sister's death. The moment they[ENTER]fell to the earth, they suddenly turned to stone.[ENTER]You can still find them in the Fireland of[ENTER]Doyyumhwaji. Get seven Tears and four pieces of[ENTER]Obsidian from the Flames that live there. As soon[ENTER]as you're done with this task, come back to me. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._090_say_reward", "69:06A50165", "Collect 7 Fossilised Tears and 4 pieces of[ENTER]Obsidian in Doyyumhwaji. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._100_say", "191:733F8536", "You need a Blood Stone so that the Guard of the[ENTER]Order will let you through? In that case, get[ENTER]seven Fossilised Tears and four pieces of[ENTER]Obsidian in the Fireland of Doyyumhwaji. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._110_say", "185:594C896A", "You need another Blood Stone? Koe-Pung isn't the[ENTER]cleverest, but you should wait a little,[ENTER]otherwise he might notice that you don't belong[ENTER]to his order. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._120_say", "32:E7F62295", "A few hours, I would say: %s "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._130_say", "26:3E499A06", "One hour and %s minutes. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._140_say", "27:FBA15694", "Wait another %s minutes. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._150_say_title", "16:6D4E1345", "Fossilised Tear "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._160_say", "76:97CFB3B6", "Here's one of the Dragon God's Fossilised Tears[ENTER]that has fallen onto the earth. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._170_1_select", "8:32D15C70", "Take the tear "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._170_2_select", "27:9DECEFD7", "Carry on searching for tears here "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._170_3_select", "12:BAA1FAF6", "Do nothing "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._180_say", "28:ECCD5E57", "You have received a Fossilised Tear. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._190_say_title", "16:6D4E1345", "Fossilised Tear "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._200_say", "47:EAC6EBFB", "You decide to try looking for more tears and[ENTER]find: %s "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._210_say", "59:BB975135", "The creatures in the area are paying attention to[ENTER]you now! "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._220_say", "175:CF8AD2BE", "Go to the Fireland of Doyyumhwaji and look for[ENTER]the Fossilised Tears of the Dragon God[ENTER]Baljit-Elvedin. Collect some Obsidian while[ENTER]you're at it - you'll get it from the Flames. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._230_say", "30:3D75E7FC", "Fossilised Tears required: %s "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._240_say", "23:B6FB5B0E", "Obsidian required: %s "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._250_notice", "34:15176725", "You have collected enough tears! "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._260_notice", "39:7C009495", "You found Obsidian by this flame! "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._270_notice", "36:9738D981", "You have collected all the required Obsidian! "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._280_say", "60:CDA52AB1", "Go back to Seon-Hae with the Fossilised Tears and[ENTER]the Obsidian. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._290_say", "20:439F932F", "Seon-Hae is in: %s "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._300_say", "146:3F770C92", "Baljit-Elvedin's tears! I'll transform them back[ENTER]into their liquid form and put them inside the[ENTER]Obsidian. Their power allows you to call the[ENTER]Goddess Bahar-Taraji! "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._310_say", "140:5F691E27", "Her spirit still wanders the earth. Her voice[ENTER]will talk to you when you carry the tears with[ENTER]you. Look for her in the Red Forest of Lungsam! "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._320_say", "58:7422B248", "Here, take this vase and look for Bahar-Taraji's[ENTER]voice. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._330_say", "165:B181AA23", "Look for Bahar-Taraji's voice in the area of the[ENTER]Red Forest in Lungsam. Even if you can't see the[ENTER]goddess' ghost, you will be able to feel her[ENTER]spirit's presence. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._335_say", "169:F34B657B", "A quiet sound of whispering whistles through the[ENTER]wind: Go to a safe place... We can't talk here...[ENTER]Click on the quest scroll to talk to the ghost. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._340_say", "64:79106E5A", "In the distance, the voice of the murdered[ENTER]Goddess Bahar-Taraji sounds... "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._350_say", "109:7057C215", "My brother's tears... he grieved for me for so[ENTER]long and yet he still couldn't punish[ENTER]Beran-Setaou for his deeds. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._360_say", "146:2DEAA468", "He couldn't confront his brother Beran-Setaou,[ENTER]the destroyer, the one that the people feared. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._370_say", "116:7E299963", "But you... Who are you? You're different![ENTER]You're not afraid of him. On the contrary, I can[ENTER]see that you're seeking combat. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._380_say", "170:5DA97B22", "%s! Take these drops of my blood. Produce a Blood[ENTER]Stone with it and make Beran-Setaou pay for his[ENTER]deeds. The Grotto of Exile isn't far from here. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._390_say", "64:79106E5A", "In the distance, the voice of the murdered[ENTER]Goddess Bahar-Taraji sounds... "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._400_say", "17:86C304F7", "%s! I recognise you! "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._410_say", "107:CAF304E5", "You have brought my brother's tears to console me[ENTER]and will therefore receive my blood as a reward,[ENTER]so that you can carry on fighting. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._420_say", "45:10E0446F", "Go back to Seon-Hae with Bahar-Taraji's blood. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._430_say", "73:81BA078B", "Seon-Hae's eyes become glassy as she takes the[ENTER]Drops of Blood from you... "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._440_say", "83:0A221186", "The blood of a real Goddess! Quick, let me make[ENTER]it into a Blood Stone before it dries up. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._450_say", "372:0AE2EDD9", "The guard Koe-Pung will let you use the portal[ENTER]that leads to the Grotto of Exile if you have a[ENTER]Blood Stone on you. However, it'll only work[ENTER]once. If you need more blood stones, then come[ENTER]back to see me. Unfortunately I can only produce[ENTER]a Blood Stone once a day, so that we don't[ENTER]attract the Order's Wrath. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._460_say_reward", "99:ADFD1FE9", "Seon-Hae can produce more Blood Stones for you,[ENTER]but only one per day. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._470_say", "88:DBF8FBAA", "I'm going to turn Bahar-Taraji's blood into a[ENTER]Blood Stone. May it serve you well. "},
	{"heavens_cave_keyquest._480_say_reward", "137:25140D3F", "I can only make you one Blood Stone a day.[ENTER]Otherwise Koe-Pung might become suspicious. "},
	{"horse_exchange_ticket._10_npcChat", "21:034001BB", "Voucher for a Horse Medal "},
	{"horse_exchange_ticket._20_sayTitle", "10:65E0ED3A", "Stable Boy: "},
	{"horse_exchange_ticket._30_say", "143:67BC04A3", "In former times, a voucher like this was needed[ENTER]to receive a Horse Medal. You can exchange it for[ENTER]one. Would you like to use your voucher now? "},
	{"horse_exchange_ticket._40_select", "8:4E4CAE91", "Exchange "},
	{"horse_exchange_ticket._50_say", "22:27663F5D", "I gave you a Horse Medal. "},
	{"horse_guard._10_npcChat", "21:4F524BA7", "Information about horses "},
	{"horse_guard._20_say", "92:A1B5797F", "To start a horse mission, you need a Horse Medal.[ENTER]You can get one in the monkey dungeon. "},
	{"horse_guard._30_say", "223:C17018D9", "There are horses for three levels of riders:[ENTER]beginner, intermediate and expert.[ENTER]When you have practised enough and want to get to[ENTER]the next level, you have to pass a test. "},
	{"horse_guard._40_say", "270:83688FED", "Depending on the individual pressures put on[ENTER]horses by their riders, horses need different[ENTER]types of food. Riding beginners should feed their[ENTER]animals with hay, advanced riders should feed[ENTER]their animals with carrots and expert riders that[ENTER]demand a lot from their horses, should only feed[ENTER]their horses with red Ginseng. When it comes to[ENTER]food, horses can be very picky. "},
	{"horse_guard._50_say", "377:23B517B6", "The condition of your horse is shown by means of[ENTER]a simple indicator: Green means that it is[ENTER]healthy, yellow means it is hungry. Red is[ENTER]dangerous, as it means that your horse is[ENTER]undernourished. You have to feed your horse if[ENTER]the indicator is yellow or red. It is a serious[ENTER]business if your horse dies. "},
	{"horse_guard._60_say", "183:4B880B0D", "When you ride your horse, it's health slowly[ENTER]depletes and it becomes exhausted. You can't ride[ENTER]a horse without health. Therefore, you have to[ENTER]let it rest occasionally. "},
	{"horse_guard._70_say", "251:54A8408F", "There are rumours going round that a dead horse[ENTER]can be revived with Monkey Herbs. However the[ENTER]herbs are strictly guarded by monkeys, and it[ENTER]seems to be difficult to get hold of them. Rumour[ENTER]has it that if you are caught by the monkeys,[ENTER]they will curse you, and you'll be transformed[ENTER]into one of them. "},
	{"horse_guard._80_say", "188:5ABA4E16", "A rider's skills can vary a lot. If you have a[ENTER]Horse Medal, you can improve the level of your[ENTER]mount. "},
	{"horse_levelup._100_say", "113:2DFBDC81", "Kill the Black Orc while riding your horse. If[ENTER]you get off your horse, you will fail. "},
	{"horse_levelup._10_makequestbutton", "16:BA40CFFF", "Kill Gu-Ryung! "},
	{"horse_levelup._110_makequestbutton", "25:DD9DF55C", "Kill the Dark Tormentor! "},
	{"horse_levelup._120_say", "119:96B87A89", "Kill the Dark Tormentor while riding your horse.[ENTER]If you get off your horse, you fail. "},
	{"horse_levelup._130_makequestbutton", "31:BD909103", "Kill the Claw Poison Spider! "},
	{"horse_levelup._140_say", "125:1C9F6E77", "Kill the Claw Poison Spider while riding your[ENTER]horse. If you get off your horse, you fail. "},
	{"horse_levelup._150_makequestbutton", "28:6F6E667A", "Kill the Desert Outlaw! "},
	{"horse_levelup._160_say", "122:22550125", "Kill the Desert Outlaw while riding your horse.[ENTER]If you get off your horse, you fail. "},
	{"horse_levelup._170_makequestbutton", "23:02D426AE", "Kill the Ice Golem! "},
	{"horse_levelup._180_sayTitle", "23:02D426AE", "Kill an Ice Golem! "},
	{"horse_levelup._190_say", "117:7BCE629E", "Kill the Ice Golem while riding your horse. If[ENTER]you get off your horse, you fail. "},
	{"horse_levelup._200_say", "117:7BCE629E", "Kill the Ice Golem while riding your horse. If[ENTER]you get off your horse, you fail. "},
	{"horse_levelup._20_say", "126:4117D610", "Kill Black Wind Gu-Ryung while on horseback.[ENTER]If you get off your horse, the mission will fail. "},
	{"horse_levelup._210_makequestbutton", "26:856BD271", "Kill the Fighting Tiger! "},
	{"horse_levelup._220_say", "120:2CB455CC", "Kill the Fighting Tiger while riding your horse.[ENTER]If you get off your horse, you fail. "},
	{"horse_levelup._230_npcChat", "27:C5B166AE", "How do you fight while riding? "},
	{"horse_levelup._240_sayTitle", "10:65E0ED3A", "Stable Boy: "},
	{"horse_levelup._250_say", "79:0C89BA6D", "Your horse has been fully trained. You should[ENTER]concentrate on strengthening your horse now. "},
	{"horse_levelup._260_say", "82:EAA7FB65", "You need a Horse Medal to train your horse. Your[ENTER]results will be recorded on it. "},
	{"horse_levelup._270_say", "39:571B3D36", "Your horse needs rest. Try again tomorrow. "},
	{"horse_levelup._280_say", "54:307AF3CD", "Your horse is very tired. You have to give him a[ENTER]rest. "},
	{"horse_levelup._290_say", "39:5AEAEBE8", "Your horse is very hungry. Go feed it. "},
	{"horse_levelup._300_say", "30:007BD7C6", "Ride over to me. "},
	{"horse_levelup._30_makequestbutton", "20:0EFFED38", "Kill the Deserts Flying Eye! "},
	{"horse_levelup._310_say", "279:9142C744", "Attacking while riding is much more difficult[ENTER]than simply riding. But the same rules apply[ENTER]here: Practice makes perfect. If you fall down,[ENTER]you fail. So be careful! Your results will be[ENTER]recorded on your Horse Medal. "},
	{"horse_levelup._320_makequestbutton", "21:1E4DBAEC", "Get a Horse Medal! "},
	{"horse_levelup._330_say", "101:10A6B9F0", "You need a Horse Medal in order to learn how to[ENTER]fight on the back of a horse. You can get one in[ENTER]the monkey dungeon. "},
	{"horse_levelup._340_makequestbutton", "43:56133738", "Attacking while riding has failed"},
	{"horse_levelup._350_say", "70:F8A3A4E7", "You have fallen off your horse or have[ENTER]dismounted. You therefore have not completed your[ENTER]mission. "},
	{"horse_levelup._360_makequestbutton", "20:0A82105E", "Return to the Stable Boy "},
	{"horse_levelup._370_say", "87:96E26A31", "If you go back to the Stable Boy, you can check[ENTER]your results on the Horse Medal. "},
	{"horse_levelup._380_say", "129:64A84C99", "Did everything work out? Your training will[ENTER]continue tomorrow. Today's results have been[ENTER]recorded on your Horse Medal. "},
	{"horse_levelup._390_makequestbutton", "15:4B785BF9", "Training results "},
	{"horse_levelup._400_qSetTitle", "15:4B785BF9", "Training results "},
	{"horse_levelup._40_say", "121:73A56196", "Kill the Deserts Flying Eye while on horseback.[ENTER]If you get off your horse, the mission will fail. "},
	{"horse_levelup._410_say", "32:C5604246", "Your horse has not had enough training. "},
	{"horse_levelup._420_say", "38:64D75D32", "Your horse can now ascend a level. "},
	{"horse_levelup._430_say", "93:2839D582", "Your attack whilst riding has failed.[ENTER]Return to the Stable Boy to try it again. "},
	{"horse_levelup._440_say", "32:CB3D8D20", "Horse training successful "},
	{"horse_levelup._450_say", "28:45624669", "Your horse's level is %s "},
	{"horse_levelup._460_say", "77:8431F64C", "Return to the Stable Boy to advance your horse[ENTER]for intermediates into a mount for experts. "},
	{"horse_levelup._470_say", "82:E1F0B76D", "To get a horse for an expert rider you have to[ENTER]train your horse to level 20. "},
	{"horse_levelup._480_say", "46:CAF79A97", "You can't save your results without a Horse Medal. "},
	{"horse_levelup._50_say", "121:73A56196", "Kill the Deserts Flying Eye while on horseback.[ENTER]If you get off your horse, the mission will fail. "},
	{"horse_levelup._60_makequestbutton", "25:8C3EFBF8", "Kill the Elite Orc General! "},
	{"horse_levelup._70_say", "150:78D964DD", "Kill the Elite Orc General whilst riding your[ENTER]horse. If you get off your horse, you will fail[ENTER]you mission. "},
	{"horse_levelup._80_say", "150:78D964DD", "Kill the Elite Orc General whilst riding your[ENTER]horse. If you get off your horse, you will fail[ENTER]you mission. "},
	{"horse_levelup._90_makequestbutton", "21:1E7692DB", "Kill the Black Orc! "},
