	{"horse_revive._10_npcChat", "15:F14DFB2A", "Revive horse. "},
	{"horse_revive._110_say", "130:B3A73F8F", "These are Herbs of Normal Monkeys from the normal[ENTER]Monkey Dungeon. They can revive your horse. You[ENTER]have to call it first though. "},
	{"horse_revive._120_say", "300:4FAF58C4", "You can only revive the horse if you get Herbs of[ENTER]Easy Monkeys from the beginners Monkey Dungeon.[ENTER]But this isn't an easy mission, as the herbs are[ENTER]guarded by the monkeys that live there. And those[ENTER]monkeys are incredibly aggressive. "},
	{"horse_revive._130_say", "118:F6791E28", "For your information: the Herbs of Normal Monkeys[ENTER]from the normal Monkey Dungeon are for[ENTER]intermediate horses. "},
	{"horse_revive._140_say", "129:D817739C", "These are Herbs of Easy Monkeys from the[ENTER]beginners Monkey Dungeon. Your horse can be[ENTER]revived with them. You have to call it first[ENTER]though. "},
	{"horse_revive._20_say", "278:9B8B4315", "You can only revive the horse if you get Herbs of[ENTER]Hard Monkeys from the expert Monkey Dungeon. But[ENTER]don't be fooled into thinking that is going to be[ENTER]a walk in the park. The herbs are guarded by the[ENTER]monkeys that live there. And those monkeys are[ENTER]incredibly aggressive. "},
	{"horse_revive._30_say", "118:F6791E28", "For your information: the Herbs of Normal Monkeys[ENTER]from the normal Monkey Dungeon are for[ENTER]intermediate horses. "},
	{"horse_revive._40_say", "115:E7797025", "For your information: the Herbs of Easy Monkeys[ENTER]from the beginners Monkey Dungeon are for[ENTER]beginner horses. "},
	{"horse_revive._50_say", "129:12864F4F", "These are Herbs of Hard Monkeys from the expert[ENTER]Monkey Dungeon. They can revive your horse. You[ENTER]have to call it first though. "},
	{"horse_revive._60_say", "77:BE9740C8", "Feed the horse the herbs and wait.[ENTER][DELAY value=400]. . .[/DELAY][ENTER] "},
	{"horse_revive._70_say", "77:2409BEBA", "The horse has been revived. Don't forget to feed[ENTER]your horse in the future. "},
	{"horse_revive._80_say", "280:A31A770B", "You can only revive the horse if you get Herbs of[ENTER]Normal Monkeys from the normal Monkey Dungeon.[ENTER]But don't be fooled into thinking that this is[ENTER]going to be a walk in the park. The herbs are[ENTER]guarded by the monkeys that live there. And those[ENTER]monkeys are incredibly aggressive. "},
	{"horse_revive._90_say", "114:F3473E20", "For your information: the Herbs of Hard Monkeys[ENTER]from the expert Monkey Dungeon are for horses[ENTER]that belong to expert riders. "},
	{"horse_ride._10_npcChat", "26:4890928A", "Mount (use the Horse Riding Ticket) "},
	{"horse_ride._15_say", "104:8F6F7E1C", "I can rent you a horse, but the horse has to rest after its last ride. An hour of rest will be enough for it. "},
	{"horse_ride._20_say", "277:51D66DB1", "You're looking for a mount? At the moment we are[ENTER]renting out horses to people that have Horse[ENTER]Riding Tickets. Your current riding skills will[ENTER]allow you to ride a horse for about 10 minutes.[ENTER]You do not have much riding experience, so you[ENTER]can keep steady on a horse, but cannot attack[ENTER]from horseback yet. "},
	{"horse_ride._30_select", "12:35D4D7D7", "Don't ride "},
	{"horse_ride._40_say", "36:1517BB8C", "You need a Horse Riding Ticket. "},
