	{"horse_upgrade._100_makequestbutton", "32:8EE3BB05", "Armed Horse Book test "},
	{"horse_upgrade._10_say", "126:DD31369F", "What's the point of improving a dead horse?[ENTER]Apart from anything else, it won't work. Go get[ENTER]hold of some monkey herbs and bring your horse[ENTER]back to life with them. Afterwards we can then[ENTER]talk about improving your horse again. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._110_sayReward", "133:13D096D5", "Kill 100 Scorpion Archers or Snake Archers in 30[ENTER]minutes. Once you're done, report back to the[ENTER]Stable Boy. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._120_npcChat", "26:8F02CE31", "About the Armed Horse Book... "},
	{"horse_upgrade._130_say", "180:C98309ED", "Kill 100 Scorpion Archers or Snake Archers in 30[ENTER]minutes.[ENTER]You can do this mission with a group, but only[ENTER]the group's leader is awarded points for killing[ENTER]the targets. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._140_say", "103:C1E3C1B7", "You don't have time for this! Go kill the[ENTER]Scorpion Archers or Snake Archers as quickly as[ENTER]possible! "},
	{"horse_upgrade._150_npcChat", "26:2BF7751A", "Status report aptitude test "},
	{"horse_upgrade._160_npcChat", "33:9F6F8F96", "Results of aptitude test "},
	{"horse_upgrade._170_say", "223:A54EACC4", "Well done.[ENTER]If you want to improve your horse now, you have[ENTER]to exchange your Horse Picture for the Armed[ENTER]Horse Book. That's going to take a while; you'd[ENTER]best come back tomorrow. And don't forget, you[ENTER]also need 500,000 Yang to buy the Armed Horse[ENTER]Book. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._180_makequestbutton", "35:5E116C8C", "Wait for the Armed Horse Book "},
	{"horse_upgrade._190_sayReward", "78:E6C71625", "Wait for the Stable Boy to finish the Armed Horse[ENTER]Book. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._200_npcChat", "28:EABA2C4F", "Is the Armed Horse Book finished yet? "},
	{"horse_upgrade._20_say", "158:594E900B", "Your level is too low to improve your horse. You[ENTER]can only improve your horse once you have reached[ENTER]level 35. Come again when you're ready. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._210_say", "115:BD05187B", "I am sorry, but you will have to wait a little[ENTER]bit longer. Remember to bring the 500,000 Yang[ENTER]when you come back! "},
	{"horse_upgrade._220_sayReward", "91:799E4999", "Go to the Stable Boy and get the Armed Horse[ENTER]Book. You need your Horse Picture and 500,000[ENTER]Yang to get it. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._230_sayReward", "91:799E4999", "Go to the Stable Boy and get the Armed Horse[ENTER]Book. You need your Horse Picture and 500,000[ENTER]Yang to get it. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._240_npcChat", "37:542270AB", "Is the Armed Horse Book ready? "},
	{"horse_upgrade._250_say", "230:1AF6D1D9", "If you get the Armed Horse Book, you will be able[ENTER]to ride faster and attack whilst riding.[ENTER]Here, this is for you: Preparation for the[ENTER]Military Horse Book. And another thing: You need[ENTER]500,000 Yang to improve your horse. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._260_say", "150:9295A495", "When you own the Armed Horse Book, you can call[ENTER]your horse any time. So look after it! "},
	{"horse_upgrade._270_say", "74:7ED68E6F", "You need the Horse Picture to get the Armed Horse[ENTER]Book. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._280_say", "38:CB21F921", "You also need 500,000 Yang. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._290_say", "78:1CE5BC6C", "Come again if you want the Armed Horse Book. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._300_say", "89:9A96A10C", "Are you sure? If you discontinue the quest now,[ENTER]you will have to do it from scratch. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._30_say", "117:AC5EDAB0", "The level of your horse is too low to improve it.[ENTER]Go train your horsemanship. Once your horse[ENTER]reaches level 10, you can come again. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._310_sayReward", "105:AF5FEBA4", "As you have not killed 100 Scorpion Archers or[ENTER]Snake Archers you haven't passed the test. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._40_say", "115:174CEB7E", "I don't want to have to say this again: If you[ENTER]want to ride a horse, you need to have your Horse[ENTER]Picture with you! "},
	{"horse_upgrade._50_say", "286:45C4955A", "If you own the Armed Horse Book, you can attack[ENTER]your opponents from the back of your horse. I'm[ENTER]going to test your combat experience and your[ENTER]horsemanship. Go to the desert and kill some[ENTER]Scorpion Archers. You can go there with a group,[ENTER]but YOU have to be the group leader. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._60_say", "18:921F1CDB", "Okay, come back later. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._80_say", "144:5880DBB7", "I can't think of a reason why you shouldn't have[ENTER]received the Armed Horse Book. Perhaps you should[ENTER]consult a Game Master. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._90_sayReward", "120:28960637", "You need a Horse Medal to start the quest for the[ENTER]Armed Horse Book. You can find it in the monkey[ENTER]dungeon. "},
	{"horse_upgrade._test_2015_count", "15:F81A8C06", "Archers left "},
	{"horse_upgrade._test_2107_count", "15:F81A8C06", "Archers left "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._100_makequestbutton", "21:1E4DBAEC", "Get the Horse Medal! "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._10_npcChat", "20:E2BF2886", "I want to improve my horse. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._110_sayReward", "116:5FA08A94", "You need a Horse Medal if you are interested in[ENTER]the Military Horse Book. You can find the Horse[ENTER]Medal in the monkey dungeon. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._120_makequestbutton", "26:EE253162", "Military Horse Book test "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._130_sayReward", "71:68A6A5C9", "Kill 300 Demon Archers within 30 minutes and[ENTER]report back to the Stable Boy. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._140_sayReward", "72:1D31534D", "You can travel in a group and enjoy support in[ENTER]battle. But remember that only the group leader[ENTER]will be credited with the results. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._150_npcChat", "30:4AD6B610", "About the Military Horse Book... "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._160_say", "129:25184098", "Kill 300 Demon Archers! You have 30 minutes to[ENTER]complete the mission.[ENTER][ENTER]You can work in a group for extra protection, but[ENTER]you need to be the group leader if you want the[ENTER]results to count. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._170_say", "36:BE09C410", "Are you sure you want to discontinue the test? "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._180_select", "4:48F9C4CD", "Yes "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._190_select", "22:51BC726A", "No, just kidding! "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._200_say", "40:1D5521B9", "All right. Good luck next time. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._20_say", "171:AD8D2BAA", "What's the point of improving a dead horse?[ENTER]Apart from anything else, it won't work. Go find[ENTER]some Monkey Herbs, which can bring your horse[ENTER]back to life. Afterwards we can then talk about[ENTER]the possibility of improving your horse. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._210_say", "115:964FA23C", "If you want to pass the test you don't have any[ENTER]time to hang around here! Go kill the Demon[ENTER]Archers! "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._230_makequestbutton", "20:0A82105E", "Return to the Stable Boy "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._240_sayReward", "36:CE9251DB", "Tell the Stable Boy the results of your test. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._250_npcChat", "33:52956DE1", "Aptitude test status "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._260_npcChat", "33:9F6F8F96", "Results of aptitude test "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._270_say", "308:3E8675E4", "Well done! If you want to improve your horse now,[ENTER]you need to exchange your Armed Horse Book for[ENTER]the Military Horse Book. It will also cost you[ENTER]1,000,000 Yang. It's going to take some time to[ENTER]finish the book, so come again tomorrow. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._280_makequestbutton", "36:4478A0CA", "Wait for the Military Horse Book"},
	{"horse_upgrade2._290_sayReward", "75:600823E3", "Wait for the Stable Boy to finish the Military[ENTER]Horse Book. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._300_npcChat", "27:1891F977", "Status horse improvement "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._30_say", "158:81CB416F", "Your level is too low to improve your horse. You[ENTER]can only improve your horse once you have reached[ENTER]level 50. Just come back when you're ready. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._310_npcChat", "28:EABA2C4F", "Is the Military Horse Book finished yet? "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._320_say", "128:81F66497", "I'm sorry, you need to wait a little longer.[ENTER]Ahhhh yes, don't forget: you need 1,000,000 Yang[ENTER]for the Military Horse Book. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._330_makequestbutton", "18:CA02CB1F", "Go to the Stable Boy "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._340_sayReward", "155:32239AAD", "Go to the Stable Boy and pick up your Military[ENTER]Horse Book. You need your Armed Horse Book and[ENTER]1,000,000 Yang to get it. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._350_npcChat", "37:6D28D8EC", "I want to collect the Military Horse Book. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._360_say", "253:8807F1AE", "If you have the Military Horse Book, your horse[ENTER]will be able to master different fighting styles.[ENTER]A book like this is very rare, and it is not very[ENTER]cheap either. You need 1,000,000 Yang to buy one.[ENTER]Do you really want to improve your horse? "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._370_select", "13:42EA976E", "Improve horse "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._380_select", "19:C2CDC4A4", "Don't improve horse "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._385_select", "9:C232B558", "Oh, whatever. Forget it. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._390_say", "176:0568B42D", "Once you have the Military Horse Book, you can[ENTER]call your horse any time and it'll come to you.[ENTER]So, take good care of it. These are the basics;[ENTER]now it's up to you. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._400_say", "87:CD487FFD", "You need the Armed Horse Book to get the Military[ENTER]Horse Book. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._40_say", "117:8D9A5CB0", "Your horse's level is too low to improve it. Go[ENTER]train your riding skills. Come back once your[ENTER]horse has reached level 20. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._410_say", "30:876D549D", "You haven't got 1,000,000 Yang on you. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._420_say", "61:4F612646", "Come back if you want to get the Military Horse[ENTER]Book. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._430_say", "89:9A96A10C", "Are you sure? If you give up now, you'll have to[ENTER]start the quest from scratch. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._440_makequestbutton", "14:940D4289", "Time's up! "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._450_sayReward", "76:989FA59A", "You haven't killed 300 Demon Archers so you[ENTER]haven't passed the test! "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._460_sayReward", "90:74A4B8F5", "If you want to try again, get another Horse Medal[ENTER]and go visit the Stable Boy. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._50_say", "236:D425C0C0", "If you want to improve your horse, you need to[ENTER]pass a qualification test. Just like last time,[ENTER]you need a Horse Medal to be able to take the[ENTER]test. You can find it in the monkey dungeon. Of[ENTER]course, the monkeys living there won't give it to[ENTER]you without a fight and they're very violent... "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._60_say", "121:AF32209D", "Do I really have to say it again? If you want to[ENTER]ride a horse, you need to have the Armed Horse[ENTER]Book with you. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._70_say", "308:E3A20A90", "Only the strongest in the world will get the[ENTER]Military Horse Book. Go to the Demon Tower and[ENTER]kill 300 Demon Archers. If you manage to do this,[ENTER]no-one will be able to stop me from giving you[ENTER]the Military Horse Book. Of course, it's a hard[ENTER]assignment. You can do it with a group, but YOU[ENTER]need to be the group leader. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._80_say", "26:9E774078", "Well then, come back later. "},
	{"horse_upgrade2._90_say", "104:7174884B", "I can't think of a reason why you haven't[ENTER]received the Military Horse Book. (Ask a game[ENTER]master about it). "},
