	{"locale.ariyeong.failure_info_label", "18:C943789F", "Return to Ariyoung. "},
	{"locale.ariyeong.failure_info_text_1", "18:C943789F", "Return to Ariyoung. "},
	{"locale.ariyeong.failure_info_text_2", "85:4CA86457", "Return to the village and tell Ariyoung that you[ENTER]couldn't find her husband's keepsake. "},
	{"locale.ariyeong.find_ariyeong_label", "18:6259FB92", "Visit Ariyoung. "},
	{"locale.ariyeong.find_ariyeong_text_1", "21:1E513D5E", "Go to Ariyoung "},
	{"locale.ariyeong.find_ariyeong_text_2", "46:7419645B", "Go to Ariyoung and tell her about her husband's[ENTER]death. "},
	{"locale.ariyeong.kill_label", "39:1FB19ADD", "Kill the leader of the Black Wind Gang. "},
	{"locale.ariyeong.kill_text_1", "39:1FB19ADD", "Kill the leader of the Black Wind Gang. "},
	{"locale.ariyeong.kill_text_2", "86:F9B75EF3", "Kill the Black Wind Gang and their leader, find[ENTER]the keepsake and take it back to Ariyoung. "},
	{"locale.ariyeong.success_info_label", "36:CA6AF720", "Take the wedding ring to Ariyoung. "},
	{"locale.ariyeong.success_info_text_1", "36:CA6AF720", "Take the wedding ring to Ariyoung. "},
	{"locale.ariyeong.success_info_text_2", "94:160E1F25", "Go back to the village, give the wedding ring to[ENTER]Ariyoung, and get your reward. "},
	{"locale.ariyeong.too_late", "128:55AE1D3D", "This must be a divine providence![ENTER]You're bringing me back my beloved husband's[ENTER]keepsake! Thank you so much! "},
	{"locale.blacksmith.refine_info", "127:F8B9042F", "Greetings![ENTER]I am responsible for upgrading items.[ENTER]If you want to upgrade an item, just bring it to[ENTER]me. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.accept_ask", "121:1FF97F96", "Why are you still here?[ENTER]You accepted the task, so hurry up and do your[ENTER]job. First come, first served. Attack! "},
	{"locale.bookworm.accept_failure_info_label", "14:2DD487C1", "Go back to Soon. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.accept_failure_info_text_1", "14:2DD487C1", "Go back to Soon. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.accept_failure_info_text_2", "73:F3AACA72", "Return to the village and tell Soon that you[ENTER]couldn't find the Milgyo book. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.accept_failure_say_1", "16:61B25E43", "Return to the village. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.accept_failure_say_2", "117:3C87CC2D", "I seem to be followed by misfortune - I just[ENTER]can't find the Milgyo book. The only thing that[ENTER]is left to do is to go back to the village. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.accept_success_info_label", "31:39F6DE8C", "Get the Milgyo book for Soon! "},
	{"locale.bookworm.accept_success_info_text_1", "31:39F6DE8C", "Get the Milgyo book for Soon! "},
	{"locale.bookworm.accept_success_info_text_2", "51:22335716", "Return to the village, give the book to Soon and[ENTER]get your reward. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.accept_success_say_1", "27:ED488B4E", "Here it is...the Milgyo book! "},
	{"locale.bookworm.accept_success_say_2", "47:B839CC4E", "There's the Milgyo book! Take it to Soon in the[ENTER]village. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.aranyeo_complete_say", "151:75A4781A", "Which fool got this strange book for my husband?[ENTER]He's been staring at it the whole day, learning[ENTER]strange chants off by heart. He doesn't lift a[ENTER]finger anymore! I'll break every one of his bones[ENTER]when I get my hands on him! "},
	{"locale.bookworm.aranyeo_complete_say2", "61:B89245A8", "What's wrong? What's with the cold sweat on your[ENTER]forehead? "},
	{"locale.bookworm.aranyeo_start_say", "182:0DDBC301", "Where did he go now? His attitude is getting on[ENTER]my nerves! He wastes his days reading books[ENTER]without earning a single Yang. And he's not even[ENTER]ashamed of the fact that he's such a bad role[ENTER]model for his children. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.aranyeo_start_say2", "85:20A124D2", "Can books put food on your table or get clothes[ENTER]for you? I'll break all his bones when I get hold[ENTER]of him! "},
	{"locale.bookworm.aranyeo_talk", "9:77289C86", "Talk. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.complete_say", "41:E206FB8C", "Oha! Yes, I see it! I see it! I can see the new[ENTER]world! "},
	{"locale.bookworm.do_you_find_the_book", "25:BA724C4A", "Did you find the Milgyo book? "},
	{"locale.bookworm.do_you_mean_this_book", "25:6BD0B98B", "Do you mean this Book? "},
	{"locale.bookworm.etc_shop_start_say", "276:44803A25", "He came here yesterday and asked about the Milgyo[ENTER]book. He didn't have any Yang, but he asked about[ENTER]it constantly anyway. Maybe Milgyo has got[ENTER]something to do with these brual creatures in the[ENTER]Valley of Seungryong. Dunno why he has developed[ENTER]a sudden interest in those creatures though. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.etc_shop_start_say2", "69:77A691FA", "You just have to feel sorry for Aranyo. Why does[ENTER]she put up with him? "},
	{"locale.bookworm.etc_shop_talk_about_bookworm", "17:7B0777E6", "About Soon the academic "},
	{"locale.bookworm.order_accept", "29:0B8C8491", "Okay! I'm going to get it for you! "},
	{"locale.bookworm.order_accept_answer", "31:ECCB4B52", "Thanks! I'm counting on you. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.order_find_book_label", "24:7D063C13", "Kill Milgyo's disciple! "},
	{"locale.bookworm.order_find_book_text_1", "24:7D063C13", "Kill Milgyo's disciple! "},
	{"locale.bookworm.order_find_book_text_2", "35:89B56A01", "Take the Milgyo book from Milgyo's disciple. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.order_refuse", "25:BEFAA36A", "That should be rather difficult. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.order_refuse_answer", "60:F20F6B7D", "Why don't you give it a try? I know you can do it! "},
	{"locale.bookworm.order_say1", "265:2B911101", "Do you want to hear something funny? I can[ENTER]actually claim that I've read all books in this[ENTER]world! Right now, I am studying a collection of[ENTER]holy texts. Rumour has it, that secret[ENTER]information and hints about how to become a saint[ENTER]may be found in the Milgyo book. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.order_say2", "192:0A7EADC2", "I would like to read this book. What do you[ENTER]think, could you get it for me? I would, of[ENTER]course, reward you! "},
	{"locale.bookworm.order_too_late", "81:113748C4", "Someone else has already brought me the Milgyo[ENTER]book. You don't need to do it any more. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.start_find_bookworm_label", "12:60DA046B", "Go to Soon "},
	{"locale.bookworm.start_find_bookworm_text_1", "12:60DA046B", "Go to Soon "},
	{"locale.bookworm.start_find_bookworm_text_2", "38:C0FCE227", "Go to Soon and ask about the Milgyo book. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.start_say", "156:77219C18", "Can you see the deep wisdom in this document?[ENTER]Individual words form sentences and that's how a[ENTER]wonderful story is made. You have to get used to[ENTER]to being led by other people's imaginations and[ENTER]it's not to everyone's liking, but I love it. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.start_say2", "152:10B4F701", "The more you have, the more you get.[ENTER]The more you know, the more fun you have in life.[ENTER]Ah, if only I could read books my entire life... "},
	{"locale.bookworm.success_thanks", "62:9DEA7DBD", "Oh! That's it! I'm going to read it with pleasure. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.talk", "9:77289C86", "Talk. "},
	{"locale.bookworm.talk_about_milgyo_book", "24:CDA99E65", "Ask about the Milgyo book. "},
	{"locale.cancel", "7:729E4BAD", "Cancel "},
	{"locale.christmas_santa.bye_msg", "62:3A6077EE", "As you wish. Good luck today![ENTER]And happy holidays, ho ho ho! "},
	{"locale.christmas_santa.hairdye_msg", "179:EE9B0360", "%d Yang for an item from this sack. There are[ENTER]different materials for upgrading items inside.[ENTER]You are allowed to take one out, but you cannot[ENTER]look inside! What do you think? "},
	{"locale.christmas_santa.hairdye_sold_out_msg", "120:23B24D81", "Hmm, well will you look at that - I don't have[ENTER]any more upgrade materials! I'm really sorry. "},
	{"locale.christmas_santa.intro_msg", "145:211E584B", "Ho, ho, ho! Merry Christmas! You are lucky that[ENTER]you caught me. I'm a very busy man these days.[ENTER]Would you like to buy something? "},
	{"locale.christmas_santa.no_need", "12:B1617667", "Got it. "},
	{"locale.christmas_santa.not_enough_money", "131:0532F093", "I'm really sorry, but unfortunately you don't[ENTER]have enough Yang in order to buy something.[ENTER]Nevertheless, I wish you the happiest of holidays! "},
	{"locale.christmas_santa.say_title", "16:BD852708", "Santa Claus: "},
	{"locale.christmas_santa.select_buy", "8:A365E227", "I will buy it. "},
	{"locale.christmas_santa.select_stop", "13:69E16BE1", "No, thanks. "},
	{"locale.christmas_santa.skill_book_msg", "207:69374C2B", "This skill book will cost you %d Yang, but you[ENTER]won't know which skill book it is until you open[ENTER]it. Do you still want to try your luck and buy[ENTER]one? "},
	{"locale.christmas_santa.skill_book_sold_out_msg", "130:2FF7123C", "Oh, I was sure I still had some books here...[ENTER]I'm sorry, but apparently I have sold them all. "},
	{"locale.christmas_santa.want_hairdye", "27:B928F769", "Buy upgrade materials "},
	{"locale.christmas_santa.want_skillbook", "24:638E2832", "Buy skill book "},
	{"locale.christmas_tree.christmas_say_title", "19:F686965A", "Christmas Tree "},
	{"locale.christmas_tree.gain_item_msg", "269:15FDD125", "You hang your stockings onto the tree.[ENTER]Then you close your eyes and wait for 3 seconds.[ENTER][DELAY value;500]. . .[/DELAY][ENTER][ENTER]I hope you like your present.[ENTER]Happy Christmas. "},
	{"locale.christmas_tree.greet", "80:0DE9AA12", "Hello. Are you here to be awed by my[ENTER]magnificence? Or is there something I can do for[ENTER]you? "},
	{"locale.christmas_tree.greet2", "115:11410403", "As you wish. But know that when you hang a[ENTER]stocking on me, I will give you a present. Happy[ENTER]Christmas! "},
	{"locale.christmas_tree.intro_msg", "190:C8F778AD", "I'll give you something if you hang a stocking on[ENTER]me! You can find stockings all over the[ENTER]continent. However, you can only hang them on me[ENTER]if you have a minimum level of 10. "},
	{"locale.christmas_tree.no_more_sock", "67:1A8EA4BC", "You cannot hang up any more stockings. Some of[ENTER]yours are already hanging up there. "},
	{"locale.christmas_tree.no_sock", "20:35F17C18", "You do not have any stockings! "},
	{"locale.christmas_tree.sel_intro_event", "32:DE7BA13D", "Why are there stockings hanging here? "},
	{"locale.christmas_tree.sel_no_need", "37:4B9C7793", "No, thanks. I don't need anything. "},
	{"locale.christmas_tree.sel_put_sock", "25:02BC49DF", "I want to hang up a stocking. "},
	{"locale.christmas_tree.sel_put_sock_not", "34:3D5A7DE5", "No, I don't want to hang up a stocking. "},
	{"locale.christmas_tree.under_level_10", "65:3FC0D6E7", "To hang up stockings, you must have a min. level[ENTER]of 10. "},
	{"locale.complete", "8:0C6FF08B", "Completed "},
	{"locale.confirm", "10:4D545491", "Confirm! "},
	{"locale.count_postfix", "6:8087A784", "Units "},
	{"locale.deokbae.failure_info_label", "24:67449414", "Return to Deokbae the lumberjack. "},
	{"locale.deokbae.failure_info_text_1", "24:67449414", "Return to Deokbae the lumberjack. "},
	{"locale.deokbae.failure_info_text_2", "68:5A1EA50B", "Tell Deokbae the lumberjack that you couldn't[ENTER]find the golden axe. "},
	{"locale.deokbae.find_deokbae_label", "23:E4D82138", "Find Deokbae the lumberjack. "},
	{"locale.deokbae.find_deokbae_text_1", "23:E4D82138", "Find Deokbae the lumberjack. "},
	{"locale.deokbae.find_deokbae_text_2", "36:18F72264", "Find Deokbae the lumberjack and give him a few[ENTER]words of encouragement. "},
	{"locale.deokbae.kill_label", "25:717EC98F", "Kill the Savage General. "},
	{"locale.deokbae.kill_text_1", "25:717EC98F", "Kill the Savage General. "},
	{"locale.deokbae.kill_text_2", "78:4CC4CA25", "Kill the savage general and take the axe back to[ENTER]Deokbae the lumberjack. "},
	{"locale.deokbae.success_info_label", "36:577809E1", "Take the golden axe back to Deokbae the[ENTER]lumberjack. "},
	{"locale.deokbae.success_info_text_1", "36:577809E1", "Take the golden axe back to Deokbae the[ENTER]lumberjack. "},
	{"locale.deokbae.success_info_text_2", "66:D68E2901", "Return the golden axe to Deokbae the lumberjack[ENTER]and get your reward. "},
	{"locale.deokbae.too_late", "229:AE71F2C7", "Without his help, I would never have found this[ENTER]axe. I thought it was all over when I lost it.[ENTER]But this adventurer here went into battle without[ENTER]hesitation and got my axe back! Now, I carry the[ENTER]axe with me, night and day. "},
	{"locale.deviltower_enter", "6:EBF9CCE6", "Enter "},
	{"locale.deviltower_man_chat", "20:F6F355C5", "Into the Demon Tower... "},
	{"locale.deviltower_man_say", "211:9CD24328", "This tower is swarmed with demons. Only the[ENTER]strongest fighters can reach the top. However,[ENTER]rumour has it that no one who enters the tower[ENTER]ever comes out alive. Are you sure that you want[ENTER]to enter the Demon Tower? "},
	{"locale.deviltower_man_say_you_cant", "235:3BBC33E0", "This tower is swarmed with demons. Only the[ENTER]strongest fighters can reach the top. However,[ENTER]rumour has it that no one who enters the tower[ENTER]ever comes out alive. You can only enter the[ENTER]Demon Tower once you have reached level 40. "},
	{"locale.deviltower_no_enter", "11:A47FED03", "Don't enter "},
	{"locale.eliminate_on_end", "11:B995FE3A", "Eliminate "},
	{"locale.empire_names_1", "17:6A1464FE", "Junjeh Kingdom "},
	{"locale.empire_names_2", "8:C66D52E5", "Shinsoo kingdom "},
	{"locale.empire_names_3", "7:DD3B1C28", "Chunjo kingdom "},
	{"locale.empire_names_4", "6:949E0475", "Jinno Kingdom "},
	{"locale.event.cancel", "15:509E4673", "Cancel event. "},
	{"locale.event.close", "15:38702C7A", "Close event. "},
	{"locale.event.info_print", "30:6EA77400", "Check information on the event. "},
	{"locale.event.modify", "23:74F49995", "Change event process. "},
	{"locale.event.on_going", "14:7D38A16B", "The event is running. "},
	{"locale.exp", "14:764D74DB", "Experience "},
	{"locale.exp_pct", "22:8E2E89CE", "Experience percentage "},
	{"locale.forked_condition", "144:BC24CA91", "We need to find the guardian of the portal before[ENTER]one of the other kingdoms does.[ENTER]Let's flex our kingdom's muscles and expand its[ENTER]power! "},
	{"locale.forked_condition2", "97:EFA8B364", "Now all we need to do is wipe out those who are[ENTER]violating the holy grounds. Attack! "},
	{"locale.forked_enter", "6:EBF9CCE6", "Take part "},
	{"locale.forked_kill_boss", "222:712A1E72", "I am Thorr Sarch! What do you want from me? I'm[ENTER]not dead, I will come back to life. Legions of[ENTER]warriors will follow me![ENTER]You have ended the kingdom battle. Everyone will[ENTER]be transported back to the village. "},
	{"locale.forked_man_chat", "29:69B1652A", "Take part in the Kingdom Battle "},
	{"locale.forked_man_say", "295:FEE35FFE", "A new area has been discovered. It is in the[ENTER]middle of the continent - it may even connect all[ENTER]the kingdoms together. It's swarming with dark[ENTER]creatures. Perhaps you could go there and[ENTER]confront them? Destroy them all and restore peace[ENTER]to our kingdom. "},
	{"locale.forked_man_say_cant", "196:A1755F29", "Hey! A new area has been discovered at the inner[ENTER]part of the continent. It may even connect all[ENTER]the kingdoms. As soon as the research is done[ENTER]there, you can enter the area. "},
	{"locale.forked_no_enter", "11:A47FED03", "Don't take part "},
	{"locale.forked_open_gate", "173:39A03BB8", "The door, which had been closed until now,[ENTER]opened. Let's head to the new grounds! We're[ENTER]going to conquer them! Everyone is going to be[ENTER]transported to the holy grounds. ", "b"},
	{"locale.forked_rule", "387:675981A5", "Rules for entering the Kingdom Battle:[ENTER]1. Everyone who dies in this area is transported[ENTER]back to the village but the battle bailiff can[ENTER]bring him back here immediately.[ENTER]2. Once the doors to the Holy Land have been[ENTER]opened, this area is closed.[ENTER]3. To enter the Holy Land, the matching key must[ENTER]be found. "},
	{"locale.forked_rule_sungzi", "475:569B6A19", "Rules of the Kingdom Battle:[ENTER]1. The kingdom with the lowest number of[ENTER]victories against another kingdom is eliminated[ENTER]first.[ENTER]2. Enemy monsters are going to appear. The first[ENTER]kingdom to slay a certain number of monsters[ENTER]wins.[ENTER]3. If the Nine Tails is killed after that, the[ENTER]battle ends.[ENTER]4. No items can be obtained during the battle.[ENTER]5. Whoever dies three times in the Holy Land[ENTER]returns to the village and is eliminated from the[ENTER]Kingdom Battle. "},
	{"locale.fortune_words_1_body", "173:050527E4", "Fortune has truly taken a shine to you! Today you[ENTER]will have 'Very Good Fortune'! Those protected by[ENTER]such harmony will have something good happen to[ENTER]them today. "},
	{"locale.fortune_words_1_title", "19:7369F402", "Very good fortune! "},
	{"locale.fortune_words_2_body", "233:BAEBFD8F", "That's good. How does that saying go? You reap[ENTER]what you sow. Today, you will have 'Great[ENTER]Fortune'! I'm glad for you. A little bit of[ENTER]effort and you will receive more than before! "},
	{"locale.fortune_words_2_title", "19:B9313301", "Great fortune! "},
	{"locale.fortune_words_3_body", "170:35CF2A05", "That's not bad. Today, you will have 'Some Good[ENTER]Luck'. Your day is going to go a little better[ENTER]than usual but don't expect great gifts! "},
	{"locale.fortune_words_3_title", "18:BF7C96B2", "A bit of fortune. "},
	{"locale.fortune_words_4_body", "197:478658AC", "Nothing particularly good, but nothing too bad[ENTER]either! You will have 'normal luck' today. It[ENTER]won't really help you any further, but it is[ENTER]better than having misfortune. Normal days are[ENTER]not to be sneezed at so enjoy! "},
	{"locale.fortune_words_4_title", "20:10DC0BDB", "Normal fortune. "},
	{"locale.fortune_words_5_body", "356:8464444B", "You will not be very lucky today. Even if you[ENTER]throw out your nets as conscientiously as ever,[ENTER]you will not catch many fish today. On the plus[ENTER]side, you will not starve. You will have 'a bit[ENTER]of bad luck' today! But there's nothing better[ENTER]than being well prepared. If you like, I can sell[ENTER]you a talisman which can help you to avert very[ENTER]bad luck. Are you interested? "},
	{"locale.fortune_words_5_title", "12:AFA121C7", "A bit of misfortune. "},
	{"locale.fortune_words_6_body", "329:EC50C9EE", "Today is a bad day. A day when even doing your[ENTER]best will get you almost nothing. Today, you have[ENTER]'Bad Luck' and have to be careful where you go[ENTER]and what you do. I could, however, help you and[ENTER]sell you a talisman so that you can avoid the[ENTER]worst.[ENTER]Are you interested? "},
	{"locale.fortune_words_6_title", "6:5DCD6146", "Misfortune. "},
	{"locale.fortune_words_7_body", "467:F94BFD98", "This is going to be one of the worst days in your[ENTER]life. All gods in heaven and on earth have turned[ENTER]their backs on you. Nothing is going to work out[ENTER]for you today. If you want to start a fire, it[ENTER]will rain; if you are thirsty, the sun will burn[ENTER]down on you. You will work just as hard as[ENTER]everyone else, but you will not reap any rewards[ENTER]for it. You are going to suffer 'really bad[ENTER]luck'![ENTER]Without a talisman, you will have a tough time.[ENTER]Are you interested in buying one? "},
	{"locale.fortune_words_7_title", "13:D943014C", "Extreme misfortune. "},
