	{"locale.guild.create", "13:20839E06", "Found guild "},
	{"locale.guild.create_confirm", "131:2E0D2E83", "You need a minimum level of 40 to found a guild.[ENTER]You also need 200,000 Yang. Do you want to found[ENTER]a guild? "},
	{"locale.guild.create_confirm_for_china", "279:ACEFB610", "You're here to found a guild?[ENTER]We accept new guilds if the founder has a minimum[ENTER]level of 40 and can provide the Book of[ENTER]Providence. It also costs 200,000 Yang.[ENTER]Do you want to found a guild? "},
	{"locale.guild.create_not_enough_money", "19:74AF0C40", "You don't have enough Yang! "},
	{"locale.guild.disband", "15:EA33FBFA", "Disband guild "},
	{"locale.guild.disband_confirm", "259:C690D8E2", "What?[DELAY value;150] [/DELAY][ENTER][ENTER]I have put a lot of effort into creating it, and[ENTER]now you want to disband it?[ENTER]All the experience and the memories of your[ENTER]friends will be lost forever![ENTER][ENTER]Do you really want to disband it? "},
	{"locale.guild.disband_msg", "65:C5E23F53", "Well then.[ENTER][ENTER]I'm going to disband the guild that you preside[ENTER]over. "},
	{"locale.guild.guild_master_greet", "63:6D8277A8", "Long time no see. How are things at the guild? "},
	{"locale.guild.guild_member_greet", "19:307AD0E8", "Don't you like the guild? "},
	{"locale.guild.no", "4:AEC6064F", "No "},
	{"locale.guild.no_guild_create_item", "77:36A9A267", "If you want to found a guild, you need the Book[ENTER]of Providence "},
	{"locale.guild.noguild_greet", "8:B0F02F83", "What's up? "},
	{"locale.guild.not_enough_leadership", "45:93B5BEF7", "Your level is too low to preside over a guild. "},
	{"locale.guild.war_bet_already", "145:A5C62EA8", "According to my list, you have already bought a[ENTER]betting slip for this guild war. You can only buy[ENTER]one slip per war. "},
	{"locale.guild.war_bet_assume1", "26:15FE0E4E", "It seems that the guild  "},
	{"locale.guild.war_bet_assume2", "22:7FC3C6E4", "will win against the guild with "},
	{"locale.guild.war_bet_assume3", "64:C3405401", "points difference.[ENTER][ENTER]Which guild do you want to put your money on? "},
	{"locale.guild.war_bet_done", "119:BB6A6970", "Everything is ready. If you have made the right[ENTER]choice, you'll be paid as soon as the guild war[ENTER]is over. Good luck! "},
	{"locale.guild.war_bet_info", "421:6CB5A667", "The gamble. Buy betting slips for your kingdom.[ENTER][ENTER]1. For every guild war, there is a pre-announced[ENTER]projection of the possible outcome announcing the[ENTER]potential winners.[ENTER]2. You can buy a betting slip. On the betting[ENTER]slip you can write whether you think that the[ENTER]guild you believe in will achieve the results[ENTER]forecast.[ENTER]3. The choices are determined by the betting[ENTER]booth. After the guild war, you will be informed[ENTER]whether you have won or lost.[ENTER][ENTER]* 10% of the winnings will be paid out to the[ENTER]kingdom. "},
	{"locale.guild.war_bet_list_button", "20:2A651FEB", "The guild war bet "},
	{"locale.guild.war_bet_list_choose", "61:94284A43", "Which guild war do you want to buy a betting slip[ENTER]for? "},
	{"locale.guild.war_bet_list_none", "48:D3F81EAA", "There is no guild war on at the moment that you[ENTER]can bet on. "},
	{"locale.guild.war_bet_no_money", "19:74AF0C40", "You don't have enough Yang with you! "},
	{"locale.guild.war_bet_price", "41:C7453E65", "Good decision! What have you chosen? "},
	{"locale.guild.war_entry_ask_tail", "34:C21325C6", "Do you want to join a war against a guild? "},
	{"locale.guild.war_join_request", "30:F05CAB05", "Ask for permission to join "},
	{"locale.guild.war_list_button", "25:40BA7DF5", "Look at the list of guild wars "},
	{"locale.guild.war_list_choose", "116:991648B2", "The following guild wars are currently underway:[ENTER]If you want to watch, choose one of the[ENTER]participant guilds. "},
	{"locale.guild.war_list_none", "35:26DD376A", "Currently, no guilds are taking part in wars. "},
