	{"locale.monkey_dungeon.no_enter", "11:A47FED03", "Don't enter "},
	{"locale.monkey_dungeon.notice", "249:3A672EAD", "1. When you enter the monkey dungeon, you have to[ENTER]kill the supreme monkey within 20 minutes.[ENTER]2. You cannot use any scrolls to return to the[ENTER]city or to any other place.[ENTER]A lot of people who have not followed these rules[ENTER]have been turned into monkeys, so be careful. "},
	{"locale.monkey_dungeon.quest_rest_time", "15:B7782156", "Remaining time "},
	{"locale.monkey_dungeon.quest_title", "11:2B292D04", "Monkey Dungeon "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1001_1", "29:B2837EEB", "Everyone will die! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1001_2", "9:EB9F77E1", "Small, small, small pieces... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1001_3", "9:C564B6F1", "There is no escape! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1001_4", "19:5D3AE62A", "The floor will be soaked with your blood. Die! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1001_5", "7:BB5012A1", "You can beg, but it won't do you any good! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1001_6", "48:74218E28", "You can't hide your fear from me! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1002_1", "6:82B42C9F", "Death! Death to all people... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1002_2", "8:8F202316", "You miserable pigs! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1002_3", "33:37219BE5", "You're starting to make me angry... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1002_5", "15:DAAF29F7", "There will be blood, human. "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1003_1", "22:35EFAFBA", "Death and Perdition...! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1003_2", "37:5A74523B", "Have you seen the wounds that a spear can rip into your skin? "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1003_3", "28:9520C4BF", "Yes, go on, walk away! We'll see how far you get... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1003_4", "52:4CBDE041", "Just looking at your shaking hands makes this completely worth my while... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1003_5", "18:070B4AB6", "You piece of scum dare to challenge me? "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1003_6", "12:5E56AA3E", "Death will be your only companion in the future! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1004_1", "29:A5F1696A", "Your soul will be mine, human! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1004_2", "14:3078701E", "Ah, fresh blood! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1004_3", "30:32C805CC", "Looks like another person is going to meet his death here! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1004_4", "45:CFA36905", "You should suffer and let out all your anguish... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1004_5", "25:D69ED21B", "Do you really think that that ridiculous weapon in your hand will be able to protect you? "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1004_6", "44:53E3F9EE", "Your courage brought you to me. And now it's going to leave you... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1035_1", "25:EF366023", "If I die, my revenge will follow you for eternity! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1035_2", "20:0F623488", "I will make you die and suffer slowly, very slowly... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1035_3", "25:1AB11D8C", "It will be my pleasure to make you suffer. "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1035_4", "38:B97A6F4B", "Your body is shivering like that of a senile old hag! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1035_5", "22:23E99C5B", "I can smell your fear, little one. "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1035_6", "72:2896D06E", "I think it is time to relieve you of a few of your body parts. "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1036_1", "30:CFC694C1", "I'm going to send you into your own personal hell! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1036_2", "35:A05D84D7", "Your pain will drive you insane, before you die... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1036_3", "9:92C61980", "You can wail! You can beg! But it won't do you any good. "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1036_4", "36:74B84501", "You're going to experience the worst death you can imagine... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1036_6", "48:8297E6CB", "Your power is getting weaker. You are already on the brink of death... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1037_1", "33:22C0ED50", "Are you ready to walk to halls of death for eternity? "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1037_2", "38:234EA686", "You should get used to the idea of greeting eternal darkness... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1037_3", "24:8135EA8D", "Welcome to hell! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1037_4", "30:4F01F5B1", "Scream as much as you like! No one's going to hear you! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1037_5", "32:E1D44A18", "If you think you can kill me like this... you're more naive than I thought! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1037_6", "25:8B6C090B", "Not bad, but it still won't be able to save you from your death. "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1038_1", "11:71B8BC6A", "Take a look around, this is hell! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1038_2", "16:E70C7620", "I'm going peel the skin from your bones. "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1038_3", "34:13EE3106", "I want to hear you whimper before you die. "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1038_4", "41:9D46FD9B", "You know that there's no use hoping, don't you? "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1038_6", "50:D5285166", "No, you're not going to die yet. First I want to know how many sword blows your body can handle... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1039_1", "35:D47D1B6C", "Ah, a volunteer... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1039_2", "35:861FDDB1", "Do you really think that you have even got the smallest chance of escaping? "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1039_3", "42:07327C3A", "It's not the ground that's moving... it's your knees that are shaking with fear! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1039_4", "30:DB08B4F8", "Welcome to the place in which you will seek your death! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1039_5", "27:C79D3222", "I can see the panic in your eyes. "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1039_6", "22:36AD6E23", "Oh, so young and so helpless... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1040_1", "31:7D9F2240", "We can see every little movement you make. "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1040_2", "13:1DDE347E", "In a hurry? Do you really want to die? "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1040_3", "42:EB2D78E6", "Death has already taken its place at your side... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1040_4", "81:A5B9E6C2", "Can you hear my bell chiming? It'll be the last thing you hear! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1040_5", "62:1099EC77", "I smell blood, lots of it... you won't survive much longer... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1040_6", "28:2DD2E0BF", "You can fight... or you can let death embrace you... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1041_1", "25:F3749523", "Why are you here if you want to live? "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1041_2", "23:36249F78", "Ah, new bodies for me to destroy! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1041_3", "46:1DB2F56D", "It was your decision to come here, human! And now you'll have to live with the consequences... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1041_4", "35:C7A673C5", "Our combat strength will never leave us. We cannot die! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1041_5", "40:DD0588A5", "There's no point in attacking us! You're doomed... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1041_6", "36:F4DCC4DC", "Perhaps you will die of exhaustion... or of fear... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1091_1", "45:872A98EB", "You have made it here.... and now I'm going to send you to your death. "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1091_2", "29:1580AD1F", "Sacrifice your soul and become one of us! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1091_3", "28:F4FE9EC2", "Look at you! Weak and slow... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1091_4", "45:2466E7AE", "Your body and your soul are mine! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1091_5", "31:78A97BDD", "Your legs are shaking! Just face it, you're not up to this... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1091_6", "35:7E2253A0", "How much longer will you be able to handle this? "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1093_1", "34:AE0B2E40", "Who could have ever guessed that there is something worse than death? "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1093_2", "27:2FAAF551", "Welcome, death hungry one. "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1093_3", "12:29EAED12", "You will pay for your indiscretion. With your blood and your soul. "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1093_4", "27:437448B5", "After I have destroyed your body, your soul will be mine! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1093_5", "27:053DE70D", "How long do you think you can fight me? "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_1093_6", "46:4883EF94", "You amuse me. Your fear and your haste is very entertaining... "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_1", "54:AD02037B", "Everyone who is worried about their future should listen! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_10", "68:D703449F", "If you want to control the powers of nature and lightning, I recommend the Healing Force training! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_11", "71:2B1E8BEA", "Each warrior has a different way of fighting! Focus on toughening up your body to prepare yourself! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_12", "76:445EEF11", "The strength of the Sura is magic. Work on your intelligence and speed but don't neglect your physical strength! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_13", "63:D44977AE", "Use the skills of the ninja! Focus on speed and physical strength! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_14", "84:C3DD7EE0", "Shamans use regeneration, support- and combat-spells. Intelligence is vital! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_15", "28:CB73955A", "Don't forget that you're in your apprenticeship! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_16", "49:54B5F877", "Become an apprentice if you want to train your skills! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_17", "70:FA338B19", "Skills? You can rise up to the level of a master, which occurs randomly between the levels of 17 and 21! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_18", "90:ED73C479", "Do you want to become a grand master? Then you need a special skill book! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_19", "43:3EEF9507", "As soon as you have finished reading a skill book, it disappears! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_2", "42:46026817", "All warriors up to Level 5 listen to me! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_20", "76:63F022A3", "Do you want to read another skill book again? Then wait a day. "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_21", "70:1547EB0A", "Upgrade your intelligence to improve your Sura skills! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_22", "36:A9910F25", "Experience the mighty powers of a Sura in combat! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_23", "99:B68C5FAB", "Do you know where the temple of the esoteric sect is? It is in the middle of the Valley of Seungryong! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_24", "49:5765C91E", "The spider caves appeared again! They're in the Yongbi desert! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_25", "53:A7B5CCD8", "Finish your missions and use the rewards for upgrading! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_26", "63:38128FB4", "Fishing? Sounds great! Have you already got a fishing pole and a bait with you? "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_27", "123:BDE44328", "You're looking for a bigger hunting challenge? The portal can send you to a hunting place that corresponds to your level! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_28", "79:9965C291", "Beware of enemies from other kingdoms. You never know when they might stab you in the back. "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_29", "113:AAFD241C", "Do you want to reset your skills? Then go to the old lady! Make sure that you bring enough Yang with you! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_3", "59:EAC0A87A", "See the blade-fight teacher for training if you want to become known as a mighty offensive warrior! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_30", "77:C496CC18", "Aim for the master rank! It's the only way you can become a true hero! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_31", "72:61F4D389", "If you want to enter another battlefield or city, look for old people on the continent. "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_4", "73:EE92FE9D", "If you want to be adept with the skills of a warrior, go and learn from the master of the art of war. "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_5", "87:F8BE83E5", "If you want to become a Sura who able to use magic swords, choose weaponry training! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_6", "86:DA424245", "Choose black magic training if you want to become skilled at using black spells! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_7", "81:34BD5D21", "Archery training is reserved for ninjas who have reached level 5! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_8", "65:4378AC4C", "Choose blade-fight training if you want to climb the secret ranks of the Ninjas! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11000_9", "75:FBF76520", "If you want to control battles as the warrior of the Dragon God, choose the Dragon Force training! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11002_1", "47:89783100", "Listen up, all of you who worry about your health! "},
	{"locale.monster_chat_11002_10", "61:E73EF772", "If you want to control the power of nature and lightning, sign up for Healing Force training! "},
