	{"locale.skeleton_gem.accept_ask", "160:CD60834D", "Peddler:[ENTER]Oh, finally! You look like a person who can[ENTER]handle his weapon well. My life is at stake.[ENTER]Please, help me! "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.accept_failure_info_label", "20:9C4FC3F0", "Return to the Peddler. "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.accept_failure_info_text_1", "20:9C4FC3F0", "Return to the Peddler. "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.accept_failure_info_text_2", "66:FC07BB7E", "Tell the Peddler that you could not find the[ENTER]Demon's Gem+. "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.accept_failure_say_1", "20:9C4FC3F0", "Return to the Peddler. "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.accept_failure_say_2", "66:B2072BBF", "I can't find the Demon's Gem+. What on earth am I[ENTER]going to tell the Peddler? "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.accept_success_info_label", "19:BE99FCD8", "Return to the Peddler "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.accept_success_info_text_1", "40:CB318198", "Take the demon gem+ to the peddler. "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.accept_success_info_text_2", "85:0A265884", "You have managed to take the demon's gem+ from[ENTER]the Demon Magician. Return it to the peddler. "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.accept_success_say_1", "28:47CD9C40", "Demon's Gem+ received. "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.accept_success_say_2", "49:AE496E6C", "You have got the Demon's Gem+. Take it to the[ENTER]Peddler. "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.i_dont_have_the_skeleton_gem_yet", "40:7C326E57", "I haven't found the Demon's Gem+ yet. "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.i_have_the_skeleton_gem", "21:4E4974B9", "Here's the Demon Gem+! "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.order_accept", "22:74671989", "I'm going to get it for you! "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.order_accept_answer", "77:07EF920C", "Peddler:[ENTER]Oh, thanks a million. I'll never forget what you[ENTER]did for me! "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.order_get_skeleton_gem_", "27:714F5667", "Look for the demon gem+. "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.order_get_skeleton_gem_text", "67:DEDFE1A8", "Find the demon magician and take the demon gem+[ENTER]from him. "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.order_refuse", "22:439C0AEE", "I think that's too dangerous for me. "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.order_refuse_answer", "152:AB265B8B", "Peddler:[ENTER]I understand your hesitation. Of course it's a[ENTER]difficult and dangerous task! But if things[ENTER]continue like this, it'll be the end of me! "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.order_say", "243:84CA7691", "Peddler:[ENTER]Now everything's over. There's nothing left to[ENTER]do, except to wait for death to come. If the[ENTER]thieves hadn't attacked me, I wouldn't have lost[ENTER]my belongings. Why did that have to happen to me? "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.order_say2", "163:658D18D4", "Peddler:[ENTER]Please help me. If you can get hold of the[ENTER]Demon's gem+ from the Demon Magician, I'll give[ENTER]you a generous reward. "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.order_too_late", "86:868618BF", "Peddler:[ENTER]Someone else has already got it for me. You don't[ENTER]need take care of it any more. "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.start_find_peddler_label", "19:A29B99E8", "Go to the Peddler. "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.start_find_peddler_text_1", "18:51DCF808", "Go to the Peddler "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.start_find_peddler_text_2", "47:7B5E4381", "Go to the peddler and ask him about the demon[ENTER]gem+. "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.start_say", "252:3A5F4DCE", "The Peddler's letter:[ENTER]I don't know what to do any more. The Demon's[ENTER]Gem+ has been stolen. Now I'm ruined, because I[ENTER]spent all my money on it.[ENTER]Could you please help me? I'm really desperate! "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.success_say", "105:41CBCC60", "Peddler:[ENTER]You really managed it? Come into my arms, my[ENTER]beloved stone! Thank you. You can't begin to[ENTER]imagine how relieved I am. "},
	{"locale.skeleton_gem.talk_about_skeleton_gem", "26:FD2EAF54", "Ask about the demon gem+. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.board", "169:6786C617", "The pamphlet reads:[ENTER]We're recruiting brave men and women who are[ENTER]willing to fight for the peace of the kingdom and[ENTER]its people![ENTER][ENTER]Requirement for joining the military: Minimum[ENTER]level 5. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_assassin_1", "422:EAB9B868", "Ninjas are trained here, who can hide well and[ENTER]ambush their enemies. They focus on using daggers[ENTER]and poison. Only Ninjas who are apprentices and[ENTER]are at level 5 and above can participate. When[ENTER]you have reached this level, you receive a[ENTER]recruit letter. If you're ready to sneak around[ENTER]the dark corners of the world as a Ninja, then[ENTER]come and find me. Then we can talk further. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_assassin_2", "332:359F40A8", "Ninjas are trained here, who can hide well and[ENTER]ambush their enemies. They focus on using daggers[ENTER]and poison. If you're ready to sneak around the[ENTER]dark corners of the world as a Ninja, then come[ENTER]and find me. Then we can talk further. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_assassin_3", "501:B15B16C0", "Ninjas who are masters of the bow are trained[ENTER]here. They teach you how to fire a well-aimed[ENTER]volley of arrows at enemies from a long distance.[ENTER]Only Ninjas who are apprentices and have a[ENTER]minimum level of 5 can join the training. As soon[ENTER]as you have reached the appropriate level you[ENTER]will receive a recruit letter. If you're[ENTER]interested in it, come see me. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_assassin_4", "434:A77AB0B8", "Ninjas who are masters of the bow are trained[ENTER]here. For example, they teach you to fire a[ENTER]well-aimed volley of arrows at enemies from[ENTER]long-distance. Follow me. I'll make you the best[ENTER]archer on this continent. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_assassin_5", "110:F6DEF16C", "Choose between Blade-Fight training and Archery[ENTER]training, and you'll get the skills you want. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_shaman_1", "460:984EC961", "This is the place where the Shamans who want to[ENTER]follow the path of the Dragon God meet. They[ENTER]teach you how to use amulets and your mental[ENTER]power, which then allows Shamans to throw their[ENTER]enemies' techniques back at them. It also allows[ENTER]them to increase their own defence value through[ENTER]holy protection and to support befriended[ENTER]warriors. Only Shamans who are apprentices or[ENTER]have a minimum level of 5 can participate. As[ENTER]soon as you have reached this level, you will[ENTER]receive a recruit letter. When you're ready for[ENTER]the teachings of the Dragon Force, then come look[ENTER]for me. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_shaman_2", "324:308E1787", "This is the place where the Shamans who want to[ENTER]follow the path of the Dragon God meet. They[ENTER]teach you how to use amulets and your mental[ENTER]power, which then allows Shamans to throw their[ENTER]enemies' techniques back at them. It also allows[ENTER]them to increase their own defence value through[ENTER]holy protection and to support befriended[ENTER]warriors. Do you think you're ready to spread the[ENTER]teachings of the Dragon God with me? A humble[ENTER]believer is always welcome. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_shaman_3", "344:946DE664", "Shamans worship the forces of nature and light[ENTER]here. They teach skills connected to lightning,[ENTER]storms but also the powers of healing here.[ENTER]Shamans that follow the doctrine of healing often[ENTER]work as a group to help support each other.[ENTER]Only Shamans who are apprentices or have a[ENTER]minimum level of 5 can join in. As soon as you[ENTER]have reached this level, you will receive a[ENTER]recruit letter. I'll be waiting for you. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_shaman_4", "305:4A741B6F", "Shamans worship the forces of nature and light[ENTER]here. They teach skills connected to lightning,[ENTER]storms but also the powers of healing here.[ENTER]Shamans that follow the doctrine of healing often[ENTER]work as a group to help support each other.[ENTER]Do you want work with me to help others? Your[ENTER]support would help all of those who are[ENTER]suffering. Please help me. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_shaman_5", "89:AF3244E3", "Choose between Dragon Force training and Healing[ENTER]Force training, and you'll get the skills you[ENTER]need. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_sura_1", "552:7F881063", "I teach those who have been blessed with the[ENTER]devil's seed how to use their magic abilities.[ENTER]They learn how to enchant swords and armour which[ENTER]increases attack and defence strength. They also[ENTER]learn how to evocate spirits from hell and thus[ENTER]reduce the morale of the enemy. Only Sura who are[ENTER]apprentices or have a minimum level of 5 can take[ENTER]part. As soon as you have reached this level, you[ENTER]will receive a recruit letter. If you're ready to[ENTER]take on your demonic legacy, come here. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_sura_2", "404:CD02004F", "I teach those who have been blessed with the[ENTER]devil's seed how to use their magic abilities.[ENTER]They learn how to enchant swords and armour which[ENTER]increases attack and defence strength. They also[ENTER]learn how to evocate spirits from hell and thus[ENTER]reduce the morale of the enemy. Are you ready to[ENTER]swing enchanted swords and cast dark spells? I[ENTER]can assure you that the power that you find here[ENTER]is certainly looking for people of their own[ENTER]kind. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_sura_3", "459:64CF1DFA", "If you are interested in this place: You will[ENTER]only find those who have dedicated themselves to[ENTER]darkness here. They learn how to deal with[ENTER]spirits, demons and with the flames of hell here.[ENTER]Only Sura who are apprentices or have a minimum[ENTER]level of 5 can do this training. As soon as you[ENTER]have reached appropriate level you will receive a[ENTER]recruit letter. If you call the darkness your[ENTER]home, you will definitely find your brothers and[ENTER]sisters here. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_sura_4", "376:1D7ABC88", "If you are interested in this place: You will[ENTER]only find those who have dedicated themselves to[ENTER]darkness here. They learn how to deal with[ENTER]spirits, demons and with the flames of hell here.[ENTER]If you're interested in making friends with evil[ENTER]spirits who will slowly consume your mind bit by[ENTER]bit, then come with me! Join our order and leave[ENTER]your humanity behind... "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_sura_5", "117:EFAE78F2", "Choose between Black Magic training and Weaponry[ENTER]training and you'll get the skills you need. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_warrior_1", "459:A6AB5A6C", "Do you know where you are? Attackers are trained[ENTER]here, Warriors who are the fastest and the[ENTER]bravest around. Techniques for fast, repeated[ENTER]hits and for skilled attacks are taught here with[ENTER]sword or spear.[ENTER]Only Warriors who are apprentices or have a[ENTER]minimum level of 5 can participate in the[ENTER]training. As soon as you have reached the[ENTER]appropriate level you will receive a recruit[ENTER]letter. If you want to find out the real strength[ENTER]of your body, come with me! "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_warrior_2", "252:97DFA85D", "Do you know where you are? Attackers are trained[ENTER]here, Warriors who are the fastest and the[ENTER]bravest around. Techniques for fast, repeated[ENTER]hits and for skilled attacks are taught here with[ENTER]sword or spear.[ENTER]So what's it going to be? Do you want to train? "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_warrior_3", "422:5D32D347", "I teach Warriors how to focus their Chi properly.[ENTER]This requires a slow, mentally exhausting fight[ENTER]style. However, in return, you will be able to[ENTER]hit several opponents at the same time. And the[ENTER]impenetrable defence of the great mind-warrior is[ENTER]downright legendary. Only Warrior apprentices or[ENTER]Warriors with a minimum level of 5 can[ENTER]participate in the training. As soon as you have[ENTER]reached the required level, you will receive a[ENTER]recruit letter. If you're interested, come see[ENTER]me. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_warrior_4", "332:0FDB9907", "I teach Warriors how to focus their Chi properly.[ENTER]This requires a slow, mentally exhausting fight[ENTER]style. However, in return, you will be able to[ENTER]hit several opponents at the same time. And the[ENTER]impenetrable defence of the great mind-warrior is[ENTER]downright legendary. What's it going to be? Can[ENTER]you deal with the mental battle? "},
	{"locale.skill_group.dialog_warrior_5", "86:A4D67635", "Choose between the Body-Force training and the[ENTER]Mental-Fight training and you will receive the[ENTER]skills you requested. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.invite", "28:9BB51425", "Military's recruitment message: "},
	{"locale.skill_group.lets_join_skill_group_1", "361:20B74D73", "[COLOR r;1|g;0.6|b;0.6]Announcement about Warrior[ENTER]recruitment[/COLOR][ENTER]If you admire the Warrior because of his rapidity[ENTER]and attack power, I recommend the Body-Force[ENTER]training.[ENTER]If you want to become invulnerable and eliminate[ENTER]entire groups of monsters with a single hit, I[ENTER]recommend the Mental-Fight training.[ENTER][ENTER]I'll be waiting for you at the Village Square. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.lets_join_skill_group_2", "312:4E70286B", "[COLOR r;1|g;0.6|b;0.6]Announcement about[ENTER]recruiting Ninjas[/COLOR][ENTER]If you want to make yourself a name as an[ENTER]outstanding archer, then learn archery from the[ENTER]Archery teacher.[ENTER]If you are ready to carry out various secret[ENTER]missions in the shadows of the night as a Ninja,[ENTER]then Blade-Fight is right thing for you.[ENTER][ENTER]I'll be waiting for you at the Village Square. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.lets_join_skill_group_3", "361:110B42CA", "[COLOR r;1|g;0.6|b;0.6]Announcement about[ENTER]recruiting Sura[/COLOR][ENTER]Would you like to become a super human sword[ENTER]master and make your opponents feel the tip of[ENTER]your enchanted blade? Then I recommend that you[ENTER]learn the art of magic weapons. If, you however[ENTER]want to become the intimidating ruler of flames[ENTER]and of curses, then you should learn the art of[ENTER]Black Magic.[ENTER][ENTER]I'll be waiting for you at the Village Square. "},
	{"locale.skill_group.lets_join_skill_group_4", "402:8044A1F5", "[COLOR r;1|g;0.6|b;0.6]Announcement about[ENTER]recruiting Shamans[/COLOR][ENTER]If you want to awaken the powers of the dragon[ENTER]god in your combatants and use his fiery breath[ENTER]against your enemies, then I recommend learning[ENTER]Dragon Force. However if you want to relieve and[ENTER]heal the pain of those that are suffering, then[ENTER]you should look for the the Healing Force[ENTER]Teacher.[ENTER][ENTER]I'll be waiting for you at the Village Square. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.accept_ask", "81:3545BECC", "Oakgu:[ENTER]What, is that it? When I was young, I was able to[ENTER]catch more than ten green frogs! "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.accept_failure_say_1", "15:7368FB72", "Return to Oakgu. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.accept_failure_say_2", "63:D2962A78", "I can't get any green frog meat. What am I going[ENTER]to tell Oakgu? "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.accept_success_info_label", "40:A65A0750", "Take the green frog meat to Oakgu. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.accept_success_info_text_1", "40:A65A0750", "Take the green frog meat to Oakgu. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.accept_success_info_text_2", "98:249A27DA", "Give him the green frog meat, and you can eat the[ENTER]green frog soup soon! "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.accept_success_say_1", "27:1E4C2A96", "I have green frog meat. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.accept_success_say_2", "65:69F1E9E0", "I have green frog meat. I should take it to Oakgu. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.baekgo_accept_failure_info_label", "15:7368FB72", "Return to Oakgu. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.baekgo_accept_failure_info_text_1", "15:7368FB72", "Return to Oakgu. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.baekgo_accept_failure_info_text_2", "66:34667853", "Tell Oakgu that you couldn't find green frog meat. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.butcher.start_say", "325:29414F28", "Old man in the restaurant Suhpyung:[ENTER]My body isn't as useful as it used to be. When I[ENTER]was young, I could work a week straight, and I[ENTER]still had the energy to drink every night! Now,[ENTER]even standing around is hard. In times like[ENTER]these, a bowl of green frog soup seems like a[ENTER]good way of regaining your energy. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.butcher.start_say2", "381:3E566787", "Old Man in the restaurant Suhpyung:[ENTER]You want to know what green frog soup is? If you[ENTER]eat one bowl of this, you'll never be tired[ENTER]again! Even if you worked in the fields for one[ENTER]straight week, you'd still have energy in the[ENTER]evenings! A friend of mine named Oakgu is the[ENTER]best cook for green frog soup I know. However,[ENTER]for some reason, he doesn't make the soup[ENTER]anymore. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.butcher.talk", "9:77289C86", "Talk. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.complete_say", "216:81D6DEA5", "Oakgu:[ENTER]You got it? Don't tell anyone about the green[ENTER]frog soup. Especially not that bastard in the[ENTER]restaurant Suhpyung! This isn't enough; if people[ENTER]hear about the green frog soup, they'll all come[ENTER]here and eat it! "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.food_manager.order_say", "220:25EE36BC", "Oakgu:[ENTER]Green frog soup? Yes! I used to make it. But that[ENTER]was back when I was young. I wasn't afraid of the[ENTER]dangerous monsters, and that's why I was able to[ENTER]hunt green frogs. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.food_manager.order_say2", "265:5FB2AF25", "Oakgu:[ENTER]But now? Now I'm old, and I don't have enough[ENTER]energy for this. I would like to eat green frog[ENTER]soup myself, but green frogs aren't easy to kill.[ENTER]If you got me some green frog meat, I'd be able[ENTER]to make the best green frog soup ever for you! "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.food_manager.talk", "9:77289C86", "Talk. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.food_manager.talk_about_greeenfrog_soup", "24:1EF456EA", "About the green frog soup "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.i_dont_have_the_greeenfrog_meat_yet", "39:7EC16E0B", "I don't have green frog meat yet. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.i_have_the_greenfrog_meat", "27:3629A1B5", "I got the green frog meat! "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.order_accept", "18:7184B3AC", "Okay, I'll get it. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.order_accept_answer", "35:ECA9D296", "Oakgu:[ENTER]Great! Good luck! "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.order_get_greenfrog_general_meat_label", "31:2B5B3DA5", "Get the green frog meat. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.order_get_greenfrog_general_meat_text", "41:B1AC230E", "Hunt green frogs and obtain green frog meat. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.order_refuse", "27:007BC907", "I'm not interested. "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.order_refuse_answer", "102:4936EBCF", "Oakgu:[ENTER]You don't get the chance to eat green frog soup[ENTER]every day! "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.order_too_late", "75:DB34627D", "Oakgu:[ENTER]You don't deserve to eat green frog soup![ENTER]Sayonara! "},
	{"locale.stamina_food.success_say", "202:D725C7D1", "Oakgu:[ENTER]Oha! Good work! Let me start cooking right now![ENTER][DELAY value;1000] [/DELAY][ENTER][ENTER]Here you go! You won't believe how much stamina[ENTER]you're going to have! Ha, ha, ha! "},
	{"locale.stash.beginner_info", "85:DF12581E", "If you haven't changed your password yet, it's[ENTER]still 000000. And don't get confused. "},
	{"locale.stash.buy_silver_and_gold_bar", "29:DE74535C", "Buying Silver or Gold Bars "},
	{"locale.stash.dont_open", "59:91825740", "Oh well, then don't. I don't force anybody to do[ENTER]anything, right? "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge", "17:D03B45D4", "Expand my Storeroom "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_1_complete", "37:78B5AC62", ": I have 30 of them, so I'll[ENTER]take them to the Storekeeper. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_1_counter", "31:696F059B", "remaining bear galls"},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_1_fail_info", "30:28B5F8BA", "Time's up. I have failed. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_1_fail_msg", "113:8F20B3BB", "Why is this taking so long?[ENTER]Your 30 minutes are up.[ENTER]I can't expand your Storeroom this time! "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_1_getone", "25:5EE5060B", "I have got the bear gall! "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_1_info1", "66:2A23712C", "To expand your Storeroom, you need 30 Bear Galls. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_1_info2", "196:C53E8F97", "Can be used for hunting bears to get bear's[ENTER]galls. Kill the fire bears, grey bears. black[ENTER]bears and the Bear God to get bear's gall! "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_1_item", "7:2E19A42C", "Galls "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_1_notyet", "92:8D6F2551", "You don't have 30 yet! Go back and get some more[ENTER]bear galls! "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_1_success", "110:A25EFE36", "You brought me 30 Bear Galls![ENTER][ENTER]I'm going to reward you by expanding your[ENTER]Storeroom. Use it wisely. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_1_take_bear", "33:AC09D7BF", "I have the bear galls with me. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_1_timer", "15:AA1BAFB9", "remaining time "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_1_title", "38:D481A783", "Hunt bears and collect gallbladders! "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_2_again", "62:C80B0B67", "You again? No, I still don't know. You should get[ENTER]the Old Lady's advice. Now go! "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_2_have_mark", "16:CB2344D1", "I have got the symbol. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_2_have_mark2", "82:9F321AE3", "Do you think I'm stupid? That's not the Old[ENTER]Lady's symbol! Did you lose it? I hate liars![ENTER]Now go look for the symbol. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_2_have_mark3", "224:8EF32D1E", "Oh! The old lady gave you her blessing! I told[ENTER]you she would! You're made to be a hero! And who[ENTER]told you that from the start? Yes, the good old[ENTER]Storekeeper! So don't forget to reward me for my[ENTER]services when you're rich and famous.[ENTER][ENTER]I'm going to expand your storeroom by 15 slots. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_2_msg1", "115:11B999D6", "You want me to expand it again? Do I look like a[ENTER]philanthropist?[ENTER][ENTER]On the other hand... You have the face of a hero.[ENTER]Hmm... "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_2_msg2", "152:9EF94984", "Listen: I'm going to give you a recommendation[ENTER]letter, take it to the old lady. She will check[ENTER]you and tell you whether you really have the[ENTER]energy and the volition of a hero running through[ENTER]your veins. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_2_no_mark", "37:1CA45874", "The old lady didn't want to check me. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_2_no_mark2", "137:8CF6AC1E", "Baby face? That's what she said to you? Hahaha![ENTER]Yes, that's just like her! But don't worry, just[ENTER]come back again once you've reached a higher[ENTER]level! "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_2_oldwoman_accept", "160:5D9EE10E", "Hmm, yes... You'll be very successful in the[ENTER]future. Do you best for the kingdom and you will[ENTER]see that it'll be worth it in the end. Here's a[ENTER]token of my appreciation. Take it to the[ENTER]Storekeeper. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_2_oldwoman_greet", "83:E577ACA5", "Aha, a letter of recommendation from the[ENTER]Storekeeper. Well then, let me take a look at[ENTER]your face. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_2_oldwoman_reject", "96:4CB73D7F", "That crazy Storekeeper keeps sending me[ENTER]greenhorns. You're not ready yet! Come back once[ENTER]you've grown up! "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_2_oldwoman_title1", "32:4DCF5BB9", "Talk to the Storekeeper again. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_2_oldwoman_title2", "68:3A95AA17", "Go back to the storekeeper and show him the old[ENTER]woman's symbol. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_2_recommendation", "25:BB82E5FC", "Letter of recommendation from the Storekeeper. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_2_title", "49:01C6F851", "I'm supposed to take this letter of[ENTER]recommendation to the Old Lady. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_3_complete", "31:E6E0779E", "I have eliminated the esoteric sect. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_3_counter", "38:DC63546C", "Members of the esoteric sect left"},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_3_msg1", "196:F2F803DA", "You again![ENTER][ENTER]How about serving the kingdom once more?[ENTER]Somewhere, there's an esoteric sect, following[ENTER]some dark faith.[ENTER]Capture 100 members of this sect and bring them[ENTER]here. You have 30 minutes. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_3_notyet", "53:9F713BAE", "The esoteric sect is still very strong. Give it[ENTER]your best! "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_3_success", "65:CDB64A2F", "Good work![ENTER]I'm going to reward your efforts by expanding[ENTER]your Storeroom. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_3_timer", "15:B7782156", "Remaining time "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_3_title", "74:C0D7443D", "Expand your Storeroom by eliminating the esoteric[ENTER]sect! "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_4_msg", "91:D3E690C8", "You again? You don't ever seem to get enough![ENTER]No, enough is enough. I'm not Father Christmas! "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_first1", "101:7370705A", "You want to expand your Storeroom? Hmm, let me[ENTER]find out how well you serve your kingdom. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_first1_cannot", "286:30FA44B3", "I'm sorry, but I can't do anything for you at the[ENTER]moment. I've expanded so many people's storage[ENTER]spaces that there isn't any space left now. It'll[ENTER]be a while before I can expand my storeroom[ENTER]again. Why don't you just use the space that you[ENTER]have at the moment? "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_first2", "132:980DFD6A", "Is available for 30 bear's galls.[ENTER]You have 30 minutes to bring me the 30 bear's[ENTER]galls. Then, I'll accept you! But you[ENTER]need  "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_no_need", "67:76260103", "Yeah, yeah, only talking to me whenever you need[ENTER]something! "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_try_no", "18:502D46EF", "I'll try again later. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_try_ok", "10:DF7C299F", "I'm going to try. "},
	{"locale.stash.enlarge_try_ok_answer", "45:BDED39F7", "Okay then: See you in 30 minutes! "},
	{"locale.stash.first_open", "373:37DA576B", "Okay, your Storeroom is open. If you want to use[ENTER]it, just let me know. Your password for the[ENTER]Storeroom is currently 000000. You should change[ENTER]it for security reasons. You don't think that 45[ENTER]slots are enough? Well, then you'd better be nice[ENTER]to me and perhaps I'll give you some more space[ENTER]sometime. Ha, ha, ha! "},
	{"locale.stash.gold_bar_beginner_info", "458:34ECFDB6", "Do you know what a Gold Bar is? Of course you do.[ENTER]But do you also know what it's good for?[ENTER][ENTER]It's simple. If you carry a lot of Yang around[ENTER]with you, it's like walking around with a sign[ENTER]saying 'Hello, please kill me and take all my[ENTER]money!' That's why I swap people's Yang for these[ENTER]Gold Bars and store them here for them. Then they[ENTER]also won't get lost.[ENTER][ENTER]Admittedly I demand a little more Yang than the[ENTER]Gold Bars are actually worth. But hey, I need to[ENTER]make a living. There's no need to feel deceived.[ENTER]As you know, it's a dangerous world out there. "},
	{"locale.stash.greet1", "209:4777B980", "Do you want to use the Storeroom?[ENTER]Nothing comes for free and especially not if you[ENTER]want to use the Storeroom. But you're lucky: I'm[ENTER]in a good mood today, so I'm going to offer you[ENTER]my storage space for 500 Yang. So, how about it?[ENTER]Cheap isn't it? Ha, ha, ha! "},
	{"locale.stash.greet2", "11:6CD2ABC9", "Oh, welcome! "},
	{"locale.stash.greet3", "7:D9F67B2D", "Welcome! "},
	{"locale.stash.greet4", "29:65174CFE", "Well, well. Our future hero, eh? "},
	{"locale.stash.nomatter", "19:96F159F1", "Oh, nothing. "},
	{"locale.stash.not_enough_money", "51:4ED7B97B", "What? Not enough Yang?[ENTER]Come back once you have enough. "},
	{"locale.stash.open_mall", "15:86BBA89F", "Open Storeroom "},
	{"locale.stash.pay_no", "9:C1B1D942", "Don't pay "},
	{"locale.stash.pay_ok", "7:E1E12713", "Pay "},
	{"locale.tengold_drop_pct", "34:F2B78517", "Percentage of Yang Tenners dropped. "},
	{"locale.time.days_and_hours", "24:18452F0E", "%d day(s) and %d hour(s) "},
	{"locale.time.hours_and_minutes", "18:E62587AB", "%d hrs. %d min. "},
	{"locale.time.minutes_and_seconds", "18:E62587AB", "%d minute(s) and %d second(s) "},
	{"locale.time.seconds", "8:0788B4D2", "%d second(s) "},
	{"locale.woman_postfix", "8:B8B84CE2", "Woman "},
	{"locale.years_greetings.bless_msg", "111:6B86611D", "You should have more respect for your elders.[ENTER]Nevertheless, I wish you all the best for the new[ENTER]year. "},
	{"locale.years_greetings.chat_greet", "25:10303A21", "Happy New Year! "},
	{"locale.years_greetings.event_info", "255:FCCB6949", "Everyone who bows down in front of me today will[ENTER]receive a small New Year's present, provided that[ENTER]they meet the requirement of being level 15 or[ENTER]higher. I hope you have been raised well and[ENTER]respect your elders and their wisdom? "},
	{"locale.years_greetings.give_msg", "139:D0C09593", "I cannot thank you enough! May the dragon gods[ENTER]bless you. As a token of my appreciation take[ENTER]this bag of Yang. Have a happy new year! "},
	{"locale.years_greetings.greet_msg", "42:DB692182", "Are you here to greet me with a bow? "},
	{"locale.years_greetings.no_money_this_time", "148:C3F08FF3", "I wish you all the best for the coming year.[ENTER]However, you have already received your gift. Did[ENTER]you think that I wouldn't remember you? "},
	{"locale.years_greetings.not_enoguh_inventory", "107:AED6CE80", "Too bad. You don't have any space in your[ENTER]inventory. Come back once you have cleared up. "},
	{"locale.years_greetings.select_1", "34:DF5C7521", "Yes! Good luck in the new year! "},
	{"locale.years_greetings.select_2", "4:AEC6064F", "No "},
	{"locale.years_greetings.select_3", "31:231D3708", "Why is everyone bowing? "},
	{"locale.years_greetings.under_level_15", "285:29D7AD21", "Oh thank you! I wish you the greatest and best of[ENTER]luck for the new year![ENTER]Unfortunately, I don't have a present for you.[ENTER]only those who have already reached level 15 are[ENTER]allowed these gifts. Don't feel too bad about it[ENTER]though, I'm certain the new year has plenty of[ENTER]great things in store for you! "},
	{"locale.yeonnahwan.event_item", "15:58F18394", "Giant Axe+0 "},
	{"locale.yeonnahwan.find_eulduji_label", "13:4B1F2C76", "Find Soon "},
	{"locale.yeonnahwan.find_eulduji_text_1", "13:4B1F2C76", "Find Soon "},
	{"locale.yeonnahwan.find_eulduji_text_2", "112:1D711132", "Find Soon. Listen to his hints about producing[ENTER]the new porcelain and report back to Yonah[ENTER]afterwards. "},
	{"locale.yeonnahwan.find_yeonnahwan_label", "14:59271F2B", "Find Yonah "},
	{"locale.yeonnahwan.find_yeonnahwan_text_1", "24:114CE2AE", "Find Yonah the potter "},
	{"locale.yeonnahwan.find_yeonnahwan_text_2", "51:B4F4ADC8", "Go to Yonah the potter. He has a mission for you. "},
	{"locale.yeonnahwan.kill_unggwi_label", "32:B62F1150", "Collect golden teeth from the Dark Orcs "},
	{"locale.yeonnahwan.kill_unggwi_text_1", "32:B62F1150", "Collect golden teeth from the Dark Orcs. "},
	{"locale.yeonnahwan.kill_unggwi_text_2", "61:18C6C6E7", "Collect golden teeth from Dark Orcs and take them[ENTER]to Yonah. "},
	{"locale.yeonnahwan.report_label", "16:9C143F62", "Return to Yonah "},
	{"locale.yeonnahwan.report_text", "59:6C774131", "Describe the manufacturing of the new porcelain[ENTER]to Yonah. "},
	{"locale.yes", "4:48F9C4CD", "Yes "},
	{"locale.yuhwan.failure_info_label", "24:8FF481AD", "Return to Yu-Hwan the musician. "},
	{"locale.yuhwan.failure_info_text_1", "24:8FF481AD", "Go back to Yu-Hwan the musician. "},
	{"locale.yuhwan.failure_info_text_2", "71:F5F21FF6", "Tell Yu-Hwan the musician that you couldn't find[ENTER]the spider web. "},
	{"locale.yuhwan.find_label", "22:B8DD9791", "Find the musician Yu-Hwan "},
	{"locale.yuhwan.find_text_1", "22:B8DD9791", "Find the musician Yu-Hwan "},
	{"locale.yuhwan.find_text_2", "47:7A5B5CF9", "Find Yu-Hwan the musician and listen to his song. "},
	{"locale.yuhwan.kill_label", "21:FC37B444", "Kill the Claw Spider. "},
	{"locale.yuhwan.kill_text_1", "26:3197B89E", "Capture the claw spider. "},
	{"locale.yuhwan.kill_text_2", "83:E84D44F5", "Go to the Yongbi Desert and kill the Claw Spider.[ENTER]Take her Spider Web and take it to musician[ENTER]Yu-Hwan. "},
	{"locale.yuhwan.success_info_label", "41:64ABDE59", "Give the spider web to Yu-Hwan the musician. "},
	{"locale.yuhwan.success_info_text_1", "41:64ABDE59", "Give the spider web to Yu-Hwan the musician. "},
	{"locale.yuhwan.success_info_text_2", "71:B297A732", "Give the spider web to Yu-Hwan the musician and[ENTER]claim your reward. "},
	{"locale.yuhwan.too_late", "15:83A3A155", "Musician Yu-Hwan: "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._010_sendLetter", "15:403F146A", "Black Matter "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._020_say", "42:ED8EB25D", "Yak-Hwan is looking for you. Please go to him. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._030_say", "160:C0B2090A", "Welcome. Yon-I-Walker has ended his[ENTER]investigations. The phenomenon that you observed[ENTER]in Fireland has been identified as Black Matter. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._040_say", "203:328A974D", "It flows out of the interior of the fortress and[ENTER]alters the demons in the surroundings. The longer[ENTER]the amount of time they are under its influence,[ENTER]the stronger and more aggressive they become. We[ENTER]need to stop this Black Matter from spreading[ENTER]further! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._060_say", "197:3036F65D", "Whilst our alchemist searches for a solution, we[ENTER]shouldn't sit around on our thumbs here. Return[ENTER]to the Fireland and defeat 300 demons in the[ENTER]fortress' surroundings. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._070_say", "12:B8E85D39", "Naturally. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._080_say", "32:209CB74B", "Thank you. Now hurry! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._090_notice", "126:521A0ED6", "Defeat 300 Fireland demons in the fortress[ENTER]surroundings and at the location of the Sun[ENTER]Herbs. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._100_sayTitle", "12:ECDD366C", "Demon Hunt "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._110_say", "89:64C0986D", "Kill 300 Demons near the [ENTER]Fireland Fortress and around the sun herbs"},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._120_say", "128:0EB58E85", "I fear that you have not yet defeated enough[ENTER]demons. Head back into Fireland and keep[ENTER]fighting. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._130_notice", "62:3F5D4CB1", "You have defeated all of the demons.[ENTER]Now report back to Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._140_say", "19:1BCB91E5", "Seek out Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._150_say", "148:49FA1560", "Very good, that should have held up the spread of[ENTER]Black Matter. Relax a little whilst I talk with[ENTER]the alchemist. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._160_sendLetter", "17:6536CC9C", "Nimbus Tincture "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._170_say", "71:AB87C94C", "The alchemist is looking for you. It seems to be[ENTER]urgent! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._180_say", "375:B50BD8B5", "A catastrophe! I told Yak-Hwan to act with care.[ENTER]And what does he go and do? Charges us head first[ENTER]with swords raised into chaos! The Black Matter[ENTER]grows and spreads faster when the host that it[ENTER]has nested in dies. Now I hear that 300 infected[ENTER]demons have already been killed! That is not[ENTER]good... "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._190_say", "170:4608D19A", "Under these conditions, even my Nimbus Tincture,[ENTER]which was supposed to banish the Black Matter,[ENTER]will no longer suffice. I urgently need[ENTER]ingredients to make more of it. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._210_say", "251:EF138D5D", "Bring me 10 Foundation Stones, 50 Bear Galls, 10[ENTER]Spider's Poison Sacks and 200 Energy Fragments.[ENTER]An experienced warrior such as yourself certainly[ENTER]does not need telling where these things can be[ENTER]found, right? "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._220_say", "22:94CAC879", "I'll head out straight away. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._230_say", "116:A8F55C6D", "Very good. Hurry, as with every minute that we do[ENTER]not do anything, the Black Matter is spreading[ENTER]further. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._240_notice", "78:C65FA98C", "Get the ingredients with which the alchemist the[ENTER]Nimbus tincture can make. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._250_say", "21:E11C3586", "Remaining Ingredients "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._260_sayTitle", "17:6536CC9C", "Nimbus Tincture "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._270_say", "169:EAA91AD1", "Locate 10 Foundation Stones, 50 Bear Galls, 10[ENTER]Spider's Poison Sacks and 200 Energy Fragments.[ENTER]Bring these ingredients to the alchemist. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._280_say", "140:D1859DD2", "You have found all of the ingredients! Great, I[ENTER]will get to work. I will call for you as soon as[ENTER]the Nimbus Tincture is finished. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._290_say", "170:F4A83F90", "If we don't stop the Black Matter soon, it looks[ENTER]does not look good for us all. Go, bring me all[ENTER]the ingredients for the Nimbus Tincture! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._300_notice", "76:BCAD1D26", "You have all the necessary ingredients. Return to[ENTER]the alchemist. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._310_say", "23:B4BD2604", "Speak with the alchemist. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._320_sendLetter", "27:EF44A66B", "Stop the Black Matter "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._330_say", "248:11144414", "Such a... hmph... I complained to the blacksmith,[ENTER]because the Foundation Stones have been ground[ENTER]too roughly. And now? He is offended and refuses[ENTER]to convert the rest of the stones into powder.[ENTER]The stubborn mule! Could you talk to him please? "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._340_say", "7:78CB26CD", "Certainly. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._350_say", "97:03D2DB30", "Thank you. Here are the foundation stones. And bring[ENTER]him this basket with treats as apology. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._360_sayTitle", "18:C3D37062", "Calm the Smith "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._370_say", "85:1324AAEC", "Soothe the smith and convince him to grind the[ENTER]Foundation Stones to a fine powder. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._380_say", "40:28F0049D", "Foundation Stone Powder: 1 piece "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._390_say", "78:540C9051", "What can I do for you? Shall I sharpen your sword?Polish your armour? "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._400_say", "169:BEC4F35F", "No, not today. I am here because the alchemist[ENTER]would like to ask for your forgiveness regarding[ENTER]his sharp tongue earlier. He has sent you this[ENTER]basket of treats. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._410_say", "161:6A3E442F", "I am reluctant to do anything for that ungrateful[ENTER]little jerk. But because it is you, I will grind[ENTER]the Foundation Stones. Wait a moment. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._420_say", "10:0A05E06D", "Thank you! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._430_say", "99:38639424", "Is the smith being stubborn? Give him the basket[ENTER]and ask him to help. He won't be able to say no[ENTER]to you. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._440_notice", "72:F55E31F1", "The Foundation Stone Powder is ready. Take it to[ENTER]the alchemist. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv100._450_say", "177:0ED578F1", "Oh, as fine as Baby Powder, excellent! The old[ENTER]door head it is however, hehe. I can now[ENTER]Nimbus tincture mix. Rest a bit.[ENTER]I will call you when it is finished. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._010_sendLetter", "20:4213868A", "Mysterious Fortress "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._020_say", "69:F39688FE", "Yak-Hwan is looking for you. Go to him and find[ENTER]out what he wants. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._030_say", "133:E9687B8B", "The alchemist has already informed me of my[ENTER]mistake. Hopefully it is not too late to fix it. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._040_say", "216:25E5A66D", "I will coat your weapon with Nimbus Tincture. Now[ENTER]if you kill infected demons, the Black Matter[ENTER]inside them will be banished and will not be able[ENTER]to spread. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._050_say", "244:77EFEA27", "Now you can also test yourself in the interior of[ENTER]the mysterious fortress. You already have the[ENTER]Passage Ticket. Perhaps there you will uncover a[ENTER]clue to the Servants of Darkness' scheming and[ENTER]also the remains of my missing scout. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._070_say", "30:669FADEA", "I'll set out on my way immediately. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._080_say", "32:5B9405AB", "Thank you.  I wish you the best. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._090_notice", "203:658DB2CA", "Force your way into the fortress and fight the[ENTER]demons inside.[ENTER]Keep your eyes open for the missing scout and any[ENTER]important clues. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._100_sayTitle", "17:B67ABBCD", "Explore Fort "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._110_say", "144:E7885A46", "Force your way into the fortress and defeat[ENTER]demons in the interior. Look for clues as to the[ENTER]Servants' scheming and for the missing scout! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._120_sayReward", "131:12BB29DF", "You can this dungeon alone not enter.[ENTER]Make a group, to happen may.[ENTER]You take no further pass. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._130_say", "256:B8CB7F57", "Were you already in the fortress interior? There[ENTER]has to be some clues as to the scheming of the[ENTER]Servants of Darkness as well as the remains of my[ENTER]scout! Go back to Fireland and search the[ENTER]fortress. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._140_say", "100:440FA2AD", "The scout is already dead for a while. In his[ENTER]bag you find a letter. Deliver him[ENTER]Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._150_notice", "41:63F0BBF9", "You have discovered Yak-Hwan's scout. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._160_say", "20:62071666", "Have you any news? "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._180_say", "283:2EE64312", "Reading your face makes for bad news... I had[ENTER]feared this already. He was carrying a letter?[ENTER]Show me. There must also be a clue as to the[ENTER]scheming of the Servants of Darkness. Go back and[ENTER]search for it. We'll read the letter later. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._190_notice", "85:0130F7BA", "You have uncovered a Riveted Necklace belonging[ENTER]to the Servants of Darkness. Show it to Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._200_say", "265:0F50A9DD", "Interesting, the Riveted Necklace belongs to the[ENTER]Servants of Darkness. Perhaps it could be a clue[ENTER]as to their scheming! But still no sign of my[ENTER]scout? Please keep looking for him. He has to be[ENTER]in this fortress. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._210_notice", "111:988C235F", "You have discovered the Riveted Necklace as well[ENTER]as the scout. Report back to Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._220_say", "22:59262C0D", "Report to Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._230_say", "217:3D6765B6", "You were successful then! This Riveted Necklace[ENTER]belongs to the Servants of Darkness. It[ENTER]definitely contains a hidden clue as to their[ENTER]plans. And what is that? A letter from my scout?[ENTER]Show me. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._250_say", "112:8A875BA6", "A letter... to leave my scouts[ENTER]has? I am shocked. Let us join his[ENTER]Read last words. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._260_sayTitle", "28:FDBFD1C7", "Hastily written words: "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._270_say", "467:F5C8341E", "Yak-Hwan, I will not return alive, but I hope[ENTER]that this letter will get to you. I have come[ENTER]across a fortress in Fireland that is not marked[ENTER]on any map. Its ruler is a powerful Fireland[ENTER]demon - a unique aura surrounds him just as all[ENTER]the other demons in his following.[ENTER]His roar is deafening and he seems to be guarding[ENTER]something. But what that is, I cannot say.[ENTER]Forgive me, I have failed... "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._280_say", "241:27972C9A", "We have to find out what is being hidden in this[ENTER]fortress.[ENTER]Look here, on the inside of the Riveted Necklace[ENTER]there is an engraving. I will ask Yon-I-Walker[ENTER]for advice. He will be in touch with you should[ENTER]he need your help. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._290_sendLetter", "21:2F9727BF", "Decrypt engraving "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._300_say", "38:96A55CA1", "Yon-I-Walker is looking for you. Go to him. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._310_say", "125:4E039ACC", "Welcome, I have you already awaits. I[ENTER]need something help to decipher the engraving in this[ENTER]spiked collar. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._330_say", "203:69858166", "The characters on the inside of the Riveted[ENTER]Necklace originate from an ancient culture, that[ENTER]existed a long time ago. To decipher them I need[ENTER]Flame King Blood. It flows through his veins as[ENTER]lava. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._340_say", "18:AA48B9FC", "Consider it done. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._350_say", "177:3337FE25", "If you have received the blood, you have to return to me so[ENTER]soon as possible. Because[ENTER]even this vessel can its heat through limited time without loss only for a. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._360_notice", "30:3A6D32BA", "Acquire Flame King Blood. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._370_say", "66:E5FF173E", "We cannot make the engraving legible without[ENTER]Flame King Blood! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._380_notice", "76:B367738A", "You have received Flame King Blood.[ENTER]Return to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._390_say", "28:132F8936", "Talk to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._400_say", "123:6C6FE427", "Ah, very good. With the blood's help I will be[ENTER]able to make the engraving readable. This[ENTER]requires some time. Return again in the morning. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._410_say", "40:1B2B5A95", "Be patient for a few more hours and minutes "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._420_say", "42:FF24EDBB", "I need a bit more time. Come back again later! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._430_sendLetter", "11:92303DA6", "The Engraving "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._440_say", "100:3624A433", "You have come at the right time! I have[ENTER]deciphered the engraving on the Riveted Necklace. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._450_say", "345:2BC80054", "She tells us that the servants of darkness[ENTER]one of the powerful most Flamers sent[ENTER]have to melt the sealing of doors, behind[ENTER]when the six dragon at a hidden place[ENTER]are being held. It is also mentioned an[ENTER]special furnace. I have all held this letter to Yak-Hwan in. Bring [ENTER]it please him! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._470_notice", "47:5F321529", "Bring the letter from Yon-I-Walker yak-hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._480_sayTitle", "18:2FB28BCA", "Post for Yak-Hwan "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._490_say", "47:5F321529", "Bring the letter from Yon-I-Walker yak-hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._500_say", "100:EACD0183", "Was Yon-I-Walker read the engraving? Oh, a[ENTER]letter with all the information about him? Very good, [ENTER]I'll show her! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._510_say", "351:8D70C0B2", "The seal of the six dragons... soso... a[ENTER]magical furnace... aha... In the fortress,[ENTER]that we have discovered, it must be the[ENTER]legendary Rotdrachenfestung! There is[ENTER]one of the dragon be trapped, which must kill the servant[ENTER]to obtain the pearl of the night.[ENTER]I will retire now and consult with my[ENTER]strategists decision on further action. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv101._520_say", "57:FAACBE83", "Kill the flame King and begin his burning blood[ENTER]on. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._010_sendLetter", "16:861C26A6", "Storm the Fortress "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._020_say", "79:25A57124", "Yak-Hwan is looking for you. He wants to let you[ENTER]in on the further planning. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._030_say", "205:27042218", "We have barricaded the Red Dragon Fortress. With[ENTER]this, no more infected demons can get out and we[ENTER]can prevent the continued spread of Black Matter. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._040_say", "186:ABE77A5B", "Your task is now in the fortress[ENTER]invade, so many demons as possible[ENTER]harmless to make and find out whether it[ENTER]is the legendary red dragon is caught. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._050_say", "7:9BB7C771", "Understood. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._060_say", "72:79113993", "Perform 30 demons and bring me as evidence[ENTER]for your daemon claws. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._070_notice", "71:89E9EAFB", "Perform 30 demons and bring yak-hwan as evidence[ENTER]your daemon claws. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._080_sayTitle", "36:3A5B15BC", "Storm the Red Dragon Fortress! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._090_say", "95:8552B53A", "Defeat 30 demons in the Red Dragon Fortress and bring[ENTER]Yak-Hawn your daemon claws as proof. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._100_say", "48:6678BCA2", "Daemon Claw of the piece Daemon Claw of the piece "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._110_say", "52:640ECCDC", "Armour Fragment of the piece Weapon Fragment of the piece "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._120_say", "118:3FADBB2D", "You have not enough demons defeated.[ENTER]to complete a total of 30 pieces and bring me your[ENTER]daemon claws as proof! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._130_notice", "86:56FEF2D0", "You have defeated all of the Ember Flame Demons.[ENTER]Report back to Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._140_say", "21:29167D98", "Go to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._150_say", "89:6C5660CD", "You are back - and from what I can see, you were[ENTER]successful! What can you tell me? "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._170_say", "379:04B08FE6", "A powerful flame demon, you say? That is Razador,[ENTER]Ruler of Fire! If the Servants have sent him,[ENTER]there must be something of great value in the[ENTER]fortress. Perhaps even the legendary red dragon![ENTER]I will talk with my advisers. Here, take this[ENTER]Passage Ticket and look after it. You will need[ENTER]it later. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._190_say", "75:9B228D9B", "Yon-I-Walker is looking for you. Go to him to[ENTER]find out more. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._200_say", "89:4FD306BA", "So you have survived an encounter with the[ENTER]monstrous Razador. I bow with respect. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._220_say", "210:B842BCB5", "Along with the Frost King Alastor, the ruler of[ENTER]fire belongs to the most evil and deadly[ENTER]underworld creatures that humanity is aware of.[ENTER]Razador may himself be the reason for the Black[ENTER]Matter. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._250_say", "351:F4C5D5ED", "This makes him an overwhelming opponent. First[ENTER]defeat the lower ranked demons in the Red Dragon[ENTER]Fortress and gather the Black Matter from their[ENTER]bodies. Ten of them should be sufficient. Perhaps[ENTER]we will find a way to neutralise their power[ENTER]before we then face Razador. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._260_say", "25:DBA3B666", "I'll head out immediately! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._270_notice", "63:B9513256", "Fight the Ember Flame Demons in the Red Dragon[ENTER]Fortress. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._290_say", "116:71961B66", "Storm the Red Dragon Fortress, fight the Ember[ENTER]Flame Demons and gather ten pieces of Black[ENTER]Matter. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._300_sayReward", "87:E053C247", "You require a group and a Passage Ticket to be[ENTER]able to enter the Red Dragon Fortress. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._310_say", "74:ADAF680C", "That is not enough. I need ten pieces of Black[ENTER]Matter for my research. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._320_notice", "82:E5B100EA", "You have gather ten pieces of Black Matter. Take[ENTER]them to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._330_say", "135:04F816F5", "Even the sight of Black Matter makes me shudder![ENTER]Very well, to work... I will call for you when I[ENTER]am successful. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._350_sendLetter", "33:0BA65DBC", "Black Matter Neutralisation "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._360_say", "100:60CF7248", "Good news! I have found out how the power of[ENTER]Black Matter can be neutralised. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._380_say", "239:6F020AAF", "All powers of nature have a counterpart - light[ENTER]and dark, fire and water, good and evil. Even[ENTER]Black Matter has a counterpart, something which[ENTER]has the power to neutralise it: Pure Lumen! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._390_say", "181:9C5A7C66", "To produce Pure Lumen, you need to melt Energy[ENTER]Fragments in Mong Water. Could you gather 50[ENTER]bottles of Mong Water as well as 100 Energy[ENTER]Fragments and then take them to Yu-Hwan? Thank[ENTER]you. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._400_say", "17:C401BF43", "Consider it done! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._410_notice", "99:4CFA936C", "Gather 50 bottles of Mong Water as well as 100[ENTER]Energy Fragments and take them to Yu-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._420_sayTitle", "13:9C37730A", "Pure Lumen "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._430_say", "99:4CFA936C", "Gather 50 bottles of Mong Water as well as 100[ENTER]Energy Fragments and take them to Yu-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._440_say", "194:B33D7ABF", "Woah, Yon-I-Walker had already warned me that you[ENTER]would be coming. Well, let's get to work. Why[ENTER]don't you relax in the meantime? "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._450_say", "194:68FC98E6", "Woah, Yon-I-Walker had already warned me that you[ENTER]would be coming. I'd like to get to work, but the[ENTER]materials are not yet sufficient to produce Pure[ENTER]Lumen. Go out and keep gathering. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._460_notice", "101:23A338B3", "You have enough Mong Water and Energy Fragments.[ENTER]Take them to Yu-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._470_say", "16:4549854D", "Go to Yu-Hwan "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._480_sendLetter", "22:FC19680F", "Deliver the Pure Lumen "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._490_say", "49:C6619975", "Yu-Hwan has produced the Pure Lumen. Go to him. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._500_say", "74:611A2DD3", "There you are! At exactly the right time. The[ENTER]Pure Lumen has just now been finished. Report the[ENTER]news to Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._540_notice", "46:F86F7599", "Return with the pure lumen to yak-hwan back. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._550_say", "66:6FBF7052", "Are you still here? It is very urgent! Bring the pure[ENTER]Lumen to Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._560_say", "59:E2B19D06", "Ah, welcome! You have the pure lumen with thee?[ENTER]Fantastic! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv102._580_say", "135:B36EAB5F", "Impressive. With that we now have an ace in the[ENTER]hole where it comes to the fight for Red Dragon[ENTER]Fortress. Take some time to relax whilst I gather[ENTER]the troops. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._010_sendLetter", "36:A2F40192", "Storm the Red Dragon Fortress "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._020_say", "120:1AC418AF", "Yak-Hwan is calling for you. He will give you the[ENTER]final briefing before you head into battle. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._030_say", "231:96B7ED36", "It is time. The battle has begun. I have send a[ENTER]troop to Red Dragon Fortress. All men are[ENTER]equipped with Pure Lumen. Their wits have become[ENTER]razor sharp. The effect is tremendous! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._040_say", "123:7C97375B", "Follow them and meet them at the Red Dragon Fortress. Look for the Commandant. He will let you in on the plan of attack. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._060_say", "18:56BC2C0B", "Be careful. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._070_notice", "81:CA54D1ED", "Follow them into the Red Dragon Fortress[ENTER]and search the Commandant. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._080_sayTitle", "13:02A3C73F", "To the Fortress! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._090_say", "81:CA54D1ED", "Follow them into the Red Dragon Fortress[ENTER]and search the Commandant. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._100_say", "80:02941DC9", "You are still here? Go, follow my men to the Red[ENTER]Dragon Fortress! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._110_say", "252:F64DD695", "Nice to see you. They spotted us so[ENTER]we have to attack the fortress earlier.[ENTER]Everything was fine until ... RAZADOR[ENTER]we dont had any chance - the whole squad[ENTER]died. I'm the last one. Can you tell Yak-Hwan[ENTER]what happend? Thanks. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._120_say", "68:6423A666", "Report the events in the Red Dragon Fortress to[ENTER]Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._130_say", "48:4491FE04", "You're back already? What... something went wrong?Talk! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._150_say", "125:4724CD50", "The whole battalion fell? Oh, no... this is all[ENTER]my fault. The attack took place too hastily and[ENTER]my men have paid the price with their deaths. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._170_say", "179:9745E91D", "I need to rethink my strategy. There has to be[ENTER]another way to eliminate these demons. Get ready.[ENTER]I will call for you as soon as I have a plan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._180_sendLetter", "14:72E947B7", "Step by Step "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._190_say", "145:978514E9", "Good that you are here. We have decided to attack[ENTER]the demons first and weaken them, before we try[ENTER]to attack Razador again. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._200_say", "288:C677EC89", "While my men stand guard before the gates of the Red Dragon Fortress and finish off every enemy that storms out, you will go inside and fight the Flame Demons within. The Pure Lumen will protect you from the influence of the Black Matter and neutralise its power. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._210_say", "114:1EA6211D", "If you kill, 1000 Firedemon[ENTER]t will be a lot easier to[ENTER]kill Razador. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._220_say", "10:8799830A", "To Arms! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._230_notice", "75:A7FFF230", "Storm the Red Dragon Fortress and defeat 1,000[ENTER]Flame Demons. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._240_sayTitle", "21:1E77CCB8", "Step 1: 1,000 Demons "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._250_say", "75:A7FFF230", "Storm the Red Dragon Fortress and defeat 1,000[ENTER]Flame Demons. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._260_sayReward", "49:794EAA7F", "You need a group and a passage ticket! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._270_say", "102:340A7EA1", "The enemy defence lines are still too strong.[ENTER]Defeat more demons. We are counting on you! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._280_notice", "78:41690624", "You have defeated 1,000 Flame Demons. Report to[ENTER]Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._290_say", "185:1FBECC25", "Good job! The defensiveline from the[ENTER]Firedemons is broke[ENTER]Wait a moment while i talk[ENTER]to my strategist to find out what to do next. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._300_sendLetter", "7:BA724710", "Step 2 "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._310_say", "337:8962AA9E", "It is time for the next step. Now we need to[ENTER]attack the high-ranking demon warriors.[ENTER]Storm into the Red Dragon Fortress once again and[ENTER]defeat 50 each of the Ember Flame Kings, Ember[ENTER]Flame Beards, Ember Flame Trolls, Ember Flame[ENTER]Generals and Ember Flame Chieftains. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._330_notice", "223:6ACBDCA9", "Storm into the Red Dragon Fortress once again and[ENTER]defeat 50 each of the Ember Flame Kings, Ember[ENTER]Flame Beards, Ember Flame Trolls, Ember Flame[ENTER]Generals and Ember Flame Chieftains. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._340_sayTitle", "7:BA724710", "Step 2 "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._350_say", "165:911ACB56", "Its time for the next step. We should[ENTER]attack the higher Firedemon.[ENTER]Visite the Red Dragon Fortress again and[ENTER]kill 50 Ember Flame King,[ENTER]50 Ember Flame Beard, 50 Ember Flame Golem,[ENTER]50 Ember Flame General and 50 Ember Flame Chieftrain. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._360_say", "143:FC819123", "The enemy troops are still too strong.[ENTER]You have yet to defeat enough high-ranking Ember[ENTER]Flame Demons. Return to the fortress and keep[ENTER]fighting! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._370_notice", "90:54833813", "You have defeated the high-ranking Ember Flame[ENTER]Demons. Report to Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._380_say", "237:F50B3FF2", "Fantastic! The ranks of Ember Flame Demons have[ENTER]been weakened and my men can now storm the Red[ENTER]Dragon Fortress. Good work! As soon as I have[ENTER]news, I'll let you know. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._400_say", "249:4C207DA9", "My men are now inside the Red Dragon Fortress and[ENTER]thanks to your preparatory work the losses on our[ENTER]side are within limits. Yon-I-Walker will explain[ENTER]the next part of our strategy to you. Go to him. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._410_notice", "76:CFC35DE4", "Go to Yon-I-Walker and listen to his strategy. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._420_say", "76:CFC35DE4", "Go to Yon-I-Walker and listen to his strategy. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._430_say", "147:EAC27B05", "I have been expecting you. We are close to being[ENTER]able to once again frustrate the plans of the[ENTER]Servants of Darkness. Let me explain what our[ENTER]next step is. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._440_say", "282:5BD04B9A", "Through our spies we have discovered that Razador[ENTER]generates a large part of his power from the[ENTER]Purgatory Fire Metin. He has had this stone[ENTER]brought to the Red Dragon Fortress, where it is[ENTER]heavily guarded. Destroy this Metin! This will[ENTER]make the fight against Razador considerably[ENTER]easier. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._460_say", "185:1EEDD759", "We do not know where exactly the Purgatory Fire[ENTER]Metin is. But it has to be somewhere in this[ENTER]fortress! Once you have attained your goal,[ENTER]report back to Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._480_notice", "76:EAEB9FF1", "Destroy the Purgatory Fire Metin in the Red[ENTER]Dragon Fortress. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._490_sayTitle", "23:FFB449A2", "Purgatory Fire Metin "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._500_say", "75:B0B2D518", "Head out on the hunt for the Purgatory Fire Metin[ENTER]in the Red Dragon Fortress and destroy it. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._510_say", "10:A4DD2054", "Remaining "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._520_say", "134:9C610F68", "We need to destroy the Purgatory Fire Metin, or[ENTER]the fight against Razador will be futile. Go, you[ENTER]can do it! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._530_notice", "76:FAF031AE", "You have destroyed the Purgatory Fire Metin.[ENTER]Report to Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv103._540_say", "209:43DDE22F", "Good job.[ENTER]Now we can fight the Razador[ENTER]Take the pure lumen. I will[ENTER]take some preparations . Chill[ENTER]out. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._010_sendLetter", "18:37A54B7A", "The Fight Against Razador "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._020_say", "45:EF9836CD", "Go to Yak-Hwan and listen to his battle plan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._030_say", "91:13A8C8C6", "The day of triumph is close enough to touch![ENTER]This time we are prepared and we will defeat[ENTER]Razador. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._040_say", "133:C10283D5", "Do you still have the Pure Lumen? Note that its[ENTER]effects only last for an hour. So take it just[ENTER]before the battle begins. To arms! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._050_say", "7:9BB7C771", "Understood. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._060_notice", "62:314574FD", "Storm the Red Dragon Fortress and defeat Razador. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._070_sayTitle", "18:37A54B7A", "The Fight Against Razador "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._080_say", "75:482F2C53", "Charge into the Red Dragon Fortress and defeat[ENTER]Razador, Ruler of Fire. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._090_sayReward", "49:794EAA7F", "You need a group and a pass! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._100_say", "209:2FD82211", "It won't be easy to take on Razador. But we have[ENTER]no other choice if we want to stop the plans of[ENTER]the Servants of the Darkness. Generate new[ENTER]strength and face up to the Ruler of Fire, before[ENTER]it is too late! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._110_say", "248:F5A8D595", "Mortal, heed my words! Enjoy your short-lived[ENTER]view of triumph. It will not last for long. The[ENTER]red dragon will break from his chains. With his[ENTER]power I will return to your pitiful world to[ENTER]complete my task. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._120_notice", "68:2F6B5E4F", "Razador, Ruler of Fire, has been defeated. Report[ENTER]to Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._130_say", "18:9BD821BD", "Return to Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._140_say", "98:612DE776", "What a triumph! Never before has someone managed[ENTER]to get the better of the Ruler of Fire. This[ENTER]truly is a great day. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._160_say", "178:89B7B853", "What do you say? The red dragon will allow[ENTER]Razador to rise again? How is that possible? We[ENTER]know little of the great dragons... but the[ENTER]extent of their power seems to be enormous. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._170_sendLetter", "22:78F026E7", "Thwarting Plans I "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._180_say", "174:6E65D73F", "Bad news! Razador has arisen through the power of[ENTER]the red dragon. His powers have grown as a result[ENTER]and the influence of Black Matter seems to be[ENTER]greater than ever before. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._190_say", "78:C60FD71D", "Talk with Yon-I-Walker. He knows how you can[ENTER]defeat Razador for once and for all. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._200_notice", "77:4D0268A8", "Go to Yon-I-Walker and find out how Razador can[ENTER]be defeated for good. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._210_sayTitle", "28:132F8936", "Talk to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._220_say", "77:4D0268A8", "Go to Yon-I-Walker and find out how Razador can[ENTER]be defeated for good. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._230_say", "111:189F285E", "You haven't been to see Yon-I-Walker yet? How do[ENTER]you propose to defeat Razador?! Go! What are you[ENTER]waiting for! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._240_say", "173:F9A449C4", "Yes, it is true. Razador is back - and even more[ENTER]agitated than ever before. We only have one[ENTER]option to stop the Servants of the Darkness from[ENTER]carrying out their plan... "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._250_say", "141:03E3AB4F", "Razador will not rest before he has completed his[ENTER]task and has freed the red dragon. To stop this,[ENTER]we will have to banish the dragon. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._270_say", "283:E3DC04A3", "The element of the red dragon is the fire ... and[ENTER]Fire is best tackled with - Fire! Each[ENTER]flame daemon has a magma core.[ENTER]Acquire me five cores of the following[ENTER]Monsters: Gluten Flame King, gluten flame beard,[ENTER]gluten flame Golem, gluten flame general and[ENTER]gluten flame Prince "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._280_notice", "44:7730A7DD", "Acquire the magma cores of the Flames Demons. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._290_say", "174:2C594803", "Acquire five magma cores of these opponents:[ENTER]gluten flame king[ENTER]gluten flame Bart[ENTER]gluten flame golem[ENTER]gluten flame general[ENTER]gluten Flame Lord[ENTER]Return to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._300_say", "72:0C1CDA7D", "Oh yes, you've already found some. Bring a few more, then that should be enough. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._310_say", "176:9A94D94C", "Good, now I have all the Magma Rings I require.[ENTER]They need to cool down a little bit so that I can[ENTER]work on them. If I need your help, I will be in[ENTER]touch. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._320_say", "85:94E9F931", "Hmm, these Magma Rings are already cold. I cannot[ENTER]use them anymore. Bring me fresh ones. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._330_sendLetter", "23:E80314A1", "Thwarting Plans II "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._340_say", "38:96A55CA1", "Yon-I-Walker is looking for you. Go to him. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._350_say", "222:1D0DE4C1", "I will need a little bit more time, until the[ENTER]Magma Rings have cooled to the point where they[ENTER]can be worked on. Could you collect me some Dok[ENTER]Water in the meantime? I can then dissolve the[ENTER]Magma Rings in it. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._360_say", "216:FEB9DC5B", "With this Magma suspension we will[ENTER]red dragon banish can. Yak-Hwan will[ENTER]then later on the exact procedure explain.[ENTER]please acquire me now 100 bottles Dok-Wasser.[ENTER]I do here for so long."},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._370_notice", "64:CBC57213", "Find 100 bottles of Dok Water and bring them to[ENTER]Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._380_say", "64:CBC57213", "Find 100 bottles of Dok Water and bring them to[ENTER]Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._390_say", "71:FB28C584", "I now have everything together and can the[ENTER]exile magic manufacture. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._400_say", "28:459146C7", "Soon? Do you need something? "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._410_say", "198:72AE35F1", "I am missing one final ingredient. But I have to[ENTER]concentrate on the melting process. We cannot[ENTER]afford any mistakes! I will be in touch later. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._420_say", "90:82C90A09", "That isn't quite 100 bottles of Dok Water yet.[ENTER]Please bring me more. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._430_notice", "76:FC5813FA", "You have gathered 100 bottles of Dok Water. Now[ENTER]return to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._440_say", "21:29167D98", "Go to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._450_sendLetter", "24:C960A17B", "Thwarting Plans III "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._460_say", "101:AFEC422C", "I keep going with the suspension. But one[ENTER]more time i need your help. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._470_say", "174:3DB9D9D1", "Now I need a suitable container for the[ENTER]exile magic. The Wing Skin Martyaxwars,[ENTER]chieftain of the Manti Kore, should give us good services[ENTER]. Acquire five pieces. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._480_notice", "63:F602CC8F", "Bring Yon-I-Walker five pieces from the wing skin Martyaxwars[ENTER]. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._490_say", "81:ACFDB878", "Bring yon-I-walker five pieces from the wing skin[ENTER]Martyaxwars in good quality. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._500_say", "76:83623CAB", "We are as close to the target - enter now not.[ENTER]Go, bring me the wing skin! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._510_say", "216:1599F876", "Perfect! The Wing skin is very resistant.[ENTER]from it i can now leather bag for the[ENTER]exile magic. Yak-Hwan will[ENTER]later even more brief. But now make[ENTER]I get to work!"},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv104._520_notice", "87:B029747A", "You have all the pieces of wing skin. Take them to[ENTER]yon-I-walker. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._010_sendLetter", "15:2ECEA59A", "Battle Begins "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._020_say", "86:617D7441", "Get ready - the battle is beginning. Yak-Hwan has[ENTER]a final briefing for you. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._030_say", "123:966054C9", "It is time. Our troops are ready. The battle can[ENTER]start. Do you have the Ring of Samael with you? "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._040_say", "17:FE65A22D", "Yes, here they are "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._050_say", "344:726E89C5", "Ah very good. I will explain how you can use it[ENTER]later. But first we need to break through the[ENTER]newly formed flame demon defence lines. Head to[ENTER]the Red Dragon Fortress and defeat:[ENTER]10 Ember Flame Kings[ENTER]10 Ember Flame Beards[ENTER]10 Ember Flame Trolls[ENTER]10 Ember Flame Generals[ENTER]10 Ember Flame Chieftains "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._070_say", "7:9BB7C771", "Understood. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._080_notice", "118:6A71783D", "Defeat each 10 embers Flames kings[ENTER]embers Flames beards, embers Flames Golem,[ENTER]ember Flamesgenerals and embers Flames Sovereigns. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._090_sayTitle", "21:E759A4FB", "Start the offensive"},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._100_say", "36:3A5B15BC", "Storm the Red Dragon Fortress! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._110_sayReward", "49:794EAA7F", "You need a group and a pass! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._120_say", "125:C4A45F6C", "We have not yet been able to break through the[ENTER]enemy defence lines. Defeat all of the required[ENTER]Ember Flame Demons. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._130_notice", "79:0668ED60", "You have defeated the army of Ember Flame Demons.[ENTER]Report to Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._140_say", "18:9BD821BD", "Return to Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._150_say", "130:6DC9612A", "You have done well. We have gotten another step[ENTER]closer to our goal - the red dragon will not be a[ENTER]threat to us for much longer! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._160_sendLetter", "16:87AF19B7", "Favor and resentment "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._170_say", "175:5B65692C", "It seems that your fierce enemy Razador resents[ENTER]you for killing him. His howl echoes over the[ENTER]Plains of Doyyumhwaji louder than ever. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._180_say", "210:91BAC5C9", "It is time to silence him once again. As he[ENTER]stands, with eagle eyes, above the gate behind[ENTER]which the red dragon is held. Be wary of him! He[ENTER]will have learnt from his defeat and will not[ENTER]make the same mistakes twice. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._190_notice", "32:4D041132", "Defeat Razador, Ruler of Fire. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._200_sayTitle", "17:60CF7E9A", "Play with Fire "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._210_say", "66:01446182", "Defeat Razador, Ruler of Fire, in the Red Dragon[ENTER]Fortress. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._220_say", "119:00551E75", "Was Razador too much for you this time? I can[ENTER]hardly believe it! You managed it once - you will[ENTER]manage it this time too! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._230_notice", "49:67192734", "Razador has been defeated. Report back to[ENTER]Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._240_say", "155:1D33E3E8", "I knew you'd do it! Great. Now[ENTER]we will prepare everything for the banishment of the Red Dragon.[ENTER]I'll call you as soon as we are ready. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._250_sendLetter", "26:A581D6C2", "Banishment of Red Dragon "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._260_say", "90:25B8AB3C", "It is time. Everything is ready to banish the red[ENTER]dragon. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._270_say", "221:09F64C16", "My men have already been erected two spell circles.[ENTER]Your task now is to ignite it to.[ENTER]Throw the bag spell on the circles and[ENTER]they will ignite. This will make the[ENTER]banishment of Red Dragon. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._280_notice", "69:CFF6A98A", "Light the spell circles and send the Red Dragon[ENTER]into exile. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._290_say", "28:50435974", "Mount of banishement "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._300_sayTitle", "26:A581D6C2", "Banishment of Red Dragon "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._310_say", "105:5AE81A06", "Kindle using the spell bag the magic[ENTER]circle symbols and send the Red Dragon in the[ENTER]banishment. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._320_say", "28:7FB3F3A5", "Gravestone of Taramor: 1 piece "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._330_sayTitle", "29:5F281A08", "Red Dragon flame experience "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._340_say", "228:A7CADD86", "Was it everything you worm?! This has more than[ENTER]tickled - you'll banish me not so[ENTER]I'm going to get Razador from the realm of the dead![ENTER]Then he will release the seal[ENTER]and finally free me from captivity.[ENTER]There is nothing you can do about it! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._350_notice", "72:62FE0784", "The banishment of the Red Dragon has failed.[ENTER]Report back Yak-Hwan report. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._360_say", "59:F3233F6F", "The exile has failed? How could this happen? "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._370_say", "350:B73514AC", "Yes. Actually the spell circles have been activated and[ENTER]the ignition has taken place and the[ENTER]exile had begun, but the red dragon was[ENTER]so powerful that it has failed. He[ENTER]said that he will resurrect Yamachun (6091)[ENTER]and he will remove the seal. But he[ENTER]also great harm by our[ENTER]has suffered the mount of banishement. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv105._380_say", "397:DDA5D12A", "Oh. Good work. Thanks to you, we could take it as[ENTER]far. I already have with Yon-I-Walker[ENTER](20380) talked and thought about what we do now[ENTER]can. My men are still the situation[ENTER]watching and we are looking ach other methods[ENTER]how we can accomplish the banishment.[ENTER]If we have a perfect Methoe found the[ENTER]to banish Red Dragon, I will post  call you[ENTER]blank. Good work! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._010_sendLetter", "25:B39F198F", "Run into the Fire "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._020_say", "69:F39688FE", "Yak-Hwan is looking for you. Go to him and find[ENTER]out what he wants. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._030_say", "159:7ACCCCC9", "Welcome back! We should have been granted even[ENTER]just the smallest of breaks - the Servants of[ENTER]Darkness are back in action. That cannot be good. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._050_say", "119:A83D6E9D", "However, my information is very vague. All we[ENTER]know is that they are holed up in Fireland. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._060_say", "188:E7AA1E80", "We have already sent out a scout. But recently he[ENTER]broke off contact with us and I am very[ENTER]concerned.[ENTER]Can you take a look for him on your way to[ENTER]Fireland? "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._070_say", "12:B8E85D39", "Of course. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._080_say", "81:E9A6E1F2", "Thanks. I'll mark his last known location on the[ENTER]map for you. Good luck! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._090_notice", "73:5A0F465B", "Take a look around Fireland for the missing scout.[ENTER]Coordinates: %d,%d "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._100_sayTitle", "23:30A167CB", "Explore Fireland! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._110_say", "117:A7494275", "Travel to Fireland. Search for the scout there[ENTER]and any clues as to the scheming of the Servants[ENTER]of Darkness. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._120_say", "82:91365335", "There must be something at this location. Perhaps[ENTER]you overlooked a clue. Keep searching. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._130_notice", "106:BF3C3F4F", "This is the place, the Yak-Hwan has marked on the map.[ENTER]Look around and then go back to[ENTER]Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._140_say", "51:F5DFCA34", "Yak-Hwan is waiting on Dark Dragon Rock for your[ENTER]report. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._150_say", "51:EDF389C9", "You're back! Have you uncovered anything? "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._160_say", "202:3018EEF5", "Unfortunately there was no trace of the scout.[ENTER]But there was a fortress there, that I hadn't[ENTER]noticed before. A powerful aura flows out from[ENTER]within the walls and is affecting the[ENTER]surroundings. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._170_say", "115:BADF3719", "Hmm, I do not like that at all. I will find out[ENTER]more about this fortress and then get back in[ENTER]touch with you. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._180_sendLetter", "16:90DF7DB7", "Investigate the Fortress "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._190_say", "241:D9316A6B", "Hm, we are in the dark. I have pure even[ENTER]nothing about this mysterious fortress[ENTER]to find out. In this letter, I have[ENTER]everything put together, what we know so far.[ENTER]Please bring him Yon-I-Walker. He will know,[ENTER]what is to do."},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._200_say", "21:29167D98", "Go to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._210_say", "140:9417F12B", "What can I do for you?... Ah, a letter.[ENTER]Yak-Hwan therefore asking for my help. Then[ENTER]Let's try to bring light into the darkness. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._240_say", "413:9127674B", "A mysterious aura, which flows a fortress from the inside?[ENTER]Interesting...[ENTER]Look around first of all in the immediate[ENTER]around there to. I've got a suspicion[ENTER]what it could be in this Aura.[ENTER]Here, take this paper and wrap it around your[ENTER]weapon. If confirmed my suspicions,[ENTER]should be the paper turn black when you order[ENTER]demons kill who are under the influence of the dark aura. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._250_notice", "42:040D8E4E", "Defeat demons that are roaming around the[ENTER]fortress. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._260_sayTitle", "15:0FDB7215", "Demon Hunt "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._270_say", "120:9A75292B", "Defeat Fireland demons that are roaming around in[ENTER]the vicinity of the fortress and check to see if[ENTER]your weapon colours. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._280_say", "202:7A52C1BF", "Hmm, I am certain that there is evidence of this[ENTER]aura to be found in Fireland. Return back there[ENTER]once more and defeat demons, that are in close[ENTER]proximity to this fortress. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._290_notice", "78:6CF92EAB", "Your weapon has coloured black. Return back to[ENTER]Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._300_say", "131:E614888A", "Ah, just as I had expected! This is highly[ENTER]remarkable. I will examine this paper a little closer.[ENTER]Calm yourself from long. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._310_sendLetter", "16:3A61EF5C", "Explore Aura "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._320_say", "75:9B228D9B", "Yon-I-Walker is looking for you. Go to him to[ENTER]find out more. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._330_say", "169:2F31084D", "Ah, there you are! The aura is treacherous and is[ENTER]clouding my mind.[ENTER]I need Sun Herbs to lighten my mind and to[ENTER]continue my investigations. Can you get me some? "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._340_say", "12:B8E85D39", "Of course. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._350_say", "279:D08B0059", "The Sun Herbs grow in hot, dry locations - they[ENTER]can be found in Fireland all year round. I'll[ENTER]mark the last location I found some on the map.[ENTER]Although I'm not entirely certain that was the[ENTER]actual location... "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._360_say", "25:DBA3B666", "I'll head out immediately! "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._370_notice", "79:C354A2F2", "Go to the marked location in Fireland and search[ENTER]for Sun Herbs. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._380_sayTitle", "23:4B258139", "Get Sunherbs "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._390_say", "88:95AADAC3", "Go to the location that Yon-I-Walker has marked[ENTER]on the map and search there for Sun Herbs. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._400_say", "178:CCA9AA3E", "You return with empty hands? That is not good. I[ENTER]feel as if my mind is getting more and more[ENTER]clouded by the aura. Please get me some Sun[ENTER]Herbs. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._410_notice", "72:EF53073B", "You have found the Sun Herbs. Take them to[ENTER]Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._420_say", "136:B176014F", "Ah, you have found the Sun Herbs![ENTER]Excellent. Now I can continue my investigations.[ENTER]Yak-Hwan will let you know about the results. "},
	{"main_quest_flame_lv99._430_say", "67:537413D2", "The adventure continues as soon as you have[ENTER]reached level %d. "},
	{"main_quest_lv1._10_sendLetter", "29:B3244A58", "Welcome to Metin2 SinglePlayer"},
	{"main_quest_lv1._20_say", "496:F1140BAA", "The exciting adventures in Metin2 SinglePlayer are[ENTER]only just beginning. To start with, you will get[ENTER]some basic information and various tasks from the[ENTER]City Guard. Please go to him, he is already[ENTER]waiting for you.[ENTER][ENTER]If you want to go hunting, you will find some wild[ENTER]animals outside the village. They are marked in[ENTER]red on the minimap. At first you should hunt the[ENTER]easiest animals, e.g. Wild Dogs.[ENTER]Good luck! "},
	{"main_quest_lv1._30_targetVid", "28:CA588AFC", "Find the City Guard "},
	{"main_quest_lv1._40_sayTitle", "28:CA588AFC", "Find the City Guard "},
	{"main_quest_lv1._50_sayReward", "193:326DDB44", "Talk to the City Guard by clicking on him. He's[ENTER]the NPC that the arrow is pointing at. If you[ENTER]can't see him, you might be too far away. Follow[ENTER]the blinking circles on the map until you reach[ENTER]the City Guard. "},
	{"main_quest_lv1._60_sayTitle", "18:357A1BC5", "City Guard: "},
	{"main_quest_lv1._70_say", "323:258ECF8D", "You must be new in town! I see they haven't made[ENTER]you a soldier yet. Have you had any training at[ENTER]all yet? Look at yourself! Have you ever even[ENTER]used a weapon? Listen up! You have to be careful[ENTER]if you want to survive this war. I'm going to[ENTER]assist you until you have reached level 10. And[ENTER]don't be fooled into thinking that it's going to[ENTER]be easy! Now move! "},
	{"main_quest_lv1._80_say", "226:C8DA3BCB", "Now go and learn some basics for combat and[ENTER]hunting! Once you have reached a higher level,[ENTER]return to the village and talk to me again. Why[ENTER]are you still standing here? You won't get[ENTER]experience by just standing around! "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._100_sayReward", "153:124603B2", "You have received 50,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 12,000 Yang.[ENTER]You have received some Gold Threaded Shoes+4.[ENTER]You have received 5 Purple Potions. "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._10_sendLetter", "17:E82B8840", "Go to the Captain "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._110_sayTitle", "17:A14CC9E2", "The Captain's training "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._120_sayReward", "164:4C64621D", "The Captain's first mission takes you to the[ENTER]neighbouring village. There you should visit the[ENTER]musician Yu-Hwan and ask for the secret documents[ENTER]for the Captain. "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._130_sayTitle", "15:83A3A155", "Musician Yu-Hwan: "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._140_say", "191:AA7E5DC6", "Life is a dream, just like everything else. Where[ENTER]do we come from and where do we go? The world is[ENTER]full of conflict. Honest work never pays off...[ENTER]Are you here to listen to my song? "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._150_say", "324:B0E9C1C6", "Oh, the Captain sent you! Psst, lower your[ENTER]voice... Nobody in the village can find out my[ENTER]true identity. Here, take this. This document[ENTER]contains all the important information that I was[ENTER]able to find out. Take it to the Captain. "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._160_sayTitle", "15:83A3A155", "Musician Yu-Hwan: "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._170_say", "183:E2241C4E", "Hurry up and leave! If you stand around here for[ENTER]too long, something bad will happen. Remember:[ENTER]Life is short, so enjoy for as long as you can. "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._180_targetVid", "18:C34018F3", "Return to the Captain "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._190_sayReward", "130:1955EB79", "The musician Yu-Hwan who secretly works as a spy[ENTER]has given you important documents.[ENTER]Take them to the Captain in the first village. "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._200_say", "215:B84FD044", "This is the document from the musician? Not bad[ENTER]for a new adventurer! I expect great things of[ENTER]you. Take this as a reward for your work. Keep up[ENTER]the good work for your country! "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._20_sayReward", "242:05E9CEAF", "You have gathered enough experience to be able to[ENTER]serve your kingdom as a fully fledged warrior.[ENTER]From now on, the Captain will give you your[ENTER]assignments. You will find him in the first[ENTER]village. Don't take too long. "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._30_sayTitle", "8:C329F351", "Captain "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._40_say", "247:BF6BCB95", "You look familiar.... Oh yes, I think I have[ENTER]heard of you. You're the new adventurer and you[ENTER]have done well in proving your skills. I don't[ENTER]know yet exactly how skilled you are, but you're[ENTER]going to be tested in future assignments. "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._50_say", "243:C09ACCAE", "There are challenges ahead, so get prepared for[ENTER]them. Do you know the story of the three[ENTER]kingdoms? Or the story of the continent Lightning[ENTER]Heaven? You don't know it!? What do the[ENTER]instructors teach these days? Do I really have to[ENTER]teach you such fundamental stuff? "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._60_say", "304:18548113", "This is important, as it is the history of the[ENTER]continent. So I'm going to summarise it for you.[ENTER]Once upon a time, the kingdom was united. But[ENTER]then the Metin Stones came down and brought war[ENTER]and conflict. The continent was divided into[ENTER]three individual countries: Shinsoo is the[ENTER]kingdom of trade, Chunjo is the kingdom of[ENTER]religion and Jinno is the kingdom of military. "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._70_say", "284:FA0648C5", "Every kingdom is desperately trying to recover[ENTER]from the uprisings that came about after the[ENTER]Metin Stones came down. A lot of people want the[ENTER]continent to be reunified. You should also fight[ENTER]for it! Never forget that. "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._80_say", "336:DD8522AB", "I'm going to give you your first assignment.[ENTER]Relax, it's an easy one. In the next village, you[ENTER]will find a musician called Yu-Hwan. People say[ENTER]that he quit the army to become a musician.[ENTER]But really, he's a secret spy, who gets hold of[ENTER]secret documents. There's a document that I need[ENTER]from him. Bring it to me. And don't forget that[ENTER]this is a secret mission. "},
	{"main_quest_lv10._90_say", "207:0C804AA8", "Press the M key to figure out how to get to the[ENTER]next village on the map. Use the warp portal[ENTER]indicated by the corresponding village name.[ENTER]Hurry up! Yu-Hwan is very tall - but you'll be[ENTER]able to recognise him by the instruments he has[ENTER]with him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._100_sayTitle", "23:7E281183", "Kill Alpha Grey Wolves "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._10_sayReward", "77:A595FF7A", "The Captain has a new assignment for you. Go talk[ENTER]to him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._110_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._120_say", "137:41C14F60", "So you made it? Well done! You did not have too[ENTER]much trouble, I hope? Anyway, let's move on to[ENTER]the next step. "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._130_targetVid", "16:D5305923", "Find the Captain "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._140_sendLetter", "18:72ECCC9D", "Task completed "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._150_say", "18:72ECCC9D", "Task completed "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._160_sayReward", "103:C3949BA5", "You have killed the required number of Alpha Grey[ENTER]Wolves. Now go back to the Captain and report[ENTER]your success. "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._170_say", "193:2B4D95E9", "Did you kill the Alpha Grey Wolves? Good work.[ENTER]Thanks to you, it's a lot easier to keep the[ENTER]village safe now. That's really good news for a[ENTER]change in times of war like these. "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._180_sayReward", "109:13F3DA0F", "You have received 40,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 10,000 Yang.[ENTER]You have received a Skill Book. "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._20_say", "300:13FF13CB", "Several Alpha Grey Wolves have been causing[ENTER]mayhem just outside the village. They have been[ENTER]running wild for a while, but now their behaviour[ENTER]is getting completely out of hand! They have[ENTER]started attacking the village and the people on[ENTER]the streets. To regain control of the situation,[ENTER]we have to kill some Alpha Grey Wolves. Could you[ENTER]help? Eliminate 10 Alpha Grey Wolves for us. "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._30_sayReward", "71:CCD6C0D9", "You will receive 24,000 experience points and[ENTER]3,500 Yang in reward. "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._40_sendLetter", "29:FEAD3A39", "Kill 10 Alpha Grey Wolves "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._50_sayReward", "116:9FB33739", "The Alpha Grey Wolves are attacking the village.[ENTER]To get the situation under control, you have to[ENTER]kill 10 of them. "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._60_sayReward", "44:FCE0F9D2", "So far, you have killed %s Alpha Grey Wolves. "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._65_counter", "16:613B44F0", "Remaining number"},
	{"main_quest_lv12._70_sayReward", "60:3109F769", "You have killed all 10 Alpha Grey Wolves. Return[ENTER]to the Captain. "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._80_npcChat", "23:7E281183", "Kill Alpha Grey Wolves "},
	{"main_quest_lv12._90_say", "123:AE3FC640", "What, you still haven't finished the task?[ENTER]Are you having trouble killing 10 Alpha Grey[ENTER]Wolves? If you want to keep fighting for your[ENTER]kingdom you should keep trying. "},
	{"main_quest_lv14._100_sayTitle", "18:72ECCC9D", "Task completed "},
	{"main_quest_lv14._10_sayReward", "61:362FF524", "The Captain has a new task for you. Go talk to[ENTER]him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv14._110_sayReward", "84:2690BB3E", "You have destroyed a Metin of Battle. Go to the[ENTER]Captain and tell him of your success. "},
	{"main_quest_lv14._120_say", "196:A5C35597", "Nice work! You've become a very reliable helper![ENTER]Now I know I can trust you with any assignment.[ENTER]I'm proud to have you working with us. Here is[ENTER]your reward and keep up the good work! "},
	{"main_quest_lv14._130_sayReward", "101:1B50BD95", "You have received 20,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 20,000 Yang.[ENTER]You have received a Lump of Gold. "},
	{"main_quest_lv14._140_sayReward", "20:E68BBD37", "You have received a %s. "},
	{"main_quest_lv14._20_say", "190:9A17ED6C", "I know about the dark energy of the Metin stones.[ENTER]The musician Yu-Hwan told me that the Metin[ENTER]stones make the animals go berserk and spread[ENTER]terrible diseases. "},
	{"main_quest_lv14._30_say", "219:AC67388C", "If we don't do anything about the Metin stones,[ENTER]the animals will attack the villagers again or[ENTER]worse; a disease might break out! Could you take[ENTER]care of the stones that have landed outside the[ENTER]village? "},
	{"main_quest_lv14._40_sayReward", "30:CDE7719C", "Plus a Spirit Stone (+0 to +2). "},
	{"main_quest_lv14._50_sendLetter", "20:C63BCA05", "Destroy the Metin of Battle "},
	{"main_quest_lv14._60_sayReward", "103:E7656C76", "The Metin Stones are a serious danger. Help the[ENTER]Captain and destroy a Metin of Battle. "},
	{"main_quest_lv14._70_sayTitle", "18:72ECCC9D", "Task completed "},
	{"main_quest_lv14._80_sayReward", "56:57C1EAD7", "You have destroyed the Metin of Battle. Talk to[ENTER]the Captain. "},
	{"main_quest_lv14._90_sendLetter", "18:C34018F3", "Return to the Captain "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._100_say", "279:A8AEB015", "Our kingdom, Jinno, has always been a strong[ENTER]military power. The emperor unified the continent[ENTER]with his powerful and tried and tested cavalry.[ENTER]Even though we are now divided due to the riots[ENTER]that the Metin Stones caused, our kingdom still[ENTER]rightfully owns the power of Iryung. "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._10_qSetTitle", "18:99DB7FBD", "The current situation "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._110_say", "312:5E67F8AE", "We still have the most powerful army of the three[ENTER]kingdoms, even though there is nothing we can do[ENTER]about the Metin stones right now. If we really[ENTER]wanted to, we could easily conquer the other[ENTER]kingdoms. You should train hard to become a good[ENTER]soldier! "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._120_say", "265:BA4A955A", "I'm going to give you a new assignment. Take this[ENTER]ammunition to Yu-Hwan in the neighbouring[ENTER]village. We store this munition in several places[ENTER]for extra security, so that we can quickly access[ENTER]it in an emergency. If you deliver this to[ENTER]Yu-Hwan, you'll be helping to arm the village. "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._130_sayReward", "98:A187C3B0", "You have received 36,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 10,000 Yang.[ENTER]You have received an Ornament. "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._140_sayTitle", "18:99DB7FBD", "The current situation "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._150_sayReward", "95:11314FFB", "The Captain has entrusted you with a delivery for[ENTER]Yu-Hwan. Take to him in the Second Village. "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._160_say", "293:DAA12EC4", "Once upon a time, there was a bloody battle[ENTER]between Sung Mahi and the Dragon God. Since then,[ENTER]the people have been divided and are competing[ENTER]against each other in never ending wars... You[ENTER]again! Do you need something? The Captain has[ENTER]sent me something important? Thanks. And now be[ENTER]on your way again - it's not good if people see[ENTER]us together. "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._170_makequestbutton", "25:078AFFEA", "Talk to the Captain "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._175_say", "99:C0E321BC", "You have given Yu-Hwan the Captain's delivery.[ENTER]Now go back to the Captain and pick up your[ENTER]reward. "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._180_say", "132:50DE3CFD", "Well done! If you carry on like this, you could[ENTER]become a really important helper for our village.[ENTER]Here is your reward. "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._20_say", "126:24C03AF6", "As you may have heard, the peace situation[ENTER]between kingdoms isn't good at the moment. Go to[ENTER]the Captain, he can give you more information. "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._30_say", "215:104E865F", "I think you should find out more about our[ENTER]current situation. Direct your attention to our[ENTER]kingdom first. To win a war, you need to know[ENTER]yourself before you get to know your enemies. "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._40_say", "475:5FA64C11", "Our kingdom, Shinsoo, has always been a centre of[ENTER]trade. Our extensive trade routes brought loads[ENTER]of merchants and goods over to us from all over[ENTER]the world. But since the Metin Stones came down,[ENTER]these relations have broken down and our economy[ENTER]has got much worse. We were prosperous once, but[ENTER]we never had much military power, which is why we[ENTER]have hired some mercenaries. These fighters are[ENTER]very reliable and loyal to those who pay them. "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._50_say", "211:34954A7D", "Thanks to the mercenaries, our country has[ENTER]regained its stability. But to be prepared for[ENTER]future wars, we need more mercenaries and a[ENTER]strong economy. This isn't going to be easy for[ENTER]any of us. "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._60_say", "260:C59954AF", "I have another task for you. Take this speciality[ENTER]to Yu-Hwan, who lives in the neighbouring[ENTER]village. Our country was and still is a kingdom[ENTER]of commerce and so we trade with different[ENTER]specialities from different regions. The returns[ENTER]we get from it benefit the village. "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._70_say", "476:72B99C45", "Our kingdom, Chunjo, is ruled by governor[ENTER]Yoon-Young and was founded on strong religious[ENTER]beliefs. Because of this, we knew about the[ENTER]presence of Sung Mahi long before anyone else[ENTER]did. Our Shamans prepared us for the appearance[ENTER]of the Metin Stones. Without them, the protection[ENTER]of our country would never have been secured.[ENTER]Their belief gives them skills that normal humans[ENTER]will never have. And without the Shamans it would[ENTER]only be a matter of time until another country[ENTER]defeated us. "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._80_say", "291:060BED49", "The people of our country have a very strong[ENTER]faith and pray to the Dragon God every day. The[ENTER]benevolent Dragon God is protecting us from the[ENTER]resurrection of Sung Mahi. With his help we are[ENTER]going to keep defending ourselves from these[ENTER]barbaric attacks and reunite the empire under our[ENTER]control. "},
	{"main_quest_lv15._90_say", "293:F4C5B2B1", "I'm going to give you a new assignment. Deliver[ENTER]this stone statue of the Dragon God to Yu-Hwan in[ENTER]the neighbouring village. Religion and our deep[ENTER]faith in the Dragon God are very important to our[ENTER]kingdom. If you deliver this to Yu-Hwan, you will[ENTER]be doing the villagers a big favour. "},
	{"main_quest_lv16._100_sayReward", "97:83462CA8", "You have received 3,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 5,000 Yang.[ENTER]You have received some Wolf Fur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv16._10_sendLetter", "17:8A5FA135", "Capture the spy "},
	{"main_quest_lv16._20_sayTitle", "17:8A5FA135", "Capture the spy "},
	{"main_quest_lv16._30_sayReward", "89:964146CA", "there is an enemy spy in our village. The Captain[ENTER]will give you more information about it. "},
	{"main_quest_lv16._40_say", "298:935155A4", "I have a feeling that we have a spy in our midst.[ENTER]Someone from the villagers' ranks is in collusion[ENTER]with the White Oath Soldiers. I need your help in[ENTER]this matter: Go and kill White Oath Soldiers,[ENTER]perhaps you'll be able to find some information[ENTER]about the spy. "},
	{"main_quest_lv16._50_sayReward", "81:83AAE74B", "You will receive 100,000 experience points and[ENTER]5,000 Yang in reward. "},
	{"main_quest_lv16._60_sendLetter", "18:4DF6CCAB", "Expose the spy "},
	{"main_quest_lv16._70_sayReward", "175:7C8FA090", "The Captain suspects a spy in the White Oath[ENTER]Village. Kill White Oath Soldiers until you find[ENTER]some evidence of the spy. "},
	{"main_quest_lv16._75_say", "39:2C328944", "You've found a letter.[ENTER]Take it to the Captain. "},
	{"main_quest_lv16._80_sayReward", "179:3FB6FCAC", "You have found a Letter with the White Oath[ENTER]Soldiers. Maybe this is the evidence of the Spy[ENTER]the Captain is looking for. Take the letter to[ENTER]the Captain. "},
	{"main_quest_lv16._90_say", "314:763A6ECC", "Did you find any evidence? A Letter? Let me take[ENTER]a look... It could be enough to find out who the[ENTER]spy is. Thanks to you we should be able to get[ENTER]rid of this problem. Well done! You should have a[ENTER]rest. Take this as a token of my gratitude. "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._100_sendLetter", "18:F0435DF5", "First exercise: "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._10_npcChat", "11:B3A30828", "What are you doing? "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._110_sayTitle", "18:F0435DF5", "First exercise: "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._120_sayReward", "66:DCF82C6A", "Kill 9 Wild Dogs. You'll find them directly in[ENTER]front of the City Gates. "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._130_sayReward", "37:19870018", "So far you have killed %s wild dogs. "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._135_counter", "16:613B44F0", "Remaining number"},
	{"main_quest_lv2._140_sayTitle", "27:D5D7B394", "First practice task completed. "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._150_sayReward", "62:4F4EC4C2", "You have killed all 9 wild dogs. Report back to[ENTER]the City Guard. "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._160_npcChat", "23:2DEE50B8", "About the first task... "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._170_say", "108:DA9099B3", "If you have a problem with killing 9 Wild Dogs,[ENTER]you aren't really a true adventurer are you? "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._180_sayTitle", "20:5C6792C0", "Exercise task: "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._182_say", "114:F9FDBB6A", "Do you want to give up the quest for good?[ENTER]It will be deleted from your mission overview and[ENTER]will not be available again. "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._190_say", "115:9EDF2D2F", "How did you do that? You didn't cheat, did you?[ENTER]Anyway, let's get to the next step. "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._200_sendLetter", "38:D4CBF0AB", "Practice task completed "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._20_say", "101:8AA4EFAE", "City guard:[ENTER]Your interest is commendable but you should[ENTER]collect more experience points. Come back once[ENTER]you've reached a higher level! "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._210_say", "320:E9056393", "You are better than I thought! But I suppose[ENTER]anyone could have done that. Ha ha! Back in my[ENTER]days, the assignments were much more difficult.[ENTER]Be prepared for the next one. Here, you've earned[ENTER]yourself some potions and Yang with which you can[ENTER]improve your equipment. I'll call you as soon as[ENTER]I have a new assignment for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._220_sayReward", "69:6BC5835A", "You receive 250 experience points.[ENTER]You receive 1,000 Yang. "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._230_sayReward", "25:32ADBF72", "You have received %s, %s units. "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._30_sendLetter", "29:FA68B481", "Letter from the City Guard "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._40_targetVid", "28:CA588AFC", "Find the City Guard "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._50_sayReward", "166:2A0DA79E", "If you're reading this message, then you have[ENTER]reached a new level! Congratulations! Now go to[ENTER]the City Guard to receive you first training[ENTER]session! "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._60_say", "333:03B222B9", "You still lack discipline, though you've at least[ENTER]shown me that you can handle a weapon! Do you[ENTER]really think you're ready to take on wild[ENTER]animals? I'm going to check how skilful you are[ENTER]first. Leave the village and kill 9 Wild Dogs,[ENTER]then come afterwards and get your reward. "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._70_say", "172:892EE35C", "Wild Dogs are not very strong, so it shouldn't be[ENTER]too difficult. If you can't manage this task, you[ENTER]won't survive for very long! Get going! The[ENTER]sooner you start, the sooner you'll be done! "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._80_sayReward", "214:E342E4FB", "From time to time the Villagers give you[ENTER]assignments which give you experience points and[ENTER]Yang. It pays to look out for people who give you[ENTER]assignments! "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._90_sayReward", "35:768935ED", "For killing the Wild Dogs you will receive: "},
	{"main_quest_lv2._95_counter", "11:044F7395", "Wild Dogs: "},
	{"main_quest_lv27._100_makequestbutton", "31:9D32F72F", "The Metin Stone has been destroyed"},
	{"main_quest_lv27._105_say", "85:95FD5306", "You have destroyed the Metin of Black. Go to the[ENTER]Captain and tell him about your success. "},
	{"main_quest_lv27._10_makequestbutton", "24:137EF33A", "Destroy the Metin Stones "},
	{"main_quest_lv27._110_say", "310:02B08377", "Did you destroy the Metin Stone? Thank you! The[ENTER]village is safe for the time being now! Where[ENTER]have these stones come from anyway? We barely[ENTER]have any information about them, even though they[ENTER]are causing so many problems. I heard that Uriel[ENTER]the wise was investigating the Metin Stones. But[ENTER]I don't know what he has found out so far.[ENTER]Either way, you did a good job! "},
	{"main_quest_lv27._120_sayTitle", "9:8F643B8C", "Reward: "},
	{"main_quest_lv27._130_sayReward", "108:9919E474", "You have received 3,300,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 270,000 Yang.[ENTER]You have received a Master Book. "},
	{"main_quest_lv27._140_sayReward", "16:C1F386CB", "You receive %s. "},
	{"main_quest_lv27._20_say", "152:AB380787", "The destruction caused by the Metin Stones is[ENTER]becoming worse. The country is suffering. The[ENTER]Metin Stones must be destroyed! Go to the[ENTER]Captain. "},
	{"main_quest_lv27._30_say", "152:AB380787", "The destruction caused by the Metin Stones is[ENTER]becoming worse. The country is suffering. The[ENTER]Metin Stones must be destroyed! Go to the[ENTER]Captain. "},
	{"main_quest_lv27._40_say", "302:252E4086", "I heard that you have worked very hard. People[ENTER]have been talking about your good work. You owe[ENTER]me something for sending you to the right place.[ENTER]Ha, ha! Don't get annoyed, I was only joking![ENTER]You've been doing your job really well.[ENTER][ENTER]But more and more Metin Stones are appearing.[ENTER]It's a serious problem. "},
	{"main_quest_lv27._50_say", "256:AD610D9B", "If the number of Metin Stones increases, people[ENTER]suffer. I sometimes wonder the Shamans are right[ENTER]and the evil God Sung Mahi has really been[ENTER]resurrected... But first we have to take care of[ENTER]the obvious. Let me know when you've destroyed a[ENTER]Metin Stone! "},
	{"main_quest_lv27._60_sayTitle", "9:5BCA3F45", "Task: "},
	{"main_quest_lv27._70_say", "88:A26129E9", "The kind of Metin Stone you have to destroy is[ENTER]called Metin of Black. Find it! "},
	{"main_quest_lv27._80_say", "137:9310C446", "Recently more and more falling Metin Stones have[ENTER]been sighted. Their evil radiation has to be[ENTER]stopped! Destroy a Metin of Black. "},
	{"main_quest_lv27._90_say", "44:8E839855", "You have destroyed the Metin of Black. Return to[ENTER]the Captain. "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._100_say", "151:2FC1E46D", "Greetings. Did the City Guard send you? I have an[ENTER]easy mission for you. My father left an important[ENTER]book here this morning. He needs it desperately. "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._10_npcChat", "28:4044D94F", "I've completed the first assignment. "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._110_say", "165:0A0C59F5", "Could you take this book to my father? I have to[ENTER]stay at my post. Please do me this favour.[ENTER]If you do, I will reward you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._120_sayItem", "21:21858993", "Manufacturing armour "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._130_targetVid", "26:F43E2F80", "Find the Armour Shop Dealer "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._140_sendLetter", "17:9058016F", "Deliver the book "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._150_sayReward", "88:FCD4F4B7", "Deliver the book that the General Store[ENTER]Saleswoman's father left behind to him. He is the[ENTER]Armour Shop Dealer from the village. "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._160_sayTitle", "19:6CAD0F5F", "Armour Shop Dealer: "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._170_say", "133:7268F238", "You look like a man on a mission! Ah, my daughter[ENTER]sent you! Thank you. I need this book to produce[ENTER]new sets of armour. "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._180_say", "136:0A586632", "My daughter must be very busy if she's sending[ENTER]you to give me the book. Let's see, what would be[ENTER]an appropriate reward...? "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._190_say", "288:978DC235", "As a reward, I'm going to give you some Yang, so[ENTER]you can buy yourself some proper equipment. That[ENTER]should be enough, shouldn't it? Thank you. When I[ENTER]need some help again I'll probably ask you for[ENTER]another favour. And when you need a new armour[ENTER]then come and see me. My shop is always open. "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._200_sayReward", "110:46288027", "You have received 850 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 5,000 Yang.[ENTER]You have received 20 Blue Potions. "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._20_say", "183:CF098E74", "It looks like you had fun doing your first task.[ENTER]You're already waiting for the next one? Look for[ENTER]me when you've reached the next level. Then I'll[ENTER]give you another job. "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._30_sendLetter", "31:3B9BD31B", "News from the City Guard "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._40_sayReward", "90:6175B357", "Stop hunting and go to the City Guard. He has[ENTER]some more assignments for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._50_say", "233:CFA7E545", "I'm glad you came around. You probably know the[ENTER]General Store Saleswoman, right? She has asked me[ENTER]for some help. Could you find out what she needs?[ENTER]I hope it's nothing serious, but I'm sure that[ENTER]you can help her. "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._60_say", "216:74F823CD", "For your information: The General Store Saleswoman[ENTER]sells regeneration potions and other items which[ENTER]may come in handy in the future. So it can't hurt[ENTER]to make a good impression on her. Now go. "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._70_targetVid", "26:ADC1BD44", "Find General Store Saleswoman "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._80_sendLetter", "25:F55832B7", "Help General Store Saleswoman "},
	{"main_quest_lv3._90_sayReward", "59:91FDE76F", "Go to the General Store; the saleswoman needs[ENTER]your help. "},
	{"main_quest_lv30._100_say", "66:3F6E7BCB", "There are inscriptions on the Stone Memorial. You[ENTER]quickly make a copy. "},
	{"main_quest_lv30._10_targetVid", "14:A56A50E3", "Find Uriel "},
	{"main_quest_lv30._110_say", "178:B347544A", "Uriel is right: there really was an inscription[ENTER]on the Stone Memorial. You couldn't read it but[ENTER]at least make a copy. Take your notes to Uriel. "},
	{"main_quest_lv30._120_say", "390:49813285", "Did you find the Hasun Stone Memorial? Oh, you[ENTER]even have a copy. Very good! That is a a unique[ENTER]historical discovery! Let's see.[ENTER]Hmm... It really seems to be information about[ENTER]the Metin Stones. Although I can't decipher all[ENTER]of it. This writing is really ancient, some of[ENTER]the letters almost look antique. What are we[ENTER]going to do now? "},
	{"main_quest_lv30._130_say", "300:74599517", "Ah, I have an idea! Do you know the Valley of[ENTER]Seungryong? There's a mysterious ancient site[ENTER]there. If you find old inscriptions there I might[ENTER]be able to draw conclusions about the missing[ENTER]letters. Go to the Valley of Seungryong and look[ENTER]for the Seul Rong Stone Memorial. "},
	{"main_quest_lv30._140_targetVid", "29:7EADB4AB", "Tablet in Valley of Seungryong "},
	{"main_quest_lv30._150_say", "214:206B3800", "Uriel the scholar needs more ancient texts to[ENTER]draw conclusions about some of the letters he[ENTER]doesn't know.[ENTER]Go to the Valley of Seungryong and look for the[ENTER]inscriptions on the Seul Rong Stone Memorial. "},
	{"main_quest_lv30._160_say", "359:59DDD5DB", "You have found more inscriptions? Oh! Thanks to[ENTER]you, I'll be able to find out the secret of the[ENTER]Metin Stones soon. My investigations might[ENTER]produce results more quickly than I thought.[ENTER]Thank you, thank you! I'll let you know when I[ENTER]need your help again. And here, please take this[ENTER]reward for your efforts. "},
	{"main_quest_lv30._20_sendLetter", "21:B7102C55", "The secret of the Metin Stones"},
	{"main_quest_lv30._30_say", "108:2D1574B4", "Uriel has finally managed to get some information[ENTER]about the secret of the Metin Stones. Go and find[ENTER]Uriel the scholar. "},
	{"main_quest_lv30._50_say", "490:5B31A194", "The Captain already sent you to me once. You seem[ENTER]to be very talented. I need to ask you a favour.[ENTER]You know about the Metin Stones, don't you? The[ENTER]Metin Stones came down from the sky. They possess[ENTER]evil energy and are spreading disease and making[ENTER]the animals go wild. We don't know how they got[ENTER]into our world or what they consist of. It makes[ENTER]my research a lot more difficult. However, I[ENTER]recently found out the key to the secret of the[ENTER]Metin Stones. "},
	{"main_quest_lv30._60_say", "350:4A10DB8F", "There is a tablet, a memorial of an ancient[ENTER]kingdom, in a cave in the Easy Monkey Dungeon. I[ENTER]think the information on the tablet is about the[ENTER]secret of the Metin Stones. If you bring me the[ENTER]information, I might be able to find out the[ENTER]secret of the Metin Stones. Please bring me the[ENTER]information from the Hasun Stone Memorial in the[ENTER]Easy Monkey Dungeon! "},
	{"main_quest_lv30._70_sayReward", "110:2BD1E3AB", "You have received 122,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 20,000 Yang.[ENTER]You have received a Silver Bracelet. "},
	{"main_quest_lv30._80_targetVid", "36:3DD9D2CE", "Stone Memorial in the Easy Monkey Dungeon"},
	{"main_quest_lv30._90_say", "185:65080795", "Uriel the scholar thinks he has found a clue[ENTER]which may help him to work out the Metin Stones.[ENTER]Go to the Easy Monkey Dungeon and look for the[ENTER]Hasun Stone Memorial. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._100_sayReward", "93:C480A383", "Hint: If you ride on a horse, you can get it done[ENTER]more quickly and easily. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._10_sendLetter", "19:14E9D830", "The secret book "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._110_npcChat", "27:64B84F75", "The pages of the secret book "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._120_sayTitle", "12:15B74897", "Peddler: "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._130_say", "352:A162D32D", "Ever since all these problems started in the[ENTER]world, trade has got really difficult. What do[ENTER]you want to buy? Oh, you were sent from Uriel the[ENTER]scholar? He's a regular customer here, he's[ENTER]always looking for ancient books from different[ENTER]places. It's a bit of a nuisance really. Ha, ha,[ENTER]ha. You want to know more about ancient books?[ENTER]Hm, ancient books... "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._140_say", "428:D8E97CC8", "I heard something a few days ago, but I can't[ENTER]pass it on for free! If you scratch my back, I'll[ENTER]scratch yours, eh? Weapon trade has been going[ENTER]really well recently, but unfortunately I just[ENTER]can't supply such huge amounts! I've been snowed[ENTER]under with orders! As you're just standing around[ENTER]doing nothing, why don't you do something useful[ENTER]for a change and get hold of 20 Silver Swords+0[ENTER]for me? As soon as you bring them to me, I will[ENTER]give you the information that you want. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._150_targetVid", "18:51DCF808", "Find the Peddler "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._160_sayTitle", "27:E4321189", "You have 20 Silver Swords+0 "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._170_say", "111:BD05BAC5", "The Peddler has heard about the old pages. Give[ENTER]him 20 Silver Swords+0, then he will tell you[ENTER]what he knows. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._180_sayTitle", "30:888BDED3", "Get 20 Silver Swords+0 "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._190_say", "203:4703C942", "The Peddler has heard about the old pages but[ENTER]didn't want to share the information for free.[ENTER]Get 20 Silver Swords+0 and take them to the[ENTER]Peddler in return for the information. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._200_npcChat", "11:4FEEBED3", "I have got the swords. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._20_targetVid", "22:9A6689E6", "Look for Uriel the scholar "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._210_say", "341:80092682", "Good. You are more talented than I thought.[ENTER]Thanks to your help, business is going be much[ENTER]better soon. As far as your page is concerned...[ENTER]A few days ago I was passing a pavilion and a[ENTER]memorial next to it. I had a rest there and[ENTER]noticed a torn piece of paper at the foot of the[ENTER]memorial. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._220_say", "298:5454103E", "At the time I didn't think anything of it. But[ENTER]now I think it could have been one of the old[ENTER]pages you are looking for. The name of the[ENTER]memorial, hmmm... Was it the Weol Memorial? Yes,[ENTER]that's what it's called. The Weol Memorial near[ENTER]the Neighbouring Village. You should look there! "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._230_sayTitle", "12:15B74897", "Peddler: "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._240_say", "99:F35F383B", "Bring me the 20 Silver Swords+0, and I will give[ENTER]you the information about the old pages. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._250_sendLetter", "23:69A7F2CC", "Looking for the first page "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._260_targetVid", "21:0AFB9CB9", "A memorial next to the pavilion "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._270_say", "257:F6E00350", "The Peddler has seen an old page at the foot of[ENTER]the Weol Memorial when he had a rest in the[ENTER]pavilion next to the memorial.[ENTER]Go to the Weol Memorial near the First Village[ENTER]and see whether it really is the page you are[ENTER]looking for. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._280_npcChat", "13:FBE23093", "The Weol Memorial "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._290_say", "73:788FB9E8", "That's the memorial. Ah, there it is! I have the[ENTER]page! "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._300_sendLetter", "16:CF7F529A", "The first page "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._30_say", "167:2DE6A3B7", "Uriel the scholar sends for you. He needs help[ENTER]with his research on an old, secret book Go to[ENTER]Uriel and see what you can do for him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._310_targetVid", "22:9A6689E6", "Look for Uriel the scholar "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._320_sayTitle", "27:73706936", "You have found the first page "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._330_say", "117:B9FB1315", "You have been following the Peddler's clues and[ENTER]have found the first of the missing pages. Take[ENTER]it to Uriel the scholar. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._340_say", "159:7A5160CC", "So, did you find the old page? Oh, you have it,[ENTER]great! Let's see what's written on it.[ENTER]Hm... It looks like a diary. Listen "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._350_sayTitle", "25:9167F25D", "First page of the book: "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._360_sayReward", "377:B8ACF8A0", "Lee Seop from the Taejo kingdom is expanding his[ENTER]territory through conquest. He wants to conquer[ENTER]every country using his military forces. We need[ENTER]to ensure he does not take our country. Our[ENTER]options are limited as his army is so large and[ENTER]so strong. That's why we have decided to use the[ENTER]forbidden witchcraft! "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._370_sayTitle", "25:9167F25D", "First page of the book continued: "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._380_sayReward", "390:08CC1FE5", "This is our only chance of survival. We don't[ENTER]know if it'll be a success, but we should[ENTER]definitely try. Before they attack us, we need to[ENTER]get the information about the forbidden black[ENTER]witchcraft. According to the legend, we should be[ENTER]able to find out about it from the Dragon Valley. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._390_say", "451:218703CA", "From the contents I can see that ancient beliefs[ENTER]existed in this country. Before Lee Seop from the[ENTER]Taejo kingdom united all the countries, every[ENTER]country had its own special characteristics. As[ENTER]far as I know, every country even had its own[ENTER]religious beliefs. The author of this book, seems[ENTER]to have been quite educated. He probably belonged[ENTER]to one of the guilds or may have even been their[ENTER]captain. Guild members were considered the elite[ENTER]of society. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._400_say", "481:BA552849", "A lot of talk has been going around about the old[ENTER]stories of the Dragon Valley. I also know a few[ENTER]tales about it. Perhaps we might even still be[ENTER]able to find information about it or find more[ENTER]pages from the book. Unfortunately I have never[ENTER]found out information about where this valley is.[ENTER]Go to the hunter Yang-Shin in the neighbouring[ENTER]village, he knows his way around there really[ENTER]well. He might know where the Dragon Valley is[ENTER]and if there is anything useful to be found[ENTER]there. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._40_say", "478:6FFDF5A3", "Greetings.[ENTER]Your work the last time was very helpful. With[ENTER]your help, I was able to make some real progress.[ENTER]But now I have a problem. While investigating[ENTER]some information about the meteors, I found an[ENTER]old book. As far as I can understand, there are[ENTER]important speculations about the cause of the[ENTER]changes in there, that are affecting our country.[ENTER]It is really important. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._410_say", "85:7F59023F", "How exciting! Oh, before I forget: Here's your[ENTER]reward for your first page! "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._420_sayReward", "44:A7BE5F9C", "You receive 1,000,000 experience points. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._430_sayReward", "24:4A64FA46", "You have received 50,000 Yang. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._440_sayReward", "23:8DD3E020", "You have received a Goddess' Tear. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._450_sendLetter", "13:8287C863", "Go to the hunter "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._460_targetVid", "24:455B4C45", "Find the hunter Yang-Shin "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._470_sayTitle", "33:7105406B", "Ask Yang-Shin for the Dragon Valley. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._480_say", "246:115D80BB", "On the first page of the secret book the Dragon[ENTER]Valley is mentioned. Uriel has heard stories[ENTER]about it but doesn't know where it is. Go to the[ENTER]Neighbouring Village and ask the hunter Yang-Shin[ENTER]if he knows more about it. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._490_sayReward", "43:6204854C", "Hint: The hunter is in the Neighbouring Village. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._500_npcChat", "29:5934605E", "Information about the Dragon Valley "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._50_say", "351:AB1E41DB", "The problem is that the book is very old and[ENTER]ripped. The book was passed on from hand to hand[ENTER]for years, which is probably why it's so badly[ENTER]damaged. 13 pages are missing from this book.[ENTER]Could you get hold of them for me? There is[ENTER]probably some important information on how to end[ENTER]the war on those pages. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._520_say", "293:FD30BB55", "You want to know where the Dragon Valley is? That[ENTER]is the very old name for the Valley of[ENTER]Seungryong. There aren't any dragons there, but[ENTER]there are a large amount of orcs and even a[ENTER]secret sect living there instead. Why do you want[ENTER]to go to such a dangerous place? Even I, a clever[ENTER]hunter, don't like going there. It would be[ENTER]better if you kept away from there. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._530_say", "275:59DFDF4B", "What? You are looking for the old book pages? Hm![ENTER]Once I heard from the hunters that the Orc[ENTER]Sorcerers have got some papers. I wonder whether[ENTER]that's true?[ENTER]If you are so curious, then go figure it out.[ENTER]I already said that it is a dangerous place.[ENTER]Take good care of yourself! "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._540_sendLetter", "28:E0429F0A", "Looking for the second page "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._550_say", "249:1EA30221", "As the hunter already mentioned, you should be[ENTER]able to find the Elite Orc Sorcerers in the[ENTER]Dragon Valley. They should have the second old[ENTER]page. Kill the Elite Orc Sorcerers and get hold[ENTER]of the second page. Once you have the page,[ENTER]deliver it to Uriel. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._560_sendLetter", "13:74339E3F", "The second page "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._570_sayTitle", "23:350973AA", "Found the second page "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._580_say", "153:E9D9C29C", "Hunting the Elite Orc Sorcerer has been[ENTER]successful: you have found the second page of the[ENTER]Secret Book. Take it to Uriel the scholar. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._590_say", "98:B83F68AB", "Is that the second page? Let me see. Hmm, it's[ENTER]not very easy to decipher. It[ENTER]says:  "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._600_sayTitle", "14:13E515B8", "Second page: "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._60_say", "341:1D204BCF", "Once you find one of the old pages, bring it to[ENTER]me. Then I will try to decipher it. Hmm... Where[ENTER]could you start looking? Some time ago, a Peddler[ENTER]in the neighbouring village told me that he found[ENTER]an old book page. Go to him and see what you can[ENTER]find out. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._610_sayReward", "466:C00F49B2", "The dark magic followers have been found.[ENTER]They were hidden in the Dragon Valley. They are[ENTER]very informed about the witchcraft that has been[ENTER]passed through the ages. It took a lot of[ENTER]convincing, some threats and some flattery until[ENTER]they agreed to help us. And the result was: You[ENTER]need a special place to perform forbidden[ENTER]witchcraft. The place has to be full of evil[ENTER]energy. Time is running out so I need to find a[ENTER]suitable place as quickly as possible. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._620_say", "391:9553821C", "Hm, we need a place full of negative energy for[ENTER]black witchcraft. A place where everything can be[ENTER]converted into evil energy. Hmm... Where can we[ENTER]find a place like that? Hm... Hm... I know, it[ENTER]could be the Hwang Temple! The people don't call[ENTER]it the Temple of Darkness for nothing. It's a[ENTER]place where nobody good hearted wants to go. Even[ENTER]animals don't want to go there. And the secret[ENTER]sect is up to no good there. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._630_say", "258:4AD9B33F", "Furthermore, there is a connection between the[ENTER]forbidden witchcraft and this secret sect. You[ENTER]can find the key to that in the Hwang Temple.[ENTER]Find out what's going on in the Hwang Temple and[ENTER]see if you can find more book pages there![ENTER]Here is your reward for the second page... "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._640_sayReward", "44:A7BE5F9C", "You receive 1,000,000 experience points. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._650_sayReward", "24:4A64FA46", "You have received 50,000 Yang. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._660_sayReward", "28:F0FFB5ED", "You have received 10 White Flags. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._670_sendLetter", "15:13F91406", "The third page "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._680_say", "89:86D4F07F", "You have taken the first two pages of the Secret[ENTER]Book to Uriel. The next page can be found in the[ENTER]Hwang Temple. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._690_sayReward", "93:DB8B3735", "Hint: This series of quests will be continued[ENTER]when you have reached level 40. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._70_targetVid", "18:51DCF808", "Go to the Peddler "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._80_sayTitle", "31:C6EF7DCF", "Look for the pages of the secret book. "},
	{"main_quest_lv32._90_say", "218:E94A04A8", "Uriel the scholar said that he had heard[ENTER]something about a Peddler with an old book page.[ENTER]Go to the Peddler and ask him about it. You will[ENTER]find him in the second village. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._100_sayReward", "44:0064E4AD", "You have received 2,000,000 experience points. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._10_sayTitle", "20:9939611A", "The Temple of Darkness "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._110_sayReward", "24:4A64FA46", "You have received 50,000 Yang. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._120_sayReward", "41:2A1877EB", "You have received the Blessing of Life. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._130_sendLetter", "18:5D91DEE2", "Off into the Yongbi Desert "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._140_targetVid", "21:5FB1F146", "The search for the memorial "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._150_targetVid", "25:B63C79E8", "The search for the Wha Memorial "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._160_sayTitle", "29:B69D289A", "The search for the fourth page "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._170_say", "283:828ED21E", "The wise Uriel thinks that the fourth page may be[ENTER]found in the Monkey Dungeon Jungsun Dong in the[ENTER]Yongbi Desert. There are two memorials there. The[ENTER]fourth page is probably near one of them. Go to[ENTER]the Yongbi Desert and look for the memorials in[ENTER]Jungsun Dong. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._180_say", "16:DA26AF13", "That is the Wha Memorial! "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._190_say", "98:380B67FF", "But there is no old diary page to be seen.[ENTER]I have to get on and find another memorial. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._200_npcChat", "24:8349F23F", "The search for the Su Memorial "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._20_say", "288:0024AC3D", "Uriel the scholar is looking for old diary pages.[ENTER]You have already brought him two of them. Now the[ENTER]exciting hunt for the secret of the old book[ENTER]continues.[ENTER]The discoveries so far indicate that the Proud[ENTER]Dark Fanatics that live in the Hwang Temple have[ENTER]the next page.[ENTER]Be on your way! "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._210_say", "27:AF0BE3C3", "This must be it! The Su Memorial. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._220_say", "98:380B67FF", "But there is no old diary page to be seen.[ENTER]I have to get on and find another memorial. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._230_sendLetter", "15:7E39C130", "The fourth page "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._240_sayTitle", "20:74C2B5A1", "Found the fourth page "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._250_say", "163:20F76A9A", "The ancient memorials prove to be faithful[ENTER]guardians of their treasures: you have found the[ENTER]fourth old page in Jungsun Dong. Take it to Uriel[ENTER]the scholar. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._260_npcChat", "15:7E39C130", "The fourth old page "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._270_say", "98:B6CE3265", "Oh! You have found the fourth old page.[ENTER]Hopefully, we will get some new insights with the[ENTER]new information we have received from the book. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._280_sayTitle", "16:C8E1E2B2", "Fourth page: "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._290_sayReward", "330:93F01E1A", "Now I'm in the deep cave where the monkeys live.[ENTER]My companions are petrified, but the bad energy[ENTER]we have gathered here is still insufficient. Time[ENTER]is going by too fast and Lee Seop's cavalry is[ENTER]coming closer and closer. I wonder whether we'll[ENTER]make it on time? "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._300_sayTitle", "37:CAB380C3", "Fourth page continued: "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._30_sayTitle", "20:CB23631E", "Found the third page "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._310_sayReward", "172:981CA3D6", "I need to find the next location as soon as[ENTER]possible. Nothing is lost yet. I'll try the[ENTER]Spider Caves. This time, our wish might even come[ENTER]true... "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._320_say", "391:ABBAEC31", "Hm. The Monkey Dungeons are not the place we are[ENTER]looking for. We have to try again! According to[ENTER]what is written here, we must go to the Spider[ENTER]Dungeon. But first we have to deal with a more[ENTER]important matter: the Captain is worried, because[ENTER]strangers have been coming to the village[ENTER]regularly and asking strange questions. Go to the[ENTER]Captain and look into this matter. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._330_say", "140:AC86EC3A", "This whole situation is making me uneasy. Let's[ENTER]see what the Captain says. Oh, before I forget:[ENTER]Here's your reward for the fourth page. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._340_sayReward", "44:0064E4AD", "You have received 2,000,000 experience points. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._350_sayReward", "32:91E18BDB", "You have also got a Blessing of Magic. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._360_sendLetter", "20:FAB43EB9", "The eerie strangers "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._370_targetVid", "16:D5305923", "Go to the Captain "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._380_sayTitle", "83:4282EBDF", "Ask the Captain about the strangers "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._390_say", "230:6E09EB54", "Rumour has it that a lot of strangers have been[ENTER]appearing in the village. They are asking a[ENTER]suspicious amount of questions about the[ENTER]memorials. The Captain wants to do something[ENTER]about it. Go see him and find out more. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._400_npcChat", "20:A4DB75C4", "The strangers in the village "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._40_say", "141:6DC06758", "Uriel the scholar's assumptions about the Proud[ENTER]Dark Fanatics were correct. You have found the[ENTER]third diary page in their possession. Take the[ENTER]page to Uriel the scholar. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._410_say", "323:4118BF80", "There has been an increasing number of strangers[ENTER]coming into our village. They keep asking about[ENTER]memorials and ancient books. Some people know[ENTER]about it, but they do not want to tell the[ENTER]strangers. I'm afraid that it might get us all[ENTER]into trouble. No one knows who sent these[ENTER]strangers and how far they might go to get their[ENTER]information. After all, we're at war. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._420_say", "151:0687FC99", "If my sources are correct, Nakajima from the[ENTER]neighbouring village has something to do with it.[ENTER]Please try and find out from him what the[ENTER]strangers want here. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._430_sendLetter", "21:999BA060", "Go to Nakajima "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._440_say", "228:33285A96", "The Captain thinks there is a connection between[ENTER]Nakajima and the strangers who are asking[ENTER]everywhere in the village for the memorials. Go[ENTER]to Nakajima and find out what he knows. You'll[ENTER]find him on the outskirts of the second village. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._450_npcChat", "34:43C48AF5", "You know the strangers in the village? "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._470_say", "193:79C05CC4", "Excuse me? What kind of question is that? I'm[ENTER]sorry. I can't help you. I don't have the[ENTER]slightest clue about what you're talking about.[ENTER]No, no. It's hard enough to find work at the[ENTER]moment as it is. What am I supposed to live on,[ENTER]eh? "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._480_say", "208:0D667816", "Oh well, I admit to it. But I only agreed because[ENTER]they promised me a lot of Yang.[ENTER]I don't know what the strangers wanted here. But[ENTER]they have given me a mission: I'm supposed to[ENTER]kill the Bestial Captains. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._490_say", "202:64D9B279", "You could probably find out more from the Bestial[ENTER]Captains. The strangers really wanted me to kill[ENTER]him. Oh, I've got an idea: Why don't you go and[ENTER]kill him for me? Please? "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._500_sendLetter", "29:A095597A", "Kill the Bestial Captains "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._50_say", "108:F8D8F045", "Oh, you've found the next clue?! It's the third[ENTER]page. Let's see what it says. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._510_say", "300:2C8BF7A8", "Nakajima has confessed that the strangers want to[ENTER]kill the Bestial Captains. As the strangers have[ENTER]been asking about the Diary Pages, the Bestial[ENTER]Captains obviously have a page with them To find[ENTER]out more, I have to kill the Bestial Captains.[ENTER]They can be found outside the second village. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._520_sendLetter", "24:15288477", "You have found the fifth page "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._530_say", "245:C51BA946", "I got there before the strangers and took the[ENTER]fifth diary page from the Bestial Captains. I'm[ENTER]sure the strangers will disappear now that[ENTER]there's nothing left for them to find here. I'd[ENTER]best take this page to the scholar Uriel so that[ENTER]I can decipher it. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._540_sayTitle", "21:D992807B", "The fifth page "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._550_sayReward", "143:59EE2063", "Note: You can only take the fifth page to Uriel[ENTER]once you have reached level 47. Take good care of[ENTER]the page until then! "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._60_sayTitle", "16:90515993", "Third page: "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._70_sayReward", "276:52123B83", "We have found a place that is ruled by evil[ENTER]energy. But that's not enough. That place is[ENTER]evil, but it's not appropriate for practising[ENTER]magic, which is a real blow. But our spies are[ENTER]talking about a hidden place in the desert that[ENTER]could be promising for us. We're going to head[ENTER]there now and are very optimistic. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._80_say", "456:AC367217", "So, they were unable to reach their goal in the[ENTER]Dragon Valley. Hm... the Yongbi Desert? You rarely[ENTER]meet anyone there, and many areas around it have[ENTER]not been explored yet. But this is all very[ENTER]complicated. Where exactly is the area they are[ENTER]talking about? My guess is that they mean the[ENTER]Monkey Dungeon Jungsun Dong. It is a deep cave[ENTER]where a great deal of negative energy can surely[ENTER]be gathered. "},
	{"main_quest_lv40._90_say", "254:514A2512", "Please go to the Jungsun Dong and look for more[ENTER]stone memorials. With a bit of luck you can find[ENTER]more pages near the memorials. Oh, and of course[ENTER]we shouldn't forget your reward for the third[ENTER]page. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._100_sayTitle", "23:019090A3", "The page in the Spider Dungeon "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._10_sayTitle", "30:B7FDC3C3", "The page from the Bestial Captains "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._110_say", "241:3C410D61", "Uriel thinks that further information about black[ENTER]witchcraft can be found in the Spider Dungeon.[ENTER]Maybe we'll find a monument like the one in the[ENTER]Monkey Dungeon there too.[ENTER][ENTER]You can get to the Spider Dungeon via the Yongbi[ENTER]Desert. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._120_npcChat", "12:8504AC63", "The Mok Memorial "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._130_say", "101:19589706", "Really! Here is a memorial and also a Diary Page.[ENTER]Quickly go back to Uriel. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._140_sayTitle", "24:605D4462", "Found the sixth page "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._150_say", "133:D5677B13", "You have found another ancient memorial in the[ENTER]Spider Dungeon and also the sixth diary page that[ENTER]was hidden there. Deliver it to Uriel the[ENTER]scholar. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._160_npcChat", "14:14F2E048", "The sixth page "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._170_say", "371:8721C648", "How was the Spider Dungeon? Did you find the[ENTER]sixth page? That's fantastic! I was worried that[ENTER]you might be too late. One always hears about[ENTER]other people who are also looking for the secrets[ENTER]of black witchcraft. It seems to be very[ENTER]important information. Let's see what this page[ENTER]says. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._180_say", "276:3FEA8CF9", "Oh no, this Page is really very hard to decipher.[ENTER]I need a little more time for it. Its contents[ENTER]seem to be very interesting. Perhaps it will help[ENTER]us understand what exactly this ritual involves.[ENTER]After all, it was not forbidden without a reason. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._190_say", "291:2A07CF96", "While I'm trying to decipher this page, you[ENTER]should go to the musician Yu-Hwan. I heard that[ENTER]he has some interesting information for our[ENTER]search. When you get back, I will be able to tell[ENTER]you what this page says. But of course you will[ENTER]get your reward now. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._200_sayReward", "44:62167122", "You have received 3,000,000 experience points. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._20_say", "183:2B088B6F", "Uriel has carefully analysed the Fifth Page of the[ENTER]mysterious Book that you obtained from the Bestial[ENTER]Captain. You should get in touch with him as soon[ENTER]as possible. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._210_sayReward", "13:B63F5768", "You have received 75,000 Yang. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._220_sayReward", "35:035AC229", "You have received a Blessing of the Dragon. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._230_sendLetter", "15:F1B4401D", "Go to Yu-Hwan "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._240_targetVid", "22:B8DD9791", "Find the musician Yu-Hwan "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._250_sayTitle", "16:37A57AD7", "The secret forces "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._260_say", "114:B2836AE0", "The musician Yu-Hwan may have some information[ENTER]about the old diary pages. Go and see him and ask[ENTER]him about it. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._270_npcChat", "15:C8CF80B3", "Any news? "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._280_say", "374:08E54509", "Enjoy life, because it is very short![ENTER]Trallalaaa... Ah, there you are again. You've[ENTER]probably just come from Uriel the scholar. He[ENTER]asked whether I could ask around a bit. I've[ENTER]found out that in all kingdoms people have been[ENTER]going around looking for important documents.[ENTER]Unfortunately nobody could tell me exactly what[ENTER]it's all about. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._290_say", "297:19ED875B", "It's a bit weird that these strange creeping[ENTER]figures are hanging around while we're in the[ENTER]middle of a war. You excluded, of course! I also[ENTER]heard that the Desert Outlaws were able to loot[ENTER]some things that could be quite important for us.[ENTER]Perhaps you should try having a look at what you[ENTER]can get out of them. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._300_say", "210:2984E3B9", "The Desert Outlaws are quite dangerous beasts, so[ENTER]watch out. But I think it'll be worth it. I'm[ENTER]going to dedicate a song to you and entrust the[ENTER]wind with it, so that it follows you into the[ENTER]desert. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._30_npcChat", "21:D992807B", "The fifth page "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._310_sendLetter", "19:BAEF6E4A", "The Desert Outlaws "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._320_sayTitle", "35:64457417", "The quest for the secret information "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._330_say", "248:0F07F27A", "Uriel needs all information about black[ENTER]witchcraft. Yu-Hwan, the musician, said that the[ENTER]Desert Outlaws stole something that could have[ENTER]helped us out. I should leave now and kill a[ENTER]couple of Desert Outlaws. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._340_sendLetter", "24:D8EED5BE", "Found the seventh page "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._350_targetVid", "28:05018D05", "Looking for the musician Yu-Hwan"},
	{"main_quest_lv47._360_say", "220:5814EE43", "Thanks to the information that the musician[ENTER]Yu-Hwan gave you, you were able to find the[ENTER]seventh page of the secret book at the Desert[ENTER]Outlaws'. Go to Yu-Hwan and tell him that his[ENTER]information was correct. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._370_say", "306:4267523D", "Your eyes are as beautiful as a mountain lake[ENTER]lalalala.... Hey, there you are again. Were you[ENTER]successful in regard to the desert bandits? What,[ENTER]that's all? An old piece of paper? That's no use[ENTER]to me. But if it makes you happy... Take it to[ENTER]Uriel. And send him my best wishes! "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._380_sendLetter", "14:360D22BF", "Go to Uriel. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._390_targetVid", "14:360D22BF", "Go to Uriel. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._400_sayTitle", "14:4E4A8596", "The seventh page "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._40_say", "128:F2FEEAF4", "You've got the fifth page? Unbelievable. We're[ENTER]really lucky that these pages even exist after[ENTER]all these years. You really are very proficient.[ENTER]Now let's see what this page says. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._410_say", "59:C430E885", "You have found the seventh page of the old diary.[ENTER]Take it to Uriel. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._420_say", "329:FAFC5E8F", "Hello, nice to see you again! I have good news: I[ENTER]have finished deciphering the sixth page. Not[ENTER]bad, eh? I have to admit, I am quite proud of[ENTER]myself. Because what actually caught my eye, was[ENTER]that this character... Excuse me? You found[ENTER]another one? My goodness! That was really fast.[ENTER]Show me. Wow, where did you get that one from? If[ENTER]I'm not mistaken, these are the characters that[ENTER]were used by the imperial family. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._430_say", "438:6DD61B4B", "Since these characters were rarely used and then[ENTER]only by very few people, it is very difficult to[ENTER]translate them. But I guess a bit of a challenge[ENTER]never harmed anyone, haha! I'm looking forward to[ENTER]it. The Desert Outlaws stole this page from the[ENTER]mysterious strangers? Hmm...[ENTER]Does this mean that the strangers understand[ENTER]these characters? This is getting so confusing.[ENTER]We need to make sure that we don't overlook[ENTER]anything. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._440_say", "141:4E9AC7C2", "Oh yeah, oversight: Before I concentrate on the[ENTER]next page, I should probably tell you what was on[ENTER]the sixth page. Hrm-hrm... "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._450_sayTitle", "15:F1FE4FCC", "Sixth page: "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._460_sayReward", "275:332CC046", "Time is running out. We have tried to use the[ENTER]secret magic even in the Spider Dungeon, to no[ENTER]avail. What else are we missing? Some of our[ENTER]mystics believe that the secret magic demands[ENTER]greater sacrifices. If that is true, it must be[ENTER]truly powerful. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._470_sayReward", "249:6EDED241", "According to fairy tales and legends, this type[ENTER]of magic always demands human sacrifice. But if I[ENTER]kill their loved ones at the altar, my reputation[ENTER]amongst the people will receive a knocking. We[ENTER]need an adequate substitute. Let's try it with[ENTER]the Snake Swordsmen from the desert. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._480_say", "458:7FDC2080", "Aha. So because they couldn't sacrifice humans,[ENTER]they decided to use snake fighters. I can't[ENTER]pretend that I like this new development. It's[ENTER]going to end badly... We still need to follow[ENTER]their trail though. Go to the desert and kill[ENTER]some Snake Swordsmen and Snake Archers there. Who[ENTER]knows what else we might find there. By t he way:[ENTER]your reward is in this purse! "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._490_sendLetter", "26:D050ECF4", "Kill the snake fighters "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._500_sayTitle", "12:52346ADF", "The eighth page "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._50_sayTitle", "14:E94E8785", "Fifth page: "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._510_say", "237:F4ADE3A9", "The diary describes the attempt to sacrifice[ENTER]Snake Swordsman and Snake Archers for carrying[ENTER]out black witchcraft. Go to the Yongbi Desert and[ENTER]kill Snake Swordsmen. Look out for some more[ENTER]information. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._520_sendLetter", "22:D50BAB03", "Found the eighth page "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._530_targetVid", "19:C14691F0", "Go to Uriel the scholar "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._540_say", "104:3ABAFFD9", "You have found the eighth page of the diary with[ENTER]the Snake Swordmen in the Desert. Take it to[ENTER]Uriel the scholar. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._550_say", "77:01FE052A", "That's the eighth page. Very good. Since it is[ENTER]very short, I think I can read it out straight[ENTER]away. One moment please...Ah, yes. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._560_sayTitle", "13:9E36E253", "Eighth page: "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._570_sayReward", "203:5E77EFE4", "The necessary victims have been found. We're[ENTER]lucky. I wonder whether that's a sign? We need a[ENTER]ceremonial bell. If I remember rightly the[ENTER]spiders have something like that . We'll set off[ENTER]now. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._580_say", "383:5021B701", "Ah, the Spider Dungeon again, strange. You have[ENTER]to go there and look for the bell. It's going to[ENTER]be an exhausting journey, so relax a bit first[ENTER]and come back later. I'm going have a bit of a[ENTER]think and translate some more fragments. When you[ENTER]come back, I'll give you a new mission. And don't[ENTER]worry, of course you'll get your reward for the[ENTER]eighth page now. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._590_sayReward", "185:F569F83B", "Experience points: 3,000,000[ENTER]Yang: 70,000[ENTER]Bravery Capes: 20[ENTER]Note: For the next assignment, you need to have a[ENTER]minimum level of 50. "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._60_sayReward", "577:FE3F37AD", "Lee Seop has arrived in the Taejo kingdom with[ENTER]his cavalry but seems to want to stay there for a[ENTER]while. In the meantime both small and large[ENTER]meteorites are raining down on the country.[ENTER]They're causing chaos, destruction and conflict.[ENTER]The vast kingdom has split into three smaller[ENTER]kingdoms. They are also fighting amongst each[ENTER]other, instead of fighting evil together. The[ENTER]Dragon God is not talking to us any more either.[ENTER]Sometimes he supports one party and sometimes the[ENTER]other. Thus everyone is fighting for his favour[ENTER]and in the meantime the disaster is just getting[ENTER]worse and worse... "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._80_say", "149:7D8DA408", "An eyewitness account from the first days of our[ENTER]era. Absolutely priceless! Ah yes, your pay. Here[ENTER]is your reward for an excellent job! "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._85_say", "307:6F960846", "Hello![ENTER]Unfortunately someone else is on the same trail as[ENTER]we are, so I have no time to lose. At the end of[ENTER]the fifth page it says that Lee Seop then searched[ENTER]for evil energy in the Spider Dungeon. If you find[ENTER]something there, come to me at once! I am burning[ENTER]with impatience! "},
	{"main_quest_lv47._90_sendLetter", "14:14F2E048", "The sixth page "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._100_say", "76:3A099E41", "Hey, not so fast, hotspur! Don't forget your[ENTER]reward for the ninth page! "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._10_sayTitle", "34:A57F438D", "Kill Proud Soldier Spiders "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._110_sayReward", "45:ABA7E80D", "You have received 5,000,000 experience points. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._120_sayReward", "25:03C8AE2F", "You have received 125,000 Yang. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._130_sayReward", "38:ABBAD417", "You have received a Sage King's Symbol. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._140_sendLetter", "24:4F0D4B11", "The clue in Ice Land "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._150_targetVid", "24:3D8A95F2", "The Old Box with Papers "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._160_sayTitle", "39:7F88C75A", "Looking for the Old Box with Papers "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._170_say", "152:D505F22A", "At Mount Sohan the enemy armies finally stumbled[ENTER]upon each other. Look for further diary pages or[ENTER]other written evidence about the progress of the[ENTER]battle. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._180_npcChat", "25:0675BD38", "An Old Box with Papers! "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._190_say", "122:4BF2E355", "These are military plans and notes.[ENTER]And here is another diary page![ENTER]I should take it to Uriel. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._200_sendLetter", "17:4564F824", "The tenth page "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._20_say", "245:4A61C117", "Our previous research indicates that there are[ENTER]clues in the Spider Dungeon. Catch the Proud[ENTER]Soldier Spider in Kuahlo Dong. If you find[ENTER]another page from the old book take it to Uriel[ENTER]the scholar. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._210_sayTitle", "27:70D6651F", "Found the tenth page "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._220_say", "144:C26ECE60", "You have found the tenth page of the Secret Diary[ENTER]in Ice Land. It was in an Old Box with Papers.[ENTER]Take it to Uriel. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._230_say", "237:A9311E28", "Ah, you found the missing tenth Diary Page![ENTER]Great, we are getting closer to the end of the[ENTER]story. It's good they documented everything[ENTER]otherwise this knowledge would be lost. Let's see[ENTER]what the page says. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._235_sayTitle", "26:0CF9CBBA", "Tenth Page: "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._240_sayReward", "454:42A0B182", "We have succeeded in repelling the first attack.[ENTER]But the next one will follow soon. The terrain[ENTER]will handicap Lee Seops heavy iron soldiers and[ENTER]will give us some advantages, but they are just[ENTER]too many. We cannot win. We only have one last[ENTER]chance, finish our black witchcraft research.[ENTER]Under cover of darkness we will penetrate the[ENTER]enemy lines and go back to the Spider Caves. I'm[ENTER]praying. Not for victory, but for a little bit of[ENTER]hope... "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._250_say", "210:B62EB72E", "Ooohh. I think we are almost there! Soon we will[ENTER]find out what Black Magic is all about. I can't[ENTER]wait! You have to return to the Spider Dungeon[ENTER]once more. Hopefully the eleventh page of the[ENTER]book is there. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._260_say", "23:9176EE52", "And here is - once again - your well earned[ENTER]reward! "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._270_sayReward", "44:3B325877", "You have received 5,500,000 experience points. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._280_sayReward", "25:0F1BA570", "You have received 137,500 Yang. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._290_sayReward", "40:CEF1958C", "You have received a Sage King's Glove. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._300_sayTitle", "36:19C5AAEF", "Kill Claw Poison Spiders "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._30_sendLetter", "17:56F90FD9", "The ninth page "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._310_say", "178:804DD6CB", "The black witchcraft research is being continued[ENTER]in the Spider Caves. Go there and kill some Claw[ENTER]Poison Spiders to find out the required[ENTER]information. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._320_sendLetter", "17:4AC138FF", "The eleventh page "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._330_targetVid", "16:EAAD15EC", "Return to Uriel the scholar "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._335_sayTitle", "31:A9E84BF2", "You've found the Eleventh Page "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._340_say", "95:BC31EB9E", "You found the eleventh page of the Secret Diary[ENTER]in the Spider Dungeon. Take it to Uriel. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._350_say", "196:1AECB0E9", "Have you found out any new information? Aha, the[ENTER]eleventh page! Let's see...[ENTER]Ah yes, it looks quite easy. I've become quite[ENTER]good at reading these characters now. Now, watch[ENTER]this! "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._355_sayTitle", "26:B7EB9BEE", "Eleventh Page: "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._360_sayReward", "341:D54402AC", "It has failed. Despite all our preparation, we[ENTER]had to act fast. Too fast. Now a lot of us are[ENTER]injured, and some of us have even gone insane.[ENTER]Black witchcraft truly is evil. Lee Seop's[ENTER]cavalry are onto us, but that's irrelevant now.[ENTER]We don't have enough men to defend ourselves[ENTER]against him and we're going to die anyway. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._365_sayTitle", "39:9D6AB6D6", "Continuation of the Eleventh Page: "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._370_sayReward", "288:0EBDA84A", "One last thought is keeping the rest of the troop[ENTER]together and is giving us strength: Our[ENTER]informants in the Dragon Valley lied. They[ENTER]deliberately didn't warn us ways from the[ENTER]terrible side effects of black witchcraft.[ENTER]They'll pay for doing that. It will be our last[ENTER]deed on this earth. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._380_say", "512:9789C4A5", "Well, in the end it turned out a little bit[ENTER]differently than they were hoping. A sad story.[ENTER]But unfortunately you can't trust anyone who is[ENTER]involved with black witchcraft. They should have[ENTER]thought of that. It's strange enough that the[ENTER]author of these lines even managed to receive[ENTER]information about these forbidden schemes. Who[ENTER]knows what kind of goal his informants had. We[ENTER]should finish this path though, even if it's[ENTER]dangerous. We already know so much, it would be a[ENTER]shame to give up now. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._390_say", "451:E39B532B", "You have already been to the Valley of[ENTER]Seungryong. I don't think we'll find anything[ENTER]else there. Hmm, I wonder where else we can[ENTER]look... I know! The memorials played a big part[ENTER]during our search. And there are also memorials[ENTER]around that we haven't investigated yet. The ones[ENTER]in the other kingdoms! It's very dangerous there.[ENTER]You will probably be attacked constantly.[ENTER]So prepare yourself well and come see me when[ENTER]you're ready. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._400_say", "39:E2E5AE7B", "But first, I will give you your reward for the[ENTER]eleventh page. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._40_targetVid", "19:C14691F0", "Go to Uriel the scholar "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._410_sayReward", "74:BAB432DA", "Hint: For the next assignment you need to be at[ENTER]least level 55. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._50_sayTitle", "28:7E1B67A4", "Found the ninth page "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._60_say", "71:5A1139E7", "You have found the ninth page in the Spider[ENTER]Dungeon. Take it to Uriel the scholar. "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._70_say", "153:A2CEFF95", "You found out something else about black[ENTER]witchcraft? Wow, the ninth page! I'm really[ENTER]excited to see whether the magic worked or not.[ENTER]Let's have a look. Hmm, it says here... "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._75_sayTitle", "26:44030CDD", "Ninth Page: "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._80_sayReward", "552:1756614B", "Lee Seop's attack has begun. And we still don't[ENTER]know exactly how to use black witchcraft. I'm[ENTER]really nervous. We are at the front-line, trying[ENTER]to defend our kingdom, but our strength is[ENTER]insufficient. The enemy army is much too strong[ENTER]and if something doesn't happen soon, we're going[ENTER]to lose the battle. We need to retreat. It would[ENTER]be best for us to retreat to a barren place,[ENTER]where they won't be able to use their horses[ENTER]properly: The Ice Desert. With a bit of luck[ENTER]we'll then have enough time to keep researching.[ENTER]Oh, God help us... "},
	{"main_quest_lv50._90_say", "276:29B9914C", "Hmm... The attack began before they were able to[ENTER]research black witchcraft properly. They have had[ENTER]to barricade themselves in the Ice Desert.[ENTER]They must mean Mount Sohan, which is also called[ENTER]Ice Land nowadays. We should look for some more[ENTER]clues. Go to Mount Sohan and see what you can[ENTER]find out. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._100_say", "82:931CB2AA", "You have found the twelfth page in the Joan Area.[ENTER]Take it to Uriel in the Yongan Area. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._10_sendLetter", "22:6D8BD821", "Looking for the memorials "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._110_say", "85:66A3E3CC", "You have found the twelfth page in the Yongan[ENTER]Area. Take it to Uriel in the Pyungmo Area. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._120_say", "212:38B6C773", "I'm delighted to see you again. I'm sorry that I[ENTER]had to send you here, there and everywhere, but[ENTER]at least our success has proven us right, don't[ENTER]you think? Let's see what it says. I hope it was[ENTER]all worth it. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._130_sayTitle", "28:3E992C70", "Twelfth page: "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._140_sayReward", "357:37739457", "We found the informants and they paid for their[ENTER]deception with their lives. But what is much more[ENTER]important is that we were still able to squeeze[ENTER]some information out of them: We don't need the[ENTER]Spider Caves, but the Temple of Darkness. This is[ENTER]where the ancient belief followers have been[ENTER]performing their dark rituals since the beginning[ENTER]of time. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._145_sayTitle", "38:74A7091D", "Continuation of the Twelfth Page: "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._150_sayReward", "368:743C4C76", "We've only got one more way of stopping Lee Seop[ENTER]left. We need to travel to the Temple of Darkness[ENTER]so that we can perform black witchcraft. There[ENTER]aren't many of us left and the exertion from the[ENTER]last few months has certainly taken its toll. But[ENTER]even a handful of tired men can change the fate[ENTER]of the world when they have powerful information.[ENTER]We can't lose sight of our goal. Let's go. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._160_say", "365:762C56AE", "Ah, so they did find the right place. I was right[ENTER]after all! It really is the Hwang Temple. You[ENTER]probably remember that dark place, that was[ENTER]buzzing with bad energy. As long as anyone can[ENTER]remember, rituals and ceremonies have been taking[ENTER]place there, from which honest villagers[ENTER]shouldn't should steer clear of. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._170_say", "351:AD18FDC3", "Nowadays monsters are the only things living in[ENTER]the temple, there haven't been humans there for a[ENTER]long time. It's very dangerous, but I'm sure that[ENTER]you can make it. Go to the Valley of Seungryong[ENTER]and look for the last page in the Hwang Temple.[ENTER]The story that this diary has been telling us[ENTER]finished there. I need to find out how it[ENTER]finished. Good luck! Oh, wait a second, here's[ENTER]your reward for the twelfth page. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._200_sendLetter", "16:8E959EDE", "The last page "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._20_say", "228:13E171D8", "As you have already found several Diary Pages[ENTER]near the memorials, Uriel thinks that you will be[ENTER]able to find out more information about the[ENTER]secret dark witchcraft near the unexplored[ENTER]memorials. Go to the Chunjo Kingdom and[ENTER]investigate the memorial in the Joan Area. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._210_sayTitle", "28:BB4CE50B", "Kill Bogeymen in the Temple "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._220_say", "259:3C4578D3", "So far, you've found 12 of the 13 Diary Pages.[ENTER]Now, there's only one more step left. Uriel says[ENTER]that black magic has been cast at the Hwang[ENTER]Temple. You should go there and find out some[ENTER]more information. Start your search by killing[ENTER]the Bogeymen in the temple. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._230_say", "32:9B1A1590", "I have to go deeper into the Temple! "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._240_sendLetter", "20:9939611A", "The Temple of Darkness "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._250_sayTitle", "21:74E8C52D", "The evil energy of the temple "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._260_sayReward", "290:E76526CE", "After you have spent a bit of time in the temple,[ENTER]you develop a feeling for this strange, dark[ENTER]place: Slow shadows flicker in every corner. Dark[ENTER]energy seeps out of every crack and nook like[ENTER]oil. It is obvious that the temple itself is the[ENTER]reason behind it. This is where it all began... "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._270_say", "220:D867022B", "You become aware of the fact that the wickedness[ENTER]that lies in the air gets stronger, the further[ENTER]you move towards the centre of the temple. You[ENTER]should try finding the middle of the temple.[ENTER]That's where the source of the darkness must be. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._280_npcChat", "11:BC5C4F65", "Gum Memorial "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._290_say", "109:61F2DA6C", "The Gum Memorial is at the heart of the temple.[ENTER]You slowly move closer and actually find the last[ENTER]Diary Page. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._300_say", "130:46BC494B", "You found the last page of the Secret Diary in[ENTER]the Temple of Darkness. Go to Uriel and report[ENTER]back to him about your discovery. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._30_say", "230:1FA777AD", "As you have already found several Diary Pages[ENTER]near the memorials, Uriel thinks that more[ENTER]information about the secret black witchcraft can[ENTER]be found near and around the unexplored[ENTER]memorials. Go to the Jinno Kingdom and explore[ENTER]the memorial in the Pyungmo Area. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._310_say", "257:2ADB268D", "There it is, the thirteenth and final page! I[ENTER]can't tell you how grateful I am to you for doing[ENTER]this. Look at my how my hands are shaking.[ENTER]I'm too excited to even read the page. Phew...[ENTER]Ah well, let's see how the story ends. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._320_sayTitle", "29:F0BEBB1E", "Thirteenth Page: "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._330_sayReward", "405:FBA281E8", "We've finally arrived.[ENTER]After all our ordeals we now have the following[ENTER]mission: We need to perform the ceremony and[ENTER]activate the black witchcraft magic. I just hope[ENTER]we're strong enough. A lot of us are swaying[ENTER]slightly, because we're so exhausted from the[ENTER]long journey and from constantly being on the run[ENTER]from Lee Seop's warriors. However we still have[ENTER]to try or our kingdom will perish. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._335_sayTitle", "39:C9B515F2", "Continuation of the Thirteenth Page: "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._340_sayReward", "329:F3F64474", "There are seven of us. We did put on our best[ENTER]clothing, even if they do look like rags now. We[ENTER]are going to gather in a circle and hold hands so[ENTER]that the lines of power are sealed. Then we will[ENTER]start singing the magic words and hope that the[ENTER]black witchcraft does not make any more[ENTER]sacrifices.[ENTER]... "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._350_sayReward", "432:FE544A20", "... It's over...[ENTER]At the beginning it was all very promising. The[ENTER]room filled up with energy and song, but suddenly[ENTER]I felt really strange. My six fellow combatants[ENTER]fell to their knees. The temple began to quake.[ENTER]Then lightning struck and we were hurtled[ENTER]backwards. And then the lines of power broke...[ENTER]Now it is quiet. My comrades are lying dead on[ENTER]the ground. The magic didn't work.[ENTER]We have failed. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._360_say", "530:8C2BCC3C", "What? Is that all?!?[ENTER]That's crazy! All that work for nothing? I can't[ENTER]believe it. We travelled, fought, translated and[ENTER]mulled it over for hours. All for nothing! We're[ENTER]just as wise to it as we were before. However it[ENTER]does seem to be better if we keep away from black[ENTER]witchcraft, which is what I had thought from the[ENTER]beginning. But knowing is better than believing,[ENTER]isn't it? "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._370_say", "257:EC27E473", "We're going to take a break first. I have a[ENTER]headache and you're probably quite worn out too.[ENTER]I need to run it though my head first. When I'm[ENTER]finished, we'll talk further. Despite everything,[ENTER]you provided me with an invaluable service. It[ENTER]will not go unrewarded! "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._40_say", "231:761C57DF", "As you have already found several Diary Pages[ENTER]near the memorials, Uriel thinks that you will be[ENTER]able to find out more information about the[ENTER]secret dark witchcraft near the unexplored[ENTER]memorials. Go to the Shinsoo Kingdom and[ENTER]investigate the memorial in the Yongan Area. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._50_npcChat", "9:66DDAA34", "There it is! "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._60_say", "145:78B5335D", "This is the monument that Uriel was looking for.[ENTER]There is a folded page too! I should quickly take[ENTER]it to Uriel. "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._70_sendLetter", "25:A5870E16", "Found the twelfth page "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._80_targetVid", "14:92AC36A9", "Return to Uriel "},
	{"main_quest_lv55._90_say", "76:A3E8E73C", "You have found the twelfth page in the Pyungmo[ENTER]Area. Take it to Uriel in the Joan Area. "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._100_sayReward", "41:E5B33938", "Go to the Blacksmith. He needs your help. "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._10_targetVid", "29:AD8D791F", "Go to the City Guard "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._110_say", "263:759D4C3B", "Who are you and what do you want here?[ENTER]I'm verybusy so don't disturb me.[ENTER]Oh the city Guard sent you? I thought nobody[ENTER]would ever come. It's not a difficult task and it[ENTER]won't take long. Just the right thing for a young[ENTER]adventurer like you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._120_say", "209:2C0DB405", "I'm supposed to be getting a delivery from the[ENTER]Storekeeper - I really need a Pig Nose. I've been[ENTER]waiting for ages. Could you help me out and get[ENTER]hold of one for me? It's really important. "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._130_targetVid", "16:506330FE", "Ask the Storekeeper "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._140_sendLetter", "15:0FDEFC58", "Go to the Storekeeper "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._150_sayReward", "101:8ED18FD5", "The blacksmith is waiting for an urgent delivery[ENTER]from the Storekeeper. Go to the Storekeeper and[ENTER]ask him for a Pig Nose for the blacksmith. "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._160_sayTitle", "9:AD74B78E", "Storekeeper: "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._170_say", "170:AFE27DE5", "Welcome. I'm the Storekeeper of this village. If[ENTER]you have too much stuff with you, some of it can[ENTER]be stored at my storehouse. "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._180_say", "79:E53A24C9", "Do you want to... Ah, the blacksmith sent you for[ENTER]Pig Nose! "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._190_say", "137:EA830DD8", "I'm afraid I'm getting old and forgetful. In the[ENTER]past something like that would not have happened.[ENTER]Here's the Pig Nose. Please take it immediately[ENTER]to the Blacksmith. See you later. "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._200_sendLetter", "21:0F9571D5", "Back to the Blacksmith "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._20_sayReward", "88:66325950", "The City Guard has a new mission for you.[ENTER]Go to him and ask him what it is all about. "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._210_sayReward", "149:5957406E", "The Storekeeper has completely forgotten the[ENTER]delivery. He has now given you the Pig's Nose.[ENTER]Quickly take it to the blacksmith so he doesn't[ENTER]have to wait any longer. "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._220_say", "183:467E688E", "You came back more quickly than I thought! You[ENTER]should keep up this speed, it could be useful in[ENTER]the future. And now listen carefully, I have some[ENTER]important information for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._230_say", "218:FD0C3A88", "Do you know anything about refinement? Of course[ENTER]not! You're still a young adventurer! It's about[ENTER]this: If you give me a piece of your equipment, I[ENTER]can work on it for only a few Yang so that its[ENTER]attributes will improve. "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._240_say", "478:2385685A", "The art of refinement can occur in several[ENTER]different ways - the higher your aspired aim, the[ENTER]harder the execution. For an improvement of +3 or[ENTER]below you just need a bit of Yang and for[ENTER]everything else an additional item is needed.[ENTER]Like for instance, the Pig Nose your brought me.[ENTER]However, sometimes the item that you would like[ENTER]to refine is destroyed even if the process is[ENTER]done by a skilled blacksmith like me.[ENTER]Come around if you have some time. I can forge[ENTER]fantastic weapons! "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._250_sayReward", "37:E620F83A", "You have received %s experience points. "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._260_sayReward", "20:4D16ABEA", "You have received %s Yang. "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._270_sayReward", "25:AB3860F0", "You have received some Wolf Fur+. "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._30_say", "186:9216C407", "Hey, you there! Now is not the time to hang[ENTER]around and do nothing. You need to do some hard[ENTER]training! Training is the only way to increase[ENTER]your chances of survival in these times! "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._40_say", "244:6F3BA15B", "But as you are here anyway I have a mission for[ENTER]you: the Blacksmith was here a short while ago[ENTER]and said something about pigs and delivery[ENTER]problems. Perhaps he needs help. Go to him and[ENTER]tell him I have sent you. Off you go! "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._50_sayReward", "43:2A2A861D", "If you fulfil the mission for the Blacksmith you[ENTER]will get a reward. "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._60_sayReward", "25:A774B0E0", "Experience points: %s "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._80_targetVid", "14:B9B8E674", "Find the Blacksmith "},
	{"main_quest_lv6._90_sendLetter", "18:4E6135E1", "The Blacksmith's mission "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._100_say", "73:92F0FE6C", "Mount Sohan? I saw an old gravestone there once! "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._10_sendLetter", "10:0FB4C639", "A new clue "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._110_say", "257:287D8AA1", "You don't perhaps remember any inscription on it?[ENTER]Evidently not. This gravestone may be able to[ENTER]provide us with valuable information on the Dark[ENTER]Nation. Could you perhaps go to Mount Sohan and[ENTER]make a copy of the inscription for me? "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._120_say", "221:1C8986F8", "According to the research Uriel has carried out,[ENTER]the seven Dragon Priestesses belonged to the Dark[ENTER]Nation. Examine the Old Gravestone on Mount[ENTER]Sohan. The capital of the Dark Nation is said to[ENTER]have stood there centuries ago. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._130_say", "257:287D8AA1", "You don't perhaps remember any inscription on it?[ENTER]Evidently not. This gravestone may be able to[ENTER]provide us with valuable information on the Dark[ENTER]Nation. Could you perhaps go to Mount Sohan and[ENTER]make a copy of the inscription for me? "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._140_sayReward", "121:2B6B2B26", "You have located the old gravestone from the[ENTER]times of the Dark Nation and made a copy of the[ENTER]inscription. Take it to Uriel. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._150_say", "221:1C8986F8", "According to the research Uriel has carried out,[ENTER]the seven Dragon Priestesses belonged to the Dark[ENTER]Nation. Examine the Old Gravestone on Mount[ENTER]Sohan. The capital of the Dark Nation is said to[ENTER]have stood there centuries ago. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._160_say", "146:6B43F456", "Finally! Let me analyse the inscription...[ENTER]It says the following: the Dark Nation has[ENTER]dedicated itself to black magic and serves Sung[ENTER]Mahi, God of the Demons. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._170_say", "131:6653644C", "Oh my... Sung Mahi! Then perhaps the seven Dragon[ENTER]Priestesses attempted to summon Sung Mahi using[ENTER]the power of the forbidden witchcraft? "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._180_say", "82:BB16A1CE", "You've done well. For such efforts, it's only[ENTER]fair you receive a reward. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._190_sayReward", "37:E620F83A", "You have received %s experience points. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._200_sayReward", "20:4D16ABEA", "You have received %s Yang. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._20_say", "140:89FC6E7A", "Uriel has found new information on the story from[ENTER]the old diary. Seek Uriel out and find out more. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._210_sayReward", "16:8E82333E", "You receive %d. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._220_sendLetter", "17:BA39ADFA", "Dark Nation II "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._230_say", "383:570F67D4", "According to Uriel, the Ghost Forest once was[ENTER]part of the Dark Nation's kingdom. There may[ENTER]perhaps be further clues there.[ENTER]But this forest is full of dangers and the Metin[ENTER]stones have put all the creatures there in a[ENTER]frenzy. Find the Evil Tree in order to receive[ENTER]more evidence. Then speak with Uriel. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._240_say", "298:D229DB0A", "The Dark Nation is surrounded by numerous[ENTER]secrets. Thanks to you, we have been able to air[ENTER]some of these, but we are still missing important[ENTER]information. Please head out and hunt for an old[ENTER]document. It should be located in the Ghost[ENTER]Forest near to Mount Sohan. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._250_counter", "16:098847D2", "Pages remaining:"},
	{"main_quest_lv60._260_say", "298:D229DB0A", "The Dark Nation is surrounded by numerous[ENTER]secrets. Thanks to you, we have been able to air[ENTER]some of these, but we are still missing important[ENTER]information. Please head out and hunt for an old[ENTER]document. It should be located in the Ghost[ENTER]Forest near to Mount Sohan. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._270_sayReward", "170:B17FAA9C", "You have defeated the Evil Tree and taken the[ENTER]document. It has been written in a foreign[ENTER]language. Allow Uriel to translate it. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._280_say", "90:852A79F8", "Finally! You have found the old document.[ENTER]Hopefully it will shed some light on this matter! "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._290_say", "179:E95B3905", "But whaa...? There's hardly anything in it! The[ENTER]document is actually made of ten pages. Please[ENTER]head back into the forest and find the remaining[ENTER]nine pages. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._300_say", "31:FCE7EED8", "You still need to find %d pages. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._30_say", "133:78D86AA9", "How are you? Do you remember that diary and the[ENTER]story in it? The one that abruptly ends on the[ENTER]thirteenth and final page? "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._310_say", "239:2ADBBF42", "So, now we'll see...[ENTER]Apparently the Dark Nation ensnared the High[ENTER]Priestess of the Dragon cult using a curse and[ENTER]misused the holy powers of the seven women in[ENTER]order to carry out the ancient arts of black[ENTER]witchcraft. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._320_say", "279:E5696943", "To summon Sung Mahi, the black witchcraft must be[ENTER]used at the same time at seven different[ENTER]locations. But Lee Seop and his army managed to[ENTER]stop the ritual in time and foiled the Dark[ENTER]Nation's plans. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._330_say", "125:C5E62335", "This Nation was most definitely to be feared.[ENTER]They were capable of controlling human[ENTER]conciousness through black magic! "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._340_sendLetter", "10:C52BDBDB", "The Clue "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._350_say", "125:D0F0B88C", "Uriel has uncovered clues relating to the Gum[ENTER]Memorial in the old scrolls. Go to him to find[ENTER]out more. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._360_say", "413:DBA23F70", "Let's summarise what we have learnt so far: Once[ENTER]there was a people, who called themselves the[ENTER]Dark Nation and who served the demon god Sung[ENTER]Mahi. In order to summon him, they ensnared the[ENTER]seven Dragon Priestesses and misused their holy[ENTER]powers for the forbidden arts of black[ENTER]witchcraft. But this needed to be carried out at[ENTER]seven locations all at the same time. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._370_say", "174:F7AC7B0D", "The Dragon Priestesses only carried out the black[ENTER]witchcraft in this one tower and not at the seven[ENTER]different locations...[ENTER]This is why the summoning of Sung Mahi failed! "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._380_say", "67:95B66490", "The Dark Nation must have given the seven Dragon[ENTER]Priestesses the wrong information. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._390_say", "210:DF8AFE67", "Perhaps they too did not know how to do it...[ENTER]It could be chance, but the old scrolls mention[ENTER]this tower in relation to the Gum Memorial. It[ENTER]seems that they are talking about the Demon Tower[ENTER]at Hwang Temple. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._400_say", "240:6705D658", "We have finally found the decisive clue on the[ENTER]seven Dragon Priestesses! Calm yourself a little[ENTER]and then we'll talk about what to do next. I fear[ENTER]that a trip to the Demon Tower looms before[ENTER]you... "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._40_say", "231:FB8B1E62", "Yes, naturally. Seven people ran from Lee Seop[ENTER]and his cavalry into the Hwang Temple and in[ENTER]their desperation, they enacted the forbidden[ENTER]black witchcraft... in the end, only one of them[ENTER]survived. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._410_sayReward", "71:BE5B2E1F", "The next part of this adventure is available once[ENTER]you have reached level 66. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._50_say", "406:94D798D9", "Correct. I have carried out further research and[ENTER]found that the seven members of the holy cult[ENTER]were the Dragon Priestesses. In old scrolls they[ENTER]are associated with a theocratic people named the[ENTER]Dark Nation.[ENTER]Were these Dragon Priestesses part of this[ENTER]mysterious nation? Here, read this scroll through[ENTER]carefully and then talk to me again once you are[ENTER]done. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._60_sendLetter", "16:F6038A3E", "Dark Nation I "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._70_say", "262:2D07D954", "According to Uriel's investigations the seven[ENTER]Dragon Priestesses are from the Dark Nation.[ENTER]Examine the old gravestone on Mount Sohan. It is[ENTER]supposed that the capital of the Dark Nation was[ENTER]once at that location. Before you go, speak with[ENTER]Uriel once more. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._80_say", "248:D2FB8472", "Their unbelievably high-developed witchcraft and[ENTER]the fact that according to the diary, they have[ENTER]been destroyed by Lee Seop all points to the idea[ENTER]that the seven Dragon Priestesses were actually[ENTER]part of the Dark Nation. "},
	{"main_quest_lv60._90_say", "184:6EA632ED", "In the old scrolls there is a map. With closer[ENTER]inspection, you can determine that the capital of[ENTER]the Dark Nation must have been located on Mount[ENTER]Sohan. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._100_say", "366:B508A3B0", "Unbelievable! Do you understand what this means?![ENTER]Originally there were no demons or spirits in the[ENTER]Demon Tower. How it is now is the legacy of the[ENTER]Dragon Priestess. In a last desperate attempt to[ENTER]defeat Lee Seop's cavalry, she opened the door to[ENTER]this world for the demons using this cursed and[ENTER]dark ritual. At the end, she paid for this with[ENTER]her life. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._10_sendLetter", "10:F5D2F2BD", "The Diary "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._110_say", "416:8887B27C", "This is the opening that the Death Reaper and his[ENTER]demonic following used to enter our world.[ENTER]However the grand mission of the Dark Nation and[ENTER]the Dragon Priestesses failed: the summoning of[ENTER]Sung Mahi was not successful, Lee Seop to the[ENTER]opposite came to power and finally established a[ENTER]united world kingdom.[ENTER][ENTER]Thanks to your help, I have finally managed to[ENTER]solve the greatest mystery of my life! "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._120_say", "101:396FF2D9", "For your reward, I would like to present you with[ENTER]a Blessing Scroll. Please take my gift, I insist! "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._130_sendLetter", "22:8D192AB9", "You have post. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._140_say", "123:26902C1C", "The guardian has a letter for you. Read it and[ENTER]find out who the secretive sender is. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._150_say", "160:9909B509", "You have made yourself pretty scarce recently,[ENTER]eh? I am supposed to give you this letter - no[ENTER]idea who sent it, he didn't introduce himself. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._160_say", "327:109E8563", "The paper that the letter was written on seems to[ENTER]be very old. In hurried scrawl, the following is[ENTER]written:[ENTER]Have important info on the seven Dragon[ENTER]Priestesses and Sung Mahi. Waiting at the back of[ENTER]the Demon Tower in Hwang Temple for you. Am in[ENTER]the shadow of the tree. Hurry! Time is short! "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._170_sendLetter", "15:39466562", "Anonymous Letter "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._180", "122:FFA07E6F", "Go to the Hwang Temple and meet the secretive[ENTER]letter writer at the rear of the Demon Tower. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._200_say", "261:56FE6437", "Welcome! Allow me to introduce myself first: my[ENTER]name is Lee Chung. It is very brave of you to[ENTER]follow the instructions of someone you don't even[ENTER]know. I have not fooled myself in choosing you -[ENTER]and you will also not regret my decision![ENTER]Listen to what I have to say! "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._20_say", "179:445485DB", "Uriel has news on the last survivor of the Dragon[ENTER]Priestesses. Her diary should be in the Demon[ENTER]Tower. Go to Uriel to find out more. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._210_sendLetter", "9:6CE0169B", "New Evil "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._220_say", "42:918078B7", "Listen to what Lee Chung has to tell you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._230_say", "208:79306F40", "There is one reason why you should come to Hwang[ENTER]Temple: in recent times some very strange things[ENTER]are going on. And just now we discovered an[ENTER]entrance to a massive cave at the back of the[ENTER]Demon Tower! "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._240_say", "40:39B93A63", "A gigantic cave? What's inside it? "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._250_say", "472:E0AA5F0A", "In this cave, a new, unimaginable evil lies in[ENTER]wait for us. Our scouts talk of a gruesome[ENTER]creature that even makes the demons hide in the[ENTER]shadows. Its terrifying emergence and the[ENTER]insatiable lust for life it has makes us believe[ENTER]that this beast is none other than the legendary[ENTER]Agwi - one of the ten great devils of the demon[ENTER]world.[ENTER]If we are correct, then we are all in very[ENTER]serious danger. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._260_say", "81:8D28A0F1", "More terrifying than demons... this creature must[ENTER]be truly powerful and vicious. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._270_say", "276:9517967B", "So it is. My men and I have attempted many times[ENTER]to storm the Devil's Catacomb. But we failed[ENTER]every time and suffered heavy losses.[ENTER]In this matter we need the support of an[ENTER]outstanding warrior - this is why we summoned you[ENTER]here. Will you help us? "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._280_say", "30:DAF1AB4E", "Yes, I will help you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._290_say", "253:347E87F6", "Oh, that gives us new hope![ENTER]Now, as I know that you are standing on our side,[ENTER]I'll tell you the entire truth: I, Lee Chung, am[ENTER]commander of the Shadow Warriors. We are a secret[ENTER]elite unit of Lee Seop's army. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._30_say", "473:CB9D66D2", "Ah, good to see you healthy and safe again. Are[ENTER]you ready for a new adventure? We are still[ENTER]missing important information on the Dark Nation[ENTER]and the seven Dragon Priestesses. The final[ENTER]Dragon Priestess must have hidden her diary in[ENTER]the Demon Tower before she carried out the black[ENTER]witchcraft. Head out and bring me the diary.[ENTER]It's possible the Demon King has it in his[ENTER]possession. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._310_say", "290:FAA99ED1", "The Shadow Warriors have been in pursuit of one[ENTER]goal since that time, to prevent the resurrection[ENTER]of Sung Mahi. That is our mission. Let us attempt[ENTER]together to send this Agwi back to the hell he[ENTER]came from and then find out how he managed to get[ENTER]into our world in the first place! "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._320_sendLetter", "13:A9173E45", "No Time "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._330_say", "79:1CFE2D93", "Lee Chung, commander of the Shadow Warriors, is[ENTER]searching for you. It is very urgent! "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._340_say", "311:C58994C2", "I have an urgent request. Do you see the injured[ENTER]soldier over there?[ENTER]That is one of my scouts, who explored the[ENTER]Devil's Catacomb under my orders. Whilst doing[ENTER]so, he was attacked by the Agwi and poisoned. The[ENTER]poison is spreading across his body - he does not[ENTER]have much time left. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._350_say", "243:22B7B3F8", "He needs an antidote and he needs it fast![ENTER]Could you fetch some? You can find it in the Red[ENTER]Forest near the Red Dryad.[ENTER]He's one of my best fighters - save his life and[ENTER]I will reward you with %s. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._360_say", "21:FF5DC157", "I will fetch the antidote! "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._370_say", "142:9E3647F7", "Thank you! He's still breathing, but he is[ENTER]getting weaker by the minute. We have no time to[ENTER]lose! "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._380_notice", "29:B157DD22", "You have %d minutes remaining. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._390_sendLetter", "10:36B4EE22", "The Antidote "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._400_say", "235:A4DA3E2A", "You know from what Lee Chung told you, that the[ENTER]antidote can be found in the Red Forest. Trap %d[ENTER]Red Dryads for this.[ENTER][ENTER]In the Red Forest there are even greater dangers[ENTER]than there are in the Ghost Forest, so be[ENTER]careful. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._40_say", "137:553C4E1D", "You have defeated the Demon King and have[ENTER]received the Dragon Priestess's diary. Take it to[ENTER]the learned Uriel. He will analyse it. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._410_say", "90:9924B87F", "The time has expired. The soldier is dying, take[ENTER]the antidote to him as soon as possible. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._420_say", "29:B157DD22", "You have %d minutes remaining. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._430_say", "66:71006B6B", "You have finally found the antidote! Quickly,[ENTER]take it to Lee Chung! "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._440_say", "141:D7FDF5B3", "Here, quick! I think you have arrived at exactly[ENTER]the right time. That's a tremendous load off my[ENTER]chest. My men and I are extremely grateful for[ENTER]what you have done. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._450_say", "93:0EEA4E4F", "Thanks to your help, my soldier survived. Here's[ENTER]your reward for saving him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._460_say", "136:C9011299", "You took your time. He is clinging with all his[ENTER]strength to his life. Fortunately you have[ENTER]arrived in time. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._470_say", "180:18567BD9", "He seems to be coming through. But that was close[ENTER]- he almost died because you took so long finding[ENTER]the antidote.[ENTER]I'm sorry, but this is all I can give you as a[ENTER]reward. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._480_sendLetter", "7:A2389F66", "The Report "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._490_say", "94:450679D3", "The scout has regained conciousness. Listen to[ENTER]what he observed whilst he was in the Devil's[ENTER]Catacomb. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._500_say", "145:973B2D9E", "Thank you for saving me. I saw unbelievable[ENTER]things in the Devil's Catacomb. But then I was[ENTER]discovered, and... "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._50_say", "281:393EF4F6", "You found it! The last Dragon Priestess's diary.[ENTER]My hands are trembling with anticipation![ENTER]I will need a little time to examine its[ENTER]contents. Take some time to rest. I'll call for[ENTER]you when I can tell you more. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._510_say", "15:C9E3F767", "What did you see? "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._520_say", "385:C0C8A81E", "There were people in black cloaks with hoods,[ENTER]pulled over their faces.[ENTER]The snippets of their conversation allowed me to[ENTER]work out that they were Servants of the Darkness.[ENTER]But that is not all: A ghastly spirit in the form[ENTER]of a woman floated above their heads. The[ENTER]Servants of the Darkness were calling her[ENTER]Banshee. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._530_say", "66:C6BEA6A6", "That doesn't sound good. What do the Servants of[ENTER]the Darkness and this Banshee have planned? "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._540_say", "164:EB60D097", "The Banshee summoned the Agwi using black magic,[ENTER]these devil creatures come directly from the jaws[ENTER]of hell. They call the King of the Agwi Azrael. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._550_say", "272:CB5308EE", "I hastily made my way out to inform Lee Chung of[ENTER]this. But I stumbled and was discovered.[ENTER][ENTER]Ah, I just remembered, commander Lee Chung has[ENTER]something important he wants to tell you. I'd[ENTER]head to him now, if I were you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._560_sendLetter", "19:ED2CDF37", "Dark Threat "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._570_say", "111:F81BC14B", "Go to Lee Chung and talk to him about the new[ENTER]threat that lurks in the Devil's Catacomb. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._580_say", "362:4B314A97", "What my scouts reported is pretty frightening,[ENTER]right? The Servants of the Darkness, a sect of[ENTER]sorts, are responsible for the appearance of the[ENTER]Agwi. They have also raised the spirit of the[ENTER]final Dragon Priestess. As a Banshee, a[ENTER]manifestation of evil, she has returned to this[ENTER]world and using her magical powers, may soon[ENTER]summon the demon god Sung Mahi. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._590_say", "48:A0A87540", "What?! This Banshee is the spirit of the last[ENTER]Dragon Priestess?! "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._600_say", "378:858CDCD7", "Without a doubt. Even amongst her sisters of the[ENTER]Dragon cult, only she possessed the power to[ENTER]summon the holy four Heaven's Sentinels and to[ENTER]carry out the black witchcraft.[ENTER]Now we know who is behind this new threat: these[ENTER]Servants of the Darkness and the Banshee plan to[ENTER]complete the work of the Dark Nation and to[ENTER]awaken Sung Mahi! "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._60_sendLetter", "20:484C4C26", "The Puzzle's Solution "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._610_say", "292:9F82CC4A", "We have a lot to thank you for: you have saved[ENTER]one of my men from certain death and only with[ENTER]that, we were able to learn about the sudden[ENTER]appearance of the Agwi and the latest threat in[ENTER]the Devil's Catacomb. Take a little time to[ENTER]relax, and then we will start thinking about a[ENTER]suitable tactic. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._620_say", "67:D108F839", "The adventure will continue when you have reached[ENTER]level 72. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._70_say", "39:9D5F9C5E", "Uriel is looking for you. He has now read the[ENTER]diary. "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._80_say", "138:D9820C91", "Ah wonderful. There you are.[ENTER]The chronicles of the last Dragon Priestess are[ENTER]truly astounding. Listen well: "},
	{"main_quest_lv66._90_say", "582:01ADEE76", "My fate is now sealed! I have barricaded myself[ENTER]in the highest floor of this tower and Lee Seop's[ENTER]men are about to break through the door of my[ENTER]final prison. There is no escape, I have lost.[ENTER][ENTER]No! It can't end like this! It cannot all be set[ENTER]already. I have to evoke the black witchcraft,[ENTER]this ancient evil power, by myself and summon the[ENTER]dark forces.[ENTER]It will certainly mean my death. But my enemies[ENTER]will join in my ruin, if it is the last thing[ENTER]that I do! "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._100_say", "124:F8D19324", "What, you haven't handed it over yet? The Fishing[ENTER]Pole is for the Fisherman at the river.[ENTER]Hurry up, he needs it urgently! "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._10_targetVid", "18:0D8ADB8B", "Another favour "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._110_npcChat", "28:98238017", "The Blacksmith sends this new Fishing Pole! "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._120_say", "196:F41E1F88", "Thank you very much. At last I can lay my faithful[ENTER]but very worn-out old Fishing Pole to rest.[ENTER]For me, fishing is not only a living, but also the[ENTER]greatest pleasure of the day! "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._140_say", "85:BFD02067", "Ah yes, here is the payment for the fishing pole.[ENTER]Please give it to the blacksmith when you go back[ENTER]to the village. "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._150_sayItem", "38:23A374CF", "Fishing pole delivery receipt "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._160_sayReward", "133:49C94EEE", "You delivered the fishing pole to the fisherman.[ENTER]Return to the blacksmith with the payment and you[ENTER]will get your reward. "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._170_say", "167:2B3B7631", "Did you manage to find the Fisherman?[ENTER]Wonderful. Thanks to your trip I will save quite a[ENTER]lot of time. As a reward, I will give you some[ENTER]Yang and experience. "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._180_sendLetter", "7:58BE8B91", "Voucher "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._190_sayReward", "139:156B8A2D", "With this voucher, the Blacksmith will upgrade a[ENTER]piece of your equipment for free. Just drag the[ENTER]item you want to improve onto the Blackmsith to[ENTER]open the upgrade-window. "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._200_sayItem", "34:4B744D27", "Voucher for one free item upgrade "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._20_sayReward", "89:F0C54356", "Please go to the Blacksmith. He needs someone to[ENTER]make a delivery for him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._210_sayTitle", "11:27B7B9D5", "Hint: "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._220_sayReward", "150:45B034A0", "1) The voucher will not be shown in the Inventory.2) A successful refinement - as with any[ENTER]refinement - cannot be 100% guaranteed. "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._230_sayTitle", "32:46490129", "The voucher has already been used. "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._240_sayReward", "123:65AD9D4C", "You have already used the voucher for a free[ENTER]refinement. It is only valid for one refinement. "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._30_say", "234:FEC34B92", "Greetings adventurer! Could you do me another[ENTER]favour? Normally I don't ask other people to do[ENTER]things for me, but you seem to be quite[ENTER]trustworthy. Think of it as an honour! "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._40_say", "158:9D13993F", "I made a fishing pole for the fisherman, but[ENTER]unfortunately, I'm very busy. I don't have time[ENTER]to take it to the fisherman myself. Could you do[ENTER]it for me? "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._50_sayItem", "24:B588F0AA", "A very flexible fishing pole "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._60_say", "153:AD2FB406", "The fisherman should be somewhere by the river.[ENTER]If you deliver the fishing pole to the fisherman,[ENTER]I will improve one piece of your equipment for[ENTER]free. That's a fair deal; don't you think? "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._70_sendLetter", "14:BA08DAE4", "Find the Fisherman "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._80_sayReward", "108:183E6571", "The blacksmith made a fishing pole for the[ENTER]fisherman. Find the fisherman by the river and[ENTER]give the new fishing pole to him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv7._90_npcChat", "24:EDE936F6", "Who is the Fishing Pole for? "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._100_say", "255:309BE301", "Heaven's Teardrop gets its perfect brilliance[ENTER]from the magical unison of Hallowed Tree Gum,[ENTER]Blue Crystal Essence and Red Hell Quartz.[ENTER]The Blue Crystal Essence has to be obtained from[ENTER]the ruler of the Ice Land. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._10_sendLetter", "17:598E93F1", "Worn Stone Tablet "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._110_say", "120:26932162", "You have made a note of this striking[ENTER]inscription. Report back to Lee Chung on what you[ENTER]just read. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._120_say", "82:B66BC8B7", "Ah, you have returned in good health! If I am[ENTER]reading your face correctly, I assume you have[ENTER]had success? "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._130_say", "171:CCF0270E", "Actually, yes! Thanks to the inscription on the[ENTER]Worn Stone Tablet, I have managed to find out[ENTER]that you can summon the holy powers by using a[ENTER]magical gem, known as Heaven's Teardrop. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._140_say", "114:0B1AB42A", "Heaven's Teardrop... so it does exist. Have you[ENTER]found any clues as to how we can get hold of it? "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._150_say", "231:5580DA56", "In order to produce Heaven's Teardrop, you need[ENTER]Hallowed Tree Gum, Blue Crystal Essence and Red[ENTER]Hell Quartz. It says that Blue Crystal Essence[ENTER]has to be obtained from the ruler of the Ice[ENTER]Land. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._160_say", "221:E05649C6", "The ruler of the Ice Land? Hmm... They must mean[ENTER]Mount Sohan by that.[ENTER]I will show your notes to the Shadow Warrior[ENTER]mages and analyse it with them.[ENTER]I'll be in touch when I know more! "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._170_say", "86:8124BEE2", "Take this as a reward for your actions. I[ENTER]continue to count on your help! "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._180_sendLetter", "13:9CD53D6E", "Icy Treasure "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._190_say", "422:122F1252", "Commander Lee Chung has informed you that the[ENTER]first element required for Heaven's Teardrop,[ENTER]Blue Crystal Essence, has to do with the[ENTER]legendary Nine Tails treasure on Mount Sohan.[ENTER]It is closely watched by Ice Golems, Yetis and[ENTER]Frosty Ice Men. Hunt these monsters to come into[ENTER]possession of the Blue Crystal Essence. Speak[ENTER]with Lee Chung again before you head into battle. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._200_say", "176:F796D3F0", "The Shadow Warrior mages have found out that the[ENTER]fearsome Nine Tails of Mount Sohan watches the[ENTER]blue essence as if it is the apple of its eye. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._20_say", "145:830F2307", "Lee Chung, commander of the Shadow Warriors,[ENTER]would like to talk to you. He has found out how[ENTER]you can defeat the Agwi in the Devil's Catacomb. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._210_say", "186:AD89AEB8", "The Nine Tails' treasure is guarded by Ice[ENTER]Golems, Yetis and Frosty Ice Men.[ENTER][ENTER]50 Blue Crystal Essences are required to produce[ENTER]Heaven's Teardrop "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._220_say", "176:2D97C314", "Red Hell Quartz is believed to be located in[ENTER]either the Hwang Temple or in Fire Land. I have[ENTER]sent out scouts to find out more. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._230", "344:0FBEBC49", "Commander Lee Chung has informed you that the[ENTER]first element required for Heaven's Teardrop,[ENTER]Blue Crystal Essence, has to do with the[ENTER]legendary Nine Tails treasure on Mount Sohan.[ENTER]It is closely watched by Ice Golems, Yetis and[ENTER]Frosty Ice Men. Hunt these monsters to come into[ENTER]possession of the Blue Crystal Essence. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._240_notice", "135:AF4A1C91", "You search through the corpses of the defeated[ENTER]monsters and find a blue, shimmering gemstone.[ENTER]It has to be the Blue Crystal Essence. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._250_notice", "72:75744D33", "You need to seek out %d Blue Crystal Essence(s). "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._260_say", "68:F23FA797", "I think you have received enough advice for[ENTER]today. Come back again in the morning. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._270_say", "130:BB08D578", "These crystals are useless. Look for yourself:[ENTER]they have cracks. To be able to use them, they[ENTER]need to be faultless! Keep searching! "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._280_say", "72:BE812EC3", "These are of excellent quality! Keep it up! I[ENTER]only need %d more. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._290_say", "165:EF6D8081", "You have collected all the Blue Crystal Essence[ENTER]we needed. I can feel the power of Nine Tails[ENTER]within them. Amazing... They are positively[ENTER]vibrating with energy. Well done! "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._300_say", "67:EA452897", "The adventure will continue when you have reached[ENTER]level 78. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._30_say", "151:2480D4AB", "Unlike the demons we are used to, you cannot[ENTER]simply kill Agwi. We Shadow Warriors have already[ENTER]tried every means we could think of - without[ENTER]success. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._40_say", "148:392246F0", "But now I have found out that the Dragon[ENTER]Priestesses possessed the power to summon the[ENTER]holy powers in order to banish evil spirits. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._50_say", "292:A340815C", "In the Red Forest there was one of the Dragon[ENTER]Priestesses' holy temples. Search there for some[ENTER]ruins and any signs of their cult. Scouts have[ENTER]reported about a worn tablet made of stone, which[ENTER]has been covered by brushwood... Maybe we'll find[ENTER]something useful on this stone. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._60_sendLetter", "9:1CA3DF29", "The Discovery "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._70_say", "277:EDC94640", "Lee Chung has told you that the Dragon[ENTER]Priestesses were able to summon holy powers, an[ENTER]ancient white magic, which banishes evil spirits.[ENTER]Search in the Red Forest for the Worn Stone[ENTER]Tablet of which Lee Chung spoke, and acquire[ENTER]further evidence. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._80_say", "204:BC35A38A", "After a long search, you come across a stone[ENTER]tablet in the undergrowth that seems to have been[ENTER]lying there for centuries. That has to be the old[ENTER]tablet that Lee Chung was talking about! You[ENTER]painstakingly decipher the worn inscription. "},
	{"main_quest_lv72._90_say", "510:66ADCE8F", "Heaven's Teardrop is the most valuable secret of[ENTER]the Dragon Priestesses. The art of its production[ENTER]has been kept secret for generations and in[ENTER]extreme cases, defended with blood. Agwi and[ENTER]demons cannot readily approach the wearer of this[ENTER]magical gem. If Heaven's Teardrop is first filled[ENTER]with the strength of the holy powers, its effects[ENTER]are then overwhelming. It shines as brightly as[ENTER]the polar star in the sky, seven sun discs long. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._100_say", "65:82D7CBAE", "Ah fantastic! It worked. Here's your Red Hell[ENTER]Quartz. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._10_sendLetter", "23:91750EAC", "Red Hell Quartz "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._110_sendLetter", "16:B5AC0CCA", "Final Element "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._120_say", "288:89CBA7F5", "Lee Chung and the council of mages have[ENTER]discovered that you can acquire the final[ENTER]element, the Hallowed Tree Gum, from the Red Evil[ENTER]Trees. Go on the hunt for them in the Red Forest[ENTER]and collect 100 portions of the tree gum.[ENTER]Speak with Lee Chung first before you head out. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._130_say", "240:A45DEE2B", "Lee Chung and the council of mages have[ENTER]discovered that you can acquire the final[ENTER]element, the Hallowed Tree Gum, from the Red Evil[ENTER]Trees. Go on the hunt for them in the Red Forest[ENTER]and collect 100 portions of the tree gum. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._140_say", "124:8BF976D0", "This is the final step in the production of[ENTER]Heaven's Teardrop. Take care of yourself, the Red[ENTER]Forest is teeming with deadly creatures! "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._150_say", "49:AB816ED1", "You still need to collect %d portion(s) of the[ENTER]Hallowed Tree Gum. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._160_notice", "89:E11F2842", "You have found enough Hallowed Tree Gum! Take it[ENTER]to commander Lee Chung. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._170_say", "255:E9D7B1B8", "Is that the Hallowed Tree Gum? I can feel its[ENTER]enormous power. Fantastic![ENTER]Unfortunately I had to send all the mages on a[ENTER]mission. They will be gone a while. Is there not[ENTER]a chemist in your home town that goes by the name[ENTER]of Baek-Go? "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._180_say", "24:3706A6C1", "Yes, there actually is. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._190_say", "150:1B988CE5", "Ah, superb! Take the three elements and go to[ENTER]Baek-Go. He will be able to create Heaven's[ENTER]Teardrop out of them. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._200_say", "86:D0C03FE0", "You have a long and exhausting journey behind[ENTER]you. Please, take this reward for all your[ENTER]efforts. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._20_say", "496:0F94134C", "Lee Chung, commander of the Shadow Warriors, has[ENTER]found out more about the Red Hell Quartz. Three[ENTER]different substances are needed to make it:[ENTER]Volcanic Earth from Doyyumhwaji, Flaming Mane and[ENTER]Foundation Stone. Hunt Flames, Flame Warriors and[ENTER]Fighting Tigers in the Fire Land to get the[ENTER]substances. Then have 20 pieces of Red Hell Quartz[ENTER]formed. But before you set off to fight, seek out[ENTER]Lee Chung. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._210_sendLetter", "12:59774CE2", "Heaven's Teardrop "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._220_say", "112:62617DE4", "Return back to your home town, seek out Baek-Go[ENTER]and ask him to create Heaven's Teardrop out of[ENTER]the three elements in the name of Lee Chung. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._230_say", "104:80D6A0BE", "You've been away for some time. I was beginning[ENTER]to ask myself whether something had happened to[ENTER]you. What brings you to me? "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._240_say", "58:0E36D6C0", "Lee Chung has asked me to come to you for a[ENTER]favour. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._250_say", "231:93FA6826", "Lee Chung?! The commander of the Shadow War...[ENTER]Oh! Shhhhh! Quiet! Before you stands a Shadow[ENTER]Warrior mage. But that information is top secret,[ENTER]nobody in the village can know this.[ENTER]What favour does Lee Chung want to ask of me? "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._260_say", "61:DB79EEA9", "He requests that you create Heaven's Teardrop out[ENTER]of these three elements. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._270_say", "367:7D070EF3", "Heaven's Teardrop eh... He has so many mages at[ENTER]his disposal, why does he always leave the[ENTER]difficult tasks to me?![ENTER]...[ENTER]OK. Here we are then, Heaven's Teardrop.[ENTER]Beautiful! I will send it directly to Lee Chung[ENTER]via messenger and he will call for you when[ENTER]everything is ready. Can you tell me what it is[ENTER]for? "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._280_say", "165:E6AEF8AD", "I can't really tell you anything more specific.[ENTER]Only this: this stone summons the holy powers in[ENTER]order to banish demons and other evil creatures. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._290_say", "316:E3A77EB0", "Very interesting. I wish you the best of success[ENTER]in your task. As a reward for your actions so[ENTER]far, here's two Shrunken Heads.[ENTER]Now that I know how the process works, I am happy[ENTER]to help you should you need any further Heaven's[ENTER]Tears.[ENTER]Oh and would you send my best regards to Lee[ENTER]Chung too? "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._300_say", "67:2217E911", "The adventure will continue when you have reached[ENTER]level 84. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._30_say", "217:7ADC3290", "Our mages have discovered that the Red Hell[ENTER]Quartz needed for the production of Heaven's[ENTER]Teardrop carries the power of fire within it.[ENTER]This quartz must also be the reason for the[ENTER]unbelievable strength of the creatures in Fire[ENTER]Land. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._40_say", "191:BBE7CFAA", "Red Hell Quartz is created from three substances:[ENTER]Volcanic Earth, Flaming Mane and Foundation[ENTER]Stone. You can find all of them in Fire Land. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._50_say", "155:3F9FD596", "You did it! Finally we have the %d pieces of Red[ENTER]Hell Quartz that we needed. Your bravery and[ENTER]strength have exceeded my expectations again! "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._60_say", "122:6363000E", "One substance is missing. We need Volcanic Earth,[ENTER]Flaming Mane as well as Foundation Stone. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._70_say", "196:F84A83F8", "I'm sorry, but I can only produce seven pieces of[ENTER]Red Hell Quartz per day. This procedure is a[ENTER]challenge for my magical skills. I'm not even a[ENTER]mage! "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._80_say", "114:8D474D71", "So then! I will now mix the three substances[ENTER]together and attempt to make a Red Hell Quartz. "},
	{"main_quest_lv78._90_say", "129:98A14383", "Argh! The magic failed. Apparently I[ENTER]overestimated my magical capabilities. Next time[ENTER]will work better for sure. "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._100_say", "302:77888066", "Now that you have defeated General Tartaros, an[ENTER]entrance to a before-hidden floor of the Devil's[ENTER]Catacomb has opened. Prince Charon must be down[ENTER]there! Teleport to the sixth floor and face the[ENTER]prince of the Agwi. But careful! he is extremely[ENTER]strong and cunning like a devil. "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._10_sendLetter", "21:8FD03937", "The Fight Begins "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._110_say", "274:4D00D450", "The way you move through the Devil's Catacomb -[ENTER]freely and without fear - it's impossible that[ENTER]you are just a mere mortal![ENTER]The basalt obelisk on the fifth floor will act as[ENTER]a portal to the hidden sixth floor. "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._120_say", "217:CA6F9CA6", "Prince Charon delivers all his commands to[ENTER]Agwi-General Tartaros from there.[ENTER]What are you waiting for? Defeat Charon and[ENTER]frustrate the sinister plans of the Servants of[ENTER]Darkness and the Banshee! "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._130_sayReward", "63:ACE4ADAF", "You did it! Charon, prince over the Agwi, has[ENTER]been annihilated. "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._140_say", "513:F240F00B", "Exhausted but relieved, you wipe the sweat from[ENTER]your brow.[ENTER]Suddenly a shrill laughter shocks through the[ENTER]Devil's Catacomb, so piercing that cuts to the[ENTER]core of you:[ENTER]Ahahahaha! Too late, you pathetic humans! Our[ENTER]master Sung Mahi has already risen and there is[ENTER]nothing you can do to stop it now![ENTER]The day draws near that Sung Mahi will reach his[ENTER]full strength on the island where the evil[ENTER]dragons sleep. Your world is doomed! "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._150_sendLetter", "23:CD8BF044", "Unfinished Story "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._160_say", "74:BA7EA6CA", "Go to Lee Chung and report the Banshee's[ENTER]threatening message to him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._170_say", "221:A1EC3D95", "After you report your victories over Tartaros and[ENTER]Charon to the commander, you repeat the Banshee's[ENTER]formidable message. With a serious look on his[ENTER]face, he starts to talk: "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._180_say", "138:ABAEAF28", "I had assumed that once we defeated the[ENTER]Agwi-prince we would frustrate the plans of the[ENTER]Servants of Darkness and the Banshee. How wrong I[ENTER]was... "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._190_say", "166:13964621", "The Banshee must have managed to complete the[ENTER]resurrection of Sung Mahi together with Azrael,[ENTER]king over the Agwi. I shiver at the thought of[ENTER]it... "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._200_say", "359:3B71582F", "The island on which the evil dragons sleep...[ENTER]Hmm, they must mean the Dark Dragon Rock by that.[ENTER]It's an uncharted island far away from here.[ENTER]Even if we have not achieved what we had hoped[ENTER]to, we still owe you a great deal of gratitude.[ENTER]Without your help we would never have been able[ENTER]to uncover the cause of the mischief that lurked[ENTER]in the depths of the Devil's Catacomb. "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._20_say", "165:879777DD", "Lee Chung has received Heaven's Teardrop and has[ENTER]prepared everything for your mission into the[ENTER]Devil's Catacomb. Go to him to find out more. "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._210_say", "203:D73654FD", "You have accomplished truly great deeds, deeds[ENTER]that no-one but you were capable of. I will be[ENTER]ready to stand by your side whenever you shall[ENTER]need it, for the rest of my life. Farewell! "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._30_say", "307:A7914E4A", "Now that we hold Heaven's Teardrop in our hands,[ENTER]it is only a question of time before we defeat[ENTER]the Servants of Darkness and expel the Agwi out[ENTER]of our world! But the teardrop's entire power[ENTER]will only unleash itself when it is deployed in a[ENTER]specific location in Devil's Catacomb. "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._40_say", "292:3EAEC982", "We know of five floors in the Devil's Catacomb.[ENTER]On the fifth and final floor that we know of, you[ENTER]will come across Tartaros, the terrifying Agwi[ENTER]General and third-in-line behind King Azrael and[ENTER]Charon. Defeat him with the help of Heaven's[ENTER]Teardrop! "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._50_say", "32:5A8864CA", "But where is Charon? "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._60_sendLetter", "15:578E4AE6", "General Tartaros "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._70_say", "169:53988F80", "Only use the Heaven's Teardrop when you have[ENTER]reached the fifth floor of the Devil's Catacomb.[ENTER]The entrance to the Devil's Catacomb can be found[ENTER]at the rear of the Demon Tower. "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._80_say", "207:1C303B63", "The holy powers begin to take effect within the[ENTER]Heaven's Teardrop. You feel a tremendous power[ENTER]flow through your body. The power of this stone[ENTER]is completely mind-blowing![ENTER][ENTER]Defeat General Tartaros. "},
	{"main_quest_lv84._90_sendLetter", "14:A6A5717A", "Prince Charon "},
	{"main_quest_lv9._10_targetVid", "28:CA588AFC", "Find the City Guard "},
	{"main_quest_lv9._20_sendLetter", "36:85B70E99", "Talk to the City Guard "},
	{"main_quest_lv9._30_sayReward", "222:244B88A2", "You have taken the first steps on the way to[ENTER]becoming a true hero. It is now time for bigger[ENTER]things. Go to the City Guard and get your last[ENTER]beginner's mission from him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv9._40_say", "465:937CE639", "Are you ready to tackle some more difficult[ENTER]tasks? Remember that the time of easy tasks will[ENTER]be over once you have decided to fight for your[ENTER]kingdom. You will have to endure lots of battles[ENTER]and endless amounts of suffering. So be on your[ENTER]guard. Here, this is a reward for your previous[ENTER]efforts. I hope it comes in useful. "},
	{"main_quest_lv9._50_say", "222:3B68A50A", "From now on, the Captain will guide you. He will[ENTER]supervise your progress and give you tasks to[ENTER]help train you. Practise in battle and go see him[ENTER]afterwards. Good luck! "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._010_sendLetter", "22:5238B710", "Dark Dragon Rock "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._020_say", "182:6CB13A1F", "Your journey was long and arduous. But now you[ENTER]have finally reached your goal: Dark Dragon Rock.[ENTER]Seek out Admiral Angur. You will find him at Cape[ENTER]Dragon Fire. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._030_say", "96:F66163F4", "Welcome to Dark Dragon Rock, stranger! Have you[ENTER]come to help us in the fight against Sung Mahi? "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._040_say", "69:32039ED9", "Yes, absolutely. Lee Chung, Commander of the[ENTER]Shadow Warriors, sent me. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._050_say", "154:9C5FD1E7", "Lee Chung! He is a long time companion of mine.[ENTER]So you're here at his request. Aye, then I know[ENTER]that I can trust you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._060_say", "40:6F883C1A", "I thank you. What's the situation here then? "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._070_say", "201:D8158C87", "Demons rule over large parts of the island.[ENTER]Nothing and no one is safe from them. They are[ENTER]even eating each other. The dark influence of[ENTER]Sung Mahi has made them all lose their minds. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._080_say", "136:D0868C3C", "I could use your help. Could you explore the[ENTER]island and give me an up-to-date report of the[ENTER]situation? "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._090_say", "12:B8E85D39", "Of course. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1000_say", "7:9BB7C771", "Understood. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._100_say", "40:EF7B55DE", "I thank you. Wait, I'll show you the way. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1010_say", "99:B2723802", "You are very diligent, but that's not enough.[ENTER]Keep collecting! "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1020_sayTitle", "14:5AE5F987", "Collect Clay Bricks "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1030_say", "67:56413DB5", "Head into battle against the Manticores to gather[ENTER]Clay Bricks. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1040_1_notice", "48:6A50BB94", "You have collected enough Clay Bricks. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1040_2_notice", "34:863D98DF", "Deliver them to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1050_say", "34:6E53BDDD", "Speak with Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1060_say", "145:FD7551E0", "Very good, thanks to you we have enough materials[ENTER]to strengthen the defensive rampart. As soon as[ENTER]we are finished with that, I'll send a summons[ENTER]for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1070_sendLetter", "22:EAC67B30", "Lee Chung's task "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1080_say", "33:CB708AAC", "Lee Chung has a task for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1090_say", "395:5B674C7D", "Unfortunately there's some bad news that brings[ENTER]us back together: the Servants of the Darkness[ENTER]are close to their goal. Soon Sung Mahi will be[ENTER]undefeatable.[ENTER]We have no time to lose! Go to the teleporter.[ENTER]From there a ship will take you to Dark Dragon[ENTER]Rock. Seek out Admiral Angmur there. I have[ENTER]already sent a letter announcing your arrival. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1100_say", "22:94CAC879", "I'll leave straight away. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._110_sayReward", "68:93AF8D57", "Explore Dark Dragon Rock. Go here first: (%d, %d).  "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1110_sayTitle", "13:55CF5A9E", "Leave for the Island "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1120_say", "70:FAC847CF", "Go to the Teleporter. It will bring you to Dark[ENTER]Dragon Rock. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1160_targetInfo", "161:B8650DBF", "The arrow above the NPC shows you that this[ENTER]person wants to talk to you. If you cannot see[ENTER]the NPC on your screen, follow the flashing dot[ENTER]on the minimap. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1170_posInfo", "44:CD556EA8", "Follow the flashing dot on the minimap. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1180_say", "10:A4DD2054", "Remaining: "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1180_say_count", "31:A4907522", "You will receive the item after killing "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1190_say", "13:238C99BA", "%s: %d pieces "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._1200_say", "67:52065760", "The adventure continues as soon as you have[ENTER]reached level 91. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._120_sayTitle", "18:FCFE7EA4", "Situation Report "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._130_say", "67:8B9B2268", "Take a look around the island and then report[ENTER]your findings to Admiral Angmur afterwards. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._140_sayReward", "30:4922A20D", "This is your first destination: %d, %d "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._150_sayReward", "57:8821512A", "You have reached your first destination.[ENTER]The next one is: (%d, %d) "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._160_say", "69:BE901D7B", "You have not yet explored all areas.[ENTER]Please explore everywhere. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._170_sayReward", "26:C33AC826", "Your second target is: %d, %d "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._180_sayReward", "55:646059B5", "You have reached your second destination.[ENTER]The next one is: (%d, %d) "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._210_sayReward", "28:1276D77C", "Your third destination is: %d, %d "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._220_sayReward", "60:7729F97C", "You have explored all regions.[ENTER]Return to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._230_say", "34:6E53BDDD", "Speak with Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._240_say", "91:1DC41689", "After you have wandered through the entire[ENTER]island, the following realisation has become[ENTER]clear to you: everywhere is teeming with demons. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._250_say", "69:0B816A11", "You've done well. Take this here as a thank-you[ENTER]for your help. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._260_sendLetter", "16:41941F14", "Lee Chung's Letter "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._270_say", "133:745CE2AB", "Whilst you give your account of the current[ENTER]situation on Dark Dragon Rock, Admiral Angmur's[ENTER]facial expression darkens. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._280_say", "47:A82EA9F7", "I would have liked to have brought you better[ENTER]news. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._290_say", "151:07A18C12", "The demons on the island are getting ever[ENTER]stronger. If we are unable to stop Sung Mahi and[ENTER]the Servants of Darkness, may the Dragon God have[ENTER]mercy upon us. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._300_say", "41:50454B6A", "Yes, I'll admit that it seems pretty bleak. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._310_say", "214:9AB8B873", "Aye, you can say that again...[ENTER]Lee Chung must have uncovered a decisive clue. He[ENTER]sent me a letter with some important information.[ENTER]But it never reached me. The message was[ENTER]intercepted by the gnolls. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._320_say", "40:5BE7E691", "We need to find this letter. Can you help us? "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._330_say", "45:475F28B3", "Of course. I'm already on my way. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._340_say", "60:21306BBC", "I thank you. The gnolls are settled quite close[ENTER]to here. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._350_sayTitle", "23:1C2B7CEA", "Find Lee Chung's Letter. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._360_say", "173:89401465", "One of the following creatures has Lee Chung's[ENTER]Letter: Gnoll Warrior, Gnoll Archer, Gnoll[ENTER]Defender, Gnoll Magician, Gnoll General, Gnoll[ENTER]Lord or the Supreme Gnoll Guard "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._370_say", "118:DED717B0", "If we want to stop Sung Mahi, we need this letter!The thief comes from the ranks of the gnoll tribe. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._380_1_notice", "28:590F6650", "You have found the letter. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._380_2_notice", "31:A1E3C9D9", "Bring it to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._390_say", "34:6E53BDDD", "Speak with Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._400_say", "92:C1A36DA2", "You're back and you have the letter! Aye, I knew[ENTER]that I could count on you. Let's see it then. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._410_say", "489:91D0D132", "Greetings Angmur![ENTER]My friend, in Sung Mahi's empty camps we came[ENTER]across something: the Servants of Darkness have[ENTER]approached their allies on the island using[ENTER]secret messages. One such message was sent to the[ENTER]Gnoll Tribe. If you could intercept this, we'll[ENTER]be an important step ahead of the demons! I'm[ENTER]sending %s as support and wish you strength and[ENTER]courage in this dark time.[ENTER]L.C. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._420_say", "98:8531DEC0", "My scouts will find out whether the gnolls have[ENTER]already received the letter or not. In the[ENTER]meanwhile, take this here as a thank-you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._430_sendLetter", "17:705C10A9", "The Gnoll Letter I "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._440_say", "51:DAEB952F", "Admiral Angmur is looking for you. Find out what[ENTER]he wants. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._450_say", "170:801600A2", "The Gnoll General has already received the letter[ENTER]sent by the Servants. Can you obtain it for us?[ENTER]Be careful though: gnolls are extremely[ENTER]aggressive.[ENTER]They attack first and ask their questions later. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._460_say", "17:39C5C227", "I'm already on my way. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._470_say", "48:E0C11B77", "Thanks. I knew we could count on you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._480_sayTitle", "23:824A77DD", "Find the Gnoll Letter! "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._490_say", "64:AA4363C1", "Find the Gnoll General. He has the letter! "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._500_say", "80:F69F4883", "We have no time to lose. Please hurry and bring[ENTER]me the letter. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._510_1_notice", "36:DA48F0AC", "You have obtained the Gnoll Letter. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._510_2_notice", "31:A1E3C9D9", "Bring it to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._520_say", "34:6E53BDDD", "Speak with Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._530_say", "276:A41C4569", "You have the letter! Finally some good news eh?[ENTER]Hmm...[ENTER]I cannot read a single word. The letter seems to[ENTER]be encrypted. Our scholar knows his way around[ENTER]cryptology. I'll seek him out directly. As soon[ENTER]as I know more, I'll be in touch. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._560_sendLetter", "18:C1889462", "The Gnoll Letter II "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._570_say", "85:AC833674", "Admiral Angmur is looking for you. It seems to be[ENTER]important. Find out what he wants. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._580_say", "181:0D34F3FC", "The encrypted letter consists of two pages. The[ENTER]message can only be decoded when the two sheets[ENTER]are laid over one another. Lord Gnoll has the[ENTER]second sheet.[ENTER]Can you help us? "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._590_say", "12:B8E85D39", "Of course. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._600_say", "45:5D1CEC08", "Thank you. You help is invaluable! "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._610_sayTitle", "18:C1889462", "The Gnoll Letter II "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._620_say", "70:861621CC", "Find the second sheet of the Gnoll Letter! You[ENTER]will get it from Lord Gnoll. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._630_say", "67:2F27F667", "Time is running out! Hurry and find the second[ENTER]sheet of the letter. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._640_1_notice", "71:4A39B686", "You have found the second sheet. Bring it to[ENTER]Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._650_say", "236:4F6DEF0B", "Excellent, now we can decode the message: Hmm, it[ENTER]seems to be talking about dragons that sleep deep[ENTER]in the heart of the world. It speaks of a method[ENTER]with which you can awaken them and make them mad.[ENTER]Oh ho! That does not sound good... "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._670_say", "126:D28C49EF", "It seems the Manticores and the Red Thief Gang[ENTER]have also received letters. I will find out more[ENTER]about this news and then call for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._680_say", "38:ED1BDA9D", "Admiral Angmur has a new task for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._690_sendLetter", "10:85FD45AA", "The Manticores "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._700_say", "43:3688AFD0", "Admiral Angmur has a new task for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._710_say", "163:BE444210", "Good, you are here! Our information on the[ENTER]manticores is quite old. We need to find out how[ENTER]strong their forces currently are. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._720_say", "58:9C2B2DE3", "Can you go and spy on them? Their camp is not far[ENTER]from here. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._730_say", "27:427B0594", "Sure. What should I do? "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._740_say", "134:A8CFC269", "Defeat 50 Manticore Warriors, 40 Manticore[ENTER]Soldiers, 20 Manticore Executioners as well as[ENTER]defeating General Cor 10 times.[ENTER]Then report back to me. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._750_say", "10:A4DD2054", "Remaining: "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._770_say", "67:50FF9DD3", "The information you've got is not enough. You[ENTER]need to find out more. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._780_1_notice", "46:29D4E6DF", "You have gathered the required amount of[ENTER]information on the manticores. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._780_2_notice", "34:AFC9EE2F", "Report back to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._790_say", "89:E98F963E", "Have you completed your task? Very good. Then[ENTER]give me a report of the current situation. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._800_say", "275:7E532513", "The forces of the manticores is not particularly[ENTER]large. You have the advantage in the numbers[ENTER]game.[ENTER]But their warriors are well trained and are[ENTER]extremely tough.[ENTER]I would recommend that you strengthen the defence[ENTER]wall around the fort. It will not currently[ENTER]resist a manticore onslaught. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._810_say", "138:AE52C5F9", "Aye, that is the information that we need. I will[ENTER]take your advice and strengthen the defensive[ENTER]wall.[ENTER]Please take this as a reward. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._820_say", "34:6E53BDDD", "Speak with Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._830_sayTitle", "24:E3551CE1", "The Manticore Forces "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._840_say", "102:91D662B4", "Defeat 50 Manticore Warriors, 40 Manticore[ENTER]Soldiers, 20 Manticore Executioners as well as[ENTER]defeating General Cor 10 times. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._850_sendLetter", "24:C88E6478", "Strengthen the Rampart I "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._860_say", "76:3F5B5ACA", "Admiral Angmur is looking for you. It seems to be[ENTER]important. Go to him immediately. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._870_say", "131:E4B03B0D", "Ah, there you are. You were right, our rampart[ENTER]would not have withstood any attack. But we don't[ENTER]have the materials we need to strengthen it. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._880_say", "93:8579EE7B", "We need Clay Bricks and Fine Sand. Can you get[ENTER]hold of these building materials for us? "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._890_say", "12:B8E85D39", "Naturally. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._900_say", "128:DD152F09", "Very good. First search for the Fine Sand. The[ENTER]gnolls have a large supply of it. 50 buckets[ENTER]should be enough. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._910_sayTitle", "14:65D9FC63", "Fine Sand "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._920_say", "50:625D2865", "Fight against the gnolls and get hold of 50[ENTER]buckets of Fine Sand. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._930_say", "77:CFF866E4", "Unfortunately, what you have there is not enough.[ENTER]We need more Fine Sand. Please keep collecting. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._940_1_notice", "51:5332740F", "You have now collected enough Fine Sand. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._940_2_notice", "31:A1E3C9D9", "Deliver it to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._950_say", "4:4836E194", "OK. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._960_say", "178:88973B2A", "I thank you! With the Fine Sand we will now be[ENTER]able to strengthen the rampart.[ENTER]My men will get to work straight away.[ENTER]I will call for you as soon as we need your help[ENTER]again. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._970_sendLetter", "25:63BB7EED", "Strengthen the Rampart II "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._980_say", "68:8FE116D7", "Admiral Angmur is asking for your help. Find out[ENTER]what he wants. "},
	{"main_quest_lv90._990_say", "217:D7F878FA", "To finish the construction, we need Clay Bricks.[ENTER]The manticores hoard these like gold. I think[ENTER]that 100 bricks should do the trick. You will, of[ENTER]course, be generously rewarded for your help. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._010_sendLetter", "19:4B00C072", "The Manticore Letter "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._020_say", "38:ED1BDA9D", "Admiral Angmur has a new task for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._030_say", "197:3E14966D", "Aye, it is time once again to turn our attention[ENTER]to the scheming of the Servants of Darkness.[ENTER]We need to bring the letters that they sent the[ENTER]manticores and the red thieves into our[ENTER]possession![ENTER]Pay a visit to the manticores first. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._050_say", "7:1C9AC4BE", "Right you are. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._060_say", "117:6D00B163", "General Cor has headed out with the letter to[ENTER]give it to Martyaxwar. You have to stop the[ENTER]handover! "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._070_sayTitle", "19:4B00C072", "The Manticore Letter "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._080_say", "38:5C6F3149", "Defeat General Cor and find the letter. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._090_1_notice", "51:B2729F24", "You have arrived too late. Martyaxwar has already[ENTER]received the letter. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._090_2_notice", "34:AFC9EE2F", "Report back to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._100_say", "97:0114B0AB", "You are too late. I have already given Martyaxwar[ENTER]the letter. The fate of the humans is sealed! "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._110_say", "34:AFC9EE2F", "Report back to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._120_say", "32:535F7A77", "There you are at last. Do you have the letter? "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._130_say", "77:4A0C3EBF", "No, I was too late - General Cor had already[ENTER]given the letter to Martyaxwar. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._150_say", "189:009189CB", "Aye, well does not make the situation any[ENTER]easier...[ENTER]My scouts will seek out Martyaxwar's location.[ENTER]Here, take this as a reward in the meantime. I[ENTER]will inform you as soon as I hear anything new. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._160_sendLetter", "21:07261A58", "Martyaxwar's Hideout "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._170_say", "69:11CC5D6C", "Admiral Angmur is looking for you. He knows where[ENTER]Martyaxwar is located. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._180_say", "166:71742B74", "There you are finally! We now know Martyaxwar's[ENTER]location. My scouts have also observed that he[ENTER]has placed the letter in his Barb Necklace, the[ENTER]one he never removes. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._190_say", "25:DBA3B666", "I'll head out immediately! "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._200_sayTitle", "21:33CD010C", "Defeat Martyaxwar. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._210_say", "44:FC087E9B", "Hunt Martyaxwar down and take his Barb Necklace[ENTER]from him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._220_say", "70:9F360354", "We cannot lose any time. Hurry and bring me the[ENTER]Barb Necklace! "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._230_1_notice", "81:9D9D326D", "You have received the Barb Necklace. The letter[ENTER]is found in a pocket on the inside of it. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._230_2_notice", "31:A1E3C9D9", "Bring it to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._240_say", "30:EB3A1DBC", "Go to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._250_say", "141:E315E39A", "Good work. That was no easy opponent. We can only[ENTER]hope that the letter tells us more about the[ENTER]demons' sinister plans. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._260_say", "124:17E4D9FF", "Dammit, I thought just as much - it's encrypted[ENTER]again! Yon-I-Walker, our scholar, should take a[ENTER]look at it. Go to him please. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._270_sendLetter", "14:B11BBE62", "Decoding "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._280_say", "61:FE0DB31E", "Go to Yon-I-Walker to have the letter decoded. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._290_say", "50:4D95A96D", "*mumble* Woah, I spooked myself![ENTER]Who are you? "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._300_say", "30:507BC1AA", "Admiral Angmur has sent me. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._310_say", "60:BBE24388", "Ah, yes! You are here because of the letter.[ENTER]Angmur has already told me about it. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._320_say", "135:70D1E61F", "I was not able to decrypt the letter yet. But it[ENTER]seems to be the script of the crustacean tribe[ENTER]who dwell in Nephrite Bay. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._330_say", "110:CAF6E894", "To be able to interpret these characters, I need[ENTER]the crustacean tribe's Carapax Script. Can you[ENTER]get hold of ten of them for me? "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._340_say", "12:B8E85D39", "Of course. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._350_sayTitle", "17:93D796BE", "Carapax Script "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._360_say", "77:3D15E4D3", "Head into battle against the crustacean tribe and[ENTER]get hold of ten Carapax Scripts. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._370_say", "89:9803050A", "This Carapax Script has unfortunately been[ENTER]damaged and I cannot use it. Please bring me[ENTER]another one. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._380_say", "88:60658A05", "You have found the Carapax Scripts. They have the[ENTER]form of turtle shells. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._390_say", "111:65CD6BF3", "Perfect now I can decrypt the letter. Good work![ENTER]Take this here as a sign of my gratitude. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._400_say", "28:0AB7C2E0", "Bring me %d more pieces! "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._410_1_notice", "39:52593405", "You have found a Carapax Script. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._410_2_notice", "27:2D0FE88B", "Deliver it to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._420_sendLetter", "39:0CA1B464", "Manticore letter decoded. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._430_say", "93:043305E2", "Yon-I-Walker is looking for you. Go to him and[ENTER]find out whether he was already able to decrypt[ENTER]the letter or not. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._440_say", "344:EE32758B", "*mumble* ...ah! There you are! Thanks to your[ENTER]help I was able to decrypt a large part of the[ENTER]message.[ENTER]But I'm not making any progress on the last part.[ENTER]I fear that I need to ask your help once more. I[ENTER]urgently need Carapax Powder. You can find it on[ENTER]General Lobster or King Crab of the crustacean[ENTER]tribe. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._450_say", "17:96CAA669", "Carapax Powder "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._460_say", "182:D646AE14", "Yes, only the crustacean tribe have it in their[ENTER]possession. Even a small dose of this powder is[ENTER]lethal! Three doses should be enough. Good luck. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._470_say", "30:669FADEA", "I'll set out on my way immediately. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._480_sayTitle", "17:96CAA669", "Carapax Powder "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._490_say", "129:7448AF4E", "Go up against General Lobster and King Crab of[ENTER]the crustacean tribe and obtain three doses of[ENTER]Carapax Powder. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._500_say", "173:494B348A", "Carapax Powder is extremely poisonous. I need to[ENTER]wait a day in order for its effects to diminish.[ENTER]Come by again tomorrow, hopefully I will then be[ENTER]able to tell you more. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._510_say", "23:DC594281", "You have the Carapax Powder! "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._520_say", "76:F64D5D44", "Good work. Now I can finally decrypt the letter.[ENTER]Please take this as a reward. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._530_say", "28:0AB7C2E0", "Bring me %d more pieces! "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._540_say", "82:15AFE89B", "This Carapax Powder is contaminated. Please bring[ENTER]me a new dose. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._550_1_notice", "39:5695F70D", "You have found a dose of Carapax Powder. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._550_2_notice", "27:E95BCD6C", "Take it to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._560_sendLetter", "9:58E4ED78", "Poisoned! "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._570_say", "51:E80CE0FF", "Admiral Angmur is needs you urgently. Find out[ENTER]what it is that he needs. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._580_say", "84:5332BC1D", "There you are! Praise be to the Dragon God.[ENTER]Yon-I-Walker has been poisoned by the Carapax[ENTER]Powder. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._590_say", "260:34E16ADA", "He wanted to hurry and got careless. What makes[ENTER]matters worse is that our supply of medicinal[ENTER]herbs is used up.[ENTER]Seek out the Rock Flower - its roots can[ENTER]neutralise the poison. I've marked the locations[ENTER]where you can find it on the map. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._600_say", "12:B8E85D39", "Of course. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._610_say", "103:50B51661", "I knew that I could rely on you. Please hurry, we[ENTER]don't have much time! "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._620_sayTitle", "21:6F2B2435", "Save Yon-I-Walker! "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._630_say", "77:62F1FFDD", "Find the Rock Flower Roots, to be able to heal[ENTER]the poisoned Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._640_1_notice", "49:4395F47C", "Bring Yon-I-Walker the Rock Flower Root. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._650_say", "103:83A400F5", "*cough*[ENTER]*hack*[ENTER]Ah, it's you. I'm not doing well at all. Have you[ENTER]found the Rock Flower Roots? "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._660_say", "19:C28BD905", "Yeah, I have them here. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._670_say", "232:50945498", "Ah, I already feel better. It seems my time has[ENTER]not come after all.[ENTER]I thank you. Take this as a reward. Now I can[ENTER]complete my work. Admiral Angmur will inform you[ENTER]as soon as I am able to decrypt the letter. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._680_say", "38:0048AEA5", "Yon-I-Walker wants to talk to you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._760_say", "10:A4DD2054", "Remaining "},
	{"main_quest_lv91._780_say", "67:7F2B327C", "The adventure continues as soon as you have[ENTER]reached level 92. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._010_sendLetter", "25:D847DDE9", "The Red Thief Letter "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._020_say", "119:6596D46B", "The final letter sent by the Servants of Darkness[ENTER]is with the Red Thief Gang. Admiral Angmur has[ENTER]more information for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._030_say", "122:C8DC3F40", "We are coming ever closer to the plotting of the[ENTER]Servants of Darkness. The final letter is[ENTER]currently in the hands of the Red Thief Gang. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._040_say", "18:54B75C6A", "The Red Thief Gang? "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._050_say", "144:EE1BF5B5", "They are a group of criminals who were banished[ENTER]to Dark Dragon Rock. The strange thing about the[ENTER]red thieves is that here humans have allied with[ENTER]demons. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._060_say", "93:16D59DE1", "Demons, who have allied with humans instead of[ENTER]eating them? Curious. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._070_say", "192:E3A4C575", "They are united by a shared goal: gold.[ENTER]The red thief camp is not far from here. Defeat[ENTER]the Red Thief Executioner and the Black General.[ENTER]One of them has the letter. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._080_say", "118:8F7E223D", "However they were warned of our intentions in[ENTER]sufficient time and they have now torn the letter[ENTER]into four pieces. We need to find them all. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._090_say", "7:1C9AC4BE", "Right you are. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._100_say", "10:0A05E06D", "Thank you! "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._110_sayTitle", "25:D847DDE9", "The Red Thief Letter "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._120_say", "95:856DC064", "Fight the Red Thief Executioner and the Black[ENTER]General. Find all four pieces of the letter. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._130_say", "71:2374F93C", "The letter is not yet complete. Find all the[ENTER]pieces. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._140_1_notice", "72:38C12F10", "You have found all parts of the Red Thief Letter. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._140_2_notice", "31:B29EC3CF", "Show it to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._150_say", "34:6E53BDDD", "Speak with Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._160_say", "49:69B47938", "Good work. Here, take this as a mark of my[ENTER]gratitude. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._170_sendLetter", "25:D847DDE9", "The Red Thief Letter "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._180_say", "41:DCD3BA34", "Admiral Angmur needs your help. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._190_say", "33:D11A1BD2", "Good that you are here. We have a problem. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._200_say", "13:A3C6856B", "What's going on? "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._210_say", "281:B92DA7BD", "There is actually a fifth piece to the Red Thief[ENTER]Letter. Without this piece, the rest of the[ENTER]letter is worthless. I have already sent[ENTER]Bae-Yong, one of my bravest men, but something[ENTER]must have happened.[ENTER]He should have been back a long time ago. Can you[ENTER]search for him? "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._220_say", "65:27DB877D", "Of course! Do you know where he could be now? "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._230_say", "99:E6CBD378", "An idea, yes. He last mentioned that he wanted to[ENTER]head to Nephrite Bay. But nobody can say for sure[ENTER]whether he got there or not. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._240_say", "25:DBA3B666", "I'll head out immediately! "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._250_sayTitle", "19:1A9EA22B", "The Missing Soldier "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._260_say", "95:53026D55", "Find the fifth piece of the letter. To do so,[ENTER]look for Bae-Yong in Nephrite Bay. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._270_say", "119:BAD3345E", "You haven't found Bae-Yong yet?[ENTER]This is a matter of life and death! Please keep[ENTER]looking. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._280_say", "335:65E05836", "*cough*[ENTER]Thank you for finding me. I was heavily injured[ENTER]in battle and I fear that I do not have much time[ENTER]left...[ENTER]Here, I took this from a red thief. Take it to[ENTER]the Admiral. Go! I'll be o...[ENTER](He dies in your arms.) "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._290_1_notice", "80:62706B61", "Before Bae-Yong died, he gave you the missing[ENTER]piece of the letter. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._290_2_notice", "34:FF84C3FF", "Head back to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._300_say", "44:4715EAE0", "You are back! Did you find Bae-Yong? "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._310_say", "12:EE8C7412", "Yes, but... "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._320_say", "28:7382CCBA", "But?[ENTER]Oh no. Is he dead? "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._330_say", "175:C4D38F82", "I couldn't do anymore for him. My condolences. He[ENTER]was a brave man - he defended the final piece of[ENTER]the letter with is life. Here it is. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._340_say", "165:7CAF3F17", "The loss of Bae-Yong hurts us badly. But I am[ENTER]very proud of him. He completed his mission - we[ENTER]now have all the pieces of the letter. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._350_say", "136:84C79BFE", "I thank you for everything. Here, take this here[ENTER]as a reward.[ENTER]I'm going to light a incense stick in the temple[ENTER]for Bae-Yong now.[ENTER]I'll call on you later. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._360_say", "30:EB3A1DBC", "Go to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._370_sendLetter", "35:CD4B53B0", "Decrypt the Red Thief Letter "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._380_say", "120:FDD0E88B", "Admiral Angmur has important news on the Red[ENTER]Thief Letter.[ENTER]Listen to what he has to say. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._390_say", "120:34421558", "Ah there you are. The Servants of Darkness are[ENTER]giving me a headache. This letter is also[ENTER]encrypted. Please take it to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._400_say", "12:B1617667", "Got it. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._410_say", "42:CED0D1FC", "Take the encrypted letter to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._420_say", "64:7CD37890", "Argh! Do you always have to sneak up on me like[ENTER]that?![ENTER]What can I do for you? "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._430_say", "81:907FD5D9", "Here is the Red Thief Letter. Just like the[ENTER]others, this one is encrypted. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._440_say", "104:9613D56C", "Let me have a look. Hmm, this looks to be the[ENTER]characters of the tritons. Decrypting them[ENTER]shouldn't be too difficult. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._450_say", "27:82AD0ECC", "Excellent. How long do you need for it? "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._460_say", "132:3ABD87BD", "Not so fast. The decryption is not particularly[ENTER]complicated, but without further resources it[ENTER]won't work. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._470_say", "35:6ADABBFB", "Of course not. That would have been too easy. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._480_say", "255:B7D7A69B", "I see you have not lost your sense of humour,[ENTER]hehe.[ENTER]To decrypt the letter, I need Oin Scales. Of the[ENTER]tribe of tritons, only General Kappa and Triton[ENTER]himself may wear these rare scales. Please get[ENTER]ten of them. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._490_say", "22:94CAC879", "I'll head out straight away. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._500_sayTitle", "18:B8DE9566", "Find Oin Scales! "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._510_say", "81:AC8BE8FE", "Only Triton, King of the Tritons and General[ENTER]Kappa wear Oin Scales. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._520_say", "47:CEC37E76", "I cannot decrypt the letter without these scales.[ENTER]I need them urgently. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._530_1_notice", "43:435713B0", "You have found the tritonic Oin Scales. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._530_2_notice", "34:3873E431", "Quickly take them to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._540_say", "172:20D8F367", "You have done well. As soon as I have decrypted[ENTER]the letter, I will let Admiral Angmur know.[ENTER]You should rest up a little. Here, take this as a[ENTER]token of my appreciation. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._550_say", "38:0048AEA5", "Yon-I-Walker would like to talk to you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._560_sendLetter", "14:CD4AF983", "Dark Plans "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._570_say", "97:8D06D48D", "The letter from the Servants of Darkness has been[ENTER]decrypted. Admiral Angmur wants to tell you about[ENTER]the sinister plans. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._580_say", "298:74A8BF48", "We have managed to completely decrypt the secret[ENTER]message. Do you remember the letter sent to the[ENTER]gnolls? There they already spoke of dragons,[ENTER]sleeping deep in the island, as well as a method[ENTER]for waking them up and making them full of rage.[ENTER]Now we have found out for what purpose the[ENTER]Servants of Darkness are pursing this. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._590_say", "244:4AB46729", "If you then kill a dragon at this moment, when[ENTER]its mind is as black as the jaws of hell, it[ENTER]spits a Pearl of the Night out. With the help of[ENTER]this pearl, the immeasurable powers of Sung Mahi[ENTER]can be summoned to our world. That's their[ENTER]sinister plan! "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._600_say", "139:8CD7F933", "Our next steps need to be well thought out. As[ENTER]soon as I have any news for you, I will call for[ENTER]you. Thank you for everything. "},
	{"main_quest_lv92._610_say", "67:2E6E4107", "The adventure continues as soon as you reach[ENTER]level 93. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._010_sendLetter", "16:775AD556", "Stocking Up On Power I "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._020_say", "40:24A3EFBC", "Admiral Angmur wants to talk to you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._030_say", "39:8A42B785", "We are hot on the heels of the Servants of[ENTER]Darkness. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._040_say", "270:41E8628F", "To defeat them, we need to strengthen your powers.Do you know of the Inner Light? It is[ENTER]concentrated energy. Some mythical beings or[ENTER]plants have it in them. Yon-I-Walker can make a[ENTER]tonic from it. Go to him next. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._050_say", "7:9BB7C771", "Understood. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._060_say", "146:420D705F", "Ah, there's my saviour![ENTER]The Inner Light, oh yes... my tonic will make you[ENTER]an equal opponent for the Servants of Darkness. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._070_say", "177:A71C11A6", "For this I need the Inner Light of the cyclops[ENTER]and the giants. Only the tribe leaders of each of[ENTER]these groups will have it inside them. Take the[ENTER]cyclops on first. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._080_say", "7:9BB7C771", "Understood. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._090_sayTitle", "21:8B9A300F", "The Inner Light I "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._100_say", "77:84D87ED1", "Defeat Polyphemos, King of the Cyclops, and loot[ENTER]his Inner Light. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._110_say", "116:D98D10AF", "You're back with empty hands? I can't help you[ENTER]like this. Bring me the Inner Light! "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._120_1_notice", "74:FE9E65E3", "You have found the Inner Light. Bring it to[ENTER]Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._130_say", "28:132F8936", "Talk to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._140_say", "171:7B504E05", "So this is the Inner Light... before I work on[ENTER]it, it needs to be cleaned. That will take some[ENTER]time.[ENTER]I'll let you know when it's ready. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._150_sendLetter", "17:60ED366E", "Stocking Up On Power II "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._160_say", "27:5D512DB3", "Yon-I-Walker is looking for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._170_say", "136:06BC0734", "The Inner Light of Polyphemos is now clean. Next[ENTER]up we need the one that belongs to the giants.[ENTER]You'll need to defeat King Wubba to get it. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._180_say", "22:94CAC879", "I'll head out straight away. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._190_sayTitle", "22:C133903A", "The Inner Light II "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._200_say", "72:C09006E6", "Defeat the giant's king, King Wobba, and loot his[ENTER]Inner Light. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._210_say", "121:C81A9AF8", "You come back empty-handed? It would surprise me[ENTER]if you are not up to this task. Head out there[ENTER]and try again! "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._220_1_notice", "60:8304035D", "You are holding the Inner Light of the giants in[ENTER]your hands. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._220_2_notice", "27:E95BCD6C", "Take it to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._230_say", "28:132F8936", "Talk to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._240_say", "170:FD8F1E53", "The Inner Light of King Wobba possesses enormous[ENTER]power. I believe that comes from the size. I now[ENTER]need to clean it. This will take a while. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._250_sendLetter", "18:59D30934", "Stocking Up On Power III "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._260_say", "27:5D512DB3", "Yon-I-Walker is looking for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._270_say", "164:D842CE77", "You are here, excellent. I need your help. In[ENTER]order for the effects of my tonic to fully[ENTER]develop, I need one further component: the[ENTER]Millennium Essence. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._280_say", "46:EFCD9978", "Millennium Essence? Never heard of it. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._290_say", "252:78E2C587", "It is a very effective mixture made from various[ENTER]herb essences. Do you know Octavio? He lives on[ENTER]the mainland and is the only one who is capable[ENTER]of producing the Millennium Essence. Go to him. I[ENTER]hope he will help us. He can be a bit stubborn... "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._300_say", "7:9BB7C771", "Understood. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._310_sayTitle", "23:A604378E", "Talk to Octavio! "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._320_say", "113:457A94A2", "Seek out Octavio. He lives on the mainland and is[ENTER]the only one who can brew the Millennium Essence. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._330_say", "78:907A7917", "Hello! What can I get you? A Samgyetang perhaps?[ENTER]It's a house speciality with... "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._340_say", "113:3653E710", "Octavio, I'm not here for the good food! I need[ENTER]something rather different: the Millennium[ENTER]Essence. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._350_say", "287:61D25A5D", "Woah, psssst, not so loud! The Millennium[ENTER]Essence...[ENTER]No, that's not possible. How do you know of this?[ENTER]Only a few can handle the power that it provides.[ENTER]I don't want to take the risk. Go now, before[ENTER]anyone else hears you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._360_say", "294:814429ED", "Octavio, wait and listen! Yon-I-Walker from Dark[ENTER]Dragon Rock sent me. We need this essence[ENTER]urgently. Without it, we have no chance against[ENTER]the Servants of Darkness. And then the world as[ENTER]we know it, is doomed. Only you can produce the[ENTER]essence. Please! "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._370_say", "241:011B130D", "Yon-I-Walker you say? Hmm, he's an old friend of[ENTER]mine. We have had many a good chat with a better[ENTER]bottle of wine. I need to think about it. Come[ENTER]again in the morning and then I will give you my[ENTER]answer. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._390_say", "43:E053EB1A", "I haven't decided yet. Come again later. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._400_npcChat", "17:14233D85", "The Millennium Essence "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._410_say", "37:A8037CEE", "Octavio wants to talk to you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._420_say", "147:B3860CC4", "So, I have thought about your request the entire[ENTER]night. I am taking a huge risk in this, but I am[ENTER]sure that I am doing the right thing. Yes, I will[ENTER]help you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._430_say", "11:0CD7B708", "Excellent! "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._440_say", "104:31B38517", "However I don't have it in supply at the moment.[ENTER]Can you get hold of a few ingredients for me?[ENTER]Then I will produce the essence for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._450_say", "29:1A5D9969", "Of course. What do you need? "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._460_say", "99:28C61B36", "I'm missing Gango Root, Tue Fungus and Alpine[ENTER]Rose. I need 200 of each ingredient. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._470_say", "61:11195826", "I'll head out immediately. Where can I find them[ENTER]all? "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._480_say", "147:590C34E8", "You will find these plants at the most different[ENTER]of locations on the continent.[ENTER]Whilst you are searching, I will start here with[ENTER]my preparations. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._490_sayTitle", "19:16B53FE2", "The Millennium Recipe "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._500_say", "97:322722DC", "Search for Gango Root, the Tue Fungus and the[ENTER]Alpine Rose.[ENTER]You need 200 of each of them. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._510", "147:590C34E8", "You will find these plants at the most different[ENTER]of locations on the continent.[ENTER]Whilst you are searching, I will start here with[ENTER]my preparations. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._520_say", "231:03B89088", "Ah, you are back, very good. And you have[ENTER]everything with you. Then I shall get to work[ENTER]immediately. I must not be interrupted during[ENTER]this time. Come back tomorrow at the same time.[ENTER]By then the essence should be ready. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._530_say", "22:FA5B69DB", "Got it. See you tomorrow. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._540_say", "85:DBAB7B73", "I understand that you have an urgent need for it,[ENTER]but you need to be patient a little while longer.[ENTER]Come back again later. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._550_say", "19:CFCB2F68", "Octavio is looking for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._560_say", "141:1EBB78D9", "Ah, you have come at exactly the right time: the[ENTER]Millennium Essence has just now become ready for[ENTER]use! You can now take it to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._570_say", "10:0A05E06D", "Thank you! "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._580_sendLetter", "17:14233D85", "Millennium Essence "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._590_say", "27:5D512DB3", "Yon-I-Walker is looking for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._600_say", "151:DF022D3E", "You have the Millennium Essence![ENTER]Now I have all the ingredients for my tonic. I[ENTER]shall call for you as soon as it is ready. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._610_say", "7:1C9AC4BE", "Right you are. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._620_say", "67:DBE7B7E9", "The adventure continues once you reach level 94. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._630_say", "44:E1637146", "%s: %d pieces, %s: %d pieces,[ENTER]%s: %d pieces "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._640_say", "142:1DC83F4B", "I have a guest house to run - I don't have all[ENTER]the time in the world. Bring me all the missing[ENTER]ingredients, and hurry please. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._650_1_notice", "92:7FA0C368", "You have found all the necessary ingredients for[ENTER]the Millennium Essence. "},
	{"main_quest_lv93._650_2_notice", "17:0B7D4FA0", "Return to Octavio. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._010_sendLetter", "15:219B2CA9", "Leviathan Pearls "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._020_say", "27:5D512DB3", "Yon-I-Walker is looking for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._030_say", "112:65B8D92C", "I did it. I have managed to combine the most[ENTER]effective essences that are known to us with each[ENTER]other. I present to you: the Leviathan Pearls! "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._040_say", "10:0A05E06D", "Thank you! "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._050_say", "213:AF7E5CC3", "If you take these capsules, you might not feel[ENTER]any change. But a well-trained eye, such as mine[ENTER]or Angmur's, will be able to tell.[ENTER]Angmur wants to talk to you. Go to him now. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._060_sayTitle", "13:434F4F09", "Strengthen yourself! "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._070_say", "51:145F8CFD", "Swallow the Leviathan Pearls and seek out Admiral[ENTER]Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._080_sendLetter", "24:4D55BD64", "Call of the Thunder Mountains "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._090_say", "42:41AA1548", "Admiral Angmur has news for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._1000_say", "118:C2BF26BD", "I will need a little time for the analysis of the[ENTER]samples. Come by again tomorrow and then I will[ENTER]hopefully have the results ready. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._100_say", "252:48A79F97", "Ah, the Leviathan Pearls are showing their[ENTER]effect: I can clearly see an aura of power around[ENTER]you.[ENTER]My scouts have an idea of where the headquarters[ENTER]of the Servants of Darkness might be. The place[ENTER]is heavily guarded. Could you take a look? "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._1010_say", "65:2FCC2B65", "I will report my findings to Angmur. He will then[ENTER]be in touch with you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._1020_say", "90:90CC5886", "Admiral Angmur has information on the Black Gold.[ENTER]Go to him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._1030_say", "223:B2F1F02F", "Aye, there you are. The analysis of the Black[ENTER]Gold is not yet complete. I hope that I will be[ENTER]able to tell you more soon. Here, take this as a[ENTER]reward for your efforts. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._1040_say", "77:3ABAA5C8", "We cannot lose any time. Quickly, bring me[ENTER]samples of the Black Gold! "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._1050_say", "47:4A75DE75", "The adventure continues as soon as you reach[ENTER]level 95. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._1060_say", "10:A4DD2054", "Remaining "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._1080_say", "17:7357DEC8", "Missing amount: "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._110_say", "12:B8E85D39", "Of course. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._120_say", "114:07363A6D", "Thank you. Come, I'll show you which areas you[ENTER]need to scout. Report back to me when you are[ENTER]done. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._140_say", "91:ED289870", "Under Admiral Angmur's orders, scout out the[ENTER]Thunder Mountains. Your first target is: (%d, %d) "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._150_sayTitle", "14:56BB87F4", "The Thunder Mountains "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._160_say", "65:6E092473", "Scout out the Thunder Mountains and report back[ENTER]to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._170_say", "149:C815B254", "You haven't scouted all of the areas yet, right?[ENTER]We are dependent on this information. Please[ENTER]carry out my orders. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._180_say", "29:5E466315", "Your first target is: %d, %d "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._190_say", "26:C33AC826", "Your second target is: %d, %d "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._210_say", "27:4E967E25", "Your third target is: %d, %d "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._220_say", "60:9ACD2D49", "You have reached your first target. The next[ENTER]location is: (%d, %d) "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._230_say", "52:2AF34733", "You have reached your second target. The next[ENTER]location is: (%d, %d) "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._240", "22:12B1420E", "You have reached the third target. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._250_say", "109:39041613", "You were able to get an idea of the situation in[ENTER]the Thunder Mountains.[ENTER]Now report back to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._260_say", "26:5ED999E1", "Return to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._270_say", "132:8DC3C140", "Ah, you are back! Very good, we will evaluate the[ENTER]information that you have gathered and work out a[ENTER]strategy. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._280_say", "19:836A7AE1", "Here is your reward. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._290_sendLetter", "23:F11CEC4E", "Weaken the Red Thieves "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._300_say", "26:08909A34", "Admiral Angmur is looking for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._310_say", "141:21C6FEB0", "A direct attack seems to be too risky to me at[ENTER]this time. Before we go on the offensive, we[ENTER]should weaken the enemy's troops. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._320_say", "131:0597ECE0", "The following groups live in the Thunder[ENTER]Mountains: the Giants, the Cyclops and the Red[ENTER]Thieves.[ENTER]We'll attack the Red Thieves first! "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._330_say", "40:97904CC7", "What weaknesses do the Red Thieves have? "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._340_say", "132:859EE364", "The Red Chief always wears a special cape, a[ENTER]symbol of strength and invincibility. Rip him out[ENTER]of this cape - that will shatter the Red Thief[ENTER]Gang's motivation! "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._350_say", "46:22E36798", "The Red Chief? That won't be an easy task... "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._360_say", "104:A59C4FD8", "You are right. But if there is anyone that is a[ENTER]match for him, it's you. Good luck! "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._370_sayTitle", "14:8F0E8DB9", "The Red Chief "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._380_say", "59:8F21A94C", "Defeat the Red Chief and rip his cape from him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._390_say", "133:6DE1A228", "... failed? No, I don't believe it. Go take on[ENTER]the Red Chief again. I'm sure you'll beat him[ENTER]this time. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._400_1_notice", "22:0EC03B5B", "You have defeated the Red Chief. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._400_2_notice", "58:91D7D4C6", "Take his cape and bring it to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._410_say", "29:B5B215E7", "Admiral Angmur is waiting for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._420_say", "228:EC0DBAC8", "The cape! I knew you would do it. We'll hang it[ENTER]up near to their camp so that they can see it -[ENTER]that'll unnerve the Red Thief Gang.[ENTER]My people will take care of it. That way you can[ENTER]recover. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._430_sendLetter", "14:06B4937E", "Weaken the Cyclops "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._440_say", "40:24A3EFBC", "Admiral Angmur would like to talk to you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._450_say", "249:E1CA2C7B", "Our plan is working: when the Red Thieves saw the[ENTER]cape a great amount of disruption broke out. In[ENTER]the end, the demons and humans ended up fighting[ENTER]each other. Now this gang is completely[ENTER]disorganised.[ENTER]Next up for us are the Cyclops. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._460_say", "16:49BB9154", "How are we to proceed? "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._470_say", "192:3A938869", "The Cyclops worship their leader. If we eliminate[ENTER]the leadership squad, the Cyclops will break out[ENTER]in panic and scatter. Defeat General Outis %d[ENTER]times, Arges %d times and Polyphemos %d times. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._480_say", "19:4A417258", "It will be a pleasure. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._490_say", "18:56BC2C0B", "Be careful. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._500_sayTitle", "21:3F77954A", "Fight the Cyclops! "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._510_say", "64:71241EA9", "Defeat General Outis %d times, Arges %d times and[ENTER]Polyphemos %d times. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._520", "125:0ED05604", "I can hardly believe that you are having second[ENTER]thoughts about the Cyclops, of all creatures! Go![ENTER]I know that you can do it! "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._530_1_notice", "28:46E7814D", "You have defeated the leaders of the Cyclops. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._530_2_notice", "34:AFC9EE2F", "Report back to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._540_say", "30:EB3A1DBC", "Go to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._550_say", "195:1FE46BF3", "The news of your deeds precedes you! The Cyclops[ENTER]are on the run.[ENTER]All that remain are the Giants. I will gather[ENTER]information on their weaknesses and then call for[ENTER]you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._560_sendLetter", "15:C02C711C", "Weaken the Giants "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._570_say", "40:9B962A51", "Admiral Angmur is calling for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._580_say", "44:AA6B41CB", "My scouts have uncovered the Giants' weakness. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._590_say", "9:36315038", "Tell me! "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._600_say", "142:A9005A08", "The Giants possess a totem that has great[ENTER]spiritual value. If we take it away from them, we[ENTER]will be able to break their will. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._610_say", "24:CA8AF040", "Where can I find this totem? "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._620_say", "191:DC4D24C2", "The totem has the form of a large piece of amber.[ENTER]To protect it from thieves, it was split into %d[ENTER]parts. King Wubba and his Officers carry these[ENTER]with them. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._630_say", "7:9BB7C771", "Understood. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._640_sayTitle", "15:9F485B0A", "Giants' Totem "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._650_say", "33:98DFF3FD", "Acquire all the totem pieces. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._660_say", "129:972A5D7C", "The giants are very powerful opponents. But you[ENTER]have to defeat them and bring me this totem! "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._670_say_1_notice", "33:E7F57467", "You have gained all the totem pieces. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._670_say_2_notice", "26:5ED999E1", "Return to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._680_say", "153:CE0B1209", "Aye, I had started to worry! You really did it.[ENTER]Now we have the Giants' holy totems. Your reward[ENTER]for this will be great. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._690_sendLetter", "18:4029582A", "To the Thunder Mountains "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._700_say", "26:08909A34", "Admiral Angmur is looking for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._710_say", "76:122ED553", "My scouts have observed Cyclops as they gathered[ENTER]something in the Thunder Mountains and carried it[ENTER]away. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._720_say", "137:7768139C", "Find out what the Cyclops are up to. It certainly[ENTER]can't be anything good... I doubt that they will[ENTER]give up their secret easily either. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._730_say", "7:9BB7C771", "Understood. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._740_sayTitle", "20:88439797", "What are the Cyclops planning? "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._750_say", "68:4EBC99C1", "Find out what the Cyclops are gathering in the[ENTER]Thunder Mountains. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._760_say", "137:7768139C", "Find out what the Cyclops are up to. It certainly[ENTER]can't be anything good... I doubt that they will[ENTER]give up their secret easily either. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._770_1_notice", "62:AC38AA39", "You hold a shining black stone as well as a Slip[ENTER]of Paper in your hand. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._770_2_notice", "50:E307B15F", "Show Admiral Angmur your findings. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._780_say", "30:EB3A1DBC", "Go to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._790_say", "78:418063D6", "Have you found out what the Cyclops are doing in[ENTER]the Thunder Mountains? "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._800_say", "194:A05E4C1E", "The Cyclops were not willing to talk freely, but[ENTER]in the end I was able to convince them to give me[ENTER]this: a black stone and this bit of paper. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._810_say", "180:0FC05FBB", "We have located the veins of Black Gold in the[ENTER]Thunder Mountains and are now mining it as you[ENTER]requested. For the handover we will meet as[ENTER]planned within the Thunder Mountains. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._820_say", "105:B5A97D6C", "Black Gold... That is an ore that only exists in[ENTER]the Thunder Mountains. Why do the Servants of[ENTER]Darkness need it? "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._830_say", "38:35B0A5AA", "We need to find out what they are planning. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._840_say", "21:B0F576FA", "Here it says: "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._850_sendLetter", "13:85E6C737", "Black Gold "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._860_say", "66:A1192D59", "Admiral Angmur would like to talk to you about[ENTER]the Black Gold. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._870_say", "279:65188ADE", "The alchemist could not analyse the Black Gold.[ENTER]The piece is too small.[ENTER]We need to find out what properties it has and[ENTER]why the Servants of Darkness are seeking it![ENTER]Could you return to the Thunder Mountains and[ENTER]secure further samples of Black Gold? "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._880_say", "87:00A55A86", "Go to the alchemist first. He will tell you how[ENTER]many samples he requires. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._890_say", "23:B4BD2604", "Speak with the alchemist. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._900_say", "67:F55326D9", "Greetings. Has Admiral Angmur already informed[ENTER]you about your task? "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._910_say", "45:37165987", "Yes. How many samples of Black Gold will you need? "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._920_say", "69:47ADFE60", "Hmm, let me think a second. I think that %d[ENTER]samples should be enough for an analysis. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._930_say", "7:9BB7C771", "Understood. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._940_sayTitle", "21:F5B493C2", "The Gold of the Thunder Mountains "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._950_sayTitle", "23:1371984D", "Go to the alchemist. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._960_say", "58:456237FC", "Search for samples of Black Gold in the Thunder[ENTER]Mountains. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._970_1_notice", "69:67F03F51", "You have discovered a Black Gold vein and secured[ENTER]a sample of the ore for yourself. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._970_2_notice", "24:11CF3515", "Bring it to the alchemist. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._980_say", "151:533EAA7D", "Ah, you found Black Gold. Show me! Hmm, no tears[ENTER]and the piece is large enough... yes, I can use[ENTER]this for my analysis. Now I only need %d more. "},
	{"main_quest_lv94._990_say", "94:B2456252", "I cannot do anything with this sample. It is too[ENTER]light for a full analysis. Bring me another! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._010_sendLetter", "15:AC3FCDDE", "Gold Fever "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._020_say", "81:2FB5C821", "Admiral Angmur is looking for you. He has new[ENTER]information on the Black Gold. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._030_say", "300:B97BEA58", "The Black Gold extracts energy from creatures in[ENTER]its surroundings and releases it to another body.[ENTER]The Servants of Darkness intend to infuse Sung[ENTER]Mahi with stolen power! The Giant Captain Hooks[ENTER]hoards large supplies of Black Gold in the[ENTER]Thunder Mountains. Get them! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._040_say", "17:C401BF43", "Consider it done! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._070_sayTitle", "25:288E4773", "On the Hook: Captain Hooks "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._080_say", "63:79197C78", "Defeat Captain Hooks of the Giants and secure the[ENTER]Black Gold! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._090_say", "92:62A406B0", "We have no time to lose. Defeat Captain Hooks and[ENTER]secure the Black Gold! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._100_1_notice", "73:4BC333A2", "There was no trace of Black Gold. Instead,[ENTER]Captain Hooks was carrying a letter on his[ENTER]person. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._110_say", "34:AFC9EE2F", "Report back to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._120_say", "95:A9F0BB6F", "Aye, so you were able to hold your ground against[ENTER]Captain Hooks. What's that? A letter? Show me! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._140_say", "177:CA27EF1C", "Curses. Captain Hooks has already passed on the[ENTER]Black Gold to the Banshee.[ENTER]The last sentence poses a puzzle: The curse of[ENTER]life will be summoned from the fog of time by the[ENTER]army of darkness. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._150_say", "197:2F31ECA4", "We have to stop the delivery! We think that the[ENTER]Banshee's hideout is to the west on Gautama Cliff[ENTER]- a godless place, constantly enclosed in thick[ENTER]fog.[ENTER]Ogres and Lemures dwell there. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._170_say", "85:E881AE1F", "As soon as I know which route will be used to[ENTER]bring the Black Gold to the Banshee, I'll tell[ENTER]you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._180_sendLetter", "17:8DDC4E71", "Head off the Delivery "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._190_say", "83:8482C740", "Go to Admiral Angmur. He has more information on[ENTER]the delivery of the Black Gold. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._200_say", "204:D8A41156", "My scouts have found out that Captain Shruk,[ENTER]commander of the Ogres, is transporting the Black[ENTER]Gold to Gautama Cliff. He is carry it in a bag[ENTER]attached to his belt. Take it from him! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._220_say", "37:3858846C", "Understood. I'll head out on the hunt right away. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._230_sayTitle", "18:FAC2F9C9", "Head off the delivery! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._240_say", "94:BA14F59D", "Seek out Captain Shruk and secure the bag[ENTER]containing the Black Gold before it reaches the[ENTER]Banshee. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._250_say", "117:0B9F108C", "Captain Shruk is no lightweight. But you can beat[ENTER]him! Try again. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._260_1_notice", "17:55B5D3F4", "You have received the bag. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._260_2_notice", "26:5ED999E1", "Return with it to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._270_say", "38:CA456A2F", "Bring your loot to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._280_say", "86:4BC725C8", "The Black Gold is in this bag? Show me! Hey?![ENTER]There's just a note here... "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._290_say", "79:DBB1FA51", "The delivery of the Black Gold will take place[ENTER]once it has been completely processed. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._300_say", "182:2DCC242E", "Curses, the Black Gold is still in the wrong[ENTER]hands. At least we now know that it has to be[ENTER]processed before the Banshee can use it for her[ENTER]purposes. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._310_say", "245:D41F5C66", "It is still not too late yet. I will find out who[ENTER]is currently in possession of the Black Gold and[ENTER]whether it has already been processed. As soon as[ENTER]I find something out, I will summon you. Here,[ENTER]take this as a reward. See you soon! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._320_sendLetter", "30:BB84E8B4", "Stop the Processing "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._330_say", "85:1D81F00E", "Go to Admiral Angmur. He has news on the Black[ENTER]Gold. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._340_say", "176:70E9A568", "We have discovered that the Great Ogre is[ENTER]personally overseeing the processing of the Black[ENTER]Gold and will then take it to the Banshee. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._350_say", "150:BA22A1E9", "Currently he is holding up on Gautama Cliff.[ENTER]Prevent the Black Gold from reaching its goal.[ENTER]Quickly before it is too late! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._370_sayTitle", "12:AC9A1280", "The Great Ogre "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._380_say", "78:B32FDBE5", "Defeat the leader of the Ogres and stop the[ENTER]completion of the Black Gold. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._390_say", "51:EE642DFE", "Every minute counts! Stop the Great Ogre! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._400_notice", "20:B7D5532B", "You have defeated the Great Ogre. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._410_say", "93:C56A6AEA", "You can't stop us! The Banshee has already[ENTER]received the Black Gold. Too late, you fools! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._420_say", "87:9BC0DB2E", "The noose is tightening. Return to Admiral Angmur[ENTER]and give him your report. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._430_say", "34:6E53BDDD", "Speak with Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._440_say", "37:95F6CF0B", "That was fast! Do you have the Black Gold? "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._450_say", "69:068C947E", "No, I was too late. The Banshee has it already. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._460_say", "268:6BDC1E19", "May the Dragon God have mercy on us. But we will[ENTER]not give up so easily! I will send out my scouts[ENTER]to find out where the Banshee's whereabouts is.[ENTER]As soon as I know this, I will tell you. Take[ENTER]some time to relax and take this as a reward. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._470_sendLetter", "13:5AFA18B4", "Curse of Life "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._480_say", "65:71054591", "Admiral Angmur has new information for you. Go to[ENTER]him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._490_say", "330:E9671E8B", "We now know what is meant by the curse of life[ENTER]and the army of darkness. There once lived a[ENTER]horrible mage on Dark Dragon Rock. He had[ENTER]aspirations for domination over the entire[ENTER]continent and he literally stopped at nothing to[ENTER]achieve this: using black magic, he raised the[ENTER]dead and sent them into battle as his army. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._510_say", "202:360443BB", "Summoning the dead - even the thought of it makes[ENTER]me cringe. The Servants of the Darkness are using[ENTER]the Black Gold to create an army of the undead.[ENTER]We have to stop them! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._520_say", "175:58902414", "Search for the Lemures Magician in the old ruins[ENTER]at Gautama Cliff. He knows something about this[ENTER]curse. If you ask him nicely, I'm sure he'll tell[ENTER]you everything we need to know. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._530_say", "35:206C81AD", "Ask nicely... ho hum. Understood. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._540_sayTitle", "13:5AFA18B4", "Curse of Life "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._550_say", "98:B268FC3D", "Defeat the Lemures Magician and gather[ENTER]information on the curse of life and the[ENTER]summoning of the dead. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._560_say", "114:6B4C2968", "We have no time to lose. Defeat the Lemures[ENTER]Magician and squeeze information on the curse of[ENTER]life out of him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._570_1_notice", "83:1921F288", "You have defeated the Lemures Magician and found[ENTER]a stone tablet with an inscription. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._570_2_notice", "31:B29EC3CF", "Show it to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._580_say", "34:AFC9EE2F", "Report back to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._590_say", "68:78B352AA", "Aye, the Lemures Magician was carrying this stone[ENTER]tablet? Let me take a look. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._600_sayReward", "177:378C8781", "Three things are needed to awaken the dead:[ENTER]1. A human body[ENTER]2. ...[ENTER]The Lemures Tablet is broken here. The remaining[ENTER]part of the inscription is missing. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._610_say", "135:9265C484", "I fear you will have to head out again. We need[ENTER]the rest of this inscription.[ENTER]There must be two more pieces of the Lemures[ENTER]Tablet. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._620_say", "136:73BF272B", "Here is your reward for everything that you have[ENTER]achieved so far. Please now head out on the hunt[ENTER]for the rest of the Lemures Tablet! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._630_sendLetter", "11:DF321FD3", "The Inscription "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._640_sayTitle", "24:33146BE4", "Find the Lemures Tablet! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._650_say", "62:B8D1DFE5", "Defeat the Lemures Magician and find the[ENTER]remaining pieces of the stone tablet. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._660_say", "73:7FA6A2F3", "Please, we need to know what this inscription[ENTER]says. Don't give up! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._670_say", "72:CF860109", "Bring the two missing broken sections of Lemures[ENTER]Tablet to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._680_say", "101:15EF86D1", "Aye, you are back! Let's put the pieces of the[ENTER]Lemures Tablet together and read the inscription. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._690_sayReward", "314:E8DD50DE", "Three things are needed to awaken the dead:[ENTER]1. A human body[ENTER]2. Black Gold[ENTER]3. Tree Demon bark[ENTER]Only a magician with outstanding skills can[ENTER]summon the curse of life and maintain it. And[ENTER]when they die, the whole undead army falls with[ENTER]them. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._700_say", "221:3A4439E9", "So its for this reason that our cemeteries have[ENTER]been defiled and the corpses stolen from their[ENTER]graves. They are to be brought to life and[ENTER]marched against us as an undead army. What a[ENTER]sickening thought! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._710_say", "45:D5C8E2EF", "We need to stop this outrageous deed! "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._720_say", "310:D2BA47C5", "Aye, but time is working against us. Only the[ENTER]Banshee is powerful enough to summon a curse of[ENTER]this size - but we don't know where she is[ENTER]hiding.[ENTER]I will send out more men to find out the location[ENTER]of the dark high priestess. As soon as I hear[ENTER]something, I will let you know. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._740_say", "47:01A3C81B", "The adventure continues as soon as you have[ENTER]reached level 96. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._750_say", "34:AFC9EE2F", "Report back to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv95._760_say", "10:A4DD2054", "Remaining "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._010_sendLetter", "17:8F68DC10", "Prevent the Curse "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._020_say", "40:24A3EFBC", "Admiral Angmur would like to talk to you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._030_say", "75:29F58608", "Good that you are here. We have found a way to[ENTER]sabotage the plans of the Servants and the[ENTER]Banshee. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._060_say", "241:15D46C69", "So that the souls of the dead give up their[ENTER]bodies, a medium is needed. This medium is the[ENTER]Holy Ground that the Giants are storing in sacks.[ENTER]If you are able to loot 100 sacks, we will be[ENTER]able to prevent the curse of life. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._070_say", "25:DBA3B666", "I'll head out immediately! "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._080_sayTitle", "18:2915850F", "Holy Ground "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._090_say", "65:537F8DFE", "Defeat the Giants and loot 100 sacks of Holy[ENTER]Ground. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._100_say", "97:96B48886", "Time is working against us. Quickly, hurry and[ENTER]loot the sacks full of Holy Ground! "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._110_1_notice", "37:F40A82F2", "You have looted all the sacks of Holy Ground. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._110_2_notice", "34:0286B4B4", "Bring them to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._120_say", "34:AFC9EE2F", "Report back to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._130_say", "93:2E7770F7", "As always, we can rely on you! Please take this[ENTER]as a reward. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._140_sendLetter", "17:8F68DC10", "Prevent the Curse "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._150_say", "48:8F62677D", "Admiral Angmur has a further task for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._160_say", "187:F6CC167E", "The Ogres are also guarding a medium for the[ENTER]summoning of the dead. But we do not know what it[ENTER]looks like. Go to the Ogres and bring back[ENTER]whatever seems suspicious to you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._190_say", "7:9BB7C771", "Understood. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._200_sayTitle", "13:7A1E61DE", "The Ogre's Medium "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._210_say", "58:7B4BAC9B", "Defeat the Ogres and find out what form their[ENTER]medium has. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._220_say", "89:0E357C07", "I know that you do not have many clues. But[ENTER]something has to be there to find! "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._230_1_notice", "46:29C803A0", "You have found a Coin Bag and a Golden Medal. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._230_2_notice", "43:C66CFDCD", "Take the items to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._240_say", "34:AFC9EE2F", "Report back to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._250_say", "74:5E7B03D7", "Well done! I will ask Yon-I-Walker to analyse[ENTER]these items. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._260_say", "74:1B59A93D", "Find Yon-I-Walker and have him tell you the[ENTER]results of his analysis. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._270_say", "88:86E72440", "Ah there you are! I have already been able to[ENTER]take a look at the items that you found with the[ENTER]Ogres. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._290_say", "121:A3317ED9", "The golden coins in the bag are releasing a[ENTER]strong dark power. They are the medium. Please[ENTER]report this to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._300_sendLetter", "17:8F68DC10", "Prevent the Curse "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._310_say", "30:EB3A1DBC", "Go to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._320_say", "102:F5D41025", "Here, take the Gold Hunter's Band. Use it to[ENTER]locate the Ogres' Coin Bags. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._330_say", "169:93A9879D", "We need 100 Gold Coins. But I fear that not all[ENTER]of the coins that you will find will be used as a[ENTER]medium. There is a lot of work ahead of you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._340_say", "15:5DBD78C2", "No problem. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._350_sayTitle", "19:23F170D5", "Hunt for Gold "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._360_say", "195:BB4FB5B0", "Go up against the Ogres in battle and collect[ENTER]Coin Bags. Not all of the coins are mediums -[ENTER]have them checked by Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._370_say", "41:696293BD", "Yep, I can clearly sense the dark magic here. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._380_say", "233:BCDBCCFC", "Fantastic, we now have all the gold coins that[ENTER]could be used as a medium. That certainly won't[ENTER]please the Banshee! Here, take this as a reward.[ENTER]Angmur will issue your next task. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._390_say", "50:AABA44DF", "There are still gold coins missing. Collect %d[ENTER]more. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._400_sendLetter", "17:8F68DC10", "Prevent the Curse "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._410_say", "26:08909A34", "Admiral Angmur is looking for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._420_say", "76:4F538E2B", "We need to ensure that the Servants of the[ENTER]Darkness are not able to get hold of the Tree[ENTER]Demon Bark. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._430_say", "297:3E4C490B", "Tree Demons are one of the most mysterious[ENTER]species in our world and serve no one person, not[ENTER]even Sung Mahi.[ENTER]There are three types of them on Gautama Cliff:[ENTER]Aku-Boku, Arboretum and Sycomore. Pull the bark[ENTER]off of them! "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._450_say", "7:9BB7C771", "Understood. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._460_sayTitle", "24:F955A6D8", "Pruning the Tree Demons "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._470_say", "47:E5EFF2CB", "Pull the bark off of an Aku-Boku, an Arboretum[ENTER]and a Sycomore. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._480_counterName", "10:A4DD2054", "Remaining "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._500_say", "94:FAFAED52", "Time is pressing. Make chippings out of the Tree[ENTER]Demons and secure their bark before the Servants[ENTER]do! "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._510_1_notice", "107:F725E69C", "You have defeated all of the Tree Demons, but[ENTER]somebody got there before you: the bark has[ENTER]already been pulled from the trunks. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._510_2_notice", "33:3CA18ED4", "Report this news to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._520_say", "34:AFC9EE2F", "Report back to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._530_say", "118:C27FB683", "Good to see you return unharmed! Were you[ENTER]successful? What?! The bark was already pulled[ENTER]from the Tree Demons and there were fresh signs[ENTER]of battle? The Servants of the Darkness must have[ENTER]gotten there before us. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._550_say", "308:DAE987C1", "If they have the bark, then they will also find a[ENTER]way to summon the curse of life. It seems it is[ENTER]unavoidable - we are heading into war. The[ENTER]Banshee will not be able to hide from us much[ENTER]longer. My men are already on her tracks. I will[ENTER]call for you when we have found her. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._560_sayTitle", "47:69F94380", "The adventure continues as soon as you have[ENTER]reached level 97. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._570_counterName", "10:A4DD2054", "Remaining "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._580_sayReward", "13:238C99BA", "%s: %d pieces "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._590_say", "193:DB4EE53A", "The gold coins serve as a medium then. Good, then[ENTER]I will seek advice from Yon-I-Walker about what[ENTER]our next move will be. I will be in touch with[ENTER]you soon. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._620_1_notice", "31:EF7819F8", "You have received a Coin Bag. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._620_2_notice", "27:C3C91C73", "Bring it to Yon-I-Walker. "},
	{"main_quest_lv96._630_say", "50:9039C54B", "That is just a normal coin, not a medium. Keep[ENTER]looking! "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._010_sendLetter", "18:B6C81B0F", "Stop the Banshee "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._020_say", "115:81E4F4ED", "The Banshee's hideout has been discovered! Go to[ENTER]Admiral Angmur to find out more. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._030_say", "293:3D2DDB05", "My men have finally found the Banshee base on[ENTER]Gautama Cliff. She is holed up deep in the[ENTER]darkness of the forests in this area and is[ENTER]working on her black magic from there.[ENTER]Additionally, she has reawakened one of her[ENTER]former Dragon Cult Temple Servants. Together with[ENTER]her, she intends to summon the curse of life. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._040_say", "172:F4B840F7", "Without her help, the Banshee will not be able to[ENTER]maintain the curse. Defeat the Temple Servant[ENTER]Mu-Shu and calm the souls of our comrades, before[ENTER]their bodies rise up against us. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._050_say", "226:BA42D4EF", "It is almost impossible to get near to the Temple[ENTER]Servant undetected in order to attack her. Use[ENTER]the moment when she is so deep in her dark magic[ENTER]that she falls into a trance! "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._060_say", "12:B1617667", "Got it. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._070_say", "168:8168CE5C", "Take care! In life, she was the primary bodyguard[ENTER]for the high priestess and was well trained not[ENTER]only in magic, but also in sword combat. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._080_sayTitle", "19:353850C5", "The Temple Servant "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._090_say", "70:21976799", "Defeat Mu-Shu, the Banshee's Temple Servant, at[ENTER]Gautama Cliff. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._100_notice", "63:EB03D8D0", "Killer blow struck, the Temple Servant sinks to[ENTER]the ground. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._110_say", "295:EA03CCCD", "You fools! You willingly took the bait that the[ENTER]Banshee set out for you. Whilst you wasted your[ENTER]time with me, the mistress and Yah-Ki, the true[ENTER]Temple Servant, have already begun the curse. I[ENTER]pray that it succeeds! "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._120_say", "197:2F1800EF", "Her doppelganger put you on the wrong track![ENTER]Searching the body, you find a necklace similar[ENTER]to the one Martyaxwar had before. There is a[ENTER]document in an inner pocket. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._130_say", "34:AFC9EE2F", "Report back to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._140_say", "70:44DB65CB", "You are back! Did you defeat the Temple Servant? "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._150_say", "168:7FDF5702", "No, we were deceived by a doppelganger. The real[ENTER]Temple Servant was able to prepare the raising of[ENTER]the dead in peace. But I did manage to find this[ENTER]document. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._160_say", "78:A9878969", "Curses! How could we fall for her little game?![ENTER]Please, show me the document. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._190_say", "291:A6AE8AD4", "Hmm, encrypted. But perhaps this message may[ENTER]reveal to us where her base is actually hidden. I[ENTER]have seen characters such as these once before...[ENTER]I believe that Yak-Hwan, the Palace Guard, showed[ENTER]me something similar recently. Go to him. He[ENTER]should take a look at it. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._200_sendLetter", "19:2148840A", "Decrypt document "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._210_say", "61:55FE4E83", "Go to Yak-Hwan and show him the encrypted[ENTER]document. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._220_say", "183:4201A1B0", "Greetings! My name is Yak-Hwan. It is an honour[ENTER]to meet you. Your deeds are already legendary![ENTER]What can I do for you? Ah, an encrypted message.[ENTER]Let me take a look. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._230_say", "169:E09F8078", "Yes, I should be able to decrypt these characters[ENTER]without a problem. Although, to be able to do so,[ENTER]I require Fossil Earth. The alchemist probably[ENTER]has a clump of it lying about. Please go and ask[ENTER]him for it. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._260_say", "12:B8E85D39", "Of course. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._270_sayTitle", "19:726B0332", "Fossil Earth "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._280_say", "59:E38349F3", "Go to the alchemist and ask him about the Fossil[ENTER]Earth. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._290_say", "104:19DA4DA6", "Have you not forgotten something? You need to[ENTER]bring me the Fossil Earth. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._300_notice", "68:48F0EF4C", "The alchemist has given you the Fossil Earth. Now[ENTER]return to Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._310_say", "102:26AC3FEC", "Ah, the Fossil Earth. Very good, I shall get to[ENTER]work. I will report what I find out to the[ENTER]Admiral. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._320_sendLetter", "17:11223335", "Through the back door "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._330_say", "26:08909A34", "Admiral Angmur is looking for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._340_say", "221:8DB4D4FA", "We now know where the Temple Servant Yah-Ki is[ENTER]residing. But the base resembles a fortress -[ENTER]guard troops patrol there around the clock. A[ENTER]frontal attack at this time would be pure[ENTER]suicide. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._350_say", "140:0339C76F", "For this reason, we want to attack in an ambush.[ENTER]My men are searching for a suitable location.[ENTER]Distract the guards to provide us with more time. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._370_say", "290:53568DC3", "The greatest danger comes from a troop of guards[ENTER]who call themselves the Brigade of Black Death.[ENTER]This brigade consists of Moghu, Carnifex and[ENTER]General Albus. Their leader is Skeletos.[ENTER]Eliminate them, before they uncover my scouting[ENTER]troop. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._380_say", "7:1C9AC4BE", "Right you are. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._390_sayTitle", "24:C65292D6", "Brigade of Black Death "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._400_say", "106:4A8B25E7", "Eliminate the Brigade of Black Death, comprising[ENTER]of Moghu, Carnifex, General Albus and Skeletos. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._410_say", "85:F4BB2A1E", "Defeat the members of the Brigade of Black Death[ENTER]before they uncover the scouting troop. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._420_say", "34:AFC9EE2F", "Report back to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._430_say", "234:4CF5E644", "Our plan is ready to go! Whilst you distracted[ENTER]the Brigade of Black Death, my men have located a[ENTER]suitable position for an ambush. As soon as our[ENTER]attack strategy is ready, I will call for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._440_sendLetter", "19:353850C5", "The Temple Servant "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._450_say", "41:3367FC93", "Admiral Angmur needs your help! "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._460_say", "139:3EA612CE", "Good, you are here. Skeletos, leader of the[ENTER]Brigade of Black Death, has survived and attacked[ENTER]my men just as they planned to storm the base.[ENTER]Nobody could get past him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._480_say", "189:473DDBFA", "You have defeated him once, please help my people[ENTER]on Gautama Cliff! Go up against Skeletos.[ENTER]Afterwards, storm the base and kill the Temple[ENTER]Servant Yah-Ki. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._490_say", "7:9BB7C771", "Understood. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._510_sayTitle", "15:196F7CFD", "Defeat Yah-Ki "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._520_say", "88:B6C8DB94", "Defeat the Temple Servant Yah-Ki and stop her[ENTER]from summoning the army of the dead. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._530_say", "271:C3669139", "The decisive day has arrived. If we fall, the[ENTER]world falls with us. But if we are victorious,[ENTER]our deeds will still be sung in songs one hundred[ENTER]years from now. Stop the Servants of Darkness.[ENTER]Defeat the Temple Servant Yah-Ki! "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._540_say", "143:3AE83B3B", "Why are you here? The battle is not yet won![ENTER]Defeat the Temple Servant Yah-Ki. All our hopes[ENTER]rest on you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._550_1_notice", "75:93269264", "You have brought your opponent to their knees and[ENTER]victory is yours! "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._550_2_notice", "80:47E5048D", "There's no time for relaxing - the Temple Servant[ENTER]Yah-Ki is waiting for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._560_notice", "67:8133AD3E", "You have won! With a bloodcurdling scream, Yah-Ki[ENTER]sinks to the ground. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._570_say", "125:D066EDCC", "Aaargh! This cannot be! Defeated by a mortal...[ENTER]oh, Banshee, forgive me! I have failed. I could[ENTER]not complete my ta... "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._580_say", "103:A243B8CF", "You search amongst her lifeless body and find a[ENTER]sealed letter. Return with it to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._590_say", "88:D1762976", "Aye, praise be to the Dragon God! You are back,[ENTER]unharmed too! Did you defeat the Temple Servant? "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._600_say", "170:A09EE0EA", "Yes, I sent her back to the Hell that she crawled[ENTER]out from. At the point of death she begged the[ENTER]Banshee for forgiveness for her failure. She was[ENTER]carrying this. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._610_say", "28:C4AFE5C7", "A Sealed Letter. Show me! "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._620_sayReward", "512:FCC16F21", "My Mistress, They swallowed our bait whole and[ENTER]your plan is working. The summoning of your[ENTER]undead army is moving forward and nobody will be[ENTER]able to stop us now. Once the soulless bodies[ENTER]start to march, we will attack Cape Dragon Fire[ENTER]and bury its population beneath us. We will then[ENTER]head across to the mainland and meet you in[ENTER]Fireland. The world will burn under our[ENTER]footsteps![ENTER]I bow deeply to you, Your eternal servant "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._630_say", "420:FFABAFE6", "A message to the banshee! Aye, the damnable witch[ENTER]is now waiting in vain in Fireland on her army of[ENTER]darkness.[ENTER]I thank you. Without your help, Cape Dragon Fire[ENTER]and its people would have been levelled to the[ENTER]ground by the army of the undead. You have not[ENTER]only saved us, you have also restored peace to[ENTER]the souls of our ancestors. I present this reward[ENTER]to you for all you have done. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._640_sayTitle", "67:EF6D0700", "The adventure continues as soon as you have[ENTER]reached level 98. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._650_say", "88:8198BB8C", "We needed a lot of time to locate the base.[ENTER]Please, we cannot lose any more time! "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._660_say", "148:D89353A7", "Yak-Hwan needs Fossil Earth? It's very fortunate[ENTER]that I haven't used it all yet. Here, you're[ENTER]welcome. Now bring it to him and give him my[ENTER]warmest greetings. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._670_counterName", "10:A4DD2054", "Remaining "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._690_1_notice", "48:992002C7", "You have eliminated the Brigade of Black Death. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._690_2_notice", "34:AFC9EE2F", "Report back to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._700_sayTitle", "62:333A092E", "Defeat Skeletos, leader of the Brigade of Black[ENTER]Death! "},
	{"main_quest_lv97._710_say", "76:3297F69B", "The Temple Servant can first be defeated for good[ENTER]once you have defeated Skeletos. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._010_sendLetter", "15:3ECEAC53", "Reconstruction of the Fort "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._020_say", "48:7D48DC5B", "Admiral Angmur is asking after your help. Go to[ENTER]him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._030_say", "253:BAA77935", "Thank you for coming. The battle did not pass us[ENTER]by without leaving a trace. The fort was attacked[ENTER]too and the protective wall was torn down in many[ENTER]places. This peace will not last for long. We[ENTER]should use the calm to our benefit and rebuild. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._040_say", "89:E5D2852A", "To fortify the protective wall, we need the[ENTER]armour of the crustacean tribe. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._050_say", "35:4AE74A62", "Understood. How much of this armour do you need? "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._060_say", "94:8DF7F010", "100 of them should do it. You can still strike at[ENTER]the crustacean tribe in Nephrite Bay. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._070_say", "70:6A5B8218", "Aye, that's not quite enough Crustacean Armour.[ENTER]Please gather some more. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._080_1_notice", "48:A7DDFFC8", "You have now gathered all the Crustacean Armour[ENTER]you require. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._080_2_notice", "34:721B6811", "Bring them to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._090_say", "235:A79E77AA", "Aye, very good. The Crustacean Armour will help[ENTER]us to re-fortify the protective wall. Please take[ENTER]this as a reward. I will ask my engineers whether[ENTER]they need any other materials and then let you[ENTER]know. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._130_sendLetter", "15:3ECEAC53", "Reconstruction of the Fort "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._140_say", "66:FA0B8601", "Admiral Angmur needs your help again. Go to him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._150_say", "177:619695A7", "To further fortify, we need Triton Spears. As the[ENTER]name suggests, you will find them amongst the[ENTER]Tritons. Please bring me 100. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._160_say", "7:9BB7C771", "Understood. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._170_say", "94:001D0556", "There you are! Aye, that isn't enough Triton[ENTER]Spears. Please keep going. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._180_1_notice", "37:6F00123D", "You have gathered all Triton Spears "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._180_2_notice", "34:0286B4B4", "Bring them to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._190_say", "157:03D5BB03", "Perfect! Now we can build a safer defensive[ENTER]fortification. I thank you for your help. By the[ENTER]way, Yak-Hwan is looking for you. Find out what[ENTER]he wants. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._200_sendLetter", "12:BD9A01C5", "Emergency "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._210_say", "51:3AAC8428", "Go to Yak-Hwan. He has an important task for you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._220_say", "70:9B6D7E0A", "Ah, very good, you are here! We are reliant on[ENTER]your assistance once again. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._260_say", "201:C99C41CE", "The hard times of the war have not passed by the[ENTER]people that reside in the fort without a trace.[ENTER]They are suffering from starvation and their[ENTER]misery grows worse every day. Unless we do[ENTER]something soon, it does not look good for them. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._280_say", "206:A4C3A1A4", "Gangs of ogres are ambushing our supply[ENTER]transports and attacking them. We need to stop[ENTER]this plundering. Captain Shruk and his Generals[ENTER]are behind it. Kill the captain of the ogres and[ENTER]50 General Ogg! "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._300_say", "95:D2B4AE4D", "You're back already? There are still some ogres[ENTER]about. Please take care of all of them! "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._310_1_notice", "37:C02C13A6", "You have defeated all the ogres. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._310_2_notice", "17:2C822779", "Now return to Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._320_say", "156:3F44D238", "Finally, the food supply transports are reaching[ENTER]the fort and our people can be provided with food[ENTER]and medicines! The emergency is at an end. You[ENTER]truly are a hero. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._330_sendLetter", "14:15DA6DFC", "Acknowledgement "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._340_say", "34:476F567B", "Yak-Hwan wants to talk to you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._350_say", "155:A93AFD5B", "Thanks to your help the danger on Dark Dragon[ENTER]Rock is banished for the time being. For this,[ENTER]the people would like to personally say thank you[ENTER]to you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._360_say", "58:83393A53", "Walk a tour of the fort and talk to the people. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._380_say", "45:AFBEB29E", "Thanks. I'll visit all of the residents. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._390_say", "139:F2083777", "Not all of the citizens have had the chance to[ENTER]thank you. They will be most disappointed. Please[ENTER]make sure you haven't forgotten anyone. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._400_say", "144:2A07155C", "Bravery and wisdom are in your heart in equal[ENTER]measure. Your deeds will be sung generations on[ENTER]from now. I bow before you. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._410_say", "73:73A42F94", "May you be well armed against all dangers, always! "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._420_say", "77:CDABF84A", "You will have a place of honour in our hearts for[ENTER]all time. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._430_say", "135:A1E18E35", "They were some turbulent times, right? I am sure[ENTER]that the Dragon God alone was responsible for[ENTER]paving your way to our island. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._440_1_notice", "59:B87ADE37", "You have spoken with all residents. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._440_2_notice", "17:2C822779", "Now return to Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._450_say", "140:0B5ABCD4", "That truly meant something to the residents of[ENTER]the fort. The Admiral would like to talk to you[ENTER]once more. Go to him next. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._480_sendLetter", "23:4B3E8E45", "The Admiral's Thanks "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._490_say", "64:6D76F872", "Admiral Angmur would like to express his[ENTER]gratitude to you. Go to him. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._500_say", "265:EDDA7BEF", "Without you, the residents of this fort would[ENTER]have been overrun by demons. For your support in[ENTER]the fight against the Servants of Darkness, I[ENTER]thank you, on behalf of my troops and the entire[ENTER]people.[ENTER]On Dark Dragon Rock you will always find a place[ENTER]to call home. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._520_say", "174:70EAE554", "But the Banshee and the Servants of Darkness will[ENTER]not indulge in any form of break and will[ENTER]continue indefinitely with the forging of their[ENTER]black plans.[ENTER]The adventure continues as soon as you have[ENTER]reached level 99. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._540_sayTitle", "15:3ECEAC53", "Reconstruction of the Fort "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._550_say", "68:A2DCC226", "Fight against the Crustacean Tribe and gather 100[ENTER]pieces of Crustacean Armour. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._560_say", "34:6E53BDDD", "Speak with Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._580", "30:FD3A890A", "Strengthen the defensive fortifications. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._590_say", "48:4F25ED2B", "Attack the Tritons and gather 100 Triton Spears. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._600_say", "30:EB3A1DBC", "Go to Admiral Angmur. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._610_sayTitle", "14:82EFF489", "Plundering Ogres "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._620_say", "82:241C3A82", "Eliminate Captain Shruk and 50 of his General[ENTER]Oggs and stop the plundering. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._630_say", "19:1BCB91E5", "Seek out Yak-Hwan. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._640_sayTitle", "14:15DA6DFC", "Acknowledgement "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._650_say", "63:628C3CF1", "Walk a tour of the fort and talk to the people. "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._660_counterName", "10:A4DD2054", "Remaining "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._670_sayReward", "13:238C99BA", "%s: %d pieces "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._680_counterName", "10:A4DD2054", "Remaining "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._700_counterName", "12:A9B9C10C", "Residents: "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._710_say", "45:0DC29A1B", "Confucius (%s)[ENTER]Armour Shop Dealer (%s) "},
	{"main_quest_lv98._720_say", "51:52E658BB", "General Store Saleswoman (%s)[ENTER]Weapon Shop Dealer (%s) "},
	{"manwoo._10_npcChat", "12:03CFA56C", "The fish farm "},
	{"manwoo._20_sayTitle", "7:AEB62596", "Fisherman: "},
	{"manwoo._30_say", "199:21F8392F", "I would like to expand my fish farm. This is why[ENTER]I need living Carps. These fish are very good for[ENTER]breeding and are very popular amongst Fishermen.[ENTER]Unfortunately they're not very easy to catch. "},
	{"manwoo._40_say", "364:F1240BBC", "If you bring me a Carp, I'll give you a reward.[ENTER]I have a chest in my attic that has been there[ENTER]for ages. I can't even remember what is in there.[ENTER]It might be something completely useless or[ENTER]something really valuable. However, monsters[ENTER]might also be hiding in there. If you want it,[ENTER]bring me a living Carp. "},
	{"manwoo._50_npcChat", "30:8BEF403C", "Exchange Carp for Chest "},
	{"manwoo._60_say", "111:8964138D", "You are bringing me a carp for my fish farm?[ENTER]Thank you! Here is the promised chest. Good luck! "},
	{"manwoo._70_sayReward", "74:F8F28FB0", "You have received a Chest![ENTER]Right-click to open it. "},
	{"map_warp._150_say", "99:0F693C5D", "I could teleport you for free, but I have a big[ENTER]family. I need to keep them fed, so I have to[ENTER]earn money. "},
	{"map_warp._170_say", "106:4A8AF4E0", "Now, I'm going to teleport you immediately. You[ENTER]will be going to a dangerous place, so be[ENTER]careful. Good luck! "},
	{"map_warp._240_say", "30:86FE1DEF", "As you like. Watch out, off we go! "},
	{"map_warp._250_say", "30:2DFE46F1", "As you wish... See you soon! "},
	{"map_warp._70_say", "83:506DFEC2", "These are the places I can teleport you to once[ENTER]you reach level 60. "},
	{"map_warp._80_sayReward", "38:B4FBB617", "But it'll cost you %s Yang. "},
	{"map_warp._96_select", "5:5F587915", "Back "},
	{"map_warp._97_select", "25:D86ED120", "Use Dragon God Amulet "},
	{"marriage_manage._1000_npcChat", "25:9CF18C16", "List of wedding ceremonies "},
	{"marriage_manage._100_sayItem", "9:BD625542", "Tuxedo "},
	{"marriage_manage._1010_say", "51:E1877FC6", "There are no weddings being held at the moment. "},
	{"marriage_manage._1015_foreach", "13:52BFFB59", "The wedding of %s and %s "},
	{"marriage_manage._1020_say", "48:344DA0B9", "You are a wedding guest! Have fun. "},
	{"marriage_manage._1030_say", "63:11B44FF3", "The ink hasn't even dried yet! Give yourself more[ENTER]time. "},
	{"marriage_manage._10_npcChat", "16:CBAE9369", "I want to get married. "},
	{"marriage_manage._110_sayReward", "61:5FA97418", "If you want to get married, you need to wear a[ENTER]Tuxedo. "},
	{"marriage_manage._120_sayItem", "14:557CB043", "Wedding Dress "},
	{"marriage_manage._130_sayReward", "67:AF1151FE", "If you want to get married, you need to wear a[ENTER]Wedding Dress. "},
	{"marriage_manage._140_say", "140:EAE3B966", "Love alone cannot help you to arrange a wedding,[ENTER]you need some Yang for that. Unfortunately you do[ENTER]not have enough money at the moment. When you[ENTER]have saved a million Yang, I would be happy to[ENTER]plan you ceremony. "},
	{"marriage_manage._150_sayReward", "29:35FD2512", "You need to have 1 million Yang. "},
	{"marriage_manage._160_say", "100:431BC233", "You are mature enough now and you also look[ENTER]determined. Whom do you want to marry? "},
	{"marriage_manage._170_sayReward", "46:35C9F789", "Please enter the name of the person whom you wish[ENTER]to marry. "},
	{"marriage_manage._180_say", "85:9E337DA3", "Are you so excited that you can't even write down[ENTER]the name? Try again. "},
	{"marriage_manage._190_say", "83:3FD99DAF", "So you don't know the name of the person you want[ENTER]to marry? Are you really sure you want to get[ENTER]married? "},
	{"marriage_manage._200_sayReward", "20:F1ECD6B6", "%s is not online "},
	{"marriage_manage._20_say", "78:40550593", "Another wedding is taking place right now. Please[ENTER]wait a moment, or come back later! "},
	{"marriage_manage._210_say", "113:19ED4C14", "Your partner needs to be close so that I can[ENTER]conduct the ceremony. Please bring your partner[ENTER]here.  "},
	{"marriage_manage._220_sayReward", "19:B0F0A8D0", "%s is too far away. "},
	{"marriage_manage._230_say", "60:3162DB66", "Not your name, but your partner's name. "},
	{"marriage_manage._240_sayReward", "30:95C25CE3", "Enter your partner's name here. "},
	{"marriage_manage._250_say", "72:792587E5", "I'm sorry, but you can't marry a person of the[ENTER]same sex. "},
	{"marriage_manage._260_say", "59:C15B7DC8", "Only people from the same kingdom can marry. "},
	{"marriage_manage._270_say", "109:7FCC0FAE", "The person you want to marry is already married.[ENTER]Didn't you know that? You need to find someone[ENTER]who's single. "},
	{"marriage_manage._280_sayReward", "33:1C2DB774", "%s is married. "},
	{"marriage_manage._290_say", "115:434CC901", "This person is not mature enough for a marriage.[ENTER]Your partner needs to be at least at level 25,[ENTER]too. "},
	{"marriage_manage._300_say", "198:D6A494E8", "I'm sorry, but I cannot wed the two of you. You[ENTER]don't make a good couple because your experience[ENTER]difference is larger than 15 levels. "},
	{"marriage_manage._30_say", "184:F276D155", "Aren't you are too young to get married? You need[ENTER]a lot of responsibility for married life and you[ENTER]don't seem mature enough yet. Young people get[ENTER]divorced very quickly, so I'm afraid I'm not[ENTER]going to authorise this. Get some more experience[ENTER]first. "},
	{"marriage_manage._310_say", "33:6D06389C", "Now, you may exchange rings. "},
	{"marriage_manage._320_say", "111:EDC9B634", "A wedding is a very important step in one's life.[ENTER]Couldn't your partner at least have brought a[ENTER]Wedding Ring? "},
	{"marriage_manage._330_say", "41:206977B5", "Your partner needs to have a Wedding Ring, too. "},
	{"marriage_manage._340_say", "106:70370F85", "Your partner isn't wearing any wedding clothes.[ENTER]Aren't you embarrassed? "},
	{"marriage_manage._350_say", "41:B64FA0AB", "Your partner needs to wear a Tuxedo. "},
	{"marriage_manage._360_say", "50:19CF4905", "Your partner needs to wear a Wedding Dress. "},
	{"marriage_manage._370_say", "212:6C8B2985", "So this is it: The two of you have decided to be[ENTER]joined in holy matrimony and can now spend some[ENTER]time together. I am going to send you to Lovers'[ENTER]Island. I wish you both a long and happy[ENTER]marriage. Congratulations.[ENTER][ENTER]Shortly you will automatically be sent to Lovers'[ENTER]Island. "},
	{"marriage_manage._380_say", "70:C325EA5B", "Your partner does not seem to want to marry you.[ENTER]Perhaps you should sort that out. "},
	{"marriage_manage._390_npcChat", "26:3812281B", "Return to the wedding room "},
	{"marriage_manage._400_say", "78:2AC755EA", "Why are you still here? Your partner is already[ENTER]waiting for you. You should go there immediately. "},
	{"marriage_manage._40_sayTitle", "12:13856003", "Information: "},
	{"marriage_manage._410_npcChat", "20:546EB89E", "Wedding Permit "},
	{"marriage_manage._420_sayTitle", "19:76F0190E", "Wedding Planner: "},
	{"marriage_manage._430_say", "39:B5E5C8A1", "I'm talking to your partner. One moment, please. "},
	{"marriage_manage._440_say", "78:02587BDD", "I'm here to ensure that the ceremony is performed[ENTER]without a hitch. First of all, write down the[ENTER]name of your partner. "},
	{"marriage_manage._450_say", "85:F453A708", "This name is not registered. Please check your[ENTER]information. "},
	{"marriage_manage._460_say", "96:127E5C11", "Please bring your partner here. I need to talk to[ENTER]your partner to clarify a few things. "},
	{"marriage_manage._470_sayReward", "20:284496F5", "%s is still too far away. "},
	{"marriage_manage._480_say", "95:55CD785C", "You have to write down the name of your partner,[ENTER]not your own name. "},
	{"marriage_manage._490_sayTitle", "19:76F0190E", "Wedding Planner: "},
	{"marriage_manage._500_say", "75:B583CC95", "Something's wrong, this isn't the person I was[ENTER]expecting. "},
	{"marriage_manage._50_sayReward", "32:D9148F6D", "Marriage is only possible once level 25 has been[ENTER]reached. "},
	{"marriage_manage._510_say", "74:AC33A3E7", "Your partner does not seem to be ready for the[ENTER]wedding yet. Sort it out amongst yourselves. "},
	{"marriage_manage._520_say", "67:C9AC16C6", "Now that everything is prepared, the ceremony can[ENTER]begin! "},
	{"marriage_manage._530_say", "23:CDF00C3A", "It will be a really nice wedding! "},
	{"marriage_manage._540_npcChat", "25:CB1685EC", "Start of the wedding march "},
	{"marriage_manage._550_npcChat", "22:F8651BB4", "Stop the wedding march "},
	{"marriage_manage._560_npcChat", "4:17D34E13", "Night "},
	{"marriage_manage._570_npcChat", "6:3336DA6D", "Snow "},
	{"marriage_manage._580_npcChat", "18:F2276DB5", "End of the wedding "},
	{"marriage_manage._590_say", "47:08E3CC0D", "Please wait a moment, I'm talking to your partner[ENTER]at the moment. "},
	{"marriage_manage._600_say", "27:6ECC604E", "Do you want to end the wedding? "},
	{"marriage_manage._60_say", "36:BAF0B823", "You want to marry without a Ring? "},
	{"marriage_manage._610_select", "4:48F9C4CD", "Yes "},
	{"marriage_manage._620_select", "4:AEC6064F", "No "},
	{"marriage_manage._630_say", "143:E816DABB", "Your partner needs to agree with the cancellation[ENTER]of the wedding. It cannot be cancelled now as you[ENTER]partner is not online. "},
	{"marriage_manage._640_say", "69:BEB75D9B", "The ceremony cannot be performed until we have[ENTER]received affirmation from your partner. Have a[ENTER]little patience. "},
	{"marriage_manage._660_say", "32:B7A5310D", "Your partner does not want to. "},
	{"marriage_manage._670_npcChat", "7:E9575205", "Divorce "},
	{"marriage_manage._680_npcChat", "7:E9575205", "Divorce "},
	{"marriage_manage._690_say", "134:3E91BF1C", "You can't get divorced in the absence of your[ENTER]partner. You have to come back here together one[ENTER]more time first. "},
	{"marriage_manage._700_say", "124:2A5BF837", "For a legal divorce, you need 500,000 Yang and[ENTER]your partner's agreement. Do you really want to[ENTER]get divorced? "},
	{"marriage_manage._70_sayItem", "24:427DEB33", "Engagement Ring "},
	{"marriage_manage._710_select", "22:2346F57B", "Nah, just kidding. "},
	{"marriage_manage._720_say", "26:21FAC7E7", "The Wedding Ring please. "},
	{"marriage_manage._730_say", "46:C4D7AC03", "Your partner also needs to have the ring here. "},
	{"marriage_manage._740_say", "43:3DA76B2F", "You don't have enough Yang for a divorce. "},
	{"marriage_manage._750_sayReward", "40:D9290350", "To get divorced, you need %s Yang. "},
	{"marriage_manage._760_sayReward", "37:C452F23F", "You need 500,000 Yang for a divorce. "},
	{"marriage_manage._770_say", "87:9003C262", "Do you really want to get divorced? You shouldn't[ENTER]take a decision like this lightly. "},
	{"marriage_manage._780_select", "23:08F7D130", "No. I have changed my mind. "},
	{"marriage_manage._790_say", "40:A9926CC8", "I have changed my mind. I don't want to get[ENTER]divorced. "},
	{"marriage_manage._800_say", "66:01297A00", "It's better this way. I hope you have a long and[ENTER]fulfilled life. "},
	{"marriage_manage._80_say", "85:BE6D92A5", "You have to get an Engagement Ring first. Then[ENTER]you can marry. "},
	{"marriage_manage._810_sayReward", "16:6DF99F50", "You are now divorced. "},
	{"marriage_manage._820_say", "65:B9A18618", "The divorce has been carried out.[ENTER]You are now divorced. "},
	{"marriage_manage._830_say", "68:5E9279BA", "Your documents are not complete. Please come[ENTER]again later. "},
	{"marriage_manage._840_sayReward", "25:62697C95", "The divorce has been declared invalid. "},
	{"marriage_manage._850_say", "59:A7FC672C", "Your partner doesn't want to get divorced. You[ENTER]should sort this out amongst yourselves. "},
	{"marriage_manage._860_npcChat", "25:DB5A158D", "Remove Wedding Ring  "},
	{"marriage_manage._870_npcChat", "25:DB5A158D", "Remove Wedding Ring  "},
	{"marriage_manage._880_say", "84:EDD4C380", "You should forget bad memories as quickly as[ENTER]possible. "},
	{"marriage_manage._890_sayReward", "32:F09E4993", "The Wedding Ring has been removed. "},
	{"marriage_manage._900_npcChat", "20:63CB6801", "One-sided divorce "},
	{"marriage_manage._90_say", "133:C2C281C8", "Do you really want to marry like this? You only[ENTER]get married once in a lifetime, so you should[ENTER]think about dressing appropriately. "},
	{"marriage_manage._910_sayTitle", "10:06E874BB", "Guardian: "},
	{"marriage_manage._920_say", "100:A4F50A60", "You need 1 million Yang for a one-sided divorce.[ENTER]Do you still want to get divorced? "},
	{"marriage_manage._930_select", "30:E2874185", "No, I just wanted to know. "},
	{"marriage_manage._940_say", "147:74E94BD6", "You don't have enough Yang for the divorce. You[ENTER]need as much Yang for it as you paid for your[ENTER]wedding. "},
	{"marriage_manage._950_say", "71:F412856F", "Are you sure that you want to get divorced? "},
	{"marriage_manage._960_select", "11:D5797690", "I do. "},
	{"marriage_manage._970_select", "33:3567264F", "I should reconsider. "},
	{"marriage_manage._980_say", "142:B0D0367F", "Well, it's probably better this way. You can come[ENTER]back again once you're sure that you really want[ENTER]it. "},
	{"marriage_manage._990_say", "137:D44D56A0", "As you are sure about this, I'm going to go ahead[ENTER]with the divorce. I wish you both all the best[ENTER]for the future. "},
	{"mining._10_sayTitle", "9:1E940235", "Deokbae the lumberjack: "},
	{"mining._20_say", "64:5B4FBD4D", "Your Pickaxe can't be improved because you don't[ENTER]have enough training. "},
	{"mining._30_say", "66:49883E11", "Do you want to improve your Pickaxe? Let's see...[ENTER]The current level of your Pickaxe is %s. "},
	{"mining._40_say", "24:24993275", "Do you want to improve it? "},
	{"mining._50_say", "149:4814480C", "There is a %d%% chance of a successful upgrade. If it fails, the Pickaxe's level will be reduced by 1 and its points reset to zero. So, shall we upgrade it?"},
	{"mining._55_say", "124:F0E64B61", "It's your decision. If I should improve the[ENTER]pickaxe then come back later. See you! "},
	{"mining._60_say", "143:459F747B", "Sorry, there was a problem with the improvement.[ENTER]I couldn't do anything. Here, take it back and[ENTER]try again later. "},
	{"mining._70_say", "33:E84B720E", "Here is your Pickaxe with a new level! "},
	{"mining._80_say", "116:A3D4FAF4", "Oh no, something went wrong.[ENTER]Forgive me, the Pickaxe's level has been reduced[ENTER]and its points reset to zero. I'm sorry... "},
	{"mystery_key._010_say", "48:DB539E7C", "Do you want to open the box with the key? "},
	{"mystery_key._020_select", "21:BE9D602A", "Yes, open box "},
	{"mystery_key._030_select", "16:5255EEF4", "No, not right now. "},
	{"mystery_key._040_say", "93:95B92C8A", "You need a Ruby Key or a Diamond Key to open the[ENTER]Mysterious Ruby Box! "},
	{"neutral_warp._10_npcChat", "7:D9F67B2D", "Hello! "},
	{"neutral_warp._20_sayTitle", "11:BE7AA048", "Old Man: "},
	{"neutral_warp._30_say", "113:01C273D0", "Hello! I know how you can get to other regions[ENTER]from here. If you give me some Yang, I can[ENTER]teleport you there. "},
	{"neutral_warp._40_say", "56:DFB9F072", "Where do you want to go?[ENTER]It costs %s Yang. "},
	{"neutral_warp._50_select", "11:C86EF8BF", "Mount Sohan "},
	{"neutral_warp._65_npcChat", "31:04DCC04C", "I want to go to the Old Lady's sister. "},
	{"neutral_warp._70_say", "384:06AFAE40", "The Old Lady already told me that you were[ENTER]coming. She said that I shouldn't charge you for[ENTER]this trip, because you're doing her a favour. We[ENTER]often drink tea together and I'm happy to help[ENTER]her out. But don't kid yourself that it's going[ENTER]to stay that way in the future! Take care over[ENTER]there, because those affiliated with foreign[ENTER]kingdoms aren't taken to kindly. "},
	{"new_christmas._020_say", "189:06D17F63", "Ah, it's you![ENTER]We haven't seen one another for quite a while.[ENTER]Another year has already come and gone, ho ho![ENTER]Perhaps you are asking yourself why I'm back here[ENTER]in the village.[ENTER]Allow me to explain... "},
	{"new_christmas._030_say", "276:D6765060", "Times are hard. Nobody wants to buy books or[ENTER]other such things these days.[ENTER]With my age creeping on, it's too tiresome to be[ENTER]flying around on a reindeer-led sledge.[ENTER]So, with that in mind, I have decided to[ENTER]celebrate Christmas this year in the village. "},
	{"new_christmas._040_say", "74:1677BCED", "If you've got any more questions, you can always[ENTER]come and ask me. Happy Christmas! "},
	{"new_christmas._050_npcChat", "22:856B50C7", "Would you like some mulled wine? "},
	{"new_christmas._060_say", "151:5D1CF54A", "Ho ho ho! I'm certain you know what that is,[ENTER]right? There's no better drink for wintry times![ENTER]You mix a fine wine, a pinch of cinnamon and a[ENTER]bunch of cloves... mmmmm! "},
	{"new_christmas._070_say", "126:522B070D", "In this cold weather, a sip of mulled wine will[ENTER]do you the world of good! It gives you strength[ENTER]and helps you to move faster.[ENTER]Would you like to try some?[ENTER]Very well, one coming right up! "},
	{"new_christmas._080_say", "130:37EDBABC", "It seems you like the taste of mulled wine ho ho![ENTER]Do you feel it warming you from the inside?[ENTER]Oh and the taste, so sweet and fruity![ENTER]Merry Christmas! "},
	{"new_christmas._090_npcChat", "25:094B8807", "More mulled wine please! "},
	{"new_christmas._100_say", "320:851B1753", "Hang on a second![ENTER]I forgot one small detail![ENTER]I can only prepare mulled wine for you once a[ENTER]day, I don't have enough ingredients to make[ENTER]more. And it only lasts for 20 hours. In one[ENTER]bottle there are 6 portions, the effects of a sip[ENTER]last for 30 minutes. Portion them out wisely! "},
	{"new_christmas._110_say", "98:1A86CB11", "You're welcome! You've had to wait long enough.[ENTER]This wonderful drink will give you wings, ho ho[ENTER]ho! So, I hope you enjoy it. Merry Christmas! "},
	{"new_christmas._120_say", "255:186D6D9C", "What, you want some more?[ENTER]Sorry, but I think you've had enough. 24 hours[ENTER]have not passed since your last ration of mulled[ENTER]wine. Too much of this stuff isn't good for you,[ENTER]you know! Come back again later.[ENTER]Until then, enjoy the festivities! "},
	{"new_christmas_gift_box._010_say", "35:67358E51", "Of %d, you can still unpack %d. "},
	{"new_christmas_gift_box._020_say", "28:9D267BA3", "Unpack the next present in %d minutes. "},
	{"new_christmas_sock._010_npcChat", "32:D321C466", "What's with the stockings? "},
	{"new_christmas_sock._020_say", "205:CD94A6F1", "The stockings! I almost forgot about them![ENTER]I wanted to hide my presents in the stockings[ENTER]hanging over the fireplace. However these[ENTER]un-Christmassy creatures have stolen them all![ENTER]Help me to get them back. "},
	{"new_christmas_sock._030_say", "102:3FA1B7B3", "Stockings aren't so easy to find. You will need[ENTER]the Reindeer Calf to be able to sniff them out. "},
	{"new_christmas_sock._040_say", "469:8444617A", "Isn't it cute?[ENTER]It also has an excellent sense of smell. A[ENTER]specialist in stocking hunting![ENTER]It stays with you for 2 hours and helps you in[ENTER]the search. Afterwards it will get tired and need[ENTER]24 hours' rest before it can continue.[ENTER]If you don't want to wait so long, then take a[ENTER]look down to the left at what's behind the[ENTER]spinning coin, I've heard that another Reindeer[ENTER]Calf is waiting there. But I'll also be glad to[ENTER]see you if you visit me again tomorrow! "},
	{"new_christmas_sock._050_npcChat", "24:E859D40C", "I'm bringing you stockings! "},
	{"new_christmas_sock._060_say", "199:6EA9BD18", "Bring me at least 5 Stockings and you will[ENTER]receive a reward.[ENTER]Urrgh, the scent of musty Stockings is[ENTER]unbearable! Come back when you have collected[ENTER]enough. Happy Christmas! "},
	{"new_christmas_sock._070_say", "187:FAE881A1", "Ho ho ho, you've gathered enough Stockings.[ENTER]Hmm, let me see.[ENTER]URRGH this smell! Well, they are definitely the[ENTER]right ones![ENTER]Merry Christmas! "},
	{"new_christmas_sock._080_npcChat", "13:530D49AB", "'s Reindeer Calf "},
	{"new_christmas_sock._090_say", "359:068F36A5", "You have already received a Reindeer Calf Seal[ENTER]from me today. I'm afraid the little guy needs a[ENTER]rest now. It'll be back to full fitness tomorrow.[ENTER]If you don't want to wait so long, then take a[ENTER]look down to the left at what's behind the[ENTER]spinning coin, I've heard that another Reindeer[ENTER]Calf is waiting there. But I'll also be glad to[ENTER]see you if you visit me again tomorrow! "},
	{"new_christmas_sock._100_say", "99:D7B15D08", "You already brought me your stockings today.[ENTER]Remember, you can only hand some over every 24[ENTER]hours. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._020_say_title", "23:6E2DC5E6", "The gift for Chaegirab "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._021_say", "370:6A94E719", "My uncle Chaegirab has dedicated his life to[ENTER]science and has invested all his Yang into his[ENTER]research. He's always been good to me, so I would[ENTER]like to surprise him with a gift. Would you go to[ENTER]Uriel and ask him whether he has an idea of what[ENTER]I could give him? He's my uncle's old teacher and[ENTER]he knows him very well. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._030_say", "32:DB830B72", "But don't tell my uncle about it! "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._031_say", "13:F2043C86", "Will you help me? "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._040_say_title", "22:5E5E9B47", "Speak to Uriel "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._041_say", "61:80A70F4C", "Talk to Uriel about his former pupil Chaegirab. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._042_say", "17:9941A37D", "Uriel is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._050_say_title", "39:7CE18F53", "Wonda-Rim wants to give Chaegirab a gift... "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._051_say", "301:9A7EE012", "A scientist's pleasure in life comes from[ENTER]research. It's that simple. The best way to[ENTER]please Chaegirab is to support his work. The[ENTER]Mu-Rang Wolf is a rare visitor to these lands,[ENTER]but its fur is also a rare treat for every[ENTER]biologist. Five pieces of fur should be enough.[ENTER]So you can tell Wonda-Rim that. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._052_say", "48:65583455", "I'm sure this impressive fur would impress the[ENTER]biologist. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._060_select", "16:D814CF33", "Yes, I'll let him know. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._065_say_title", "21:92A34EB9", "Back to Wonda-Rim "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._066_say", "114:C5705DD1", "Uriel thought of a great gift for Chaegirab. Go[ENTER]back to Wonda-Rim and tell him about it. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._067_say", "29:5F5EE6D6", "Wonda-Rim is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._070_say", "217:292FF6B3", "Uriel's suggestion sounds good. As I really want[ENTER]to make this a surprise for my Uncle Chaegirab, I[ENTER]have to get hold of this fur. Could you go out[ENTER]and kill 5 Mu-Rangs for me? "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._071_say", "49:6507BE30", "I'm supposed to kill Mu-Rang-Wolves to get their[ENTER]fur. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._072_say", "45:E8205B4D", "5 are enough for a good gift. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._073_say", "11:2507F914", "Let's go! "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._074_notice", "31:6385C982", "You have looted some good quality fur. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._075_say", "44:28EFD25A", "Hunt Mu-Rang Wolves and loot their fur. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._076_say_reward", "35:C7966EB0", "You have collected %s of 5 pieces of fur. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._081_say_title", "21:35924A28", "Fur for Wonda-Rim "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._082_say", "78:E83C4AC1", "You have looted enough fur, now take it to[ENTER]Wonda-Rim. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._092_say_reward", "30:BCF24136", "You have already collected %s pieces of wolf fur. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._110_say", "99:B417B990", "This is really nice fur, thank you. Could you[ENTER]take it to my uncle? "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._120_target", "16:742164E3", "Uncle Chaegirab "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._121_say", "70:0E441EE4", "Wonda-Rim has asked you to take the Wolf Fur to[ENTER]Chaegirab. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._122_say", "29:12A9866D", "Chaegirab is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._130_say", "32:A9C818A5", "Aha. So that what he's trying to do now. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._131_say", "252:D150AB1C", "From whom is this fur? It's from Wonda-Rim, but[ENTER]you killed the wolves for him?[ENTER]I'm embarrassed to have a nephew that makes[ENTER]others do work for him. So, I'm sorry, but I[ENTER]can't accept this, even though I know you went to[ENTER]a lot of time and effort. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._132_say_reward", "113:026EDCFD", "Tell Wonda-Rim that I've seen right through him![ENTER]If he really wants treat me to something, he[ENTER]should go hunting himself. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._140_say", "123:9BFAD56C", "Chaegirab didn't accept the fur and is angry at[ENTER]Wonda-Rim for his laziness. He has sent you back[ENTER]to Wonda-Rim. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._141_say", "72:D1F6EFDE", "What did my uncle say? I hope he liked my gift? "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._142_1_select", "21:7D5F4F5E", "Yes, he was thrilled. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._142_2_select", "12:F99E303E", "No, not at all. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._143_say", "121:55706603", "Great! I love giving other people a treat. And of[ENTER]course I will give you a generous reward. Here,[ENTER]take this! "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._144_say_reward_b", "61:DB8E976C", "You lied to Wonda-Rim and have lost good/evil[ENTER]points. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._145_say", "146:015C1A52", "He didn't accept the fur? Hmm, maybe it wasn't[ENTER]such a good idea to send you hunting instead of[ENTER]me. I'll do it differently next time. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._146_say_reward", "148:3CCCB450", "But I don't want all your hard work to be for[ENTER]nothing: Go to Yang-Shin. He'll buy the fur off[ENTER]you for a good price. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._147_say", "150:EA7C8FE9", "What a disappointing turn of events. Well, at[ENTER]least you still have the fur. Go to the hunter[ENTER]Yang-Shin in Yayang and sell the fur to him. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._148_say", "151:E204B088", "What a disappointing turn of events. Well, at[ENTER]least you still have the fur. Go to the hunter[ENTER]Yang-Shin in Bokjung and sell the fur to him. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._149_say", "149:0416A876", "What a disappointing turn of events. Well, at[ENTER]least you still have the fur. Go to the hunter[ENTER]Yang-Shin in Bakra and sell the fur to him. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._151_say", "193:BF2C452E", "Mu-Rang Furs? They will certainly come in handy.[ENTER]I'll make myself some new underwear out of them.[ENTER]Here is a bag of Yang for your trouble. Look, I[ENTER]found an old scroll yesterday - maybe it will be[ENTER]of use to you. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._152_say_reward", "32:5B8D3E30", "You have received a Skill Book. "},
	{"new_quest_lv17._153_say_reward", "14:3CCBA80B", "You have received %s "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._010_target", "10:06E874BB", "Guardian: "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._011_say", "87:78FF513B", "The Guardian has got a mission for you. Go see[ENTER]him and find out what it's all about. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._015_npcChat", "11:F3B99B9B", "The sick brother "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._016_send_letter", "15:99637724", "The sick guard "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._017_say_title", "10:06E874BB", "Guardian: "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._019_say_title", "23:0F9070BE", "Demon Tower Guard "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._021_say", "308:7CE0FE24", "I'm worried about my brother, the Demon Tower[ENTER]Guard. He's hasn't been feeling well recently and[ENTER]now he's really ill. He's got a really bad[ENTER]headache and a strange skin rash, but he just[ENTER]can't leave his post. Could you get some medicine[ENTER]for him from Baek-Go? "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._022_say", "169:6C7BD13E", "I'd go myself, but the Demon Tower is in the[ENTER]Hwang Temple, right in the centre of the Valley[ENTER]of Seungryong. And the whole place is just[ENTER]swarming with dangerous creatures... "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._023_say", "179:6A589710", "You're back already. Did you forget the symptoms?[ENTER]You must listen more carefully when someone is[ENTER]talking to you. My brother has a headache and[ENTER]reddened skin. Tell Baek-Go that! "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._024_select", "12:C5168F0E", "Help the brother "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._025_say_title", "21:17A903C3", "Baek-Go's medicine "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._026_say", "70:47BCEF48", "Talk to Baek-Go about the medicine for the Demon[ENTER]Tower Guard. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._027_say", "27:0A5284E8", "Baek-Go is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._031_say", "144:57BE43AF", "So you need medicine? It's dangerous to[ENTER]administer medicine on the off chance that its[ENTER]the right one! You have to tell me the symptoms[ENTER]of the illness. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._032_1_select", "33:B33F7B2B", "Headaches and rashes "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._032_2_select", "24:AF3C351D", "Throat ache and cramps "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._032_3_select", "10:2AEFBB20", "I don't know. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._035_say", "202:E344E785", "Sounds like demon scratches to me. This often[ENTER]occurs when too many mite-infested beasts are[ENTER]close by. I can produce something that can help[ENTER]him. You will have to get hold of some[ENTER]ingredients for it though. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._040_say", "12:8A14460B", "I need: "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._041_say_reward", "19:74CCFCC2", "You must hunt: "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._042_say", "16:9EC3B77D", "I also need: "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._043_say", "180:1533C8CC", "I've never heard of such an illness. Are you sure[ENTER]that the Guardian told you the right symptoms?[ENTER]I'd ask him again if I were you. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._044_say", "103:AA517DB5", "I can't make a diagnosis without symptoms. Go[ENTER]back and ask again. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._050_set_title", "10:A6DD990C", "Medicine "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._056_notice", "47:DF5E37C3", "Good, now I'm just missing %s bundles of herbs. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._057_notice", "74:81A9520B", "That should be all the herbs I need. Now quickly[ENTER]go to Baek-Go. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._058_notice", "49:65F13323", "Good, now there's only %s livers left. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._060_notice", "37:C05DC207", "Ah, some liver. Now I'm just missing %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._061_notice", "76:4DA2B825", "That should be all the liver I need. Now quickly[ENTER]go back to Baek-Go. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._062_notice", "41:A6CC1D87", "Unfortunately this liver isn't any use to me. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._063_say", "48:A9E1C8C8", "You still need %s x Medicinal Herbs. (%s) "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._064_say", "48:BAE7E9FE", "You still need %s x Tiger Liver. (%s) "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._065_say", "121:C1FE1293", "Now you've got all the ingredients for the[ENTER]medicine. Now go and take it to Baek-Go. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._066_say", "77:3A0D3968", "Collect the ingredients for Baek-Go's medicine: "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._070_say", "69:036F49D0", "Thanks, now I can make the medicine for the demon[ENTER]scratches. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._071_say", "149:15DB69D8", "Finished! Here's your medicine. Its fresh[ENTER]ingredients means that the medicine doesn't keep[ENTER]for very long - so you should deliver it to your[ENTER]patient within the next %s minutes. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._072_say", "148:9F9C2B27", "You can find the guard's brother in the centre of[ENTER]the Hwang Temple. But be careful on your way[ENTER]there, the Valley of Seungryong is swarming with[ENTER]dangerous creatures! "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._073_say", "142:D30E64AD", "That's not enough. Did you lose the ingredients[ENTER]on the way over here? I can't do anything for you[ENTER]without the rest of the components. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._080_target", "23:0F9070BE", "Demon Tower Guard "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._082_set_clock", "15:B7782156", "Remaining time "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._083_say", "169:54A379F5", "Well you still have enough time, but you have to[ENTER]hurry up. So hurry to the guard in Seungryong[ENTER]now, before the medicine goes off! "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._084_say", "125:5A182CAC", "The time has run out because you were too slow.[ENTER]But you should take the medicine to the Demon[ENTER]Tower Guard anyway. It might still work. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._085_say", "93:C4646EA0", "Thanks for bringing me the medicine. The itching[ENTER]is killing me. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._086_say", "61:96252C3E", "Oh, this tastes quite good. I can already feel[ENTER]the itch getting better. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._087_say", "33:29060741", "You've earned an especially generous reward for[ENTER]doing this! "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._089_say", "117:216F1B50", "Oh, this tastes terrible. The medicine has gone[ENTER]off - how long did it take you to get here? My[ENTER]tongue feels like cured monkey dung. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._090_say", "98:AD66D6A2", "Hmm, wait a second... it seems to be getting[ENTER]better. Yes, it's working! OK, in that case I'm[ENTER]not going to be mean. You'll get your reward[ENTER]after all. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._091_say", "274:210BAEAD", "It seems you have lost the Medicine. Please go[ENTER]hunting once more, get the ingredients needed to[ENTER]prepare a new Medicine and take them to Baek-Go.[ENTER]Otherwise I will turn into a demon myself, because[ENTER]I cannot bear this pain any longer. "},
	{"new_quest_lv22._098_say", "130:07197B95", "You have lost the medicine again? I've never come[ENTER]across such a scatterbrained person in all my[ENTER]life! Oh well, there's not a lot we can do about[ENTER]it. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._010_target", "8:C329F351", "Captain "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._020_say_title", "23:E2E47F1D", "Additional Supplies "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._030_say", "222:487B1170", "It's hard to keep our troops motivated when we[ENTER]have trouble with additional supplies. The General[ENTER]Store Saleswoman, who is an important supplier of[ENTER]ours, has been delivering only a tiny amount of[ENTER]potions for a few weeks now. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._031_say_reward", "73:0AE201CF", "Please go to the General Store Saleswoman and find[ENTER]out what is going on. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._032_select", "24:CF9D75BC", "I'll get you those potions! "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._040_say_title", "20:F10E5104", "General Store Saleswoman: "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._040_set_title", "23:E2E47F1D", "Additional Supplies "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._050_target", "20:F10E5104", "General Store Saleswoman: "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._051_say", "293:368468D7", "Yes, lately I've had a lot of trouble with[ENTER]deliveries of additional supplies. The trade[ENTER]routes have become dangerous, and robbers and wild[ENTER]beasts appear on them more and more often.[ENTER]Travelling merchants stand no chance when[ENTER]dangerous Tigers appear on the road. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._052_say", "163:27644C66", "Maybe the Captain and his soldiers could help.[ENTER]Please go to him and ask whether he could send his[ENTER]soldiers to protect the merchants. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._054_say", "129:61DECF10", "Go to the General Store Saleswoman and find out[ENTER]why the deliveries of additional potion supplies[ENTER]are delayed. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._055_say", "38:F5327882", "The General Store Saleswoman is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._056_say_title", "8:C329F351", "Captain "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._060_say", "195:8E3EE8D9", "Secure the trade routes? Yes... in principle I[ENTER]would gladly do it, but I don't have enough[ENTER]soldiers to protect travelling merchants from[ENTER]other kingdoms. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._061_say", "196:27724AFF", "Besides, soldiers may not hunt Tigers - only the[ENTER]hunters of the hunting brotherhood have that[ENTER]right. And violating it would not help to keep the[ENTER]peace in the village. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._062_say_reward", "135:7C4EFB27", "That's why you have to turn to Yang-Shin. He is a[ENTER]member of the hunting brotherhood. Maybe he can[ENTER]help you deal with the Tigers. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._064_say", "101:90360ACD", "Go to the Captain and try to persuade him to[ENTER]secure the trade routes against the Tigers. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._065_say", "27:F9489F17", "The Captain is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._071_say", "242:F4BFC680", "Many of my hunters were called up to fight as[ENTER]warriors and were killed. It has become impossible[ENTER]to keep the wild animal population in balance. The[ENTER]wild cats in particular are expanding their[ENTER]territory and threatening travellers. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._072_say", "194:C39A41B0", "If you help us with this matter, you will receive[ENTER]a precious Book that belonged to my fallen[ENTER]companion Mi-Song. In return, you must thin out[ENTER]the Tiger population considerably. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._073_say", "58:C94DF06B", "The Cursed White Tigers in particular have[ENTER]multiplied. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._074_say", "24:76A4F3D7", "As proof, I need: "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._075_say", "19:74CCFCC2", "You must hunt: "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._076_say", "99:EF477338", "Find Yang-Shin and try to persuade him to secure[ENTER]the trade routes against the Tigers. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._078_say", "29:BB36737D", "Yang-Shin is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._080_set_title", "14:BCF76BD7", "Tiger Fur "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._081_notice", "44:A994C73C", "Ah, a perfect specimen. Only %s more to go! "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._082_notice", "40:9B232CCC", "Done! Now hurry back to Yang-Shin. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._083_notice", "36:A742FFF1", "This Tiger Fur is useless. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._084_say", "46:4B5FA3D3", "I still need %s x Shimmering Tiger Fur "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._085_say", "69:46F53D5B", "Get Shimmering Tiger Fur from the Cursed White[ENTER]Tigers. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._090_npcChat", "19:B37C8869", "I have the Tiger Fur. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._091_say", "106:34D4056C", "How is anyone supposed to tell whether the routes[ENTER]are safe? These few Furs are no proof at all. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._092_say", "183:F3CB853D", "At last, the Furs will bring me a big profit...[ENTER]eh! Are you still here? Thanks to you the routes[ENTER]are safe again! I'm sure the Captain will reward[ENTER]you royally. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._093_say", "43:F38AA5EA", "And now get out of here! I have to clean the Furs. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._094_say", "173:86255BAF", "Ah, the Captain won't give you a reward? That's[ENTER]not my business. And if you try to betray me, you[ENTER]can forget about the Furs. You will never get your[ENTER]hands on them! "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._095_say_reward", "76:5AFF0249", "I don't need this old, strange, triangular object[ENTER]any more. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._096_say", "9:8F643B8C", "Reward: "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._097_say_reward", "29:5625575D", "You have received a Tiger Shield+3. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._098_say", "136:5E5356B9", "What, you want to bribe me with these measly Furs?[ENTER]At this rate my debt... I think the roads will[ENTER]never be safe. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._099_say_reward", "42:3E8F15F5", "Keep hunting until you have %s Furs! "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._100_say", "42:8617AD4E", "That's all of them. Now hurry to Yang-Shin. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._101_say_reward", "43:1E3A1DA7", "You have received 3,750,000 experience points "},
	{"new_quest_lv24._102_say_reward", "25:03C8AE2F", "You have received 125,000 Yang. "},
	{"new_quest_lv26._020_set_title", "9:D14530DC", "The deserter "},
	{"new_quest_lv26._021_say", "127:7AD7B39B", "Yang-Shin is having trouble finding good hunting[ENTER]ground. Go see him and find out how you can help[ENTER]him. "},
	{"new_quest_lv26._025_say", "357:861740BE", "Nothing's the way it used to be since the Metin[ENTER]Stones came down. Even going hunting has become[ENTER]impossible in lots of places, because wild[ENTER]animals have started behaving as if they have[ENTER]rabies. The wanderer Nakajima is living out there[ENTER]somewhere, I'm sure he'll know where there's some[ENTER]good hunting ground. Could you look for him and[ENTER]ask? "},
	{"new_quest_lv26._031_say", "147:ECD6970A", "So you want to know a good place to hunt? Don't[ENTER]be so hasty, if I'm supposed to do something for[ENTER]you, then you should also do me a favour. "},
	{"new_quest_lv26._032_say", "448:D4D783CA", "You should know... I don't live out here[ENTER]voluntarily. I need to hide because I fled from[ENTER]the atrocities of the military. I just wish that[ENTER]my beloved wife Ah-Yu knew that I'm still alive.[ENTER]Can you take this message to her?[ENTER]But remember that it's for Ah-Yu's ears only![ENTER]In return, she'll tell you where we kissed for[ENTER]the first time - I want to meet her there and its[ENTER]also a great place to hunt. "},
	{"new_quest_lv26._036_say_title", "18:A8D12D27", "Look for Nakajima "},
	{"new_quest_lv26._037_say", "70:01F7E69E", "Nakajima should know of some good places to hunt.[ENTER]Look for him. "},
	{"new_quest_lv26._038_say", "28:5FEBE9C4", "Nakajima is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv26._040_say", "130:FBD6DD8D", "Are you Nakajima? Yang-Shin sent me! He's looking[ENTER]for some hunting ground, perhaps you have an idea[ENTER]where hunting might not be so dangerous? "},
	{"new_quest_lv26._051_say", "168:947ABB9F", "Nakajima is a deserter and has to hide from the[ENTER]army now. His wife Ah-Yu thinks that he fell in[ENTER]the war. Let her know that Nakajima is still[ENTER]alive. "},
	{"new_quest_lv26._052_say", "25:0F622F55", "Ah-Yu is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv26._057_say", "209:5782AE52", "Nakajima... he's alive? My darling husband is[ENTER]alive? I can't thank you enough for telling me![ENTER]It was the Valley of Yonjang that he was talking[ENTER]about. I'm going to head there immediately and[ENTER]meet him. "},
	{"new_quest_lv26._058_say", "170:CDB3CF44", "Thank you for making this reunion possible. Take[ENTER]this Rose with you, perhaps you could give it to[ENTER]a loved one? And now... please excuse me, but I[ENTER]have to hurry! "},
	{"new_quest_lv26._061_say", "132:E57EFA95", "The Valley of Yonjang - where Nakajima and Ah-Yu[ENTER]first kissed - is still a very good hunting[ENTER]ground. "},
	{"new_quest_lv26._062_say", "112:36992625", "Yang-Shin will be pleased when he hears this. Go[ENTER]to %s and give him the good news. "},
	{"new_quest_lv26._063_say", "228:F8B8B1B4", "The Valley of Yonjang? That does sound plausible,[ENTER]as I have never heard of a Metin Stone[ENTER]contaminating that area. I'll probably be able to[ENTER]get great loot there! Here, you deserve this[ENTER]reward. "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._011_say", "115:E37EB928", "Yu-Hwan, the musician, needs your help. Go[ENTER]quickly and find out what's going on! "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._015_npcChat", "18:0C6A31E5", "Ah-Yu's worries "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._016_say", "124:F2EDC7E8", "Ah-Yu seems to have something on her mind that[ENTER]she doesn't want tell Yu-Hwan. Go visit her and[ENTER]and see if she wants to open up to you. "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._017_say", "25:0F622F55", "Ah-Yu is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._018_select", "23:2D80AFA1", "I'll talk to Ah-Yu soon! "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._021_say", "349:5D0C00DB", "Do you know Ah-Yu? She collects herbs for my[ENTER]potions. She used to be in a good mood, but[ENTER]yesterday she seemed completely out of sorts. She[ENTER]just didn't want to tell me what was on her mind,[ENTER]but maybe it's because she works for me?[ENTER]Please go see her and find out how she is.[ENTER]Perhaps she'll open up to you! "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._022_say", "341:9FB875DC", "It's very nice of Yu-Hwan to worry about me. But[ENTER]yes, there is something on my mind... I didn't[ENTER]want to talk about it, but it's giving me such a[ENTER]hard time! It's about Yang-Shin, the hunter.[ENTER]He's been blackmailing me every since he found[ENTER]out that my husband Nakajima is a deserter.[ENTER]Yang-Shin is threatening to rat on him! And then[ENTER]they'll kill him... "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._023_say", "155:F0BE0EBE", "This time he's demanding a Bear Paw in return for[ENTER]his silence. But I can't go off on the hunt now.[ENTER]Could you help me and get Yang-Shin what he[ENTER]wants? "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._024_set_title", "26:B63C4D9D", "Hunting bears "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._025_notice", "115:1D0180B7", "Off to the hunt![ENTER]Hunting down the bear demigod Bera is the best[ENTER]way to get hold of a Bear Paw. "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._026_notice", "28:1C6B8546", "I've looted a Bear Paw! "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._027_notice", "35:BF51BC27", "That should be all. Off to Yang-Shin! "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._028_notice", "42:7F54F2B4", "This bear's paw is useless. "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._029_say", "45:5B0B2361", "You need another %s x Bear Paws. "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._031_say_reward", "19:74CCFCC2", "You must hunt: "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._032_say", "59:3949DD3E", "Ah-Yu has asked you to fulfil Yang-Shin's demand. "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._032_say_reward", "107:33B59DAF", "You still need %s x Bear Paws.[ENTER]Hunt the bear demigod Bera to get them."},
	{"new_quest_lv28._036_say", "84:85495344", "You've obtained the requested Bear Paws. Take[ENTER]them to Yang-Shin and pay off Ah-Yu's debt. "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._037_say", "29:BB36737D", "Yang-Shin is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._040_npcChat", "8:877E1224", "The blackmail "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._041_say_title", "17:0895F2A6", "Bear Paws "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._042_say", "326:08F6721D", "You've brought me some Bear Paws? Please don't[ENTER]think badly of me! We live in tough times and I[ENTER]have to make ends meet, now that hunting game has[ENTER]got so difficult and since the Metin Stones[ENTER]turned animals into murderous beasts. Life as a[ENTER]hunter has never been so dangerous. "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._043_say", "165:4E8636CE", "Please tell Ah-Yu that she's got nothing to worry[ENTER]about. She can count on it. At least until I need[ENTER]something again... hehehe! "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._044_say", "89:8B61FC89", "What, you wanted to fob me off without loot? I[ENTER]wanted fresh Bear Paws! "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._045_say_reward", "223:9ED93B13", "It's nice of you to help Ah-Yu. But it also means[ENTER]that you have to do what I say. Now go hunting[ENTER]and don't come back until you have two Bear Paws! "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._046_say", "93:459AF20F", "Give Ah-Yu the message that Yang-Shin will stop[ENTER]blackmailing her because you helped him. "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._051_say", "157:6DF5CBC4", "You're our saviour! I'll be grateful to you for[ENTER]the rest of my life. Here, this is my Yang. Take[ENTER]it - admittedly it isn't much, but you've truly[ENTER]earned it. "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._055_1_select", "25:A016C73B", "Thank you, it'll come in very useful! "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._055_2_select", "23:B12AF129", "No, I can't accept this. "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._056_say", "122:CB0AFF89", "This is all that I have. But it's worth it if I[ENTER]can get rid of this barbarous cut-throat. "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._057_say", "86:910B2A36", "Oh, thank you! Your place at the Dragon God's[ENTER]side is guaranteed! "},
	{"new_quest_lv28._070_say", "12:8A14460B", "I need: "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._015_npcChat", "18:91D10DC2", "The broken porcelain "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._021_say", "277:5EE97FE8", "My beloved Celadon Porcelain! It's been in my[ENTER]family for three generations and now three of the[ENTER]precious vases are broken. I saw that[ENTER]ne'er-do-well Taurean hanging around the[ENTER]warehouse earlier. I'm sure he's to blame! "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._022_say", "124:9C867A5B", "It wouldn't be the first foolish thing he's done,[ENTER]but this really crosses the line. Someone should[ENTER]teach him a lesson! Do you have time to do it? "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._023_1_select", "17:C401BF43", "With pleasure "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._023_2_select", "21:E55BC7CE", "That's none of my business "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._024_say", "122:224A7453", "I don't have time to educate wicked children.[ENTER]You'll have to capture him yourself. However, I[ENTER]doubt that you'll manage it... "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._031_say", "210:B8C93EF4", "Yonah's precious family heirlooms, three vases[ENTER]made from celadon porcelain, are all broken. He[ENTER]thinks that Taurean is to blame. Go to Taurean[ENTER]and find out. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._032_say", "27:A268FC22", "Taurean is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._034_say_reward", "81:9090EDDF", "What are you looking at me like that for? I[ENTER]haven't done anything... "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._035_say_reward", "29:5D38EEB1", "What have you done with Yonah's vases? "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._036_say_reward", "50:37DC57AB", "Vases? Yonah? I just don't know what you're[ENTER]talking about! "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._037_say_reward", "43:C433815C", "Then please could you explain to me again, why[ENTER]three of them are broken. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._038_say_reward", "201:B116ED6B", "I swear that I haven't been anywhere near a vase[ENTER]today and I haven't seen Yonah either. In fact, I[ENTER]spent the whole day fighting with Harang. She[ENTER]even locked me in the barn for while! Go and ask[ENTER]her if you don't believe me! "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._041_say", "199:B53BEA75", "Taurean claims he's innocent. He was playing with[ENTER]Harang all day and couldn't have broken the[ENTER]vases. Go to Harang and ask if that's true. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._042_say_reward", "36:69EC8342", "Harang, have you seen Taurean recently? "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._044_say_reward", "68:4A6FA83D", "Taurean? Yes, we played the whole day. Is[ENTER]something wrong? "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._045_say_reward", "43:E51E9A43", "Yonah said that Taurean broke three of his vases. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._046_say_reward", "242:E102E15A", "Yonah is mean. He chases Taurean and me away as[ENTER]soon as we come anyway near him. He's always so[ENTER]worried about his porcelain. The only person[ENTER]who's allowed to touch his precious vases is his[ENTER]friend the Stable Boy. Maybe he broke them?! "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._047_say", "26:95408024", "Harang is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._050_target", "10:65E0ED3A", "Stable Boy: "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._051_say", "187:5F070B7C", "Harang confirmed that Taurean is innocent. But[ENTER]they might also be in cahoots with one another.[ENTER]Before you render judgement you should ask[ENTER]Yonah's friend the Stable Boy. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._052_say", "295:B9B86AA6", "Ah, good old Yonah. He worries about his[ENTER]porcelain and suspects the village children. But[ENTER]the Metin Stones are to blame - ever since they[ENTER]poisoned our land, our resources haven't been[ENTER]what they used to be. Even porcelain has become[ENTER]more brittle. But Yonah won't hear of it... "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._053_say", "132:42B9E0C9", "If you collected some Hay for him, he could pad[ENTER]out the porcelain in his chests a little bit[ENTER]better. I'm sure it would be a good way to[ENTER]placate him. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._054_say", "43:80503582", "The Stable Boy is in[ENTER]%s or %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._061_say", "329:D981424C", "It's not Taurean's fault that Yonah's porcelain[ENTER]is broken. It's the radiation of the Metin Stones[ENTER]that makes everything so very brittle.[ENTER]Collect some Hay for Yonah so that he can store[ENTER]his porcelain more safely! I'm sure a few of the[ENTER]villagers will be able to spare you some. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._062_say", "147:1568121E", "You can find %s and %s in front of the gates to[ENTER]the village. You should be able to get a decent[ENTER]amount of Hay out of the straw hats that they[ENTER]wear. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._063_notice", "74:8DBA322C", "I'll get a nice bundle of Hay out of this. Now[ENTER]I'm just missing another %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._064_notice", "104:0C082CA7", "This hat is not made of straw but of coconut[ENTER]fibres. And those are no use to me at all. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._065_1_say", "88:5D461607", "I see you have a lot of Hay with you. I'm sure[ENTER]Yonah will calm down if you give him some of it. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._065_notice", "110:EFCAE3AE", "This hat isn't made of straw, but of coconut[ENTER]fibres. It's also quite damaged... "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._066_say", "116:3A23273F", "You can also hunt Savage Infantrymen or Strong[ENTER]Savage Infantrymen. You can get Hay from their[ENTER]straw hats. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._067_say_reward", "43:994C8B74", "You have collected %s of %s bundles of Hay. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._068_notice", "23:3024B4D7", "You have looted a bundle of hay. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._070_npcChat", "11:991F377A", "The haystack "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._071_say_reward", "105:3A037131", "Taurean, you mentioned earlier that you were at[ENTER]the haystack earlier. Did you happen to take some[ENTER]Hay with you? "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._072_say_reward", "99:65AEA240", "Haha, let's see... it was all in my hair and in[ENTER]my shoes. Can you see it? Here's some more, take[ENTER]it! "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._073_notice", "99:6BAAAABD", "It's not much Hay, but it should be enough for a[ENTER]small bundle. Now I'm just missing %s more. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._074_say_reward", "82:BACA9656", "It wasn't me, I swear! Didn't Harang tell you[ENTER]that we were having a fight at the haystack? "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._075_say_reward", "81:A3C6770E", "You were at the haystack earlier, weren't you?[ENTER]Did you happen to take some Hay with you from[ENTER]there? "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._076_say_reward", "97:5A5F2683", "How do you know about the haystack? What, I still[ENTER]have Hay in my clothes? Oh yes, here's some! "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._077_say_reward", "19:D1FA93EA", "Can I have that? "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._078_say_reward", "12:FD365773", "I suppose so... "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._079_say_reward", "101:C164D1A2", "I don't have time right now. I need to go and[ENTER]calm down Taurean about the whole thing with the[ENTER]vases! "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._080_npcChat", "16:6DE1E4E5", "Hay for Yonah "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._081_say_reward", "66:7FA8E80C", "Is there some more Hay laying around in the[ENTER]stable that I could bring to Yonah? "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._082_say_title", "10:65E0ED3A", "Stable Boy: "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._083_say_reward", "115:9050BAF1", "We don't have much Hay. The wild animals and[ENTER]bandits outside the village have prevented us[ENTER]from cutting down any more of it. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._084_say_reward", "24:E1981491", "But I can give you a little bit! "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._085_notice", "96:C2C3A373", "It's really not that much, but at least it's[ENTER]enough for a bundle. Now I'm just missing another[ENTER]%s more. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._086_say_reward", "61:3134FDF3", "I'm afraid I can't do anything else for you. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._090_send_letter", "20:8F27C477", "Hay instead of hits "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._091_say", "73:873035B2", "You have collected enough Hay for Yonah. Go take[ENTER]it to %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._101_say_reward", "130:21974D66", "It's not Taurean's fault. The radiation from the[ENTER]Metin Stone has made the porcelain brittle. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._103_say_reward", "63:CE682916", "What did you say? That's complete nonsense, that[ENTER]ne'er-do-well lied to you! "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._104_say_reward", "65:CCF16CBD", "Taurean played in the haystack with Harang all[ENTER]day. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._105_say_reward", "142:CD048D33", "I'm supposed to send you best wishes from your[ENTER]friend the Stable Boy and I've also brought you[ENTER]some Hay to help you protect your vases. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._106_say_reward", "262:DEDEB7F7", "I admit, I am a little embarrassed about my[ENTER]reaction. But you should know that I'm very[ENTER]attached to my porcelain because it brings back[ENTER]good memories of my family. When a vase breaks,[ENTER]its more than just a lost object to me... "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._107_say_reward", "84:45813E1C", "I have to apologise to you and Taurean. Here's a[ENTER]small reward for your efforts. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._108_notice", "59:AA374EE0", "You receive a bonus of %s experience points! "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._109_say_reward", "142:CD048D33", "I'm supposed to send you best wishes from your[ENTER]friend the Stable Boy and I've also brought you[ENTER]some Hay to help you protect your vases. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._110_say_reward", "151:F7F6D7B2", "That's very nice of you, but could you get me[ENTER]another %s bundles of Hay so that my vases are[ENTER]really safe? "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._111_say_reward", "181:83263598", "I think it's going to be hard to find more Hay.[ENTER]But my vases are almost holy to me. I would be[ENTER]incredibly grateful if you got hold of some for[ENTER]me and I'd also give you some Yang for it. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._112_say_reward", "62:97BB522C", "That brat Harang is obviously in cahoots with[ENTER]Taurean. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._113_say_reward", "112:9B6E64F9", "Apparently no one believes me when I say that I[ENTER]saw the boy hanging around the warehouse earlier. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._114_say_reward", "47:BC970316", "It's all right. Here's some compensation for your[ENTER]efforts. "},
	{"new_quest_lv29._115_say_reward", "16:D9BDB915", "Here, %s Yang. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._010_send_letter", "11:5ABD0123", "Rumble rumble "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._021_say", "128:CEFB0F35", "My stomach is rumbling like a wild boar. Perhaps[ENTER]I should pay a visit to Octavio. He makes the[ENTER]best seafood stew around. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._023_say", "202:3E9C46B7", "You want some seafood stew? The one with all the[ENTER]heads in it? Oh, I'm sorry, my kitchen hasn't[ENTER]seen any fish for days. Usually the fisherman[ENTER]delivers a fantastic deep-sea fish for my stew. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._024_say", "113:0742F670", "Well he hasn't been round here for days. Could[ENTER]you perhaps go and ask him what's going on? "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._025_say", "19:E9A7D411", "Octavio is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._026_select", "21:1E2C30E2", "I'm off to find the fisherman! "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._030_target", "7:AEB62596", "Fisherman: "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._031_say", "272:1C2529E3", "The untroubled days at sea are over! Fishermen[ENTER]are disappearing every day, it's terrible! Ever[ENTER]since the Metin stones plunged into the sea, the[ENTER]once peaceful whales have transformed into brutal[ENTER]sea monsters. Fishing has become a dangerous[ENTER]trade. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._032_say", "96:B086D58C", "Our spears can't hurt the whales any more. Their[ENTER]skin is tougher than ogre skin! "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._033_say", "104:756E9C04", "Perhaps Yonah knows what to do. He used to go to[ENTER]sea quite often and hunted whales for years. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._034_say_title", "7:AEB62596", "Fisherman: "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._035_say", "92:0E55181C", "Octavio is waiting for his deep-sea fish. Ask the[ENTER]Fisherman why the delivery is delayed. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._036_say", "17:88B91CCA", "The Fisherman is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._037_send_letter", "26:67277A75", "Furious Sea Monsters "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._038_say", "82:530FE67A", "The Fisherman has asked you to ask Yonah for[ENTER]advice on how to hunt the evil whales. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._039_say", "25:A3D5338C", "Yonah is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._041_say", "413:66C745A4", "I heard about what happened to the whales. It's a[ENTER]bad business for fishermen. Even if they dare to[ENTER]venture out onto the sea, their spears are just[ENTER]too weak to penetrate whale skin. When I used to[ENTER]work on a whaler, we used special weapons for[ENTER]whales with old and scarred skin. They were able[ENTER]to penetrate everything... "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._042_say", "138:E4F56953", "It's a special technique to harden whale catching[ENTER]spears. The only person who can make this type of[ENTER]spear is a Blacksmith. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._043_say_reward", "15:3C795364", "Go to the Blacksmith "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._045_say", "139:CC15A1DD", "Yonah recommends using very robust and sharp[ENTER]spears for hunting whales. Go to the Blacksmith[ENTER]and ask him if he can make some of those spears. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._050_target", "7:43EE785F", "Blacksmith "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._051_say", "135:F778760D", "Yes, I've heard of those spears and I can also[ENTER]make them. However, so that they can gain the[ENTER]required durability, I do need a Diamond Stone. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._052_say", "12:8A14460B", "I need: "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._053_say_reward", "7:A0E3ACA3", "Process: "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._054_say_title", "7:43EE785F", "Blacksmith "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._060_set_title", "18:B87F70AF", "Diamond Stone "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._061_notice", "121:977C4D02", "Let's see. I need a Pickaxe to mine the stone. I[ENTER]wonder whether mine is around here somewhere or[ENTER]whether Deokbae has to get me a new one? "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._062_say", "47:4BE12363", "You need another %s x Diamond Stones. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._063_say", "70:56BE758E", "You have everything that you need. Now quickly go[ENTER]back to the Blacksmith. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._064_say", "142:049F684E", "Great, now I've got everything that I need. Come[ENTER]back at the same time tomorrow to pick up the[ENTER]spears. Iron like that has to be forged[ENTER]carefully. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._065_say", "81:318B75CE", "You can get a Diamond Stone by chipping at the[ENTER]Vein of Diamond Ore with a Pickaxe. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._066_say", "225:9741B832", "The Blacksmith needs a Diamond Stone to make[ENTER]special spears for hunting whales. Look for Veins[ENTER]of Diamond Ore, so that you can mine Diamond[ENTER]Stone. If you don't have a Pickaxe for mining,[ENTER]you can buy one from Deokbae. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._067_say", "25:6328AF70", "The Blacksmith is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._068_say", "103:9C3D71F0", "We need another %s x Diamond Stones before we can[ENTER]start working on the spears. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._070_set_title", "8:814FC01E", "The spears "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._071_set_clock", "21:43FC5ECB", "Wait time: %s "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._072_say", "114:B973508C", "The Blacksmith should be finished by now. Go to[ENTER]him and pick up the special spears for hunting[ENTER]whales. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._073_say", "76:FADB50E3", "The spears aren't finished yet. You have to be a[ENTER]little more patient. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._074_say", "33:7A98C4AB", "Here are your spears. Take them to the Fisherman. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._075_say", "83:E1938A75", "I've already asked you to wait until the spears[ENTER]are finished. Come back later. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._079_say", "71:9D9321F9", "You have received some Whale Spears from the[ENTER]Blacksmith. Take them to the Fisherman. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._080_say", "163:2C8E157D", "Great! These spears are really impressive! We can[ENTER]protect ourselves from whale attacks now. Please[ENTER]let Octavio know that he'll have fresh fish again[ENTER]soon! "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._081_say_reward", "25:E5A84F22", "You have received 500,000 Yang. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._082_say_reward", "34:6A75914A", "As a special recognition you have received 3x: "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._083_say", "98:90EF1182", "Those aren't enough spears to drive a whale away.[ENTER]It's just enough to tickle their flesh. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._084_say_reward", "90:C7642B31", "Please go back to the Blacksmith again and get[ENTER]him to forge some more spears. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._090_say", "153:DE288B86", "The fishermen are well equipped and can hunt in[ENTER]the open sea again now. Go to Octavio and try to[ENTER]assure him that he will get a new delivery soon. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._095_say", "189:8AA4B606", "What did you say? Peaceful whales have become[ENTER]aggressive sea monsters? That's terrible...[ENTER]Thanks for helping the fishermen. A large part of[ENTER]my menu is dependant on their deliveries. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._096_say", "131:2E973135", "Oh and about your grumbling stomach: Of course I[ENTER]can offer you seafood stew, but wouldn't you[ENTER]prefer some sushi? "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._098_say_reward", "75:DFD99030", "You receive 750,000 experience points.[ENTER]You receive 2 pieces of Sushi. "},
	{"new_quest_lv42._say_drop", "39:78FBE14E", "You have mined some Diamond Stone!"},
	{"new_quest_lv42._say_drop_fail", "60:D775807F", "That didn't work! I should hit harder, it's a hard stone!"},
	{"new_quest_lv43._005_send_letter", "20:36F21E68", "Visiting Wonda-Rim "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._006_send_letter", "8:CA7F0990", "The orphan "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._011_say", "179:C3FDAEBA", "You haven't heard from Wonda-Rim recently. His[ENTER]relationship with his uncle might have improved[ENTER]by now and they may have forgotten the whole[ENTER]episode with Mu-Rang Fur by now. Why don't you go[ENTER]and visit him. "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._012_say", "29:5F5EE6D6", "Wonda-Rim is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._020_say", "32:82E877AA", "It's nice of you to come around. "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._022_say", "192:8A60931F", "I was brought up by my uncle Chaegirab. We've[ENTER]always had a good relationship... but when I ask[ENTER]him about my parents, he avoids the question.[ENTER]They're dead, but that's all he'll tell me. "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._023_say_reward", "258:4AB7121A", "I want to get married and have a family one day,[ENTER]so I really should know where I came from. Could[ENTER]you talk to my uncle and ask him about my[ENTER]parents? But please don't tell him that I sent[ENTER]you. "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._024_select", "15:36F49F00", "I'll talk to him! "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._025_say", "211:FEDBDD58", "Wonda-Rim isn't Chaegirab's biological nephew, he[ENTER]was just raised by him. Now it's time for him to[ENTER]find out who his real parents are. Ask Chaegirab[ENTER]about Wonda-Rim's parentage. "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._026_say", "29:12A9866D", "Chaegirab is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._032_say", "274:90EF55E0", "Wonda-Rim... no, I'm not his biological uncle. I[ENTER]don't know who his parents are. I've shielded him[ENTER]from the truth so far because I didn't think he[ENTER]was ready to know it. But maybe the time has[ENTER]finally come. "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._033_say", "154:1A5058E9", "I found him in the Valley of Seungryong, with a[ENTER]pack of Orc Fighters. If you want to find out[ENTER]anything about Wonda-Rim's origins, the Orcs are[ENTER]your best bet. "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._034_say", "121:E24AAA39", "I may be strict with him, but I'll always be his[ENTER]uncle. Even if he stays a ne'er do well. "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._035_say_reward", "174:C2A1853F", "Go to the Valley of Seungryong and hunt Orc[ENTER]Fighters or Elite Orc Fighters until you find a[ENTER]clue about Wonda-Rim's origins. "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._036_say", "242:2174A296", "In the dirty bag of one of the slain Orc Fighters[ENTER]you found an old Letter. It's barely legible, but[ENTER]you recognised the name Wonda-Rim on it. You've[ENTER]just found the clue you needed. Take the Letter[ENTER]to Wonda-Rim at once. "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._041_say", "215:7A6D2C49", "Off you go! The best way to find out anything[ENTER]about Wonda-Rim's origins is to kill Orc Fighters[ENTER]or Elite Orc Fighters. Perhaps they are carrying[ENTER]the right clue! "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._043_notice", "33:8ADBB164", "Clues about Wonda-Rim... "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._045_say", "187:0BAD91F2", "I've already told you everything I knew. The only[ENTER]clue that could still help us is the Orc[ENTER]Fighters. Unfortunately, you can't have a[ENTER]sensible conversation with them... "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._049_say", "201:ECE36D01", "A Letter? Let's see... These characters are[ENTER]really hard to read... It's about a raid,[ENTER]apparently the Orcs burned down the farm and they[ENTER]had to run for their lives. They had to leave[ENTER]their child behind... And here's a name. "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._050_say", "85:0BBD37B1", "Thank you for bringing me this letter. At last I[ENTER]know what really happened. "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._051_say", "154:03250281", "I should talk to Chaegirab. He obviously went to[ENTER]a lot of trouble to save me. I'm going to try and[ENTER]be a better nephew to him. See you soon, my[ENTER]friend! "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._052_say_title", "12:13856003", "Information: "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._053_say_reward", "24:5703099F", "You have received 32,000 Yang. "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._054_say_reward", "44:BA43EA67", "You receive 1,250,000 experience points. "},
	{"new_quest_lv43._060_say", "234:71B19D87", "Have you spoken to my Uncle Chaegirab? A hint?[ENTER]What are you talking about? If you have nothing[ENTER]to show, then you should hold back on guessing![ENTER][ENTER]Please ask my Uncle again. After all, I am paying[ENTER]you for it. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._010_send_letter", "17:6969EFAB", "Letter from the Captain "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._020_say_title", "14:1E1D44F9", "Loyal countryman "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._021_say_reward", "222:91588AD1", "I would like you to do me a favour. I can't sleep[ENTER]any more and despite Baek-Go's medicine, I just[ENTER]spend the whole night tossing and turning.[ENTER]Could you look for him and ask him for a stronger[ENTER]sleeping medication? "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._022_say", "27:0A5284E8", "Baek-Go is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._030_set_title", "13:BD955379", "A good night's sleep "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._040_say", "118:349B7AE3", "The Captain is having trouble sleeping. Go to[ENTER]Baek-Go and ask him for stronger sleeping pills[ENTER]for the Captain. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._041_say", "141:B668D75A", "Sleeping medication for the Captain? I'm afraid I[ENTER]don't have anything stronger to give you.[ENTER]However, Yu-Hwan could make something on a herbal[ENTER]basis that would give you the required results. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._042_say", "137:CC1D58C8", "Ah, you got my letter. I don't know what to do[ENTER]any more, I just can't get a good night's sleep.[ENTER]Please help me and ask Baek-Go for advice. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._042_select", "42:AD61C19F", "Then I'm better off going to Yu-Hwan! "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._043_say", "27:0A5284E8", "Baek-Go is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._045_say", "27:2B7A5A46", "Yu-Hwan is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._046_say", "76:2411B060", "Then go to the Captain and tell him that you[ENTER]cannot help him. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._051_say", "144:8C2AFBAB", "Baek-Go didn't have any stronger medicine left.[ENTER]Yu-Hwan might be able to help though, if he knows[ENTER]of a herb that has the required effect. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._052_say", "189:485F9069", "I know the Captain well. As you may already know,[ENTER]I have been fulfilling secret missions for him[ENTER]for quite some time. But I can tell you now that[ENTER]herbs won't solve his problems. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._053_say", "243:9AF6CFF2", "There's another reason why the Captain can't[ENTER]sleep any more. And believe me, he knows exactly[ENTER]what the reason is. But it's something he has to[ENTER]sort out himself and I can't do it for him. Go[ENTER]see him and ask him about it. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._054_say_title", "8:C329F351", "Captain "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._055_say_reward", "155:31DDEC3F", "Ah, you got my letter. I just don't know what to[ENTER]do. Please go and ask Baek-Go for his advice so[ENTER]that I can finally get a good night's rest again. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._055_select", "10:9A6F4289", "Yes Sir! "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._056_say", "10:0A05E06D", "Thank you! "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._056_say_reward", "160:8A151BE3", "I've already seen him and he doesn't have any[ENTER]stronger medicine in supply. But I'm going to[ENTER]look for Yu-Hwan and ask him whether he can help[ENTER]you. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._060_target", "8:C329F351", "Captain "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._061_say", "258:AA95F8D9", "Yu-Hwan doesn't want to blab about someone else's[ENTER]secrets, so it's probably something quite[ENTER]unpleasant. But it's just no use, you have to[ENTER]talk to the Captain about it. If we don't know[ENTER]what the cause is, we can't solve his sleep[ENTER]problems. So go to %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._062_say_reward", "125:8DCD1C7A", "There's no stronger sleeping medication[ENTER]available. But Captain, perhaps I could help you[ENTER]if I found out the reason for your sleeplessness. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._063_say_reward", "84:4F55582E", "It's not something that I would like to tell a[ENTER]young man like you. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._064_say_reward", "80:9B856DE0", "It's not something that I would like to tell a[ENTER]young woman like you. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._065_say_reward", "306:448B2A5F", "But if I don't get a proper night's sleep soon,[ENTER]I'll go mad before long. It looks like I have[ENTER]to... But remember, what I'm about to tell you[ENTER]is for your ears only. Every night I am visited[ENTER]by ghosts... and that's not even the worst of[ENTER]it... I am responsible for their deaths. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._066_say_reward", "201:9AA1DEF5", "They're four soldiers. They say that they were[ENTER]tortured and killed by summoners and tormentors[ENTER]in the Valley of Seungryong. I was the one who[ENTER]ordered them to go there - I sent them to their[ENTER]deaths! "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._067_say_reward", "46:5C533F82", "What must be done to get rid of these ghosts? "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._068_say_reward", "179:19079578", "They want revenge! What must be done? If I set out[ENTER]to avenge them, the village will be left without[ENTER]a leader and will be laid waste. But if I don't[ENTER]go, I'll soon go mad. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._069_say_reward", "155:0F4CD4FA", "If I wasn't responsible for the village's safety[ENTER]I would go immediately. I can only see one way[ENTER]out: "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._070_say_reward", "174:45D82B8C", "Someone else will have to get revenge for them[ENTER]for me! But how can I send more men into the[ENTER]valley and risk sending them on their road to[ENTER]ruin as well!? I can't ask that of someone just[ENTER]for the sake of sleep? "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._071_say_reward", "36:FE0B16C2", "A decision like that isn't easy. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._080_1_select", "16:AF783A82", "The good of the village... "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._080_2_select", "20:F6CAB5B6", "It won't be easy... "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._080_3_select", "31:F4024EE5", "You can't expect something like that! "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._081_say_reward", "122:360017D1", "... carries more weight than your cowardice. I[ENTER]will avenge your men. And if I don't come back,[ENTER]I'll see you tonight! "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._082_say_reward", "124:4C805044", "... dealing with these summoners and tormentors.[ENTER]But you'll sleep well tonight, I promise! "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._083_say_reward", "177:3E6F0621", "Have you got a death wish? It's so dangerous[ENTER]taking on summoners and tormentors. Try telling[ENTER]those ghosts how much you are needed here! "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._084_say_reward", "137:BB79C294", "You're right. But I still hoped that you would[ENTER]volunteer to do it, therefore rendering both me[ENTER]and my village a great service. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._090_1_select", "13:E7DDCA48", "Well... "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._090_2_select", "14:DA3EFBA6", "No, I won't manage that! "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._091_say_reward", "100:EB61275C", "...if I'm your last hope, then I'll eliminate[ENTER]those summoners and tormentors for you! "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._092_say_reward", "83:8A45DAFC", "If I try that, another ghost will find you. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._093_say_reward", "73:1557C8AB", "OK. Well let me give you some Yang for your[ENTER]efforts. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._093_say_reward_exp", "40:207F3BDC", "You receive 20,000 experience points. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._093_say_reward_gold", "24:4B0DE441", "You have received 25,000 Yang. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._100_notice", "28:0EDFA917", "The conversation has been ended. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._110_say_reward", "200:75F44808", "I hoped you'd say that. But unfortunately I don't[ENTER]know which tormentors or summoners killed them. I[ENTER]hope that I'll feel it when one of the ghosts is[ENTER]released. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._111_say_reward", "175:458C3C12", "I'll send you a letter. The ghosts told me that[ENTER]the revenge has to take place in the Dragon God's[ENTER]Triangle. There are three pillars there that form[ENTER]the vertices of the triangle. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._120_set_title", "20:CA4E0433", "Avenge 4 of the fallen "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._125_say_title", "17:6969EFAB", "Letter from the Captain "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._130_say_reward", "30:2E3FD489", "There are another 3 soldiers to avenge! "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._131_say", "216:4AC9AA6E", "You seem to have been successful. I just heard[ENTER]the voice of one of my fallen soldiers. He said[ENTER]that he forgives me now that his death has been[ENTER]avenged. And this is all thanks to you! "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._132_say", "257:6A30A956", "Please also avenge the other fallen soldiers and[ENTER]kill Dark Tormentors, Dark Summoners, High[ENTER]Tormentors and High Summoners. Remember that you[ENTER]can only release them in the triangle of the[ENTER]three large Dragon God pillars. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._140_say_reward", "29:6BCEE52C", "Another 2 soldiers to avenge! "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._141_say", "168:8B4C61C9", "You eliminated another of my soldiers' murderers![ENTER]In the half-light I saw a fallen soldier holding[ENTER]up his hand in a salute. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._150_say_reward", "29:B31C7A3F", "There's another soldier left to avenge! "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._151_say", "190:C2B073ED", "You're incredible! A fallen soldier's ghost was[ENTER]standing next to me just a minute ago and he bid[ENTER]me farewell. It'll probably be quite difficult to[ENTER]find the last murderer. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._160_say", "258:D9B7327E", "The ghosts that have been plaguing the Captain[ENTER]are the young soldiers that fell during his[ENTER]mission. They were killed by Dark Tormentors,[ENTER]Dark Summoners, High Tormentors and High[ENTER]Summoners. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._161_say", "139:5BAB6803", "You have to eliminate the responsible tormentors[ENTER]and summoners in the triangle of the Dragon God's[ENTER]three pillars to avenge the soldiers. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._162_say", "66:5EF66471", "The Dragon God's triangle is in the middle of the[ENTER]Valley of Seungryong. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._170_send_letter", "29:50CBA3B8", "First soldier avenged "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._171_send_letter", "26:4487CB02", "Second soldier avenged "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._172_send_letter", "27:D2D150EB", "Third soldier avenged "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._173_send_letter", "29:C33F0CEB", "All soldiers avenged "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._180_say_reward", "34:CC248EFD", "You have avenged all 4 soldiers! "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._181_say", "166:A185DC36", "You have found the last of the murderers! The[ENTER]ghost of the last of the four fallen soldiers[ENTER]has just appeared to me and asked me to thank you[ENTER]for your courage. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._182_say", "67:53BD34F4", "Come see me to get your reward. I'll be waiting[ENTER]for you in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._183_say_reward", "119:E643C594", "You have done me and my village a great service.[ENTER]Here is your reward, which the ghost left for[ENTER]you. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._184_say_reward", "70:7B0242AC", "Take some more Yang from me as well. And now I'm[ENTER]going to get some sleep. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._185_say_reward", "40:118A2C1E", "I am deeply indebted to you, my son. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._186_say_reward", "31:5508E82A", "I am indebted to you for eternity. "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._190_say_title", "12:13856003", "Information: "},
	{"new_quest_lv52._85_say", "64:558D83C0", "Then maybe later? Please go to Baek-Go when you[ENTER]do! "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._012_say_title", "13:49EDAE86", "Old Lady "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._020_say_title", "11:3C2FD47C", "The daughter's wedding "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._021_say", "187:6810A804", "Have you got children? Then you will surely[ENTER]understand my worries... it's about my daughter![ENTER]She has met a man who has totally turned her[ENTER]head. And now she has fled to a different kingdom[ENTER]with her lover. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._022_say", "211:6732A13F", "He is from Chunjo. Of course I was against it![ENTER]I thought a lady from Shinsoo can't marry a[ENTER]spiritual dreamer from Chunjo. We parted after an[ENTER]argument, she fled with him to Chunjo. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._023_say", "186:74D81986", "He is from Jinno. Of course I was against it![ENTER]I thought a lady from Chunjo can't marry a brute[ENTER]from Jinno. We parted after an argument, she fled[ENTER]with him to Jinno. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._024_say", "197:4D456D4B", "He is from Shinsoo. Of course I was against it![ENTER]I thought a lady from Jinno can't marry a money[ENTER]making weakling from Shinsoo. We parted after an[ENTER]argument, she fled with him to Shinsoo. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._030_say", "36:AB17C34E", "I heard that she wants to marry him there. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._031_say", "239:5DBE93C5", "Now my daughter is waiting for a sign from me.[ENTER]What shall I do? She is my only child! Of course[ENTER]I'm going to give her my blessing. Please go to[ENTER]the Old Lady for me and ask her to help with the[ENTER]preparations. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._040_target", "13:49EDAE86", "Old Lady "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._041_say", "73:05AEDBD2", "Look for the Old Lady and ask her to make the[ENTER]wedding preparations. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._042_say", "32:B8D771AB", "The Old Lady is in %s. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._051_say", "425:A32A6FE4", "A wedding, you say? That is a very important[ENTER]moment in every woman's life. Every detail has to[ENTER]be perfect, from the Wedding Dress or the Tuxedo[ENTER]to the Engagement Rings, which become Wedding[ENTER]Rings during the ceremony. Only when the bride's[ENTER]father has given his consent and paid the proper[ENTER]amount of Yang can a splendid wedding be arranged. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._052_say", "154:21167AD2", "The flowers are particularly important - no[ENTER]wedding can take place without a bridal bouquet[ENTER]the groom gives his beloved. The bouquet should[ENTER]have the following flowers: "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._054_say", "12:8A14460B", "I need: "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._055_say", "21:D7841708", "You must hunt: %s"},
	{"new_quest_lv7._056_say", "19:16988C0A", "I still need: "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._060_say", "195:AEEFB77C", "Come back to me when you have got all three[ENTER]flowers. I'll check whether they are fresh enough[ENTER]and will then make up a nice bouquet. Then you[ENTER]can take it to my sister. She will carry out the[ENTER]ceremony. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._081_say", "163:A7E3DB68", "Collect a flower of each sort. You'll get them by[ENTER]killing Hungry Alpha Wolves, Hungry Blue Wolves[ENTER]and Hungry Alpha Blue Wolves. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._082_say", "72:3BD05472", "This withered flower is not particularly[ENTER]decorative. All this work and nothing to show for[ENTER]it! "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._083_say", "72:3BD05472", "This withered flower is not particularly[ENTER]decorative. All this work and nothing to show for[ENTER]it! "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._084_say", "72:3BD05472", "This withered flower is not particularly[ENTER]decorative. All this work and nothing to show for[ENTER]it! "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._085_1_say_reward", "88:57C008CA", "You're missing %s Bloodred Flower. You can get it[ENTER]by killing Hungry Alpha Wolves. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._085_2_say_reward", "98:B0745526", "You're still missing %s Orange-Coloured Flower.[ENTER]You can get them by killing Hungry Blue Wolves. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._085_3_say_reward", "103:64D893CA", "You're still missing %s Fragrant Yellow Flower.[ENTER]You can get it by killing some Hungry Alpha Blue[ENTER]Wolves. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._085_say_reward", "39:0C8F8DCA", "You're still missing %s Bloodred Flower. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._086_say_reward", "45:1CE32D41", "You're still missing %s Orange-Coloured Flower. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._087_say_reward", "37:9237712E", "You're missing %s Fragrant Yellow Flower. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._088_notice", "40:D7ADA284", "This flower is a splendid specimen. Very nice! "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._089_notice", "40:D7ADA284", "This flower is a splendid specimen. Very nice! "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._090_notice", "40:D7ADA284", "This flower is a splendid specimen. Very nice! "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._091_say", "120:8E3BDF51", "Finished! These flowers should make a lovely[ENTER]bunch. Now go back to the Old Lady quickly before[ENTER]the flower heads start drooping! "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._092_say", "45:BDEB1D2C", "Collect flowers for the wedding bouquet. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._110_say", "68:D6212D32", "They are pretty flowers, but they're just not[ENTER]special enough for such a grand wedding. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._111_say", "118:28048267", "You can get them by killing Hungry Alpha Wolves,[ENTER]Hungry Blue Wolves and Hungry Alpha Blue Wolves. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._112_say", "44:FDCD2C1B", "These flowers should make a beautiful bunch. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._115_say", "80:9116844B", "Thanks, that looks great! Here, take this bunch[ENTER]of flowers and go to my sister with them. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._116_say_reward", "45:D7A31530", "You can find her in Bokjung area of the Chunjo[ENTER]Kingdom. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._117_say_reward", "42:C7D8D324", "You can find her in Bakra area of the Jinno[ENTER]Kingdom. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._118_say_reward", "45:44138975", "You can find her in the Yayang area of the[ENTER]Shinsoo Kingdom. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._120_set_title", "8:E89DA17A", "The sister "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._125_notice", "83:FD27AB06", "This is the right kingdom, I should be able to[ENTER]find the Old Lady's sister here. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._129_say", "58:A9588DB7", "This is the right kingdom, I should find Octavio[ENTER]here. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._130_say", "68:227F41C2", "This seems to be the right kingdom. Now look for[ENTER]the Old Lady's sister. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._131_say", "32:A91E16BA", "That doesn't seem to be the right kingdom. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._132_say_reward", "48:50800FC1", "You have to go to the Bokjung area of the Chunjo[ENTER]Kingdom. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._133_say_reward", "45:80D56ABC", "You have to go to the Bakra area of the Jinno[ENTER]Kingdom. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._134_say_reward", "48:C5D3444B", "You need to go to the Yayang area of the Shinsoo[ENTER]Kingdom. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._135_say", "47:B7404F80", "Go back to Octavio in Yongan in the Shinsoo[ENTER]Kingdom. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._136_say", "44:0BC3F914", "Go back to Octavio in Joan in the Chunjo Kingdom. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._137_say", "75:0AE161AE", "Go back to Octavio in Pyungmoo in the Jinno[ENTER]Kingdom. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._140_say", "175:BA27D0B9", "Here are the flowers for Octavio's daughter's[ENTER]forthcoming wedding. They should be handed to the[ENTER]bride with a blessing. She will know who they are[ENTER]from. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._141_say", "208:7C2055D4", "They are beautiful flowers! They will make the[ENTER]bride glow. This completes the preparations.[ENTER]Please tell Octavio that he is invited to the[ENTER]marriage ceremony. I know he'll be delighted. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._142_say", "35:0E552534", "Now off to Octavio, what are you waiting for? "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._143_say", "130:638B9C8C", "You've brought flowers for Octavio's daughter's[ENTER]wedding?[ENTER]How nice of you! But... where are they? Did you[ENTER]lose them on your way here? "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._144_say_reward", "70:CD672B67", "Go back to your kingdom and get a new bunch of[ENTER]flowers for the wedding. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._145_say", "67:1EBFE3C7", "Go to the Old Lady's sister before the flowers[ENTER]wither away. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._150_say", "115:639EF862", "Why do you reek of bullfrog soup? Ah well, it[ENTER]doesn't really matter as long as you have good[ENTER]news. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._151_say", "70:E3842196", "I can't thank you enough. I'm so happy that I'm[ENTER]going to be at my daughter's wedding! "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._152_say", "28:4669D86F", "Here, take your reward: "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._153_say_reward", "67:45E8ED7D", "A weapon forged for the hand of a martial arts[ENTER]master. Take good care of it! "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._154_say_reward", "37:E620F83A", "You have received %s experience points. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._155_say_reward", "20:4D16ABEA", "You have received %s Yang. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._160_say", "127:B5A9AC9E", "You are obviously confusing me with a distant[ENTER]relative. I don't have a daughter and don't have[ENTER]enough Yang to be able to arrange a wedding. "},
	{"new_quest_lv7._165_say", "127:B1032891", "Would you care to try a spoonful of my bullfrog[ENTER]soup? I made it using an old recipe of my aunt's. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._020_set_title", "18:6F07EA14", "Diary of a Legend "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._021_say", "137:1352A240", "I've found these warrior remains. I don't know if[ENTER]it's the Sura that Heuk-Young's looking for, but[ENTER]I'm sure she'll be interested. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._022_say", "190:B4B5393E", "Not just one Sura has died here. I've seen their[ENTER]remains. I wonder whether that legendary warrior[ENTER]is also amongst them? I should report back to[ENTER]Heuk-Young about this. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._023_say", "198:E1CD7A19", "I've found an old piece of paper, frozen in the[ENTER]Underworld Ice Golem. I can barely read it, but[ENTER]it could be a clue that might interest[ENTER]Heuk-Young. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._024_say", "173:D03E8EC0", "I've found quite a few things that might interest[ENTER]Heuk-Young. I should go see her and give her the[ENTER]piece of paper. Then I'll also be able to tell[ENTER]her about the body. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._025_say", "202:818A225C", "Heuk-Young has asked me to keep my eyes peeled[ENTER]for any clues about the legendary Sura.[ENTER]Unfortunately I have no idea what I'm looking[ENTER]for... "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._030_say", "373:AFD96902", "Look for the legendary fighter Akuma. He was the[ENTER]most famous Sura who ever lived - an almost[ENTER]invincible warrior. Rumour has it that he even[ENTER]challenged the emperor once. I think that this[ENTER]place here is the place where Akuma disappeared,[ENTER]several hundred years ago. Please look out for[ENTER]clues that might tell us where he was. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._050_npcChat", "27:E44C68D8", "Examine Fallen Warriors "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._060_say", "163:C3CC55BC", "It seems to be the remains of a warrior. The left[ENTER]arm doesn't look human though... it must have[ENTER]been a Sura. I have to tell Heuk-Young about[ENTER]this. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._070_notice", "60:E779116D", "A book page... frozen in the remains of an[ENTER]Underworld Ice Golem... "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._090_say", "156:C13651B7", "I can't really tell you what exactly we're[ENTER]looking for. Just have a look around and come[ENTER]back when you've found something. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._100_say", "33:CB5F52CC", "What have you got there? Let me see! "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._105_say", "185:EB3573B5", "A note... what kind of writing is this? It must[ENTER]be quite old. You may have found something really[ENTER]important. The things that are written here look[ENTER]familiar. It looks like this page was once part[ENTER]of a book. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._109_say", "119:1F347D0E", "If we could find a few more pages, it would all[ENTER]make a bit more sense. Look out for more clues! "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._110_say", "62:BDCE1D2D", "There you are again. Have you found something?[ENTER]Tell me! "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._115_say", "252:AAAC7E59", "A dead Sura... it could be him, or it could just[ENTER]be one of his followers. But we need more proof[ENTER]to be sure. Look for clues that might reveal who[ENTER]it is. Weapons, Jewellery, or perhaps notes or[ENTER]something like that. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._120_say", "243:DAA13CAA", "The skeleton of a Sura and a book page? Let me[ENTER]have a look at the parchment... Hmm, you may have[ENTER]found Akuma's remains. However, we need more[ENTER]proof. Please try and find more book pages. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._130_say", "129:B3C186AC", "I have found some evidence already, but I'm not[ENTER]sure if the legendary Sura really was here or[ENTER]not. I need more information. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._140_1_select", "7:7D5CFFE0", "Good "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._140_2_select", "18:AD189583", "Ice Creature "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._140_3_select", "21:AD10B42F", "At the edge of despair "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._140_4_select", "20:E2F19676", "Dark terror "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._140_5_select", "18:343B83B3", "The face of death "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._140_6_select", "15:7A7617DF", "The fate of the warrior "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._140_7_select", "36:28D7CFFB", "No, I'm not interested. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._150_say", "105:9A725A38", "I can only decipher parts of the sentences. They[ENTER]say something about courtly life and an excessive[ENTER]love of adventure... "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._160_1_say", "507:4D0B0221", "The script on the yellowed parchment is pale and[ENTER]shaky, as if it has been written by a very old or[ENTER]very weak person: \"...Ice Creatures. Even my Sura[ENTER]skills didn't help me to defeat them all.[ENTER]Some of them are still wandering the caves and I[ENTER]have to be especially careful in case they find[ENTER]me. Until recently they offered me protection,[ENTER]but now...\"At this point the writing on page[ENTER]disappears. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._160_2_say", "457:5D4A07C7", "This page is also very worn. By the date at the[ENTER]top corner you can recognise that it seems to be[ENTER]some kind of diary: 'It isn't the first time that[ENTER]wish that I had acted differently when I was[ENTER]looking for the Grotto. I was so proud and[ENTER]pleased with myself! All these things have now[ENTER]led me to my certain death...' The last word is[ENTER]thickly underlined. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._160_3_say", "389:7B79445F", "The parchment page is very damaged, pieces of it[ENTER]seem to have been ripped out. You can only[ENTER]decipher parts of the message: '... Emperor's[ENTER]court... when the scholars taught me all that I[ENTER]had so desperately wanted to know... easy opening[ENTER]the portal, but... death and terror in the[ENTER]dark...' A big, jagged rip prevents you from[ENTER]being able to read the rest. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._160_4_say", "559:1B36EC65", "You will find a sketch on this page of the[ENTER]parchment: It's a picture of a woman's face.[ENTER]Underneath it are some words written in the[ENTER]script that you are already familiar with.[ENTER]However, the writing looks a lot more shaky and[ENTER]unsettled: 'Death has its claws out - I found[ENTER]this out yesterday. I only had one quick look at[ENTER]the creature, before the fear took over and I had[ENTER]to back away. Oh my beloved Sunmi, if only I had[ENTER]known! If I had known of this unspeakable horror[ENTER]before, I would never have stooped to this[ENTER]level!' "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._160_5_say", "645:CFF931F2", "During the Hee-Se Dynastie there lived a[ENTER]legendary Sura called Akuma. He was so talented[ENTER]in battle that he could barely find any opponents[ENTER]that he could test his strength against. One day,[ENTER]he came across some notes about a mysterious[ENTER]place that had long since been sealed away and[ENTER]decided to invest all his time in finding this[ENTER]place. He even managed to learn how to find[ENTER]portals and open them. He promised to return to[ENTER]his lover Sunmi once he had finished his deeds...[ENTER]yet he never returned. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._170_say", "137:74F2820F", "The writing looks really archaic... it's also[ENTER]very shaky and uneven, as if the author didn't[ENTER]have much strength left... "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._171_say", "64:6590E8A3", "That doesn't make sense. We need more pages. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._172_say", "102:87E67FBC", "I'm starting to figure out what might have[ENTER]happened here. But there's still a lot of stuff[ENTER]that I'm not sure about. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._173_say", "29:9F63C692", "Would you like to know the details? "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._174_say", "110:948BF0C7", "Another page! Whoever wrote these things must[ENTER]have been completely desperate. Should I[ENTER]summarise what it says? "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._175_say", "265:17063AD0", "Some of the pages are in such a bad condition[ENTER]that I can only guess what they say. However, I'm[ENTER]starting to make sense of what happened in this[ENTER]cave so many years ago. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._176_say", "87:29BBDF87", "Not much is missing. Do want to know what I've[ENTER]found out? "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._177_say", "47:F01C3F35", "It seems like there aren't too many pages missing. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._178_say", "65:7FF3A735", "Do you want to know what I've found out so far? "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._180_notice", "64:2833C48D", "I have found the last page by the Underworld Ice[ENTER]Golems. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._185_send_letter", "31:16B312D0", "That should be all of the pages now!"},
	{"new_quest_lv75._190_notice", "64:9C419A3E", "I found this page by the Underworld Ice Golems. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._195_send_letter", "24:FF800385", "I have found a page! "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._200_npcChat", "31:74730AC8", "Search Fallen Warriors "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._210_say", "178:0995FDD6", "There are 3 pages of the fragile parchment lying[ENTER]by the human skeletons. The jagged edges indicate[ENTER]that they have been ripped out of a book. The[ENTER]writing on the page is faded and difficult to[ENTER]read. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._220_say", "69:9C15CE39", "I think that that should be enough. I'll take it[ENTER]to Heuk-Young. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._230_say", "145:4A41DD16", "I wonder whose remains these are? Well one[ENTER]thing's for sure, he didn't have anything on him[ENTER]that can still be used today. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._240_send_letter", "18:2D6C7087", "I've got the pages! "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._250_say", "75:380C7CF9", "I should go back to Heuk-Young. Perhaps she can[ENTER]fit the pieces of the puzzle together. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._270_say", "532:EB5750E2", "I'm surprised that you found so many things in[ENTER]those caves. These pages seem to have been part[ENTER]of a book. The things that are written here are[ENTER]really interesting. It all makes sense when I[ENTER]think about all the other stories I have heard...[ENTER]If you give me these pages, I'll bind them and[ENTER]turn it into a book. Perhaps it might come in[ENTER]handy when you go to the Grotto of Exile. If it's[ENTER]no use to you, I'm sure we'll find someone who[ENTER]will buy it off you. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._280_say", "191:30071138", "I have bound the pages into a book and added a[ENTER]couple of my notes. Perhaps they might come in[ENTER]useful to you. I'll tell you the rest of the[ENTER]story if you like. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._290_1_select", "26:7A08C500", "Yes, tell me more! "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._290_2_select", "29:5508BF30", "No, I'm not interested in that! "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._310_say", "100:18963947", "What do you want from me? Can't you see that I'm[ENTER]reading? "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._330_say", "101:06DDAA1F", "That's a very interesting book that you're[ENTER]holding. Where's it from? Can I have a look at[ENTER]it? "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._340_say", "288:7769C443", "These are the notes from the Grotto of Exile,[ENTER]right? They look ancient. The writing is unusual[ENTER]and the spelling is very old-fashioned... It must[ENTER]have been hard work getting hold of a book like[ENTER]this. Of course I'd love to get my hands on this.[ENTER]Would you perhaps be interested in selling it? "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._350_1_select", "4:48F9C4CD", "Yes "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._350_2_select", "4:AEC6064F", "No "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._360_say", "36:41017F4C", "How much Yang do you want for the book? "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._370_say", "233:2C642756", "Haha... you're quite the joker. It obviously[ENTER]isn't easy doing business with you. OK, so here's[ENTER]the deal: 500,000 Yang for the Legendary Diary.[ENTER]Take it or leave it! "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._380_1_select", "20:A322A5F1", "I'll take the 500,000 Yang. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._380_2_select", "25:36056A57", "Let's forget it then. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._390_say", "12:228539DC", "OK, then forget it. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._400_say", "36:58F9ED81", "No, I'm sorry, that's too expensive for me. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._410_say", "25:FE7B0846", "Let me make another offer. I'll give you %s Yang[ENTER]for this Legendary Diary. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._420_say", "14:2DC6D758", "Are you okay with that? "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._425_say", "29:CAFA5003", "This is my last offer! "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._430_1_select", "16:D7D860D2", "I'll take the %s Yang. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._430_2_select", "50:B74E28E2", "Then I guess we won't be doing business together. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._440_say", "14:22708098", "Whatever you want.. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._450_say", "61:3465D1A3", "It's not exactly cheap. But I want to be generous. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._460_say", "87:0D64F024", "There's a limit to my generosity. I'll give you[ENTER]500,000 Yang for the Legendary Diary. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._470_say", "65:E1CF2F9F", "Just take it or leave it! "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._480_say", "12:228539DC", "OK, then forget it. "},
	{"new_quest_lv75._490_say", "41:6DB75FDA", "What a shame. Ah well, maybe you'll change your[ENTER]mind later. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._020_set_title", "24:9685E3C8", "The Sombre Wooden Mask "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._030_say", "67:1B6EE900", "Ah, you're just in time! I heard that you were in[ENTER]the Grotto of Exile recently? "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._040_say", "114:92A9FF34", "This is the first time that I hear of anyone that[ENTER]ever returned from there. I have to admit, I'm[ENTER]very curious... "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._050_1_say", "132:A3FEEB07", "I've got a mission for you, but it's quite[ENTER]dangerous. However, I think a man like you might[ENTER]just be able to accomplish it. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._050_2_say", "153:72A07CFF", "I've got a mission for you, but it's quite[ENTER]dangerous. However, I think a woman like you[ENTER]might just be able to accomplish it. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._060_say", "190:21BF3699", "Take the Sombre Wooden Mask and go to[ENTER]Doyyumhwaji. Look for the Flame Ghosts there.[ENTER]You may have met them before - they are[ENTER]creatures that are always surrounded by fire. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._070_say", "156:EB05AE23", "If you kill one of them, the Wooden Mask will[ENTER]react and turn into ashes. Don't lose courage if[ENTER]it doesn't work the first time. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._080_say", "50:ACA52B76", "Then bring the ash back to me. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._090_say", "126:A874E891", "If you're going into the wilderness anyway, you[ENTER]may as well bring me %s Chunks of Ice. I[ENTER]desperately need them. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._100_say", "66:6285C2DA", "Yetis often have Chunks of Ice on them! So, what[ENTER]are you waiting for? "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._110_say_title", "12:54D6329C", "Fire and Ice "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._120_say", "23:FA1732BF", "Soon has assigned me to... "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._130_say", "28:3AFF82F7", "I have already found the Chunks of Ice. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._140_say", "18:4F9FC807", "I still need: "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._150_say_reward", "64:1FF4A980", "Apparently I'll be able to find it if I hunt[ENTER]Yetis! "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._160_say", "72:AAE825F9", "The Sombre Wooden Mask has already transformed[ENTER]into Bewitched Ashes. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._170_say", "12:8A14460B", "I need: "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._180_say_reward", "11:F3136CF7", "I need to carry "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._190_say_reward", "130:1089E85B", "with me. According to Soon, the mask will turn[ENTER]into Bewitched Ashes when I fight the Flame[ENTER]Ghosts. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._200_say", "90:5AAF013A", "Now I just need the Bewitched Ashes and Chunks of[ENTER]Ice. Great, wait a second... "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._210_say", "63:A26083E8", "It's worked! What the ancient scripts say is[ENTER]really true! "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._220_say", "69:545CA2DB", "I have produced Black Ice from the items that you[ENTER]brought me. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._230_say", "164:C48D78D8", "However, I have another mission for you that is[ENTER]connected to the first one. If you complete this[ENTER]one as well, I will give you all my savings! "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._240_say", "78:71435126", "Take the Black Ice to the Grotto of Exile and[ENTER]sacrifice it at the Dark Shrine. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._250_say", "32:C5CD7CAB", "%s Chunks of Ice are still missing. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._260_notice", "18:9F57372D", "Something's not right. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._270_say", "93:56FFA8AE", "Great - I see you have the ice with you. Now I[ENTER]just need the Bewitched Ashes. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._280_say", "18:1B4FDAA7", "What are you waiting for...? "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._290_say", "61:26AB84EE", "Hm... these seem to be normal ashes that aren't[ENTER]bewitched. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._300_target", "15:FAE250D2", "Dark Shrine "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._310_set_title", "15:FAE250D2", "The Dark Shrine "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._320_say", "142:020051AA", "I'm supposed to take the Black Ice to the Grotto[ENTER]of Exile and sacrifice it at the altar. The[ENTER]sacrificial altar won't be easy to find! "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._330_npcChat", "20:988FAC9E", "Sacrifice Black Ice! "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._340_say", "279:127FB501", "As you get closer to the altar, darkness appears[ENTER]to close in around you. In the dark, disembodied[ENTER]voices whisper about their eternal anguish. This[ENTER]really is an unholy place. Do you really want to[ENTER]sacrifice the Black Ice? "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._350_1_select", "31:E3BFD818", "Yes! What's the worst that could happen? "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._350_2_select", "44:F0399D0D", "No, this will all end in tears! "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._360_say", "167:9E3658BD", "I'm still not sure if I've done the right thing -[ENTER]sacrificing something in the Grotto... I'm sure[ENTER]the Dragon God won't approve. I wish I could take[ENTER]it back. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._370_say", "133:EB8ADBD8", "I don't like this whole thing. Taking a victim to[ENTER]the grotto probably wouldn't get the Dragon God's[ENTER]approval. I won't do it. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._380_say", "15:B388824D", "That's the wrong Shrine! "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._390_send_letter", "15:4BEE1AD4", "Back to Soon "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._400_set_title", "15:B2AFE302", "Strange monsters "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._410_say", "45:493318DB", "I should go back to Soon to pick up my reward. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._420_say", "88:EFDC7603", "I heard that strange monsters have been sighted[ENTER]in some parts of the country. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._430_say", "109:A6E32E6D", "I hope it doesn't have anything to do with the[ENTER]fact that I sacrificed the Black Ice in the[ENTER]Grotto of Exile. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._440_say", "33:DCBEE9FA", "Well done! Here's your reward. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._450_npcChat", "23:B17E00D5", "Have you seen the monster? "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._460_say", "114:22C83ABC", "A %s?! My goodness... I have no idea how[ENTER]something like this could've happened... I'm[ENTER]going to research it in my book immediately. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._470_say", "148:A1D314C1", "I couldn't sacrifice the Black Ice... it felt so[ENTER]wrong! I'm going to go to Soon and tell him that[ENTER]I won't complete this mission. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._475_npcChat", "11:13A54025", "The Black Ice "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._476_say", "113:8FCB8589", "I see you're not carrying the Black Ice with you[ENTER]any more. So you really sacrificed it? Tell me[ENTER]what happened! "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._477_say", "120:AB4F9E6B", "Forgive me, but this is a misunderstanding - I've[ENTER]still got the Black Ice. I'm going to get it and[ENTER]come back later... "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._480_say", "65:BC6EBB07", "Ah, there you are! Why have you still got the[ENTER]Black Ice on you? "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._490_say", "96:EE9CBF4A", "I can't do what you have asked of me. It would go[ENTER]against the Dragon God's will. I won't sacrifice[ENTER]the ice! "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._495_say", "177:A9CE2865", "Pha, what a good-for-nothing! Can't even complete[ENTER]the simplest of tasks. Then I'll just have to[ENTER]find someone who's not so squeamish.[ENTER]Give the ice back to me! Come on, give it here! "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._500_say", "41:FD27E2A1", "Should I really give the Black Ice to Soon? "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._510_1_select", "28:5FAC6F16", "Yes, I want to get rid of it! "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._510_2_select", "43:5E0ECD14", "No, he might cause trouble! "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._520_say", "58:6C48DB8D", "Here, take the Black Ice and leave me alone! "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._530_say", "58:E93D5918", "Are you waiting for me to thank you? Get out of[ENTER]my sight! "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._535_sayReward", "45:F10A00E6", "You have received 70,000,000 experience points. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._540_say", "97:EB9BFFB7", "You won't get the ice back. I'm going to throw it[ENTER]in the sea - it won't do any damage there! "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._550_say", "87:1A03B422", "You wouldn't dare! Give it back to me or I'll[ENTER]curse you and your family! "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._560_say", "65:01B89CF9", "Do what you like - I won't let you stop me. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._570_target_pos", "17:4CCE8294", "Southern Shore "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._580_target_pos", "16:95BD49D2", "Western Shore "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._590_target_pos", "16:EFEF35F2", "Eastern Shore "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._599_set_title", "21:28B71A49", "At the end of a wrong track "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._600_say", "67:4A84ACBE", "I should go to Yongan and throw the Black Ice[ENTER]into the sea. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._610_say", "69:F6A346A7", "I should go to Joan and throw the Black Ice into[ENTER]the sea. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._620_say", "73:67D8E32C", "I should go to Pyungmoo and throw the Black Ice[ENTER]into the sea. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._630_say_reward", "201:D9800D67", "Just as you want to throw the Black Ice in the[ENTER]water, it melts. Black liquid drips down from[ENTER]your fingers and onto the floor and then[ENTER]evaporates before you can even touch it. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._640_say", "61:A2411925", "Suddenly the following objects appear in front of[ENTER]you: "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._650_say", "171:90ED4226", "As you pick up the items, you feel satisfied that[ENTER]you made the right decision. And now you hold the[ENTER]Dragon God's gratitude in your hands. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._660_say", "124:0FB4E045", "Oh no, I forgot to take the Black Ice with me! I[ENTER]guess there's nothing else for it but to get it[ENTER]and come back here again. "},
	{"new_quest_lv80._670_sayReward", "64:D4156038", "You have also received 120,000,000 experience[ENTER]points. "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._100_npcChat", "13:8349D8B2", "Open shop "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._100_say_reward", "19:74CCFCC2", "You must hunt: "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._10_targetVid", "20:F10E5104", "General Store Saleswoman: "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._110_say", "98:CD215698", "Look for the Weapon Shop Dealer and ask him why[ENTER]he doesn't sing under the General Store[ENTER]Saleswoman's window any more. "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._120_qSetTitle", "11:15F12868", "Collect Lilac "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._130_notice", "29:BB828C4D", "You have looted a pretty Lilac branch! "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._140_notice", "51:7E2313C9", "Finished! Now let's quickly go back to the Weapon[ENTER]Shop Dealer. "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._150_notice", "34:5384611B", "Unfortunately this Lilac has already withered. "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._160_say", "45:A54214C6", "You need the following number of Lilac branches:[ENTER]%s "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._170_say", "62:4F39CA39", "That's not enough. This Lilac is only enough for[ENTER]a few drops! "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._180_say", "397:D64B37DD", "Ahh, Lilac! Now I just need some unusual Musk[ENTER]Oil. You can only order it in a very special[ENTER]shop. A turning coin will show you the way. You[ENTER]will need some Dragon Marks, but I'm sure you've[ENTER]got some stashed away, haven't you? I would be[ENTER]eternally grateful! Afterwards, you can pick up[ENTER]your order from the Storekeeper. Then I would[ENTER]finally have all the ingredients! "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._190_say", "82:AA12A5D4", "Please hurry up and bring me the Musk Oil. You[ENTER]will get a reward for doing it! "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._200_say_reward", "77:F5989742", "Carry on hunting until you can bring me back %s[ENTER]Lilac branches! "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._20_sayTitle", "15:737EC6B4", "My sweetheart "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._210_say", "44:2858BCE8", "Kill Blue Wolves to get them. "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._220_say", "45:79AA3A23", "That's all. Now go back to the Weapon Shop Dealer. "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._230_qSetTitle", "15:5681E209", "The Musk Oil "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._240_say", "64:AB11AFE0", "Thank you so much. Now I can finally produce a[ENTER]new fragrance. "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._250_say", "111:C948FE93", "You can tell my songbird that I will be singing[ENTER]at her window again tonight. She will be pleased. "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._260_say", "24:2AF27A6A", "You deserve a reward: "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._280_say", "137:5C69B6DF", "I can't produce my fragrance without the Musk[ENTER]Oil. Please let yourself be led by the turning[ENTER]coin and get me another specimen. "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._290_say_reward", "28:5CF2FA5B", "Come back with %s x Musk Oil. "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._300_say", "168:04FA2200", "I need to take some Musk Oil to the Weapon Shop[ENTER]Dealer. I'm supposed to let myself be led by the[ENTER]turning coin, order an unusual fragrance oil and[ENTER]pick it up from the Storekeeper. "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._30_say", "245:016BE0FC", "I miss my sweetheart, the Weapon Shop Dealer. For[ENTER]weeks he was singing below my window every night[ENTER]and now I haven't heard anything from him in[ENTER]days. Perhaps he's afraid of my father. Can you[ENTER]find out what's wrong with him? "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._310_say_title", "16:02B6FCD3", "The Weapon Shop Dealer "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._320_say", "130:BEDF1A94", "Oh, thank you. So you say he was only held up?[ENTER]What a relief. I'm going to wait for him this[ENTER]evening. "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._330_say_reward", "46:A65BD85C", "For you efforts you will get: %s experience[ENTER]points. "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._340_say", "35:EFA3162C", "Go back to the General Store Saleswoman quickly. "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._350_npcChat", "4:A5DA051B", "Lilac "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._35_qSetTitle", "32:FF34F906", "Speak to the Weapon Shop Dealer"},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._360_npcChat", "15:5681E209", "The Musk Oil "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._40_qSetTitle", "12:C9241E79", "A new fragrance "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._45_qSetTitle", "23:1E27C855", "Hunt Blue Wolves "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._50_targetVid", "17:E0E08991", "Weapon Shop Dealer: "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._55_qSetTitle", "25:88C8FD3B", "Back to the Weapon Shop Dealer"},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._60_sayTitle", "7:43922F72", "The rogue "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._65_qSetTitle", "44:2819E280", "Take Musk Oil to the Weapon Shop Dealer"},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._70_say", "430:A8B985A5", "That's right, I haven't been singing below her[ENTER]window any more because... oh, well, I'm so[ENTER]embarrassed to talk about it! My body odour is[ENTER]getting rather repulsive. I wash all the time,[ENTER]but the odour just won't go away. That's why I[ENTER]want to produce a fragrance oil that can[ENTER]enrapture the General Store Saleswoman, my little[ENTER]songbird, with its tangy and fascinating scent.[ENTER]Outward appearance is very important to her. "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._75_qSetTitle", "31:C4B55D9F", "To the General Store Saleswoman"},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._80_say", "115:5DBCAD2F", "I really need to produce a fragrance. It's the[ENTER]only way I can get rid of my unpleasant body[ENTER]odour. "},
	{"new_quest_premium_lv4._90_say", "46:892D0F22", "I need to mix several ingredients for that. These[ENTER]need to be mixed first: "},
	{"notify_test_server._10_chat", "15:3A857F36", "Test server "},
	{"npc_talk._100_say", "343:38FD7118", "I'm a very old man, but I'm still fit and healthy[ENTER]because I have a special secret. I have found out[ENTER]that a potion made of Gango Root Juice and Tue[ENTER]Fungi can prolong your life. If you want to try[ENTER]the potion, take the ingredients to Yu-Hwan. He[ENTER]can brew the potion for you. "},
	{"npc_talk._10_say", "154:B872317B", "Be quiet and maintain your discipline! Behave and[ENTER]don't start any trouble. You should respect your[ENTER]fellow men. Is that understood? "},
	{"npc_talk._110_npcChat", "24:C84FE3EA", "You look quite strong... "},
	{"npc_talk._120_say", "389:0B453844", "For many years, the secret of strength has been[ENTER]passed on in our family. My father told me that[ENTER]if you mix the bell flower into the potion in the[ENTER]right way, the potion will give you extra[ENTER]strength for a short period of time. As far as I[ENTER]know, Beak-Go can brew this potion. You just need[ENTER]to bring him a bell flower.  "},
	{"npc_talk._130_npcChat", "45:F5F2E26C", "Go, tell it on the mountain... "},
	{"npc_talk._140_sayTitle", "15:83A3A155", "Yu-Hwan, the musician: "},
	{"npc_talk._150_say", "244:74D1BACE", "...over the hills and everywhere... Do you also[ENTER]like music? I sing all kinds of songs in solitude[ENTER]here, so that I don't get caught up in the war.[ENTER]But without a country to protect me, I wouldn't[ENTER]be able to keep doing what I do. "},
	{"npc_talk._160_npcChat", "27:3CC51FB7", "Why do you read so much? "},
	{"npc_talk._170_sayTitle", "20:04381819", "Soon, the bookworm: "},
	{"npc_talk._180_say", "187:E482BBC5", "Oh, adventurer! The world is full of problems.[ENTER]You can only survive with a certain amount of[ENTER]knowledge. So honour you books. In bad times -[ENTER]and nowadays the times are always bad - they will[ENTER]help you. Believe me! "},
	{"npc_talk._190_npcChat", "13:A9495959", "Have you got children? "},
	{"npc_talk._200_say", "462:A5002ACD", "Actually I didn't want any children, but...[ENTER]Well I keep collecting Kaki Blossoms because if[ENTER]you prepare them properly, you can strengthen[ENTER]your magical energy with them. Baek-Go found that[ENTER]out. He only needs a single blossom to make 100[ENTER]potions. Unfortunately the Kaki Blossom also has[ENTER]a side effect. If a woman wears a necklace made[ENTER]from this blossom, she will have a son. Between[ENTER]you and me, my wife shamelessly took advantage of[ENTER]this. "},
	{"npc_talk._20_npcChat", "24:E97B354B", "Mmm, it smells good here... "},
	{"npc_talk._210_npcChat", "17:2DB47099", "What's wrong with your foot? "},
	{"npc_talk._230_say", "414:EDA690A6", "It's getting better. While taking a walk[ENTER]recently, I stumbled over a Gango Root and[ENTER]sprained my ankle. Luckily I know the doctor[ENTER]Baek-Go, so he treated me and gave me some[ENTER]advice: To heal small wounds you can brew a[ENTER]potion from these same Gango Roots. So I made the[ENTER]culprit roots into a tea and it cured the damage[ENTER]that it had made... "},
	{"npc_talk._240_npcChat", "12:309F77A7", "Who are you? "},
	{"npc_talk._260_say", "398:28668C3B", "I am Wonda-Rim, Chaegirab's nephew. My uncle is[ENTER]famous! Do you know him? He experiments a lot[ENTER]with potions and herbs. Whilst doing this, he[ENTER]found out that you can get a large amount of[ENTER]protection against magical energy if you mix 100[ENTER]Bo Water with a Mulberry. As far as I know,[ENTER]Huahn-So can produce the potion if you take the[ENTER]ingredients to him. "},
	{"npc_talk._270_npcChat", "26:1441D6F0", "Why have you got so many scars? "},
	{"npc_talk._280_sayTitle", "15:D4F30F16", "Traitor Balso: "},
	{"npc_talk._290_say", "415:D0B902AD", "I'm not a good fighter and I constantly got hurt[ENTER]in war. At some point I asked Yu-Hwan whether he[ENTER]could brew a potion for me that could protect my[ENTER]body from injuries. He brewed me something from[ENTER]Bellflower Juice and Lilac, but unfortunately the[ENTER]protection wasn't sufficient. Or perhaps it was[ENTER]just my own incompetency. But I'm sure the potion[ENTER]will help you. "},
	{"npc_talk._300_npcChat", "31:7B6A6550", "Why do so many people call you a traitor? "},
	{"npc_talk._30_sayTitle", "33:1F4D12B6", "Octavio, the restaurant owner: "},
	{"npc_talk._310_say", "334:55019342", "I fled from the war and joined the Black Wind[ENTER]Gang. My comrades never forgave me for that.[ENTER]Afterwards I found out that the Black Wind[ENTER]Warriors kill innocent people, so I immediately[ENTER]left them. It was awful! "},
	{"npc_talk._320_say", "165:46FDB9A4", "You have innocent people on your conscience? Then[ENTER]you really do deserve your name. You stopped them[ENTER]from leading a good life. "},
	{"npc_talk._330_say", "178:2DF7160D", "We live in a lawless world. But I have decided[ENTER]that I won't do anything bad any more, ever[ENTER]again. I don't want people to keep describing me[ENTER]as a traitor.[ENTER][ENTER]Have you got some Yang for me? "},
	{"npc_talk._340_npcChat", "28:37218B0F", "They call you the scholar? "},
	{"npc_talk._350_sayTitle", "15:A06E8698", "Uriel the wise: "},
	{"npc_talk._360_say", "209:BEC6A915", "There are so many things to learn in this vast[ENTER]world. Ignorance paired with military power is an[ENTER]especially dangerous combination. You don't want[ENTER]to live like these ignorant soldiers, right?[ENTER]Knowledge is power! "},
	{"npc_talk._370_npcChat", "55:51B52CBE", "My sources tell me that you practise medicine? "},
	{"npc_talk._380_say", "228:BED33EB8", "I do what I can. But there are more and more[ENTER]casualties every day in this dangerous world. We[ENTER]don't have enough medicine or helpers. Times are[ENTER]hard! Perhaps you could give me a hand later? "},
	{"npc_talk._390_npcChat", "14:0B1DAED2", "How's the hunting business going? "},
	{"npc_talk._400_sayTitle", "17:6C2B0298", "Yang-Shin the hunter: "},
	{"npc_talk._40_say", "103:EA40E810", "Welcome! Our traditional restaurant is so[ENTER]successful that we could open restaurants[ENTER]worldwide. If you want to have something yummy to[ENTER]eat, then come around and give our food a try. "},
	{"npc_talk._410_say", "248:E403CFB1", "Hmm, ever since the Metin stones came down,[ENTER]animals have become really wild. Nowadays, you're[ENTER]already risking your life when you go out to hunt[ENTER]some chickens. It's a dangerous time for hunters.[ENTER]Luckily, I'm one of the best! "},
	{"npc_talk._420_npcChat", "40:EEACDC39", "Where does your high accuracy come from? "},
	{"npc_talk._430_say", "364:87648507", "I'm great with a bow, because I have a special[ENTER]recipe, hehe! When you mix Peach Blossom Juice[ENTER]with Lilac, you get a potion that increases your[ENTER]accuracy. Take the ingredients to Yu-Hwan, I'm[ENTER]sure he'll brew the potion for you. "},
	{"npc_talk._440_npcChat", "37:38AAF8C1", "Such a nice floral wreath... "},
	{"npc_talk._450_say", "308:C4870FF1", "I used to collect Peach Blossoms with my brother.[ENTER]But I have to do it alone today. They don't look[ENTER]very pretty, but they have a special effect.[ENTER]If you take a Peach Blossom to Baek-Go, he'll[ENTER]brew a potion from it that makes you very[ENTER]nimble-footed! "},
	{"npc_talk._460_npcChat", "22:B190C131", "Where's your brother? "},
	{"npc_talk._470_say", "68:0A0BCE26", "Recently my brother has been travelling a lot. I[ENTER]barely see him any more and I worry a lot about[ENTER]him. "},
	{"npc_talk._480_npcChat", "28:51E8614C", "You sell rice cakes? "},
	{"npc_talk._490_sayTitle", "28:7CC54ADC", "Yu-Rang, the Rice Cake seller: "},
	{"npc_talk._500_say", "163:EDD84F16", "It is difficult to sell Rice cakes because of the[ENTER]war. Thanks to the bandits, I have lost lots of[ENTER]customers. I just don't know what I should do for[ENTER]a living any more. "},
	{"npc_talk._50_say", "74:7BF6F530", "Although it is a big restaurant, the furnishing[ENTER]is surprisingly simple. "},
	{"npc_talk._510_npcChat", "21:90138688", "Who usually buys goods from you? "},
	{"npc_talk._520_say", "511:12904B90", "I sell most of my cakes to travellers. One day, a[ENTER]mysterious cavalier dressed in black came to see[ENTER]me. As payment, he gave me a recipe that you can[ENTER]make with Zin Water. It's a potion that improves[ENTER]your attack power. I sold the recipe to Huahn-So.[ENTER]If you take some Sim Water and an Alpine Rose to[ENTER]Huahn-So, he will produce some Zin-Water for you. "},
	{"npc_talk._530_npcChat", "32:F79BC95A", "Why do you look so sad? "},
	{"npc_talk._540_say", "182:CAE005FB", "Oh, who could have known that our sweet dreams[ENTER]would be shattered so mercilessly... My poor[ENTER]husband, he fell during battle! ... Please avenge[ENTER]his death. "},
	{"npc_talk._550_npcChat", "29:6AD000D0", "So many people have fallen in the war... "},
	{"npc_talk._560_say", "516:69B42562", "We're losing more and more men in the war, so the[ENTER]women in the village gathered together and asked[ENTER]Huahn-So to create a better healing potion.[ENTER]After a lot of research, he produced a potion[ENTER]which increases defence, so that less healing[ENTER]potions have to be used. Go see him. I'm sure he[ENTER]can produce the potion, that he calls[ENTER]SamBo-Water, for you. He just needs some[ENTER]Dok-Water and a Alpine Rose to make it. "},
	{"npc_talk._570_npcChat", "28:17E9CD44", "Oh, what a cute child... "},
	{"npc_talk._590_say", "93:79249837", "He is screaming again... I don't know whether he[ENTER]wants some sweets or... oh no! "},
	{"npc_talk._600_npcChat", "18:F11AE74E", "How are you two? "},
	{"npc_talk._60_npcChat", "31:D32BAD9B", "Tell me something about pottery. "},
	{"npc_talk._610_say", "432:83B28C95", "My child! Now that my husband has fallen in the[ENTER]war, I need to look after myself. I am trying to[ENTER]support myself and my child on my own. And thanks[ENTER]to the Bo Water, I have found a way to make a[ENTER]living. I need to bring Yu-Hwan 100 Kaki Blossom[ENTER]Juices and one Tue Fungus. He brews Bo Water from[ENTER]these things, which sells really easily. After[ENTER]all, I need to get by somehow... "},
	{"npc_talk._620_npcChat", "27:02C32C44", "How is your husband? "},
	{"npc_talk._640_say", "124:5104988B", "My so-called husband is married to his books. He[ENTER]barely even looks at me any more. And I'm not an[ENTER]ugly woman. "},
	{"npc_talk._650_npcChat", "24:AC62C0A8", "How's business? "},
	{"npc_talk._660_say", "291:42C6FAAE", "Since the war broke out, business has been really[ENTER]bad. The merchant's union was once a rich and[ENTER]powerful union, but those days are over now. We[ENTER]cannot keep on ignoring the wild, the white oath[ENTER]soldiers and the black wind soldiers any more. "},
	{"npc_talk._670_npcChat", "33:45781326", "Why are you in such a bad mood? "},
	{"npc_talk._690_say", "101:1FA973F2", "Harang is a bad girl! I hate her! I'm weak, and[ENTER]she's always picking on me! "},
	{"npc_talk._700_say", "56:B24CDDB0", "You're a man, and you have muscles. Work them out[ENTER]a bit! "},
	{"npc_talk._70_sayTitle", "16:B9D029EC", "Yonah the potter: "},
	{"npc_talk._710_npcChat", "14:A8E26C54", "What are you doing? "},
	{"npc_talk._730_say", "136:EDCFD62A", "I'm waiting for Taurean. We often play together[ENTER]and we fight a lot too. What a coward! If he[ENTER]doesn't come voluntarily, I'll give him a really[ENTER]hard time! "},
	{"npc_talk._740_npcChat", "24:5F712FBD", "Taurean is scared of you. "},
	{"npc_talk._750_say", "502:64D3C6B9", "Taurean is actually stronger than me. So now I've[ENTER]thought of a way that I can win anyway. A white[ENTER]Ninja told me that you can mix Young Water with a[ENTER]Mulberry and make a potion that makes you hit[ENTER]more quickly. Then I'll finally be able to defeat[ENTER]Taurean! If you also want to becomes a quick[ENTER]attacker, then take the the ingredients to[ENTER]Huahn-So. I'm sure he'll make the potion for you. "},
	{"npc_talk._760_npcChat", "14:7917F7D6", "New insight... "},
	{"npc_talk._780_say", "199:65E8098F", "My friend, the world is full of unanswered[ENTER]questions. And I, am a seeker of answers and a[ENTER]seeker of knowledge. Have you ever heard of epic[ENTER]weapons and Spirit Stones? "},
	{"npc_talk._790_npcChat", "14:A8E26C54", "What are you doing? "},
	{"npc_talk._800_say", "153:840FDF64", "You probably already know that I research unknown[ENTER]knowledge. And at the moment I'm looking into a[ENTER]method of further reinforcing weapons and[ENTER]improving the power of the Spirit Stones. "},
	{"npc_talk._80_say", "438:2B604547", "I like being a potter. It's very satisfying to[ENTER]mould clay with your own hands and to see how[ENTER]something is being created... I usually only make[ENTER]simple things. In the east, on the outskirts of[ENTER]the continent, the production methods are a lot[ENTER]more developed. I saw some pottery there once and[ENTER]I was really inspired. Sometimes, when I have the[ENTER]time, I try experimenting. But I still haven't[ENTER]found out which trick they use. "},
	{"npc_talk._810_npcChat", "27:6CF303D1", "The weapon research... "},
	{"npc_talk._820_say", "277:5C5A1159", "Interesting isn't it? Do you want to know more[ENTER]about it? Then please bring me the appropriate[ENTER]level 65 weapon +9. I also need a Fencing[ENTER]Pamphlet and two Blessing Scrolls. I'll try to[ENTER]make you an epic weapon out of them. "},
	{"npc_talk._830_say", "41:6BDD978F", "However, I can't promise that it'll work. "},
	{"npc_talk._840_npcChat", "18:C6397207", "The Spirit Stones... "},
	{"npc_talk._850_say", "248:E8A1F103", "Spirit Stones are widely used, but although they[ENTER]are used a lot, most people don't really know[ENTER]what their true power is. But my research has[ENTER]helped me to find out a lot more about them. If[ENTER]you bring me another Spirit Stone, I can improve[ENTER]it for you. "},
	{"npc_talk._90_npcChat", "53:26715373", "You're very sprightly for your age... "},
	{"olympic_badge._010_npcChat", "15:76C95BF0", "Hero's Medal "},
	{"olympic_badge._020_say", "8:0BF1A939", "Help me! "},
	{"olympic_badge._030_say", "289:0443E6FE", "Dratted thieves...[ENTER]They broke into my house last night![ENTER]They've stolen the Hero's Medal. My ancestor was[ENTER]awarded the medal after he ran 42.195 km from the[ENTER]battlefield to his emperor, to tell him about[ENTER]their battle victory.[ENTER]And now it's gone! "},
	{"olympic_badge._040_say", "78:977221B6", "Oh dear... it has sentimental value to my family[ENTER]and I. What on earth should I do? "},
	{"olympic_badge._050_say", "13:F2043C86", "Will you help me? "},
	{"olympic_badge._060_npcChat", "15:76C95BF0", "Hero's Medal "},
	{"olympic_badge._070_say", "56:8A524C22", "Finally! You're back![ENTER]Did you find the Hero's Medal? "},
	{"olympic_badge._080_say", "128:FD358B0E", "But why? What do those thieves want to do with my[ENTER]medal? It's worthless to strangers! Can you help[ENTER]me find it? "},
	{"olympic_badge._090_npcChat", "23:83EE2B12", "Find the Hero's Medal! "},
	{"olympic_badge._100_say", "149:3B499567", "You've returned empty-handed? Oh no, I'm so[ENTER]distressed. If you can't help me, then who can?[ENTER]Carry on looking, please! "},
	{"olympic_badge._110_say", "190:A5E07B5B", "You've found my medal![ENTER]But wait... that's just one piece of it. What a[ENTER]disgrace, they broke it into five pieces![ENTER]Please bring me all the fragments! Then I might[ENTER]be able to put the medal back together. "},
	{"olympic_badge._120_say", "163:E8E661E2", "Those wretched criminals have broken my family[ENTER]heirloom! Thank you for finding all the pieces.[ENTER]Now I can put the pieces back together. "},
	{"olympic_badge._130_say", "118:CCCC2BA0", "Thank you so much! You've restored my family's[ENTER]honour. Of course all your trouble will not be in[ENTER]vain. Here's your just reward! "},
	{"olympic_badge._140_say", "117:E5B8F3E5", "Do you really want to decline this mission? If[ENTER]you select 'yes', you will not be able to accept[ENTER]it later. "},
	{"olympic_badge._150_say", "132:9755C279", "I understand if you don't have enough time for it[ENTER]now. Come again when it suits you better. But[ENTER]don't make me wait for long! "},
	{"olympic_badge._160_say", "133:F8B49F2F", "Unfortunately you arrived too late and can't help[ENTER]me now. I wish you all the best for the future! "},
	{"olympic_badge._170_say", "187:009DEFD5", "Hunt the monsters that stole from me! But be[ENTER]careful, they were very strong - at least level[ENTER]30. If you bring back my Hero's Medal, I will[ENTER]give you a generous reward! "},
	{"olympic_badge._180_say", "46:577FE914", "Find the Hero's Medal and take it to Yu-Hwan. "},
	{"olympic_badge._190_say", "84:B7E13F10", "Yu-Hwan needs your help. Go see him! You will[ENTER]find him in the second village. "},
