	{"pony_buy._100_say", "87:5007AA41", "Kill 20 Savage Archers within 30 minutes and give[ENTER]the result to the Stable Boy. "},
	{"pony_buy._10_npcChat", "14:9C551A92", "I want to ride. "},
	{"pony_buy._110_npcChat", "21:076F8D05", "Status upgrade pony-quest. "},
	{"pony_buy._120_npcChat", "31:A50D5E5B", "Progress of the qualification test "},
	{"pony_buy._130_sayReward", "58:F9E5D22D", "Kill 20 Savage Archers within 30 minutes and come[ENTER]back here afterwards! "},
	{"pony_buy._140_select", "7:729E4BAD", "Leave "},
	{"pony_buy._150_say", "36:BE09C410", "Do you really want to cancel the qualification[ENTER]test? "},
	{"pony_buy._160_select", "23:8B2A749E", "No, just kidding. "},
	{"pony_buy._170_say", "30:30C8F31C", "Make sure that you're successful next time. "},
	{"pony_buy._180_sayTitle", "10:65E0ED3A", "Stable Boy: "},
	{"pony_buy._190_say", "106:90B1E3EC", "You don't have time to stand around here. Hurry[ENTER]up! Kill those Savage Archers and come back! "},
	{"pony_buy._200_say", "224:AEACCA3C", "You have finished the test successfully, very[ENTER]good. You need a Horse Picture to be able to[ENTER]ride. It will take some time before I can make[ENTER]you one. Come back tomorrow. Don't forget that[ENTER]the Horse Picture costs 100,000 Yang! "},
	{"pony_buy._20_say", "113:DD5E5AC9", "You need to have level 25 to be able to ride. In[ENTER]my opinion, you need to get a little bit better[ENTER]first though. "},
	{"pony_buy._210_makequestbutton", "29:7122995E", "Horse Picture in progress "},
	{"pony_buy._220_sayReward", "142:AEE9B9AE", "The Stable Boy is making a Horse Picture for you[ENTER]but it takes some time. Go to him once the Horse[ENTER]Picture is ready. "},
	{"pony_buy._230_npcChat", "31:F1ADABC7", "Is the Horse Picture ready? "},
	{"pony_buy._240_say", "82:336F5275", "It will take a while before it's ready.[ENTER]Remember to bring 100,000 Yang! "},
	{"pony_buy._250_makequestbutton", "19:5746B996", "Go to the Stable Boy "},
	{"pony_buy._260_sayReward", "69:7DDE8D9D", "The Stable Boy has finished the Horse Picture. Go[ENTER]to him and pick it up. "},
	{"pony_buy._270_npcChat", "28:0614E3EC", "I want to collect the Horse Picture. "},
	{"pony_buy._280_sayTitle", "10:65E0ED3A", "Stable Boy: "},
	{"pony_buy._290_say", "224:F759662C", "I have finished the Horse Picture. Now, you can[ENTER]ride a beginner's horse and so move faster.[ENTER]The Horse Picture costs 100,000 Yang.[ENTER]Do you want to buy it? "},
	{"pony_buy._300_select", "10:7FCE1983", "Do not buy "},
	{"pony_buy._30_say", "226:03B90F7E", "If you want to ride, you need to take a[ENTER]qualification test first. To participate in the[ENTER]qualification test, you need to give me a Horse[ENTER]Medal. The easiest way to get one is in the[ENTER]Monkey Dungeon in the second village. The monkeys[ENTER]won't just hand it over to you though... "},
	{"pony_buy._310_say", "205:979B4C08", "This picture allows you to call the horse from[ENTER]wherever you are. If you lose the picture, you'll[ENTER]have to pay for a new one. So, take good care of[ENTER]it! "},
	{"pony_buy._320_say", "36:6BFED15E", "You don't have enough Yang for the Horse Picture! "},
	{"pony_buy._330_say", "14:4E1C8138", "Come back later. "},
	{"pony_buy._340_say", "129:EB83C0F6", "Do you really want to give up the Horse Picture[ENTER]mission? If you cancel it now, you'll have to[ENTER]start the quest all over again. "},
	{"pony_buy._350_select", "4:AEC6064F", "No "},
	{"pony_buy._360_makequestbutton", "19:B8E7D72E", "Time limit exceeded! "},
	{"pony_buy._370_sayReward", "110:AE720A3E", "You did not pass the qualification test because[ENTER]you did not manage to kill 20 Savage Archers[ENTER]within 30 minutes. "},
	{"pony_buy._380_sayReward", "109:D1F6EBF8", "In order to repeat the challenge, take a Horse[ENTER]Medal to the Stable Boy and apply for a new[ENTER]qualification test. "},
	{"pony_buy._40_say", "219:5842C44C", "Ohh, you have the Horse Medal, great! Now you[ENTER]need to prove that you have the necessary[ENTER]qualifications for riding. Please kill 20 Savage[ENTER]Archers within 30 minutes. If you manage that,[ENTER]then you're ready to ride. "},
	{"pony_buy._50_say", "34:57665275", "Come again if you're still interested. "},
	{"pony_buy._60_say", "62:36EBB6AB", "Apparently, there is a problem with the[ENTER]information about riding. "},
	{"pony_buy._70_sayReward", "144:B16007F2", "Take a Horse Medal to the Stable Boy! After that,[ENTER]you may continue the riding-training mission. You[ENTER]can get the Horse Medal in the Monkey Dungeon. "},
	{"pony_buy._80_makequestbutton", "30:17D0AFC8", "Riding Qualification "},
