	{"pony_levelup._530_say", "80:5122660C", "You need a Horse Medal to train. The results will[ENTER]be noted on the medal. "},
	{"pony_levelup._540_say", "108:81DF9059", "Horses need a break too. It'd be better if you[ENTER]came back tomorrow. "},
	{"pony_levelup._550_say", "78:A72FC735", "Your horse looks very tired. You should let it[ENTER]rest. "},
	{"pony_levelup._560_say", "72:F16D6642", "Your horse seems to be hungry. How about feeding[ENTER]it before training? "},
	{"pony_levelup._570_say", "84:F74095F6", "Your horse doesn't need any more training. Try[ENTER]getting hold of the Armed Horse Book. "},
	{"pony_levelup._580_say", "17:41598670", "Ride over to me. "},
	{"pony_levelup._590_say", "399:E519DA85", "You have almost completed your training. Go off[ENTER]and explore the area on your horse. It might be[ENTER]more difficult this time but you can do it. Just[ENTER]follow your nose and keep your eyes peeled. Good[ENTER]bye and come back soon! All progress will be[ENTER]noted on your Horse Medal. It won't be long until[ENTER]you are ready to go on to the medium level. "},
	{"pony_levelup._60_sayReward", "25:1CDD0CF5", "Arrived at destination (8)! "},
	{"pony_levelup._620_say", "484:35C8E1F9", "It seems you've improved your horsemanship[ENTER]skills. Move out and explore the map on your[ENTER]horse's back. Even if it's a little dangerous;[ENTER]with your training, you should be able to do it.[ENTER]It's a long trip, so you had better get moving.[ENTER]Farewell, my friend and come back soon. The[ENTER]results of your training will be noted on your[ENTER]Horse Medal. It seems to me like it's about time[ENTER]to raise your horse's level! "},
	{"pony_levelup._650_say", "245:9DB7386C", "You seem to have learned enough. It's time to get[ENTER]tough. Go visit the main outpost. Check your[ENTER]Horse Medal! It's going to show you the results[ENTER]of your training today. "},
	{"pony_levelup._680_say", "377:E1D5831F", "It seems like your horse has evolved! But to me,[ENTER]you're obviously still a novice at handling[ENTER]horses. You should practise riding, because it[ENTER]lays the foundation for everything else. So get[ENTER]in your saddle and get the horse to turn by[ENTER]itself. One look at the Horse Medal will tell you[ENTER]if you have been successful. "},
	{"pony_levelup._690_say", "28:3574F923", "The quest status is strange "},
	{"pony_levelup._700_makequestbutton", "19:14E6ED87", "Find a Horse Medal "},
	{"pony_levelup._70_makequestbutton", "25:112B24D8", "Horseman training (7) "},
	{"pony_levelup._710_sayReward", "86:91621798", "You need a Horse Medal to do the horseman[ENTER]training. You can get one from the easy monkey[ENTER]dungeon. "},
	{"pony_levelup._720_makequestbutton", "28:71DEBFDC", "Horseman training has failed "},
	{"pony_levelup._730_sayReward", "103:E799EDBB", "Horseman training failed because you got off the[ENTER]horse or passed through a portal. "},
	{"pony_levelup._740_sayReward", "103:E799EDBB", "Horseman training failed because you got off the[ENTER]horse or passed through a portal. "},
	{"pony_levelup._750_say", "20:0A82105E", "Return to the Stable Boy "},
	{"pony_levelup._760_sayReward", "92:E86E6B5A", "Return to the Stable Boy to have your results[ENTER]noted on your Horse Medal. "},
	{"pony_levelup._770_sayReward", "41:7B02D9A3", "You can use a portal to end the training. "},
	{"pony_levelup._780_say", "147:72267D0B", "Did you manage to finish everything? The training[ENTER]will continue tomorrow. I'm going to note today's[ENTER]results on your Horse Medal. "},
	{"pony_levelup._790_makequestbutton", "26:C6AEF4CB", "Beginner's Horse Results "},
	{"pony_levelup._800_say", "40:79DA1D30", "You can improve your horse now. "},
