	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._100_say", "48:7099A1F4", "Here, for a little bit of cash they shall be[ENTER]yours. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._10_npcChat", "12:309F77A7", "Who are you? "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._110_say", "48:5BA70F3B", "You can choose one of these items as a reward: "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._120_say", "8:7CBD42EA", "or %dx "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._130_4_select", "18:5ACB3107", "I'm not going to swap! "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._140_say", "36:215FAFE8", "Thank you! I already have %d Glyph Stones. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._150_1_select", "36:B314CCB6", "What do you need these stones for? "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._150_2_select", "7:7D5CFFE0", "Good "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._160_say", "117:A949E55A", "These stones were made in the times of the[ENTER]ancient empire - nobody knows how they are made[ENTER]any more. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._170_say", "37:62164247", "A lot of them have gone missing since then. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._190_say", "96:FB9B32F5", "I have discovered one of the old portals in the[ENTER]hinterland and am now searching for the stones[ENTER]that can help me to open them. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._200_say", "104:8753D089", "However, I don't just need Glyph Stones, but I[ENTER]also need gold to channel the magic currents. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._210_say", "138:7E35583E", "However, I need more gold than I actually have.[ENTER]If you get hold of some gold for me, I'll give[ENTER]you this Dragon God Amulet. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._220_say", "114:3974AB37", "If you carry it with you, an Old Man or a[ENTER]Teleporter can directly take you to the blocked[ENTER]portal. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._230_say", "80:5B7C9F05", "You will get one if you bring me pure gold in one[ENTER]of these forms: "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._240_say", "111:81930354", "Unfortunately you do not have enough gold to[ENTER]start the ritual. I need more pure gold: "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._250_say", "20:2A8B3E0F", "Perhaps another time. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._260_npcChat", "11:4F567134", "Here's some gold. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._270_say", "130:69987DB0", "Where? Unfortunately you don't have any pure gold[ENTER]with you. If you want a Dragon God Amulet, please[ENTER]bring me the following items: "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._280_say", "16:84F9DA86", "Give Heuk-Young: "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._290_select", "4:D965E9AC", "Nothing "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._300_say", "77:DAA15A64", "That's very kind of you! Here, as I promised, the[ENTER]amulet is yours. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._30_say", "175:F56FEDCA", "My name is Heuk-Young. I'm an annalist and I'm in[ENTER]charge of our people's ancient records. The first[ENTER]transcripts tell the story of the founding of the[ENTER]three kingdoms: "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._310_say", "99:524C5F31", "If you carry the Dragon God Amulet with you, an[ENTER]Old Man or a teleporter takes you to the vicinity[ENTER]of the portal. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._320_say", "66:BAF34F06", "Ah, I see you already have an amulet. But thank[ENTER]you anyway! "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._330_say", "39:55A493C2", "I have already collected gold amounting to %d[ENTER]Yang. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._40_say", "47:08A9A378", "Our kingdom Shinsoo as well as Chunjo and Jinno. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._50_say", "47:3664BFD2", "Our kingdom Chunjo as well as Shinsoo and Jinno. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._60_say", "47:40FEF5EA", "Our kingdom Jinno as well as Chunjo and Shinsoo. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._70_say", "154:0FCD9445", "I'm investigating the ancient portals that used[ENTER]to allow people to travel to distant regions. We[ENTER]need special stones to open them. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._80_say", "158:06978863", "They carry special symbols. If you get hold of[ENTER]one of these stones, please bring it to me. I[ENTER]will, of course, reward you for it. See, this is[ENTER]what they look like: "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._90_1_select", "32:D0890AC0", "I have found some of those stones. "},
	{"pre_event_heavens_cave._90_2_select", "4:48F9C4CD", "Yes "},
	{"pricing_lv12._10_send_letter", "8:63257DCD", "Packages "},
	{"pricing_lv12._20_say_title", "18:E54E1B16", "Packages have arrived! "},
	{"pricing_lv12._30_say", "133:07DCCF43", "During war we can use all the help we can get. A[ENTER]few packages are waiting for you, which will help[ENTER]equip you for battle better. "},
	{"pricing_lv12._40_say", "84:EC4C0363", "And the good news is: You can save loads with[ENTER]these packages! "},
	{"pricing_lv12._50_say_reward", "51:47967181", "A turning coin will show you the way to the[ENTER]packages. "},
	{"pricing_lv40._10_send_letter", "8:63257DCD", "Packages "},
	{"pricing_lv40._20_say_title", "39:F7B3D6E5", "Pro packages have arrived! "},
	{"pricing_lv40._30_say", "172:FE1F3700", "Even the strongest fighters can get better[ENTER]equipment. The Pro Packages can help you to[ENTER]resist the powers of evil even more effectively. "},
	{"pricing_lv40._40_say", "84:EC4C0363", "And the good news is: You can save loads with[ENTER]these packages! "},
	{"pricing_lv40._50_say_reward", "51:47967181", "A turning coin will show you the way to the[ENTER]packages. "},
	{"pricing_lv9._10_send_letter", "8:63257DCD", "Packages "},
	{"pricing_lv9._20_say_title", "18:E54E1B16", "Packages have arrived! "},
	{"pricing_lv9._30_say", "129:39146F3C", "In times of war we can do with all the help we[ENTER]can get. Thankfully new packages have arrived[ENTER]which can help beginners like you. "},
	{"pricing_lv9._40_say", "84:EC4C0363", "And the good news is: You can save loads with[ENTER]these packages! "},
	{"pricing_lv9._50_say_reward", "51:47967181", "A turning coin will show you the way to the[ENTER]packages. "},
