	{"reset_scroll._120_say", "63:26CFD660", "You can't reverse this. Do you still want to use[ENTER]the scroll? "},
	{"reset_scroll._140_sayTitle", "19:EC173E47", "Reset skill "},
	{"reset_scroll._150_say", "23:29ABE6A8", "Re-initialize skill %s. "},
	{"reset_scroll._160_sayReward", "38:2B7B383E", "The chosen skill was reset. "},
	{"reset_scroll._20_say", "309:90474002", "This scroll lets you undo all the status[ENTER]improvements you have made so far. This affects[ENTER]all of your attributes: VIT, INT, STR and DEX will[ENTER]be reset to their minimum value. You can then[ENTER]redistribute the points you get back.[ENTER][ENTER]Do you want to use the scroll? "},
	{"reset_scroll._30_sayTitle", "32:028CAAFF", "Status reset: Confirm "},
	{"reset_scroll._40_say", "159:9C549950", "All your status points will be reset to 1.[ENTER]Do you really want to reset your status? "},
	{"reset_scroll._50_sayTitle", "19:EC173E47", "Reset skill "},
	{"reset_scroll._60_sayReward", "313:DD543A0E", "A skill of your choice will be reset. You will[ENTER]receive all the points of that particular skill[ENTER]back, apart from the ones that you got from[ENTER]books. This means that you will get a maximum of[ENTER]17 skill points back. You can redistribute the[ENTER]points that you get back onto a skill of your[ENTER]choice. "},
	{"reset_scroll._70_say", "58:93D7AC46", "You do not have a skill that can be reset. "},
	{"reset_scroll._80_say", "43:FB5B881F", "Please choose the skill you would like to reset. "},
	{"reset_scroll._90_sayReward", "313:DD543A0E", "A skill of your choice is going to be reset, so[ENTER]you can assign your points again. You are going[ENTER]to lose all points gathered through books,[ENTER]though, and you can only get back a maximum of 17[ENTER]points, even if you used more points for the[ENTER]skill. "},
	{"reset_status._100_say", "10:4D545491", "Continue "},
