	{"ride._010_say", "22:017347DD", "Your level is too low. "},
	{"ride._020_say", "60:F77E866C", "You cannot ride while you are transformed! "},
	{"ride._030_say", "118:9BB41C60", "You're already riding! If you want to change your[ENTER]mount, you have to get off first. "},
	{"ride._040_say", "75:7215FF67", "You need to send your horse away if you want to[ENTER]use another mount. "},
	{"ride_mount_change._010_npcChat", "26:51F63D9F", "Swap animal seal "},
	{"ride_mount_change._020_say", "124:890FF1F7", "Hello! I heard that you swap animal seals? These[ENTER]seals are just too powerful for me, I can't use[ENTER]them yet... "},
	{"ride_mount_change._040_say", "291:84B5F0C7", "But of course. Lots of adventurers swap seals[ENTER]here, so I've always got something appropriate in[ENTER]stock. Are you sure you want to swap your high[ENTER]level animals seals for ones that match your[ENTER]level? "},
	{"ride_mount_change._050_select", "13:A805A950", "Yes, I want to swap them. "},
	{"ride_mount_change._060_select", "16:DDFE8EA5", "No, I want to keep them. "},
	{"ride_ticket_change._010_npcChat", "33:57F3CCF5", "Swap certificate for mount "},
	{"ride_ticket_change._020_say", "152:880AFF50", "You want to swap your certificate for a mount?[ENTER]Let me see which ones you've got with you. If you[ENTER]own several certificates, you can choose between[ENTER]them in the following steps. "},
	{"ride_ticket_change._030_say", "167:D6C5D9A4", "Do you want to have this mount? Then confirm with[ENTER]a 'yes' and give him a bonus in the next step.[ENTER]Select 'no' to go to the next certificate. "},
	{"ride_ticket_change._040_say", "10:387847C7", "Are you sure? "},
	{"ride_ticket_change._050_say", "102:FD70C55C", "So you don't want to swap your certificate. Come[ENTER]back later when you're ready to do it. "},
	{"ride_ticket_change._060_say", "26:8911BAE8", "Now select a bonus. "},
	{"ride_ticket_change._070_say", "25:3D64F43C", "Strength against monsters "},
	{"ride_ticket_change._080_say", "19:8837F9DE", "Experience (EXP) "},
	{"ride_ticket_change._090_say", "18:35190AC3", "Hit Points (HP) "},
	{"ride_ticket_change._100_say", "13:223F52E0", "Defence (DEF) "},
	{"ride_ticket_change._110_say", "11:7A809AA5", "Attack Value (AV) "},
	{"ride_ticket_change._120_say", "24:EC4B3427", "No, thank you. "},
	{"ride_ticket_change._130_say", "133:9FB87BA2", "You don't seem to be able to decide. Come back[ENTER]later when you're ready. "},
	{"ride_ticket_change._140_say", "25:2305DF93", "You've made a wise choice. Good luck! "},
	{"ride_ticket_change._150_say", "27:132B0B4A", "Hm, something seems to have gone wrong. "},
	{"ring_warp._010_say", "15:1D3F995A", "Cancel process. "},
	{"ring_warp._020_say", "44:61A2AA3F", "You may use the ring again in %d minutes. "},
	{"ring_warp._030_say", "36:31FE8AC8", "Teleport (remaining jumps: %d) "},
	{"skill_group._100_sayTitle", "28:8A50A555", "Warrior training teacher: "},
	{"skill_group._10_sendLetter", "8:02E01CEC", "The training "},
	{"skill_group._110_sayReward", "279:8BCF96C8", "If you admire a Warrior because of his rapid and[ENTER]repeated attacks, I recommend the Body-Force[ENTER]Teacher. If you want to defeat entire groups of[ENTER]monsters with a single attack, I recommend the[ENTER]Mental-Fight Teacher. We're waiting for you near[ENTER]the village square. "},
	{"skill_group._120_sayTitle", "23:988C72FA", "Ninja training teacher: "},
	{"skill_group._130_sayReward", "229:03A8C500", "If you want to call yourself an outstanding[ENTER]archer, then learn about Archery. If you are[ENTER]ready to carry out various secret missions in the[ENTER]dark as a Ninja, then Blade-Fighting is for you.[ENTER]We'll be waiting for you by the village square. "},
	{"skill_group._140_sayTitle", "22:3BE54C27", "Sura training teacher: "},
	{"skill_group._150_sayReward", "281:4A3EFF33", "Do you want to be a true sword magician and[ENTER]demonic warrior? Then I recommend Magic-Weaponry[ENTER]Training. But if you want to be feared as a[ENTER]magician of darkness and curses then choose the[ENTER]Black Magic Training.[ENTER]We'll wait for you in the vicinity of the Village[ENTER]Square. "},
	{"skill_group._160_sayTitle", "26:EE89B85A", "Shaman training teacher: "},
	{"skill_group._170_sayReward", "316:044C5930", "If you want to become a Shaman who controls magic[ENTER]and blessing, then choose the Dragon Force[ENTER]training. However, if you want to heal the pain[ENTER]of those suffering, then I recommend Healing[ENTER]Force training. We'll be waiting for you near the[ENTER]Village Square. "},
	{"skill_group._180_npcChat", "30:E54CFD64", "Begin Body-Force training "},
	{"skill_group._190_sayTitle", "20:D0440923", "Wrong training "},
	{"skill_group._200_say", "66:A76873F3", "I'm sorry.[ENTER]Only Warriors can choose Body-Force training. "},
	{"skill_group._20_targetVid", "18:431AEC23", "Body-Force Teacher "},
	{"skill_group._210_sayReward", "74:7F6B483B", "A Warrior can choose between Body-Force and[ENTER]Mental-Fight training. "},
	{"skill_group._220_sayReward", "67:008B757C", "A Ninja can choose between Blade-Fight training[ENTER]and Archery training. "},
	{"skill_group._230_sayReward", "64:133417FC", "A Sura can choose between Weaponry training and[ENTER]Black Magic training. "},
	{"skill_group._240_sayReward", "71:6D691C0A", "A Shaman can choose between the Dragon Force and[ENTER]the Healing Force training. "},
	{"skill_group._250_sayTitle", "18:431AEC23", "Body-Force training "},
	{"skill_group._260_say", "145:57A05439", "A student of Body-Force training trains his body[ENTER]strength and learns how to use it in the best[ENTER]way. His attacks inflict deep wounds, so that his[ENTER]opponents are easily and quickly defeated. "},
	{"skill_group._270_sayReward", "46:7220DBB7", "Requirement: Warrior at level 5 or above "},
	{"skill_group._280_select", "11:86187BEE", "Start "},
	{"skill_group._290_select", "8:376AE857", "Save for later "},
	{"skill_group._30_targetVid", "21:C01F781B", "Mental-Fight Teacher "},
	{"skill_group._310_sayTitle", "29:BB71E40D", "You have chosen Body-Force training. "},
	{"skill_group._320_say", "7:D9F67B2D", "Welcome! "},
	{"skill_group._330_say", "145:097D9F2F", "You will receive skill points for deciding to do[ENTER]training. You can use them to improve the skills[ENTER]of your choice. "},
	{"skill_group._340_sayReward", "32:FD769356", "You have received skill points. "},
	{"skill_group._350_sayReward", "94:F1404F75", "Once you have chosen your training, you will not[ENTER]receive any more skill points. "},
	{"skill_group._360_npcChat", "33:20F02198", "Begin Mental-Fight training "},
	{"skill_group._370_sayTitle", "20:D0440923", "Wrong training "},
	{"skill_group._380_say", "67:74EC919A", "I'm sorry. Only Warriors can choose Mental-Fight[ENTER]training. "},
	{"skill_group._390_sayReward", "67:008B757C", "A Ninja can choose between Blade-Fight training[ENTER]and Archery training. "},
	{"skill_group._400_sayTitle", "22:656E7A21", "Mental-Fight training "},
	{"skill_group._40_targetVid", "19:FF5AEEC8", "Blade-Fight Teacher "},
	{"skill_group._410_say", "128:9430C1D9", "Mental-Fight training teaches to attack the enemy[ENTER]with strong chi attacks and how to defend[ENTER]yourself from his attacks. "},
	{"skill_group._420_sayTitle", "32:18BCC41E", "You have chosen Mental-Fight training. "},
	{"skill_group._430_npcChat", "32:EA232DA9", "Start Blade-Fight training "},
	{"skill_group._440_say", "63:C4903FD8", "I'm sorry.[ENTER]Only a Ninja can choose Blade-Fight training. "},
	{"skill_group._450_sayTitle", "20:7D52D57E", "Blade-Fight training "},
	{"skill_group._460_say", "148:98796A5A", "In Blade-Fight training a Ninja learns how to[ENTER]quickly and lethally hit his opponent's weak[ENTER]points. "},
	{"skill_group._470_sayReward", "43:BA2CC8F9", "Requirement: Ninja at level 5 or above "},
	{"skill_group._480_sayTitle", "30:73D47A73", "You have chosen Blade-Fight training. "},
	{"skill_group._490_say", "137:E2C6C176", "Since you have decided to take up this training, you receive 4 skill points. You can use them to improve the skills of your choice. "},
	{"skill_group._500_npcChat", "29:3A04E0C8", "Start Archery training "},
	{"skill_group._50_targetVid", "24:98E6B4CF", "Archery Teacher "},
	{"skill_group._510_say", "61:7D40DA37", "I'm sorry.[ENTER]Only a Ninja can choose Archery training. "},
	{"skill_group._520_sayTitle", "18:657F972C", "Archery training "},
	{"skill_group._530_say", "135:841836FF", "In Archery training a Ninja learns how to handle[ENTER]his bow and to fight the enemy with precision[ENTER]from a distance. "},
	{"skill_group._540_sayTitle", "28:2DCBDE9E", "You have chosen Archery training. "},
	{"skill_group._550_npcChat", "26:5AE4298C", "Start Weaponry training "},
	{"skill_group._560_say", "59:47411C9B", "I'm sorry.[ENTER]Only a Sura can choose Weaponry training. "},
	{"skill_group._570_sayTitle", "14:74B325CB", "Weaponry training "},
	{"skill_group._580_say", "169:455A49AF", "In Weaponry training you practice the art of[ENTER]using powerful blows against weakened enemies,[ENTER]with the help of cursed blades. "},
	{"skill_group._590_sayReward", "42:57BCC0EC", "Requirement: Sura at level 5 or above "},
	{"skill_group._600_sayTitle", "23:B0DF0EDA", "You have chosen Weaponry training. "},
	{"skill_group._60_targetVid", "23:B613D680", "Weaponry Teacher "},
	{"skill_group._610_npcChat", "34:2C13FCF7", "Start Black Magic training "},
	{"skill_group._620_say", "50:184CC36F", "I'm sorry.[ENTER]Only a Sura can choose the Black Magic training. "},
	{"skill_group._630_sayTitle", "22:AD5CD03C", "Black Magic training "},
	{"skill_group._640_say", "115:A2024FA0", "In Black Magic training you learn the art of[ENTER]weakening your enemies from a distance with black[ENTER]magic. "},
	{"skill_group._650_sayTitle", "32:2FC960CB", "You have chosen Black Magic training. "},
	{"skill_group._660_npcChat", "25:9FA15806", "Start the Dragon Force training "},
	{"skill_group._670_say", "51:465419F7", "I'm sorry.[ENTER]Only Shamans can choose the Dragon Force training. "},
	{"skill_group._680_sayTitle", "14:40DBCF83", "Dragon Force training "},
	{"skill_group._690_say", "203:14FBDCAB", "The Dragon Force training uses the strong fire[ENTER]attacks from the Dragon God as well as support[ENTER]magic which can give the group the protection[ENTER]from the Dragon God. "},
	{"skill_group._700_sayReward", "44:88EAE863", "Requirement: Shamans at level 5 or above "},
	{"skill_group._70_targetVid", "21:06D64C58", "Black Magic Teacher "},
	{"skill_group._710_sayTitle", "24:CA47719B", "You have chosen the Dragon Force training. "},
	{"skill_group._720_npcChat", "26:BB0FE805", "Start the Healing Force training "},
	{"skill_group._730_say", "72:23CE6839", "I'm sorry.[ENTER]Only Shamans can choose the Healing Force[ENTER]training. "},
	{"skill_group._740_sayTitle", "17:12FED39D", "Healing Force training "},
	{"skill_group._750_say", "173:0052E50C", "With the Healing Force training, you learn to[ENTER]stun your enemies with electric shocks. You also[ENTER]learn to heal group members and give them[ENTER]additional strength. "},
	{"skill_group._760_sayTitle", "27:D2112730", "You have chosen the Healing Force training. "},
	{"skill_group._80_targetVid", "23:37CCCBE9", "Dragon Force Teacher: "},
	{"skill_group._90_targetVid", "16:0901AA9B", "Healing Force Teacher "},
	{"skill_reset2._10_npcChat", "20:03C34D36", "Reset skills "},
	{"skill_reset2._110_say", "68:EE2D002C", "Suit yourself. If you change your mind, come[ENTER]visit me again. "},
	{"skill_reset2._120_say", "73:84F86DAF", "You don't have enough Yang. I'm sorry, but I[ENTER]can't help you. After all, I also need to make a[ENTER]living too. "},
	{"skill_reset2._130_say", "244:25B9BC7E", "This item offers you the possibility of[ENTER]forgetting your old training and beginning a[ENTER]completely new one. However, you must have a[ENTER]minimum level of 31 to be able to use it. Then[ENTER]you will be able to redetermine your destiny. Do[ENTER]you really want to turn your back on the old[ENTER]skills that made you who you are now? "},
	{"skill_reset2._135_say", "98:A0C608D2", "You don't follow a lore and don't have any skill[ENTER]points you could reset! "},
	{"skill_reset2._140_say", "42:72790F07", "This item can only be used from level 31. "},
	{"skill_reset2._20_say", "241:B750CAE0", "You haven't started any training yet! As long you[ENTER]as you don't spend any skill points you can't[ENTER]reset them either. Come back when you have made a[ENTER]mistake during your training, then I'll be happy[ENTER]to help you. "},
	{"skill_reset2._30_say", "236:98FA2770", "I'm afraid I can't help you, my child. You have[ENTER]already reached level %s, but unfortunately you[ENTER]can only change your training up to level 30. "},
	{"skill_reset2._40_say", "98:A0C608D2", "You don't follow a lore and don't have any skill[ENTER]points you could reset! "},
	{"skill_reset2._50_say", "241:421E4183", "Oh dear, what's the matter? I can see great[ENTER]sorrow in your eyes...Wait, I can help you. I can[ENTER]let people forget their skills so they can learn[ENTER]new ones. What do you think? It will only cost[ENTER]you %s Yang. "},
	{"skill_reset2._60_select", "12:F5A7558F", "Do not reset "},
	{"skill_reset2._70_say", "232:31D40C70", "Just look at that gloomy face! Aren't you feeling[ENTER]well? If you're unhappy about your lore: I could[ENTER]help you forget everything in a flash. "},
	{"skill_reset2._80_say", "232:344F571B", "This means that all your skill points will be[ENTER]reset and that you then redistribute them.[ENTER]Unfortunately I cannot give you back the points[ENTER]that you gained from reading books, they will be[ENTER]lost after resetting. Do you want to go ahead?[ENTER]Forget everything and start from the beginning[ENTER]again? Then I will need %s Yang from you. "},
	{"skill_reset2._90_select", "19:EC173E47", "Reset skills "},
	{"spider_dungeon_2floor._10_npcChat", "18:6B65F063", "Back to the first floor "},
	{"spider_dungeon_2floor._20_say", "61:A6975B98", "Do you really want to return to the first floor? "},
	{"spider_dungeon_2floor._30_say", "124:CEB32FE2", "A wise decision. It is too dangerous to stay up[ENTER]here any longer. Go tend to your wounds. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_2floor._40_say", "96:BE1762ED", "Suit yourself...[ENTER]But be careful![ENTER]It's very dangerous up here. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._100_say", "323:34A88CFC", "You mean to tell me that you didn't feel[ENTER]confident enough to go into the Spider Dungeon?[ENTER]You are an experienced warrior with sophisticated[ENTER]technical ability - a few creepy crawlies[ENTER]shouldn't pose any kind of problem for you. But[ENTER]you do know that you need the Passage Ticket to[ENTER]enter the cavern, right? "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._10_npcChat", "30:1CC7C583", "Access to the Breeding Lair "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._110_sendLetter", "23:444A09D4", "New Danger "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._120_say", "75:97FAD208", "You have made an exact replica of the[ENTER]inscription. Show it to the Captain. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._130_say", "148:44E5FD57", "Great, you did it! Show me it then... Hmm. These[ENTER]characters are not known to me, I cannot[ENTER]understand a single word. You should ask the[ENTER]advice of Uriel the scholar. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._140_say", "100:B73ADB3B", "Head to the scholar Uriel and show him the[ENTER]inscription. He will certainly be able to[ENTER]translate it. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._150_say", "383:CC99F073", "The Captain is asking me to decipher this[ENTER]mysterious inscription? Naturally. I do love a[ENTER]good challenge. Pass it here.[ENTER]That is... well that is just terrible! Here, I'll[ENTER]write the translation down on this paper.[ENTER]Take it to the Captain as fast as you can and[ENTER]then return to me. If what is written here is[ENTER]true, then we are all in great danger! Go, go! "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._160_say", "168:69245B1D", "You've not been to the Captain yet?! Please! You[ENTER]must hurry. We have no time to lose. He needs to[ENTER]read this letter! "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._170_sayTitle", "20:08ED8708", "Deliver Uriel's letter "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._180_say", "218:30A0BE7A", "That pig-headed old man... is a thank-you too[ENTER]much to ask for?! Very well. He said the[ENTER]information was extremely important, so I had[ENTER]better take it to the Captain as soon as[ENTER]possible. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._190_npcChat", "12:0CB50535", "Uriel's letter "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._200_say", "436:7B8FDD75", "Oh no! If what is written here is true, then a[ENTER]dangerous arachnid demon has set its web within[ENTER]the third floor of the Spider Dungeon - the[ENTER]Spider Baroness. The inscription reads that you[ENTER]need a special key in order to get to this hidden[ENTER]cavern. Go first to Uriel and ask him about this[ENTER]key. Then get yourself a troop together and storm[ENTER]this Spider Baroness' hideout! Here, I have[ENTER]another Passage Ticket for you too. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._20_say", "68:C0FC53CC", "This gate can only be opened by the Arachnids Key. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._210_npcChat", "14:B2C2B706", "The Arachnids Key "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._220_say", "51:5B92D634", "I should seek out Uriel as soon as I can. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._230_say", "498:A90801BD", "Ah, you are back. Then I assume the Captain has[ENTER]issued you with the order to destroy the Spider[ENTER]Baroness? However the entrance to the Baroness'[ENTER]Breeding Lair is sealed and can only be opened[ENTER]with the Arachnids Key. Producing this key is[ENTER]very labour intensive. But if you bring me a[ENTER]Spider's Poison Sack, a Spider Egg Sack, a Spider[ENTER]Web, Spider Eyes, Spider Legs as well as the[ENTER]Spider Queen's Poison, I will make one for you. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._240_say", "260:9DF5FC05", "You want me to make you an Arachnids Key? To do[ENTER]so, I need a Spider's Poison Sack, a Spider Egg[ENTER]Sack, a Spider Web, Spider Eyes, Spider Legs as[ENTER]well as the Spider Queen's Poison. Did you find[ENTER]all these substances? "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._250_say", "87:CDAC0E43", "Fantastic! You have all the things I need to make[ENTER]the Arachnids Key. Please wait a moment. It[ENTER]shouldn't take too long to make... "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._260_say", "307:298206C5", "Ha, finished! Here, your Arachnids Key. It will[ENTER]give you access to the Spider Baroness' hideout.[ENTER]I wish you and your comrades the best of success[ENTER]in the fight against this long-legged beast! But[ENTER]you have to hurry - the key is very unstable.[ENTER]After 24 hours it will fall apart back into its[ENTER]component pieces. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._270_say", "377:947C1FEA", "Oh, oh... I'm afraid to say no one is born a[ENTER]master. You must understand that forging this key[ENTER]is extremely complicated. Even the tiniest of[ENTER]errors will lead to a failed attempt.[ENTER]Unfortunately I have lost all of the spider[ENTER]substances you collected for me in the creation[ENTER]process. The next attempt will work for sure! "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._280_say", "224:B99F2F72", "Something is still missing, I can't make you the[ENTER]Arachnids Key just yet. Here's a reminder of what[ENTER]we need: a Spider's Poison Sack, a Spider Egg[ENTER]Sack, a Spider Web, Spider Eyes, Spider Legs as[ENTER]well as the Spider Queen's Poison. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._300_say", "74:FBDBF5E6", "Your group leader has entered the dungeon. Do you[ENTER]want to follow them? "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._30_npcChat", "17:793CA79C", "Reset SD3 quest "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._320_say", "85:41372CEA", "There is already a group in the Baroness'[ENTER]Breeding Lair who are carrying out an attack on[ENTER]the Spider Baroness. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._330_say", "120:A5482091", "You can only enter once the previous group has[ENTER]finished their task. Please return in %s minutes. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._340_say", "71:1CE5764E", "Waiting time until the gate to the Baroness'[ENTER]Breeding Lair reopens: "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._350_say", "8:177E2808", "%s minutes "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._360_say", "111:16EA8B29", "The warrior who entered the cavern before you can[ENTER]start moving again after ten seconds have passed.[ENTER]Please wait a moment. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._370_say", "182:E3B981C9", "Would you like to start a conquest? You will have[ENTER]20 minutes to complete it. Before this time ends,[ENTER]no one will be able to leave the Baroness'[ENTER]Breeding Lair.[ENTER]A renewed conquest attempt can be carried out[ENTER]after one hour has passed. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._380_say", "50:5AA7F186", "You need the Arachnids Key to open the entrance. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._390_say", "71:F62E2121", "Only the leader of the group can use the[ENTER]Arachnids Key. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._400_say", "119:8C836C2A", "The Spider Baroness has been defeated! In three[ENTER]minutes all warriors will be teleported out of[ENTER]the cavern. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._40_say", "24:32E52C1A", "Before production of the key "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._410_say", "33:07F03DC9", "That didn't work. Please try it again! "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._420_notice", "110:BE84A125", "Warning: the Spider Baroness is getting angry![ENTER]Her attacks will be stronger, but she has also[ENTER]lowered her defence. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._50_npcChat", "15:64550AF0", "Spider Dungeon 3 "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._60_say", "531:9C02E4F4", "Ah, good that you are here. I have important[ENTER]information for you: a scouting troop has[ENTER]uncovered a third floor in the Spider Dungeon.[ENTER]There are supposed to be some extremely monstrous[ENTER]and treacherous spiders nested there. On top of[ENTER]this, my men found an old gravestone with an[ENTER]inscription, but they were unable to make a copy[ENTER]of it. Go on the hunt for this stone and bring me[ENTER]a copy of this inscription. Here, this Passage[ENTER]Ticket will allow you to access the Spider[ENTER]Dungeon unhindered. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._70_sendLetter", "11:DF321FD3", "The Inscription "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._80_say", "142:9D101031", "On the third floor of the Spider Dungeon you will[ENTER]find an old gravestone with an inscription[ENTER]engraved on it. Make a copy of this and bring it[ENTER]to the Captain. "},
	{"spider_dungeon_3floor_boss._90_say", "125:0F908CB7", "Perfect, you found the old gravestone and made a[ENTER]copy of the inscription on it! Head back to the[ENTER]Captain and show him. "},
	{"subquest_01._100_sayTitle", "20:F10E5104", "General Store Saleswoman: "},
	{"subquest_01._10_targetVid", "22:292F3714", "Get Empty Bottles "},
	{"subquest_01._110_say", "76:D95BA249", "That's good.[ENTER]You can get Empty Bottles from Yonah the potter.[ENTER]Thank you very much. "},
	{"subquest_01._120_targetVid", "24:114CE2AE", "Find Yonah the potter "},
	{"subquest_01._130_sayReward", "71:55B77359", "The General Store Saleswoman needs an Empty[ENTER]Bottle for her Red Potion from Yonah the potter. "},
	{"subquest_01._150_say", "186:A2A6FB12", "Oh dear! Damn it! I can't stop coughing! How am I[ENTER]supposed to work like this?[ENTER]The saleswoman from the General Store sent you? I[ENTER]have Empty Bottles, but I can't give you one for[ENTER]free. "},
	{"subquest_01._160_say", "338:48B8396E", "I'm asthmatic. I was told that Peach Seeds are a[ENTER]good remedy. If you get me one, I will give you a[ENTER]bottle. You can get Peach Seeds from the Wild[ENTER]Boars outside the village. As soon as the farmers[ENTER]plant Peach Seeds, the Wild Boars dig them out[ENTER]and eat them up. "},
	{"subquest_01._170_sendLetter", "29:F6EBD995", "Get the Peach Seeds "},
	{"subquest_01._180_sayReward", "184:84F10553", "The General Store Saleswoman needs an Empty[ENTER]Bottle for her potion from Yonah the potter.[ENTER]Yonah, who has asthma, will give you an Empty[ENTER]Bottle if you bring him some Peach Seeds. You can[ENTER]find seeds by hunting down Wild Boars. "},
	{"subquest_01._190_npcChat", "34:DD38101B", "To get Peach Seeds... "},
	{"subquest_01._200_say", "164:8F172A11", "You can get Peach Seeds from the Wild Boars[ENTER]outside the village. As soon as the farmers plant[ENTER]Peach Seeds, the Wild Boars dig them out again[ENTER]and eat them up.[ENTER]Cough, cough.[ENTER]Thanks in advance. "},
	{"subquest_01._20_npcChat", "22:292F3714", "Get Empty Bottles "},
	{"subquest_01._210_sendLetter", "14:556190C8", "Return to Yonah "},
	{"subquest_01._220_sayTitle", "15:F9E06B91", "Return to Yonah "},
	{"subquest_01._230_sayReward", "51:4199757C", "You have found the Peach Seed. Take it to Yonah. "},
	{"subquest_01._240_say", "10:BDE2BAD6", "Oh, you've got it! "},
	{"subquest_01._250_say", "69:058B45B3", "Thank you. Now I can ease my asthma and get back[ENTER]to work. "},
	{"subquest_01._260_say", "58:070B3B71", "Here's an Empty Bottle. Take it to the General[ENTER]Store Saleswoman. "},
	{"subquest_01._270_sendLetter", "23:B0E8373C", "Deliver the Empty Bottle "},
	{"subquest_01._280_sayReward", "71:F4DC90EF", "The saleswoman at the General Store needs the[ENTER]Empty Bottle from the potter. Take it to her. "},
	{"subquest_01._290_sayTitle", "20:F10E5104", "General Store Saleswoman: "},
	{"subquest_01._300_say", "151:EAF662DA", "Thank you. I hope it didn't cause you too much[ENTER]trouble. Here, take this for your efforts. Again,[ENTER]thank you very much! "},
	{"subquest_01._30_say", "148:6FEE2376", "Excuse me, if you aren't busy at the moment,[ENTER]could you do me a favour? I need an Empty Bottle[ENTER]for my Red Potion. "},
	{"subquest_01._310_sayReward", "67:FB3951EE", "You receive 1500 experience points.[ENTER]You receive 1000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_01._320_say", "38:2D17F820", "You don't have an Empty Bottle for me yet? "},
	{"subquest_01._330_say", "110:12DFE9D2", "Do you want to hunt down Wild Boars again to get[ENTER]another Empty Bottle, or do you want to quit this[ENTER]quest? "},
	{"subquest_01._340_select", "30:CC27C58F", "Yes, I'll go hunt the Wild Boars. "},
	{"subquest_01._350_select", "26:BA333970", "No, I'm quitting the task. "},
	{"subquest_01._360_say", "29:DCA95CFA", "Do you really want to quit? "},
	{"subquest_01._370_say", "19:462F6F76", "Thanks for helping me. "},
	{"subquest_01._380_say", "36:D641B7F9", "That's too hard for me. I'm sorry. "},
	{"subquest_01._40_say", "129:36D660FE", "I'm busy at my shop and cannot get it myself. If[ENTER]you get me that bottle, I will reward you. "},
	{"subquest_01._50_select", "9:23A53143", "Accept "},
	{"subquest_01._60_select", "7:2568ABFA", "Refuse "},
	{"subquest_01._70_say", "30:65B15CA8", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_01._80_say", "90:0772C98F", "Thanks for helping me. Come again when you have[ENTER]the time. "},
	{"subquest_01._90_say", "35:FB99D0B0", "Have a nice day. And come back soon. "},
	{"subquest_02._100_sayTitle", "19:6CAD0F5F", "Armour Shop Dealer: "},
	{"subquest_02._10_targetVid", "6:927A17C6", "The dinner "},
	{"subquest_02._110_say", "134:B1DD0BA3", "All this talk about food is making me hungry.[ENTER]I'm really craving a Hotpot with venison, bear,[ENTER]cabbage and two eggs. "},
	{"subquest_02._120_say", "64:7E8FFB4E", "Did my father tell you what he would like to have[ENTER]for dinner? "},
	{"subquest_02._121_select", "40:6EEEBC0B", "Hotpot with pork, bear, cabbage and an egg "},
	{"subquest_02._122_select", "38:A8E71FE2", "Hotpot with venison, bear, cabbage and an egg "},
	{"subquest_02._123_select", "41:6A091F9A", "Hotpot with venison, bear, cabbage and two eggs "},
	{"subquest_02._124_select", "21:2DE55619", "Oh... I forgot what it was... "},
	{"subquest_02._130_say", "88:8233C551", "Thank you for getting the information to me so[ENTER]quickly. Here's your reward. "},
	{"subquest_02._140_sayReward", "67:BA47E8C9", "You have received 1,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 1,500 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_02._150_say", "106:DB133E46", "General Store Saleswoman:[ENTER]I'm not surprised, he always has quite unusual[ENTER]requests. Could you please ask him again? "},
	{"subquest_02._160_say", "166:9EB9545E", "General Store Saleswoman:[ENTER]He said that? Are you sure? That doesn't sound[ENTER]like my father... Could you please ask him again?[ENTER]I really don't think he meant that dish. "},
	{"subquest_02._20_say", "242:AA046124", "You know that the Armour Shop Dealer is my[ENTER]father, don't you? I want to prepare dinner for[ENTER]him, but I don't know what he wants to eat.[ENTER]Could you ask him what he would like to have?[ENTER]I will reward you for your time. "},
	{"subquest_02._30_sayReward", "95:4FBDE086", "The Saleswoman at the General Store would like to[ENTER]know what her father, the Armour Shop Dealer,[ENTER]wants for dinner. "},
	{"subquest_02._40_sayReward", "39:84D6F5F3", "Go to the Armour Shop Dealer and ask him. "},
	{"subquest_02._50_say", "86:6E54551B", "Welcome![ENTER]I produce armour to protect you from attacks with[ENTER]knives and swords. "},
	{"subquest_02._60_say", "243:F892407F", "Oh, my daughter sent you? She wants to know what[ENTER]she should cook tonight? Let me think.[ENTER]Mmmhhh, I'd like to have a Hotpot with venison,[ENTER]bear, cabbage and two eggs. That's what I'm[ENTER]really craving! "},
	{"subquest_02._70_targetVid", "6:927A17C6", "The dinner "},
	{"subquest_02._80_sayReward", "95:4FBDE086", "The Saleswoman at the General Store would like to[ENTER]know what her father, the Armour Shop Dealer,[ENTER]wants for dinner. "},
	{"subquest_02._90_sayReward", "66:CD30B4B7", "Go back to her and tell her what you have found[ENTER]out. "},
	{"subquest_03._100_sayTitle", "17:B2BB03B0", "Go back to Baek-Go. "},
	{"subquest_03._10_targetVid", "22:02DF4BD0", "Ingredient for the Medicine "},
	{"subquest_03._110_sayReward", "47:29F58F08", "You have found the liver. Take it to Baek-Go. "},
	{"subquest_03._120_say", "30:B8C883EB", "Thank you. We owe you! "},
	{"subquest_03._130_say", "29:EA682CFB", "The patients will praise you. "},
	{"subquest_03._140_say", "90:CCF12EDE", "Here, take this as a reward. I'm sure you'll need[ENTER]it one day. "},
	{"subquest_03._150_sayReward", "97:83462CA8", "You have received 3,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 5,000 Yang.[ENTER]You have received some Wolf Fur. "},
	{"subquest_03._20_say", "305:94320BF7", "Could you help me? Since the Metin Stones started[ENTER]falling from the sky, an unknown disease has[ENTER]started spreading. A lot of doctors have been[ENTER]working on a remedy, but they're still missing an[ENTER]ingredient to produce the medicine. There are[ENTER]wild animals outside the village, so we can't[ENTER]move freely there. "},
	{"subquest_03._30_say", "150:D5A03B47", "Could you get me the ingredient for the medicine?[ENTER]I'm asking you because you're a soldier. I need a[ENTER]Blue Wolf's Liver for the medicine. "},
	{"subquest_03._40_say", "96:6CDE82AA", "Please bring me a Blue Wolf's Liver. Let me know[ENTER]once you've got it. "},
	{"subquest_03._50_sayReward", "208:28AC982B", "Since the Metin Stones started falling down, an[ENTER]unknown disease has started to spread. Baek-Go[ENTER]needs a Blue Wolf's Liver to produce a remedy.[ENTER]Take the liver to him. "},
	{"subquest_03._60_npcChat", "26:6B75BC80", "How do I get a Wolf Liver? "},
	{"subquest_03._70_say", "87:BA8A5247", "There's only one way to get hold of a Wolf Liver:[ENTER]You have to hunt Blue Wolves. "},
	{"subquest_03._80_say", "110:CDBE4953", "I feel sorry for the wolves, but we need the[ENTER]liver for the remedy. Thanks in advance. "},
	{"subquest_03._90_sendLetter", "16:178664EA", "Return to Baek-Go "},
	{"subquest_03.no_item", "79:BFF0760D", "It's a pity you don't have a precious Wolf Liver with you. Come back when you've got one!"},
	{"subquest_04._100_say", "122:75934C6A", "You have a long road ahead of you. Take care of[ENTER]yourself! And don't forget: You have to use the[ENTER]portal by the blue dot. "},
	{"subquest_04._10_targetVid", "22:F35A0AAD", "How is Deokbae? "},
	{"subquest_04._110_sayReward", "166:37FE995B", "Go and deliver the Letter from the Blacksmith to[ENTER]Deokbae, the lumberjack. You'll find him in the[ENTER]second village which you can only get to via the[ENTER]portal. "},
	{"subquest_04._120_sendLetter", "16:A7FBD17E", "A Letter from the Blacksmith "},
	{"subquest_04._130_targetVid", "23:E4D82138", "Find Deokbae the lumberjack. "},
	{"subquest_04._140_npcChat", "16:A7FBD17E", "A Letter from the Blacksmith "},
	{"subquest_04._150_sayTitle", "9:1E940235", "Deokbae the lumberjack: "},
	{"subquest_04._160_say", "393:B762CC96", "Welcome. I have some good axes here. Do you want[ENTER]to buy one? You don't need an axe? Then why are[ENTER]you here? Ah, a Letter from the Blacksmith. Thank[ENTER]you. I'm a lumberjack, but I also sell pick axes[ENTER]and other tools. Sometimes I order some tools[ENTER]from him. That's how we became good friends. "},
	{"subquest_04._170_say", "156:07C30328", "I should really go have a drink with him in the[ENTER]Seo-Pyung Bar. Thanks for bringing me the letter.[ENTER]Send my best wishes to the Blacksmith. "},
	{"subquest_04._180_say", "115:FA63680B", "A Letter from the Blacksmith? Man, it has been a[ENTER]long time. Where is it? You didn't lose it on the[ENTER]way here, did you? "},
	{"subquest_04._190_select", "8:A49BF312", "Here it is. "},
	{"subquest_04._200_select", "17:66A78A06", "Oh, I don't have it. "},
	{"subquest_04._20_say", "239:68227441", "Hey there, adventurer! I'd like to ask you a[ENTER]favour. Do you know a guy called Deokbae? He's a[ENTER]lumberjack and a good friend of mine. Perhaps[ENTER]it's a bit boring, but he really is one of the[ENTER]last hard working lumberjacks out there. "},
	{"subquest_04._210_say", "18:B34AC3E7", "Quit quest? "},
	{"subquest_04._220_say", "23:4C6AFEDE", "That's nice. Come back soon. "},
	{"subquest_04._230_say", "26:DDDE59A2", "You lost it? Get out of my sight. "},
	{"subquest_04._240_say", "63:8BC32777", "Go back to the Blacksmith and get it. Don't lose[ENTER]the letter again though. Take care. "},
	{"subquest_04._250_sayReward", "34:5BB5C93C", "Go back to the Blacksmith and claim your reward. "},
	{"subquest_04._260_targetVid", "21:0F9571D5", "Back to the Blacksmith "},
	{"subquest_04._270_npcChat", "18:A2FBC159", "I have delivered the letter. "},
	{"subquest_04._280_say", "192:CBEF6F37", "So, how is Deokbae? Hehe, he hasn't changed.[ENTER]Thanks. Take this as a reward. It isn't much, but[ENTER]it might come in handy one day. Thanks again. "},
	{"subquest_04._290_sayReward", "67:42F9AF81", "You have received 4,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 3,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_04._30_say", "241:15DF3270", "I haven't seen him in a while and I wrote him a[ENTER]letter to ask how he is. I would like you to[ENTER]deliver the letter to him. There are a lot of[ENTER]dangers in the village nowadays. So be careful.[ENTER]And don't bend the letter! "},
	{"subquest_04._40_say", "277:EE727ABF", "Oh, you don't know how to get to the next[ENTER]village? Press 'M' to view the miniature map.[ENTER]A blue dot will be displayed on it. This dot[ENTER]represents the portal that will take you into the[ENTER]adjoining area. The second village is also[ENTER]situated in this area. "},
	{"subquest_04._50_select", "11:3D3AE21D", "I will do it. "},
	{"subquest_04._60_select", "13:69E16BE1", "No, thank you. "},
	{"subquest_04._70_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_04._80_say", "24:436A24DA", "Come back soon. "},
	{"subquest_04._90_say", "30:DE0DCAC5", "Well, that's too bad. "},
	{"subquest_05._100_say", "48:7B8F1A2D", "That's nice to hear. Just come around again. "},
	{"subquest_05._10_targetVid", "20:8B39D5C8", "A Favour for Soon "},
	{"subquest_05._110_say", "28:3F73B933", "Too bad. Now let me carry on reading. "},
	{"subquest_05._120_say", "67:6D39D71E", "Really? I'm pleased! This is going to be a great[ENTER]book. "},
	{"subquest_05._130_sayTitle", "16:66A46488", "Help for Soon "},
	{"subquest_05._140_sayReward", "69:6431D4A8", "Go to Uriel and ask him which fans are the best[ENTER]ones. "},
	{"subquest_05._150_npcChat", "34:0830ECA6", "List fans according to their attack values "},
	{"subquest_05._160_say", "220:95B6D244", "What brings you here? Oh the bookworm sent you?[ENTER]Every day he disappears with his books and[ENTER]scrolls, but he doesn't seem to get any more[ENTER]intelligent. And he's always disturbing me.[ENTER]Well, let's hear what he wants to know this time! "},
	{"subquest_05._170_say", "155:8476D2EC", "He wants me to list the fans according to their[ENTER]attack values? That's rather easy: Heavenly Bird[ENTER]Fan, Triple Fan, Aquatic Fan and Crane Wing Fan.[ENTER]Got it? "},
	{"subquest_05._180_sendLetter", "15:4BEE1AD4", "Back to Soon "},
	{"subquest_05._190_sayTitle", "13:113DA1A3", "Returning to Soon "},
	{"subquest_05._200_sayReward", "38:2890B7EF", "Go back to Soon and give him the information. "},
	{"subquest_05._20_npcChat", "20:8B39D5C8", "A Favour for Soon "},
	{"subquest_05._210_say", "47:9853D1EC", "So, was Uriel able to give you a clear answer? "},
	{"subquest_05._211_select", "34:C9FAF448", "Bird, Single, Aquatic, Crane Wing. "},
	{"subquest_05._212_select", "32:9767CF74", "Bird, Triple, Aquatic, Crane Wing. "},
	{"subquest_05._213_select", "32:82FAD1BF", "Bird, Double, Aquatic, Crane Wing. "},
	{"subquest_05._214_select", "23:8528EFC8", "Oh no, I forgot it. "},
	{"subquest_05._220_say", "40:6DE2E0CE", "Thanks a lot! Now I can continue reading. Thank[ENTER]you! "},
	{"subquest_05._230_sayReward", "69:67C6E07F", "You have received 6,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 2,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_05._240_say", "85:8B9F75DA", "I'm not sure if that's correct. Please verify it. "},
	{"subquest_05._250_select", "20:7B19255C", "Yes, it is correct. "},
	{"subquest_05._260_select", "18:3EB549F2", "I'm not sure. "},
	{"subquest_05._270_say", "36:1916AC3F", "Good to hear. Just come around again. "},
	{"subquest_05._280_say", "38:08BF9961", "That's not good to hear! Go away... "},
	{"subquest_05._290_say", "44:EB190121", "Wonderful, that's great. Then come back again[ENTER]later. "},
	{"subquest_05._300_say", "42:6FDF0562", "Are you sure that this order is correct? "},
	{"subquest_05._310_select", "13:CA46620E", "Yes, I am. "},
	{"subquest_05._320_select", "19:19D97E01", "No, I'm not. "},
	{"subquest_05._330_say", "42:00DE465E", "Good to hear. Come back again later. "},
	{"subquest_05._340_say", "27:86D98E7A", "It would have been too good. Now go... "},
	{"subquest_05._350_say", "46:649AF091", "Great, this is simply great! Thank you very much! "},
	{"subquest_05._40_say", "309:6706AE82", "Aha... Hmhm... No, that...[ENTER]Yikes, where did you come from? How dare you[ENTER]disturb while I'm reading! Oh dear, sorry, I[ENTER]didn't mean to shout at you. Sometimes I come[ENTER]across something that I don't understand when I'm[ENTER]reading and that's just so frustrating.[ENTER]Could you give me a hand with something? "},
	{"subquest_05._50_say", "351:68368477", "I'm examining the fan weapons that are used by[ENTER]shamans. I'm having trouble trying to find out[ENTER]which ones are the best. I can't possibly test[ENTER]them all. Uriel, the scholar, knows all about[ENTER]these fans. Could you ask him for me? I'm[ENTER]interested in the following types of fan: Aquatic[ENTER]Fans, Heavenly Bird Fans, Triple Fans and Crane[ENTER]Wing Fans. "},
	{"subquest_05._60_say", "61:F80B01B1", "I want him to list all fans according to their[ENTER]attack values. "},
	{"subquest_05._70_select", "11:3D3AE21D", "I'll do it. "},
	{"subquest_05._80_select", "17:24DE563A", "I won't do it. "},
	{"subquest_05._90_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_06._100_say", "50:5B46BB63", "Get out, now! Useless prowler... "},
	{"subquest_06._10_targetVid", "22:60B11DFE", "Ordering Armour "},
	{"subquest_06._110_say", "71:38B33B00", "Thank you! Go back to the Blacksmith and ask him[ENTER]how he's getting on with the armour. "},
	{"subquest_06._120_sayReward", "106:03D5AEAD", "Go to the Blacksmith and ask him how far he has[ENTER]got with the armour that the Armour Shop Dealer[ENTER]ordered. "},
	{"subquest_06._130_npcChat", "30:4087E8D3", "Armour for the Armour Shop Dealer "},
	{"subquest_06._140_say", "402:5E69A806", "What is it now? Why are you disturbing me? Oh,[ENTER]the Armour Shop Dealer sent you? That old man is[ENTER]very impatient. It's not that I don't want to do[ENTER]it. I just don't have the necessary materials for[ENTER]it. Could you get them for me? To produce the[ENTER]armour I need Iron Ore, Leather and Coal. You can[ENTER]get the Iron Ore from Uriel, the Leather from[ENTER]Octavio and the Coal from Yonah. "},
	{"subquest_06._150_select", "19:29E5894F", "I'll get the materials for you. "},
	{"subquest_06._160_select", "16:5255EEF4", "No, not right now. "},
	{"subquest_06._170_say", "63:42C09ECE", "Are you sure you want to stop doing this quest? "},
	{"subquest_06._180_say", "97:1C999FE4", "You can also do it later. But don't wait too[ENTER]long, this mission is urgent! "},
	{"subquest_06._190_say", "93:1B4DE304", "Well, I suppose I'll have to get those things[ENTER]myself then. Take care. "},
	{"subquest_06._200_say", "51:8B972C07", "Then off you go again, so that I can get back to[ENTER]working in peace... "},
	{"subquest_06._20_npcChat", "22:60B11DFE", "Ordering Armour "},
	{"subquest_06._210_sendLetter", "18:FE7A6374", "Get materials "},
	{"subquest_06._220_sayReward", "30:51861061", "Get the materials for the Blacksmith. "},
	{"subquest_06._221_say", "43:68506B22", "Iron Ore - you can get that from Uriel. "},
	{"subquest_06._222_say", "39:8AB6B393", "Leather - you can get that from Octavio. "},
	{"subquest_06._223_say", "38:9E4A1EDE", "Coal - you can get it from Yonah. "},
	{"subquest_06._224_sayReward", "26:52D66674", "Uriel has given you Iron Ore. "},
	{"subquest_06._225_sayReward", "22:7C4B5DCA", "Octavio has given you the Leather. "},
	{"subquest_06._226_sayReward", "21:FB3781F2", "Yonah has given you the Coal. "},
	{"subquest_06._230_targetVid", "15:0B2C07AC", "Go to Octavio "},
	{"subquest_06._240_targetVid", "14:360D22BF", "Go to Uriel. "},
	{"subquest_06._250_targetVid", "14:653437E1", "Go to Yonah. "},
	{"subquest_06._260_npcChat", "21:CEB43F96", "Iron Ore for the armour"},
	{"subquest_06._270_say", "147:93948262", "Thank you for bringing me my book back! Now I can[ENTER]continue my research. Here, take some Iron Ore.[ENTER]Use it well. "},
	{"subquest_06._280_say", "277:78A5B3D7", "You need Iron Ore? I can give you some. But I do[ENTER]have a favour to ask you: I recently lost a book[ENTER]while I was being chased by a pack of Wild Dogs.[ENTER]I think those Wild Dogs must have my book. Bring[ENTER]it back to me and then I'll give you some Iron[ENTER]Ore. "},
	{"subquest_06._285_say", "80:DED6E0FA", "- Uriel will give you Iron Ore if you bring him[ENTER]the Book back from the Wild Dogs. "},
	{"subquest_06._290_npcChat", "21:CEB43F96", "Iron Ore for the armour"},
	{"subquest_06._300_say", "105:A51BA870", "More Iron Ore? I've already given you some. Now I[ENTER]don't have any left. "},
	{"subquest_06._30_say", "236:55BEA813", "Could you help me? Thank you for doing my[ENTER]daughter a favour. I need to ask you for a favour[ENTER]now. I have asked the village Blacksmith to[ENTER]produce some armour, but I haven't heard anything[ENTER]from him. Could you find out how he's getting on[ENTER]with it? "},
	{"subquest_06._310_npcChat", "25:FE4E4B9B", "I need Leather. "},
	{"subquest_06._330_say", "191:FE9436A7", "Thank you for the Gall! Now I can finally get[ENTER]back to cooking my yummy meals. Mmm... Here, take[ENTER]this Leather as a reward. "},
	{"subquest_06._340_say", "334:F8CA3F0F", "I can give you some Leather.[ENTER]But nothing in this world comes for free.[ENTER]How about a trade? You will get some Leather from[ENTER]me if you bring me Gall from bears.[ENTER]I often need Gall to cook my favourite treats.[ENTER]If you don't want to help me, well, I will manage[ENTER]somehow on my own. "},
	{"subquest_06._345_say", "71:9C64B158", "- Octavio will give you Leather if you bring him[ENTER]Gall from bears. "},
	{"subquest_06._350_npcChat", "25:FE4E4B9B", "I need Leather. "},
	{"subquest_06._360_say", "61:F7C014A7", "I have already given you Leather. Did you lose[ENTER]it? I don't have any more. "},
	{"subquest_06._370_npcChat", "25:5D8B89A9", "I need Coal. "},
	{"subquest_06._380_say", "87:EB49E794", "Thank you for the Clay. You scratch my back and[ENTER]I'll scratch yours: Here's your Coal. See you[ENTER]soon! "},
	{"subquest_06._390_say", "131:F78CAB97", "What's up? You're here to get Coal? I have loads[ENTER]of Coal. But it doesn't come for free. You have[ENTER]to do something for me first. "},
	{"subquest_06._395_say", "99:F5508689", "- Yonah will give you Coal if you bring him Clay.[ENTER]To get it, you have to hunt Red Wild Boars. "},
	{"subquest_06._400_say", "206:6E04F514", "I'm running out of Clay for my crockery. If you[ENTER]bring me some, I'll give you some Coal. It would[ENTER]be best if you kill some Red Wild Boars, as they[ENTER]believe it or not eat Clay. Thanks in advance! "},
	{"subquest_06._40_select", "16:4B842950", "Yes, I'll do it. "},
	{"subquest_06._410_npcChat", "25:5D8B89A9", "I need Coal. "},
	{"subquest_06._420_say", "71:FE28993A", "What? I have already given you Coal! Are you[ENTER]trying to trick me? "},
	{"subquest_06._430_npcChat", "26:EB72FED9", "I have all the materials. "},
	{"subquest_06._440_say", "61:82F36237", "You seem to have no Iron Ore. Go to Uriel. "},
	{"subquest_06._450_say", "39:CD9FDA32", "Seems like you don't have any Leather. Go to[ENTER]Octavio. "},
	{"subquest_06._460_say", "46:C15B31EF", "You don't have any Coal. Hmm, no Coal? Get some[ENTER]from Yonah. "},
	{"subquest_06._470_makequestbutton", "24:8AFACA43", "I have all the materials. "},
	{"subquest_06._480_qSetTitle", "22:01B01798", "Materials for the Blacksmith "},
	{"subquest_06._490_targetVid", "20:038B5485", "Go to the Blacksmith "},
	{"subquest_06._500_sayTitle", "17:69270E7D", "The ordered armour "},
	{"subquest_06._50_select", "26:952EC4CA", "No, I don't have time for this. "},
	{"subquest_06._510_sayReward", "68:0DD0B918", "I have all necessary materials. Off to the[ENTER]Blacksmith. "},
	{"subquest_06._520_npcChat", "26:B252A2A0", "I've got your materials. "},
	{"subquest_06._530_say", "157:50E1DFAC", "You have already got all the materials?[ENTER]I'm impressed! Thank you, now I can deliver the[ENTER]ordered goods to the Armour Shop Dealer. Go tell[ENTER]him the good news! "},
	{"subquest_06._540_sayReward", "88:53A9A1C2", "Tell the Armour Shop Dealer that his order will[ENTER]be finished soon. "},
	{"subquest_06._550_targetVid", "28:D580DE11", "Back to the Armour Shop Dealer. "},
	{"subquest_06._560_npcChat", "26:06535A11", "The Blacksmith will be delivering soon! "},
	{"subquest_06._570_say", "112:BADD4FE9", "Oh, so he'll be finished with the armour soon?[ENTER]Thanks for taking care of it. Take this as your[ENTER]reward. "},
	{"subquest_06._580_sayReward", "99:977EA7A8", "You have received 26,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 15,000 Yang.[ENTER]You have received a Pig Nose. "},
	{"subquest_06._590_sayReward", "37:91F70D7E", "You have received a Tiger Plate Armour+3. "},
	{"subquest_06._600_sayReward", "31:AD14363E", "You have received a Crimson Suit+3. "},
	{"subquest_06._60_say", "45:94070C46", "Do you want to give up this quest for good? "},
	{"subquest_06._610_sayReward", "41:90F060E8", "You have received a Misfortune Armour+3. "},
	{"subquest_06._620_sayReward", "26:D81A52E5", "You have received a Pink Clothing+3. "},
	{"subquest_06._70_select", "16:80F16469", "Yes, I give up. "},
	{"subquest_06._80_select", "19:AF49C53B", "No, I'd rather not. "},
	{"subquest_06._90_say", "77:5E12C98E", "Will you do it later? Come back soon, this[ENTER]mission is urgent! "},
	{"subquest_07._100_say", "184:A5F6A934", "Wait a sec, I want to make sure that this is the[ENTER]right book... Hmm, yes, that's really fantastic.[ENTER]I'm definitely going to cook these dishes![ENTER]Thanks! "},
	{"subquest_07._10_targetVid", "28:5C43F04E", "The best cookbook "},
	{"subquest_07._110_say", "251:D1690E0F", "Hmm, but I need... Wait, friend! Can I ask you[ENTER]for another favour? I have almost got all the[ENTER]ingredients for this fantastic dish, but I'm[ENTER]still missing a Grey Wolf Intestine. This[ENTER]ingredient isn't easy to get hold of and is best[ENTER]eaten when it's fresh. Please get me one! "},
	{"subquest_07._120_sayReward", "86:E58417AE", "Get a Wolf Intestine for Octavio. You can get it[ENTER]from the Grey Wolves. "},
	{"subquest_07._130_npcChat", "18:36848DFD", "I have got a Wolf Intestine. "},
	{"subquest_07._140_say", "155:FD9524B4", "Thanks to you, I can finally cook this rare meal.[ENTER]This is going to be a feast! I'm really grateful[ENTER]for your help. Please take this modest reward. "},
	{"subquest_07._150_sayReward", "98:A197964D", "You have received 12,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 5,000 Yang.[ENTER]You have received a Wolf Claw. "},
	{"subquest_07._160_say", "66:E64A364F", "I still need a Grey Wolf Intestine. Please bring[ENTER]me one. "},
	{"subquest_07._20_npcChat", "28:5C43F04E", "The best cookbook "},
	{"subquest_07._30_say", "303:1375AD6C", "Hmm, is there any chance that you know Soon the[ENTER]bookworm, who spends his whole time reading?[ENTER]I have heard that Soon owns a good cookbook.[ENTER]Please find out if that's right. The cookbook is[ENTER]apparently full of rare and exotic recipes and I[ENTER]am keen to learn them. "},
	{"subquest_07._40_targetVid", "12:8DE38169", "Ask Soon "},
	{"subquest_07._50_sayReward", "58:1E491777", "Ask Soon if he has a foreign cookbook. "},
	{"subquest_07._60_npcChat", "34:898B32AA", "Do you have a special Cookbook? "},
	{"subquest_07._70_say", "206:65200FCC", "Bla, bla... Oh! You again! What do you want?[ENTER]Yes, I have a cookbook containing exotic meals.[ENTER]Take it with you if you like, I don't need it.[ENTER]But please don't disturb me when I'm reading! "},
	{"subquest_07._80_targetVid", "85:8A0AC687", "Soon has given you the foreign cookbook. Take it[ENTER]to Octavio."},
	{"subquest_07._85_say", "52:C20F81E8", "You have found a Wolf Intestine.[ENTER]Take it to Octavio. "},
	{"subquest_07._90_npcChat", "23:DD33D13E", "Here's the cookbook! "},
	{"subquest_08._100_sayReward", "86:45A864FC", "Go to the Weapon Shop Dealer and ask him where[ENTER]you can buy Rice Cakes. "},
	{"subquest_08._10_targetVid", "15:60C9B01A", "Rice Cake "},
	{"subquest_08._110_npcChat", "31:8854162C", "What do you know about Rice Cakes? "},
	{"subquest_08._120_sayTitle", "17:E0E08991", "Weapon Shop Dealer: "},
	{"subquest_08._130_say", "229:667A6B97", "What? Rice Cake? Is that a new weapon?! Yes, well[ENTER]then you can...[ENTER]Oh, you mean edible Rice Cakes. Why didn't you[ENTER]just say that in the first place? You'd better go[ENTER]to Octavio. He knows all there is to know about[ENTER]food. "},
	{"subquest_08._140_makequestbutton", "15:60C9B01A", "Rice Cake "},
	{"subquest_08._150_sayReward", "78:B6695A88", "Go to Octavio and ask him what he knows about[ENTER]Rice Cakes. "},
	{"subquest_08._160_say", "213:7A5F94DC", "Hmm, Rice Cakes? The ones with the red cherries[ENTER]and the sugar on top? Yeah, I've eaten those[ENTER]before. You can get them from the rice cake[ENTER]seller in the next village. She's called Yu-Rang,[ENTER]I think. "},
	{"subquest_08._170_select", "26:952EC4CA", "No, I don't have time for this. "},
	{"subquest_08._180_say", "39:EA02C7D5", "You have a long road ahead of you. See you next[ENTER]time. "},
	{"subquest_08._190_say", "63:3EF1E831", "Well, you'll certainly be missing out. See you! "},
	{"subquest_08._200_say", "33:1913B24E", "You'll see, it's worth it. Have a good trip! "},
	{"subquest_08._20_say", "300:B88C3056", "Excuse me, could you please help me? My baby[ENTER]won't stop crying and I just don't know what to[ENTER]do to calm it down. My baby loves Rice Cakes and[ENTER]I think it might help. I think the Weapon Shop[ENTER]Dealer knows where to get some. Could you ask him[ENTER]for me? "},
	{"subquest_08._210_makequestbutton", "17:6820DA5A", "Find Yu-Rang "},
	{"subquest_08._220_targetVid", "15:60C9B01A", "Rice Cake "},
	{"subquest_08._230_sayReward", "88:3F830B1F", "Go to the Rice Cake seller Yu-Rang. You'll find[ENTER]her in the next village. "},
	{"subquest_08._250_say", "308:07C8471F", "Can I help you? Oh, Rice Cakes! Of course I can[ENTER]give you some! But... could you do something for[ENTER]me first? A boy named Taurean often comes here[ENTER]and annoys me, even though I never did anything[ENTER]to him. If you punish Taurean for me, I will give[ENTER]you some Rice Cakes, OK? "},
	{"subquest_08._260_makequestbutton", "18:C82B8A62", "Find Taurean "},
	{"subquest_08._270_sayReward", "85:F81D6394", "Yu-Rang is always being teased by Taurean. Punish[ENTER]him and then she'll give you a Rice Cake. "},
	{"subquest_08._280_npcChat", "26:3DA6BB38", "Why are you teasing Yu-Rang? "},
	{"subquest_08._290_say", "363:AE3BAD36", "What, who am I supposed to have annoyed? Oh, you[ENTER]mean the girl who sells Rice Cakes? No, I didn't[ENTER]want to annoy her! I was just bored and she[ENTER]looked nice and like she didn't have much to do.[ENTER]So I visited her a few times and wanted to play[ENTER]with her, but then she got angry...[ENTER]Girls are strange. I suppose I won't visit her[ENTER]any more then! "},
	{"subquest_08._300_makequestbutton", "16:44277336", "Go back to Yu-Rang "},
	{"subquest_08._30_select", "9:E7787D05", "Accept "},
	{"subquest_08._310_targetVid", "15:60C9B01A", "Rice Cake "},
	{"subquest_08._320_sayReward", "99:ECC72C8C", "Taurean won't bother Yu-Rang any more. Go to her[ENTER]and pick up your Rice Cake. "},
	{"subquest_08._330_say", "124:9B8237C1", "Ha, ha! You punished Taurean! Thank you. Now[ENTER]he'll think twice before he comes back here[ENTER]again. Here's your Rice Cake. Enjoy your meal! "},
	{"subquest_08._340_makequestbutton", "15:5EAF8C62", "Back to Ah-Yu "},
	{"subquest_08._350_targetVid", "26:798C1D74", "Rice Cake for Ah-Yu "},
	{"subquest_08._360_sayReward", "119:0448A19C", "You have received a Rice Cake from Yu-Rang. Take[ENTER]it to Ah-Yu. You'll find her and her child in the[ENTER]first village. "},
	{"subquest_08._370_npcChat", "40:E3E884A0", "Here's the Rice Cake for your child. "},
	{"subquest_08._380_say", "138:D1F98C6E", "You brought me the Rice Cake! Thank you very[ENTER]much. Oh! Look, my baby has stopped crying now[ENTER]and is happily eating the cake. You did it.[ENTER]Thanks for your help! "},
	{"subquest_08._390_sayReward", "71:0EBD8287", "You receive 26,000 experience points.[ENTER]You receive 10,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_08._40_say", "180:D4AE3188", "But... I can't leave this place and the baby is[ENTER]terrorising the whole neighbourhood... It won't[ENTER]take long! Are you sure that you don't have[ENTER]enough time? "},
	{"subquest_08._50_say", "74:7594F163", "I guess you're busy?[ENTER]Please come back later.[ENTER]Don't cry, my child. "},
	{"subquest_08._60_say", "66:B8BCD88F", "I guess I'll have to ask someone else.[ENTER]Good luck on your journey! "},
	{"subquest_08._70_say", "39:9780675F", "Thanks a lot! That's a real relief to me. "},
	{"subquest_08._80_makequestbutton", "15:60C9B01A", "Rice Cake "},
	{"subquest_08._90_targetVid", "15:60C9B01A", "Rice Cake "},
	{"subquest_09._100_sayReward", "80:2E044F19", "Find the White Oath Soldier who stole the Golden[ENTER]Axe from the Blacksmith and take it back to him. "},
	{"subquest_09._10_targetVid", "20:0614B734", "Find the Golden Axe "},
	{"subquest_09._110_sendLetter", "22:FE86AD1F", "Found the Golden Axe "},
	{"subquest_09._120_npcChat", "17:2707B367", "Here's the Golden Axe. "},
	{"subquest_09._130_say", "136:E7A828B0", "Thank you! I'm in your debt. Now I don't have to[ENTER]worry about what to tell Deokbae when I see him. "},
	{"subquest_09._140_sayReward", "98:A187C3B0", "You have received 36,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 10,000 Yang.[ENTER]You have received an Ornament. "},
	{"subquest_09._20_npcChat", "12:B3521FC7", "The Golden Axe "},
	{"subquest_09._30_say", "337:19F50207", "Do you remember my friend Deokbae? I promised to[ENTER]make him an axe. But unfortunately I wasn't[ENTER]paying attention for a few seconds and a female[ENTER]White Oath Soldier stole it from me. Can you get[ENTER]the axe back for me? A White Oath Soldier must[ENTER]have it. You should be able to recognise it.[ENTER]There aren't many of them. I'll give you a[ENTER]fantastic reward for doing it! "},
	{"subquest_09._40_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_09._50_sayTitle", "7:43EE785F", "Blacksmith "},
	{"subquest_09._60_say", "84:E04F61F2", "I really want this axe! Will we see each other[ENTER]again? Goodbye. "},
	{"subquest_09._70_say", "99:A4F5B434", "Thank you for your assistance. But be careful,[ENTER]that clan is very dangerous. "},
	{"subquest_09._80_say", "99:A4F5B434", "Thank you for helping me. But be careful. The[ENTER]clan has been causing a lot of trouble lately. "},
	{"subquest_09._90_makequestbutton", "20:0614B734", "Find the Golden Axe "},
	{"subquest_09.has_item", "55:CEB90DE2", "You have found the Golden Axe. Return to the Blacksmith with the good news!"},
	{"subquest_10._100_sayReward", "34:55018EED", "Ask the Blacksmith where the Hairpin is. "},
	{"subquest_10._10_targetVid", "24:C5E60728", "Find the Hairpin "},
	{"subquest_10._110_npcChat", "19:C6D352F5", "The stolen Hairpin "},
	{"subquest_10._120_say", "255:3C2B8428", "What? She thinks I stole her Hairpin? That's[ENTER]unbelievable! Who does she think I am? I was[ENTER]working in my shop! Ah, I probably shouldn't tell[ENTER]you this, but the Weapon Shop Dealer was in the[ENTER]General Store Saleswoman's shop recently. "},
	{"subquest_10._130_makequestbutton", "19:C6D352F5", "The stolen Hairpin "},
	{"subquest_10._140_sayReward", "51:FE1E28E6", "Ask the Weapon Shop Dealer about the whereabouts[ENTER]of the Hairpin. "},
	{"subquest_10._150_say", "319:DCCEE295", "What? You think I stole the Hairpin from the[ENTER]General Store Saleswoman? No, never, I didn't do[ENTER]it! Honest! I was there to visit the saleswoman![ENTER]But she wasn't there. Instead I found a White[ENTER]Oath Archer. When she saw me, she ran away.[ENTER]Perhaps she stole the Hairpin. "},
	{"subquest_10._160_sayReward", "58:143CF2B8", "Get the Hairpin from the White Oath Archer! "},
	{"subquest_10._170_sendLetter", "27:4B44D5CE", "You have found the Hairpin "},
	{"subquest_10._180_targetVid", "30:8A3E5C3A", "Go to General Store Saleswoman. "},
	{"subquest_10._190_npcChat", "28:FE863978", "I've got your Hairpin here. "},
	{"subquest_10._200_say", "352:AE761621", "Oh, thank you very much. I'm so happy; I've[ENTER]finally got my beloved Hairpin back! You have[ENTER]already helped me so often! How can I ever show[ENTER]my appreciation? I have a Horse Riding Ticket. I[ENTER]know it's nothing special, but I don't need it[ENTER]any more, because I can't just leave my shop.[ENTER]Take it as a token of my gratitude. "},
	{"subquest_10._20_say", "168:53F1069A", "Please listen to me! I have a big problem. I left[ENTER]the shop for a moment to take care of something[ENTER]important. And while I was gone, someone stole my[ENTER]favourite Hairpin. "},
	{"subquest_10._210_sayReward", "110:2FD2426C", "You have received 60,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 10,000 Yang.[ENTER]You have received a Horse Riding Ticket. "},
	{"subquest_10._220_say", "75:242C548D", "You haven't found my Hairpin yet? I hope you find[ENTER]it eventually. "},
	{"subquest_10._230_select", "10:6C90886C", "Quit "},
	{"subquest_10._240_say", "29:DCA95CFA", "Do you really want to quit? "},
	{"subquest_10._250_say", "86:C2713727", "Yeah, they definitely aren't pushovers... Maybe[ENTER]you should take a rest and try again later? "},
	{"subquest_10._260_say", "89:B6F4E32F", "Where's my favourite Hairpin? Guess it didn't[ENTER]work out after all... good bye. "},
	{"subquest_10._270_say", "59:DF807463", "Thank you very much. It really means a lot to me. "},
	{"subquest_10._30_say", "303:E6240E4D", "My father gave me this wonderful Hairpin for my[ENTER]birthday and I love it. But of course I can't[ENTER]leave my shop again, otherwise something[ENTER]important might be stolen from me. Could you look[ENTER]for my Hairpin for me? I suspect the Blacksmith.[ENTER]He mentioned once that he was looking for[ENTER]something like that. "},
	{"subquest_10._40_select", "14:6A74A350", "I'll look for it. "},
	{"subquest_10._50_say", "29:DCA95CFA", "Do you really want to quit the quest? "},
	{"subquest_10._60_say", "39:23FFD833", "See you next time. Have fun! "},
	{"subquest_10._70_say", "34:0DDF12BA", "Where on earth is my Hairpin? Good bye... "},
	{"subquest_10._80_say", "32:643AD2B3", "You'll look for it for me? Oh, thank you! "},
	{"subquest_10._90_targetVid", "20:038B5485", "Go to the Blacksmith "},
	{"subquest_11._100_targetVid", "38:470889B8", "Ask Yu-Hwan about Mirine's brother."},
	{"subquest_11._10_targetVid", "20:B8BE1A76", "Find my brother. "},
	{"subquest_11._110_npcChat", "24:12F379E5", "Have you seen Mirine's brother? "},
	{"subquest_11._120_say", "350:F5371D83", "I fell in love without knowing what love[ENTER]means...Lalalaa...[ENTER]Who are you looking for? Mirine's brother? We had[ENTER]a quick talk before be went into the mountains to[ENTER]look for some rare herbs. I don't know where he[ENTER]is now. The village hunter often goes into the[ENTER]mountains. Why don't you ask him?[ENTER]La, la, la, love is sad but beautiful... "},
	{"subquest_11._130_targetVid", "33:C98B0B28", "Ask Yang-Shin about Mirine's brother."},
	{"subquest_11._140_say", "283:9FF95E3B", "Mirine's brother? Yes, he was looking for herbs[ENTER]in the mountains. He was so happy when he found[ENTER]some rare herbs. He wanted to buy some new[ENTER]dresses for his sister with the profit he made[ENTER]from them. He's really nice. I'm sure he'll be[ENTER]back in a couple of days. Don't you think? "},
	{"subquest_11._150_targetVid", "23:19E6D2A6", "Tell the news to Mirine. "},
	{"subquest_11._160_npcChat", "24:3E97F8F4", "News about Mirine's brother. "},
	{"subquest_11._170_say", "293:A939D9DA", "Look, I've received a letter from my brother! He[ENTER]has written that he found a place with lots of[ENTER]herbs and that it will be a while before he comes[ENTER]home.[ENTER]Sorry, I shouldn't have bothered you with this.[ENTER]Here, it's not much, but I hope you accept it and[ENTER]forgive me. Thanks for taking such a long journey[ENTER]upon yourself. "},
	{"subquest_11._180_sayReward", "71:585752B0", "You have received 122,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 5,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_11._20_npcChat", "20:B8BE1A76", "Find my brother. "},
	{"subquest_11._30_say", "205:527C7C39", "Can I ask you for a favour? My brother has been[ENTER]gone for a long time. I haven't heard anything[ENTER]from him. I'm starting to get worried. Could you[ENTER]please look for him? "},
	{"subquest_11._40_say", "175:135735A2", "My brother wanted to visit Yu-Hwan the musician[ENTER]in the next village. If you go to Yu-Hwan, you[ENTER]might get some news of my brother. Thanks in[ENTER]advance. "},
	{"subquest_11._50_select", "16:4B842950", "Yes, I'll do it. "},
	{"subquest_11._60_say", "49:A63490DF", "Are you going to give up this quest forever? "},
	{"subquest_11._70_say", "92:E2B17DE8", "Thank you. Please look for him. I'm really[ENTER]worried. See you soon. "},
	{"subquest_11._80_say", "51:6788BB2D", "Too bad that you won't help me.[ENTER]See you. "},
	{"subquest_11._90_say", "82:FDEB52DE", "You're really going to look for him? Thank you[ENTER]very much, I am really worried. Good luck! "},
	{"subquest_12._100_qSetTitle", "26:095276E5", "Mi-Jung from the White Oath "},
	{"subquest_12._10_targetVid", "33:7282ED09", "Kill Mi-Jung from the White Oath"},
	{"subquest_12._110_sayReward", "23:5DB9EC5D", "Go back to the Guardian. "},
	{"subquest_12._120_sayTitle", "26:095276E5", "Mi-Jung from the White Oath "},
	{"subquest_12._130_sayReward", "90:13983717", "Go and kill Mi-Jung from the White Oath. Once[ENTER]you're done, return to the Guardian. "},
	{"subquest_12._140_targetVid", "22:E36E05A3", "Go to the Guardian. "},
	{"subquest_12._150_sayTitle", "34:F220A892", "You have killed Mi-Jung from the White Oath "},
	{"subquest_12._160_sayReward", "44:18E74829", "Return to the Guardian to receive your reward. "},
	{"subquest_12._170_npcChat", "17:527E5A7A", "I killed Mi-Jung. "},
	{"subquest_12._180_say", "196:A46293E5", "Oh! You really are as good as I had heard.[ENTER]Amazing. Thanks to you, it'll be a lot easier to[ENTER]deal with the White Oath problem now. Well done! "},
	{"subquest_12._190_sayReward", "110:2BD1E3AB", "You have received 122,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 20,000 Yang.[ENTER]You have received a Silver Bracelet. "},
	{"subquest_12._20_say", "92:54F94DAE", "Come here for a second. You are a good fighter. I[ENTER]have heard a lot about you from the Captain. "},
	{"subquest_12._30_say", "344:410AB4AD", "Could you go after Mi-Jung from the White Oath?[ENTER]It is hard to protect the village and its[ENTER]inhabitants from the constant White Oath attacks.[ENTER]If we kill Mi-Jung, one of their leaders, the[ENTER]situation will change. The safety of our village[ENTER]is in your hands. I trust that you won't fail! "},
	{"subquest_12._40_select", "16:4B842950", "Yes, I'm going to do it. "},
	{"subquest_12._50_select", "20:4164DE0D", "Not now. "},
	{"subquest_12._60_say", "31:CCE48A37", "You really don't want to help us? "},
	{"subquest_12._70_say", "70:400943A7", "I guess it's just not the right time. Come back[ENTER]later. "},
	{"subquest_12._80_say", "55:6CCA02EF", "If you don't want to help, there's nothing I can[ENTER]do about it. Just go... "},
	{"subquest_12._90_say", "31:CCE48A37", "You really don't want to help us? "},
	{"subquest_12._select_no", "25:DB8CC731", "I don't know, I'll think about it "},
	{"subquest_12._select_yes", "39:EB7644E0", "Yes, I can't manage this task. "},
	{"subquest_13._100_targetVid", "21:1E513D5E", "Go to Ariyoung "},
	{"subquest_13._10_targetVid", "32:38F920CC", "Materials for making weapons. "},
	{"subquest_13._110_targetVid", "14:392358E0", "Go to Ah-Yu. "},
	{"subquest_13._120_sayReward", "116:00CF1756", "The Weapon Shop Dealer needs your help. Get Iron[ENTER]Ore from Uriel and Linen from Ariyoung for him. "},
	{"subquest_13._130_npcChat", "20:30998D62", "Iron Ore for weapons "},
	{"subquest_13._140_say", "70:0640F489", "You need Iron Ore? I could give you some if you[ENTER]do me a favour. "},
	{"subquest_13._150_say", "269:15782767", "I dropped something when I had to run for my life[ENTER]from the tigers: It's a bundle containing[ENTER]important books, bound together with some cloth.[ENTER]If I don't have them, I can't continue my[ENTER]research on the Metin Stones. Bring me the[ENTER]Package and you will get some ore from me. "},
	{"subquest_13._160_npcChat", "21:C600EA1C", "I have your package. "},
	{"subquest_13._170_say", "140:54CCC7E5", "Thank you! I really ask you for favours far too[ENTER]often. Here, have some Iron Ore. I hope it[ENTER]fulfils its purpose. "},
	{"subquest_13._180_say", "400:9E2A8A88", "What? You need even more Iron Ore? It doesn't[ENTER]grow on trees, you know! I will give you some[ENTER]more Iron Ore, but you will have to do me a[ENTER]favour first. Tigers have stolen my Package. I[ENTER]had to run for my life and there were very[ENTER]important documents in it. If I don't have them,[ENTER]I can't continue my research on the Metin Stones.[ENTER]Please find the Package that the tigers stole[ENTER]from me. "},
	{"subquest_13._190_say", "43:F7553BFD", "I already gave it to you. Did you forget that? "},
	{"subquest_13._200_sayTitle", "22:2E9C9DBD", "Package found "},
	{"subquest_13._20_npcChat", "18:5AFCF7C4", "Material for weapons "},
	{"subquest_13._210_say", "49:2D77EB02", "You have found Uriel's Package. Now go back to[ENTER]him. "},
	{"subquest_13._220_npcChat", "26:EFA533BD", "I need Linen. "},
	{"subquest_13._230_say", "350:7222943B", "You need Linen? I've given it to Ah-Yu.[ENTER]Wait![ENTER]If you are going to see her anyway you can take[ENTER]this letter. We are good friends but because of[ENTER]her child haven't seen each other for a while.[ENTER]I'll also tell her that she should give you some[ENTER]of the Linen... Right, this helps everybody![ENTER]And give her my regards. "},
	{"subquest_13._240_say", "46:FA066985", "Ariyoung:[ENTER]I'm sure you must have got Linen from Ah-Yu,[ENTER]didn't you? "},
	{"subquest_13._250_npcChat", "14:DD84B419", "Ariyoung's letter "},
	{"subquest_13._260_say", "338:4EE567E2", "A letter from Ariyoung? It's nice to hear from[ENTER]her after all this time. We used to meet for a[ENTER]chat quite often. But lately, it has been[ENTER]somewhat difficult. Please wait a moment.[ENTER]It says here you need some Linen? Ariyoung gave[ENTER]me some. I can give you some of it.[ENTER]Thank you for bringing me her letter. I will[ENTER]reply to her right away... "},
	{"subquest_13._270_qSetTitle", "24:29E216E3", "Go to the Weapon Shop Dealer "},
	{"subquest_13._280_targetVid", "25:D8E8D62F", "Go to the Weapon Shop Dealer. "},
	{"subquest_13._290_sayTitle", "19:91BD2D5B", "Give materials "},
	{"subquest_13._300_sayReward", "56:9D9D12D8", "I have all the materials.[ENTER]Off to the Weapon Shop Dealer. "},
	{"subquest_13._30_say", "232:9F3116B3", "Hey, could you do me a favour? I'm trying to make[ENTER]new types of weapons. It is not easy to find the[ENTER]necessary materials. I have lots of work to do[ENTER]and can't look for these materials myself.[ENTER]Could you get them for me? "},
	{"subquest_13._310_say", "229:B7D85420", "Well done. You are really good and very fast. Now[ENTER]let me work on these weapons![ENTER]*clank, clank*[ENTER]Here they are. These are the new weapon types.[ENTER]I did my best. I hope you like your new weapon.[ENTER]Have fun with it! "},
	{"subquest_13._320_sayTitle", "9:8F643B8C", "Reward: "},
	{"subquest_13._330_sayReward", "72:921C0183", "You have received 122,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 20,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_13._340_sayReward", "28:610A891E", "You have received a Broad Sword+3. "},
	{"subquest_13._350_sayReward", "31:549536CF", "You have received a Scissor Dagger+3. "},
	{"subquest_13._360_sayReward", "28:E8193E73", "You have received a Peacock Fan+3. "},
	{"subquest_13._40_say", "251:13243F24", "Of course, I will reward you. As soon as the[ENTER]weapons are finished, I will give you one of[ENTER]them. I need the following materials: Iron Ore[ENTER]and Linen. You can get Iron Ore from Uriel and[ENTER]Linen from Ariyoung. Let me know when you have[ENTER]everything. "},
	{"subquest_13._50_say", "30:B538E1EB", "Are you sure that you don't want to do this task? "},
	{"subquest_13._60_say", "84:66439734", "I guess it was too much for you.[ENTER]Come back when you have more time! "},
	{"subquest_13._70_say", "77:BFC53488", "If you don't want to, I guess it can't be helped.[ENTER]See you. "},
	{"subquest_13._80_say", "99:EDBE9801", "Very good![ENTER]As soon as the weapons are finished, you will get[ENTER]one from me. Good luck. "},
	{"subquest_13._90_sendLetter", "24:1D12D8B5", "Look for materials "},
	{"subquest_15._100_targetVid", "29:839C59E3", "Return to the City Guard "},
	{"subquest_15._10_targetVid", "33:8FC4A4F1", "Eun-Jung from the White Oath "},
	{"subquest_15._110_sayReward", "97:F08B88B8", "You have killed Eun-Jung from the White Oath. Go[ENTER]back to the City Guard and report back to him. "},
	{"subquest_15._120_say", "185:C85BDE63", "You are fantastic! You're even better than I[ENTER]expected. We weren't able to do anything about[ENTER]those two leaders of the White Oath, and you[ENTER]defeated them both just like that. "},
	{"subquest_15._130_say", "139:3C740BB4", "This is incredible. You shall receive an adequate[ENTER]reward. Please take this and continue to work for[ENTER]the peace of the village! "},
	{"subquest_15._20_say", "239:5F5C87BB", "Come here for a moment.[ENTER]I have heard a lot about you from the Captain.[ENTER]You seem to be fearless.That's why I need your[ENTER]help again: The White Oath has been behaving[ENTER]worse than ever before. "},
	{"subquest_15._30_say", "195:03A2E2D6", "You have defeated Mi-Jung, the leader of the[ENTER]White Oath. But we are still in danger! The[ENTER]danger from the White Oath hasn't decreased but[ENTER]is worse than ever! "},
	{"subquest_15._40_say", "175:FA9A1408", "To end this, we also have to eliminate the leader[ENTER]Eun-Jung. The rest of them should be no problem.[ENTER]Go and kill Eun-Jung! Our fate is in your hands! "},
	{"subquest_15._50_sayTitle", "10:06E874BB", "Guardian: "},
	{"subquest_15._60_say", "47:8741C57B", "Are you coming back later? You are the right[ENTER]person for this. "},
	{"subquest_15._70_say", "49:35334322", "You can't do it? Ah well. See you soon. "},
	{"subquest_15._80_say", "93:A4F40C7E", "I knew you would help us! Kill Eun-Jung, and[ENTER]we'll take care of the rest. Good luck! "},
	{"subquest_15._90_sayReward", "86:3EB713B1", "Kill the leader Eun-Jung. Hopefully the White[ENTER]Oath will be quiet then. "},
	{"subquest_16._100_qSetTitle", "16:F66356E8", "Ask Yu-Hwan "},
	{"subquest_16._10_targetVid", "34:E14C18E3", "Looking for the armoured cavalry"},
	{"subquest_16._110_targetVid", "15:F1B4401D", "Go to Yu-Hwan "},
	{"subquest_16._120_say", "215:02BEFE06", "Life is so wonderful - love is so wonderful...[ENTER]Oh, you again! What do you want now? Information[ENTER]about the armoured cavalry? Why are you asking me[ENTER]about them?[ENTER]The Captain must have grand plans? "},
	{"subquest_16._140_say", "457:B4558C7D", "Hardly any original texts from that time have[ENTER]survived but I know some songs about the armoured[ENTER]cavalry. Just a minute, I'll just tune my[ENTER]instrument...[ENTER]Oh, you are in a hurry? Nowadays nobody takes the[ENTER]time to listen any more...[ENTER]Oh well. Roughly speaking Isup's cavalry was[ENTER]almost invincible. Extremely well trained[ENTER]soldiers, heavy armour and at the same time fast[ENTER]and mobile. "},
	{"subquest_16._150_say", "418:048EAC0A", "It was the best army this continent has ever[ENTER]seen. Many countries went under because nothing[ENTER]could stop the cavalry. It would be similar[ENTER]today. But you need tough training methods and a[ENTER]lot of high quality iron to set up such an army.[ENTER]You should ask the Peddler and Uriel the scholar[ENTER]about it. They probably know more details. "},
	{"subquest_16._160_makequestbutton", "14:9BEF9B96", "Go to the Peddler "},
	{"subquest_16._170_qSetTitle", "21:ABB8DD08", "The armoured cavalry "},
	{"subquest_16._180_targetVid", "12:15B74897", "Peddler: "},
	{"subquest_16._190_sayReward", "139:792BB138", "Yu-Hwan the musician says that the Peddler and[ENTER]Uriel the scholar may have information about the[ENTER]armoured cavalry. First go to the Peddler. "},
	{"subquest_16._200_sayTitle", "12:15B74897", "Peddler: "},
	{"subquest_16._20_npcChat", "21:ABB8DD08", "The armoured cavalry "},
	{"subquest_16._210_say", "234:75A028A7", "What do you want from a simple Peddler like me?[ENTER]The iron armour from the armoured cavalry? Those[ENTER]are old stories. Who is interested in those? I[ENTER]have to earn a living and can't stand around[ENTER]chatting all day! "},
	{"subquest_16._220_say", "352:A89470C3", "It is getting more and more difficult to make[ENTER]ends meet. Since these stones have been falling[ENTER]out of the sky I have... What are you saying?[ENTER]Oh yes, the cavalry.[ENTER]As far as I know they wore special armours and[ENTER]producing them required special knowledge. They[ENTER]were the best armour ever made! Standard knives[ENTER]or even arrows could not penetrate this perfect[ENTER]armours! "},
	{"subquest_16._230_say", "290:DBF7EAC0", "You can imagine how important the armours were by[ENTER]the money that was necessary to set up the[ENTER]cavalry. It is said that they used up the[ENTER]treasuries of entire kingdoms! If I was to sell[ENTER]such armours I'd be set up for life! "},
	{"subquest_16._240_say", "238:F85D369C", "Nowadays, armours can even be made out of Metin[ENTER]stones. With this new kind of armour, it's no[ENTER]longer just a dream to have an armoured cavalry[ENTER]like the one back then. But I'm talking too much.[ENTER]I have to get on. See you! "},
	{"subquest_16._250_sayTitle", "21:ABB8DD08", "The armoured cavalry "},
	{"subquest_16._260_say", "158:F6EDCF7B", "The Peddler knew something about the iron armours[ENTER]of the armoured cavalry. Now go to the next[ENTER]village and talk to Uriel the scholar about the[ENTER]training. "},
	{"subquest_16._280_say", "347:9FDD1A9F", "What brings you here? The armoured cavalry?[ENTER]Of course I know something about them. Everyone[ENTER]does. This army will go down in history as one of[ENTER]the best of all times! A lot of what is being[ENTER]said may be exaggerated but these mounted[ENTER]soldiers were much feared. And quite rightly so. "},
	{"subquest_16._290_say", "348:9230F7CD", "The armoured cavalry was superior to everyone[ENTER]else, mainly because of its intense training.[ENTER]Only the very best were able to finish the[ENTER]training, many of them died. I think if the same[ENTER]training was still done nowadays not a single[ENTER]soldier would be left by the end of it. "},
	{"subquest_16._300_say", "256:26D76061", "I will give you some detailed information about[ENTER]the training, so that you won't be completely[ENTER]clueless. I know that some terrible wars are[ENTER]going on at the moment, but I'm not sure whether[ENTER]it is a good idea to set up a fearsome army like[ENTER]the armoured cavalry again. "},
	{"subquest_16._30_say", "334:BC286D9D", "I have a new task for you. You have received the[ENTER]order to find out information about the armoured[ENTER]cavalry. It was the most important part of Isup,[ENTER]the king who unified the continent's army. The[ENTER]armoured cavalry was feared by other nations[ENTER]because of its remarkable speed and attack power. "},
	{"subquest_16._310_say", "93:064B948C", "Go to the Captain and tell him everything you[ENTER]learned about the armoured cavalry. "},
	{"subquest_16._320_makequestbutton", "17:E82B8840", "Go to the Captain "},
	{"subquest_16._330_npcChat", "31:A799EFB6", "Report about the armoured cavalry "},
	{"subquest_16._340_sayTitle", "8:C329F351", "Captain "},
	{"subquest_16._350_say", "267:042CAB98", "Have you been able to find something out? Do[ENTER]tell! ...[ENTER]Hmm, that's very interesting. So it's nothing[ENTER]more than heavy armour and hard training? Then it[ENTER]would be possible! Such an army could reunite the[ENTER]three kingdoms! "},
	{"subquest_16._360_say", "289:9432FCD1", "But I would need a lot of money. And a lot of[ENTER]good blacksmiths. And recruits who voluntarily go[ENTER]through hell to become the best of the best![ENTER]No, no! Don't look at me like that. Don't worry,[ENTER]you have done enough for the time being. "},
	{"subquest_16._370_say", "65:8102AF2B", "Here take your reward and have a rest.[ENTER]I'll see you later! "},
	{"subquest_16._40_say", "206:73CD3CA2", "With the information you collected we may be able[ENTER]to strengthen our military power. Visit the[ENTER]musician Yu-Hwan first. I'm sure that he knows[ENTER]quite a bit about Isup's cavalry. "},
	{"subquest_16._50_say", "38:93A04862", "Hm, as you like. See you later then. "},
	{"subquest_16._60_say", "65:B4419414", "Will I ever command a cavalry regiment like that?[ENTER]Be careful. "},
	{"subquest_16._70_say", "23:55A3775B", "Thank you. Take care. "},
	{"subquest_16._80_sayTitle", "21:ABB8DD08", "The armoured cavalry "},
	{"subquest_16._90_sayReward", "163:DA2B462C", "The Captain is looking for information about King[ENTER]Isup's legendary cavalry. Yu-Hwan the musician[ENTER]probably has some information. Go and ask him. "},
	{"subquest_17._100_targetVid", "37:CED4F468", "Talk to the General Store Saleswoman"},
	{"subquest_17._10_targetVid", "23:DDF74E0E", "The Story of Ariyoung's Husband "},
	{"subquest_17._110_say", "44:2DF4CD07", "Go to the Saleswoman at the General Store and ask[ENTER]about Ariyoung's husband. "},
	{"subquest_17._120_npcChat", "13:D3A269BA", "Ariyoung's husband "},
	{"subquest_17._130_say", "238:2B165E20", "That's a sad story. She doesn't know what has[ENTER]happened to her husband? He is in a place that no[ENTER]one ever returns from...[ENTER]He was just on the way back to the village one[ENTER]day, when he was abducted and killed by the Black[ENTER]Wind Gang. "},
	{"subquest_17._140_say", "181:D9F58233", "She's going to be devastated when you tell her.[ENTER]They loved each other so much. But she has to[ENTER]find out. Otherwise the uncertainty will kill[ENTER]her. "},
	{"subquest_17._150_targetVid", "17:87EE3447", "Sad news "},
	{"subquest_17._170_say", "114:96DE1A15", "The general store saleswoman has bad news. Go to[ENTER]Ariyoung and tell her about her husband's death. "},
	{"subquest_17._180_npcChat", "21:51068956", "Your husband has died... "},
	{"subquest_17._190_say", "143:D6D7CCE9", "What... what are you saying?! He... he was killed[ENTER]by the Black Wind Gang? Oh... no... he is dead...[ENTER]I don't know what to do without him! "},
	{"subquest_17._200_say", "333:F08B80A0", "Would you please bring me my husband's body?[ENTER]Then I could at least say goodbye to him. Or if[ENTER]bringing back his body is not possible, just[ENTER]bring me a memento. I'm sure the Goo-Pae from the[ENTER]Black Wind Gang have something. Please bring me[ENTER]anything you can, as long as it belonged to him! "},
	{"subquest_17._20_say", "284:97290826", "Much time has passed since I last heard something[ENTER]about my husband. I am so worried. I hope nothing[ENTER]has happened to him. I know: There's not much use[ENTER]in worrying when you can't do anything about it.[ENTER]But my heart is beating so quickly, I just can't[ENTER]calm down. "},
	{"subquest_17._210_select", "16:FCB0E2A9", "Yes, I'll help you. "},
	{"subquest_17._220_say", "44:457CFDB3", "Come back if you change your mind. Please... "},
	{"subquest_17._230_say", "69:8F9B89DF", "You didn't find anything? Well, thanks anyway...[ENTER]Oh, poor me! "},
	{"subquest_17._240_say", "83:817B3E33", "I can't express just how grateful I am. I'll pray[ENTER]for you. "},
	{"subquest_17._250_sendLetter", "14:3DC7BB4C", "Kill Goo-Paes "},
	{"subquest_17._260_say", "132:E9B1DC42", "The Black Wind Gang has robbed and murdered[ENTER]Ariyoung's husband. Kill Goo-Paes until you find[ENTER]a memento of Ariyoung's husband. "},
	{"subquest_17._270_npcChat", "25:2F12A38D", "About your husband... "},
	{"subquest_17._280_say", "93:5A2C79EA", "How did it go? Did you find a memento of my[ENTER]husband? He meant the world to me. Anything at[ENTER]all? "},
	{"subquest_17._290_select", "27:7005BE6B", "Not yet. I'll keep looking! "},
	{"subquest_17._300_say", "95:E0CE0901", "Goo-Pae from the Black Wind Gang isn't an easy[ENTER]opponent. Go take a rest. Thanks for your help. "},
	{"subquest_17._30_say", "110:FC8C0EA9", "The Saleswoman at the General Store might have[ENTER]heard something about my husband. She has lots of[ENTER]customers; maybe someone told her something. "},
	{"subquest_17._310_say", "84:9907D82F", "Then I'll have to wait for another hero who'll[ENTER]help me.[ENTER]Goodbye. "},
	{"subquest_17._320_say", "81:F49671BE", "Oh, you are so kind! Please, bring me a memento[ENTER]of my husband. "},
	{"subquest_17._330_sendLetter", "18:C0F991EA", "Ariyoung's Wedding Ring "},
	{"subquest_17._340_targetVid", "21:1E513D5E", "Go to Ariyoung "},
	{"subquest_17._350_sayTitle", "21:1E513D5E", "Go to Ariyoung "},
	{"subquest_17._360_say", "143:9C4B4FDE", "You have found Ariyoung's husband's Wedding Ring[ENTER]on one of the killed Goo-Paes. You can't imagine[ENTER]a better memento.[ENTER]Take the Ring to Ariyoung. "},
	{"subquest_17._370_npcChat", "25:00348E79", "I have found this Ring. "},
	{"subquest_17._380_say", "251:BE9DDA95", "That ring... is... mine! Thank you so much! Now[ENTER]my husband can rest in peace. I'm going to bury[ENTER]this ring with a letter that I have written! From[ENTER]now on, I will be living alone. But at least I[ENTER]have his Wedding Ring again! That's a wonderful[ENTER]feeling. Thank you, thank you so much. "},
	{"subquest_17._390_sendLetter", "18:2CB812C1", "Quest completed! "},
	{"subquest_17._400_say", "86:C0F783AC", "News of you helping Ariyoung is spreading. A lot[ENTER]of people appreciate your help. "},
	{"subquest_17._40_select", "20:32E85B0C", "I'm going to visit the Saleswoman. "},
	{"subquest_17._410_sayReward", "42:5C5FF7A4", "You have received 300,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_17._420_sayReward", "24:427BCC24", "You have received 10,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_17._50_select", "26:952EC4CA", "No, I don't have time for this. "},
	{"subquest_17._60_say", "49:A63490DF", "Are you going to give up this quest forever? "},
	{"subquest_17._70_say", "44:457CFDB3", "Come back if you change your mind. Please... "},
	{"subquest_17._80_say", "83:CFF2E6D7", "You don't have any time?[ENTER]No time for such an easy task?[ENTER]Okay, then... "},
	{"subquest_17._90_say", "60:38A347A6", "Thank you for your kindness. Aaah, where on earth[ENTER]is my husband... "},
	{"subquest_18._100_say", "89:EDF7A4B3", "Look for a man who is reading poems and wearing[ENTER]rags and talk to him. "},
	{"subquest_18._10_targetVid", "21:8EF59FE8", "Where Is He Hiding? "},
	{"subquest_18._110_npcChat", "21:8DB46C08", "Where is your husband? "},
	{"subquest_18._120_say", "190:63C4A9D0", "I don't know where could he be hiding.[ENTER]He's become so good at it, that it's really hard[ENTER]to find him. Should I really hang a bell on his[ENTER]neck, like the shop keeper recommended? "},
	{"subquest_18._130_npcChat", "13:F39CC6CC", "Find Soon! "},
	{"subquest_18._140_say", "274:E0DBD666", "You hear a wonderful poem. Enchanted by the[ENTER]words, you follow the sound of the voice until[ENTER]you find a man in rags.[ENTER][ENTER]This must be Aranyo's husband![ENTER][ENTER]You're just about to turn around, go back to[ENTER]Aranyo when he grabs your shoulder. "},
	{"subquest_18._150_say", "108:D9A88692", "You're not from around here. Did my wife send you?Oh no! He knows who I am! Should I tell him the[ENTER]truth? "},
	{"subquest_18._153_select", "30:8D0A09A9", "I was just passing by. "},
	{"subquest_18._157_select", "10:99E7E65B", "Well... "},
	{"subquest_18._160_say", "184:73660FFA", "Aha. How nice to meet you. Wonderful weather we[ENTER]have today.[ENTER]Have you read a good book lately? I'm currently[ENTER]reading a book by Oja. I would highly recommend[ENTER]it. "},
	{"subquest_18._170_say", "289:82A8D122", "I'm right, aren't I? My wife's jibes are getting[ENTER]so bad that I cannot read in peace at home any[ENTER]more. She just doesn't understand me and keeps[ENTER]sending people after me... You found me here, but[ENTER]I could go somewhere else at any time.[ENTER]How about if you keep it quiet that you saw me[ENTER]here? I will give you some good hunting advice if[ENTER]you do. "},
	{"subquest_18._180_sendLetter", "16:D9155A72", "Return to Aranyo "},
	{"subquest_18._190_say", "69:E85503CF", "Go back to Aranyo and tell her that you could not[ENTER]find Soon. "},
	{"subquest_18._200_npcChat", "16:7EFEE724", "Soon's secret. "},
	{"subquest_18._210_say", "135:F79F9636", "You could not find him? I even laid out traps.[ENTER]Where the heck is he hiding? I'm so busy. What a[ENTER]sad fate I have. "},
	{"subquest_18._220_sendLetter", "15:4BEE1AD4", "Back to Soon "},
	{"subquest_18._230_say", "41:9A3EEA7C", "Go back to Soon and tell him you were successful. "},
	{"subquest_18._240_npcChat", "12:18BB1380", "Here I am. "},
	{"subquest_18._250_say", "135:93258387", "Did everything go well? You saved my life! Take[ENTER]this, adventurer. As promised, here's your[ENTER]reward. "},
	{"subquest_18._260_sayReward", "41:76C4F615", "You have received 7,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_18._270_sayReward", "24:427BCC24", "You have received 10,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_18._280_say", "51:E8D15E30", "Go back to Aranyo and tell her where you found[ENTER]Soon. "},
	{"subquest_18._290_npcChat", "29:66CD058F", "Hiding is difficult. "},
	{"subquest_18._300_say", "128:7EE38F95", "Thank you for not blowing my cover. It's not easy[ENTER]hiding from my wife. I just want to study here in[ENTER]peace. "},
	{"subquest_18._30_say", "223:8B8637D2", "My husband really is a pain. He calls himself a[ENTER]scholar! And while we are fighting to keep[ENTER]ourselves fed, all he does is read books. Have[ENTER]you seen him? Why on earth did I have to go and[ENTER]marry a bookworm? "},
	{"subquest_18._310_npcChat", "17:40E23CDE", "Soon's whereabouts "},
	{"subquest_18._320_say", "233:1EF5BF2B", "You found him?[ENTER]Thank you so much! If he finds out that you found[ENTER]him, he might run off again. I will go there[ENTER]immediately. This time I'll get him! And you get[ENTER]this as a token of my gratitude.[ENTER]Just you wait, sunshine...! "},
	{"subquest_18._33_select", "11:71224F1F", "I'll help you. "},
	{"subquest_18._37_select", "21:1ED62FB7", "I don't have time for this. "},
	{"subquest_18._40_say", "36:1808E82F", "Do you really want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_18._50_say", "67:C2B80F9B", "OK. Perhaps you could have a look for him later. "},
	{"subquest_18._60_say", "36:ED39A367", "Perhaps you might still find him... "},
	{"subquest_18._70_say", "280:9A61B2E5", "I would be very grateful. If you find a poor[ENTER]writer, let me know. He's probably the only one[ENTER]in the whole village. He could be writing a poem[ENTER]at this very minute and might want to be alone.[ENTER]When he finds out that I'm looking for him, he[ENTER]might try to flee. So be careful. "},
	{"subquest_18._80_sendLetter", "13:4B1F2C76", "Find Soon "},
	{"subquest_18._90_sayTitle", "13:F39CC6CC", "Find the bookworm "},
	{"subquest_19._100_sendLetter", "20:A0B38DCD", "Get a Wolf Pelt "},
	{"subquest_19._10_npcChat", "29:21B2824C", "Find a feather duster "},
	{"subquest_19._110_sayTitle", "20:A0B38DCD", "Get a Wolf Pelt "},
	{"subquest_19._120_sayReward", "125:AB9653C2", "Get a Wolf Pelt so that the Old Lady can clean[ENTER]her house and so she won't have to cough any[ENTER]more. You can get one from the Grey Wolves. "},
	{"subquest_19._130_targetVid", "23:5322C239", "Return to the Old Lady "},
	{"subquest_19._140_npcChat", "21:CBC46341", "Deliver Wolf Pelt "},
	{"subquest_19._150_say", "152:E85C6B50", "A Wolf Pelt, that's great...Oh, no. This one's no[ENTER]good. Go back to the Grey Wolves. You might be[ENTER]able to find a better one. "},
	{"subquest_19._160_say", "93:33B28964", "I need a real feather duster. Sorry, I can't do[ENTER]anything with this. "},
	{"subquest_19._170_select", "19:C33ABBC5", "I'm going to try again. "},
	{"subquest_19._180_select", "12:D2576D94", "I don't want to. "},
	{"subquest_19._190_say", "45:94070C46", "Do you really want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_19._200_say", "27:994515ED", "Just come back later again. "},
	{"subquest_19._20_say", "271:AA443771", "Cough! Cough! Oh dear, this cough will be the[ENTER]death of me. I have nothing to clean my house[ENTER]with, so all the dust is hanging around here. Oh,[ENTER]why don't I have a feather duster? My son took[ENTER]it, to work on some kind of weapon. My own flesh[ENTER]and blood is killing me! "},
	{"subquest_19._210_say", "50:D069BD41", "I know it is hard, but please try again anyway. "},
	{"subquest_19._220_say", "37:7ADC397B", "Thank you for taking care of it. "},
	{"subquest_19._230_say", "236:6D6BA5C5", "You're the adventurer that was here recently![ENTER]How does my cough sound? Cough, cough! As you can[ENTER]hear, it hasn't really improved. The house is[ENTER]still full of dust.[ENTER][ENTER]Oh? You brought me a Wolf Pelt? How magnificent![ENTER]You're very noble-minded. Wait a moment, I'll be[ENTER]back in a second. "},
	{"subquest_19._240_say", "301:BADD8A79", "One, two, one, two. One foot in front of the[ENTER]other... Right, here I am again. Thank you very[ENTER]much! Finally, I can clean my house properly. I[ENTER]have also found something I would like to give[ENTER]you. I don't really know whether it's worth[ENTER]something but maybe it'll be useful to you.[ENTER]Thanks again. Farewell! "},
	{"subquest_19._250_sendLetter", "14:3333C3F4", "A dusty something "},
	{"subquest_19._260_say", "95:6F32CEA3", "Your reward consists of a large, bulky item that[ENTER]is covered in layers of dust and is hard to[ENTER]identify. Curiously, you wipe the dust off it. "},
	{"subquest_19._270_say", "79:33243DF8", "This is old and valuable armour. One of the finer[ENTER]pieces made by the Blacksmith. "},
	{"subquest_19._280_say", "45:02B7D2AC", "It's an armour. It is old but can still be used.[ENTER]Well, that's at least something! "},
	{"subquest_19._290_say", "86:5B737D30", "It is a set of armour, but despite all your hope,[ENTER]it's turned out to be completely worthless. "},
	{"subquest_19._300_sayReward", "42:565491F5", "You have received 15,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_19._30_select", "13:D8F51F60", "I'll get you one. "},
	{"subquest_19._40_say", "117:C235E07F", "Everything is dusty! I need a feather duster.[ENTER]Could you help me? "},
	{"subquest_19._50_say", "272:8B4459E7", "It has been a while, but I think that my husband,[ENTER]may he rest in peace, made it from Wolf Pelt.[ENTER]Cough! Cough![ENTER][ENTER]Could you perhaps get a Wolf Pelt for a poor old[ENTER]lady? You can get one from a Grey Wolf. You would[ENTER]really be helping me a lot. "},
	{"subquest_19._60_say", "41:A647D1D3", "Do you really want to quit? "},
	{"subquest_19._70_say", "91:67CBB57A", "Too bad. I really thought you'd help me.[ENTER]Come again if you change your mind. "},
	{"subquest_19._80_say", "79:51BE4F09", "What kind of reward could one expect from such an[ENTER]old, poor woman? "},
	{"subquest_19._90_say", "125:789309BC", "It isn't easy to get a Wolf Pelt, but I'm going[ENTER]to try. After all, I want to become a great hero[ENTER]one day! "},
	{"subquest_20._100_say", "20:F613AD7E", "Do you want to quit searching? "},
	{"subquest_20._10_targetVid", "13:09608F4D", "Help Ah-Yu! "},
	{"subquest_20._110_say", "47:DBEA9FD1", "It's okay, you can go. But come back when you[ENTER]have some time. "},
	{"subquest_20._120_say", "76:CF281CC0", "You are a coward. You would run away anyway, if[ENTER]you came across the Savages! Now just go! "},
	{"subquest_20._130_say", "66:887B1B70", "Thank you for helping me. It's three Spears. "},
	{"subquest_20._140_sendLetter", "9:96A7773E", "The Spears "},
	{"subquest_20._160_sayTitle", "14:D8FC0ECB", "The three Spears "},
	{"subquest_20._170_say", "78:4AE39986", "You have found all the three Spears belonging to[ENTER]Ah-Yu's husband. Now go back to Ah-Yu. "},
	{"subquest_20._180_sayTitle", "17:1CF7611D", "Look for the Spears! "},
	{"subquest_20._190_say", "134:BA41A5A7", "Savage Infantrymen, Savage Minions, Savage[ENTER]Archers and Savage Generals: They all have[ENTER]Spears. Look for the Husband's Spears amongst[ENTER]theirs. "},
	{"subquest_20._200_sayReward", "81:028F8571", "You have to find the three Spears and take them[ENTER]back to Ah-Yu.[ENTER](Number of spears: %s) "},
	{"subquest_20._20_npcChat", "18:C87DB0FE", "Mementos of a husband "},
	{"subquest_20._210_npcChat", "23:3C4AC421", "Where can I find the spears? "},
	{"subquest_20._220_say", "196:EE0C014F", "It's very likely that the Savages have my[ENTER]Husband's Spears. Who knows, hopefully they[ENTER]haven't sold them. They are very good Spears.[ENTER][ENTER]Are you going to continue looking for them? "},
	{"subquest_20._230_select", "30:BAD5A0EB", "Yes, I'll continue looking. "},
	{"subquest_20._240_say", "97:4A6081C1", "You are a coward! I suppose I can't do anything[ENTER]about it. I'll have to go look for myself.[ENTER][ENTER]Do you really want to give up the search? "},
	{"subquest_20._250_select", "5:BC3244D8", "Yes, I give up. "},
	{"subquest_20._260_say", "108:CB925213", "I would do it myself, but my baby needs me. Come[ENTER]again when you have found all the spears! "},
	{"subquest_20._270_say", "49:CA5385F7", "You have given up looking for Ah-Yu's Husband's[ENTER]Spears. "},
	{"subquest_20._280_say", "59:7AE530F3", "Thank you. I'm sure you'll find them soon! "},
	{"subquest_20._290_npcChat", "19:405B76BD", "Return the Husband's Spears "},
	{"subquest_20._30_say", "170:4D013E5F", "Oh, please don't cry any more sweetheart. Mummy[ENTER]has also got worries. If you carry on crying like[ENTER]that, we both won't be able to calm down. Please[ENTER]stop crying. "},
	{"subquest_20._310_say", "152:3DE3BA07", "You found one, that's great! But could you look[ENTER]for the other two too? They belong together. It[ENTER]also looks a lot nicer when they're all hanging[ENTER]up on the wall together... Thank you. "},
	{"subquest_20._320_select", "19:C33ABBC5", "I'll try it again. "},
	{"subquest_20._330_select", "13:E1E54D89", "I give up. "},
	{"subquest_20._340_say", "49:CA5385F7", "You have given up looking for Ah-Yu's Husband's[ENTER]Spears. "},
	{"subquest_20._350_say", "32:38F1AE84", "Thank you for not giving up! "},
	{"subquest_20._360_say", "96:783FA6CF", "Oh, there they are! I'm very happy, thank you.[ENTER]It's not much Yang, but please accept it. "},
	{"subquest_20._370_sayReward", "74:EE748519", "You receive 300,000 experience points.[ENTER]You receive 20,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_20._40_say", "87:F958E2B2", "Oh, you seem a little down at the moment. You're[ENTER]usually so happy! Has something happened? "},
	{"subquest_20._50_say", "241:C5EE8088", "My husband used to look after me and made sure[ENTER]that nothing bad ever happened to me. But then he[ENTER]died in the war. The only thing that I have left[ENTER]of him is our baby and his Spears. "},
	{"subquest_20._60_say", "145:22B345DA", "While I was at work, someone stole the Spears.[ENTER]The neighbours said it was the Savages. I can't[ENTER]look for them myself because of the baby. "},
	{"subquest_20._70_say", "87:60290D02", "Could you bring the Spears back for me? I'm sure[ENTER]the Savages have them. "},
	{"subquest_20._80_select", "14:4DC0C83A", "I'm going to look for them. "},
	{"subquest_20._90_select", "15:584DBDC3", "I don't have time. "},
	{"subquest_21._100_say", "68:40E7E56A", "Thank you, my friend![ENTER]I hope you are successful. "},
	{"subquest_21._110_sendLetter", "20:572EF113", "A medicine for Balso "},
	{"subquest_21._120_targetVid", "13:F0B88AC1", "Go to Balso "},
	{"subquest_21._130_sayReward", "104:B7210654", "You found the medicine for Balso who caught an[ENTER]unknown disease from the Plagued Men. Deliver the[ENTER]medicine to him. "},
	{"subquest_21._140_sayTitle", "18:ADD70C28", "Get the medicine "},
	{"subquest_21._150_say", "131:CC6D1B2B", "During his long escape, Balso caught an unknown[ENTER]disease. Get the medicine from the Plagued Men at[ENTER]Mount Sohan. "},
	{"subquest_21._160_npcChat", "15:35D0EA05", "I've got your Medicine! "},
	{"subquest_21._170_say", "146:3D16766D", "Oh, thanks! Living the life of a fugitive is[ENTER]terrible. Especially when you also get sick.[ENTER]Fortunately I can recover from my illness now.[ENTER]Thank you so much. "},
	{"subquest_21._180_sayTitle", "9:8F643B8C", "Reward: "},
	{"subquest_21._190_sayReward", "76:54818544", "You have received 1,900,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 30,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_21._20_npcChat", "24:5B7135CC", "It's so itchy... "},
	{"subquest_21._30_sayTitle", "15:D4F30F16", "Traitor Balso: "},
	{"subquest_21._40_say", "287:D4AF6E67", "Can I ask you a favour? As you know, I am a[ENTER]traitor, and as a traitor it's hard to get by[ENTER]these days. I used to live very comfortably, but[ENTER]now it's exactly the opposite... Ever since, I've[ENTER]been on the run and can never rest. And on top of[ENTER]that, I'm exposed to all sorts of diseases. "},
	{"subquest_21._50_say", "360:5D4C9EC6", "A few days ago I was at Mount Sohan and somehow[ENTER]got mixed up with a few Plagued Men. Luckily I[ENTER]was able to flee, but somehow I caught some sort[ENTER]of disease from them from touching their skin.[ENTER]Can you help me to get some medicine? I presume[ENTER]that they have some with them. I don't like doing[ENTER]this, but please, could you help me? "},
	{"subquest_21._60_select", "16:FCB0E2A9", "Yes, I'll help you. "},
	{"subquest_21._70_say", "34:F4BFFD6E", "Do you want to quit looking for it? "},
	{"subquest_21._80_say", "111:0F581C71", "Well, that's always happening to me. Everywhere I[ENTER]look there are people who don't like me. If you[ENTER]change your mind, come back again later. "},
	{"subquest_21._90_say", "51:2EA0F6CA", "Go! And don't ever come here again! It's always[ENTER]the same... "},
	{"subquest_22._100_say", "63:AB7D2C66", "Thank you. I trust you! Bring me back the Axe[ENTER]quickly. "},
	{"subquest_22._10_targetVid", "20:2B9790E4", "Deokbae's Golden Axe "},
	{"subquest_22._110_targetVid", "16:6521EBA1", "Visit Deokbae "},
	{"subquest_22._120_sayTitle", "22:FE86AD1F", "Found the Golden Axe "},
	{"subquest_22._130_say", "46:D438949D", "You got the Golden Axe from the Savages.[ENTER]Take it to Deokbae. "},
	{"subquest_22._140_sayTitle", "29:286C25BE", "Looking for the Golden Axe "},
	{"subquest_22._150_say", "61:B5174DAA", "Take Deokbae's beloved Golden Axe back from the[ENTER]Savage Generals. "},
	{"subquest_22._160_npcChat", "28:6346EA91", "I've found your Golden Axe! "},
	{"subquest_22._170_sayTitle", "9:1E940235", "Deokbae the lumberjack: "},
	{"subquest_22._180_say", "146:B0C672B4", "Without your help I would have never got the Axe[ENTER]back. Thank you so much. I will take more care in[ENTER]future and always keep it with me. "},
	{"subquest_22._190_sayReward", "42:D701887B", "You have received 400,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_22._200_sayReward", "24:366D3250", "You have received 30,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_22._20_npcChat", "39:F775A030", "About your Golden Axe... "},
	{"subquest_22._30_sayTitle", "9:1E940235", "Deokbae the lumberjack: "},
	{"subquest_22._40_say", "171:C2BC98ED", "Oh no, oh no! I have lost the Axe. Perhaps you[ENTER]know which Axe I mean? It's the Golden Axe I got[ENTER]from the Blacksmith. A Savage stole it. "},
	{"subquest_22._50_say", "165:EFC6A70D", "If the Blacksmith finds out about this he will be[ENTER]furious and refuse to repair my axes. Also it was[ENTER]a really good axe. Can you perhaps bring it back? "},
	{"subquest_22._60_select", "8:CDF3C038", "Decline "},
	{"subquest_22._70_say", "34:F4BFFD6E", "Do you want to quit looking for it? "},
	{"subquest_22._80_say", "42:1A722FB7", "Oh, come back when you have some time. "},
	{"subquest_22._90_say", "86:99F2664C", "Too difficult for you? Well, I suppose there's[ENTER]nothing I can do. But be careful, the Savages are[ENTER]everywhere. "},
	{"subquest_23._100_sendLetter", "17:14226647", "Look for Yu-Hwan "},
	{"subquest_23._10_targetVid", "37:74FC73F5", "Please look for my older brother!"},
	{"subquest_23._110_targetVid", "16:4549854D", "Go to Yu-Hwan "},
	{"subquest_23._120_say", "215:B527D4AF", "Mirine's older brother has disappeared again. He[ENTER]wrote her a letter some time ago, but since then[ENTER]she hasn't heard anything from him. Go to Yu-Hwan[ENTER]and ask him if he knows anything about Mirine's[ENTER]older brother. "},
	{"subquest_23._130_npcChat", "24:12F379E5", "Have you seen Mirine's brother? "},
	{"subquest_23._140_say", "291:E9213F19", "Mirine's brother? I'm afraid I can't help you[ENTER]there. I haven't had any contact with him[ENTER]recently either. I can barely remember when I saw[ENTER]him last. I'm also worried.[ENTER]Perhaps something has happened to him? Go ask the[ENTER]hunter Yang-Shin. He's always on the move and[ENTER]might have seen him. "},
	{"subquest_23._150_sendLetter", "19:61564467", "Look for Yang-Shin "},
	{"subquest_23._160_targetVid", "24:20C848F1", "Go to Yang-Shin the hunter "},
	{"subquest_23._170_say", "82:44F41C3A", "The Hunter Yang-Shin is always on the move.[ENTER]Perhaps he has seen Mirine's older brother. "},
	{"subquest_23._180_npcChat", "24:12F379E5", "Have you seen Mirine's brother? "},
	{"subquest_23._190_say", "236:CDD00B1F", "You mean Mirine's older brother? The last time I[ENTER]saw him he was on his way to the Valley of[ENTER]Seungryong to collect healing herbs. I was a bit[ENTER]surprised, because it's very dangerous there, but[ENTER]then I didn't really think about it any further. "},
	{"subquest_23._200_say", "167:C5992191", "I should have stopped him. If he hasn't got in[ENTER]contact, something must have happened to him.[ENTER]You'd better go to the Valley of Seungryong and[ENTER]look for him. "},
	{"subquest_23._20_npcChat", "19:BD9E24BC", "Why are you crying? "},
	{"subquest_23._210_select", "24:0C2B0377", "Start search "},
	{"subquest_23._220_say", "23:CE434913", "Do you want to quit looking? "},
	{"subquest_23._230_say", "57:EA7435B6", "Mirine was really very sad.[ENTER]I'll come back later. "},
	{"subquest_23._240_say", "221:2FE26CAA", "If an older brother doesn't get in contact for a[ENTER]while, it doesn't necessarily mean that something[ENTER]has happened to him. You don't need to go into[ENTER]that dangerous valley, just because a little girl[ENTER]has asked you to. "},
	{"subquest_23._250_say", "143:48D87F24", "The mission is not as insignificant as it seems.[ENTER]The Valley of Seungryong is a dangerous place.[ENTER]But I promised, so I will do it. "},
	{"subquest_23._260_sendLetter", "15:1E497F10", "The Missing Brother "},
	{"subquest_23._270_targetVid", "47:C57398D9", "Find the brother in Seungryong. "},
	{"subquest_23._280_sayTitle", "22:8FF31098", "Look for Mirine's brother "},
	{"subquest_23._290_say", "185:597BEA55", "Mirine's brother is looking for healing herbs in[ENTER]the Valley of Seungryong. Go there and see[ENTER]whether he is okay.[ENTER]The Teleporter will help you if you are looking[ENTER]for a short cut. "},
	{"subquest_23._300_npcChat", "7:26D27963", "The body! "},
	{"subquest_23._30_say", "201:F6662820", "You once brought me a letter from my brother,[ENTER]didn't you? I was very grateful when you did[ENTER]that. Unfortunately I haven't been in contact[ENTER]with him since then. My brother is still away.[ENTER]He's looking for healing herbs for me. "},
	{"subquest_23._310_say", "232:761BC81A", "A dead man is lying here. He's young and thin and[ENTER]seems to have been collecting Ginseng. I'm afraid[ENTER]that it might be Mirine's older brother, who we[ENTER]have been looking for. The body is wearing a[ENTER]necklace with a pendant on it. I'll take it off[ENTER]and take it to Mirine. "},
	{"subquest_23._320_sendLetter", "15:67D176AB", "Go to Mirine "},
	{"subquest_23._330_sayTitle", "17:87EE3447", "Sad news "},
	{"subquest_23._340_say", "192:3E2F45C8", "On the body found in the Valley of Seungryong[ENTER]there was a Pendant with Mirine's name engraved on[ENTER]it. Go to Mirine and give her the Jade Necklace+2[ENTER]you found and the Pendant. "},
	{"subquest_23._350_npcChat", "25:4FCC83D6", "Do you know this necklace? "},
	{"subquest_23._360_say", "264:084C0B3E", "Oh, this necklace... My brother used to wear it[ENTER]all the time. I have a similar one. We always[ENTER]wore them so that we'd remember each other and[ENTER]find our way back to each other. But... my[ENTER]brother isn't here any more... And only the[ENTER]necklace has found its way back. "},
	{"subquest_23._370_say", "275:4DA5CB3C", "My poor brother...[ENTER]And all just because of this war. My brother sold[ENTER]healing herbs, it was the only thing that brought[ENTER]any money in. It allowed us to buy food. He[ENTER]worked really hard so that I had enough to eat.[ENTER]And now he's dead. Just because of me... "},
	{"subquest_23._380_say", "162:79959200", "Thank you for bringing me this. Now I at least[ENTER]know what happened. If you hadn't helped me, I[ENTER]would never have found out. "},
	{"subquest_23._390_say", "219:3B6478DA", "I'll take good care of my older brother's pendant[ENTER]and I'll give you the necklace as a token of my[ENTER]gratitude. I'm sure it'll come in useful.[ENTER]Thanks for your help. I'm sure he's in heaven[ENTER]now, don't you think? "},
	{"subquest_23._400_sayReward", "74:75C78F76", "You have received 600,000 experience points.[ENTER]You have received 35,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_23._40_say", "151:0637B858", "I'm worried about him because I haven't had any[ENTER]contact with him for so long. I'm sorry, but[ENTER]could you have another look for my brother?[ENTER]Yu-Hwan might know something. "},
	{"subquest_23._50_select", "8:CDF3C038", "Decline "},
	{"subquest_23._60_say", "20:F613AD7E", "Do you want to quit searching? "},
	{"subquest_23._70_say", "52:2206755D", "Oh...[ENTER]I'll wait here. Maybe later? Please? "},
	{"subquest_23._80_say", "57:C31A226F", "I don't have time![ENTER]Good luck to your brother. "},
	{"subquest_23._90_say", "131:440CD5D7", "It wouldn't be very nice to abandon a crying[ENTER]girl. And the mission won't take much time[ENTER]either. Let's go! "},
	{"subquest_23._say_item", "83:36B3580F", "You receive Mirine's Pendant and a Jade Necklace+2. Take both items to Mirine."},
	{"subquest_24._100_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_24._10_targetVid", "23:F446AEE5", "Yu-Rang's Rice Cake "},
	{"subquest_24._110_say", "128:9D6109E3", "If you have time later on, please come back. I[ENTER]don't know how we'll survive without selling the[ENTER]Rice Cakes. "},
	{"subquest_24._120_say", "154:3D8EA8F4", "Everything revolves around the rich people who[ENTER]throw Yang out the window as if there was no[ENTER]tomorrow. When we don't even know if we'll have[ENTER]food on the table tomorrow! Go away! "},
	{"subquest_24._130_say", "64:F5D8FCEE", "Thanks. You are very kind. I'll wait here until[ENTER]you are back. "},
	{"subquest_24._140_sendLetter", "26:17895195", "The Stolen Rice Cake "},
	{"subquest_24._150_say", "177:8CC16B1E", "Get Yu-Rang's lost Rice Cake back from the[ENTER]Spiders in the desert. If you're too slow, the[ENTER]Spiders will eat the Rice Cake, or they will[ENTER]become terribly dry in the hot sun. Hurry up! "},
	{"subquest_24._160_sayReward", "37:4A421FB2", "Kill the Baby Spiders in the Yongbi Desert. "},
	{"subquest_24._170_npcChat", "41:00148361", "About your stolen Rice Cake... "},
	{"subquest_24._180_say", "127:E08AAC8A", "What, the Spiders ate the Rice Cake? Oh no! Or[ENTER]has it dried up?! Please don't say that[ENTER]everything is lost! "},
	{"subquest_24._190_select", "25:78C13151", "No, everything's okay. "},
	{"subquest_24._200_select", "13:E1E54D89", "I give up. "},
	{"subquest_24._20_npcChat", "35:FC45F841", "Your stolen Rice Cake... "},
	{"subquest_24._210_say", "185:CBFD90BA", "Can't you perhaps do it after all? The Rice Cake[ENTER]is very important to me. I beg you.[ENTER][ENTER]Do you want to give up the quest to find[ENTER]Yu-Rang's Rice Cake in the desert? "},
	{"subquest_24._220_select", "19:C33ABBC5", "I'm going to try again. "},
	{"subquest_24._230_select", "26:C8838042", "Sorry, it's too difficult. "},
	{"subquest_24._240_say", "48:D21F1EB2", "I can't believe it. Who is going to help us now? "},
	{"subquest_24._250_say", "25:283FAE5C", "Come on! Please help me! "},
	{"subquest_24._260_say", "107:933B8435", "So you are going to continue the search? Thank[ENTER]you! Please try to find the Rice Cake as quickly[ENTER]as possible. "},
	{"subquest_24._270_say", "130:6027F5C7", "No, it is too late. Even if you get hold of it,[ENTER]it would have dried up by now. I won't be able to[ENTER]sell it any more. "},
	{"subquest_24._280_say", "109:E98775CB", "You look at the ground and see the pieces of cake[ENTER]the Spiders have left behind. Unfortunately they[ENTER]are all dried up now. "},
	{"subquest_24._290_sayReward", "100:67FA4445", "You wasted too much time looking for Rice Cakes.[ENTER]The Rice Cakes have gone stale. You have failed. "},
	{"subquest_24._300_sendLetter", "16:44277336", "Go back to Yu-Rang "},
	{"subquest_24._30_say", "30:A8489963", "Hey, how's your mother? "},
	{"subquest_24._310_targetVid", "16:44277336", "Return to Yu-Rang "},
	{"subquest_24._320_say", "78:A5E40BD3", "You have rescued Yu-Rang's Rice Cake from the[ENTER]Spiders just in time. Take it to her. "},
	{"subquest_24._330_npcChat", "42:B56B5A39", "You are in luck. Here is your Rice Cake. "},
	{"subquest_24._340_say", "118:E62381E0", "You're really great! I don't know what to say.[ENTER]Now I can sell it on the market tomorrow. Thank[ENTER]you so much. "},
	{"subquest_24._350_sayReward", "43:5ADD39D2", "You receive 900,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_24._360_sayReward", "24:4B0DE441", "You have received 25,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_24._40_say", "41:3A103ED3", "Oh, she is feeling much better; thanks for asking. "},
	{"subquest_24._50_say", "48:288625A4", "You look like you are in trouble. What's up? "},
	{"subquest_24._60_say", "314:4061AA13", "I sell Rice Cake here every day, but something[ENTER]terrible happened today. Gigantic Spiders[ENTER]appeared and stole it from me. I was terrified[ENTER]and didn't fight them. Now I don't have any Rice[ENTER]Cake left to sell. But how am I going to survive?[ENTER]My family doesn't have any other income... "},
	{"subquest_24._70_select", "22:CC024AEE", "I'll find it for you. "},
	{"subquest_24._80_select", "27:605C4844", "Sorry, I don't have any time. "},
	{"subquest_24._90_sayTitle", "9:5D3F9461", "Question: "},
	{"subquest_25._100_npcChat", "34:E3BF3575", "What do you like? "},
	{"subquest_25._110_say", "170:9C15E4B1", "Well, ever since I lost my husband in the war,[ENTER]I've been feeling very lonely. Hm? What would[ENTER]make me feel better? Well, my husband used to[ENTER]bring me Flowers. "},
	{"subquest_25._120_say", "351:29166ECD", "They were Flowers that grow quite far away from[ENTER]our village. Even though it was dangerous, he got[ENTER]the Flowers for me. I can't see these Flowers any[ENTER]more though, as my husband is dead. But on days[ENTER]like these I miss him so much. Oh, what did I[ENTER]just say? That was very inappropriate. Please[ENTER]forget what I just said. "},
	{"subquest_25._130_qSetTitle", "19:ABC8898F", "Back to Huahn-So "},
	{"subquest_25._140_makequestbutton", "19:ABC8898F", "Back to Huahn-So "},
	{"subquest_25._160_say", "114:06309D9A", "Ariyoung is missing the Flowers her husband[ENTER]always brought her. Go to Huahn-So and tell him[ENTER]about it. "},
	{"subquest_25._170_npcChat", "24:7AC2CA8A", "The gift for Ariyoung... "},
	{"subquest_25._180_say", "266:C6DD3AAE", "So, what does Ariyoung like? You didn't tell her[ENTER]anything about me, did you? Hmm, she likes a[ENTER]Flower that her husband used to bring her?[ENTER]That's quite far away from the village. It's[ENTER]going to be difficult for me to get there. And[ENTER]there could be monsters there like tigers. "},
	{"subquest_25._190_say", "246:128EEC28", "Exactly! Why don't you help me? Why don't you[ENTER]just pick the Flowers for me? It would be a great[ENTER]help to us both. What? That's not part of the[ENTER]deal? Come on, don't you see how hard I'm trying[ENTER]to win her love? Just help me! I will reward you[ENTER]with lots of Yang! "},
	{"subquest_25._200_select", "7:2568ABFA", "Refuse "},
	{"subquest_25._20_npcChat", "26:32F12225", "Oh my beloved Ariyoung "},
	{"subquest_25._210_say", "42:74C67ADE", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_25._220_say", "85:C38CC7A4", "Damn. How am I supposed to get those Flowers?[ENTER]Please come back if you change your mind. "},
	{"subquest_25._230_say", "95:6EFDE4A6", "Have you never been in love? Don't you know how I[ENTER]feel about Ariyoung? Oh Ariyoung... "},
	{"subquest_25._240_say", "47:73C5F119", "Thank you very much! Please bring me those[ENTER]Flowers. "},
	{"subquest_25._250_qSetTitle", "16:C1778123", "Get the Flowers "},
	{"subquest_25._260_targetVid", "7:A84A58FE", "Flowers "},
	{"subquest_25._270_sayTitle", "20:31A179EB", "Flowers for Ariyoung "},
	{"subquest_25._280_say", "163:F6ED0F03", "To help Huahn-So tell Ariyoung how he feels, you[ENTER]have to get special Flowers. The Flowers can be[ENTER]found in the corner of the map of the first[ENTER]village. "},
	{"subquest_25._290_npcChat", "23:E90414B0", "I haven't found any Flowers. "},
	{"subquest_25._300_say", "129:E88A532E", "Hm, damn...[ENTER]I wanted to tell her my feelings. It's so hard to[ENTER]get her love. My dearest Ariyoung... "},
	{"subquest_25._30_say", "295:3088FEF2", "Do you know Lady Ariyoung? Well, she is...no,[ENTER]well she was married. Her husband died a few[ENTER]years back and since then she has been living[ENTER]alone. She has very impressive personality and[ENTER]she is still a very beautiful woman. She married[ENTER]very young and I was too late...  "},
	{"subquest_25._310_select", "19:C33ABBC5", "I will try again. "},
	{"subquest_25._320_select", "11:A61FC723", "I quit. "},
	{"subquest_25._330_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_25._340_say", "88:8343915F", "Oh...[ENTER]If you change your mind...[ENTER]I'll be waiting right here.[ENTER]Please help me! "},
	{"subquest_25._350_say", "52:D552DDAF", "Will my love end like this? Ariyoung... "},
	{"subquest_25._360_say", "93:2C16A102", "Thank you so much. You must also be in love, if[ENTER]you can understand what I feel for Ariyoung. "},
	{"subquest_25._370_npcChat", "25:83BA1C4F", "Ariyoung's favourite Flowers "},
	{"subquest_25._380_say", "75:47F81BDB", "These Flowers look like the ones Ariyoung[ENTER]described. I'm going to take some. "},
	{"subquest_25._390_qSetTitle", "19:ABC8898F", "Back to Huahn-So "},
	{"subquest_25._400_say", "148:EF8F66D5", "I have found Ariyoung's favourite flowers and[ENTER]have picked some. I should take them to Huahn-So[ENTER]so he can confess his love to Ariyoung. "},
	{"subquest_25._40_say", "206:5212DDD8", "But her husband died in the war. That's why she[ENTER]is such a young widow. I want her to know how I[ENTER]feel! I know its a selfish request, but could you[ENTER]please help me? "},
	{"subquest_25._410_npcChat", "30:B4D63E01", "Here are Ariyoung's favourite flowers. "},
	{"subquest_25._420_say", "234:C4C77B5B", "Oh, these are the Flowers? Now I can tell[ENTER]Ariyoung how I feel about her! Do you think it's[ENTER]too early for that? Oh well, it doesn't matter if[ENTER]it's too early. I have to tell her otherwise I'll[ENTER]burst. Here is your reward and thank you very[ENTER]much! "},
	{"subquest_25._430_sayReward", "42:D701887B", "You have received 400,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_25._440_sayReward", "24:ABEEFEE0", "You have received 12,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_25._50_say", "258:9939AD1E", "Do you think she likes handsome men? Or beautiful[ENTER]clothes? I need to find out what she likes first,[ENTER]then I might be able to talk to her. Could you[ENTER]find out for me, please? But don't tell her[ENTER]anything about me! I beg you! I'll give a reward[ENTER]for doing it. "},
	{"subquest_25._60_qSetTitle", "21:1E513D5E", "Go to Ariyoung "},
	{"subquest_25._70_makequestbutton", "21:1E513D5E", "Go to Ariyoung "},
	{"subquest_25._80_targetVid", "16:F339BE2D", "Go to Ariyoung "},
	{"subquest_25._90_say", "229:7B0B20AF", "Huahn-So loves the widow Ariyoung. To help[ENTER]Huahn-So tell Ariyoung how he feels, you have to[ENTER]find out what she likes. Ask Ariyoung what she[ENTER]likes, but take care to not tell her too much! "},
	{"subquest_26._100_say", "44:7AFAF08D", "It's your loss. You're missing the chance of a[ENTER]lifetime. "},
	{"subquest_26._10_targetVid", "16:9F0E98AE", "Go to the Storekeeper. "},
	{"subquest_26._110_say", "122:8C028562", "Very good! I knew you would be interested. If you[ENTER]get some then come back here and please share[ENTER]them with me! "},
	{"subquest_26._120_sendLetter", "15:0B2C07AC", "Go to Octavio "},
	{"subquest_26._140_sayTitle", "15:0B2C07AC", "Go to Octavio "},
	{"subquest_26._150_say", "168:237E8DB2", "The Storekeeper has given you a good tip: frog's[ENTER]leg soup is an excellent remedy for weakness and[ENTER]tired bones. Ask Octavio whether he can make this[ENTER]soup. "},
	{"subquest_26._160_npcChat", "20:D45A123C", "Frog's leg soup? "},
	{"subquest_26._170_say", "217:4BFE27E5", "Frog's leg soup... Yeah right, I used to make[ENTER]that. But that's all in the past now. Back then,[ENTER]I wasn't afraid of monsters, so I was able to get[ENTER]hold of Frog's Legs easily. "},
	{"subquest_26._180_say", "214:DFB8D530", "But now... I am too old and tired. With that[ENTER]soup, I could regain some energy, but frogs[ENTER]aren't easy to kill. If you brought me the Frog's[ENTER]Legs for the soup, I would make the best frog's[ENTER]leg soup in the world for us! "},
	{"subquest_26._190_select", "19:5DD251FD", "Sure, I'll do it. "},
	{"subquest_26._200_select", "15:DA861247", "No, I can't do that. "},
	{"subquest_26._20_npcChat", "14:4249FA23", "How are you? "},
	{"subquest_26._210_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_26._220_say", "41:D907BB44", "You're busy? Come back if you change your mind. "},
	{"subquest_26._230_say", "92:0C0C02DE", "My soup isn't very well known. If you knew what[ENTER]it was like you'd do it. Ah well, goodbye. "},
	{"subquest_26._240_say", "70:056E0624", "Then hurry up! I'll prepare everything for the[ENTER]frog's leg soup. "},
	{"subquest_26._250_sendLetter", "22:385FE089", "Received Frog's Legs "},
	{"subquest_26._270_sendLetter", "19:ADDB8F67", "Get Frog's Legs "},
	{"subquest_26._280_say", "54:204EF3FF", "You have got a giant Frog's Leg. Return to[ENTER]Octavio. "},
	{"subquest_26._290_sayTitle", "34:8A83ED41", "Kill Tree Frog Leaders "},
	{"subquest_26._300_say", "138:E9D60BE8", "Octavio needs Frog's Legs for his frog's leg[ENTER]soup. You can find them by hunting Tree Frog[ENTER]Leaders in the Hwang Temple. "},
	{"subquest_26._30_sayTitle", "9:AD74B78E", "Storekeeper: "},
	{"subquest_26._310_npcChat", "28:E4C2B044", "I can't do this right now. "},
	{"subquest_26._320_say", "76:F5E09C2F", "What's up? When I was as young as you are, I got[ENTER]10 Frog's Legs a day. "},
	{"subquest_26._330_select", "17:7D246859", "Try again "},
	{"subquest_26._340_say", "72:4120C64B", "You're already tired? Why don't you take a break[ENTER]and try again later? "},
	{"subquest_26._350_say", "120:9DE5C05A", "I could have used that frog's leg soup. But[ENTER]that's not going to happen. Shame. Bye! "},
	{"subquest_26._360_say", "92:ADB9CE27", "Then don't stand around here but go! The water is[ENTER]already boiling and everything is ready! "},
	{"subquest_26._370_targetVid", "15:0B2C07AC", "Go to Octavio "},
	{"subquest_26._380_say", "298:E4C80E98", "Now that's what I call a frog's leg! They used to[ENTER]be smaller but I'm sure this one is going to[ENTER]taste good too. Wait a moment... That already[ENTER]smells quite good. Another pinch of salt...[ENTER]Right! Here is your portion. Hahaha, now I have[ENTER]enough energy for a whole week's work. "},
	{"subquest_26._390_say", "232:77D98BD3", "And don't tell anyone about it. Especially not[ENTER]the Storekeeper. He likes talking and if the[ENTER]qualities of this soup become known, I won't have[ENTER]a minute's peace because everyone will constantly[ENTER]be coming around to taste my soup. "},
	{"subquest_26._400_sayReward", "45:ABA7E80D", "You have received 5,000,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_26._40_say", "351:6A42A295", "I haven't been very well lately. My body really[ENTER]isn't what it used to be. When I was young, I[ENTER]could work until night-time, every day of the[ENTER]week, whilst drinking alcohol. Now, it's even too[ENTER]much work to get up in the mornings. I need a[ENTER]large helping of frog's leg soup to get back my[ENTER]energy. "},
	{"subquest_26._410_sayReward", "24:4A64FA46", "You have received 50,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_26._50_say", "320:50E182A2", "You don't know what frog's leg soup is? When you[ENTER]drink a bowl of it, you are immediately wide[ENTER]awake and full of energy. The you can work a[ENTER]whole week straight without getting tired![ENTER]Octavio used to make this soup, but for some[ENTER]reason he stopped making it a little while ago. "},
	{"subquest_26._60_select", "28:D9011365", "I'll go talk to Octavio. "},
	{"subquest_26._70_select", "15:7980F7E1", "I'm busy. "},
	{"subquest_26._80_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_26._90_say", "67:EEC65C5A", "OK, if you're busy, come back later if you find[ENTER]some time. "},
	{"subquest_27._100_say", "214:AB9AAE14", "He should be ashamed to call himself a father! If[ENTER]I find him then, God have mercy on his soul![ENTER]Believe me, I'm not exaggerating. Ask the others[ENTER]in the village, they agree with me. "},
	{"subquest_27._110_targetVid", "20:F10E5104", "General Store Saleswoman: "},
	{"subquest_27._120_makequestbutton", "27:D02B6C2C", "Go to the General Store. "},
	{"subquest_27._130_say", "90:540C969C", "Perhaps the General Store Saleswoman knows what[ENTER]Soon is up to. Go to her and ask whether she has[ENTER]heard something from Soon. "},
	{"subquest_27._140_npcChat", "16:472743A3", "What's up with Soon? "},
	{"subquest_27._150_say", "235:4B5E8141", "Yesterday, he came here and asked for the Secret[ENTER]Temple Book. He had no Yang on him, so he just[ENTER]had a look at it. It must be very important to[ENTER]him if he's even neglecting his family for it.[ENTER]Why is he so interested in it? "},
	{"subquest_27._160_sayTitle", "20:F10E5104", "General Store Saleswoman: "},
	{"subquest_27._170_say", "257:8B65D492", "I feel sorry for Aranyo. She didn't marry Soon[ENTER]just so that she could work day and night. I'm[ENTER]sure she didn't expect that she would have to[ENTER]support her family by herself. You should talk to[ENTER]him. Who knows, perhaps he'll finally realise[ENTER]what he's doing wrong. "},
	{"subquest_27._180_makequestbutton", "12:60DA046B", "Go to Soon "},
	{"subquest_27._190_qSetTitle", "12:60DA046B", "Go to Soon "},
	{"subquest_27._200_targetVid", "11:33DF38C8", "Soon again "},
	{"subquest_27._20_npcChat", "23:8FD77E38", "The joy of reading "},
	{"subquest_27._210_say", "62:67259CB5", "Go to Soon[ENTER]Go to Soon and ask him about the Temple Book. "},
	{"subquest_27._220_npcChat", "36:B7614A1E", "What is the Secret Temple Book? "},
	{"subquest_27._230_say", "246:0E48EAB3", "You know, I have read every book in the world.[ENTER]Recently, I've been hearing about a Secret Temple[ENTER]Book. Rumour has it that this book contains all[ENTER]the secrets to the Temple of Darkness. It also[ENTER]explains how you can become a saint. "},
	{"subquest_27._240_say", "169:FA39E70F", "I would so love to read this Book. Could you get[ENTER]it for me? If you do, I will give you something in[ENTER]return, even if I have to sell my house for it. "},
	{"subquest_27._250_select", "11:F5F59271", "I'll do it! "},
	{"subquest_27._260_select", "22:97E3B5A7", "I can't, sorry. "},
	{"subquest_27._270_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_27._280_say", "79:740554FC", "Come on, don't you want to help me? If not now,[ENTER]then come back later. I'll be waiting for you. "},
	{"subquest_27._290_say", "140:A514FA58", "You really don't want to help me? You need[ENTER]holiday, huh? The book is really important to me.[ENTER]What do I do now? Damn. "},
	{"subquest_27._300_say", "21:8CBCE761", "Thanks, I'll be waiting for you. "},
	{"subquest_27._30_say", "189:39BCA174", "Do you like reading as much as I do?[ENTER]Words that join into sentences and are finally[ENTER]unified in a book. How wonderful! And the pure[ENTER]joy of writing a book so that other people can[ENTER]read it! It doesn't get any better than that! "},
	{"subquest_27._310_makequestbutton", "36:E1885AEE", "You have found the Secret Temple Book."},
	{"subquest_27._320_qSetTitle", "50:3AB0B34E", "Book found. Return to Soon. "},
	{"subquest_27._330_targetVid", "13:113DA1A3", "Return to Soon. "},
	{"subquest_27._340_makequestbutton", "24:586BA8AF", "Defeat the Dark Fanatics "},
	{"subquest_27._350_sayTitle", "33:5D1577BB", "You have killed the Dark Fanatics. "},
	{"subquest_27._360_say", "41:A69461C1", "Take the Secret Temple Book to Soon. "},
	{"subquest_27._370_say", "126:19E3A7EF", "Soon has a profound interest in the Secret Temple[ENTER]Book. If you kill the Dark Fanatics, you might[ENTER]find the Secret Temple Book. "},
	{"subquest_27._380_npcChat", "26:B165E70F", "The Secret Temple Book "},
	{"subquest_27._390_say", "113:1DA07E0C", "Oh, that's it! Many thanks![ENTER]Here is your reward.[ENTER]Now leave me alone, I have to read! "},
	{"subquest_27._400_sayReward", "43:3F8C7350", "You have received 850,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_27._40_say", "235:DE4DE99F", "Life is pulsing between the pages of this book![ENTER]Young knowledge and old wisdom live here![ENTER]Imagine how bleak my life would be without[ENTER]books... Only unfortunately... my wife doesn't[ENTER]understand it. Could you try convincing her that[ENTER]it's a good thing? "},
	{"subquest_27._410_sayReward", "24:BF788F3D", "You have received 20,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_27._420_say", "135:56B35B1A", "Hey... You haven't got it yet? If you start a[ENTER]quest, you should see it through until the end.[ENTER]Now finish the quest! "},
	{"subquest_27._430_say", "73:342310A6", "The Dark Fanatics are not to be underestimated.[ENTER]Just try again later. "},
	{"subquest_27._440_say", "72:9CB87E2B", "Well, then I have to ask somebody else for help.[ENTER]Farewell. "},
	{"subquest_27._450_say", "100:DBCAE11E", "Thanks, I'll be waiting for you. I can't wait to[ENTER]hold it in my hands and read it. "},
	{"subquest_27._50_makequestbutton", "14:150D2704", "Go to Aranyo  "},
	{"subquest_27._60_sayTitle", "14:150D2704", "Go to Aranyo  "},
	{"subquest_27._70_say", "36:E05F581E", "Go to Aranyo and ask about her husband. "},
	{"subquest_27._80_npcChat", "32:3E61733F", "Why are you so angry? "},
	{"subquest_27._90_say", "257:29A6EEAE", "Angry? I'm about to explode with anger! Does my[ENTER]husband to out to work? No. Does he ever bring[ENTER]Yang home? No. Instead he's hiding away somewhere[ENTER]between the pages of a book! Have you ever heard[ENTER]anything like it? Can a book bring us clothing?[ENTER]Does it provide us with food? "},
	{"subquest_30._100_sendLetter", "18:61945CA5", "Ore for a new weapon "},
	{"subquest_30._10_npcChat", "19:9D2083F4", "Do you need ore? "},
	{"subquest_30._110_targetVid", "7:43EE785F", "Blacksmith "},
	{"subquest_30._120_sayTitle", "21:0F9571D5", "Back to the Blacksmith "},
	{"subquest_30._130_say", "102:2BDAE622", "You have collected the Ore the Blacksmith needs[ENTER]to make new weapons. You should take it to him. "},
	{"subquest_30._140_sayTitle", "31:C1152DE0", "Get ore for new weapons "},
	{"subquest_30._150_say", "296:990CBE17", "The Blacksmith needs ore for producing a new kind[ENTER]of weapon. He needs 100 pieces of Gold Ore, 100[ENTER]of Silver Ore and 100 pieces of Ebony Ore. Ore[ENTER]deposits can be found in assorted places on the[ENTER]map and collected in mines. But you can also[ENTER]trade with other players and buy it from them. "},
	{"subquest_30._160_npcChat", "19:2F13B763", "Ore for a new weapon. "},
	{"subquest_30._170_say", "68:F53BC6DF", "That's not enough. I need all 100 gold ore, 100[ENTER]silver ore and 100 ebony ore. "},
	{"subquest_30._180_select", "23:3E6FF557", "Try again "},
	{"subquest_30._190_select", "10:6C90886C", "Give up "},
	{"subquest_30._200_say", "32:0CC0B7A0", "You really want to give up forever? "},
	{"subquest_30._20_say", "239:8CC73A07", "Hey, you! Yes, I mean you! You are not a beginner[ENTER]any more. And why? Because I have given you[ENTER]complicated tasks! It was only for your sake,[ENTER]hehehe. But now I'm asking you for a real favour. "},
	{"subquest_30._210_say", "146:99431004", "It is hard to get Ore, isn't it? Good luck only[ENTER]comes to those who work hard. How about taking a[ENTER]short break and trying it again later on? "},
	{"subquest_30._220_say", "83:59F3F937", "Shame. It was a brilliant idea.[ENTER]Oh well, what the heck. See you! "},
	{"subquest_30._230_say", "82:A3EB2E37", "If you make an effort you will soon have[ENTER]everything together. Good luck! "},
	{"subquest_30._240_say", "142:50960FEA", "Oh, you already have collected everything![ENTER]Hahaha! I can tell it's all going to work out.[ENTER]Wait a minute, it's not going to be long now.[ENTER]And here we go! "},
	{"subquest_30._250_say", "130:554035BB", "Hmm, it's finished. Sometimes I'm surprised at[ENTER]just how talented I am. Here's your weapon.[ENTER]It's new, so take good care of it! "},
	{"subquest_30._260_sayReward", "43:E10A5F7B", "You have received 200,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_30._270_sayReward", "24:BF788F3D", "You have received 20,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_30._280_sayReward", "28:A0131319", "You have received a Silver Sword+3. "},
	{"subquest_30._290_sayReward", "29:551EB575", "You have received an Aquatic Fan+3. "},
	{"subquest_30._30_say", "157:F7E18A5E", "I want to try to forge a new weapon but it's very[ENTER]difficult to get the materials. Could you do that[ENTER]for me? I will give you the first one I finish as[ENTER]a reward. "},
	{"subquest_30._40_say", "340:D791D20E", "I need 100 Gold Ore, 100 Silver Ore and 100 Ebony[ENTER]Ore. You may think that is a lot, but when mining[ENTER]you get a lot of material at once. So you should[ENTER]find them without any trouble. If it turns out to[ENTER]be too hard for you, you can always try to buy[ENTER]them from someone. Either way, good luck! "},
	{"subquest_30._50_select", "7:2568ABFA", "Refuse "},
	{"subquest_30._60_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_30._70_say", "45:AFE88DDD", "No need to hurry. Come back if you change your[ENTER]mind. "},
	{"subquest_30._80_say", "83:59F3F937", "Shame. It was a brilliant idea.[ENTER]Oh well, what the heck. See you! "},
	{"subquest_30._90_say", "59:D032D621", "Oh! You're going to do it?[ENTER]You're a good friend! "},
	{"subquest_31._100_sendLetter", "20:30884F7C", "Ore for new armour "},
	{"subquest_31._10_targetVid", "15:3C795364", "Go to the Blacksmith "},
	{"subquest_31._110_sayTitle", "21:0F9571D5", "Back to the Blacksmith "},
	{"subquest_31._120_sayReward", "87:C5A93599", "You have collected the ore the Blacksmith needs[ENTER]to make the new armours. You should take it to[ENTER]him. "},
	{"subquest_31._130_sayTitle", "28:08D1F10A", "Get Ore for the new armours "},
	{"subquest_31._140_sayReward", "294:C4A07CBE", "The Blacksmith needs ore to forge new armour.[ENTER]Bring him 100 Copper Ore, 100 Pieces of Pearl and[ENTER]100 Ebony Ore. You can obtain the materials all[ENTER]over the map with a Pickaxe and the mining skill.[ENTER]You can also trade with other players and buy ore[ENTER]from them. "},
	{"subquest_31._150_npcChat", "21:6936D70D", "Ore for new armour. "},
	{"subquest_31._160_say", "127:827F6265", "Hmmm, a lot of materials are missing. I said I[ENTER]need 100 Copper Ore, 100 Ebony Ore and 100 Pieces[ENTER]of Pearl! "},
	{"subquest_31._170_select", "23:3E6FF557", "Try again "},
	{"subquest_31._180_select", "10:6C90886C", "Give up "},
	{"subquest_31._190_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_31._200_say", "147:3C83FCB0", "Is it too hard? Of course, it isn't just about[ENTER]luck, but hard work, too. Why don't you just try[ENTER]again later? "},
	{"subquest_31._20_npcChat", "34:609E285F", "You still need more ore? "},
	{"subquest_31._210_say", "111:AAC46D3F", "Well, there go my plans for new armour. That idea[ENTER]could have changed the world! What a shame... "},
	{"subquest_31._220_say", "45:E19BED76", "Be strong! I know you can do it! "},
	{"subquest_31._230_say", "205:088A86EC", "Fantastic. You're really good at getting hold of[ENTER]materials. Now, pay attention. Here... and[ENTER]here... and I'll just quickly cool it down...[ENTER]Look, this is for you, as a reward for your[ENTER]efforts. See you soon! "},
	{"subquest_31._240_sayReward", "43:E10A5F7B", "You have received 200,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_31._250_sayReward", "24:BF788F3D", "You have received 20,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_31._260_sayReward", "35:5CAABED3", "You have received a Lion Plate Armour+3. "},
	{"subquest_31._270_sayReward", "39:339C6144", "You have received a Red Ant Suit+3. "},
	{"subquest_31._280_sayReward", "38:C96623DF", "You have received a Ghost Plate Armour+3. "},
	{"subquest_31._290_sayReward", "29:CADC9D45", "You have received an Amorous Clothing+3. "},
	{"subquest_31._30_say", "291:83ED6313", "Hello, have you got a minute for me?[ENTER]I appreciate very much that you helped me to make[ENTER]a new weapon. Now I would like to ask for your[ENTER]help again. This time I would like to make a new[ENTER]armour. After I have made a new weapon it is[ENTER]obvious that I also need a good armour. "},
	{"subquest_31._40_say", "273:2E0E1BB5", "Of course I need materials to make the new[ENTER]armour. Can you get them for me? In return you'll[ENTER]get the first completed armour. This time I need[ENTER]100 Copper Ore, 100 Ebony Ore and 100 Pieces of[ENTER]Pearl. You should know that already. I wish you[ENTER]success! "},
	{"subquest_31._50_select", "9:23A53143", "Accept "},
	{"subquest_31._60_say", "42:74C67ADE", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_31._70_say", "86:C2C48D40", "Why are you hesitating? Come back when you ready[ENTER]to work in the mines. "},
	{"subquest_31._80_say", "82:A44709EB", "That little bit of ore isn't too much to ask.[ENTER]Well, please yourself. Get lost! "},
	{"subquest_31._90_say", "107:E20E2906", "You'll help me again? You are a good friend.[ENTER]And don't worry: the first armour is yours! "},
	{"subquest_32._100_sendLetter", "20:3E408248", "Peddler's Request "},
	{"subquest_32._10_targetVid", "18:845C2613", "Choose a merchant "},
	{"subquest_32._110_targetVid", "13:FEEEF7CA", "Go to Ah-Yu "},
	{"subquest_32._120_targetVid", "27:D02B6C2C", "Go to the General Store. "},
	{"subquest_32._130_sayReward", "24:E2564E94", "Materials for the Merchant "},
	{"subquest_32._140_sayReward", "180:7E8D8A6C", "The Peddler needs some materials for a necklace.[ENTER]Get him 100 Molars from the Elite Orc Sorcerer, a[ENTER]Piece of Jewellery from the General Stores[ENTER]Saleswoman and Thread from Ariyoung. "},
	{"subquest_32._150_npcChat", "17:4EE0A113", "I need Thread. "},
	{"subquest_32._160_say", "187:D542BCB2", "Producing Thread is no big deal. But then I can't[ENTER]do my other work. I've mended Ah-Yu's torn[ENTER]clothes today and just wanted to take them to[ENTER]her... "},
	{"subquest_32._170_say", "105:A207857F", "What do you think: You take back Ah-Yu's clothes[ENTER]while I make Thread for you. Agreed? "},
	{"subquest_32._180_say", "32:0CC0B7A0", "Do you want to give up forever? "},
	{"subquest_32._190_say", "94:C18D2FE4", "It is really isn't very far. Why are you still[ENTER]hesitating? Come back here when you are ready. "},
	{"subquest_32._200_say", "96:B9DAD90F", "Oh, I had hoped you'd have time. Then I have to[ENTER]go myself. Farewell! "},
	{"subquest_32._20_npcChat", "28:F2DA3AFB", "About the necklaces... "},
	{"subquest_32._210_say", "142:1E46261D", "Wonderful, thank you very much! Give my regards[ENTER]to Ah-Yu and make sure you don't crush her[ENTER]clothes on the way! I'll wait here for you. "},
	{"subquest_32._230_say", "149:3888FA67", "By the time you come back from the neighbouring[ENTER]village I'll have finished your Thread. You[ENTER]haven't forgotten to take Ah-Yu her clothes, have[ENTER]you? She would resent me for that. "},
	{"subquest_32._240_say", "183:47B60C99", "Is Ah-Yu happy with her Clothes? In that case, it[ENTER]was a pleasure to work that hard for her. Here's[ENTER]your Thread. It's very strong and can be used for[ENTER]a number of things. "},
	{"subquest_32._250_say", "47:30CD384D", "I have already given you Thread. Have you lost it? "},
	{"subquest_32._260_npcChat", "36:97DB1B66", "Ariyoung sends you these clothes. "},
	{"subquest_32._280_say", "221:041B2E3A", "Oh, how nice. That was really quick. You have to[ENTER]cultivate old friendships, don't you? We often[ENTER]help each other out...[ENTER]Thank you that you have brought the clothes.[ENTER]Please give Ariyoung my regards. "},
	{"subquest_32._290_npcChat", "31:08B1211D", "I need a Piece of Jewellery. "},
	{"subquest_32._300_say", "260:CF2A37B1", "Are you looking for a Piece of Jewellery? I can[ENTER]give you one if you help me out a little. At the[ENTER]moment I am working on a remedy for pain, but I am[ENTER]missing one ingredient. For the remedy I need[ENTER]Tiger Livers. They are hard to come by, and I need[ENTER]as many as 10 of them. "},
	{"subquest_32._30_say", "408:6CD44DA4", "It is not easy for us Peddlers during war time.[ENTER]Merchandise is needed everywhere but the demand[ENTER]changes so quickly that I never know whether I[ENTER]have the right thing on offer. Not to mention the[ENTER]long ways through the wilderness where all the[ENTER]monsters are lying in wait for careless walkers.[ENTER]Don't you want to earn a few Yang? I could do[ENTER]with some help. "},
	{"subquest_32._310_say", "284:33F2F200", "I also need certain Medicinal Herbs but you'll[ENTER]also get these from the Tigers. They like to roll[ENTER]in them because they like the smell. I'll give[ENTER]you a Piece of Jewellery for the Herbs and the[ENTER]Tiger Livers. "},
	{"subquest_32._320_say", "36:9C025BCE", "Hunt Tigers or White Tigers. "},
	{"subquest_32._330_say", "30:4BBABCE9", "What do you say? Can we do a deal? "},
	{"subquest_32._340_say", "101:B7347FC8", "Is my task too difficult for you? I can't imagine[ENTER]that! Come and see me again when you have changed[ENTER]your mind. "},
	{"subquest_32._350_say", "109:3D0CDD45", "You come all this way for the Merchant and then[ENTER]give up? As you want...[ENTER]Have a nice day. "},
	{"subquest_32._360_say", "74:ACC245F9", "Very good. That's going to help us both, isn't[ENTER]it? Thank you and good luck! "},
	{"subquest_32._370_npcChat", "32:502751E4", "Do I get my Piece of Jewellery now? "},
	{"subquest_32._380_say", "175:6EC229CA", "Let me have a look... 10 Tiger Livers and the[ENTER]Medicinal Herbs, it is all there. Thank you very[ENTER]much! Here you are, you have earned this Piece of[ENTER]Jewellery. See you! "},
	{"subquest_32._390_qSetTitle", "19:BE99FCD8", "Return to the Peddler "},
	{"subquest_32._400_targetVid", "19:BE99FCD8", "Return to the Peddler "},
	{"subquest_32._40_say", "314:7E2A788A", "At the moment necklaces made of Orc Molars are[ENTER]really in demand. Orc Molars are big and hard and[ENTER]are good for making certain pieces of jewellery.[ENTER]Also soldiers think of Elite Orc Sorcerers'[ENTER]molars as lucky charms. Could you get these[ENTER]Molars for me? 100 Molars should be enough to[ENTER]start with. "},
	{"subquest_32._410_sayReward", "19:BE99FCD8", "Return to the Peddler "},
	{"subquest_32._415_sayReward", "27:AF958A81", "Return to the General Store Saleswoman "},
	{"subquest_32._420_sayReward", "82:9A90068D", "You have finally got all the materials for the[ENTER]necklace. Take them to the Peddler. "},
	{"subquest_32._430_npcChat", "24:8AFACA43", "I have all the materials. "},
	{"subquest_32._440_sayTitle", "12:15B74897", "Peddler: "},
	{"subquest_32._450_say", "294:A8CED9D5", "Did you manage to get all the materials? Let me[ENTER]see... Indeed, it is all here. Thanks to your help[ENTER]I can expand my range of goods, wonderful! As a[ENTER]thank-you I have prepared something special for[ENTER]you. Take a look and pick the one you like best."},
	{"subquest_32._460_sayReward", "44:9EBE5B60", "You have received 1,100,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_32._470_sayReward", "69:BED3A718", "You get a Golden Bracelet, a Golden Necklace and[ENTER]Gold Earrings. "},
	{"subquest_32._480_say", "117:77958C05", "Hmmm, I'm sorry but something is missing. I don't[ENTER]need incomplete deliveries. Will you keep trying? "},
	{"subquest_32._490_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_32._500_say", "126:5D33536A", "Thank you for not giving up so easily.[ENTER]Luck is with those who try! I'll wait here for[ENTER]you. "},
	{"subquest_32._50_say", "305:C373FF60", "I also need a Piece of Jewellery and Thread. One[ENTER]you'll get from the General Store Saleswoman, the[ENTER]other from Ariyoung. It is not so easy to get so[ENTER]many things but selling necklaces is good[ENTER]business and you'll get a good reward for the[ENTER]materials. What do you think? Does that sound[ENTER]interesting? "},
	{"subquest_32._510_say", "163:A63F587C", "The task is too difficult? Well, at least you've[ENTER]tried. I'll let you know if I have an easier task[ENTER]for you one day. Farewell! "},
	{"subquest_32._520_say", "60:F66734EE", "You're going to try again? Thank you. I'll be[ENTER]waiting for you. "},
	{"subquest_32._60_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_32._70_say", "108:193C4E50", "You are busy? I can understand that. But please[ENTER]come back when you have time. "},
	{"subquest_32._80_say", "68:CC19E781", "Oh dear, how am I going to complete all my tasks?[ENTER]See you! "},
	{"subquest_32._90_say", "36:2344BCAA", "Fantastic. I'll wait here for you. "},
	{"subquest_32._95_say", "53:B46FD890", "You have collected all materials for the Saleswoman. "},
	{"subquest_32.letter_tip1", "183:D321D996", "You will get a Piece of Jewellery from the Saleswoman in exchange for bringing her 10 Tiger Livers and one bunch of Medicinal Herbs. You can get both items from White Tigers or ordinary Tigers."},
	{"subquest_32.letter_tip1_done", "46:65E79900", "The Saleswoman gave you a Piece of Jewellery for your help."},
	{"subquest_32.letter_tip2", "102:D5F2903A", "Ariyoung will make Thread for you, but so that she has the time, you must help her and take the Clothes to Ah-Yu."},
	{"subquest_32.letter_tip2_done", "39:D4E34F1C", "You have received the Thread from Ariyoung."},
	{"subquest_32.reward_talk", "123:1FF62D75", "Great choice! Here is your share.[ENTER]May it serve you well![ENTER]Roll up, folks, roll up! Something for everyone! "},
	{"subquest_33._100_sayTitle", "20:2D4B3AE6", "Treasure Map found "},
	{"subquest_33._10_targetVid", "25:DD682ECC", "Go to the bookworm. "},
	{"subquest_33._110_say", "114:8746FF38", "You hunted the animal gods outside the village[ENTER]and found all 4 parts of the Treasure Map.[ENTER]Take them to Soon. "},
	{"subquest_33._120_sayTitle", "28:ADF967F7", "Hunting the animal gods "},
	{"subquest_33._130_say", "140:0C0B0DFD", "Collect all 4 parts of the Treasure Map by[ENTER]hunting the animal gods Lykos, Scrofa, Bera and[ENTER]Tigris. "},
	{"subquest_33._140_sayReward", "29:007AC257", "(Parts of the map found: %s ) "},
	{"subquest_33._150_sendLetter", "13:D3C9C5F5", "The Treasure Map "},
	{"subquest_33._160_sayTitle", "28:1F073230", "Collected all parts "},
	{"subquest_33._170_say", "78:B89373A3", "Return to Soon and tell him you found all the[ENTER]parts of the Treasure Map. "},
	{"subquest_33._175_npcChat", "27:64823140", "I've got all the map parts. "},
	{"subquest_33._180_say", "137:FD3E7FF0", "Oh! Fantastic! All four pieces together... I[ENTER]wouldn't have dreamed of this! Now I need to[ENTER]connect the pieces to get the whole map...[ENTER]right... "},
	{"subquest_33._190_say", "246:DD34F6B6", "Hmm... Strange. The map says that the treasure is[ENTER]hidden at the rock near the Old Man. I can't[ENTER]imagine that that's right. It would have been[ENTER]found by now. What a childish trick to play! Do[ENTER]you want to look anyway, or should I just burn[ENTER]the map? "},
	{"subquest_33._200_select", "10:64C62944", "I'll have a look. "},
	{"subquest_33._20_npcChat", "25:FEC4AFE3", "About the Treasure Map... "},
	{"subquest_33._210_select", "9:9D462B4E", "Burn it. "},
	{"subquest_33._220_say", "40:8FD25E4D", "Are you sure you don't need the map any more? "},
	{"subquest_33._230_say", "197:5CD13F89", "What a pathetic fairytale![ENTER]I'm sorry that I sent you on a search for those[ENTER]map pieces. I'll burn them now so that no one[ENTER]else falls for them. Still, thank you very much.[ENTER]Goodbye. "},
	{"subquest_33._240_say", "110:BB575C78", "Why are you hesitating? You have already[ENTER]collected the pieces of the map. Then you can go[ENTER]and look. Here, take the map! "},
	{"subquest_33._250_say", "128:037EE984", "As you like. I would be really surprised if you[ENTER]really found something but still, I wish you[ENTER]luck! Take the map! "},
	{"subquest_33._260_say", "108:AECE63BE", "The map has been divided into four parts. We need[ENTER]all four parts to put it together again! "},
	{"subquest_33._270_select", "18:4C858DF8", "Try again "},
	{"subquest_33._280_say", "47:3A9262A0", "You give up? Oh well, so be it. Farewell. "},
	{"subquest_33._290_say", "56:BE0BB4A8", "I knew you'd go. I believe in you! "},
	{"subquest_33._300_targetVid", "21:332B43A8", "Rock next to the Old Man "},
	{"subquest_33._30_say", "203:4A63AE0E", "Hey, I found some strange information in some old[ENTER]texts. The texts say that there is a Treasure Map[ENTER]in the village. Do you know the godly animal[ENTER]guards; the God of Dogs, God of Bears, God of[ENTER]Tigers and the God of Pigs outside the city? "},
	{"subquest_33._310_sayTitle", "23:D6188C00", "Looking for the treasure "},
	{"subquest_33._320_say", "145:90398FAB", "Hmm, under the Old Man's rock...[ENTER]No idea. Maybe I should ask the Old Man. Why is[ENTER]he such a long way away? Damn. "},
	{"subquest_33._330_sayTitle", "11:BE7AA048", "Old Man: "},
	{"subquest_33._340_say", "113:70A8B3F3", "What are you looking for? A treasure? Haha,[ENTER]you'll be looking for a long time! Show me the[ENTER]map... Hmmm. I think it's there over there. Good[ENTER]luck, hihi... "},
	{"subquest_33._350_say", "130:21482A2E", "This must be the place. Damn, the ground here is[ENTER]unusually hard. Hmm...[ENTER][ENTER]Hey, I can see a chest! "},
	{"subquest_33._360_sendLetter", "25:C30DA69C", "The treasure really exists! "},
	{"subquest_33._370_sayTitle", "15:4BEE1AD4", "Back to Soon "},
	{"subquest_33._380_say", "168:97E7250E", "You were digging in a place the Map of the Animal[ENTER]Gods showed and really found a Treasure Chest! Go[ENTER]to Soon and tell him about the unexpected[ENTER]outcome. "},
	{"subquest_33._390_npcChat", "17:E18C9CA3", "I have found the treasure! "},
	{"subquest_33._400_say", "269:4644DD32", "Oh! This is a surprise! Let's see... Amazing.[ENTER]This is exactly how the treasure chest was[ENTER]described in the old texts. Now I only have to[ENTER]find out how to open it. But that is not your[ENTER]problem. Thanks! Here, take this as a token of my[ENTER]gratitude! "},
	{"subquest_33._40_say", "272:7A6A66CA", "A ancient fairy tale says that these four godlike[ENTER]monsters divided the map into four parts and[ENTER]protected these territories. I'm not sure if[ENTER]that's right. Could you check that for me? Oh[ENTER]please, this uncertainty is killing me... I'm[ENTER]begging you, please help me! "},
	{"subquest_33._410_sayReward", "44:117087E9", "You receive 1,400,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_33._420_sayReward", "24:4B0DE441", "You have received 25,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_33._430_sayReward", "28:AF45C591", "You have received a Ghost Mask Sallet+1. "},
	{"subquest_33._440_sayReward", "27:F91C0B7E", "You have received a Castle Helmet+1. "},
	{"subquest_33._450_sayReward", "28:77E49DFE", "You have received a Steel Hood+1. "},
	{"subquest_33._460_sayReward", "32:19815658", "You have received a Sunlight Hat+1. "},
	{"subquest_33._470_say", "89:A890FADC", "Well, where is he? Do you want to make fun of[ENTER]me?! You haven't really found him, have you? "},
	{"subquest_33._50_say", "143:F3C51E7F", "You're not interested in old Treasure Maps? You[ENTER]are strange... I'm going to carry on looking for[ENTER]clues in these texts. Come back if you change[ENTER]your mind. "},
	{"subquest_33._60_say", "123:634CF585", "You don't like those kinds of adventures, do you?[ENTER]How am I supposed to get the pieces of the map?[ENTER]Ah well... Farewell "},
	{"subquest_33._70_say", "62:9BC69DBB", "You are a true friend. I believe that you'll find[ENTER]them. "},
	{"subquest_33._80_sendLetter", "14:92FA4C38", "The bookworm's Treasure Map "},
	{"subquest_33._90_targetVid", "25:DD682ECC", "Go to the bookworm "},
	{"subquest_33.kill_mob", "29:62033FF5", "You can still get a part of the map from %s."},
	{"subquest_34._100_say", "164:E262ACDB", "The Captain still has problems to get the Black[ENTER]Wind Gang under control. Kill the Generals of the[ENTER]Black Wind Gang Jak-To, To-Su and Gu-Ryung.[ENTER]Perhaps they are quiet then. "},
	{"subquest_34._10_npcChat", "32:0D58940F", "What is the Black Wind Gang doing? "},
	{"subquest_34._110_say", "19:B1B03182", "The generals are dead! "},
	{"subquest_34._120_select", "20:61DE27A0", "Try again "},
	{"subquest_34._130_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_34._140_say", "71:D9437C2B", "Fighting isn't easy, and winning is even harder.[ENTER]Especially if you're fighting the generals. Try[ENTER]again! "},
	{"subquest_34._150_say", "50:E58A60F2", "Like I said, the Black Wind Gang is a very strong[ENTER]group. Goodbye. "},
	{"subquest_34._160_say", "64:A4B2E486", "You are really brave! I think you can defeat the[ENTER]Black Wind Gang! "},
	{"subquest_34._170_targetVid", "23:6745818D", "Report to the Captain "},
	{"subquest_34._180_say", "82:064FD3A8", "Return to the Captain and inform him that you[ENTER]have killed the generals. "},
	{"subquest_34._185_npcChat", "19:C472470D", "I've killed the Generals! "},
	{"subquest_34._190_say", "234:42BE3540", "Hmm...You defeated the generals. Great. The Black[ENTER]Wind Gang was started to give us all a headache,[ENTER]but thanks to your help we'll be able to defeat[ENTER]them now. Without the generals around, it'll be a[ENTER]piece of cake. Here's a reward for you. I hope to[ENTER]see you again soon! "},
	{"subquest_34._200_sayReward", "44:A7BE5F9C", "You receive 1,000,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_34._20_sayTitle", "8:C329F351", "Captain "},
	{"subquest_34._210_sayReward", "29:6FD4DCE6", "You have received a language ring. "},
	{"subquest_34._30_say", "199:2BD834CE", "Although you defeated the Black Wind Gang, they[ENTER]just don't want to give up. Instead of keeping a[ENTER]low profile, they are behaving like a horde of[ENTER]wild animals. If we want to defeat them, we have[ENTER]to kill the generals of the Black Wind Gang. "},
	{"subquest_34._40_say", "303:21D414C5", "Once the generals are defeated, the other members[ENTER]will go down too. It's going to be hard work, but[ENTER]we need to defeat the Black Wind generals Jak-To,[ENTER]To-Su and Gu-Ryung . If we defeat them, we won't[ENTER]have to worry about the Black Wind Gang any more.[ENTER]OK, so good luck, I'll be praying for your[ENTER]victory. "},
	{"subquest_34._50_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_34._60_say", "93:2DB48E10", "Well, all right. Come back when you're ready.[ENTER]There aren't many people that are as competent as[ENTER]you. "},
	{"subquest_34._70_say", "43:856D3616", "You can't do it...?[ENTER]How are we going to defeat the Black Wind Gang[ENTER]now? "},
	{"subquest_34._80_say", "126:6F7866DB", "I knew I could rely on you! Once the generals are[ENTER]killed, the other members of the Black Wind Gang[ENTER]won't be a problem any more. Good luck! "},
	{"subquest_34._90_sendLetter", "39:E79765E5", "Kill the Black Wind generals "},
	{"subquest_36._100_sayTitle", "23:F004CAE7", "Off to see the Stable Boy "},
	{"subquest_36._110_say", "82:062C05F7", "You have collected 10 bundles of Hay. Take them[ENTER]to the Stable Boy so that he can feed the horses. "},
	{"subquest_36._120_sayTitle", "17:96E42EFA", "Hay for the stables "},
	{"subquest_36._130_say", "167:0252A1A4", "There is a food shortage at the stables. Get 10[ENTER]Bundles of Hay and take them to the Stable Boy[ENTER]before the horses starve! You can get Hay on the[ENTER]hunt. "},
	{"subquest_36._140_npcChat", "20:02880741", "You need Hay? "},
	{"subquest_36._150_say", "189:58755C88", "You came here because Yonah sent you? I have[ENTER]heard so much about you. Oh, all of our horses[ENTER]are going to starve. We need to save them. Help[ENTER]me and get Hay for the horses! "},
	{"subquest_36._160_say", "124:70BBE8E3", "A promise is a promise. Also I might like to ride[ENTER]a horse later. I absolutely have to find some[ENTER]Hay! "},
	{"subquest_36._170_say", "73:AEA3F073", "I'm sorry. I'm looking but it is simply[ENTER]impossible to find any Hay. "},
	{"subquest_36._180_say", "265:515A1D2C", "I know it's not very nice of me to ask you to do[ENTER]my work, but I still hoped you'd do it. Could you[ENTER]try again? I know a very important person in[ENTER]another kingdom. If you help me, I'll ask him if[ENTER]he can do something for you. "},
	{"subquest_36._190_select", "23:3E6FF557", "Try again "},
	{"subquest_36._200_say", "42:7BC650F8", "Of course I'll help you. Let's see what I can do. "},
	{"subquest_36._20_npcChat", "20:FA197C35", "The Stables Are in Trouble "},
	{"subquest_36._210_say", "82:17973AA2", "I don't have enough energy for that. I would like[ENTER]to help you, but I can't. I'm not strong enough. "},
	{"subquest_36._220_npcChat", "20:1698999A", "I have Hay for the horses. "},
	{"subquest_36._230_say", "291:4682D4B2", "Have you got the Hay? Oh, thanks. We didn't have[ENTER]enough food for the horses, so I told Yonah. He[ENTER]is a good friend of mine. I had an idea he would[ENTER]ask around to see whether anybody could help. But[ENTER]I would not have thought it would be sorted out[ENTER]so quickly. Just look how enthusiastically the[ENTER]horses are eating! "},
	{"subquest_36._250_sendLetter", "16:9C143F62", "Return to Yonah "},
	{"subquest_36._260_sayTitle", "16:9C143F62", "Return to Yonah "},
	{"subquest_36._270_say", "101:88DDD5ED", "You took 10 bundles of Hay for the hungry horses[ENTER]to the Stable Boy. Return to Yonah and tell him[ENTER]about your success. "},
	{"subquest_36._280_npcChat", "21:1930612F", "The horses are taken care of! "},
	{"subquest_36._290_say", "159:A95ECF76", "Hello, you're back![ENTER]It was probably a tough job to collect that much[ENTER]Hay. Thanks for not giving up! Here's a small[ENTER]present for you. "},
	{"subquest_36._30_say", "218:08E50DE2", "Hey, I have a question! I know someone else is[ENTER]responsible for the horses, but that person has a[ENTER]big problem... The horses are utterly exhausted[ENTER]by the war. Like all animals, they need to eat[ENTER]something too... "},
	{"subquest_36._40_say", "298:EAC65D04", "There are so many horses, but not enough food. A[ENTER]lot of them are dying. Could you please get some[ENTER]food for the horses so they can regain some of[ENTER]their energy? I don't have anyone else who I[ENTER]could ask. Collect 10 bales of Hay and take them[ENTER]to the Stable Boy. He already knows the problem.[ENTER]Just tell him that I sent you. "},
	{"subquest_36._50_select", "23:FB83023C", "I'm leaving immediately! "},
	{"subquest_36._60_select", "43:6536D518", "No, that is a menial job. "},
	{"subquest_36._70_say", "197:EE94575C", "Nowadays, more and more people want to have a[ENTER]horse. But nobody has thought about the fact[ENTER]we're running out of food for the horses. And now[ENTER]they're starving in the stable. If you change[ENTER]your mind, come back. "},
	{"subquest_36._80_say", "63:02089572", "Oh, those poor horses! They're starving and I[ENTER]can't do anything about it. What should I do... "},
	{"subquest_36._90_say", "184:DBD8789E", "I know you are busy and I really appreciate your[ENTER]help. Horses are really important nowadays.[ENTER]And we really need the Hay. "},
	{"subquest_37._100_say", "200:9A397070", "Yonah is doing his best to produce new porcelain[ENTER]but is not making any progress with his[ENTER]experiments. Go to Uriel the scholar and ask him[ENTER]whether he knows anything about Celadon[ENTER]Porcelain. "},
	{"subquest_37._10_targetVid", "29:A755C353", "Secret of Celadon Porcelain "},
	{"subquest_37._110_npcChat", "36:1A8E8536", "Do you know Celadon Porcelain? "},
	{"subquest_37._130_say", "322:5A4AF672", "Celadon Porcelain? Well, I know a lot about[ENTER]history and science, but I'm not really[ENTER]interested in art. That's why I'm afraid I can't[ENTER]tell you anything about Celadon Porcelain.[ENTER]But maybe Soon knows? He's not very popular, but[ENTER]he reads a lot of books. He might know something[ENTER]about it. "},
	{"subquest_37._140_makequestbutton", "13:A3CBC959", "Go to Soon "},
	{"subquest_37._150_targetVid", "12:60DA046B", "Go to Soon "},
	{"subquest_37._160_say", "180:8E94EAEC", "Unfortunately Uriel does not know anything about[ENTER]Celadon Porcelain. But Soon the bookworm reads a[ENTER]lot in his books. Go see him and ask him whether[ENTER]he knows anything about how it is made. "},
	{"subquest_37._180_say", "311:E9018796", "What do you want? Don't disturb me when I'm[ENTER]reading! Huh? Celadon Porcelain? Of course I know[ENTER]about it. I have read almost a dozen books on[ENTER]that particular topic alone. Why? Well they don't[ENTER]call me the 'bookworm' for nothing, you know! I[ENTER]can understand everything that has been written[ENTER]in books! "},
	{"subquest_37._190_say", "324:ED8D3CBC", "I know the methods of making Celadon Porcelain by[ENTER]heart, but why should I explain them to you? Hmm,[ENTER]wait. I have an idea! I asked a Peddler from the[ENTER]neighbouring village for a book that I need, but I[ENTER]don't have time to pick it up myself. Please bring[ENTER]it to me and I will help you with the porcelain.[ENTER]Off you go! "},
	{"subquest_37._200_makequestbutton", "24:B08FAA32", "Off to the Peddler's "},
	{"subquest_37._210_targetVid", "18:51DCF808", "Go to the Peddler "},
	{"subquest_37._220_say", "167:35FD73D0", "Soon the bookworm knows all about Celadon[ENTER]Porcelain. He does not want to share his[ENTER]knowledge without getting something in return.[ENTER]Head to the Peddler to pick up the Book that Soon[ENTER]has ordered. "},
	{"subquest_37._230_npcChat", "22:0C0F2BA9", "Soon sends me... "},
	{"subquest_37._240_say", "334:58F915A8", "Hey, You came back to help me again? Ahh. You[ENTER]want the book for Soon. I would have been going[ENTER]into the city soon anyway, but he is very[ENTER]impatient and asks others to get it for him. Hmm.[ENTER]Here it is. I don't understand what Soon likes[ENTER]about these stack of papers. It's much more[ENTER]important to quickly earn Yang! "},
	{"subquest_37._250_qSetTitle", "13:113DA1A3", "Returning to Soon "},
	{"subquest_37._260_targetVid", "13:113DA1A3", "Returning to Soon "},
	{"subquest_37._270_say", "128:76C276EA", "You've got Soon's book from the Peddler. Go back[ENTER]to Soon to give him the book so he'll tell you[ENTER]how to make Celadon Porcelain. "},
	{"subquest_37._280_npcChat", "13:5BF6844E", "I have got the book. "},
	{"subquest_37._290_say", "308:45E4173D", "Yay! At last I have my Book! Thank you. There[ENTER]aren't many books left that I haven't read yet...[ENTER]I'll write down everything I know about Celadon[ENTER]Porcelain for you. Follow my instructions and you[ENTER]will produce wonderful porcelain. And now it's[ENTER]time to read the new book. Farewell. "},
	{"subquest_37._300_makequestbutton", "16:9C143F62", "Return to Yonah "},
	{"subquest_37._30_say", "198:FCF69189", "Hmm... This isn't any good. And neither is this[ENTER]one... Oh, hello! Look here: I produce porcelain[ENTER]non-stop, but most of it breaks immediately. I[ENTER]think I need a new type of ground-breaking[ENTER]porcelain... "},
	{"subquest_37._310_targetVid", "27:505D9B28", "Take the notes to Yonah "},
	{"subquest_37._320_say", "96:E0D3F52F", "Soon has kept his promise and written down how to[ENTER]fire Celadon Porcelain. Take it to Yonah. "},
	{"subquest_37._330_say", "261:8031798C", "Ooh!!![ENTER]Everything about the production of Celadon[ENTER]Porcelain is written here. With the help of these[ENTER]notes I'm finally going to go down in history as[ENTER]a master of crafts. Thanks for your help. I'll be[ENTER]able to show you my best ceramic work soon! You[ENTER]can count on me! I'm going to produce such[ENTER]fantastic Celadon Porcelain that it will survive[ENTER]for centuries. "},
	{"subquest_37._340_sayReward", "44:ED60A51E", "You have received 2,500,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_37._350_sayReward", "24:30FCD8EA", "You have received 35,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_37._360_sayReward", "29:66512647", "You have received Jade Shoes+3. "},
	{"subquest_37._40_say", "344:DD9927D7", "I'm going to try a new method. It isn't easy to[ENTER]produce Celadon Porcelain, that's why only very[ENTER]few people know how to do it. I need to know it,[ENTER]though, for the sake of my art! Well.... Hmm,[ENTER]Uriel the scholar might know how to do it! Please[ENTER]go see Uriel and ask him how Celadon Porcelain is[ENTER]made! "},
	{"subquest_37._50_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_37._60_say", "109:3E56FE76", "Hm, I guess you're too busy? Remember to come[ENTER]back if you have some spare time. "},
	{"subquest_37._70_say", "72:A453BC9D", "I understand. Farewell... "},
	{"subquest_37._80_say", "43:B03D4BFD", "Thank you. Uriel will know what to do. See you[ENTER]soon! "},
	{"subquest_37._90_targetVid", "14:92AC36A9", "Let's go to Uriel "},
	{"subquest_38._100_say", "142:7B494D79", "The hunter's Lavishly Decorated Bow, which is a[ENTER]family heirloom, has been stolen from him. Go to[ENTER]Sangsun Dong and get back the Decorated Bow from[ENTER]the thieving monkeys. "},
	{"subquest_38._10_targetVid", "12:C7C5219E", "The Hunter's Treasure "},
	{"subquest_38._110_sendLetter", "25:AE1C67F7", "You found the Decorated Bow! "},
	{"subquest_38._120_targetVid", "23:33A9EF2B", "Go to the hunter Yang-Shin "},
	{"subquest_38._125_say", "57:461041D7", "You have found the Lavishly Decorated Bow of the[ENTER]Hunter. Bring it back to Yang-Shin. "},
	{"subquest_38._130_npcChat", "11:8668644D", "Here's the bow! "},
	{"subquest_38._140_say", "329:00B6D203", "Wow, that's it! My bow, yay! My honour has been[ENTER]restored. Phew. I've been suffering for so long[ENTER]since I lost it... I'm really grateful for your[ENTER]help. It's an honour for me to give you this[ENTER]here. It may not look like much, but it's from[ENTER]the heart so take it. Thanks to you, I can carry[ENTER]on my life in peace! "},
	{"subquest_38._150_sayReward", "44:70D67CBC", "You receive 1,500,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_38._160_sayReward", "24:30FCD8EA", "You have received 35,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_38._170_sayReward", "28:DAC3CACE", "You have received a Bravery Cape. "},
	{"subquest_38._180_say", "71:F793F2A5", "You have found my Bow? But where is it? Have you[ENTER]lost it again? "},
	{"subquest_38._190_select", "19:60064BA7", "I'll keep looking. "},
	{"subquest_38._200_say", "42:F699A1EE", "So be it.[ENTER]Look after yourself. "},
	{"subquest_38._20_say", "235:A5DD042E", "Hey, got a minute? As you can see, I'm a hunter -[ENTER]my family has hunted for generations. Everyone in[ENTER]my family has been a hunter, it's a family with[ENTER]traditions. But I've made a big mistake that will[ENTER]disgrace me in my family's eyes... "},
	{"subquest_38._210_say", "89:9243EF32", "Could you try again? Thank you.[ENTER]With your skills, you should be able to do it. "},
	{"subquest_38._30_say", "209:265B265A", "It is about a Lavishly Decorated Bow which was[ENTER]stolen by monkeys a while ago. I was hunting in[ENTER]the Monkey Dungeon at the time and was only[ENTER]inattentive for a second - they took advantage of[ENTER]the situation and stole it from me. "},
	{"subquest_38._40_say", "272:02E37BC9", "I've never been deep inside the Monkey Dungeon[ENTER]and I don't know what it looks like. I need your[ENTER]help. I've heard from a few people that you're[ENTER]very talented. That's why I'm asking you of all[ENTER]people for this favour. I can't go back to my[ENTER]family without that Bow. "},
	{"subquest_38._60_say", "83:486EF485", "Oh, I need it back as soon as possible...[ENTER]Please come back when you have some time.[ENTER]Farewell. "},
	{"subquest_38._70_say", "52:CDF7BB1A", "Well then...[ENTER]Watch out on your travels. "},
	{"subquest_38._80_say", "97:73523012", "You can find it easily, because it's a richly[ENTER]ornamented bow. I will give you a great reward[ENTER]for it! "},
	{"subquest_38._90_sayTitle", "21:176A7B33", "Look for the Lavishly Decorated Bow "},
	{"subquest_39._100_sayTitle", "15:45CA457B", "Traitor Balso's condition "},
	{"subquest_39._10_targetVid", "28:EA2AD6B3", "Delivery for the Traitor Balso "},
	{"subquest_39._110_say", "119:9F1D132B", "Traitor Balso's health has worsened. Go to[ENTER]Baek-Go and ask him how we can help Balso. "},
	{"subquest_39._120_makequestbutton", "15:2DCB3C11", "Go to Baek-Go "},
	{"subquest_39._130_qSetTitle", "15:2DCB3C11", "Go to Baek-Go "},
	{"subquest_39._140_targetVid", "16:F7B48CFE", "Off to Baek-Go's "},
	{"subquest_39._150_npcChat", "16:ABDDF160", "I have a patient... "},
	{"subquest_39._170_say", "234:AC913E77", "Oh, it's you, how are you? You are treating a[ENTER]sick patient? Tell me what's wrong with him...[ENTER]Hmm... And what medicine has he been taking?[ENTER]What?! No wonder he is getting worse! This[ENTER]medicine is totally unsuitable! "},
	{"subquest_39._180_say", "319:749013AC", "He is lucky to be still alive! It is very[ENTER]dangerous to give a sick person the wrong[ENTER]treatment! But I know what will help him. There[ENTER]is a certain herb that rids the body of poison[ENTER]and will restore his health.[ENTER]However, searching for it is very dangerous. "},
	{"subquest_39._190_say", "270:9AF1FBF7", "As far as I know the herb only grows in Sangsun[ENTER]Dong. But it is always harvested for the Monkey[ENTER]Lord who likes to eat it. You will have to kill[ENTER]him to get it.[ENTER]I can make the right medicine if you bring me the[ENTER]herb. "},
	{"subquest_39._200_select", "20:68884492", "Okay, I'll get it. "},
	{"subquest_39._20_npcChat", "34:F18480DE", "About your medicine... "},
	{"subquest_39._210_select", "22:B2E29B86", "I can't do that. "},
	{"subquest_39._220_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_39._230_select", "4:48F9C4CD", "Yes "},
	{"subquest_39._240_say", "122:0FBC7B25", "Well, maybe later, when you have some spare time.[ENTER]A lot of people are sick, but very few are[ENTER]looking for the cure. "},
	{"subquest_39._250_say", "115:5973103A", "Hmm, that's just the way it is. It's a shame that[ENTER]no one is brave enough. How is all this going to[ENTER]end... "},
	{"subquest_39._260_say", "89:16565BE8", "Oh, thanks. It's going to be hard work. But you[ENTER]will be helping a number of people! "},
	{"subquest_39._270_makequestbutton", "17:29504018", "Herb of the Ape Lord "},
	{"subquest_39._280_targetVid", "17:B2BB03B0", "Go back to Baek-Go "},
	{"subquest_39._290_sayTitle", "32:A3C7285D", "Found herb of the Hard Monkey "},
	{"subquest_39._300_say", "119:E155FB9C", "You have taken the Herb of the Hard Monkey from[ENTER]the Ape Lord. Take it to Baek-Go, so he can make[ENTER]the medicine for Balso. "},
	{"subquest_39._30_say", "197:0362E72A", "Thank you for bringing me that medicine last[ENTER]time. But there is a problem... The medicine has[ENTER]lost its effect. I think it's gone bad.[ENTER]*Cough* - I desperately need treatment. "},
	{"subquest_39._310_sayTitle", "30:D881A90B", "Get the herb from Sangsun Dong "},
	{"subquest_39._320_say", "172:ACADFD91", "Baek-Go can make a medicine for Balso the[ENTER]traitor's disease. He needs the Herb of the Hard[ENTER]Monkey for that. You can get it from the Ape Lord[ENTER]in the Hard Monkey Dungeon. "},
	{"subquest_39._330_npcChat", "25:FD87A334", "Herb of the Hard Monkey... "},
	{"subquest_39._340_say", "241:105101F1", "It seems as if the disease is spreading into an[ENTER]epidemic, but we don't know the cause. However,[ENTER]the academic organisation told us that a cure is[ENTER]possible with Monkey Herbs. What's wrong? Have[ENTER]you already found the herb? "},
	{"subquest_39._350_select", "27:D06E24EB", "Not yet. But soon! "},
	{"subquest_39._360_select", "21:99724FB3", "I can't get hold of the herb. "},
	{"subquest_39._370_say", "149:FEFEAE43", "Do you really want to give up? Hmm, I suppose you[ENTER]can't really do any more, than that. What shall I[ENTER]do? This herb could be a real blessing... "},
	{"subquest_39._380_select", "14:D6B38172", "I can't do it. "},
	{"subquest_39._390_select", "12:53BD4F0D", "I want to help! "},
	{"subquest_39._400_say", "87:CBF71F44", "The monkeys are too strong for me. I can't get to[ENTER]the herb. I'm sorry. "},
	{"subquest_39._40_say", "296:8D97F5C1", "I know that there is a doctor living in the next[ENTER]village. Could you go to him and explain my[ENTER]situation to him so that he can tell you what can[ENTER]be done? As you can see, I can't leave the[ENTER]village in this condition. I'm very grateful that[ENTER]you helped me last time and rest assured that I[ENTER]will reward you this time, too. "},
	{"subquest_39._410_say", "95:91EF0569", "You refuse to help people who are suffering from[ENTER]a mysterious and terrible disease. Get out of my[ENTER]sight! "},
	{"subquest_39._420_say", "120:56BBCD0B", "You are right. Somebody has to get this herb[ENTER]otherwise all these sick people will suffer[ENTER]terribly. I'll take care of this. "},
	{"subquest_39._430_say", "29:D2F2DA98", "Well then. Hurry up! "},
	{"subquest_39._440_say", "187:B4433DBE", "Oh, you managed to get the Herb of Hard Monkeys.[ENTER]Wonderful! I hope it will help us defeat this[ENTER]mysterious disease! Wait a moment, I'll make the[ENTER]medicine right away... "},
	{"subquest_39._460_say", "196:2475DE74", "Here's the medicine. Hurry to the patient and[ENTER]give it to him. Then he should be better soon.[ENTER]Also, please tell him that it is always better to[ENTER]ask a doctor which medicine is the right one. "},
	{"subquest_39._470_makequestbutton", "26:3046F3C2", "Take the medicine to Balso "},
	{"subquest_39._480_targetVid", "21:497D89CA", "You give the medicine to Balso. "},
	{"subquest_39._490_sayTitle", "16:CE0A475A", "Traitor Balso's medicine "},
	{"subquest_39._500_say", "155:D6915869", "Baek-Go has made medicine from the Herb of the[ENTER]Hard Monkey which can cure many rare diseases.[ENTER]Take it to the Traitor Balso in the neighbouring[ENTER]village. "},
	{"subquest_39._50_say", "42:74C67ADE", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_39._510_npcChat", "15:0D94843D", "Here's the medicine. "},
	{"subquest_39._520_say", "235:F3F18E5B", "Are you bringing me the new medicine? There has[ENTER]been some progress in medical research? Sorry for[ENTER]troubling you. I should have asked a doctor for[ENTER]advice right from the start. However, I have to[ENTER]accept that I have to take this medicine now. "},
	{"subquest_39._530_say", "246:95F00FA1", "Thank you for helping me to get out of my[ENTER]miserable condition. I don't have many friends.[ENTER]Here, I know it's not much, but it comes from the[ENTER]heart. Please accept it. If I ever make it, I[ENTER]will never forget you. "},
	{"subquest_39._540_sayReward", "44:4C1F8B67", "You have received 4,000,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_39._550_sayReward", "24:230478E2", "You have received 65,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_39._60_say", "45:9C0B2BCA", "If you know how to help me, we'll meet here again. "},
	{"subquest_39._70_sayTitle", "15:D4F30F16", "Traitor Balso: "},
	{"subquest_39._80_say", "63:EC4C1F40", "Do I have to continue living like this?[ENTER]See you next time. "},
	{"subquest_39._90_say", "27:4B716B2C", "Thank you. Be careful. "},
	{"subquest_40._100_say", "120:10E17D80", "I knew I could count on you! It is a difficult[ENTER]job, but I am sure you'll be able to do it. Good[ENTER]luck! "},
	{"subquest_40._10_targetVid", "17:07D82D6C", "Supporting War Device "},
	{"subquest_40._110_targetVid", "18:C34018F3", "Return to the Captain "},
	{"subquest_40._120_say", "63:EFD10645", "You have all 2,000 Arrowheads.[ENTER]Take them to the Captain. "},
	{"subquest_40._130_say", "163:65A7375B", "Our army is short of arrows. Kill the Plagued[ENTER]Archers on Mount Sohan and collect their[ENTER]Arrowheads for the Captain. 2,000 of them should[ENTER]be enough. "},
	{"subquest_40._140_npcChat", "30:2374955D", "About the Arrowheads... "},
	{"subquest_40._150_say", "272:555DFC41", "These Plagued Archers have a certain disease[ENTER]which has spread across the continent. Not even[ENTER]our doctors can explain it. Arrowheads are still[ENTER]normal at the moment, but they are becoming more[ENTER]and more toxic. "},
	{"subquest_40._160_select", "32:54644BAC", "I'll carry on. "},
	{"subquest_40._170_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_40._180_say", "64:3765478B", "You're afraid of the disease. Calm down and come[ENTER]back later. "},
	{"subquest_40._190_say", "117:7B7C948A", "Are you sure you want to give up? Hmm, maybe this[ENTER]task really is too hard for you. I'll ask someone[ENTER]else. See you! "},
	{"subquest_40._200_say", "71:CDBBEFB2", "I see.[ENTER]You never give up, do you?[ENTER]Let's go. "},
	{"subquest_40._20_say", "207:E4EF0C03", "Attention warriors! As you can see, the number of[ENTER]attacks made by our enemies is increasing every[ENTER]day. We have also received alarming information[ENTER]from Yu-Hwan. To cut a long story short: We don't[ENTER]have enough arrows! "},
	{"subquest_40._210_npcChat", "24:420DDCAB", "Here are 2,000 Arrowheads! "},
	{"subquest_40._220_say", "243:00BEDAC3", "Fantastic work! Now we can prepare for the[ENTER]attack. Now I'm going to give you the order to[ENTER]make some arrows immediately. That was a really[ENTER]good team effort. I hope we can count on you[ENTER]later. "},
	{"subquest_40._230_say", "160:281307D0", "Here is your reward. Next time I have an[ENTER]important job, you'll be the first one I call.[ENTER]All the best and see you soon! "},
	{"subquest_40._30_say", "364:742F6BF5", "Archers are an important strategic factor in[ENTER]warfare. As soon as the enemies are within reach[ENTER]our archers should fire at them. That way we can[ENTER]either chase them away immediately or at least[ENTER]reduce their number. But if there are too many[ENTER]attacks in a short time we are soon out of[ENTER]arrows. "},
	{"subquest_40._40_say", "268:4CDA7586", "That's why we need you! Go to Mount Sohan. There[ENTER]you must kill the Plagued Archers and collect[ENTER]their Arrowheads. These arrowheads are poisoned,[ENTER]which will help us immensely in battle with the[ENTER]enemy. We need 2,000 of them. What do you say? "},
	{"subquest_40._50_select", "11:83490D82", "I accept. "},
	{"subquest_40._60_select", "23:429265E6", "That's hard for me. "},
	{"subquest_40._70_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_40._80_say", "93:DEBCCBA6", "Is it too far to Mount Sohan for you? Think about[ENTER]it. This mission is of great importance. "},
	{"subquest_40._90_say", "116:EC711017", "Hm, you're afraid of Plagued Archers? I suppose I[ENTER]overestimated you. I see there's no more hope for[ENTER]us. "},
	{"subquest_41._015_npcChat", "12:630E2C04", "What are you reading? "},
	{"subquest_41._100_say", "129:6A2CCBC1", "You have collected all 100 Spider Eyes for[ENTER]Octavio's new recipe. You should quickly take[ENTER]them to him. "},
	{"subquest_41._10_targetVid", "23:47C41D37", "Spider Eyes Special "},
	{"subquest_41._110_sayTitle", "21:E47AC982", "Get Spider Eyes "},
	{"subquest_41._120_say", "222:02F6F8AC", "Octavio wants to try out his new recipe called[ENTER]'Spider Eyes special'. To make it he needs 100[ENTER]Spider Eyes from the spiders in the Yongbi[ENTER]desert. "},
	{"subquest_41._130_targetVid", "16:8C6A9D1B", "Return to Octavio "},
	{"subquest_41._140_npcChat", "18:14D7C399", "I have the Spider Eyes. "},
	{"subquest_41._160_say", "144:BB249CE4", "Show me. Exactly one hundred eyes, very good.[ENTER]Well, let's see...[ENTER]Mmhhh, done! Do you also want to try? Don't look[ENTER]so horrified. It's not going to kill you. "},
	{"subquest_41._170_say", "210:A9C0119E", "Hmm, hmm... What an experience! Very nutritious,[ENTER]not too sweet.... incredible taste! I knew it was[ENTER]worth the effort. I could have never done it[ENTER]without you. Thank you very much for your help! "},
	{"subquest_41._180_sayReward", "44:5C8AC08E", "You have received 2,100,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_41._190_say", "127:D8D9F852", "What are you talking about? That are not one[ENTER]hundred eyes, I can tell without counting them![ENTER]Please get some more. "},
	{"subquest_41._200_say", "67:050ADEE8", "I really want to cook this.[ENTER]Never mind, thanks. Take care and look after[ENTER]yourself. "},
	{"subquest_41._20_say", "304:3412C5CE", "Hey, how are you? I'm just reading a cookery book[ENTER]that Soon very kindly gave me. I found a very[ENTER]interesting recipe called 'Spider Eyes special'[ENTER]in it. I've never seen anything like it before![ENTER]Have you? It seems to be special dish from[ENTER]another country. "},
	{"subquest_41._210_say", "78:E7409FBB", "Thank you for not leaving me in the lurch.[ENTER]You're very kind! "},
	{"subquest_41._30_say", "245:300F9413", "I would really like to try this dish but how am I[ENTER]supposed to get hold of the Spider Eyes? I really[ENTER]need your help again! Please get Spider Eyes from[ENTER]the Spiders in the Yongbi Desert. "},
	{"subquest_41._40_say", "185:E8A72589", "Could you do that for me? I would really be very[ENTER]grateful. To try I this recipe I need one hundred[ENTER]eyes for a reasonably sized portion. I'm really[ENTER]excited... "},
	{"subquest_41._50_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_41._60_say", "90:483D10B8", "I really want to make this recipe, so if you feel[ENTER]like doing me a favour, please come visit me. "},
	{"subquest_41._70_say", "51:C91183F4", "Hm, where am I going to get these eyes from?[ENTER]Okay, see you soon. "},
	{"subquest_41._80_say", "88:B215A555", "Thank you. I knew you'd do me this favour. I'll[ENTER]treat you to a really nice meal for doing this. "},
	{"subquest_41._90_sayTitle", "16:8C6A9D1B", "Return to Octavio "},
	{"subquest_42._100_say", "168:71B88B7D", "Sorry to hear that. I hear so many voices of dead[ENTER]people, who just can't rest in peace. We really[ENTER]have to help them. I'll ask someone else.[ENTER]Farewell. "},
	{"subquest_42._10_targetVid", "30:730A307E", "Let the Dead Rest "},
	{"subquest_42._110_say", "97:24FBAE27", "How brave you are. I'm sure the brave young[ENTER]warriors will soon get to Nirvana with your help. "},
	{"subquest_42._120_say", "238:0999DD25", "These terrible wars keep killing more and more[ENTER]young men. They are soliders that are fighting[ENTER]for their families and for their country at the[ENTER]front-line. But after their death, some of them[ENTER]just cannot pass into Nirvana. And so they remain[ENTER]in this world. "},
	{"subquest_42._130_say", "234:B5F6CA0C", "I heard that the Proud Dark Colonel in the Hwang[ENTER]Temple apparently has a Temple Scarf and a Temple[ENTER]Doctrine. Please help me and my comrades to calm[ENTER]down those who died for their country. "},
	{"subquest_42._140_sayTitle", "27:28C35214", "Return to the Dragon Force Teacher "},
	{"subquest_42._150_say", "176:3A0CECE7", "You have found a Temple Scarf and a Temple[ENTER]Doctrine. Take them to the Dragon Force Teacher,[ENTER]so that the Shamans can begin their ritual to[ENTER]calm down the dead. "},
	{"subquest_42._160_sayTitle", "45:F077B8E8", "Get the Temple Scarf and the Temple Doctrine "},
	{"subquest_42._170_say", "293:F02BFDC4", "The Shamans need a Temple Scarf and a Temple[ENTER]Doctrine for a ceremony to calm down the spirits[ENTER]of the soldiers who died during the war.[ENTER]Kill the Proud Dark Colonel in the Hwang Temple[ENTER]to get the ritual objects. "},
	{"subquest_42._180_npcChat", "21:B4D2FC24", "I have got the Scarf and the Doctrine. "},
	{"subquest_42._190_say", "187:E216DA1F", "That was great. Now we can calm down the dead[ENTER]soldiers. They did their best. Now, they can rest[ENTER]in peace. Let me give you a reward for this noble[ENTER]deed. "},
	{"subquest_42._200_sayReward", "44:6E399262", "You have received 1,700,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_42._20_sayTitle", "23:37CCCBE9", "Dragon Force Teacher: "},
	{"subquest_42._210_sayReward", "24:366D3250", "You have received 30,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_42._220_sayReward", "23:092309EC", "You have received 3 Diamonds. "},
	{"subquest_42._230_say", "187:E216DA1F", "That was great. Now we can calm down the dead[ENTER]soldiers. They did their best. Now, they can rest[ENTER]in peace. Let me give you a reward for this noble[ENTER]deed. "},
	{"subquest_42._30_say", "238:0999DD25", "These terrible wars keep killing more and more[ENTER]young men. They are soliders that are fighting[ENTER]for their families and for their country at the[ENTER]front-line. But after their death, some of them[ENTER]just cannot pass into Nirvana. And so they remain[ENTER]in this world. "},
	{"subquest_42._40_say", "362:C9B051B5", "It is said they became resistant to death during[ENTER]the war. They think that they still have to[ENTER]defend their country.[ENTER]Our Shamans want to hold a ceremony to calm down[ENTER]the spirits. In order to do that, we need a[ENTER]special Temple Scarf and a Temple Doctrine, which[ENTER]are hard to find nowadays. Could you get both of[ENTER]those things for us? "},
	{"subquest_42._50_say", "234:B5F6CA0C", "I heard that the Proud Dark Colonel in the Hwang[ENTER]Temple apparently has a Temple Scarf and a Temple[ENTER]Doctrine. Please help me and my comrades to calm[ENTER]down those who died for their country. "},
	{"subquest_42._60_select", "11:71224F1F", "I'll help you. "},
	{"subquest_42._70_select", "32:336AA2D3", "I'm sorry, I'm too scared. "},
	{"subquest_42._80_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_42._90_say", "113:780949EE", "Help us to calm down their souls, so that they[ENTER]can rest in peace. I'll wait for your help here. "},
	{"subquest_44._100_sendLetter", "18:EB517446", "The Spider with the Bell "},
	{"subquest_44._10_targetVid", "6:8D071931", "The spider "},
	{"subquest_44._110_say", "187:A0C5ABE8", "Taurean said he hung a bell on a spider.[ENTER]Now Yu-Rang wants to know whether her friend was[ENTER]really that brave as he said.[ENTER]Look for the spider in the desert. "},
	{"subquest_44._120_say", "141:E203420D", "Have you found the spider with the bell yet?[ENTER]No? You'll probably never find it. Taurean is a[ENTER]coward and just wanted to show off! "},
	{"subquest_44._130_sendLetter", "22:902CA0DE", "Can't find a bell "},
	{"subquest_44._140_sayTitle", "31:0E4C763C", "A lot of spiders, no bell "},
	{"subquest_44._150_say", "206:2AED43EA", "You have killed some spiders but have not found a[ENTER]bell. You can't look forever. It would probably[ENTER]be best to go to Taurean and ask him for the[ENTER]truth. "},
	{"subquest_44._160_sendLetter", "15:ABB2BBCA", "Go to Taurean "},
	{"subquest_44._170_targetVid", "25:EDA9700E", "Ask Taurean about the bell "},
	{"subquest_44._180_say", "145:5212F061", "It is unlikely that Taurean was brave enough to[ENTER]put a bell on a spider. It's best to ask him[ENTER]directly for the truth. "},
	{"subquest_44._190_npcChat", "40:56CF9F47", "Tell me, about your bet with Yu-Rang... "},
	{"subquest_44._200_say", "165:D5537565", "You know about the bet with Yu-Rang? She doesn't[ENTER]believe me and thinks that I didn't do it. She[ENTER]thinks that I would drop dead if I only looked at[ENTER]a giant spider. "},
	{"subquest_44._20_npcChat", "22:C993E64D", "A spider with a bell...? "},
	{"subquest_44._210_say", "136:33866D44", "To be honest... She is right. I wasn't brave[ENTER]enough to tell her because I am too proud. "},
	{"subquest_44._220_say", "217:B731B2DD", "But you look very strong! Can't you put the bell[ENTER]on a baby spider for me and then say it was me?[ENTER]Please, please. Otherwise they will make fun of[ENTER]me for the rest of my life. "},
	{"subquest_44._230_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_44._240_say", "158:49FDB0C7", "You don't want to do it? But you are not going to[ENTER]tell Yu-Rang the truth?[ENTER]Please, help me. Come back when you have time for[ENTER]me! "},
	{"subquest_44._250_say", "77:AB2C7848", "Now Yu-Rang will never talk to me again![ENTER]Or just laugh at me... "},
	{"subquest_44._260_say", "69:31A7A767", "Ah, I was right. I knew you were as nice as you[ENTER]look. Thank you for your help. Good luck! "},
	{"subquest_44._270_sendLetter", "16:44277336", "Go back to Yu-Rang "},
	{"subquest_44._280_say", "57:5C96C0CE", "Go back to Yu-Rang and tell her about Taurean's[ENTER]lie. "},
	{"subquest_44._290_npcChat", "31:FF489F32", "Yu-Rang is very disappointed in you. "},
	{"subquest_44._300_say", "259:98C75DF2", "You have told her?![ENTER]I can understand that she doesn't want to be my[ENTER]friend any more. But it makes me very sad. I hope[ENTER]that I can change her mind some time. Perhaps I[ENTER]can think of something nice for her... "},
	{"subquest_44._30_say", "338:52E40DF6", "Hey, could you do me a favour? My friend Taurean[ENTER]is very angry because I called him a coward.[ENTER]He says that he's actually very brave, and he[ENTER]made a bet with me that he would manage to hang a[ENTER]bell on a Baby Spider. He also told me that he[ENTER]had already done it, but I just can't believe[ENTER]him. "},
	{"subquest_44._310_npcChat", "16:76FFFEDB", "Taurean lied. "},
	{"subquest_44._320_say", "266:8C177B92", "His story isn't true?[ENTER]Hmm, I'm not really angry that he lied. Nobody[ENTER]likes to lose face.[ENTER]But he should have at least tried to make it[ENTER]true! I don't want to be friends with such a[ENTER]coward any more. "},
	{"subquest_44._330_sayReward", "42:5F67E0F5", "Yu-Rang will give you a reward for your honesty. "},
	{"subquest_44._340_sayReward", "24:366D3250", "You have received 30,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_44._350_sayReward", "42:B50C2C42", "You have received 350,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_44._360_sendLetter", "19:8839FAB9", "Bell for the spider "},
	{"subquest_44._370_say", "127:7BEDCFE3", "Go to the desert to the Baby Spiders and try to[ENTER]hang Taurean's bell on one of them. "},
	{"subquest_44._380_npcChat", "13:71F18E31", "About the bell... "},
	{"subquest_44._390_say", "126:FE89AC14", "You haven't hung the bell onto the spider yet?[ENTER]Then please do it soon. And make sure Yu-Rang[ENTER]doesn't catch you! "},
	{"subquest_44._400_sendLetter", "10:449EFB29", "Done! "},
	{"subquest_44._40_say", "285:8DBA5C22", "I know I should trust my friend, but I want to[ENTER]know if he really did it. It's too dangerous for[ENTER]me in the desert. You look very strong. You could[ENTER]easily do it. Could you go and have a look for[ENTER]me? "},
	{"subquest_44._410_say", "177:A3B1941B", "It was very difficult, but you finally managed to[ENTER]hang the Bell on a Baby Spider. Now go back to[ENTER]Yu-Rang and tell her that it was Taurean who hung[ENTER]the Bell on the Spider. "},
	{"subquest_44._420_npcChat", "37:635BBE58", "The bell has been hung on the spider. "},
	{"subquest_44._430_say", "102:974EBA1D", "You have done it? That's fantastic![ENTER]Then quickly tell Yu-Rang so that she finally[ENTER]believes me! "},
	{"subquest_44._440_npcChat", "20:CAAAB611", "Taurean has told the truth. "},
	{"subquest_44._450_say", "241:162F9176", "Come again? You have found a spider with a bell?[ENTER]Then Taurean really did it. I would have not[ENTER]thought it possible. Perhaps he will be a real[ENTER]man one day after all. Thank you for checking[ENTER]that for me. Here's a reward for your help. "},
	{"subquest_44._460_sendLetter", "16:871A90BE", "Back to Taurean "},
	{"subquest_44._470_targetVid", "16:871A90BE", "Back to Taurean "},
	{"subquest_44._480_say", "145:C11010A9", "You have told Yu-Rang that her friend has really[ENTER]hung a bell on a Baby Spider.[ENTER]Now go back to Tauran and tell him about the[ENTER]successful deception. "},
	{"subquest_44._490_npcChat", "19:3E6354FE", "Yu-Rang believes you. "},
	{"subquest_44._500_say", "150:71E23BB0", "Thanks a lot. Now Yu-Rang won't despise me. We[ENTER]have to keep this a secret forever. Promise? See[ENTER]you soon! "},
	{"subquest_44._50_select", "9:23A53143", "Accept "},
	{"subquest_44._510_sayReward", "45:33B35B85", "Taurean gives you a reward for helping him lie: "},
	{"subquest_44._520_sayReward", "42:79BE0EC0", "You have received 700,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_44._60_say", "42:74C67ADE", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_44._70_say", "62:EBB0233D", "Why not? Are you afraid?[ENTER]Visit me when you have changed your mind. "},
	{"subquest_44._80_say", "132:5F4F2A14", "Aaah, are you afraid?[ENTER]But you are much taller and stronger than me![ENTER]Haha, you are a coward! Then I have to ask[ENTER]someone else. "},
	{"subquest_44._90_say", "123:D5D6D3E3", "The spiders live in the desert. You are strong. I[ENTER]am sure you can do it. Good luck! "},
	{"subquest_45._100_sayTitle", "27:4B19DF27", "Get the secret information "},
	{"subquest_45._10_npcChat", "31:5C90207F", "The thing about the Temple of Darkness "},
	{"subquest_45._110_say", "110:1EE0B90F", "You have the Temple Doctrine, the Temple Scarf[ENTER]and the Translation of the Cursebook. Take them[ENTER]to Soon. "},
	{"subquest_45._120_say", "387:D97DB9B3", "If you help Soon, the bookworm, he can continue[ENTER]his research about the Temple of Darkness.[ENTER]However, he can only do this if he gets hold of[ENTER]the following things: The Temple Doctrine, the[ENTER]Temple Scarf and the Translation of the[ENTER]Cursebook. Get hold of these things and take them[ENTER]to Soon. You'll find them in the Hwang Temple in[ENTER]the Valley of Seungryong. "},
	{"subquest_45._130_npcChat", "29:119E366F", "The things from the Temple of Darkness "},
	{"subquest_45._140_say", "272:6CF93169", "Ah, you've got them! Thank you very much.[ENTER]About the secret people in the temple, well, it's[ENTER]pretty simple: they're dangerous people.[ENTER]But you've learned that the hard way.[ENTER]They also seem to be serving the evil gods. I[ENTER]don't know any details, but I presume that they[ENTER]are planning something really bad. "},
	{"subquest_45._150_say", "237:945B9959", "Now that I have some of their holy things I will[ENTER]hopefully find out more. Best to start with the[ENTER]Temple Doctrine.[ENTER]Let's see... Hmm... Aha...[ENTER]Why are you still hanging around here? Haven't[ENTER]you got anything to do? "},
	{"subquest_45._160_sayReward", "44:95E89438", "You have received 7,000,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_45._170_sayReward", "24:43D70A9A", "You have received 70,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_45._180_sayReward", "27:45401705", "You have received the Book of the Leader. "},
	{"subquest_45._190_say", "92:A8C4BDB4", "What? You don't have them? Don't slack off if you[ENTER]accept a request! Hurry up! "},
	{"subquest_45._200_select", "17:7D246859", "Try again "},
	{"subquest_45._20_say", "293:4513FBF1", "There is something going on inside the Temple of[ENTER]Darkness. I think there are dangerous creatures[ENTER]in there, studying ancient magic.[ENTER]The secrets of the Temple of Darkness are hard to[ENTER]understand, even for me. But I am sure that the[ENTER]agenda of these people is more than dubious. I[ENTER]have to find out more about them! "},
	{"subquest_45._210_say", "75:04638EB9", "Then I have to ask a stronger hero. Farewell. "},
	{"subquest_45._220_say", "62:2CA8180B", "Thank you.[ENTER]I hope you are more successful this time! "},
	{"subquest_45._30_say", "318:3213B0E0", "I need more facts for my studies. I think the[ENTER]Temple Doctrine, the Temple Scarf and the[ENTER]Translation of the Cursebook might come in quite[ENTER]useful. Can you bring me these things. I would be[ENTER]very grateful![ENTER]And don't hang about too long, I need them soon! "},
	{"subquest_45._40_select", "5:145B8B5E", "I'll go straight away. "},
	{"subquest_45._50_say", "22:B4A37BBB", "Do you want to accept the mission? "},
	{"subquest_45._60_say", "137:4E895BA8", "I'm asking for your help! If you are too busy[ENTER]now, come back later. Perhaps you'll have more[ENTER]time then. I'll be waiting for you. "},
	{"subquest_45._70_say", "132:F3792447", "I asked for your help and you just turn your back[ENTER]on me?[ENTER]Oh, well, we don't need you anyway... now push[ENTER]off! "},
	{"subquest_45._80_say", "8:BD09E4C4", "Thanks! "},
	{"subquest_45._90_makequestbutton", "20:9939611A", "Temple of Darkness "},
	{"subquest_46._100_say", "163:C4417944", "Good luck on your search! I can only manufacture[ENTER]the right porcelain if I have the right[ENTER]materials. My customers are waiting really[ENTER]impatiently! "},
	{"subquest_46._10_targetVid", "29:A755C353", "Secret of Celadon Porcelain "},
	{"subquest_46._110_makequestbutton", "21:DDC7C4D9", "Celadon Porcelain "},
	{"subquest_46._120_qSetTitle", "21:DDC7C4D9", "Celadon Porcelain "},
	{"subquest_46._130_say", "103:0819B5D8", "You have all the material that Yonah needs to[ENTER]make the Celadon Porcelain. Take it to Yonah! "},
	{"subquest_46._140_say", "338:116CB213", "Yonah can make Celadon Porcelain, but he needs the[ENTER]following materials: Desert Sand from the Desert[ENTER]Outlaws in the Yongbi Desert, 50x Crystal Ore from[ENTER]a Vein of Crystal Ore and Monkey Blood from Strong[ENTER]Stone Apes or Strong Gold Apes. Get all the[ENTER]ingredients and deliver them to Yonah. "},
	{"subquest_46._150_targetVid", "29:A755C353", "Secret of Celadon Porcelain "},
	{"subquest_46._160_npcChat", "29:5FCB9B2B", "I've obtained all materials. "},
	{"subquest_46._170_say", "316:FDEEDB20", "You've done it! Thank you! With the right[ENTER]technique and the right materials I can produce[ENTER]wonderful pale green porcelain. The income that I[ENTER]get from it will be a blessing for my purse.[ENTER]Here, take this reward. You have earned it. I'm[ENTER]going to start producing porcelain immediately! "},
	{"subquest_46._180_sayReward", "44:62167122", "You have received 3,000,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_46._190_sayReward", "24:366D3250", "You have received 30,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_46._20_say", "418:BBEC3723", "Hello adventurer! Didn't you bring me Soon's[ENTER]notes how to make Celadon Porcelain recently? I[ENTER]have a problem... Although I know the technique I[ENTER]don't seem to manage to manufacture genuine[ENTER]Celadon Porcelain.[ENTER]It's probably because I used my regular[ENTER]ingredients instead of the material written down[ENTER]in the notes which is difficult to get. "},
	{"subquest_46._30_say", "394:B1F9EA4A", "I need special Desert Sand for the clay, 50 pieces[ENTER]of Crystal Ore and Monkey Blood. If you mix these[ENTER]ingredients and add them to the Clay, it becomes[ENTER]very hard when fired. The glaze then takes on the[ENTER]typical pale green celadon tint that resembles[ENTER]jade. This colour is very popular with customers[ENTER]and I need to sell more as soon as possible! "},
	{"subquest_46._40_say", "284:99E2DC36", "You get the Desert Sand from the Desert Outlaws,[ENTER]you can get the Crystal Ore from crystal mines[ENTER]and to get the Monkey Blood, you will have to[ENTER]kill monkeys in the Sangsun Dong. Can you get[ENTER]these materials for me? I know, it won't be easy[ENTER]but I will reward you generously. "},
	{"subquest_46._50_select", "9:23A53143", "Accept "},
	{"subquest_46._60_select", "7:2568ABFA", "Refuse "},
	{"subquest_46._70_say", "42:74C67ADE", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_46._80_say", "46:36E0F99F", "If you are too busy now, come back later. "},
	{"subquest_46._90_say", "132:5C1C48B9", "You're giving up? Really? Then I guess I'll have[ENTER]to look for everything myself. I really need this[ENTER]porcelain. Good bye and good luck. "},
	{"subquest_47._100_select", "16:E4B67CF5", "Ah! That's it. "},
	{"subquest_47._10_answer", "23:42F5C95B", "Enemies sighted on horizon "},
	{"subquest_47._10_targetVid", "8:C329F351", "Captain "},
	{"subquest_47._110_select", "10:2AEFBB20", "I don't know. "},
	{"subquest_47._115_select", "25:2DA7C2DB", "Show me again. "},
	{"subquest_47._120_say", "42:74C67ADE", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_47._130_say", "69:681CFC05", "Think about it again, and come back later. But[ENTER]don't tell anybody about it! "},
	{"subquest_47._140_say", "93:86EF2773", "Oh dear! Is it that hard? You were my last[ENTER]hope... Who is going to decipher it now? "},
	{"subquest_47._150_say", "118:30C7B120", "Okay, but be quick. Otherwise somebody is going[ENTER]to get suspicious...[ENTER][ENTER]SEE MINE[ENTER]THE DIGS[ENTER]NO[ENTER]HR IN ZOO "},
	{"subquest_47._160_say", "28:DD2A675E", "And? What does this code mean? "},
	{"subquest_47._170_say", "283:BB1AE227", "Yes, you are right! Now I also understand. I'm[ENTER]proud of you. You are one of our best soldiers![ENTER]This sentence is an agreed password. It means[ENTER]that Yu-Hwan has exposed the enemy spies and we[ENTER]have take action against them. I will give out[ENTER]the necessary orders immediately. "},
	{"subquest_47._180_sayReward", "44:E0FFCEDF", "You receive 1,300,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_47._190_say", "77:06954279", "Why are you so quiet? Don't you know? "},
	{"subquest_47._200_select", "35:561BAC6A", "I have to think about it again. "},
	{"subquest_47._20_answer", "23:42F5C95B", "Enemies sighted on horizon "},
	{"subquest_47._20_npcChat", "37:456821E7", "About the secret code... "},
	{"subquest_47._210_select", "13:E1E54D89", "I give up. "},
	{"subquest_47._220_say", "93:86EF2773", "Oh dear! Is it that hard? You were my last[ENTER]hope... Who is going to decipher it now? "},
	{"subquest_47._230_say", "23:B5B0131E", "So, what does it mean? "},
	{"subquest_47._240_say", "283:BB1AE227", "Yes, you are right! Now I also understand. I'm[ENTER]proud of you. You are one of our best soldiers![ENTER]This sentence is an agreed password. It means[ENTER]that Yu-Hwan has exposed the enemy spies and we[ENTER]have take action against them. I will give out[ENTER]the necessary orders immediately. "},
	{"subquest_47._250_sayReward", "44:9CABBAF1", "You have received 2,300,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_47._260_say", "94:51AC619B", "You'll find out. Come back when you are ready! "},
	{"subquest_47._270_say", "117:DA777362", "Hmm, that doesn't mean anything to me. What did[ENTER]he mean by that. I don't think that is right.[ENTER]Think again. "},
	{"subquest_47._280_select", "19:C33ABBC5", "I'll try it again. "},
	{"subquest_47._290_select", "13:E1E54D89", "I give up. "},
	{"subquest_47._300_say", "31:4B8B04B4", "So? What does the message mean? "},
	{"subquest_47._301_answer_correct", "23:42F5C95B", "Enemies sighted on horizon "},
	{"subquest_47._302_answer_wrong", "26:F0AA266B", "Friendlies sighted on horizon "},
	{"subquest_47._303_answer_wrong", "22:BECF6A58", "Enemy sighted on horizon "},
	{"subquest_47._304_answer_wrong", "19:668CD2AA", "The truth makes enemies "},
	{"subquest_47._305_answer_dontknow", "9:7E640CA4", "No idea "},
	{"subquest_47._30_say", "277:90E65C4E", "ATTENTION![ENTER]Ah, it's you. It's great that you're here![ENTER]I have received some information from Yu-Hwan.[ENTER]She has written it in secret writing as usual. It[ENTER]takes me ages to decipher it. And it has to be[ENTER]dealt with quickly. Last time you managed to do[ENTER]it quite easily. Please, would you help me again? "},
	{"subquest_47._310_say", "283:BB1AE227", "Yes, you are right! Now I also understand. I'm[ENTER]proud of you. You are one of our best soldiers![ENTER]This sentence is an agreed password. It means[ENTER]that Yu-Hwan has exposed the enemy spies and we[ENTER]have take action against them. I will give out[ENTER]the necessary orders immediately. "},
	{"subquest_47._320_sayReward", "24:BF788F3D", "You have received 20,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_47._330_say", "94:51AC619B", "You'll find out. Come back when you are ready! "},
	{"subquest_47._40_say", "42:74C67ADE", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_47._50_say", "81:51DCE7EA", "But you managed to do it last time. Why are you[ENTER]hesitating now? Think about it again. "},
	{"subquest_47._60_say", "101:E1229734", "I know what you mean.[ENTER]You don't want to work with us any more, right?[ENTER]That's a pity. There aren't many brave warriors. "},
	{"subquest_47._70_say", "91:72B916E2", "Oh! You're my saviour! Look, this is the code.[ENTER]Have a close look! "},
	{"subquest_47._80_say", "81:A1B293A7", "SEE MINE[ENTER]THE DIGS[ENTER]NO[ENTER]HR IN ZOO[ENTER][ENTER]Can you decipher that? "},
	{"subquest_47._90_say", "32:A31AA2E5", "So, how is it going? "},
	{"subquest_48._100_sayTitle", "15:F0F4D0EB", "Finding the spy "},
	{"subquest_48._10_npcChat", "15:C1EB7F53", "Find the Spy "},
	{"subquest_48._110_say", "235:8A9F2730", "One of the spies lives as a fisherman in the[ENTER]village Pyungmo in the Jinno kingdom. Try getting[ENTER]in contact with him discreetly and take his[ENTER]report to the Captain. "},
	{"subquest_48._120_say", "237:7521EA17", "One of the spies lives as a fisherman in the[ENTER]village Yongan in the Shinsoo kingdom. Try[ENTER]getting in contact with him discreetly and take[ENTER]his report to the Captain. "},
	{"subquest_48._130_say", "234:1E00C1EB", "One of the spies lives as a fisherman in the[ENTER]village Joan in the Chunjo kingdom. Try getting[ENTER]in contact with him discreetly and take his[ENTER]report to the Captain. "},
	{"subquest_48._140_npcChat", "14:A8E26C54", "What are you doing? "},
	{"subquest_48._150_say", "164:67B89C9A", "Pssh, be quiet! You're scaring away all the fish.[ENTER]Why are you here anyway? You're so loud and[ENTER]clumsy; you can't be here for fishing. "},
	{"subquest_48._160_say", "225:C26BDEB2", "Ah, I understand. I have been expecting you for a[ENTER]while; you are late. It wasn't easy to get this[ENTER]information without being caught. You have to[ENTER]understand that the enemy is everywhere, and all[ENTER]he is doing is waiting for you to accidentally[ENTER]blow your cover. "},
	{"subquest_48._170_say", "134:DEB2A317", "Now we shouldn't hang around here too long![ENTER]After all, we don't want someone to discover us.[ENTER]Here are the documents. Now set off immediately[ENTER]and take them directly to the Captain. "},
	{"subquest_48._180_say", "78:AFD0420E", "One moment, please! I have something for you.[ENTER]A little present. Now be on your way. "},
	{"subquest_48._190_sayReward", "75:4145A4F0", "You are curious and open the package to see what[ENTER]the spy has given you. "},
	{"subquest_48._200_say", "89:16CDE858", "Great! Grilled Rudd! The spy obviously really[ENTER]does know something about fishing. "},
	{"subquest_48._20_say", "316:A8A886FB", "Relax, soldier![ENTER]Since all our neighbouring countries are enemies,[ENTER]it is important to have friends there who go[ENTER]undercover and help us gather information, so[ENTER]that we can prepare for any potential attacks. It[ENTER]is extremely important that the cover of these[ENTER]spies is never blown. "},
	{"subquest_48._210_sayReward", "36:3E1796A1", "You have received 3 Grilled Rudds. "},
	{"subquest_48._220_sendLetter", "18:C34018F3", "Return to the Captain "},
	{"subquest_48._230_targetVid", "8:C329F351", "The Captain "},
	{"subquest_48._240_say", "223:19E95E35", "The dangerous journey to Pyungmoo in the Jinno[ENTER]kingdom was successful: You have received the[ENTER]report from the spy who is disguised as a[ENTER]fisherman.[ENTER]Now go back to your kingdom and quickly take that[ENTER]information to the Captain. "},
	{"subquest_48._250_say", "223:4968323F", "The dangerous journey to Yongan in the Shinsoo[ENTER]kingdom was successful: You have received the[ENTER]report from the spy who is disguised as a[ENTER]fisherman.[ENTER]Now go back to your kingdom and quickly take that[ENTER]information to the Captain. "},
	{"subquest_48._260_say", "220:E44C70A9", "The dangerous journey to Joan in the Chunjo[ENTER]kingdom was successful: You have received the[ENTER]report from the spy who is disguised as a[ENTER]fisherman.[ENTER]Now go back to your kingdom and quickly take that[ENTER]information to the Captain. "},
	{"subquest_48._270_npcChat", "16:BF5E8632", "The mission was successful! "},
	{"subquest_48._280_say", "229:E8068668", "Are these the documents? Great! Thanks. Now that[ENTER]we know about the plans of our enemies we can[ENTER]prepare accordingly to protect ourselves. You[ENTER]have done the kingdom a great service! "},
	{"subquest_48._290_sayReward", "44:3B325877", "You have received 5,500,000 experience points. "},
	{"subquest_48._300_sayReward", "24:4A64FA46", "You have received 50,000 Yang. "},
	{"subquest_48._30_say", "253:7DF9129F", "Surely, you know Yu-Hwan the musician, don't you?[ENTER]He's also a spy and works for us. One spy alone[ENTER]doesn't help though, so we have several all over[ENTER]the world. One of them is in the first village[ENTER]pretending to be a fisherman. "},
	{"subquest_48._40_say", "279:495E8121", "Since I can't get into direct contact with him[ENTER]without blowing his cover, I'm in need of some[ENTER]help from fearless soldiers. Yes, I mean you![ENTER]Would you please go to this Fisherman and get me[ENTER]his latest report.[ENTER]It is vitally important for the safety of our[ENTER]kingdom! "},
	{"subquest_48._50_say", "34:6B3074E9", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_48._60_say", "147:0A97B6A4", "You want to prepare yourself first? Okay, then[ENTER]come back later. I'll be waiting for you. But[ENTER]please hurry up; I need this report! "},
	{"subquest_48._70_say", "200:B4C95FD4", "What's wrong with you? Last time, you did[ENTER]fantastic work for us! And now you just want to[ENTER]abandon your country? But there's nothing I can[ENTER]do about it. Farewell. "},
	{"subquest_48._80_say", "86:AFEAF7D8", "I knew I could rely on you. Good luck and be[ENTER]careful! "},
	{"subquest_48._90_makequestbutton", "25:07B03D92", "Meet the spy "},
	{"subquest_49._100_sayTitle", "18:AFF56E6E", "What is Bingsu? "},
	{"subquest_49._110_say", "153:92D39834", "Taurean has had a row with Harang because he[ENTER]doesn't believe her that you can make ice cream[ENTER]in the summer. Go to Harang and ask her what she[ENTER]knows about Bingsu. "},
	{"subquest_49._120_qSetTitle", "14:85D484E4", "Ask Harang "},
	{"subquest_49._130_targetVid", "14:85D484E4", "Ask Harang "},
	{"subquest_49._140_npcChat", "18:AFF56E6E", "What is Bingsu? "},
	{"subquest_49._150_say", "411:9FDDBBA9", "That Taurean also pretends he knows everything.[ENTER]He doesn't even know Bingsu! How can you not know[ENTER]about something so delicious?[ENTER]You don't know what Bingsu is either?? Well you'd[ENTER]best go to Octavio in the neighbouring village.[ENTER]He's a famous chef and knows lots of good[ENTER]recipes. He made me Bingsu once... mmmmh.[ENTER]He will prove to you that I'm right! "},
	{"subquest_49._160_makequestbutton", "15:0B2C07AC", "Let's go see Octavio "},
	{"subquest_49._170_say", "156:4C9125E5", "Taurean absolutely wants to know what Bingsu is.[ENTER]Go to the restaurant owner Octavio. I'm sure he[ENTER]can help you. "},
	{"subquest_49._180_npcChat", "24:800759C4", "Do you know what Bingsu is? "},
	{"subquest_49._190_say", "246:5F313343", "Bingsu? Of course I know what that is. Every good[ENTER]cook knows how to make Bingsu! To start with, you[ENTER]need finely crushed ice. Then you add sugar,[ENTER]thinly sliced rice cake and fresh fruit for[ENTER]decoration. "},
	{"subquest_49._200_say", "328:073C2941", "Why do you ask? Because Taurean and Harang are[ENTER]arguing? That's nothing new. But Harang is right.[ENTER]Bingsu is an especially popular food in hot[ENTER]summers. Taurean is a good boy actually, evn if[ENTER]he is sometimes a little petty. If you get the[ENTER]ingredients I could make Bingsu for him. "},
	{"subquest_49._210_say", "134:E4E69DBE", "I would like to give Taurean a treat and give him[ENTER]Bingsu. What do you think? Can you go get Ice[ENTER]from Mount Sohan? "},
	{"subquest_49._220_say", "42:74C67ADE", "Do you want to quit this quest? "},
	{"subquest_49._230_say", "126:5A50F4D8", "Don't you like ice cream? Or have you eaten too[ENTER]much already? It's for Taurean so please think[ENTER]about it again. "},
	{"subquest_49._240_say", "60:975ADF6D", "Pity. Taurean is going to be very disappointed.[ENTER]See you. "},
	{"subquest_49._250_say", "132:C9EE06E1", "Very good. I need Chunks of Ice from the[ENTER]Enchanted Ice on Mount Sohan. Bring me 50 Chunks[ENTER]of Ice. Then I can make some yummy Bingsu. "},
	{"subquest_49._260_targetVid", "15:0B2C07AC", "Go to Octavio "},
	{"subquest_49._270_say", "75:2C5A5BC9", "%s[ENTER]You have got the Chunks of Ice for Taurean's[ENTER]Bingsu.[ENTER]Take them to Octavio. "},
	{"subquest_49._275_say", "21:D2D75A69", "Got the Chunks of Ice "},
	{"subquest_49._280_say", "181:82044181", "Octavio has agreed to make Bingsu for Taurean but[ENTER]needs ice to do that. Kill Enchanted Ice on Mount[ENTER]Sohan and collect 50 Chunks of Ice. Take them to[ENTER]Octavio afterwards. "},
	{"subquest_49._285_say", "18:5CA8EDE6", "Looking for ice "},
	{"subquest_49._290_npcChat", "35:63A31CC2", "Here, I have brought Chunks of Ice. "},
	{"subquest_49._300_say", "247:811D0740", "Ah, very good! The most difficult part of making[ENTER]Bingsu is done. Now I just have to put a little[ENTER]sugar... and some fruit... Here you are! An ice[ENTER]cream for Taurean. Take it now, then he will soon[ENTER]forget his anger. "},
	{"subquest_49._310_say", "137:71CBCA8B", "Sorry, but that's not enough. You have to get[ENTER]more otherwise it will be just a tiny portion! "},
	{"subquest_49._320_select", "20:61DE27A0", "Try again "},
	{"subquest_49._330_say", "113:3BBD081D", "I know it's a long way and the monsters are[ENTER]strong. If it is too difficult for you then there[ENTER]is nothing we can do about it. See you. "},
	{"subquest_49._340_say", "118:BA3697FF", "Try again. With your courage and stamina you can[ENTER]make it! "},
	{"subquest_49._360_say", "128:C4F268CE", "It is done: Octavio has made Bingsu out of the[ENTER]ice from Mount Sohan. Quickly go back to Taurean[ENTER]before it melts. "},
	{"subquest_49._370_npcChat", "15:A9AC4BF1", "Here's the Bingsu! "},
	{"subquest_49._380_say", "188:7AA906A4", "That's Bingsu? That tastes really good. Nice and[ENTER]cool. I've never tasted anything like it before,[ENTER]thanks! So Harang is right. I know have to[ENTER]apologize to her... "},
	{"subquest_49._40_say", "185:456A63E1", "Today I had an argument with Harang. I could[ENTER]just...[ENTER]She claims there is a very tasty dish made from[ENTER]finely crushed ice. It's called Bingsu. "},
	{"subquest_49._410_sayReward", "23:8CC36299", "You have received a Scroll of War. "},
	{"subquest_49._420_say", "28:BDF8F82C", "Did you remember to bring me some Bingsu? "},
	{"subquest_49._430_say", "88:DC98A02E", "Oh dear, I completely forgot about that! Hmm,[ENTER]shall I keep trying? Or should I rather leave it? "},
	{"subquest_49._440_select", "18:2DFCAF3D", "Yes, I will continue. "},
	{"subquest_49._450_select", "13:E1E54D89", "I give up. "},
	{"subquest_49._460_say", "34:0FBEA04D", "I can't do it, I'm sorry. "},
	{"subquest_49._50_say", "252:65B94C1A", "Something like that is usually only possible in[ENTER]winter, when it's very cold. But she keeps[ENTER]insisting that it can be done. Could you find out[ENTER]whether Bingsu can be made in summer too? If such[ENTER]a thing exists at all... "},
	{"subquest_49._60_say", "119:4B244092", "I'm sure this Bingsu is delicious! Are you sure[ENTER]that you will never help me to make it? "},
	{"subquest_49._70_say", "60:47F72C96", "If you want to do it later, please let me know. "},
	{"subquest_49._80_say", "175:DE2F1E68", "I'd really love to try Bingsu...[ENTER]But you are right. Harang probably only wants to[ENTER]show off and Bingsu doesn't exist! Goodbye. "},
	{"subquest_49._90_say", "136:7EC197A8", "Thanks for your help. Let me know whether you'll[ENTER]find something out. Then I can give this Harang a[ENTER]piece of my mind! "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._100_sayReward", "84:CD0DA21B", "You do not have enough rank points for training. "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._10_answer", "7:E641B7AB", "train "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._10_sayTitle", "36:07F96720", "Skill training of the grand masters "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._110_sayReward", "32:FE3DDC2A", " Required rank points: %d -> %d"},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._120_sayReward", "214:3A3C9EB2", "Your rank point level is in the negative region.[ENTER]This means that you have to spend twice as many[ENTER]rank points to improve your grand master skills[ENTER]as someone who has points in the positive region. "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._130_sayReward", "26:F40EE82C", " Required rank points: %d"},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._140_sayReward", "72:2AC713F9", "If you train now, your rank points will drop into[ENTER]the negative area. "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._150_sayReward", "10:4D545491", "Confirm! "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._160_say", "204:3522A1CF", "If you try to increase a grand master skill now,[ENTER]your rank points may fall below zero, as you do[ENTER]not have many points left at the moment. Do you[ENTER]really want to increase this skill? "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._170_sayReward", "7:E641B7AB", "train "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._180_say", "49:D225CCC0", "If you don't want to train, press 'ENTER'. "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._190_sayReward", "12:C9C70BFC", "Successful! "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._200_say", "23:24B0C8C9", "Congratulations! You did it. "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._20_say", "40:94E33490", "You haven't taken part in any training yet. "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._210_say", "46:50EE18C6", "%s is now at the Perfect Master level. "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._220_say", "113:65CFBCB5", "This means that you have reached a perfect level[ENTER]for this skill and can't improve it any more. "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._230_say", "41:77D1377A", "Congratulations! You did it. Thanks to the skill[ENTER]training of the grand masters, "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._240_say", "27:370CAEB1", "%s went up to level %s. "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._250_sayReward", "29:D9AD320E", "You have successfully raised your level! "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._260_sayReward", "26:70D4D69B", "You have used up %s rank points. "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._270_sayReward", "15:4CBF447F", "Training has failed! "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._280_say", "37:AAFCC627", "You couldn't improve your skills. "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._290_sayReward", "62:AEC5CBAB", "You have lost some rank points and used up the[ENTER]Soul Stone. "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._30_say", "97:08337146", "Since you have read the Exorcism Scroll, you can[ENTER]continue training without having to take a break. "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._40_say", "122:090E0529", "When your training is done, you have to rest for[ENTER]half a day. Try again later or use an Exorcism[ENTER]Scroll. "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._50_say", "114:0C27D59C", "None of your skills are well-trained enough to[ENTER]try and achieve the status of grand master in one[ENTER]of them. "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._60_say", "50:E7F8466E", "Please choose a skill in which you would like to[ENTER]achieve the status of a grand master. "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._70_chat", "26:C3D72287", "Current rank points: %s "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._75_chat", "25:CDA97F12", "Necessary rank points:  "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._80_stringFormat", "25:5CA11266", "%s grand master skill training "},
	{"training_grandmaster_skill._90_say", "118:209D97A3", "The grand master training uses up rank points. So[ENTER]it's possible that your level might drop into a[ENTER]negative point value. "},
	{"training_mount._01_say", "177:B073BFB5", "I'm sorry, but you do not have the necessary[ENTER]riding experience to improve your mount. You at[ENTER]least need to have the Battle Horse License. "},
	{"training_mount._02_say", "177:BA8470AC", "Sorry, but without the correct documents there[ENTER]isn't anything I can do for you. Don't try to[ENTER]pull one on me again, or I'll make you pay for[ENTER]it. "},
	{"training_mount._03_say", "235:3A3D068C", "Where is your Mount Seal? I can't improve any[ENTER]mounts without this seal. Check behind the[ENTER]spinning coin.[ENTER]You can find a certificate there that you can[ENTER]swap for a Mount Seal. "},
	{"training_mount._04_say", "33:0D86DE48", "I want to ride a new mount! "},
	{"training_mount._05_say", "89:131C9200", "Hey! You're still riding a horse?! Really? You[ENTER]know we can tame wild animals these days right? "},
	{"training_mount._06_say", "309:55AEFB5C", "To train tamed wild animals for battle, you[ENTER]should definitely have a good riding proficiency.[ENTER]On top of that, you will also need the following[ENTER]items: the Scroll of Evolution, to improve your[ENTER]mount to a wild mount and the Scroll of Mutation,[ENTER]to make it into a valiant mount. "},
	{"training_mount._07_say", "133:2165E717", "If you have any questions, you can always visit[ENTER]me again. I'll help you as much as I can. "},
	{"training_mount._08_say", "34:77BC2B93", "I want to improve my mount! "},
	{"training_mount._09_say", "123:ED78F941", "So you want to improve your mount? Do you know[ENTER]how it works? OK, I'll explain it to you. "},
	{"training_mount._10_say", "317:71F0144B", "To improve your mount to a wild mount you need to[ENTER]go on the hunt for the Scroll of Evolution. Find[ENTER]the Scroll of Mutation so that you can train the[ENTER]wild creature to become a valiant mount. They say[ENTER]that they are hidden in a faraway land populated[ENTER]with dangerous giants! "},
	{"training_mount._11_say", "99:2069C169", "Bring me these scrolls and I will improve your[ENTER]mount. You don't happen to have them on you[ENTER]already? "},
	{"training_mount._12_say", "40:EA731962", "Yes, I want to improve my mount! "},
	{"training_mount._13_say", "16:5255EEF4", "No, not right now. "},
	{"training_mount._14_say", "230:3D12F664", "Ah, you have on of the scrolls with you. Which[ENTER]one is it then? The Scroll of Evolution will let[ENTER]you train an inexperienced young animal for[ENTER]battle. The Scroll of Mutation you can improve it[ENTER]to become a valiant mount. "},
	{"training_mount._15_2_say", "23:08A120E5", "I've got the Scroll of Mutation. "},
	{"training_mount._15_say", "24:E465F665", "I've got the Scroll of Evolution. "},
	{"training_mount._16_say", "28:3A6B3567", "I don't have any scrolls on me. "},
	{"training_mount._17_say", "280:E4830BFB", "Ah, look - the Scroll of Evolution! OK, let me[ENTER]take a look at your Mount Seal. Some people have[ENTER]been trying to get me to accept fakes! I'll check[ENTER]its authenticity first. Pass it here. (Drag the[ENTER]seal onto the Stable Boy.) "},
	{"training_mount._18_say", "256:13D683BC", "The Scroll of Mutation! Up till now I'd only[ENTER]heard stories. I've never actually held one in my[ENTER]hands. Show me your Mount Seal then. I will[ENTER]exchange it for a more powerful one, once I've[ENTER]checked its authenticity. (Drag the seal onto the[ENTER]Stable Boy.) "},
	{"training_mount._19_say", "105:E3B97C64", "As soon as you have found one of the scrolls,[ENTER]return to me. I'll then be able to exchange your[ENTER]old Mount Seal for a more powerful one. "},
	{"training_mount._20_say", "255:DA7AA01A", "Your Mount Seal has definitely seen better days.[ENTER]Hang on, I'll exchange it for a new one. Please,[ENTER]take it. Now you can summon your wild mount.[ENTER]Return to me if you happen to discover the Scroll[ENTER]of Mutation. I'll use it to make you an even[ENTER]stronger Mount Seal. "},
	{"training_mount._21_say", "181:26B59393", "That is the Mount Seal that you got from me a[ENTER]while back. It's already pretty worn. Give it[ENTER]back to me and I'll create you a Mount Seal that[ENTER]is even more powerful! "},
	{"training_mount._22_say", "114:231BA00F", "This seal allows you to summon your transformed[ENTER]mount. Its value is priceless so take good care[ENTER]of it! "},
	{"training_mount._23_say", "34:662C010D", "Can I use horse skills? "},
	{"training_mount._24_say", "155:79428549", "You want to use some horse skills? You're pretty[ENTER]demanding! Although I too dream of them... Very[ENTER]well. To learn them you need to follow a few[ENTER]rules. "},
	{"training_mount._25_say", "266:0F10B5CF", "First things first, you need to master riding,[ENTER]otherwise you'll be putting yourself in serious[ENTER]danger. On top of that, your mount needs to be[ENTER]battle-ready, as it is only then ready to make[ENTER]use of horse skills. "},
	{"training_mount._26_say", "152:687ED9F7", "Is your mount ready to learn horse skills? I[ENTER]won't be able to allow the training to proceed if[ENTER]it isn't. What do you want to do? "},
	{"training_mount._27_say", "109:97BA5781", "I understand. I will now assess your strength and[ENTER]riding proficiency. Please wait a moment. "},
	{"training_mount._28_say", "204:CD132DF6", "Hmm... strong backbone, sound riding proficiency[ENTER]and your mount is extremely keen on battle. You[ENTER]can use horse skills. "},
	{"training_mount._29_say", "191:1179144C", "Now your mount can use horse skills. However, if[ENTER]you get a new mount, it will also have to learn[ENTER]the skills. In that instance, just come back to[ENTER]me. "},
	{"training_mount._30_say", "169:37D2D340", "Come on, I already told you that it is dangerous[ENTER]if you are unable to ride. Return to me when you[ENTER]know how. "},
	{"training_mount._31_say", "134:4DBD54B9", "I'm afraid your mount is not quite ready yet.[ENTER]Return to me when it shows more desire for battle. "},
	{"training_mount._32_say", "120:29642D30", "Could you perhaps climb down from your mount[ENTER]while we are talking? I have a stiff neck and it[ENTER]is pretty tiring, having to keep looking up at[ENTER]you the entire time. "},
	{"training_mount._33_say", "279:CE08F2E9", "You do not have the appropriate riding licence to[ENTER]improve your mount. You need to at least have the[ENTER]Battle Horse Licence to train a wild mount. To[ENTER]tame a valiant mount, you need to have the[ENTER]Military Horse Licence. "},
	{"training_mount._34_say", "293:92969119", "I see that you have a Power Snack. This valuable[ENTER]medicinal herb will provide your Power Mount with[ENTER]pure energy - it will extend its lifespan by a[ENTER]number of days. What should I do? Would you like[ENTER]me to extend the lifespan of your mount, or do[ENTER]you want to improve it? "},
	{"training_mount._35_select_1", "9:3287C122", "Extend "},
	{"training_mount._35_select_2", "7:6BF99C80", "Improve "},
	{"training_mount._36_select_1", "6:A7FC5DD0", "7 days "},
	{"training_mount._36_select_2", "7:C945BAE0", "15 days "},
	{"training_mount._36_select_3", "7:3A7BBF3E", "30 days "},
	{"training_mount._36_select_4", "25:AE7D04E0", "Scroll of Mutation + 200k Yang "},
	{"training_mount._37_say", "161:7D995DF9", "Unfortunately you do not have the necessary Power[ENTER]Snack for the requested duration. But I'm sure[ENTER]you'll find it in the section behind the spinning[ENTER]coin! "},
	{"training_mount._38_say", "482:F3BFAA72", "The Scroll of Mutation contains great power! It[ENTER]can extend the lifespan of your Valiant Mount by[ENTER]up to four days. An attempt will cost you 200,000[ENTER]Yang. Your mount will have to be exhausted and[ENTER]have less than a day's worth of lie remaining for[ENTER]the attempt though. Of course, a little luck also[ENTER]forms part of the process! Should the extension[ENTER]fail, I'd recommend feeding it a Power Snack.[ENTER]They can be found behind the spinning coin. "},
	{"training_mount._39_say", "152:759FAC75", "Your Power Mount is still too strong. The Scroll[ENTER]of Mutation will have no effect here. Come back[ENTER]when it has less than a day left to live. "},
	{"training_mount._40_say", "93:B2DA0386", "Unfortunately I cannot help you. Either you are[ENTER]not carrying the Scroll of Mutation, or you[ENTER]possess less than 200,000 Yang. "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._100_say", "93:6AC62E17", "Your attempt to produce the scroll failed because[ENTER]you didn't have all the materials. "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._10_npcChat", "24:7684AECE", "Manufacture the Scroll of War "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._110_npcChat", "25:B9202BA8", "Producing Dragon Scroll "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._120_say", "238:D3E1C02A", "A Dragon Scroll increases your rate of success[ENTER]when improving an item. Even if it fails, the[ENTER]item's level will only be reduced by one. This is[ENTER]a mysterious item that can be seen as a type of[ENTER]upgraded Blessing Scroll. "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._130_say", "48:ADC1460E", "To make it, you need Magic Iron Ore. "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._140_sayItem", "15:9D43794F", "Magic Iron Ore "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._150_say", "50:E6C675BC", "To produce this, you need a Blessing Scroll. "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._160_say", "158:72938667", "Do you have all the necessary items?[ENTER]Do you want to produce a Dragon Scroll? To[ENTER]produce a Dragon Scroll, you need a Blessing[ENTER]Scroll and Magic Iron Ore. "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._170_say", "166:DE42A412", "You produced a Dragon Scroll! It really is a lot[ENTER]easier to produce a Dragon Scroll if you use[ENTER]Magic Iron Ore. I like that! "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._180_say", "93:6AC62E17", "Your attempt to produce the scroll failed because[ENTER]you didn't have all the materials. "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._190_npcChat", "34:77BE6C66", "Produce a Blacksmith' Handbook "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._200_say", "379:2156AB7D", "Have you heard of the stone called Stone of the[ENTER]Blacksmith? Apparently it's a stone made from the[ENTER]blood and sweat of a blacksmith. If you bring me[ENTER]the Stone of the Blacksmith and a Blessing[ENTER]Scroll, I will make a handbook for you that has[ENTER]been passed on in my family for generations. It[ENTER]has the similar functions to the Dragon Scroll,[ENTER]but the rate of success is higher. "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._20_say", "137:4E6F5361", "These mysterious Scrolls of War improve +0 to +3[ENTER]items and have a 100% success rate. However, they[ENTER]don't work on items with +4 or above. "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._210_say", "48:239916E9", "To produce this, you need a Stone of the[ENTER]Blacksmith. "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._220_sayItem", "14:A2376353", "Stone of the Blacksmith "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._230_say", "64:9443225B", "To produce it, you need a Blessing Scroll. "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._240_say", "125:AE3D7037", "Do you have all the necessary items? So, do you[ENTER]want me to make the handbook passed on by my[ENTER]family for generations? "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._250_say", "141:A9C434DF", "I have produced a Blacksmith's Handbook for you![ENTER]Now have the ancient knowledge of an entire[ENTER]blacksmith dynasty. Use it wisely! Ha, ha, ha! "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._260_sayItem", "21:8950A6FA", "Blacksmith' Handbook "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._270_say", "117:3184D58E", "I can't produce the Blacksmith' Handbook because[ENTER]you don't have the necessary materials. "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._30_say", "60:5291E425", "To produce this, you will need Magic Copper Ore. "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._40_sayItem", "21:AA0CE759", "Magic Copper Ore "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._50_say", "51:0266F76D", "You will additionally need a Blessing Scroll. "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._60_sayItem", "22:4CCA51C8", "Blessing Scroll "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._70_say", "209:AF0F8609", "Have you got all the necessary items? You still[ENTER]need another 200,000 Yang. If you have a Blessing[ENTER]Scroll, some Magic Copper Ore and 200,000 Yang[ENTER]you can produce a Scroll of War. Do you want to[ENTER]produce a scroll? "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._80_say", "139:8CBF5CFC", "You produced the scroll successfully! It really[ENTER]is a lot easier to produce a Scroll of War if you[ENTER]have Magic Copper Ore! I like that! Ha, ha, ha! "},
	{"upgrade_refine_scroll._90_sayItem", "11:C20900A0", "Scroll of War "},
	{"warehouse._100_say", "233:B924A8F0", "Welcome! Do you know what Gold Bars are for? If[ENTER]you carry around Yang, it's like saying: Please[ENTER]kill me now![ENTER]That's why I swap people's Yang for Gold Bars and[ENTER]store these for them. "},
	{"warehouse._10_npcChat", "33:9CC2B59C", "I want to use the Storeroom. "},
	{"warehouse._110_say", "249:157B11E9", "Ok, so I ask for a little more than the Gold Bar[ENTER]is worth. But such a service is still fair, isn't[ENTER]it? There's no reason to feel like you've been[ENTER]ripped off. As you know, it's very dangerous out[ENTER]there. "},
	{"warehouse._120_npcChat", "25:861E75D4", "Open Item Shop Storeroom "},
	{"warehouse._130_say", "193:C4EA02A6", "The mines are all drained. It's hard to find gold[ENTER]or silver. As long as no new lode is found, there[ENTER]will be no more new gold or silver. "},
	{"warehouse._140_say", "233:2DB1604A", "Welcome! You want to see your item shop[ENTER]storeroom? Why have you come to see me then? Just[ENTER]look in your inventory, there's a direct entrance[ENTER]there. "},
	{"warehouse._150_say", "140:A949BBC4", "Enter the item shop storeroom any time you like[ENTER]by clicking on this symbol. Providing you haven't[ENTER]changed it, the password is 000000. "},
	{"warehouse._20_sayTitle", "9:AD74B78E", "Storekeeper: "},
	{"warehouse._30_say", "216:FAC243AE", "Do you want to use the Storeroom?[ENTER]You will however, have to pay Yang to use the[ENTER]Storeroom. I'm in a good mood today so you can[ENTER]use it for just 500 Yang. So - come on, that's[ENTER]cheap, isn't it? "},
	{"warehouse._40_say", "67:EC9999BD", "What? Not enough Yang?[ENTER]Come back when you have enough. "},
	{"warehouse._50_say", "154:34FEB93E", "Your Storeroom is open now.[ENTER]If you want to use it, just talk to me.[ENTER]The password for your Storeroom is: "},
	{"warehouse._70_say", "183:576388F9", "You should change it for security reasons.[ENTER][ENTER]You might think that 45 slots are not enough. Who[ENTER]knows, maybe once we get to know each other[ENTER]better, I will give you more space. Hehe! "},
	{"warehouse._80_say", "86:778E3D9E", "Well, I'm not forcing anybody. If you don't feel[ENTER]like it come back later. "},
	{"warehouse._90_npcChat", "15:86BBA89F", "Open Storeroom "},
}
