	{"black_steel_crafting.craft_chat", "29:E33E69D9", "Black Armour Crafting"},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_pre_start.chat", "9:4E675CB4", "A Favour"},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_pre_start.talk1", "173:F565275F", "I am impressed by how far you have come. I have seen many who fell much sooner, but there is something special about you. A potential one does not often see."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_pre_start.talk2", "251:E908C738", "Although your road has been full of challenges, you now stand on the threshold of true power. And I... can help you with that. You see, for a small favour I can offer you something special - armour forged from Black Steel. Armour that will make you all but invincible."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_pre_start.talk3", "368:901E7E8F", "Before you can receive this mighty armour, you must obtain three exceptional items. Each of them carries an ancient energy within it. The first is the Craftsmen's Chronicle, an ancient book held by a certain Armorsmith. He is in the Demon Tower, on the sixth floor. It is a place full of dangers, but he has what you need."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_pre_start.talk4", "276:9833E09A", "The second item is just as hard to obtain - the Red Forest Root. You will have to reach the very heart of that cursed place, deep in the Red Forest. There, where darkness merges with nature, grows a root that draws its power from the ancient blood spilled on that land."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_pre_start.talk5", "391:737F64B0", "Hardest of all to obtain will be the Flame of the Damned. You will not find this fire on the surface of this world. You must descend into Hell, where you will meet beings of dark power - the Flaming Executioner and the Infernal Soul Devourer. Each of them carries a fragment of hellish power, imprisoned in a petrified flame. Getting it will not be easy, but I know that you are capable of it."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.blacksmith_chat", "21:9C50B608", "Craftsmen's Chronicle"},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.blacksmith_pc_talk1", "73:57853290", "I am looking for the Craftsmen's Chronicle. I was told that you have it."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.blacksmith_pc_talk2", "48:F7708714", "Min-Sun of the Silent Pass sent me for it."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.blacksmith_talk1", "83:D7C7B8CE", "I don't often see daredevils here who make it all the way to this floor. What brings you here?"},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.blacksmith_talk2", "103:EB7FD99E", "The Chronicle? That is not something one simply hands over to anyone who asks for it. How do you know about this book?"},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.blacksmith_talk3", "50:00C0CF21", "Min-Sun, you say? Are you really working with her?"},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.blacksmith_talk4", "219:F18D879D", "Listen, I know that you are here in search of power, but Min-Sun... she is not who she seems to be. Whatever she does always has a hidden purpose. People who worked with her often ended up far worse off than they started."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.blacksmith_talk5", "297:6D02D7C7", "Min-Sun has her own plans, and those who help her often do not know what they are getting into. Her favours may cost you dearly. I will hand you the Chronicle, but know one thing - beware of her. This book is powerful, but the knowledge you draw from it may prove just as dangerous as your enemies."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.blacksmith_talk6", "196:1C37080C", "If Min-Sun really needs this book, then something bigger is going on. Remember my words when you go back to her. Not everyone who offers help has your best interests at heart."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.blacksmith_talk7", "119:BF02C867", "If you want my advice, take this Book to Uriel. If anyone is going to help you, it certainly won't be Min-Sun."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.blacksmith_talk8", "186:13916A15", "Don't go straight to Min-Sun. Before you get involved, talk to Uriel. This armour could be a great power for you... or a curse, if you do not know what you are dealing with."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.info", "306:DC3F365A", "Min-Sun will help me create mighty armour of Black Steel, but first I must obtain three items: the Craftsmen's Chronicle from the Demon Tower Armorsmith, the Root from deep in the Red Forest, and the Flame of the Damned, which is won from powerful beings in Hell - the Flaming Executioner and the Infernal Soul Devourer."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.info_done", "94:D5479EE3", "Time to return to Min-Sun and see whether what she promised me will really bring me strength..."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.info_get_item", "23:853AA309", "You have obtained %s."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.letter", "21:644054AD", "A Favour for Min-Sun"},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.red_forest_awake_mob", "25:F6D577B8", "Who wakes the Forest Guardian?", "b"},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.reward_chat", "25:C272B537", "I have all the items."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.reward_talk1", "110:6BF6D08F", "I see you have returned. And most importantly - you have brought what I asked you for. Now you will receive something special."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.reward_talk2", "272:BB7EFA3D", "Black Steel is powerful, but working it takes precision and the right materials. Now that you have helped me, in return you may come back to me whenever you are ready, and I will help you craft the armour. But remember - every choice, every decision has its consequences."},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.uriel_chat", "18:B1746221", "Tell me about Min-Sun"},
	{"black_steel_crafting.state_progress.uriel_talk1", "156:D7A1F06E", "Are you mad?![ENTER]I need that book. You have no idea what you are doing. Now that you have the Chronicle, go and get the rest of the items I asked you for."},
	{"check_trans_ticket.low_lvl_premium", "58:101ABC75", "Entry without a Passage Ticket is only possible from level %d."},
	{"collect_quest.wait_delay", "64:560704AA", "The Biologist still needs %s to analyse the previous item."},
	{"crafting.fail", "40:E39EF57D", "Crafting the item failed."},
	{"crafting.no_materials", "29:F8F5C300", "You do not have the required materials."},
	{"crafting.npc.bum.chat", "8:97521451", "Lockpicks"},
	{"crafting.npc.bum.talk1", "190:1536FCA2", "Heh... I see you have an eye for business. You know, I used to be in this trade myself... chests, treasures, quick hands - those were the days. Now I prefer a quieter life... but old habits die hard, heh."},
	{"crafting.npc.bum.talk2", "161:27EF688D", "Listen... I have lockpicks, and you have crafting materials. Iron, wood, leather - what do you need them for when something better is waiting in the chests? Let's trade, everybody wins."},
	{"crafting.npc.bum.talk3", "121:F9BE1668", "But remember one thing... if anyone starts asking, we never met. And now... hic!... I will pour myself a little more sake."},
	{"crafting.npc.chef.talk1", "164:6B04E1AE", "Welcome, gourmet! If you have the ingredients, I can turn them into a culinary masterpiece. I will prepare a dish that will not only nourish your body but also delight your senses."},
	{"crafting.npc.halfdemon.talk1", "301:2E873653", "Greetings, brave one. My skills are as mysterious as my origins. Here you will find the power that lies in the magical ingredients you have brought. As a Sura, a being on the border between worlds, I am able to uncover their hidden potential. Hand me these artefacts, and I will combine them into an item of extraordinary power."},
	{"crafting.npc_chat", "11:AAF2D60E", "Crafting"},
	{"crafting.npc_chat_arrow", "19:1F303D68", "Arrow Crafting "},
	{"crafting.open_delay", "46:1A2D6687", "Wait a moment before opening the window again."},
	{"crafting.recipe_delay", "46:0261DFC7", "Wait another %s before the next training."},
	{"crafting.recipe_known", "32:A476C419", "You understand this recipe perfectly."},
	{"crafting.recipe_learn_fail", "46:80C184C9", "Recipe training failed."},
	{"crafting.recipe_learn_success", "29:DC14FF0A", "Recipe training successful."},
	{"crafting.recipe_low_lvl", "69:E5E3A1A1", "You must be at least level %d to learn this recipe."},
	{"crafting.result", "44:68F3C802", "Of %d crafts, %d were successful."},
	{"crafting.success", "32:4AA1EF47", "Item crafted successfully."},
	{"deviltower_zone.chat_shop", "61:0021A3B9", "Remember that the price of the key changes every day at 5:00."},
	{"deviltower_zone.chest_no_key", "22:4D82518E", "The chest was empty..."},
	{"deviltower_zone.current_limit", "37:E052C207", "You can enter %d more times today."},
	{"deviltower_zone.current_limit_premium", "54:A0278BA1", "You can enter %d more times today (using a key)."},
	{"deviltower_zone.enter_premium_info", "45:2DE7C368", "The key will be taken when you enter the Tower."},
	{"deviltower_zone.limit_full", "86:983D785B", "You cannot enter the Demon Tower any more today. Come back tomorrow (it resets every day at 5:00)."},
	{"deviltower_zone.limit_info1", "274:5EB99D43", "By order of the Emperor, entry to the Demon Tower is restricted - you cannot come and go as you please. The higher your level, the higher your entry limit. An entry is used up if your character tries to upgrade an item at the Blacksmith or goes any further."},
	{"deviltower_zone.limit_info2", "49:31345ECB", "The limit is reset every day at 5:00."},
	{"deviltower_zone.limit_option", "12:CEF08C44", "Entry limit "},
	{"deviltower_zone.limit_premium_info1", "102:105D7287", "Anyone who holds a Demonic Key can enter the Tower even after reaching the standard entry limit."},
	{"deviltower_zone.limit_premium_info2", "77:B5A90F87", "You can buy the key from me. The price of the key changes every day at 5:00."},
	{"deviltower_zone.limit_premium_info3", "53:52DC27C8", "Entering with keys is also subject to a limit."},
	{"dungeon_return.info", "214:B5639409", "You have been thrown out of the dungeon. You can return to it within 5 minutes of leaving. If you were in a group and the group has moved on to the next level of the dungeon, you will unfortunately be thrown out of the dungeon again. Do you want to return to the dungeon?"},
	{"dungeon_return.last_dungeon", "16:D8871EAB", "Active dungeon: %s"},
	{"dungeon_return.letter_name", "15:F66E281D", "Return to the Dungeon"},
	{"dungeon_return.too_late", "35:57F2A665", "Unfortunately, the dungeon has already been closed."},
	{"escort.busy", "43:19A84926", "* Someone else has started this quest. Please wait. *"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_clear_water.info1", "358:36F7C260", "You hold the amulet up high, and its magical energy begins to spread across the surface of the water. A bright light radiates from the amulet, penetrating the water and cleansing it of pollution. You watch the water gradually become crystal clear as life returns to it. The fish begin to swim freely, and the plants regain their green colour."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_clear_water.info2", "148:573AAF54", "You have used the Water Purifying Amulet. The waters have been purified, and life is returning to them. You have taken an important step towards restoring the balance of nature."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_clear_water.info3", "67:0C65C540", "Go to the Fisherman and tell him what you have managed to do."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_clear_water.letter_info", "92:0F9A100D", "I have the Water Purifying Amulet. Now I have to go to any body of water and use the amulet."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_clear_water.letter_name", "20:E5E79A38", "Polluted Waters"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_complete.npc_chat", "19:30AA4E09", "Tell me about fishing"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_complete.talk1", "139:2736B844", "First of all, to fish you need a fishing pole. Besides the pole, you will need bait. The better the bait, the more valuable the fish you can catch."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_complete.talk2", "138:B0E2B0D2", "When you are ready, go to the water in the first village, swing hard and cast your line. Now wait and be patient."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_complete.talk3", "152:415595AB", "When a fish takes the bait, a little cloud with a fish icon will appear above your character's head. When the cloud disappears, you have to press the space bar."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_complete.talk4", "321:15E03FF0", "If you are lucky enough, you will be able to fight to land the fish. You will then see a mini-game window. The game starts after 3 seconds, so you have a moment to get ready. Once it has started, your task is to keep the fish inside the green area. Each time you press the space bar, the fish is pushed upwards."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_complete.talk5", "89:106174B5", "That's basically it - anyway, see for yourself. Practice makes perfect, I'm sure you'll manage!"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_go_baekgo.letter_info", "196:36FF55B0", "The plague of Metin Stones is harming the local waters as well. With the fish population dropping drastically, the village is short of food. I have to go to Baek-Go, he may know how to solve this problem."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_go_baekgo.letter_name", "20:E5E79A38", "Polluted Waters"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_go_baekgo.npc_chat", "20:E5E79A38", "Polluted Waters"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_go_baekgo.talk1", "203:2D8D5FFB", "Yes, I have heard about the trouble with the waters, but my skills will not be enough. If the Metin Stones are the source of the problem, a magical solution will be needed. My treatment would only be temporary."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_go_baekgo.talk2", "88:B051561A", "Go to Uriel. He may have the knowledge needed to solve this problem for good."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_go_uriel.letter_info", "205:4D681BD1", "Baek-Go pointed out the magical influence of the Metin Stones on the waters, which may be hard to deal with by conventional means. He suggested talking to Uriel, who should know more about the Metin Stones."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_go_uriel.letter_name", "20:E5E79A38", "Polluted Waters"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_go_uriel.npc_chat", "20:E5E79A38", "Polluted Waters"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_go_uriel.player_talk1", "65:AE7B4665", "Baek-Go said that only you can help purify our waters."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_go_uriel.say_item1", "110:89C2D155", "Essence of Nature - It can be obtained from bears, but the best chance of getting it is from Bera, the demigod of nature."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_go_uriel.say_item2", "51:198C984C", "Essence of Water - It can be found in the oasis in the desert."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_go_uriel.talk1", "32:D78DECDC", "Greetings, what brings you to me?"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_go_uriel.talk2", "237:E53C5EDC", "Yes, I have heard about the problem. The Metin Stones fell on our lands, bringing chaos and polluting the waters. Their magical energy disturbs the natural balance, stopping the fish from breeding and threatening the whole ecosystem."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_go_uriel.talk3", "229:AE5A7C19", "There is a way. We can make a Water Purifying Amulet, which has the magical power to cleanse tainted waters and restore their natural balance. But to make it, we need special ingredients."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_go_uriel.talk4", "38:2594CCB3", "We need two key essences:"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_go_uriel.talk5", "151:8F421C1A", "When you have the Essence of Nature and the Essence of Water, come back to me. Together we will make an amulet that will purify our waters and bring life back to the fish. Good luck!"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_progress.get_all", "81:ADF87F5D", "You have all the ingredients needed to make the amulet. Go to Uriel."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_progress.get_item1", "35:4F01C3DC", "You have obtained the Essence of Nature."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_progress.get_item2_chat1", "167:DC47F516", "The water in the oasis is crystal clear, sparkling in the sunlight. In its depths you notice a twinkling, luminous star that seems to draw your attention."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_progress.get_item2_chat2", "58:E881A457", "You see a glowing star in the water. Do you want to pick it up?"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_progress.get_item2_chat3_get", "138:CE9DE1B3", "You dip your hand into the water and gently grasp the glowing star. You feel energy flowing through your fingers. You have received the Essence of Water."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_progress.get_item2_chat3_refuse", "73:8E992E6E", "You decide to leave the glowing star in the water. Perhaps you will come back here later."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_progress.letter_info", "168:90EC42FB", "According to Uriel, the way to deal with the polluted waters is to make a special Amulet with magical properties. To make it, I need:"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_progress.letter_item1", "101:4CF8B9B2", "Essence of Nature - I can get it from bears, but it will be best to hunt Bera, the demigod of nature."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_progress.letter_item2", "52:ACC76D07", "Essence of Water - apparently I will find it in the oasis in the desert."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_progress.letter_name", "20:E5E79A38", "Polluted Waters"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_return_uriel.letter_info", "98:91DFC623", "I have managed to get all the ingredients needed to make the Amulet. I have to go to Uriel."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_return_uriel.letter_name", "20:E5E79A38", "Polluted Waters"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_return_uriel.npc_chat", "24:92C66531", "I have all the ingredients."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_return_uriel.player_talk1", "17:60E0875C", "I have both essences."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_return_uriel.talk1", "127:77F677F9", "Excellent, what you have managed to obtain is extremely valuable. Now we can set about making the Water Purifying Amulet."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_return_uriel.talk2", "44:BD93E475", "** Uriel combines the ingredients, creating the amulet. **"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_return_uriel.talk3", "272:FF9E8F79", "Here it is - the Water Purifying Amulet. Its magical properties will purify the tainted waters and restore the natural balance. Now you have to go to the nearest body of water and use the amulet. Once you do, the waters will begin to clear, and life in them will return to normal."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_reward.letter_info", "71:33DA996C", "The waters have been purified. Go to the Fisherman and tell him all about it."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_reward.letter_name", "14:B2DF80F4", "Return to the Fisherman"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_reward.npc_chat", "19:3A613974", "The waters are clean now."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_reward.talk1", "165:A61FBCB7", "Who do we have here? I have just caught my first fish in a long time! Thanks to you, our waters are clean again. Maybe you would like to join me, and I will show you how to fish properly?"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_start.low_lvl", "246:12C5E192", "I see that you are interested in fishing. Unfortunately, I cannot help you right now. You need to gain more experience to be able to understand and handle the challenges our polluted waters bring. Come back to me when you reach level 30."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_start.npc_chat", "8:207D4488", "Fishing"},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_start.talk1", "326:6799905D", "We have been going through a real crisis lately. Ever since the Metin Stones fell, our waters have turned acidic. The fish are having great trouble breeding, and their numbers have dropped drastically. I need your help to create an item that will improve the quality of the waters. Unfortunately, I don't have the knowledge to do it on my own."},
	{"fishing.onboarding.state_start.talk2", "186:FE5A4C96", "Go to Baek-Go, our local doctor. Perhaps he will have the right knowledge and help us create an item that will purify the waters. You will find him in the village, near the market."},
	{"fishing.stand_near_water", "35:5C21832E", "You have to stand next to a body of water."},
	{"friendly_monkey.chat", "12:F99F7E4A", "Hello, monkey!"},
	{"friendly_monkey.give", "20:4B2CB764", "Give the Cave Mushroom"},
	{"friendly_monkey.talk", "130:8CB4CA6D", "The monkey stares at you and waves its arms. Maybe it wants something? Maybe it is hungry? Find it something to eat. Bring a Cave Mushroom."},
	{"friendly_monkey.talk2", "14:9C24AFDC", "Ooh, aah, eee!"},
