	{"guild_land.wrong_empire", "64:B63BFF05", "What?! Get lost, back to your own kingdom! We do not sell land to enemy kingdoms."},
	{"herbalism.count_2_bonus", "71:19DFD5AF", "Your tug plucked a couple of flowers at once - they are of excellent quality!"},
	{"herbalism.extend_duration.cannot_extend", "35:80D7DB6B", "You cannot extend this potion."},
	{"herbalism.extend_duration.extend_success", "56:FA2D3E30", "Splendid, splendid! Done! The potion's effect has been extended."},
	{"herbalism.extend_duration.no_dust", "52:060E6DE0", "You don't have enough Magic Dust."},
	{"herbalism.extend_duration.npc_chat", "27:345A754A", "Extend potion effects"},
	{"herbalism.extend_duration.take_item_info1", "61:0B15DC45", "I know an old recipe that can prolong its effect."},
	{"herbalism.extend_duration.take_item_info2", "39:223EBDB9", "By how much do you want to extend the potion's effect?"},
	{"herbalism.extend_duration.take_item_info3", "84:9F26CFDE", "The ancient spells say that I can do it, but I need special ingredients."},
	{"herbalism.extend_duration.take_item_info4", "127:484577D0", "To extend the duration of this potion by %d%%, I will need %d pieces of Magic Dust and %s Yang. Do you agree?"},
	{"herbalism.extend_duration.take_item_select.3", "6:176C63C5", "Cancel"},
	{"herbalism.extend_duration.take_item_warning", "52:6E39CEAE", "The effect cannot be undone - it can only be extended once!"},
	{"herbalism.extend_duration.talk1", "181:0FFA3CD4", "Many years ago I discovered a recipe that makes potions last longer. It was a secret I inherited from my mentor, an ancient alchemist from the Far East."},
	{"herbalism.extend_duration.talk2", "138:D48C29DA", "Working day and night, I learned how to use Magic Dust to strengthen potions that can help you in the toughest battles."},
	{"herbalism.extend_duration.talk3", "117:08F88DAB", "If you bring a little Yang and some dust, I can do it for you. Give me the potion whose effect you want to extend."},
	{"herbalism.fail", "29:FE00796D", "You failed to gather the plant."},
	{"herbalism.fail_info.1", "47:E55810CB", "You failed to pick the flower. Try again!"},
	{"herbalism.fail_info.2", "49:A84EE78F", "The flower is too tough to pick. Try once more!"},
	{"herbalism.fail_info.3", "42:89569256", "Failure! The flower is still growing in the ground."},
	{"herbalism.fail_info.4", "50:0E02D2CB", "You are not strong enough to pick the flower. Keep trying!"},
	{"herbalism.knife_needed", "28:ADF05BE4", "You need a Herbalist's Knife."},
	{"herbalism.knife_upgrade_max", "67:0E5BFC2F", "Your knife is ready for an upgrade attempt - go to the nearest Herbalist!"},
	{"herbalism.knife_upgrade_point", "50:01EC9EEB", "Your Herbalist's Knife has gained 1 point (%d/%d)."},
	{"herbalism.low_lvl", "46:A79FFF19", "You need to be level %d to gather this plant."},
	{"herbalism.no_horse", "32:2855F08A", "You cannot gather plants on horseback."},
	{"herbalism.open_shop1", "133:34E2C559", "Have you come for ingredients or for the tools you need to make potions? Just tell me what you need, and I will be sure to help you."},
	{"herbalism.open_shop2", "77:F53164B5", "Looking for the best supplies for making potions? You will find it all here."},
	{"herbalism.open_shop3", "107:49687E04", "I have everything you could need here - fresh ingredients and the best tools to make your work easier."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.complete_quest_first", "15:76184F85", "Go to Baek-Go."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.introduction1", "257:5832E35C", "You are ready to learn the secrets of herbalism. Herbalism is the art of gathering rare and valuable plants that can be used to make elixirs, potions and other items. It is a skill that requires precision and knowledge, but it brings many benefits."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.introduction2", "122:FC826EF1", "To make potions, you will need the right ingredients. You will learn the list of ingredients when you read the recipe."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.introduction3", "177:5A2329C4", "You need the right tools. The first of them is the Herbalist's Knife. You can buy it from me for a small sum. Once you have it, you will be able to gather your first plants."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.introduction4", "206:01BFD24B", "The rare Peach Blossom grows around here. Find it, use your knife to gather it and then come back to me. 10 of them will be enough. Remember that precision and a gentle touch are the key to gathering herbs."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.introduction5", "168:EF4946E1", "If running after flowers doesn't interest you, you can get them from other players at the market, or by killing monsters. Decide for yourself what suits you better!"},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.low_lvl", "192:4D60E606", "I see that you are interested in herbalism, but I'm afraid you aren't experienced enough yet. Come back when you reach level 15, and then I will gladly introduce you to the secrets of herbalism."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.npc_chat", "10:278CE243", "Herbalism"},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.state_craft.letter_info", "206:0F193039", "Baek-Go wants to test your alchemy skills. Study the recipe for the Purple Potion that you received from him, then try to make the potion by opening Baek-Go's crafting window."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.state_craft.letter_name", "17:553E389E", "Make the Potion "},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.state_craft.success", "57:9AD8A054", "You did it! This is your first potion! Talk to Baek-Go."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.state_progress.letter_info", "329:01C63D6B", "As an introduction to herbalism, Baek-Go asked me to get 10 Peach Blossoms. I can find the plant around the first village. To gather the blossoms I will need a Herbalist's Knife, which I can buy from Baek-Go himself. He also pointed out that I don't have to pick the flowers myself - I can get them from monsters or from other players."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.state_progress.letter_info_has_flowers", "87:3090C09E", "I have the 10 Peach Blossoms that Baek-Go asked me for. I should go and see him."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.state_progress.letter_name", "10:278CE243", "Herbalism"},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.state_progress.npc_chat", "21:8DF6EF03", "I have the Peach Blossoms"},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.state_progress.talk1", "131:ECBA4FEB", "Excellent work! I can see that you have a talent for herbalism. The Peach Blossom is extremely valuable and can be used in many elixirs."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.state_progress.talk2", "203:AF1556E2", "Let's see how you do as an alchemist - try to make your first potion. Drinking a Purple Potion increases your movement speed. Its main ingredient is none other than the Peach Blossom."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.state_progress.talk3", "36:A703A966", "Here is the recipe for the Purple Potion."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.state_progress.talk4", "317:B5818C18", "The better you understand the recipe, the better the potion you will be able to make. Study the recipe and try to make a Purple Potion. When you make a potion, you have to keep it somewhere, so you will also need an Empty Bottle. This small bottle will be enough to make this potion. Here you go."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.state_reward.letter_info", "61:C6F2F6FE", "You have managed to make the Purple Potion. Talk to Baek-Go."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.state_reward.letter_name", "18:2676A683", "Talk to Baek-Go."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.state_reward.npc_chat", "29:92F916ED", "I managed to make the potion."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.state_reward.talk1", "122:F6C3B4DD", "I knew you could do it - it wasn't that hard, was it? You now have all the skills you need to make potions on your own."},
	{"herbalism.prime_quest.state_reward.talk2", "47:8938E28B", "Ah! I almost forgot - I have a little present for you."},
	{"herbalism.refine_knife", "18:77D10036", "I want to upgrade my knife."},
	{"herbalism.refine_knife_can_refine", "274:12FE266E", "That works out nicely, because I offer that very service - back in the war I gathered herbs for wounded soldiers. My experience has let me master the art of making exceptionally sharp and durable tools. Give me your knife and I will make it even better."},
	{"herbalism.refine_knife_cannot", "184:31517599", "Unfortunately, I don't upgrade herbalism knives. But I have heard that the herbalist in the second village, Yu-Hwan, is an expert at it. You should pay him a visit - he will surely help you."},
	{"herbalism.refine_low_points", "139:5418DD4E", "Well now, the knife is of excellent quality, but why have you brought it to me? It is not ready to be upgraded. Come back when you have had more practice."},
	{"herbalism.success_info.1", "38:FDB57A2A", "Congratulations! You managed to pick the flower!"},
	{"herbalism.success_info.2", "29:241B6199", "Well done! You picked a beautiful flower!"},
	{"herbalism.too_far", "33:8DECF2EC", "You are too far away - come closer."},
	{"horse_inventory.init.finish", "145:89263FDA", "Done! Your horse now has saddlebags, so you will be able to take much more with you on your travels. Treat it well, and good luck!"},
	{"horse_inventory.init.item1", "13:57EAD30B", "- Horse Medal"},
	{"horse_inventory.init.item2", "56:6C442D6A", "- 5 Crafting Materials (you can get them from the Storekeeper)"},
	{"horse_inventory.init.no_items", "265:45CF4A2B", "Hmm, I see you don't have everything I need yet. Remember that you need a Horse Medal and 5 Crafting Materials. Come back when you have these items and I will prepare the saddlebags for you. Your horse deserves to be better equipped!"},
	{"horse_inventory.init.npc_chat", "10:1A3C0EF3", "Horse Saddlebags"},
	{"horse_inventory.init.ok", "24:C53BC337", "Here are the required items."},
	{"horse_inventory.init.talk1", "169:AA034BED", "Hello, I can see that your horse looks well cared for, but it lacks one thing that would make your travels much easier. Do you know what I'm talking about? Saddlebags!"},
	{"horse_inventory.init.talk2", "198:85049A08", "Saddlebags are special bags that you can fit on your horse. With them you can carry more items on your travels. Without them your horse will never show its full potential!"},
	{"horse_inventory.init.talk3", "85:090267BD", "If you want to fit your horse with saddlebags, I will need two things from you:"},
	{"horse_inventory.init.talk4", "68:646AF1E4", "It's the only way I can prepare the right bags for you."},
	{"horse_inventory.no_items", "37:CC7A47D9", "You don't have the required items."},
	{"horse_inventory.no_level", "33:FE5E6B71", "Your riding level is too low."},
	{"horse_inventory.success", "50:424675FB", "Your Horse Saddlebags have been expanded by an additional slot."},
	{"hunting.complete", "23:EE0C0A3C", "Quest completed!"},
