	{"hunting.special_letter_reward_item", "15:B7EE3409", "- Item: %s"},
	{"hunting.special_letter_reward_title", "11:171E53C9", "~ Reward ~"},
	{"hwang_introduction.state_information.letter_info", "237:1AC97FEA", "Wanted: Nabira, once one of us, last seen in the Valley of Seungryong. He is probably hiding in the south-west of the valley. He is wanted for treason and the theft of secrets. Be careful, he may be dangerous."},
	{"hwang_introduction.state_information.letter_title", "12:523549AC", "Wanted Poster:"},
	{"hwang_introduction.state_information.npc_chat", "11:01F111DB", "Wanted Poster"},
	{"hwang_introduction.state_information.npc_say1", "176:20E19773", "I did not expect them to reach this far. It can only mean one thing - they are on my trail, and that puts us both in danger. I have to act fast, and I cannot do it alone."},
	{"hwang_introduction.state_information.npc_say2", "224:5CA9E78E", "I must get hold of the Tiger Stone, which the sect members near the entrance to the Hwang Temple have in their possession. I need it... to achieve my goals. I cannot reveal any more for now, but believe me, it is crucial."},
	{"hwang_introduction.state_information.npc_say3", "252:582AFC01", "The stone holds great power, which I must make use of. That is all I can say. Please, get it for me. The sect members are dangerous and will stop at nothing to protect what they consider theirs. Do not draw attention to yourself and act with care."},
	{"hwang_introduction.state_information.pc_say1", "82:6EC8EE5F", "I found this wanted poster on the Esoterics. It looks like they want to find you very badly."},
	{"hwang_introduction.state_information.pc_say2", "27:675ECBBD", "Why is it so important?"},
	{"hwang_introduction.state_progress.get_item", "99:424255BE", "Return to Nabira with the Tiger Stone. He is waiting for you in his hideout in the Valley of Seungryong."},
	{"hwang_introduction.state_progress.letter_info", "437:5F4D130C", "Nabira, a former member of the esoteric sect, is now wanted and is hiding from his former companions. Nabira expressed his concern about the wanted poster and asked for help in obtaining the Tiger Stone. He said that the stone is essential for achieving his mysterious goals, which remain undisclosed for now. The Tiger Stone is in the possession of members of the esoteric sect, near the entrance to the Hwang Temple."},
	{"hwang_introduction.state_progress.letter_name", "14:51F9577E", "Tiger Stone"},
	{"hwang_introduction.state_reward.npc_chat", "14:51F9577E", "Tiger Stone"},
	{"hwang_introduction.state_reward.npc_say", "240:4CBC5A97", "Excellent! You do not know how grateful I am for your help. Getting this stone was not easy, and you showed courage and determination. I would like to offer you something special to thank you for your efforts - the Mask of Sabah."},
	{"hwang_introduction.state_reward.npc_say2", "265:A2CEA715", "Yes, it is a magic mask that holds the power of Sabah, the god of tigers. It will let you enter the Hwang Temple without fear of the curse that would strike any unauthorised intruder. With it, you will be able to face the new challenges and mysteries of this sacred place."},
	{"hwang_introduction.state_reward.npc_say3", "169:DECE3C47", "If you ever need more Masks of Sabah, feel free to come and buy them from me. Each of them offers the same powers and protection from the curse in the Hwang Temple."},
	{"hwang_introduction.state_reward.pc_say", "13:B90C4C40", "The Mask of Sabah?"},
	{"hwang_introduction.title", "15:346DABF4", "Nabira's Escape"},
	{"inventory_remove.delete_info1", "22:004934FB", "Successfully deleted %s."},
	{"inventory_remove.delete_info2", "26:D9DB96E2", "Successfully deleted %dx %s."},
	{"inventory_remove.is_antidelete", "34:6C951E9B", "You cannot delete this item."},
	{"inventory_remove.is_busy", "44:128F13EA", "You cannot delete an item right now."},
	{"item_exchange.refineitem_chat", "23:5ABD4C7D", "Crafting Materials"},
	{"item_exchange.refineitem_talk1", "286:07024C33", "Need Crafting Materials? You have come to the right place. I keep loads of items in this storeroom and there is always room for more. If you have upgrade materials, I can exchange them - a fair trade, no catches. What do you say? Just hurry up, I have a few things on my plate here."},
	{"item_exchange.skillbook_chat", "22:DA5684F5", "Parchment Crafting"},
	{"item_exchange.skillbook_talk1", "325:BD2B6517", "In my workshop I turn Skill Books into powerful Parchments. These books hold knowledge from distant lands and times, and I can extract their essence to create a parchment able to carry new spells. Just think how much you could achieve with one of them! Which book do you wish to transform today?"},
	{"item_exchange.soul_stone_chat", "13:494C7516", "Magic Dust "},
	{"item_exchange.soul_stone_talk1", "484:7FA63BBB", "I see that you carry Spirit Stones with you, those rare and powerful artefacts that hold the secrets of old worlds. My skills allow me to transform their mystical energy into Magic Dust. Each stone holds a different kind of power, so choose wisely which one you wish to give up. Remember, wanderer, that every exchange is also a kind of farewell to a fragment of old magic. Are you ready for this ritual? Which Spirit Stones would you like to hand over for transformation?"},
	{"item_exchange.summary", "32:987A8E26", "Result: %d successful out of %d attempts."},
	{"labirynth.cancel_chat1", "261:6530B7C1", "Time is but an illusion, young wanderer, and yet its cogwheels grind our fates without mercy. You refuse me now, but remember that some moments, once lost, never return. And with my words vanish the chances that could have changed your destiny."},
	{"labirynth.cancel_chat2", "313:B8A3FD78", "By refusing, you choose the safe path, but is it truly free of risk? Every step back is a missed chance to discover what could change your fate. The challenge you avoid is nothing but a reflection of your own fears. Do you really want to live in the shadow of what you could have overcome?"},
	{"labirynth.chat1", "201:F980E506", "I see the fire of battle in your eyes. My name is Min-Sun, and that is all you need to know. Perhaps you would like to talk, for I have a task for you that only someone as skilled as you could accomplish."},
	{"labirynth.chat2", "377:B68B1E0C", "Darkness and light are but two sides of the same coin. Are you ready to come face to face with what hides in the shadow of your soul? I would like to invite you to a place that exists beyond the borders of our world. It is a labyrinth in which your courage, cunning and strength will be put to the test. Do you dare to set foot on this path and face the challenges that await you there?"},
	{"labirynth.chat3", "307:6E72179C", "It is wonderful to see you, wanderer. Your path through the labyrinth was a sign of true determination and strength. Now the time has come for us to return to the world we know. Important conversations await us, and your achievements deserve a fitting reward. Follow me, and I will open a portal that will lead us out of here."},
	{"labirynth.chat4", "355:6BD9A0CA", "Your courage and determination in the face of unimaginable challenges have shown me that you are worthy of more than mere words of praise. You are ready to uncover the deeper secrets of our world. That is why I offer you access to ancient potion recipes that can turn the tide of battle. Use them wisely, and remember that all knowledge brings responsibility with it."},
	{"labirynth.dungeon_end_chat", "14:64C9FA43", "I found you."},
	{"labirynth.dungeon_info", "37:7A8BAB71", "You have 10 minutes to get through the labyrinth.", "b"},
	{"labirynth.is_in_party", "185:165FF2D6", "You are not alone. The adventure I have for you calls for solitude. You should face this challenge alone, without any help. Come back to me when you are ready to continue on your own."},
	{"labirynth.not_unlocked", "142:8B758065", "I do not know you, and I have no time to chat with random travellers. Get out of my sight before you bring real trouble here."},
	{"labirynth.npc_chat", "11:C34A81E9", "Who are you?"},
	{"labirynth.npc_chat2", "21:C0A12B4D", "I made it through the labyrinth."},
	{"labirynth.select1", "22:021112A4", "I'm all ears."},
	{"labirynth.select2", "16:71EDDCAF", "I have no time..."},
	{"labirynth.select3", "14:D7AF00C4", "I am ready."},
	{"labirynth.select4", "26:F047FC16", "No, I'd rather not take the risk..."},
	{"loot_chest.fail", "32:C96471BF", "You failed to open the chest..."},
	{"loot_chest.high_lvl", "22:179ED4F5", "Your level is too high."},
	{"loot_chest.low_lvl", "49:C334F13A", "You need level %d to open this chest."},
	{"loot_chest.no_horse", "34:A95470ED", "You cannot open a chest on horseback."},
	{"loot_chest.no_picklock", "45:B5C0B3A2", "You need a lockpick to open the chest."},
	{"loot_chest.wait", "40:6EDBFE8C", "You can open the next chest in %s."},
	{"magic_ore.chat", "225:7EA550C9", "I will help you smelt these ores into Smelted Ore - a key ingredient for making the most powerful potions. Alchemy is the art of combining elements and energy, and without this ore many recipes would be impossible to make."},
	{"magic_ore.crafting", "19:3DABD47A", "Smelted Ore"},
	{"map_warp.chat", "17:26E1ED20", "I want to travel. "},
	{"map_warp.high_level", "82:22F729C8", "These are places I can only take you to once you have reached level 60."},
	{"map_warp.info_tp_from_city", "105:822D813B", "I will teleport you right away.[ENTER]You are heading to a dangerous place...[ENTER]Take care of yourself... and good luck..."},
	{"map_warp.info_tp_outside_city", "29:04679E1E", "As you wish. Careful, here we go!"},
	{"map_warp.low_level", "129:A7A2EC9A", "At your level you would not survive a journey through time and space. You can only use my services from level 11."},
	{"map_warp.next", "5:D87392ED", "Next"},
	{"map_warp.no_money", "98:35312C1B", "I could teleport you for free, but I have a large family. To support them, I need money."},
	{"map_warp.previous", "4:B8BA81F3", "Back"},
	{"map_warp.price", "18:2CBFE6F9", "The cost is: %s Yang."},
	{"map_warp.talk1", "283:D11F753A", "This is a nice village... But does anything ever happen here? There is a special place I can teleport you to. But the evil force is growing again, and time and space are slowly falling into chaos. That is why the way back does not always work... Hmm. Do you want to be teleported somewhere?"},
	{"map_warp.talk1_outside", "134:6F918487", "This place, though wild and full of dangers, also hides its secrets. I could teleport you from here to a safer location,"},
	{"map_warp.talk2", "27:615FA3A0", "Where would you like to be teleported to?"},
	{"marriage_manage.cannot_end", "62:E0A9C3D3", "One of the players is busy - you cannot end the wedding now."},
	{"marriage_manage.is_busy", "64:5A5F7B2B", "Hello! Wake up and focus! You can't have any other windows open."},
	{"marriage_manage.partner_is_busy", "105:5319333E", "Is your partner even interested in what is about to happen? A wedding is a decision for life!"},
	{"marriage_shop.next", "23:C19C6CED", "Next change in: %s."},
	{"marriage_shop.talk", "314:AF413FF4", "I sell valuable marriage items. They help married couples get through the hardest of times. Unfortunately, in the chaotic times we happen to live in, I have to adjust my prices to reality. Today is better, tomorrow will be worse... you know how it is. The shop's prices change regularly every 12 hours."},
	{"monkey_curse.break_curse", "29:FFE52B4F", "You have freed yourself from the Monkey Curse."},
	{"monkey_curse.protection", "35:BF819FB5", "You are protected from the Monkey Curse."},
	{"monkey_curse.remove_poly_info", "58:6E188354", "To break the Monkey Curse, you must eat a Herb from the Monkey Dungeon."},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_complete.random_msg.1", "10:69472207", "Get lost!"},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_complete.random_msg.2", "18:9BF40442", "Have you got nothing better to do?"},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_complete.random_msg.3", "18:80773D2B", "Looking for trouble?"},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_complete.random_msg.4", "9:63475772", "Beat it..."},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_start.accept", "10:33C4835D", "I'll help you."},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_start.acceptInfo", "73:BE582611", "Thank you. Come with me, but slowly - I can't hurry..."},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_start.attack_start", "4:C5D2801B", "Die!", "b"},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_start.cancel", "16:D4266772", "You'll manage."},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_start.cancelInfo", "48:0E6D0B95", "I beg you... no, please, don't leave me here!"},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_start.escort_end", "8:D8472188", "Got you!", "b"},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_start.escort_start", "7:2E3B6F09", "Follow me!"},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_start.escort_talk.1", "16:99A14255", "Just a little further "},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_start.escort_talk.2", "21:B62F2A11", "Wait, where was it?"},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_start.escort_talk.3", "15:9B4D7912", "We're going the right way!"},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_start.escort_talk.4", "16:DE88C457", "Wait, just a moment..."},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_start.escort_talk.5", "13:E972B336", "See? Over there!"},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_start.kill", "23:19550374", "It wasn't supposed to go like this..."},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_start.npcChat", "13:BFB3BD3A", "What are you doing here?"},
	{"new_escort_quest1.state_start.npcTalk", "193:844E2EA1", "Help... I urgently need help, I'm wounded. Can you take me to the nearest camp? It's... it's not far, I beg you. If you don't help me, I'll die here in agony..."},
	{"new_quest_lv19.gotouriel.gotouriel", "16:1B90645F", "Return to Uriel! "},
	{"new_quest_lv19.gotouriel.letter", "27:9FAE17DA", "Investigate Cursed Animals "},
	{"new_quest_lv19.gotouriel.letterInfo", "37:851CB8B9", "Go to Uriel, he has a task for you."},
	{"new_quest_lv19.gotouriel.npcChat1", "82:6F0929C2", "Greetings, it is good to see you again. The number of cursed animals worries me greatly. "},
	{"new_quest_lv19.gotouriel.npcChat2", "144:3EF73FA4", "Would you collect a few samples for me? 5 Cursed Wolf Furs, 5 Cursed Bear Hides and 5 Cursed Tiger Hides will be enough. "},
	{"new_quest_lv19.gotouriel.npcChat3", "142:18F5D45D", "Off you go, there is no time to lose! Remember that you can get the furs and hides from any kind of Cursed Wolf, Bear or Tiger! "},
	{"new_quest_lv19.gotouriel2.letter", "26:5EED41C9", "Return to Uriel with samples "},
	{"new_quest_lv19.gotouriel2.letterInfo", "54:9AD8F4B6", "Bring Uriel the furs of the cursed animals you have collected. "},
	{"new_quest_lv19.gotouriel2.notenough", "139:87F781A7", "You do not have enough samples. Bring me 5 Cursed Wolf Furs, 5 Cursed Bear Hides and 5 Cursed Tiger Hides "},
	{"new_quest_lv19.gotouriel2.npcChat1", "108:5B8D0A7F", "Excellent! Now I have to examine them closely. I will let you know later what I have found out and tell you what to do next. "},
	{"new_quest_lv19.gotouriel2.npcChat2", "89:2D3354EE", "That was quick! Accept this reward as a token of my gratitude. See you soon. "},
	{"new_quest_lv19.killanimals.letter", "27:D97BA7B8", "Investigate Cursed Animals "},
	{"new_quest_lv19.killanimals.letterInfo", "180:1503BCAF", "Bring Uriel 5 Cursed Wolf Furs, 5 Cursed Bear Hides and 5 Cursed Tiger Hides. You can get the furs and hides from any kind of cursed animal. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24.gotouriel2.fail1", "6:16C5A1AB", "Poor "},
	{"new_quest_lv24.gotouriel2.fail2", "4:21A1F12E", "lame"},
	{"new_quest_lv24.gotouriel2.letter", "26:5EED41C9", "Take the samples to Uriel "},
	{"new_quest_lv24.gotouriel2.letterFail", "10:7880A621", "You failed "},
	{"new_quest_lv24.gotouriel2.letterSuccess", "26:1252B920", "Return and brag to Uriel "},
	{"new_quest_lv24.gotouriel2.success1", "10:BE78FEC5", "Great! "},
	{"new_quest_lv24.trap.letter", "26:5EED41C9", "Take the samples to Uriel "},
	{"new_quest_lv24.trap.letterInfo", "54:9AD8F4B6", "Deliver the collected furs of the cursed animals to Uriel. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24.trap.notenough", "156:E7B2A221", "You do not have enough samples. Bring me:[ENTER]5 Cursed Wolf Furs,[ENTER]5 Cursed Bear Hides,[ENTER]5 Cursed Tiger Hides "},
	{"new_quest_lv24.trap.npcChat1", "120:8C312DBE", "Great! Now I have to examine them closely.[ENTER]I will let you know later what I have found out[ENTER]and tell you what to do next. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24.trap.npcChat2", "95:6F4BCD2E", "That was quick, accept this reward as a token of[ENTER]my gratitude.[ENTER]See you soon. "},
	{"new_quest_lv24.zbadaj_m2.complete", "8:071E6C78", "TRAP "},
	{"potion_recharge.chat", "18:55FC1A31", "Recharge Elixir"},
	{"potion_recharge.success", "29:5996C1F0", "The elixir has been recharged successfully."},
	{"potion_recharge.talk", "307:D7946847", "Do you have a Sun or Moon Elixir with you? Did you know that you can fill them with the energy of life or magic? That way they can keep you alive the whole time while you fight your enemies! Bring some Red Potions or Blue Potions to fill the Elixir with their power."},
	{"potions.already_used", "50:FB30B0FF", "A stronger or the same effect is already active."},
	{"potions.limit_use", "58:49E61268", "You can have at most %d active effects from this group."},
	{"premium_token.has_premium", "61:46C4FDAE", "You cannot use the pass while premium benefits are active."},
	{"premium_token.info", "184:6868A3C7", "Do you want to activate the premium subscription benefits? If you have other VIP effects active, the bonus will not stack - it will be replaced by the subscription benefits. Do you want to continue?"},
	{"quest_book.is_on_quest", "72:8126455B", "You have an active quest from a Mission Book - you must complete or abandon it."},
	{"quest_book.kill_progress", "24:4E26C50B", "- %s (%d of %d left)"},
	{"quest_book.mission_10_hunt", "27:F1199711", "March of the hungry bears "},
	{"quest_book.mission_10_mis", "62:19CA2F2E", "Kill 25 Black Bears and 25 Grizzly Bears. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_10_text", "221:330DC99E", "Oh, please help us. Lately, a rising number of[ENTER]Grizzly Bears and Black Bears have started[ENTER]damaging our beehives and plantations. Please[ENTER]help us and kill those beasts, otherwise we'll[ENTER]starve! "},
	{"quest_book.mission_11_hunt", "26:E4A7563C", "The Storm of the Blue Wolves "},
	{"quest_book.mission_11_mis", "64:D3A196D0", "Kill 35 Blue Wolves and 25 Alpha Blue Wolves. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_11_text", "205:2CD8D45F", "Have you heard about the Blue Wolf Tornado?[ENTER]It refers to all the mayhem the Blue Wolves have[ENTER]caused in the past weeks. When they're around[ENTER]they eliminate everything in their path and the[ENTER]whole place looks like tornado of fur and fangs.[ENTER]Can you fight this storm? "},
	{"quest_book.mission_12_hunt", "21:FD503C54", "Driving away the White Army "},
	{"quest_book.mission_12_mis", "37:3E72D0E1", "Kill 20 White Oath Commanders. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_12_text", "217:AEEC5DF8", "Recently, the army of the White Oath has been[ENTER]causing a lot of trouble. They keep capturing[ENTER]peddlers and causing lots of damage to the[ENTER]village. Please stop them. Eliminate the members[ENTER]of the army and their leaders. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_13_hunt", "27:11B37B30", "Restless Black Wind "},
	{"quest_book.mission_13_mis", "66:2C3EEF0D", "Kill 25 Jak-To and 25 To-Su from the Black Wind[ENTER]Gang. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_13_text", "185:E3902C89", "Apparently the Black Wind Gang wants to take over[ENTER]the kingdom. Before they can recruit more troops,[ENTER]we'd better eliminate their leaders.[ENTER]Please could you kill their leaders for us! "},
	{"quest_book.mission_14_hunt", "23:D40E62CD", "The Great Orc Revolt I "},
	{"quest_book.mission_14_mis", "64:4A6076BB", "Kill 30 Elite Orcs and 30 Elite Orc Scouts. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_14_text", "252:F784B3F6", "Secret information seems to show that the Orc[ENTER]leaders in the Valley of Seungryong are planning[ENTER]on taking over the world. I would like you to[ENTER]take a look around there and find out how much[ENTER]truth there is to this. So that the trip is worth[ENTER]it, you could also get rid of the couple of Orcs[ENTER]while you're at it. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_15_hunt", "14:FDB2A620", "Attack of the Savages "},
	{"quest_book.mission_15_mis", "61:9EFF9776", "Kill 30 Savage Infantrymen and 30 Savage Minions. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_15_text", "204:C3A4E364", "We have captured a Savage Spy and managed to get[ENTER]some important information from him. Apparently[ENTER]they are planning an attack on the kingdom. We[ENTER]need to beat them to it. Prove your loyalty to[ENTER]the kingdom. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_16_hunt", "24:FD6047D4", "Destroy the Metin of Darkness "},
	{"quest_book.mission_16_mis", "27:BBE31526", "Destroy 2 Metins of Darkness "},
	{"quest_book.mission_16_text", "227:5CBE8DE7", "Recently, it has started raining stones near the[ENTER]city. They seem to have an evil chi within them,[ENTER]because ever since then, animals in the area have[ENTER]started acting really crazy. Please take care of[ENTER]this problem and destroy the stones. And of[ENTER]course you will be adequately rewarded for your[ENTER]efforts. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_17_hunt", "22:4819208C", "Destroy the Metin of Black "},
	{"quest_book.mission_17_mis", "25:17D71799", "Destroy 2 Metins of Black. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_17_text", "227:5CBE8DE7", "Recently, it has started raining stones near the[ENTER]city. They seem to have an evil chi within them,[ENTER]because ever since then, animals in the area have[ENTER]started acting really crazy. Please take care of[ENTER]this problem and destroy the stones. And of[ENTER]course you will be adequately rewarded for your[ENTER]efforts. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_18_hunt", "14:54F6A2D9", "The Attack of the Se-Rang "},
	{"quest_book.mission_18_mis", "33:C57488C0", "Kill 10 Se-Rangs from the White Oath army. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_18_text", "285:AFFCB3D2", "Warrior, there is new information about the White[ENTER]Oath army. As a reaction to the pressure we put[ENTER]on them, the Se-Rangs, leaders of the White Oath,[ENTER]have started a counter-offensive. You have to do[ENTER]something about the Se-Rangs right now and thwart[ENTER]their plans. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_19_hunt", "24:215BBC66", "The Great Orc Revolt II "},
	{"quest_book.mission_19_mis", "73:D2D178A6", "Kill 20 Elite Orc Fighters and 15 Elite Orc[ENTER]Sorcerers. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_19_text", "252:F784B3F6", "The secret information seems to show that the[ENTER]leaders of the Orcs in the Valley of Seungryong[ENTER]are planning on conquering the world. As crazy as[ENTER]it may sound, you should check this rumour. And[ENTER]while you're there you can also reduce their[ENTER]troops a little. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_1_hunt", "20:9CD0775E", "Destroy the Metin of Combat "},
	{"quest_book.mission_1_mis", "24:1FAA8B91", "Destroy 2 Metins of Combat. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_1_text", "227:5CBE8DE7", "Recently, it has started raining stones near the[ENTER]city. They seem to have an evil chi within them,[ENTER]because ever since then, animals in the area have[ENTER]started acting really crazy. Please take care of[ENTER]this problem and destroy the stones. And of[ENTER]course you will be adequately rewarded for your[ENTER]efforts. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_20_hunt", "34:9F42A267", "The Normal Monkey Dungeon I "},
	{"quest_book.mission_20_mis", "50:A9E08C7E", "Kill 30 Apesoldiers and 30 Apethrowers. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_20_text", "229:63BD7A55", "We have finally discovered the location of the[ENTER]normal Monkey Dungeon in the desert. Normally the[ENTER]monkeys that live there are harmless, but when[ENTER]they gang together they pose a great threat to[ENTER]the kingdom. Go to the normal Monkey Dungeon and[ENTER]check out the monkey situation. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_21_hunt", "31:53F5C053", "The Easy Monkey Dungeon I "},
	{"quest_book.mission_21_mis", "72:864C23EF", "Kill 30 Weak Ape Soldiers and 30 Weak Ape[ENTER]Throwers. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_21_text", "223:A32BED4C", "We have finally discovered the location of the[ENTER]easy Monkey Dungeon in the desert. Normally the[ENTER]monkeys that live there are harmless, but when[ENTER]they gang together they pose a great threat to[ENTER]the kingdom. Go to the easy Monkey Dungeon and[ENTER]check out the monkey situation. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_22_hunt", "24:F692C762", "Sowers of the Black Wind. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_22_mis", "38:40226707", "Kill Chuong of the Black Wind Gang. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_22_text", "192:9E8B0839", "The Chuong, the leaders of the Black Wind Gang,[ENTER]are causing trouble. As they are masters of sword[ENTER]fighting, they have started challenging warriors,[ENTER]just for their own amusement. Stop them before[ENTER]the whole Black Wind Gang joins in. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_23_hunt", "24:6DF2F062", "Destroy the Metin of Jealousy "},
	{"quest_book.mission_23_mis", "27:45090C0E", "Destroy 2 Metins of Jealousy. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_23_text", "227:5CBE8DE7", "Recently, it has started raining stones near the[ENTER]city. They seem to have an evil chi within them,[ENTER]because ever since then, animals in the area have[ENTER]started acting really crazy. Please take care of[ENTER]this problem and destroy the stones. And of[ENTER]course you will be adequately rewarded for your[ENTER]efforts. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_24_hunt", "35:14765175", "The Normal Monkey Dungeon II "},
	{"quest_book.mission_24_mis", "58:73E35C8E", "Kill 15 Apefighters and 15 Apegenerals. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_24_text", "229:63BD7A55", "We have finally discovered the location of the[ENTER]normal Monkey Dungeon in the desert. Normally the[ENTER]monkeys that live there are harmless, but when[ENTER]they gang together they pose a great threat to[ENTER]the kingdom. Go to the normal Monkey Dungeon and[ENTER]check out the monkey situation. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_25_hunt", "32:0E5AB950", "The Easy Monkey Dungeon II "},
	{"quest_book.mission_25_mis", "74:9E91AE84", "Kill 15 Ape Soldiers and 15 Weak Ape Generals. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_25_text", "223:A32BED4C", "We have finally discovered the location of the[ENTER]easy Monkey Dungeon in the desert. Normally the[ENTER]monkeys that live there are harmless, but when[ENTER]they gang together they pose a great threat to[ENTER]the kingdom. Go to the easy Monkey Dungeon and[ENTER]check out the monkey situation. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_26_hunt", "21:F85D1D6E", "Destroy the Metin of Soul "},
	{"quest_book.mission_26_mis", "23:8ACD7C25", "Destroy 2 Metins of Soul. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_26_text", "227:5CBE8DE7", "Recently, it has started raining stones near the[ENTER]city. They seem to have an evil chi within them,[ENTER]because ever since then, animals in the area have[ENTER]started acting really crazy. Please take care of[ENTER]this problem and destroy the stones. And of[ENTER]course you will be adequately rewarded for your[ENTER]efforts. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_27_hunt", "15:79B0371D", "Wrath of the Spider I "},
	{"quest_book.mission_27_mis", "26:67D02604", "Kill 40 Baby Spiders. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_27_text", "182:2911427B", "Spiders that normally live peacefully in the[ENTER]Yongbi Desert have suddenly started attacking and[ENTER]killing travellers recently. Apart from the fact[ENTER]that the victims aren't particularly thrilled[ENTER]about it, these attacks are bad for our kingdom's[ENTER]business. Please put an end to this. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_28_hunt", "16:7A05B258", "Wrath of the Spider II "},
	{"quest_book.mission_28_mis", "28:3A1E6270", "Kill 40 Poison Spiders. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_28_text", "182:2911427B", "Spiders that normally live peacefully in the[ENTER]Yongbi Desert have suddenly started attacking and[ENTER]killing travellers recently. Apart from the fact[ENTER]that the victims aren't particularly thrilled[ENTER]about it, these attacks are bad for our kingdom's[ENTER]business. Please put an end to this. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_29_hunt", "30:FFC6E158", "Purging the Valley Sect II "},
	{"quest_book.mission_29_mis", "63:42EEAB3E", "Kill 20 Esoteric Arahan Fighters and 25 Chief[ENTER]Esoteric Arahans. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_29_text", "252:334903D3", "Finally we have received the order to eliminate[ENTER]the most dangerous sect in the whole kingdom: the[ENTER]esoteric sect in the Valley of Seungryong. Go[ENTER]there and shake the place up a little! But don't[ENTER]make the mistake of underestimating them. Even[ENTER]though they often only gabble incomprehensible[ENTER]garbage, they are very experienced fighters. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_2_hunt", "25:86561901", "Destroy the Metin of Sorrow "},
	{"quest_book.mission_2_mis", "29:656030FF", "Destroy 2 Metins of Sorrow. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_2_text", "227:5CBE8DE7", "Recently, it has started raining stones near the[ENTER]city. They seem to have an evil chi within them,[ENTER]because ever since then, animals in the area have[ENTER]started acting really crazy. Please take care of[ENTER]this problem and destroy the stones. And of[ENTER]course you will be adequately rewarded for your[ENTER]efforts. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_30_hunt", "29:83A21130", "Purging the Valley Sect I "},
	{"quest_book.mission_30_mis", "66:9F7AF908", "Kill 30 Dark Fanatics and 30 Dark Arahans. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_30_text", "252:334903D3", "Finally we have received the order to eliminate[ENTER]the most dangerous sect in the whole kingdom: the[ENTER]esoteric sect in the Valley of Seungryong. Go[ENTER]there and shake the place up a little! But don't[ENTER]make the mistake of underestimating them. Even[ENTER]though they often only gabble incomprehensible[ENTER]garbage, they are very experienced fighters. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_31_hunt", "31:D0D51005", "Purging the Valley Sect III "},
	{"quest_book.mission_31_mis", "73:B4A70741", "Kill 40 Dark Tormentors and 40 Dark Summoners. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_31_text", "252:334903D3", "Finally we have received the order to eliminate[ENTER]the most dangerous sect in the whole kingdom: the[ENTER]esoteric sect in the Valley of Seungryong. Go[ENTER]there and shake the place up a little! But don't[ENTER]make the mistake of underestimating them. Even[ENTER]though they often only gabble incomprehensible[ENTER]garbage, they are very experienced fighters. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_32_hunt", "21:C93A3EF1", "Destroy the Metin of Shadow "},
	{"quest_book.mission_32_mis", "25:12C682D7", "Destroy 2 Metins of Shadow "},
	{"quest_book.mission_32_text", "227:5CBE8DE7", "Recently, it has started raining stones near the[ENTER]city. They seem to have an evil chi within them,[ENTER]because ever since then, animals in the area have[ENTER]started acting really crazy. Please take care of[ENTER]this problem and destroy the stones. And of[ENTER]course you will be adequately rewarded for your[ENTER]efforts. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_33_hunt", "13:74022F09", "They Have 8 Legs I "},
	{"quest_book.mission_33_mis", "77:70E3726D", "Kill 35 Baby Poison Spiders and 35 Deadly Poison[ENTER]Spiders. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_33_text", "302:34E5627E", "A cave system has been discovered in the Yongbi[ENTER]Desert, which serves the spiders that live there[ENTER]as a hideout. We don't know any details about[ENTER]these spider caves, but the area is known to be[ENTER]very dangerous. On the other hand, having lots of[ENTER]spiders in a confined space also gives you a good[ENTER]opportunity to reduce their numbers a little. Go[ENTER]there now! And be careful! "},
	{"quest_book.mission_34_hunt", "21:03F7A1A1", "They Have 8 Legs II unused "},
	{"quest_book.mission_34_mis", "77:70E3726D", "Kill 35 Baby Poison Spiders and 35 Deadly Poison[ENTER]Spiders. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_34_text", "302:34E5627E", "A cave system has been discovered in the Yongbi[ENTER]Desert, which serves the spiders that live there[ENTER]as a hideout. We don't know any details about[ENTER]these spider caves, but the area is known to be[ENTER]very dangerous. On the other hand, having lots of[ENTER]spiders in a confined space also gives you a good[ENTER]opportunity to reduce their numbers a little. Go[ENTER]there now! And be careful! "},
	{"quest_book.mission_35_hunt", "14:4EB50822", "They Have 8 Legs II "},
	{"quest_book.mission_35_mis", "93:27830E95", "Kill 35 Red Deadly Poison Spiders and 35 Claw[ENTER]Poison Spiders. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_35_text", "302:34E5627E", "A cave system has been discovered in the Yongbi[ENTER]Desert, which serves the spiders that live there[ENTER]as a hideout. We don't know any details about[ENTER]these spider caves, but the area is known to be[ENTER]very dangerous. On the other hand, having lots of[ENTER]spiders in a confined space also gives you a good[ENTER]opportunity to reduce their numbers a little. Go[ENTER]there now! And be careful! "},
	{"quest_book.mission_36_hunt", "15:D7F8F2F6", "They Have 8 Legs III "},
	{"quest_book.mission_36_mis", "36:F132D5ED", "Kill 40 Soldier Poison Spiders. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_36_text", "302:34E5627E", "A cave system has been discovered in the Yongbi[ENTER]Desert, which serves the spiders that live there[ENTER]as a hideout. We don't know any details about[ENTER]these spider caves, but the area is known to be[ENTER]very dangerous. On the other hand, having lots of[ENTER]spiders in a confined space also gives you a good[ENTER]opportunity to reduce their numbers a little. Go[ENTER]there now! And be careful! "},
	{"quest_book.mission_37_hunt", "24:725C7A02", "Destroy the Metin of Toughness"},
	{"quest_book.mission_37_mis", "28:E59114FA", "Destroy 2 Metins of Toughness. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_37_text", "227:5CBE8DE7", "Recently, it has started raining stones near the[ENTER]city. They seem to have an evil chi within them,[ENTER]because ever since then, animals in the area have[ENTER]started acting really crazy. Please take care of[ENTER]this problem and destroy the stones. And of[ENTER]course you will be adequately rewarded for your[ENTER]efforts. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_38_hunt", "9:6FCDE4FB", "Scorpion!"},
	{"quest_book.mission_38_mis", "49:B6A57502", "Kill 30 King Scorpions and 20 Young Scorpion Men. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_38_text", "125:7397DCCC", "These scorpion creatures are tyrannising[ENTER]travellers and merchants, which is really bad for[ENTER]the kingdom's economy. Please help us to get rid[ENTER]of this plague. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_39_hunt", "20:7866B861", "Company of the Dead I "},
	{"quest_book.mission_39_mis", "47:CDD5FFBF", "Kill 30 Demon Soldiers and 20 Demon Archers. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_39_text", "174:F5F9AD69", "Have you heard of the Demon Tower? Esoteric sects[ENTER]have summoned Demon Soldiers there with powerful[ENTER]spells. Fight them and find out how powerful they[ENTER]are. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_3_hunt", "23:741172CC", "Attack of the Grey Wolves II "},
	{"quest_book.mission_3_mis", "30:2ED3B6DE", "Kill 30 Alpha Grey Wolves. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_3_text", "288:9674B05C", "Have you heard about the Alpha Grey Wolves? They[ENTER]used to stroll around on their own, but because[ENTER]of the influence of the evil chi in the past few[ENTER]weeks, they have begun to hunt travellers in[ENTER]packs. Could you eliminate these Alpha Grey[ENTER]Wolves? I'm sure you won't go unrewarded for it. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_40_hunt", "21:430B58B4", "Company of the Dead II "},
	{"quest_book.mission_40_mis", "47:1E5E1156", "Kill 30 Demon Spearmen and 25 Demon Shamans. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_40_text", "174:F5F9AD69", "Have you heard of the Demon Tower? Esoteric sects[ENTER]have summoned Demon Soldiers there with powerful[ENTER]enchantments. Fight them and find out how[ENTER]powerful they are. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_41_hunt", "28:3CD8728F", "Secret of the Hard Dungeon II "},
	{"quest_book.mission_41_mis", "74:1B09734E", "Kill 15 Strong Ape Fighters and 15 Strong Ape[ENTER]Generals. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_41_text", "225:6984D737", "We have finally discovered the location of the[ENTER]hard Monkey Dungeon in the desert. Normally the[ENTER]monkeys that live there are harmless, but when[ENTER]they gang together they pose a great threat to[ENTER]the kingdom. Go to the hard Monkey Dungeon and[ENTER]check out the monkey situation. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_42_hunt", "27:F5C29F3C", "The ice will melt "},
	{"quest_book.mission_42_mis", "42:4E8403A9", "Kill 25 Ice Golems on Mount Sohan. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_42_text", "306:B75ED0D7", "Do you know Mount Sohan which is covered in[ENTER]perpetual ice? Many explorers and warriors have[ENTER]gone there but never returned. Find out the[ENTER]reason and whether they were attacked. Perhaps[ENTER]you can find out something when you hunt monsters[ENTER]there. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_43_hunt", "27:703B00EB", "Secret of the Hard Dungeon I "},
	{"quest_book.mission_43_mis", "72:0D5B16E3", "Kill 30 Strong Ape Soldiers and 30 Strong Ape[ENTER]Throwers. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_43_text", "225:6984D737", "We have finally discovered the location of the[ENTER]hard Monkey Dungeon in the desert. Normally the[ENTER]monkeys that live there are harmless, but when[ENTER]they gang together they pose a great threat to[ENTER]the kingdom. Go to the hard Monkey Dungeon and[ENTER]check out the monkey situation. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_44_hunt", "33:484AEAD4", "The Yellow Tiger's Right Hand "},
	{"quest_book.mission_44_mis", "30:F29EB725", "Kill 30 Bullfrog Generals. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_44_text", "345:710A7639", "I'm sure that you must have noticed that animals[ENTER]have got really wild and violent recently. The[ENTER]kingdom's secret service thinks that the reason[ENTER]for this is that the Yellow Tiger Ghost, king of[ENTER]all animals on the continent, is currently[ENTER]rallying his subjects. As a countermeasure, we[ENTER]should eliminate the leaders, who are his right[ENTER]hand men. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_45_hunt", "16:1C3F8C04", "Owner of Mount Sohan? "},
	{"quest_book.mission_45_mis", "44:4E811A9A", "Kill 35 Frosty Ice Men and 30 Yetis. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_45_text", "295:8F2820DF", "Nine Tails, master of mount Sohan, is said to[ENTER]gather demons around him. Before he has all[ENTER]troops he needs, we have to kill Icemen and[ENTER]Yetis, since they are the backbone of his troops.[ENTER]Please help us. You'll be rewarded. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_46_mis", "76:A92F5E72", "Kill 45 Tree Frog Soldiers and 35 Tree Frog[ENTER]Leaders. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_46_text", "172:150C4D12", "The Yellow Tiger Ghost has apparently conspired[ENTER]with the Tree Frog Monsters. Break up their[ENTER]joined units immediately. If you ignore them it[ENTER]will end badly for the kingdom! "},
	{"quest_book.mission_47_hunt", "40:94BA66EC", "Ice Monsters! Their True Self "},
	{"quest_book.mission_47_mis", "30:28A3DAC7", "Destroy 45 Enchanted Ices. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_47_text", "223:FE7A01BA", "We have found out how the Ice Monsters on Mount[ENTER]Sohan communicate with each other: They spread[ENTER]information via the floating splinters of ice[ENTER]that you can find everywhere. To weaken the[ENTER]troops of the Ice Land, we need to disrupt this[ENTER]transmission of information. So please: Destroy[ENTER]the Enchanted Ice! "},
	{"quest_book.mission_48_hunt", "24:69522284", "The Secret of the Demon Tower "},
	{"quest_book.mission_48_mis", "38:ECB65CC8", "Kill 45 Brutal Demonspearmen. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_48_text", "281:B86F4FEF", "There are rumours that the Vile Demon Spearmen in[ENTER]the Demon Tower are invincible. Apparently they[ENTER]get up each time they are killed. If that is true[ENTER]then there are dark times ahead. Please find out[ENTER]more about that! "},
	{"quest_book.mission_49_hunt", "21:6331F7A3", "The Master of the Demon Tower "},
	{"quest_book.mission_49_mis", "36:0BF2C02A", "Kill 60 Brutal Demon Shamans. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_49_text", "178:5A94E3AB", "After extensive research, we found out that the[ENTER]Ghost Soldiers are constantly resurrected. We[ENTER]have to eliminate the Brutal Demon Shamans to[ENTER]prevent this. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_4_hunt", "22:BAB42B0D", "Attack of the Grey Wolves I "},
	{"quest_book.mission_4_mis", "25:B906B2F5", "Kill 35 Grey Wolves. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_4_text", "278:C7296233", "Have you heard of the Grey Wolves? They used to[ENTER]travel around on their own, but because of the[ENTER]influence of the evil chi in the past few weeks,[ENTER]they have started hunting travellers in packs.[ENTER]Could you eliminate these Grey Wolves? You'll be[ENTER]rewarded for it. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_50_hunt", "19:A850C58F", "Explore Doyyumhwaji "},
	{"quest_book.mission_50_mis", "34:BC7F3BF4", "Kill 45 Fighting Tiger Minions. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_50_text", "145:1DDFE276", "Doyyumhwaji is a lava area inhabited by unknown[ENTER]beasts. We have to explore this area. Can you[ENTER]help us with that? "},
	{"quest_book.mission_51_hunt", "29:4279CC12", "Flame Ghost! Its identity "},
	{"quest_book.mission_51_mis", "27:89B3A1A8", "Kill 45 Flame Ghosts. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_51_text", "222:D873A124", "The group that was supposed to defeat the[ENTER]Fighting Tigers has been eliminated by unknown[ENTER]enemies. Rumour has it that these enemies look[ENTER]like 'burning girls'. Find out the truth. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_52_hunt", "36:B49DEAE5", "Thin Out the Fighting Tigers "},
	{"quest_book.mission_52_mis", "65:A8D75FD7", "Kill 60 Fighting Tiger Minions and 40 Fighting[ENTER]Tigers. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_52_text", "232:8980945E", "Now that we can fight the Fireghosts, we have to[ENTER]completely eliminate them in open battle. A[ENTER]mission like this is usually taken care of by the[ENTER]military, but to gain maximum battle strength to[ENTER]fight the Fireghosts, we need a better technique.[ENTER]Please make sure that the Fighting Tigers do not[ENTER]get in our way. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_53_hunt", "23:35E31B68", "Examine the Flames "},
	{"quest_book.mission_53_mis", "19:13B4938C", "Kill 40 Flames. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_53_text", "141:5DC4A5E0", "The Flames are unbelievably brutal. They enjoy[ENTER]the pain of the people whose skin they are[ENTER]devouring. We still don't know how to kill them.[ENTER]Could you find out more about these Flames? "},
	{"quest_book.mission_54_hunt", "18:80410BE9", "Flame Warriors "},
	{"quest_book.mission_54_mis", "31:8ECE71B6", "Kill 60 Flame Warriors. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_54_text", "210:8FA001D2", "Not too long ago, the child of a nobleman who[ENTER]went into the Fireland was killed by a Flame[ENTER]Warrior. If you kill the Flame Warriors, you'll[ENTER]be rewarded. Why don't you give it a try? "},
	{"quest_book.mission_55_hunt", "24:97CA97F0", "Secret of the Ghost Forest I "},
	{"quest_book.mission_55_mis", "24:7FBBE28A", "Destroy 30 Ghost Trees. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_55_text", "151:F0CAB826", "Usually, they look just like trees - and then,[ENTER]all of a sudden, they come alive and attack[ENTER]animals and humans. Find out how we can destroy[ENTER]the Ghost Trees. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_56_hunt", "25:C99A45CB", "Secret of the Ghost Forest II "},
	{"quest_book.mission_56_mis", "43:2FFAB706", "Kill 40 Ghost Stumps and 30 Dryads. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_56_text", "176:4AADDA4D", "Research has shown that the Ghost Forest is an[ENTER]area populated by Ghost Stumps and Dryads. If you[ENTER]eliminate them, you might be able to put an end[ENTER]to the spreading of the Ghost Trees. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_5_hunt", "29:5F6C45A7", "The Village Farms I "},
	{"quest_book.mission_5_mis", "17:CFDB8896", "Kill 40 Wild Boars. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_5_text", "243:BA629F94", "In the past few weeks, the sorrows of the[ENTER]villages close to the city have worsened. Wild[ENTER]Boars who only used to attack small animals in[ENTER]the mountains have suddenly become aggressive.[ENTER]They have started coming into the fields and[ENTER]attacking the farmers. Could you drive the Wild[ENTER]Boars away? "},
	{"quest_book.mission_6_hunt", "23:008F9986", "Tigers and Bears "},
	{"quest_book.mission_6_mis", "36:E305A332", "Kill 25 Tigers and 30 Bears. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_6_text", "397:721D60F3", "Have you heard about this yet? If Tigers and[ENTER]Bears only eat garlic and onions for 100 days,[ENTER]they can transform into large Tigers and Fire[ENTER]Bears. I'm sure that it's never happened before,[ENTER]but it won't hurt to check anyway. Kill some[ENTER]Tigers and Bears and find out what's in their[ENTER]stomachs. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_7_hunt", "24:6F2CBF70", "Destroy the Metin of Greed "},
	{"quest_book.mission_7_mis", "28:ABEC917E", "Destroy 2 Metins of Greed. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_7_text", "227:5CBE8DE7", "Recently, it has started raining stones near the[ENTER]city. They seem to have an evil chi within them,[ENTER]because ever since then, animals in the area have[ENTER]started acting really crazy. Please take care of[ENTER]this problem and destroy the stones. And of[ENTER]course you will be adequately rewarded for your[ENTER]efforts. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_8_hunt", "20:C63BCA05", "Destroy the Metin of Battle "},
	{"quest_book.mission_8_mis", "24:0067AC6C", "Destroy 2 Metins of Battle. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_8_text", "227:5CBE8DE7", "Recently, it has started raining stones near the[ENTER]city. They seem to have an evil chi within them,[ENTER]because ever since then, animals in the area have[ENTER]started acting really crazy. Please take care of[ENTER]this problem and destroy the stones. And of[ENTER]course you will be adequately rewarded for your[ENTER]efforts. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_9_hunt", "30:B7FEE2FC", "The Village Farms II "},
	{"quest_book.mission_9_mis", "28:D5BC09D3", "Kill 30 Red Wild Boars. "},
	{"quest_book.mission_9_text", "269:65929D97", "For a while now, Wild Boars and their leaders,[ENTER]the Red Wild Boars, have been attacking the[ENTER]villages near the main city. The government[ENTER]ordered that the Red Wild Boars be killed. Every[ENTER]warrior should kill 30 of them each. Please help[ENTER]out, too. "},
	{"quest_book.new_quest", "41:800F274B", "A new quest has been added to your quest list - %s."},
	{"quest_book.on_quest", "71:237449EB", "Are you sure you want to abandon your current quest? Abandoning it costs %s Yang."},
	{"quest_book.quest57.desc", "146:95E9957A", "In the heart of the Ghost Forest, the Metin Pung-Ma stones radiate dark energy, strengthening the forces of evil. Destroy them to break the curse and cleanse the forest of dark powers."},
	{"quest_book.quest57.title", "18:44105DED", "Curse of the Ghost Forest"},
	{"quest_book.quest57.what", "25:83D2E609", "Destroy 2 Metin Pung-Ma stones."},
	{"quest_book.quest58.desc", "260:0F775A5C", "Naara, the ancient Guardian of the Ghost Forest, protects the secrets of this place and keeps the curse alive. Her power is immense and her presence overwhelming. To free the forest from darkness for good, you must defeat Naara and end her rule over this cursed land."},
	{"quest_book.quest58.title", "15:C9888807", "The Last Watch "},
	{"quest_book.quest58.what", "30:02C62190", "Kill Naara, the Forest Guardian."},
	{"quest_book.quest59.desc", "281:03A69166", "The Red Dryads have taken control of the Red Forest, spreading fear and destruction among all who come near their territory. Their wrath is unbridled and their numbers keep growing. To stop their malice and cleanse the forest, you must destroy these powerful creatures."},
	{"quest_book.quest59.title", "24:645011C3", "Curse of the Red Forest I"},
	{"quest_book.quest59.what", "26:0F0D0A2E", "Kill 50 Red Dryads."},
	{"quest_book.quest60.desc", "329:B08810F0", "The Red Evil Trees have spread through the Red Forest, turning it into a place full of darkness and danger. Their malicious nature makes the forest more and more dangerous. To stop this curse, you must set out into the forest and destroy 70 of these malicious trees, restoring peace and balance to this cursed land."},
	{"quest_book.quest60.title", "25:72AD7F88", "Curse of the Red Forest II"},
	{"quest_book.quest60.what", "32:FFCED6DB", "Kill 70 Red Evil Trees."},
	{"quest_book.quest61.desc", "268:C0C797A1", "The Ogre Butchers, known for their brutality, roam the lands, leaving destruction and fear in their wake. Their attacks are growing ever bolder and the number of victims keeps rising. You must face them and put an end to their slaughter to save the innocent and restore peace to the area."},
	{"quest_book.quest61.title", "10:CC8B4939", "Shadow of the Ogres"},
	{"quest_book.quest61.what", "23:E6A3A529", "Kill 15 Ogre Butchers."},
	{"quest_book.quest62.desc", "360:9FFB0942", "In the dark corners of the Demon Tower, the Brutal Demon Leaders and the Brutal Ghosts of Grudge control the evil that seeps through its walls. Their presence puts the safety of the whole land in question. Your task is to cleanse the Tower of these powerful enemies, to stop their influence from spreading and to restore order to this cursed place."},
	{"quest_book.quest62.title", "9:A018A7AB", "Call of Darkness"},
	{"quest_book.quest62.what", "67:431D07E4", "Kill 30 Brutal Demon Leaders and 25 Brutal Ghosts of Grudge."},
	{"quest_book.quest_lowlvl1.desc", "347:94685FE5", "The Craven White Oath Archers are masters of attacking from hiding, using their agility and accuracy to spread chaos and fear among their enemies. Acting from the shadows, they are a serious threat to anyone who enters their territory. Your task is to eliminate these dangerous archers to restore peace and safety to the region."},
	{"quest_book.quest_lowlvl1.title", "13:BAB9ED2E", "Silence of the Arrows "},
	{"quest_book.quest_lowlvl1.what", "35:F4D07160", "Kill 15 Craven White Oath Archers."},
	{"quest_book.quest_lowlvl2.desc", "312:07338751", "The White Tigers, majestic but extremely dangerous creatures, are spreading terror in the surrounding lands. Their sudden attacks make the region less and less safe. You must set out on a hunt and eliminate these predators to secure the area and restore peace among the local people."},
	{"quest_book.quest_lowlvl2.title", "19:B6F8DE09", "Shadow of the Snow Fangs"},
	{"quest_book.quest_lowlvl2.what", "26:FABB3483", "Kill 25 White Tigers."},
	{"quest_book.quest_lowlvl3.desc", "284:311398D4", "Under the influence of sinister magic, the Cursed Grizzly Bears have become wild and unpredictable predators. Their attacks threaten the safety of the whole area. To stop their spreading terror, you must follow their trail and eliminate these dangerous beasts."},
	{"quest_book.quest_lowlvl3.title", "16:AF43A7AA", "Cursed Beasts"},
	{"quest_book.quest_lowlvl3.what", "36:FC3667F7", "Kill 25 Cursed Grizzly Bears"},
	{"quest_book.reward", "27:69DD79C8", "Reward for the completed quest:"},
	{"quest_scroll.accept", "18:73EF94DF", "Quest %s accepted."},
	{"quest_scroll.already_active", "49:EF425611", "This quest is already active or has been completed."},
	{"quest_scroll.low_level", "45:06B3D37E", "You need level %d to accept this quest."},
	{"reputation.quest_done_letter", "47:DF83ACBD", "The quest has been completed - you can collect your reward."},
	{"reputation.quest_low_lvl", "40:A3DB6DDD", "You must be level %d to start this quest."},
	{"reputation.quest_low_reputation", "43:C18F9501", "Required reputation to start this quest: %s."},
	{"reputation.quest_not_done", "26:59A0A5B3", "Come back when you have completed the quest."},
	{"reputation.quest_reward_reputation", "30:C8FDF824", "You receive %d reputation (%s)."},
	{"reputation.quest_wait", "34:79860265", "You can complete these quests once a day."},
	{"reputation.reputation_rank.1", "9:6C9A2F22", "Neutral"},
	{"reputation.reputation_rank.2", "9:04163BDF", "Friendly"},
	{"reputation.reputation_rank.3", "9:2FC13042", "Respected"},
	{"reputation.reputation_rank.4", "9:06B1EE0A", "Ally"},
	{"reputation_desert.first.desc", "201:36100011", "The desert was once a peaceful place, but lately it has been swarming with hostile creatures. Because of these attacks our people cannot sleep in peace. Help us drive these beasts away and restore the balance of the desert!"},
	{"reputation_desert.first.name", "25:6D00B95F", "Defence of the Desert Trails"},
	{"reputation_desert.first.progress", "13:AF76D65F", "Remaining: %d."},
	{"reputation_desert.first.task", "13:01DA1C0C", "Kill %dx %s."},
	{"reputation_desert.fraction_name", "15:3FFC6AAA", "Sons of the Desert"},
	{"reputation_desert.quest_done", "110:965F14E8", "Your deeds have not gone unnoticed, my friend. The Sons of the Desert are grateful for your support and devotion."},
	{"reputation_desert.second.desc", "218:C52AC1B1", "Our supplies are starting to run low, and we need particular items to survive the harsh conditions of the desert. If you really want to help us, bring us what we need. Your support will not be forgotten."},
	{"reputation_desert.second.name", "16:36B1381A", "Supplies for the Sons"},
	{"reputation_desert.second.no_items", "60:801ACDE3", "Come to me when you have the items we need!"},
	{"reputation_desert.second.task", "16:BCDF8CBB", "Bring %dx %s."},
	{"reputation_desert.third.desc", "178:2D5BF6E6", "The Metin Stones are disturbing the peace of the desert, and their power attracts ever more dangerous creatures. We must destroy them to protect our land. Show us that you can stand up to this force."},
	{"reputation_desert.third.name", "24:499217D4", "The Metin Stone Threat"},
	{"reputation_desert.third.progress", "13:AF76D65F", "Remaining: %d."},
	{"reputation_desert.third.task", "15:D7B98C7A", "Destroy %dx %s."},
	{"reputation_orc_valley.first.desc", "330:F8431DA9", "For years the Valley of Seungryong has been a place of dark events and constant danger. The Royal Guard has received orders from the Emperor himself to patrol this land ceaselessly and keep the monsters in check. If you wish, you can support our efforts. The monsters in the Valley are growing ever more aggressive, and our ranks are thinning."},
	{"reputation_orc_valley.first.name", "19:1829AC55", "Cleansing the Valley"},
	{"reputation_orc_valley.first.progress", "13:AF76D65F", "Remaining: %d."},
	{"reputation_orc_valley.first.task", "13:01DA1C0C", "Kill %dx %s."},
	{"reputation_orc_valley.fraction_name", "17:C7EA23A5", "Royal Guard"},
	{"reputation_orc_valley.quest_done", "181:2B3E4AEB", "Your efforts in the Valley of Seungryong have brought tangible results. The monsters have been wiped out and the threat has been averted for the time being. Without you, the situation could have got out of control."},
	{"reward.alignment_reward", "24:A6E93AE0", "You have received %s rank points"},
	{"reward.alignment_reward_loss", "23:61B812FA", "You have lost %s rank points"},
	{"reward.exp_reward", "32:EF1E3375", "You have received %s experience points"},
